    ["Text Block<HighLight>150次</>伤害伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%"] = "Текстовый блок<HighLight>150 раз</>Damage Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10%",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 分担预警buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Shared Damage Warning Buff",
    ["　　不知道还能不能回伦堡，鲁恩的天气太阴沉了，雨水多不适合作物生长。\n\n\n　　主教让我负责后勤保障，顺带研究一下怎么加速魔药消化。\n\n\n　　消化丰收祭司的魔药……要不我在临时据点里种点什么？"] = "I don't know if I can ever return to Lenburg. The weather in Loen is too gloomy, and the rain is not suitable for crop growth. \n \n \n The Bishop asked me to be responsible for logistics and, by the way, research how to accelerate potion digestion. \n \n \n Digesting the Harvest Priest potion... Should I plant something in the temporary stronghold?",
    ["When DispelType is 0, it directly takes the skill level. If \n is 1, enter the formula ID. If \n is 2, enter a fixed value."] = "When DispelType is 0, it directly takes the skill level. If \n is 1, enter the formula ID. If \n is 2, enter a fixed value.",
    ["LuaDict(Enum(全技能槽位), IdGroup(技能))"] = "LuaDict(Enum(All Skill Slots), IdGroup(Skill)).",
    ["《终极扑克速成指南》"] = "《Ultimate Poker Crash Course Guide》",
    ["LuaList(Id(怪物破防))"] = "LuaList(Id(Monster Armor Break)).",
    ["trigger-画外音1"] = "trigger-Voiceover 1",
    ["【五月庄园】管家-囚笼-非奶T"] = "[May Manor] Butler - Cage - Non-Healer/T",
    ["……感谢你的聆听，休息时间结束，我要继续演奏了。"] = "...Thank you for listening, break time is over, I have to continue playing.",
    ["<Red>血液冻结</>：进入战斗后，佩戴者的血液会逐渐变冷，降低体力恢复速度直至完全无法恢复体力。通过持续不断的造成伤害，可以缓解乃至消除该效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Blood Freezing</>: After entering combat, the wearer's blood will gradually cool, reducing Stamina recovery speed until Stamina cannot be recovered at all. This effect can be alleviated or even eliminated by continuously dealing damage. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material entry attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.",
    ["　　In a bit of a rush, I'll be back in a moment. \n\n 　　You can look around the cafe. Beside it, on the <Letter_Highlight_HW>Central Plaza</>, there is a stone tablet called the <Mark id=\"#159\">\"Travel Obelisk\"</>. It was made by Miss \"Magician\" and the craftsman. Once activated, you can shuttle between travel points all over the place. \n\n 　　Good stuff, faster than walking. \n\n 　　Note: Don't go too far. \n"] = "Немного спешу, вернусь через минуту. \n\n 　　Вы можете осмотреться в кафе. Рядом с ним, на <Letter_Highlight_HW>Central Plaza</>, есть каменная табличка под названием <Mark id=\"#159\"> «Обелиск путешествий» </>. Его сделали мисс «Волшебница» и мастер. После активации вы сможете перемещаться между точками путешествия по всему миру. \n\n 　　Хорошая штука, быстрее, чем идти пешком. \n\n 　　Примечание: не заходите слишком далеко. \п",
    ["　　“它是通灵的好帮手，也是足够迷人的花精……”\n　　随着戴莉的娓娓述说，克莱恩只觉她的声音从四面八方传来。\n　　迷惑望向四周，克莱恩发现所有事物都在摇晃，都在模糊，像是笼罩了一层又一层的浓雾，连带着自己的身体都跟着摇晃，跟着模糊，跟着发飘，跟着失去了重量。\n　　红的更红，蓝的更蓝，黑的更黑，色彩混杂如同印象派油画，迷离而梦幻，而周围细碎重叠的呢喃一阵阵传来，像是有数不清的无形之人在议论。\n　　“这和我之前做‘转运仪式’时的感觉类似啊，但没有那种让人疯狂，让人想要爆炸的味道……”克莱恩看着这一切，疑惑想道。\n　　就在这时，他的视线被一双晶莹如同绿宝石的眼眸吸引了，穿黑袍的戴莉坐在模糊的“沙发”上，目光诡异地集中于克莱恩的头顶，嗓音温柔地笑道：\n　　“正式认识一下，我，‘通灵者’戴莉。”\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》 第十四章 信"] = "\"It's a great helper for Spirit Mediumship, and also a charming flower spirit...\"\n As Daly spoke, Klein felt her voice coming from all directions.\n Looking around in confusion, Klein found that everything was swaying and blurring, as if shrouded in layers of thick fog. Even his own body was swaying, blurring, floating, and losing its weight.\n The reds became redder, the blues bluer, and the blacks blacker, the colors mixing like an impressionist oil painting, hazy and dreamlike. The fragmented, overlapping whispers around him came in waves, as if countless invisible people were discussing.\n \"This is similar to the feeling I had when I did the 'Fortune-Turning Ritual', but without that flavor that makes people go crazy or want to explode...\" Klein thought, looking at all this in confusion.\n Just then, his gaze was drawn to a pair of eyes as crystalline as emeralds. Daly, dressed in a black robe, sat on a blurry \"sofa,\" her gaze strangely focused on the top of Klein's head, her voice smiling gently:\n \"Let's get to know each other formally. I am the 'Spirit Medium', Daly.\"\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 14: Letter",
    ["[Placeholder-Animation] Next, he quickly lights the candles and activates the purification ritual."] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Next, he quickly lights the candles and activates the purification ritual.",
    ["{{\"BuffID%i\",\"Buff层数%i\",\"Buff时长%i\"}}"] = "{{\"BuffID%i\",\"Buff Stacks%i\",\"Buff Duration%i\"}}",
    ["[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter 1 Non-T, Not Tracked by Hound, No Bell, Add Buff"] = "[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter 1 Non-T, Not Tracked by Hound, No Bell, Add Buff",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战场背景</>\n源自第四纪古战场的历史投影，仅在<Highlight>特定时段</>方可激活。未开启时，战场处于血皇帝亚利斯塔·图铎残存力量的主导之下，充斥着<Highlight>扭曲与杀戮</>。身处其中的非凡者皆受其影响，渴求铁与血的洗礼，体验<Highlight>厮杀的快感</>。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Battlefield Background</>\nA Историческая проекция originating from the ancient battlefields of the Fourth Epoch, which can only be activated during <Highlight>specific periods</>. When not active, the battlefield is under the dominance of the residual power of the Red Emperor Alista Tudor, filled with <Highlight>distortion and slaughter</>. Потустороннийs within it are all affected by it, craving the baptism of iron and blood, and experiencing <Highlight>the thrill of slaughter</>.",
    ["【Shadow Cloak】+5% Damage Reduction"] = "【Shadow Cloak】+5% Снижение урона",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initiate War Declaration</>\n1. The time to initiate a war declaration is: <Highlight>Monday to Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 11:00-23:00</>. \n2. The time points for declaring war are: <Highlight>Monday to Thursday 12:00-14:00, 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00, 21:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 12:00-18:00, 22:00-23:00</>. \n3. Initiating a war declaration will consume Club Funds, which are deducted based on the club's level, strength difference, and Blood Feud value. \n4. If the declaring party wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the Club Funds will be refunded; if they lose, they will not be refunded. If the declared party loses, corresponding funds will be deducted based on the club's level; if they win, no funds will be deducted. \n5. If you continuously declare war on the same club and win, the Club Funds consumed for declaring war again will increase <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n6. If you are continuously declared war on by the same club and lose, the Club Funds consumed for being declared war on again will decrease <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n1. Club war declaration will take place in the Hornacis Mountain Range open world map for free combat. After the war declaration begins, only the two parties who declared war on each other will enter a duel state. \n2. Plant Flag: The initiating party first obtains the right to plant the flag. After any one of the <Highlight>(President, Vice President, Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill will disappear. After planting the flag, you will gain points based on the survival time around the flag. \n3. Flag Rotation: After the flag ownership time ends, the right to plant the flag will rotate to the other club, or the right to plant the flag can be rotated after <Highlight>successfully seizing the flag</>. \n4. Defeating opponents or participating in defeating opponents will also grant points. \n5. The entire war declaration will last for <Highlight>30 minutes</>. At the time of settlement, the party with the higher points wins. If the scores are the same, the party that was declared war on wins. \n6. During the war declaration, you can use the <Highlight>\"Assemble - Club War Declaration\"</> item to <Highlight>initiate an assembly</> in the Hornacis Mountain Range. The item can be viewed in the Companion Shop - Club."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initiate War Declaration</>\n1. The time to initiate a war declaration is: <Highlight>Monday to Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 11:00-23:00</>. \n2. The time points for declaring war are: <Highlight>Monday to Thursday 12:00-14:00, 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00, 21:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 12:00-18:00, 22:00-23:00</>. \n3. Initiating a war declaration will consume Club Funds, which are deducted based on the club's level, strength difference, and Blood Feud value. \n4. If the declaring party wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the Club Funds will be refunded; if they lose, they will not be refunded. If the declared party loses, corresponding funds will be deducted based on the club's level; if they win, no funds will be deducted. \n5. If you continuously declare war on the same club and win, the Club Funds consumed for declaring war again will increase <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n6. If you are continuously declared war on by the same club and lose, the Club Funds consumed for being declared war on again will decrease <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n1. Club war declaration will take place in the Hornacis Mountain Range open world map for free combat. After the war declaration begins, only the two parties who declared war on each other will enter a duel state. \n2. Plant Flag: The initiating party first obtains the right to plant the flag. After any one of the <Highlight>(President, Vice President, Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill will disappear. After planting the flag, you will gain points based on the survival time around the flag. \n3. Flag Rotation: After the flag ownership time ends, the right to plant the flag will rotate to the other club, or the right to plant the flag can be rotated after <Highlight>successfully seizing the flag</>. \n4. Defeating opponents or participating in defeating opponents will also grant points. \n5. The entire war declaration will last for <Highlight>30 minutes</>. At the time of settlement, the party with the higher points wins. If the scores are the same, the party that was declared war on wins. \n6. During the war declaration, you can use the <Highlight>\"Assemble - Club War Declaration\"</> item to <Highlight>initiate an assembly</> in the Hornacis Mountain Range. The item can be viewed in the Companion Shop - Club.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Axe Knight】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["After entering the middle and high Sequence, Beyonders of the Warrior Pathway are very adept at discovering the weaknesses of different monsters; to some extent, these experiences can also be applied to humans."] = "После входа в среднюю и высшую последовательности Потусторонние Пути Воина очень искусны в обнаружении слабостей различных монстров; в некоторой степени этот опыт можно применить и к людям.",
    ["[Tarot Club Atmosphere] Placeholder"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Заполнитель",
    ["True: Ignore Damage Reflection; \nFalse: Do not ignore"] = "Верно: игнорировать отражение урона; \nЛожь: не игнорировать",
    ["　　如果忘词，就说灵体太强大，我需要更多苏勒才能继续沟通。\n　　注：请谨慎使用该方法，招致未知存在的可能性并非为零 。有些目光一旦投来，便不会移开。"] = "Если вы забудете свои реплики, просто скажите, что духовное тело слишком мощное и мне нужно больше Сола, чтобы продолжить общение.\n　　Примечание: пожалуйста, используйте этот метод осторожно; возможность привлечения Неизвестного Существования не равна нулю. Как только некоторые взгляды будут брошены, они не отойдут.",
    ["...<P_Heart> (I was just in my room a moment ago, and in the blink of an eye, I appeared in this mysterious place. Could it be... a Beyonder incident!) </>"] = "...<P_Heart> (I was just in my room a moment ago, and in the blink of an eye, I appeared in this mysterious place. Could it be... a Потусторонний incident!) </>",
    ["【本相】友方离开通灵仪式范围后可以额外保留2秒加速效果。敌方离开通灵仪式范围内时减速效果额外保留2秒。"] = "[True Form] Allies can retain the Acceleration effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range. Enemies retain the Slow effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range.",
    ["To Beyonder \n All gifts of fate \n have already been marked with a price in the dark. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "To Потусторонний\n Все подарки судьбы\n уже отмечены в темноте ценой. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["　　我知道你是我认识的“工匠”里最信得过的一个，我这次想定一件<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">你说过能“隐藏外貌、模糊辨识”的</>神奇物品。核心材料我会带来，是一份来自“无面人”的非凡特性，状态稳定，你拿去加工就行。\n　　价格按照你之前的口径，1000 镑没问题。\n　　老地方见面交接，我会提前确认周围没人跟着。"] = "Я знаю, что ты самый надежный «Ремесленник», которого я знаю. На этот раз я хочу заказать магический предмет, который, как вы упомянули, <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">, мог бы «скрыть внешний вид и размыть узнаваемость». </> Я принесу основной материал сам; это характеристика Потустороннего из «Безликого», и его состояние стабильно, так что вы можете просто взять его и обработать.\n　　Что касается цены, то 1000 фунтов, как вы уже говорили, не проблема.\n　　Давайте встретимся в обычном месте для передачи. Заранее подтвержу, что за мной никто не следит.",
    ["QTE技能（QTE的表现，实际上是额外技能按键）"] = "QTE skill (QTE performance, actually an extra skill button).",
    ["<Yellow>飓风</>：持有者战斗中移动速度提高<Yellow>10%</>，普攻攻速提高<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?20%}</>；\n<Yellow>闪电</>：持有者普攻命中敌对目标时，有<Yellow>15%</>的概率对目标释放闪电打击，造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?*d}</>点伤害，闪电有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?60%}</>的基础概率造成<Yellow>3秒</>的滞涩效果。"] = "<Yellow>Hurricane</>: The holder's Скорость бега is increased by <Yellow>10%</> in combat, and Базовая атака speed is increased by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?20%}</>; \n<Yellow>Lightning</>: When the holder's Базовая атака hits a hostile target, there is a <Yellow>15%</> probability of unleashing a Lightning Strike on the target, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?*d}</> damage. The lightning has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?60%}</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>3-second</> Stagnation effect.",
    ["……<P_Heart>（邓恩先生那样的非凡者？不，我并不是，我也想知道。）</>"] = "...<P_Heart> (A Потусторонний like Mr. Dunn? No, I am not, and I want to know too.)</>",
    ["BOSS Reset Protection Buff"] = "БОСС: усиление защиты от сброса",
    ["<P_Heart>(Lord Arrodes is so strict... but it can't speak and has to have Ms. Justice act as its mouthpiece; how truly extraordinary...)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Лорд Арродес такой строгий... но он не может говорить, и его рупором должна выступать мисс Джастис; насколько это действительно необычно...)</>",
    ["...It seems the guidance of fate has already descended. Today, it is still suitable for you to enter the club and find a real divination master to perform a divination."] = "...It seems the guidance of fate has already descended. Today, it is still suitable for you to enter the club and find a real Гадание master to perform a Гадание.",
    ["“占卜家”魔药材料"] = "Материалы для зелья «Провидец»",
    ["[May Manor] Butler - Cage - Non-Healer/T"] = "[May Manor] Butler - Cage - Non-Healer/T",
    ["{{先生|女士}}, I used to be a Magician, skilled at escaping from cages in front of everyone's eyes."] = "{{Sir|Madam}}, I used to be a Фокусник, skilled at escaping from cages in front of everyone's eyes.",
    ["...That group of knowledge-seeking lackeys coveted the Church's Sealed Artifact, the Tree of Yodra, and chased it all the way here. To stop them, I had to break the rules and let the tree touch the earth..."] = "...That group of knowledge-seeking lackeys coveted the Church's Запечатанный артефакт, the Tree of Yodra, and chased it all the way here. To stop them, I had to break the rules and let the tree touch the earth...",
    ["……In any case, I cannot leave a Beyonder creature wandering outside."] = "……In any case, I cannot leave a Потусторонний creature wandering outside.",
    ["{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}, but the ritual encountered mysterious interference. The process collapsed completely, and the out-of-control spirituality affected both parties, causing the Requiem performer's Sanity to decrease by <Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.N}}</>, and the target's Sanity to decrease by <Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.M}}</>."] = "{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}, but the ritual encountered mysterious interference. The process collapsed completely, and the out-of-control Духовность affected both parties, causing the Requiem performer's Рассудок to decrease by <Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.N}}</>, and the target's Рассудок to decrease by <Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.M}}</>.",
    ["GTA-机械造物-隐身怪无敌"] = "GTA - Mechanical Creation - Stealth Monster Invincibility",
    ["“水银天使”是命运的化身，是我主最宠爱的天使；“死亡天使”是跟随我主最久的存在，是冥界的执政官；“救赎天使”是我主的号角，是祂神谕的传达者；“生命天使”是智慧的结晶，是每个人体内永不磨灭的灵性。"] = "The \"Angel of Mercury\" is the avatar of fate, the angel most favored by my Lord; the \"Angel of Death\" is the existence that has followed my Lord the longest, the administrator of the Underworld; the \"Angel of Redemption\" is the horn of my Lord, the messenger of His oracle; the \"Angel of Life\" is the crystallization of wisdom, the inextinguishable Духовность within every person.",
    ["【塔罗会·巨斧骑士】档6增量(+25%)→累计190%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress"] = "\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress",
    ["“忽地一声惊呼：‘在那！’只见格尔曼·斯帕罗已凌空跃起，一枪、两枪、三枪……伴随着血花炸响的，还有疯狂冒险家的名号！”"] = "«Вдруг крик удивления: «Вот!» Герман Воробей уже подпрыгнул в воздух, один выстрел, два выстрела, три выстрела…… вместе с кровотечением крови прозвучало имя Безумного авантюриста!»",
    ["To 占卜家\n    占卜不是万能。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "Провидеть\n Гадание не всемогуще. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["Don't be surprised! I knew you would come here, so I left this letter; others cannot see it. \n I'm too busy with my manuscript to get away, so please help me bring this new book to Mr. \"Moon\" of the Tarot Club. I've already paid for the book! \n \"Moon\" is currently investigating the \"Abundance Corruption\" incident at Golden Autumn Lake under the guise of a deacon of the Earth Mother church. You can take this opportunity to get to know each other. \n By the way, Mr. \"Moon\" is a vampire, please do not call him a \"blood-sucker\"—that's very impolite! \n Attached is a portrait he is quite satisfied with, to help you identify him. \n (The handwriting is becoming increasingly messy... it seems there's no time to write more.)"] = "Don't be surprised! I knew you would come here, so I left this letter; others cannot see it. \n I'm too busy with my manuscript to get away, so please help me bring this new book to Mr. \"Moon\" of the Клуб Таро. I've already paid for the book! \n \"Moon\" is currently investigating the \"Abundance Искажение\" incident at Golden Autumn Lake under the guise of a deacon of the Earth Mother church. You can take this opportunity to get to know each other. \n By the way, Mr. \"Moon\" is a vampire, please do not call him a \"blood-sucker\"—that's very impolite! \n Attached is a portrait he is quite satisfied with, to help you identify him. \n (The handwriting is becoming increasingly messy... it seems there's no time to write more.)",
    ["[Roguelike] Wanderer Inscription - Periodic Damage"] = "[Roguelike] Wanderer Inscription - Periodic Damage",
    ["Ms. “Justice”, sorry to bother you, regarding Ritual Magic…… I have read many materials, but I always feel like it's just empty talk, and it's hard to truly grasp its essence."] = "Мисс «Справедливость», извините за беспокойство по поводу Ритуальной Магии…… Я прочитала много материалов, но мне всегда кажется, что это просто пустые разговоры, и трудно по-настоящему уловить ее суть.",
    ["·开启双眼的另一重视角，窥见隐匿于现实之下的真相。\n·<Yellow>高亮显示</>场景中的关键线索：你能看见逝者的残影在街角游荡，能捕捉到非凡物品散发出的灵性微光。\n·以<Yellow>不同颜色</>标识生灵的气场状态：生灵的气场在你面前无所遁形，以太体的色泽明暗诉说着他们的健康与心绪。\n·随<Yellow>跑团天赋</>的提升，可解读更深层的信息，甚至能窥见生命火光的盛衰。"] = "· Open a second perspective of your eyes to glimpse the truth hidden beneath reality. \n · <Yellow> Highlight </> key clues in the scene: You can see the lingering shadows of the deceased wandering at street corners and capture the faint glimmer of Духовность emitted by Потусторонний items. \n · Identify the aura status of living beings with <Yellow> different colors </>: The auras of living beings have nowhere to hide before you, and the brightness of their ether bodies tells of their health and mood. \n · With the improvement of <Yellow> TRPG Talent </>, you can interpret deeper information and even glimpse the waxing and waning of the flames of life.",
    ["[Enhanced] Restores <HighLight>4</> Health per second."] = "[Enhanced] Restores <HighLight>4</> Health per second.",
    ["【实证】仪式魔法造成的伤害增加30%。"] = "[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 30%.",
    ["【塔罗会·巨斧骑士】档3增量(+15%)→累计114%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["　　第一轮：黛丝不是前来占卜的顾客，<InvHighlight>是一位占卜师</>。\n　　第二轮：黛丝并非死于割伤，而<InvHighlight>是死于法阵</>。 \n　　第三轮：黛丝的死和邪恶仪式无关，<InvHighlight>和她的占卜有关</>。\n　　第四轮：黛丝的死与反锁的占卜室无关，而<InvHighlight>与占卜的结果、前来占卜的顾客有关</>。\n\n　　桌面的线索：一本《仪式魔法：向神明祈求之术》，有两页被折了角，分别是《假死与复生》和《命运的交换》，分别记载着<InvHighlight>不同的仪式魔法内容</>。"] = "Раунд 1: Дейзи была не клиенткой, которая пришла за гаданием, <InvHighlight>, а прорицателем. </> \n Раунд 2: Дейзи не умерла от пореза, но <InvHighlight> умерла от магического круга. </> \n Раунд 3: Смерть Дейзи не имеет ничего общего со злым ритуалом, <InvHighlight>, а с ее предсказанием. </> \n Раунд 4: Смерть Дейзи не имеет ничего общего с запертой комнатой для гаданий, а <InvHighlight> с результатом гадания и пришедшим за ним покупателем. </> \n \n Подсказки на столе: Книга «Ритуальная магия: искусство молиться богам» с двумя потрепанными страницами, а именно «Притворная смерть и воскрешение» и «Обмен судьбами», в которых записано различное содержание ритуальной магии <InvHighlight>. </>",
    ["【扮演占卜师】"] = "[Act as Diviner]",
    ["<P_Yellow> Security Level </> Confidential \n<P_Yellow> Reporter </> Leonard Mitchell \n<P_Yellow> Date </> July 1354 \n\n<P_Yellow> Event Overview </>\n Since June 1354, a series of bizarre disappearance cases of citizens have occurred in Tingen. After the Blackthorn Security Company intervened in the investigation, it was confirmed that there was hidden Beyonder power intervention behind the events, and it was finally confirmed to be a large-scale Sacrifice Ritual planned by the evil god organization \"Moon Servant.\" Its goal was to use the Crown of Knowledge and the Magic Mirror of Despair to sacrifice the entire city to the \"Great Mother\" (confirmed to be the avatar of ▇▇▇▇) to give birth to the evil god's offspring.\n\n<P_Yellow> Details of Disappearance Cases </>\n Most of the missing persons were ordinary Tingen citizens, covering all walks of life: workers, wealthy merchants, students, etc. \n Most of the missing persons had recently come into contact with items related to Emperor Roselle, including drama festival mirrors, posters, and promotional materials. \n Some of the missing persons had participated in the high-paying short-term job recruitment at May Manor before going missing. \n\n<P_Yellow> Rescue & Casualty Situation </>\n Rescue List \n... Charlie... Jenny... Lydia... Jack... \n Casualty List \n... Karl... Johnson... Joan... \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Factions </>\n Moon Servant (see Moon Servant Investigation Report for details) \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Sealed Artifacts </>\n Crown of Knowledge \n Magic Mirror of Despair"] = "<P_Yellow> Security Level </> Confidential \n<P_Yellow> Reporter </> Leonard Mitchell \n<P_Yellow> Date </> July 1354 \n\n<P_Yellow> Event Overview </>\n Since June 1354, a series of bizarre disappearance cases of citizens have occurred in Тинген. After the Blackthorn Security Company intervened in the investigation, it was confirmed that there was hidden Потусторонний power intervention behind the events, and it was finally confirmed to be a large-scale Sacrifice Ritual planned by the evil god organization \"Moon Servant.\" Its goal was to use the Crown of Knowledge and the Magic Mirror of Despair to sacrifice the entire city to the \"Great Mother\" (confirmed to be the avatar of ▇▇▇▇) to give birth to the evil god's offspring.\n\n<P_Yellow> Details of Disappearance Cases </>\n Most of the missing persons were ordinary Тинген citizens, covering all walks of life: workers, wealthy merchants, students, etc. \n Most of the missing persons had recently come into contact with items related to Emperor Roselle, including drama festival mirrors, posters, and promotional materials. \n Some of the missing persons had participated in the high-paying short-term job recruitment at May Manor before going missing. \n\n<P_Yellow> Rescue & Casualty Situation </>\n Rescue List \n... Charlie... Jenny... Lydia... Jack... \n Casualty List \n... Karl... Johnson... Joan... \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Factions </>\n Moon Servant (see Moon Servant Investigation Report for details) \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Запечатанный артефактs </>\n Crown of Knowledge \n Magic Mirror of Despair",
    ["<Red>灵魂重负</>：穿戴者每囚禁一个非凡者灵魂，期间自身生命值上限降低*f**。\n<Red>贪食血肉</>：穿戴者粉碎怪物灵魂后，减伤降低*f**，持续10秒。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Потусторонний soul imprisoned by the wearer, their own maximum Health is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: After the wearer crushes a monster's soul, their Снижение урона is lowered by *f** for 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["[Placeholder] As the magic mirror shatters, the Viscountess appears.\n Viscountess: Do not be rude!"] = "[Placeholder] As the magic mirror shatters, the Viscountess appears.\n Viscountess: Do not be rude!",
    ["GTA-街头围猎-乌鸦怪连线boss的buff"] = "GTA - Street Hunt - Crow monster connecting to boss buff",
    ["[Family Dungeon] [Fire Dragon] Shockwave Warning"] = "[Family Dungeon] [Fire Dragon] Shockwave Warning",
    ["<Tips_BrownTitle> Buff </>"] = "<Tips_BrownTitle> Buff </>",
    ["【晋升】序列晋升上限提升至7,1250340"] = "【Advancement】Последовательность advancement cap increased to 7, 1250340",
    ["　　当你展开这封信笺时，芬芳的气息已将你包裹。这并非偶然，而是必然的命运——你被选中了。\n\n　　在贝克兰德雾气弥漫的街头，在廷根宁静的小巷深处，有这样一群人：他们追求极致的美丽，拥抱命运的无常，在灾厄中翩翩起舞。\n\n　　我们是春夜舞会。\n\n　　我们侍奉的是不幸与美丽的源头，是将灾难化作艺术的存在。在祂的庇护下，我们明晰了一个真理：\n\n　　真正的美，诞生于毁灭与重生之间。\n\n　　若你愿意加入我们，请前往\"珠宝店\"门口右侧。\n\n　　记住，我们不接受怯懦者，不欢迎虚伪者。唯有敢于凝视深渊，敢于拥抱真实的人，才配得上这场永不落幕的舞会。\n\n　　期待你的到来。"] = "Когда вы разворачиваете это письмо, вас уже окутывает благоухающий аромат. Это не случайность, а неизбежная судьба — вы избраны. \n\n　　На залитых туманом улицах Баклунда, глубоко в тихих переулках Тингена, живет группа людей: они стремятся к абсолютной красоте, принимают непостоянство судьбы и изящно танцуют среди катастроф. \n\n　　Мы Весенний Ночной Бал. \n\n　　Мы служим источнику несчастья и красоты, существованию, которое превращает катастрофу в искусство. Под Его покровительством мы осознали истину: \n\n　　Истинная красота рождается между разрушением и возрождением. \n\n　　Если вы хотите присоединиться к нам, пройдите направо от входа в «Ювелирный магазин». \n\n　　Помните, мы не принимаем трусливых и не приветствуем лицемеров. Только те, кто осмелится заглянуть в бездну и осмелится принять истину, достойны этого никогда не кончающегося бала. \n\n　　С нетерпением жду вашего приезда.",
    ["“窥秘人”和“占卜家”都可以更好地掌握神秘学领域的知识，里面可能就有我回家的线索。"] = "Both 'Подглядывающий за Тайнами' and 'Провидец' can better master knowledge in the field of mysticism; there might be clues to my home inside.",
    ["【LV5】【秘偶技】寻踪魔弹-召唤"] = "[LV5] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon",
    ["<Title>势力对战</>\n参与战略服的俱乐部将以最终确定的势力开启为期一个月的势力对战，参与<Highlight>霜陨领主、战略服猎城战、俱乐部征服宣令、战略服终末猎杀</>等玩法，获取俱乐部神选积分，并根据每周排名与最终排名争夺神选席位。俱乐部获得的神选席位由俱乐部管理在俱乐部内部分配。\n\n<Title>战略战备</>\n本次战略服将开放三项战略服专属战备：\n<Highlight>战略技能：</>每个途径可获得专属战略技能，合理使用将对战局产生重要影响。\n<Highlight>历史结晶：</>玩家可使用历史结晶将封印物提升至1级，并逐步解锁装配非凡物质的额外槽位。\n<Highlight>大帝征途：</>参与各项战略服玩法均可获得征服声望，可用于提升战略服军衔等级。\n<Highlight>以上战备仅在战略服内生效</>。\n\n<Title>神选荣耀</>\n势力对战结束后，将开启<Highlight>胜者宣言大会</>。大会结束后统一发放神选席位奖励与限时神降。后续还将根据各俱乐部的神选积分开启本服<Highlight>贸易战争</>，敬请期待。"] = "<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month Faction Battle based on the finalized factions. Participate in gameplay such as <Highlight> Frost-Fall Lord, Strategic Server City of Dragon Hunting, Club Conquest Decree, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to obtain Club God-Chosen Points and compete for God-Chosen seats based on weekly and final rankings. The God-Chosen seats obtained by the Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive Strategic Skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle. \n <Highlight> Исторические кристаллы: </> Players can use Исторические кристаллы to upgrade Запечатанный артефактs to Level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Потусторонний materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server gameplay can earn Conquest Reputation, which can be used to increase the Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> God-Chosen Glory </> \n After the Faction Battle ends, the <Highlight> Victor's Declaration </> ceremony will begin. After the ceremony, God-Chosen seat rewards and limited-time divine descent will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, this server's <Highlight> Trade War </> will be opened based on each Club's God-Chosen Points; stay tuned.",
    ["Buff层数满足条件"] = "Buff stacks meet conditions",
    ["[Insight] When the Beacon's Shield ends, it causes an Explosion, dealing damage to up to 2 targets around the Shield."] = "[Insight] When the Beacon's Shield ends, it causes an Explosion, dealing damage to up to 2 targets around the Shield.",
    ["【塔罗会·弓箭骑士】档5增量(+25%)→累计165%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["　　As you unfold this letter, a fragrant scent already envelops you. This is no coincidence, but an inevitable fate—you have been chosen. \n\n　　In the fog-drenched streets of Backlund, deep within the quiet alleys of Tingen, there exists a group of people: they pursue ultimate beauty, embrace the impermanence of fate, and dance gracefully amidst disaster. \n\n　　We are the Spring Night Ball. \n\n　　We serve the source of misfortune and beauty, the existence that transforms catastrophe into art. Under His shelter, we have realized a truth: \n\n　　True beauty is born between destruction and rebirth. \n\n　　If you are willing to join us, please head to the right side of the \"Jewelry Store\" entrance. \n\n　　Remember, we do not accept the cowardly, nor do we welcome the hypocritical. Only those who dare to gaze into the abyss and dare to embrace the truth are worthy of this ball that never ends. \n\n　　Looking forward to your arrival."] = "Когда вы разворачиваете это письмо, вас уже окутывает благоухающий аромат. Это не случайность, а неизбежная судьба — вы избраны. \n\n　　На залитых туманом улицах Баклунда, глубоко в тихих переулках Тингена, живет группа людей: они стремятся к абсолютной красоте, принимают непостоянство судьбы и изящно танцуют среди катастроф. \n\n　　Мы Весенний Ночной Бал. \n\n　　Мы служим источнику несчастья и красоты, существованию, которое превращает катастрофу в искусство. Под Его покровительством мы осознали истину: \n\n　　Истинная красота рождается между разрушением и возрождением. \n\n　　Если вы хотите присоединиться к нам, пройдите направо от входа в «Ювелирный магазин». \n\n　　Помните, мы не принимаем трусливых и не приветствуем лицемеров. Только те, кто осмелится заглянуть в бездну и осмелится принять истину, достойны этого никогда не кончающегося бала. \n\n　　С нетерпением жду вашего приезда.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n在命运时刻战场中，非凡者分为两个阵营，每场对局持续<Highlight>4分钟</>，对局结束时分数较高的一方获胜，积分相同则依次判断击杀数和伤害量，高的一方获胜，均相同则随机一方获胜。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>机制说明</>\n<Highlight>积分获取：</>可通过拾取增益光点、击杀、助攻、进入纷争漩涡争夺来获取。\n<Highlight>汇集锚点：</>对局内会出现汇集锚点并持续<Highlight>15秒</>，届时根据锚点<Highlight>需求人数</>进入锚点，人数达到要求后持续<Highlight>3秒</>后将会将本阵营非凡者集结于此，同时参与集结的非凡者将获得限时属性加成。\n<Highlight>纷争漩涡：</>战场中间会出现纷争漩涡，纷争漩涡<Highlight>倒计时结束时</>留在漩涡内的非凡者将平分积分。\n<Highlight>增益光点：</>战场中会出现增益光点，拾取增益光点会获得<Highlight>积分及属性加成</>。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nIn the Fate Moment battlefield, Потустороннийs are divided into two factions. Each match lasts for <Highlight>4 minutes</>. The side with the higher score at the end of the match wins. If scores are tied, the side with more kills wins; if kills are also tied, the side with more damage wins. If all are equal, a random side wins.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Mechanism Explanation</>\n<Highlight>Score Acquisition: </>Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete.\n<Highlight>Gathering Anchors: </>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Highlight>15 seconds</>. When they appear, Потустороннийs must enter the anchor based on the <Highlight>required number of people</>. Once the requirement is met, after <Highlight>3 seconds</>, the Потустороннийs of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Потустороннийs will receive a temporary attribute bonus.\n<Highlight>Vortex of Strife: </>A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight>countdown ends</>, Потустороннийs remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Highlight>Buff Orbs: </>Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield. Picking them up grants <Highlight>points and attribute bonuses</>.",
    ["<Title>Resurrection Count Bonus</>\nIf 3–8 people in a party or team belong to the same Family, gain 1 extra resurrection attempt; if 9 or more people belong to the same Family, gain 2 extra resurrection attempts. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family.\n<Title>Attribute Supplement Bonus</>\nIf there are members of the same Family in a party or team, gain attribute bonuses. The more members of the same Family in the team, the higher the bonus effect. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family."] = "<Title>Resurrection Count Bonus</>\nIf 3–8 people in a party or team belong to the same Family, gain 1 extra resurrection attempt; if 9 or more people belong to the same Family, gain 2 extra resurrection attempts. There is a 24-hour Перезарядка period after leaving a Family.\n<Title>Attribute Supplement Bonus</>\nIf there are members of the same Family in a party or team, gain attribute bonuses. The more members of the same Family in the team, the higher the bonus effect. There is a 24-hour Перезарядка period after leaving a Family.",
    ["...And then we all charge up and fight the dragon for three hundred rounds!"] = "...And then we all charge up and fight the dragon for three hundred rounds!",
    ["BOSS 4 Ancestor Knight - Spell Field Corruption Stealth Monster"] = "БОСС 4 Рыцарь-предок - Стелс-монстр с повреждением поля заклинаний",
    ["　　他看着西迦·特昂道：\n　　“我打算申请加入‘红手套’。”\n　　“‘红手套’？可他们的最低要求是序列7……而且，‘红手套’面对的危险成倍于普通的值夜者小队。”西迦·特昂疑惑中带着关切地说道。\n　　伦纳德勾勒出一抹没有笑意的笑容：\n　　“我差不多可以晋升了。”\n　　他的眼眸转冷，咬牙切齿地无声自语道：\n　　我要报仇！\n　　因斯·赞格威尔，你一定要活着等到我强大起来！\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第二百一十一章 葬礼"] = "He looked at Xiga and said:\n \"I intend to apply to join the 'Red Gloves'.\"\n \"'Red Gloves'? But their minimum requirement is Последовательность 7... and the dangers the 'Red Gloves' face are exponentially higher than those of a standard Nighthawk team.\" Xiga said, her voice filled with confusion and concern.\n Leonard sketched a smile that didn't reach his eyes:\n \"I'm almost ready for advancement.\"\n His eyes turned cold, and he muttered silently through gritted teeth:\n I must have my revenge!\n Ince Zangwill, you must stay alive until I become strong enough!\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 211: Funeral",
    ["...I know how to break out of prison now, it's actually so simple!"] = "...I know how to break out of prison now, it's actually so simple!",
    ["Attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Avatar of Disaster></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Critical Hit increased.\""] = "Атакуйте <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с аффиксом <Highlight><Avatar of Disaster></>: «Все уровни навыков +1, критический удар увеличен».",
    ["<Rate>80%</> chance for a Wishing Marionette to appear; if it doesn't appear, it is guaranteed to appear next time"] = "<Rate>80%</> chance for a Wishing Марионетка to appear; if it doesn't appear, it is guaranteed to appear next time",
    ["The \"Antigonus Family Notebook\" is in Riel Bieber's hands, Sealed Artifact 2-049 will lead us to find him."] = "The \"Antigonus Family Notebook\" is in Riel Bieber's hands, Запечатанный артефакт 2-049 will lead us to find him.",
    ["L_IDLE               = 101,     -- 站立空闲\n    L_MOVE               = 102,     -- 移动, 诸如走/跑/冲刺跑\n    L_MOVE_TURN          = 103,     -- 移动转身\n    L_DODGE              = 104,     -- 冲刺\n    L_JUMP               = 105,     -- 跳跃\n    L_DROPPING           = 106,     -- 跌落"] = "L_IDLE = 101, -- Standing idle \n L_MOVE = 102, -- Movement, such as walk/run/sprint \n L_MOVE_TURN = 103, -- Move turn \n L_DODGE = 104, -- Dash \n L_JUMP = 105, -- Jump \n L_DROPPING = 106, -- Falling",
    ["“0”级封印物……需要注意什么？"] = "Grade 0 Запечатанный артефакт... what do I need to pay attention to?",
    ["[Enhanced] Critical hits deal an additional <HighLight>50%</> Critical Damage for <HighLight>3</> seconds."] = "[Enhanced] Critical hits deal an additional <HighLight>50%</> Critical Damage for <HighLight>3</> seconds.",
    ["“我的脑袋快要爆炸了……仪式魔法、神秘学知识……”"] = "«Моя голова вот-вот взорвется... Ритуальная магия, оккультные знания...»",
    ["“戏法大师”魔药配方"] = "Формула зелья «Маг»",
    ["\"The World Within the Mirror: Introduction to Magic Mirror Divination\", \"Numerology, A Divine Revelation\", \"Analysis of Divination Materials\"... these are all tough monographs to crack."] = "\"The World Within the Mirror: Introduction to Magic Mirror Гадание\", \"Numerology, A Divine Revelation\", \"Analysis of Гадание Materials\"... these are all tough monographs to crack.",
    ["[数据库错误]角色反序列化失败。"] = "[Ошибка базы данных] Не удалось выполнить десериализацию символов.",
    [" \n ...Human reason has a special fate in a certain category of its knowledge, which is that it is troubled by some problems it cannot escape. Because these problems are proposed to it by the nature of reason itself, yet it cannot answer them. Because they transcend all the capabilities of human reason. \n This predicament does not stem from ignorance, but from the impulse of reason itself—it longs to transcend the boundaries of experience and question those ultimates that cannot be verified by the senses. Thus, reason falls into a permanent self-tearing: it can neither stop questioning nor provide a confirmed answer."] = "\n ...Human reason has a special fate in a certain category of its knowledge, which is that it is troubled by some problems it cannot escape. Because these problems are proposed to it by the nature of reason itself, yet it cannot answer them. Because they transcend all the capabilities of human reason. \n This predicament does not stem from ignorance, but from the impulse of reason itself—it longs to transcend the boundaries of experience and question those ultimates that cannot be verified by the senses. Thus, reason falls into a permanent self-tearing: it can neither stop questioning nor provide a confirmed answer.",
    ["While the Buff holds this Action, the appearance information of the Buff's OverrideLockTarget is stored on the server for AddCacheAppearance to call."] = "While the Buff holds this Action, the appearance information of the Buff's OverrideLockTarget is stored on the server for AddCacheAppearance to call.",
    ["　　精通各种占卜，擅长手相、面相等占卜方式，每次收费<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> 8便士</>。"] = "Владеющий различными методами гадания, хиромантией, чтением по лицу и другими методами гадания, 8 пенсов <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> </> за сеанс.",
    ["{{先生|女士}} 能请您再点燃一根火柴吗"] = "{{ Mr.| Ms.}}, could you please light another match for me?",
    ["【Tarot Club · Sylvia】Tier 3 increment (+15%) → cumulative 114%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["{{player.name}} released a \"Space-Breaking Rift\" and summoned the <Chat_Highlight>Hall of Fame</>!"] = "{{player.name}} released a \"Space-Breaking Rift\" and summoned the <Chat_Highlight>Hall of Fame</>!",
    ["【死亡教派】(7) 全队 +35%攻击力 +10%吸血"] = "【Death Sect】(7) Entire team +35% Attack Power +10% Вампиризм",
    ["BOSS4-品质-中攻击"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — Средняя атака",
    ["[Enhanced] Gain <HighLight>2%</> Attack bonus when dealing or taking damage, stacking up to <HighLight>15</> times."] = "[Enhanced] Gain <HighLight>2%</> Attack bonus when dealing or taking damage, stacking up to <HighLight>15</> times.",
    ["[Text] Health"] = "[Text] Health",
    ["LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(技能),Float()))"] = "LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(Skill), Float())).",
    ["[LV5] [Marionette Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill"] = "[LV5] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill",
    ["True:监听所有技能；\nFalse:只监听匹配SkillIDs、SkillTags、SkillTypes的技能"] = "Верно: слушайте все навыки; \nFalse: прослушивать только те навыки, которые соответствуют SkillID, SkillTags, SkillTypes.",
    ["To 非凡者\n    总有些事情，高于其他！\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Потусторонний \n Всегда есть вещи, которые выше других! \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["[SceneCustomSystem]: Failed to export booth configuration string: serialization failed, reason = %s"] = "[SceneCustomSystem]: не удалось экспортировать строку конфигурации кабины: сбой сериализации, причина = %s",
    ["[PrintAppearanceData]: %s 为空，跳过序列化字段拆分"] = "[PrintAppearanceData]: %s пуст, разделение сериализованных полей пропускается.",
    ["“1184年1月1日，盛大的新年晚会，弗洛纳尔夫人真是一个尤物啊。”"] = "\"January 1st, 1184. A grand New Year's party. Mrs. Flonal is truly a stunner.\"",
    ["【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Normal, 1250309"] = "【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Normal, 1250309",
    ["　　邓恩和戴莉认识之后，戴莉就以“自己的羽毛掉光了，好冷”为理由在邓恩头上筑了巢，并为他重复每个被遗忘的信息；邓恩则载着它巡视森林，用厚厚的灰色皮毛为它挡风，用鹿角为它摘下最高处的浆果。\n\n　　戴莉喜欢趴在它脑袋靠后一些的位置，并时常抱怨它额前的毛发不够厚实。\n\n　　一天，戴莉发现邓恩从地上捡起来什么东西，固定在角上后它发现是自己掉落的羽毛。\n\n 　　“这些羽毛太美了，我舍不得它们就这样被遗忘。”邓恩甩了甩头，“即使我明天就会忘记为什么要这么做，但我的角会记得这种发痒的感觉。”\n\n　　戴莉的心轻轻颤动，她激动地盘旋在邓恩的两角之间，准备一展歌喉抖落几根崭新的羽毛。邓恩阻止了它这种会让自己更冷的行为，请它帮忙整理那些收集好的羽毛。戴莉将它们和一个个木牌挂在一起，让它们在风雪中碰撞，与鹿蹄声和鸟鸣声组成森林的曲调。"] = "After Dunn and Daly met, Daly built a nest on Dunn's head, using the excuse that 'my feathers have all fallen out, it's so cold,' and repeated every forgotten piece of information to him; Dunn carried it while patrolling the forest, shielding it from the wind with his thick gray fur and picking berries from the highest branches with his antlers. \n\n    Daly liked to lie on the back of his head and often complained that the fur on his forehead wasn't thick enough. \n\n    One day, Daly noticed Dunn picking something up from the ground and fixing it to his antlers, only to realize it was its own fallen feathers. \n\n     'These feathers are too beautiful, I can't bear to let them be forgotten like this.' Dunn shook his head. 'Even if I forget why I'm doing this tomorrow, my antlers will remember this itching sensation.' \n\n    Daly's heart fluttered gently. It circled excitedly between Dunn's two antlers, preparing to show off its voice and shake off a few brand-new feathers. Dunn stopped it from doing something that would make it even colder and asked it to help organize the collected feathers. Daly hung them together with wooden tags, letting them collide in the wind and snow, composing the forest's melody with the sound of deer hooves and bird calls.",
    ["【Seer】(6) +25% Attack Power"] = "【Провидец】(6) +25% Attack Power",
    ["<Red>Vision Impairment</>: Within 5 seconds after the Otherworldly state ends, you fall into a blurred vision state, during which Block is reduced by *f** and Defense is reduced by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Vision Impairment</>: Within 5 seconds after the Otherworldly state ends, you fall into a blurred vision state, during which Block is reduced by *f** and Defense is reduced by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions.",
    ["　　“看来我需要证明自己。”\n　　她缓步走到门边，伸出右掌，按在了把手的位置。\n　　霍然间，奥黛丽眼前一花，似乎看见佛尔思女士变成幻影，穿透了大门。\n　　她心中惊骇，凝神再看，发现佛尔思已不在原地。\n　　几秒之后，把手转动，反锁住的房门被直接打开，佛尔思·沃尔含笑从外面走了进来，守在门口不远处的女仆安妮却丝毫没有察觉到背后发生的事情。\n　　“这真是神奇的能力啊。”格莱林特赞叹出声。\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第一百零七章 佛尔思"] = "\"It seems I need to prove myself.\"\n She walked slowly to the door, extended her right palm, and pressed it against the handle.\n Suddenly, Audrey's vision blurred, and she seemed to see Ms. Fors turn into a phantom and pass through the door.\n She was horrified and looked again, only to find that Fors was no longer in her original spot.\n A few seconds later, the handle turned, and the locked door was opened directly. Fors Wall walked in from outside with a smile, while the maid Annie, who was guarding not far from the door, had not noticed what happened behind her at all.\n \"This is truly a magical ability,\" Gregrace exclaimed.\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 107: Fors",
    ["【死亡教派】(5) 全队 +20%攻击力 +5%吸血"] = "【Death Sect】(5) Entire team +20% Attack Power +5% Вампиризм",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛程安排</>\n<Highlight>首场四方联赛</>将在开服<Highlight>第一周周日中午12:00</>通过对俱乐部的综合评判划分赛区、分组，并于<Highlight>当日晚18:00</>公示赛区以及分组。联赛以<Highlight>每两场对阵为一轮</>，每一轮持续<Highlight>两周</>，开服第一周周日晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启首轮联赛（特殊），后续调整为每周六晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启四方联赛。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛制规则</>\n每轮比赛由两场对阵组成。每轮第一场开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名以及第7、8名将分别进入不同的比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下<Highlight>随机分配</>。第一场比赛结束后，各比赛小组<Highlight>前2名进入胜者组</>，后2名进入败者组。第二场比赛将分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，并根据比赛结果确定本轮<Highlight>第1至第8名</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋降级规则</>\n每轮第二场比赛结束后，将于当周周六21:20进行本轮晋降级：<Highlight>圣名组及圣名组以上</>分组内前两名晋级上一分组，末两名降级至下一分组；<Highlight>英杰组及英杰组以下</>组内第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组。其中<Highlight>传奇组、史诗组、旅者组</>为特殊分组：传奇组第一、二名晋升一组，第六、七名均降一组，第八名降两组；史诗组第一、二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组；旅者组第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七、八名降级两组；挑战者组第一名晋升两组，第二、三名晋升一组。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>联盟组规则</>\n排名在旅者组之后的俱乐部将根据<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>划分至<Highlight>挑战者组</>（前八名）及后续<Highlight>联盟组</>（<Highlight>联盟组不参与升降级</>）。联盟组的俱乐部将在每场联赛开始前<Highlight>自动匹配</>其它俱乐部组成联盟，以联盟形式参与四方联赛，联盟内<Highlight>所有俱乐部成员</>均可入场参战，联盟中<Highlight>排名最高俱乐部的会长</>将在局内自动获得<Highlight>联赛指挥权限</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n每个新赛季开始时联赛将<Highlight>重新划分赛区</>，届时将按照<Highlight>上一赛季联赛成绩</>重新匹配对手构建新的赛区。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide regions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs <Highlight> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening at 12:00 PM </>, and the regions and groups will be announced <Highlight> at 6:00 PM on the same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) starts at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening, and subsequent leagues are adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st and 2nd, 3rd and 4th, 5th and 6th, and 7th and 8th place teams in the group will be assigned to different match groups, and <Highlight> randomly assigned </> while meeting this rule. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the winner's bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the loser's bracket. The second match will feature winner's bracket and loser's bracket duels respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the match results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place at 9:20 PM on that Saturday: <Highlight> For the Saint Name group and above </>, the top two in the group are promoted to the previous group, and the bottom two are relegated to the next group; <Highlight> For the Hero group and below </>, the first in the group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups. Among them, <Highlight> the Legend, Epic, and Traveler groups </> are special groups: the first and second in the Legend group are promoted one group, the sixth and seventh are relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first and second in the Epic group are promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first in the Traveler group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, and the seventh and eighth are relegated two groups; the first in the Challenger group is promoted two groups, and the second and third are promoted one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance groups </> (<Highlight> Alliance groups do not participate in promotion or relegation </>) based on the <Highlight> total club Потусторонний score </>. Clubs in the Alliance group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance before each league starts, participating in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battle, and the <Highlight> president of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically obtain <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide regions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to build new regions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Tingen, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble..."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Тинген, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble...",
    ["<P_Yellow>An out-of-control Beyonder</> is extremely dangerous; we must find her as soon as possible."] = "<P_Yellow>Вышедший из-под контроля Потусторонний</> чрезвычайно опасен; мы должны найти ее как можно скорее.",
    ["self.HasOverHeal表示自己造成的治疗溢出时true"] = "self.HasOverHeal is true when the Healing you caused overflows",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战场背景</>\n<Highlight>末日将近</>，星空中的污染日益逼近，<Highlight>非凡事件</>频发。各大非凡俱乐部自发组织联合演练，在历史沙盘中模拟对抗，以应对即将到来的危机。<Highlight>四方联赛</>，便是其中规模最大、最接近实战的训练场。<Highlight>俱乐部</>同场竞技，争夺的不仅是荣誉，更是锤炼<Highlight>末日来临</>时守护人类的能力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battlefield Background </>\n <Highlight> The apocalypse is near </>, Искажение from the starry sky is closing in, and <Highlight> Потусторонний incidents </> are frequent. Major Потусторонний clubs have spontaneously organized joint drills, simulating confrontations in historical sandboxes to prepare for the coming crisis. The <Highlight> Four-Way League </> is the largest and most realistic training ground among them. <Highlight> Clubs </> compete in the same arena, vying not just for honor, but to hone the ability to <Highlight> protect humanity when the apocalypse arrives </>.",
    ["“魔术师”女士，对您来说，“愚者”先生是个什么样的存在？"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, to you, what kind of existence is Mr. “Fool”?",
    ["<Red>Screech Weakness</>: When the wearer leaves Screech Stimulation, if they are still in combat, they will fall into Weakness, reducing Attack by 5% and movement speed by 15%. This persists until leaving combat or putting the mask back on. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material entry attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Screech Weakness</>: When the wearer leaves Screech Stimulation, if they are still in combat, they will fall into Weakness, reducing Attack by 5% and Скорость бега by 15%. This persists until leaving combat or putting the mask back on. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material entry attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["“魔术师”小姐的信和托付的书籍，要尽快交给“月亮”先生。"] = "A letter and a book entrusted by Miss Фокусник, to be delivered to Mr. Moon as soon as possible.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Factions and Basic Rules </>\n<Highlight> 4 Clubs </> compete on the same field, with each Club fielding <Highlight> 60 official members </>, totaling 240 players in a single match. A single Pathway can have a maximum of <Highlight> 16 players </> from the same Club on the field; please plan your lineup configuration reasonably. Each match lasts <Highlight> 23 minutes </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n<Highlight> The first Club to reach 3000 points </> immediately secures victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is determined by the current points. If points are tied, the <Highlight> total kills </> and <Highlight> total Club Beyonder rating </> are compared in order. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> In-Match Point Acquisition </>\n The only source of in-match points is <Highlight> occupying Guardians and Guardian ownership settlement </>: The first occupation of a Guardian grants <Highlight> 50 points </>; a minor ownership settlement occurs every 5 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 1 point </>; a major ownership settlement occurs every 30 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 18 points </>. <Highlight> High-multiplier Guardian ownership settlement </> will refresh randomly at the 4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes of the match, with a 90-second advance notice. During high-multiplier settlements, each occupied Guardian can provide <Highlight> 72 points or 108 points </> during the major ownership settlement, corresponding to four times and six times the point yield, respectively, with the specific multiplier determined by the refreshed Guardian location. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Guardian Contention </>\n There are <Highlight> 5 Guardians </> on the map. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian will gain control of it. After a successful occupation, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to your side. Guardians <Highlight> cannot be healed </>, but they can slowly recover Health automatically when there are no enemies nearby. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Resources and Command Authority </>\n<Highlight> Defeating enemy players </> or <Highlight> occupying Guardians </> will grant resource points and automatically accumulate <Highlight> Morale Level </>. <Highlight> The President, Vice President, and Council Members </> can consume resource points to unleash Command Skills. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Command Skills </>\n<Highlight> Declaration of Defeating the Enemy </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to increase the all-Pathway Suppression of all your members by 15% for 20 seconds. Cooldown 180 seconds. <Highlight> Forced March </>: Consumes 600 resource points to increase the movement speed of all your members by 60% for 10 seconds. Cooldown 120 seconds. <Highlight> Zero-Order Edict </>: Consumes 1500 resource points to immediately clear the current Resurrection wait time for all your members; members of your side who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds can also be resurrected immediately. Cooldown 240 seconds. <Highlight> Summon Teleport </>: Consumes 2400 resource points to summon all your members to a designated assembly point. Cooldown 240 seconds. <Highlight> Sanctuary Protection </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to restore 50% of the maximum Health of all your Guardians. Cooldown 180 seconds. \n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Factions and Basic Rules </>\n<Highlight> 4 Clubs </> compete on the same field, with each Club fielding <Highlight> 60 official members </>, totaling 240 players in a single match. A single Pathway can have a maximum of <Highlight> 16 players </> from the same Club on the field; please plan your lineup configuration reasonably. Each match lasts <Highlight> 23 minutes </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n<Highlight> The first Club to reach 3000 points </> immediately secures victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is determined by the current points. If points are tied, the <Highlight> total kills </> and <Highlight> total Club Потусторонний rating </> are compared in order. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> In-Match Point Acquisition </>\n The only source of in-match points is <Highlight> occupying Guardians and Guardian ownership settlement </>: The first occupation of a Guardian grants <Highlight> 50 points </>; a minor ownership settlement occurs every 5 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 1 point </>; a major ownership settlement occurs every 30 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 18 points </>. <Highlight> High-multiplier Guardian ownership settlement </> will refresh randomly at the 4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes of the match, with a 90-second advance notice. During high-multiplier settlements, each occupied Guardian can provide <Highlight> 72 points or 108 points </> during the major ownership settlement, corresponding to four times and six times the point yield, respectively, with the specific multiplier determined by the refreshed Guardian location. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Guardian Contention </>\n There are <Highlight> 5 Guardians </> on the map. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian will gain control of it. After a successful occupation, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to your side. Guardians <Highlight> cannot be healed </>, but they can slowly recover Health automatically when there are no enemies nearby. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Resources and Command Authority </>\n<Highlight> Defeating enemy players </> or <Highlight> occupying Guardians </> will grant resource points and automatically accumulate <Highlight> Morale Level </>. <Highlight> The President, Vice President, and Council Members </> can consume resource points to unleash Command Skills. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Command Skills </>\n<Highlight> Declaration of Defeating the Enemy </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to increase the all-Pathway Suppression of all your members by 15% for 20 seconds. Перезарядка 180 seconds. <Highlight> Forced March </>: Consumes 600 resource points to increase the Скорость бега of all your members by 60% for 10 seconds. Перезарядка 120 seconds. <Highlight> Zero-Order Edict </>: Consumes 1500 resource points to immediately clear the current Resurrection wait time for all your members; members of your side who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds can also be resurrected immediately. Перезарядка 240 seconds. <Highlight> Summon Teleport </>: Consumes 2400 resource points to summon all your members to a designated assembly point. Перезарядка 240 seconds. <Highlight> Sanctuary Protection </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to restore 50% of the maximum Health of all your Guardians. Перезарядка 180 seconds. \n",
    ["【实证】回复量增加10%，不超过施法者血量上限22%。"] = "[Empirical] Recovery amount increased by 10%, not exceeding 22% of the caster's maximum health.",
    ["……我知道要怎么越狱了，原来这么简单！"] = "...I know how to break out of prison now, it's actually so simple!",
    ["Recharge is not currently supported on iOS."] = "Recharge is not currently supported on iOS.",
    ["Enum(技能目标)"] = "Enum (Skill Target).",
    ["“死亡执政官”向你投来注视。"] = "The Death Archon is casting his gaze upon you.",
    ["【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Seer】 \n At the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands under the wishing tree, looking around anxiously..."] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Провидец】 \n At the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands under the wishing tree, looking around anxiously...",
    ["MagicWall_Hall stairs"] = "MagicWall_Hall stairs",
    ["【Tarot Club · Alienated Hound】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Чужая гончая】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["“世界”先生，你给予的那件非凡武器超乎我预料得好，我已经攒够功勋，兑换到材料，晋升序列8了。"] = "«Мир», предоставленное вами оружие Потустороннего оказалось лучше, чем я ожидал. Я накопил достаточно заслуг, чтобы обменять их на материалы и перейти к восьмой последовательности.",
    ["[SceneCustomSystem]: 导出展台配置字符串失败：序列化失败，原因 = %s"] = "[SceneCustomSystem]: не удалось экспортировать строку конфигурации кабины: сбой сериализации, причина = %s",
    ["<P_Heart>（递出）</>这个就是你丢的旅行符咒吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (передает его) </> Это талисман путешествия, который ты потерял?",
    ["【】使人健康"] = "【】makes people healthy",
    ["　　“我们是守护者，也是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫。”\n　　窗外走廊封闭，石墙冰冷，屋内灯火照耀，明亮发黄，邓恩·史密斯的转述在这样的环境里余音袅袅，一下一下敲打在克莱恩的心头，让他短暂竟说不出话来。\n　　见克莱恩默然，邓恩摇头笑道：\n　　“是不是很失望？非凡者和你想象的并不一样，我们一直在与危险同行。”\n　　“有获得，就肯定有代价。”克莱恩从刚才的震撼里平复，斟酌着语气回答。\n　　他确实没想到非凡者光耀、超常、不同于普通的一面外，还有这样的隐患，不过或许是因为只听到描述，还没真切遭遇，也或许是由于本身已经卷入这个漩涡，说不定什么时候就有诡异事件落到身上，他的害怕、忐忑、担心和畏惧等情绪很快便降低到可以控制的程度。\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第二十章 起源和原因"] = "\"We are guardians, and also a bunch of poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and Безумие.\"\n Outside the window, the corridor was sealed and the stone walls were cold. Inside, the lamplight shone bright and yellow. Dunn Smith's retelling lingered in such an environment, striking Klein's heart beat by beat, leaving him momentarily speechless.\n Seeing Klein silent, Dunn shook his head and smiled:\n \"Disappointed? Потустороннийs aren't what you imagined; we are always walking alongside danger.\"\n \"With gain, there must be a price.\" Klein recovered from the shock and replied, weighing his words.\n He truly hadn't expected that beyond the glorious, extraordinary, and unique aspects of being a Потусторонний, there were such hidden dangers. Perhaps it was because he had only heard the description and hadn't truly encountered them yet, or perhaps because he was already caught in this vortex and could face bizarre events at any time, his fear, anxiety, and worry quickly subsided to a controllable level.\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 20: Origin and Reason",
    ["<P_Heart>(The key to a potion is not mastering and digging, but digestion and acting... what does that mean?)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Ключ к зелью - не освоение и копание, а переваривание и действие... что это значит?)</>",
    ["{{\"技能ID%i\",\"增加等级\"}}"] = "{{\"Skill ID%i\", \"Level Increase\"}}",
    ["trigger-Voiceover 1"] = "trigger-Voiceover 1",
    ["【右摇杆模式7】对身前圆形范围内敌人攻击。注意目标筛选的偏移和半径参数与右摇杆模式预警参数是相关的。"] = "[Right Stick Mode 7] Attacks enemies within a circular range in front. Note that the target filtering offset and radius parameters are related to the Right Stick Mode warning parameters.",
    ["[Placeholder] Klein recalled the divination from this period, and a yellow crystal appeared in his mind; he suddenly had some insights."] = "[Placeholder] Klein recalled the Гадание from this period, and a yellow crystal appeared in his mind; he suddenly had some insights.",
    ["did Armor Break 2"] = "did Armor Break 2",
    ["GTA连环杀手给玩家处决技能"] = "GTA Serial Killer Grants Player Execution Skill",
    ["Buff持有该Action期间，将Buff的OverrideLockTarget的外观信息存储到服务端，供AddCacheAppearance调用"] = "While the Buff holds this Action, the appearance information of the Buff's OverrideLockTarget is stored on the server for AddCacheAppearance to call.",
    ["GTA - Universal Healing Item"] = "GTA - Universal Healing Item",
    ["【塔罗会·戴里克】+10%暴击"] = "【Клуба Таро · Вышка】+10% критического удара",
    ["【Seer】(4) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 30% Attack Power distance damage bonus."] = "【Провидец】(4) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 30% Attack Power distance damage bonus.",
    ["【死亡教派】(3) 全队 +10%攻击力"] = "【Death Sect】(3) Entire team +10% Attack Power",
    ["<Title>Giant Dragon Appearance</>\nThe Giant Dragon - Projection appears at the <Highlight>center of the Dragon Hunting City Royal City</> 10 minutes after the <Highlight>Hunting Time</> starts on Friday night, which is <Highlight>19:10</>. If it is not repelled before 20:00, the Giant Dragon will leave, and the kill settlement will not be triggered. \n\n<Title>Attribution Damage</>\nDamage is only counted towards the player's current team if they are alive within <Highlight>40 meters</> of the Giant Dragon and dealing damage to it. When the Giant Dragon is repelled, the <Highlight>team with the highest current effective attribution damage</> receives the final attribution and auction rewards. After approaching the Giant Dragon, you can view the current attribution damage in real-time. \n\n<Title>Damage Decay</>\nAfter a player dies, leaves the Giant Dragon crusade range, switches channels, or leaves the team, the attribution damage that player has accumulated for the team will begin to decay, and this will synchronously affect the team's current effective attribution damage. \n\nFor the <Highlight>first 5 seconds</> after decay is triggered, the attribution damage remains unchanged; starting from the 6th second, <Highlight>it decreases by 5% of the original accumulated attribution damage every 6 seconds</>, and reaches zero after 120 seconds. \n\nAfter re-entering the <Highlight>Giant Dragon crusade range</> and resuming combat, the decay stops. The current remaining attribution damage will be retained, and new damage dealt will continue to be accumulated on this basis. \n\n<Title>Auction Rewards</>\nAfter repelling the Giant Dragon, auctions for corresponding tiers will be opened based on the Intense Battle Value. <Highlight>The higher the Intense Battle Value, the higher the tier of auction rewards that can be opened</>. \n\n<Title>Qualification Restrictions</>\nIn each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the qualification for the Giant Dragon - Projection's Final Hunt auction at most <Highlight>1 time</>; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during this event."] = "<Title>Giant Dragon Appearance</>\nThe Giant Dragon - Projection appears at the <Highlight>center of the Dragon Hunting City Royal City</> 10 minutes after the <Highlight>Hunting Time</> starts on Friday night, which is <Highlight>19:10</>. If it is not repelled before 20:00, the Giant Dragon will leave, and the kill settlement will not be triggered. \n\n<Title>Attribution Damage</>\nDamage is only counted towards the player's current team if they are alive within <Highlight>40 meters</> of the Giant Dragon and dealing damage to it. When the Giant Dragon is repelled, the <Highlight>team with the highest current effective attribution damage</> receives the final attribution and auction rewards. After approaching the Giant Dragon, you can view the current attribution damage in real-time. \n\n<Title>Damage Decay</>\nAfter a player dies, leaves the Giant Dragon crusade range, switches channels, or leaves the team, the attribution damage that player has accumulated for the team will begin to decay, and this will synchronously affect the team's current effective attribution damage. \n\nFor the <Highlight>first 5 seconds</> after decay is triggered, the attribution damage remains unchanged; starting from the 6th second, <Highlight>it decreases by 5% of the original accumulated attribution damage every 6 seconds</>, and reaches zero after 120 seconds. \n\nAfter re-entering the <Highlight>Giant Dragon crusade range</> and resuming combat, the decay stops. The current remaining attribution damage will be retained, and new damage dealt will continue to be accumulated on this basis. \n\n<Title>Auction Rewards</>\nAfter repelling the Giant Dragon, auctions for corresponding tiers will be opened based on the Intense Battle Value. <Highlight>The higher the Intense Battle Value, the higher the tier of auction rewards that can be opened</>. \n\n<Title>Qualification Restrictions</>\nIn each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the qualification for the Giant Dragon - Projection's Final Hunt auction at most <Highlight>1 time</>; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during this event.",
    ["Insufficient \"Beyonder Material\" quantity, cannot aggregate with one tap"] = "Insufficient \"Потусторонний Material\" quantity, cannot aggregate with one tap",
    ["Tab轮选测试配置-镜头优先-奶妈"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет камеры — Целитель",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide regions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs <Highlight> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening at 12:00 PM </>, and the regions and groups will be announced <Highlight> at 6:00 PM on the same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) starts at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening, and subsequent leagues are adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st and 2nd, 3rd and 4th, 5th and 6th, and 7th and 8th place teams in the group will be assigned to different match groups, and <Highlight> randomly assigned </> while meeting this rule. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the winner's bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the loser's bracket. The second match will feature winner's bracket and loser's bracket duels respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the match results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place at 9:20 PM on that Saturday: <Highlight> For the Saint Name group and above </>, the top two in the group are promoted to the previous group, and the bottom two are relegated to the next group; <Highlight> For the Hero group and below </>, the first in the group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups. Among them, <Highlight> the Legend, Epic, and Traveler groups </> are special groups: the first and second in the Legend group are promoted one group, the sixth and seventh are relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first and second in the Epic group are promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first in the Traveler group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, and the seventh and eighth are relegated two groups; the first in the Challenger group is promoted two groups, and the second and third are promoted one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance groups </> (<Highlight> Alliance groups do not participate in promotion or relegation </>) based on the <Highlight> total club Beyonder score </>. Clubs in the Alliance group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance before each league starts, participating in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battle, and the <Highlight> president of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically obtain <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide regions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to build new regions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide regions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs <Highlight> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening at 12:00 PM </>, and the regions and groups will be announced <Highlight> at 6:00 PM on the same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) starts at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening, and subsequent leagues are adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st and 2nd, 3rd and 4th, 5th and 6th, and 7th and 8th place teams in the group will be assigned to different match groups, and <Highlight> randomly assigned </> while meeting this rule. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the winner's bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the loser's bracket. The second match will feature winner's bracket and loser's bracket duels respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the match results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place at 9:20 PM on that Saturday: <Highlight> For the Saint Name group and above </>, the top two in the group are promoted to the previous group, and the bottom two are relegated to the next group; <Highlight> For the Hero group and below </>, the first in the group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups. Among them, <Highlight> the Legend, Epic, and Traveler groups </> are special groups: the first and second in the Legend group are promoted one group, the sixth and seventh are relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first and second in the Epic group are promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first in the Traveler group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, and the seventh and eighth are relegated two groups; the first in the Challenger group is promoted two groups, and the second and third are promoted one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance groups </> (<Highlight> Alliance groups do not participate in promotion or relegation </>) based on the <Highlight> total club Потусторонний score </>. Clubs in the Alliance group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance before each league starts, participating in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battle, and the <Highlight> president of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically obtain <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide regions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to build new regions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
    ["<P_Red>The mother of all spiritual powers...</>"] = "<P_Red>Мать всех духовных сил...</>",
    ["<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, the Crimson Moon Crown is activated, reducing damage taken by the player by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintains the Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked the player, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; the Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spells</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain the Corrosive Claws effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units that take damage have their movement speed reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (applies once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds."] = "<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, the Crimson Moon Crown is activated, reducing damage taken by the player by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintains the Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked the player, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; the Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spells</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain the Corrosive Claws effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units that take damage have their Скорость бега reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (applies once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds.",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡\n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+1普通\n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2普通\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡\n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1普通\n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\nreturn Round(baseprice)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний \n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний + 1 Common \n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Common \n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний \n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Common \n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\nreturn Round(baseprice)",
    ["……None? It seems we should both rest today. Hmm, this is an revelation one can get without spirituality intuition."] = "……None? It seems we should both rest today. Hmm, this is an revelation one can get without Духовность intuition.",
    ["　　……\n\n　　取受术者发丝与施术者 <Mark id=\"#159\">发丝纠缠</>，用双生草根须榨取的汁液1:1混合<InvHighlight>施术者掌心血</>，浸泡整夜。日出前取该液体绘制法阵，念诵：“彼此照映的星星啊，离开既定的轨道。此星晦暗，彼星长明。”\n\n　　……命运错轨，<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">必死者重获新生</>。 "] = "... \n \n Take the hair of the subject and the <Mark id=\"#159\"> hair </> of the caster, mix it 1:1 with the juice extracted from the roots of the Twin Grass and <InvHighlight> the blood from the caster's palm, </> and soak it overnight. Before sunrise, use this liquid to draw a magic circle and chant: \"Oh, stars that reflect each other, leave the established orbit. This star is dim, that star shines long.\" \n \n ... The fate is derailed, <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> and the one who must die is reborn. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还是先占卜一下房间内是否危险吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Лучше сначала использовать гадание, чтобы узнать, опасна ли комната.) </>",
    ["【Tarot Club · Axe Knight】+30 Health (replaces Life Steal)"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь с топором】+30 здоровья (заменяет Вампиризм)",
    ["·激活后开启一键辅助，<Yellow>使用普攻按键</>（默认E键）会<Yellow>依次释放技能</>，<Yellow>长按普攻按键</>（默认E键）2秒后进入<Yellow>自动释放技能</>状态。\n·进入自动释放技能状态后，脱战或者手动点击技能可以中断自动状态。\n·可以在设置-战斗-操作-自动战斗模式中切换移动优先模式或者技能优先模式，此设置将决定“一键辅助”在角色移动时是否会尝试释放技能。"] = "· After activation, one-tap support is enabled. <Yellow> Using the Базовая атака button </> (default E key) will <Yellow> release skills in Последовательность </>. <Yellow> Holding the Базовая атака button </> (default E key) for 2 seconds will enter the <Yellow> auto-skill release </> state. \n · After entering the auto-skill release state, exiting combat or manually clicking a skill can interrupt the automatic state. \n · You can switch between Move Priority mode or Skill Priority mode in Settings-Combat-Operation-Auto-Combat Mode. This setting determines whether \"One-tap Support\" will attempt to release skills while the character is moving.",
    ["【右摇杆模式1】对选取范围内所有敌人造成多次不同效果的伤害"] = "【Right Stick Mode 1】 Deals multiple types of damage with different effects to all enemies within the selected range.",
    ["Grade 0 Sealed Artifact... what do I need to pay attention to?"] = "Grade 0 Запечатанный артефакт... what do I need to pay attention to?",
    ["goulu_Filthy Cub mechanic02-Target 2 people (No priority on T/Healer)"] = "goulu_Filthy Cub mechanic02-Target 2 people (No priority on T/Healer)",
    ["　　我的选择很简单，“通识者”！有完整序列的“通识者”！\n　　虽然掌握更多的神秘学知识有助于我找到回家的办法，但问题是，自身不够强大的情况下，穿越这种事情必然借助外力，而外力是好是坏，是善意还是恶意，无法控制，非常危险，既然如此，还不如让自身变得强大，靠自己的力量回去，所以，完整的序列是我考虑的首要因素！"] = "Мой выбор был прост: «Савант»! «Савант» с полной последовательностью! \n Хотя овладение дополнительными оккультными знаниями помогает мне найти путь домой, проблема в том, что, если я не достаточно силен, переход требует внешней помощи, и независимо от того, хороша ли эта помощь или плоха, с благими намерениями или злонамеренна, она неконтролируема и очень опасна. Поскольку это так, лучше самому стать сильным и полагаться на свои силы, чтобы вернуться назад. Поэтому полная последовательность – это главный фактор, который я рассматриваю!",
    ["\"The World\", the Beyonder weapon you provided was better than I expected. I have saved enough merit to exchange for materials and advance to Sequence 8."] = "«Мир», предоставленное вами оружие Потустороннего оказалось лучше, чем я ожидал. Я накопил достаточно заслуг, чтобы обменять их на материалы и перейти к восьмой последовательности.",
    ["SpeedDown,\t--减速\nSleep,\t               --睡眠\nStuck,\t               --禁锢\nDizzy,\t               --眩晕\nSilent,\t               --沉默\nDodgeLimit,\t--滞涩"] = "SpeedDown, -- Замедление \nСон, -- Сон \nЗастрял, -- Заключение \nГоловокружение, -- Оглушение \nТихий, -- Тишина \nDodgeLimit, -- Стагнация",
    ["Attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><恐惧主教></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Skill Enhancement increased.\""] = "Атакуйте <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с аффиксом <Highlight><Bishop of Fear></>: «Все уровни навыков +1, улучшение навыков увеличено».",
    ["《变态开膛手杰克》……这出戏里的受害者最让人心疼了，您觉得怎么样？"] = "《Jack the Ripper》... The victim in this play is the most heartbreaking. What do you think?",
    ["[Enhanced] Gain an additional <HighLight>20%</> Damage Reduction when Health is below <HighLight>50%</>."] = "[Enhanced] Gain an additional <HighLight>20%</> Снижение урона when Health is below <HighLight>50%</>.",
    ["……<P_Heart>（刚才我还在房间里，转眼就出现在这个神秘的地方，难不成……是非凡事件！）</>"] = "...<P_Heart> (I was just in my room a moment ago, and in the blink of an eye, I appeared in this mysterious place. Could it be... a Потусторонний incident!) </>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Points Explanation</>\nDuring the first two rounds of the league in the <Highlight>Strategic Server Screening Phase</>, the Strategic Server Screening points rules will be enabled. Strategic Server Screening points are independent of the <Highlight>In-match Points</> used to determine the outcome of the current match. In-match Points are used to determine the victory and ranking of the current match; Strategic Server Screening points are accumulated based on the ranking of each match and the final ranking of each round, and are used to determine the club's Strategic Server Screening ranking and qualification for advancement.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Single Match Ranking Points</>\nAfter each match, Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking in that match:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 30 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 15 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 10 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 5 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>First Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the first round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 60 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 45 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 40 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 10 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Second Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the second round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 200 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 100 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 70 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 15 points</>\nAfter the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server Screening phase are completed, rankings will be based on the <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</> accumulated by each club. The top <Highlight>4 clubs</> in total Strategic Server Screening points for this division will advance to the <Highlight>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> and gain the qualification to <Highlight>participate in the Strategic Server</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Tie-breaking Rules</>\nThe Strategic Server Screening ranking is primarily ordered from high to low based on <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</>. When total points are tied: After the first or second round of the league, clubs are ranked according to their <Highlight>Final Ranking</> in that round, with higher rankings taking precedence; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, if a final ranking for the round has not yet been determined, tied clubs will not be distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking for the round.\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Points Explanation</>\nDuring the first two rounds of the league in the <Highlight>Strategic Server Screening Phase</>, the Strategic Server Screening points rules will be enabled. Strategic Server Screening points are independent of the <Highlight>In-match Points</> used to determine the outcome of the current match. In-match Points are used to determine the victory and ranking of the current match; Strategic Server Screening points are accumulated based on the ranking of each match and the final ranking of each round, and are used to determine the club's Strategic Server Screening ranking and qualification for advancement.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Single Match Ranking Points</>\nAfter each match, Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking in that match:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 30 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 15 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 10 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 5 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>First Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the first round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 60 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 45 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 40 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 10 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Second Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the second round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 200 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 100 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 70 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 15 points</>\nAfter the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server Screening phase are completed, rankings will be based on the <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</> accumulated by each club. The top <Highlight>4 clubs</> in total Strategic Server Screening points for this division will advance to the <Highlight>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> and gain the qualification to <Highlight>participate in the Strategic Server</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Tie-breaking Rules</>\nThe Strategic Server Screening ranking is primarily ordered from high to low based on <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</>. When total points are tied: After the first or second round of the league, clubs are ranked according to their <Highlight>Final Ranking</> in that round, with higher rankings taking precedence; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, if a final ranking for the round has not yet been determined, tied clubs will not be distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking for the round.\n",
    ["<Red>Mutation</>: For every 1 point of Life Energy consumed, the bearer accumulates 1 stack of Mutation, reducing movement speed by 5% and defense by 5%. Mutation effects can stack up to 10 times. After exiting combat or standing still, Mutation will gradually dissipate over time. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attribute entries become ineffective for 15 seconds."] = "<Red>Mutation</>: For every 1 point of Life Energy consumed, the bearer accumulates 1 stack of Mutation, reducing Скорость бега by 5% and defense by 5%. Mutation effects can stack up to 10 times. After exiting combat or standing still, Mutation will gradually dissipate over time. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attribute entries become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["PlayerInfoBuffs:RefreshBuffs entity does not exist %s"] = "PlayerInfoBuffs:RefreshBuffs entity does not exist %s",
    ["[Placeholder A] Leonard: Klein, there's no need to pretend between us. \nLeonard: I once told you that there are many special people in this world, for example, you, and for example, me. \nLeonard: I don't think a Beyonder hiding secrets is necessarily a bad person. As long as your actions don't harm me or the Nighthawks, then you are still my teammate."] = "[Placeholder A] Leonard: Klein, there's no need to pretend between us. \nLeonard: I once told you that there are many special people in this world, for example, you, and for example, me. \nLeonard: I don't think a Потусторонний hiding secrets is necessarily a bad person. As long as your actions don't harm me or the Ночные Ястребы, then you are still my teammate.",
    ["LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(技能),Int()))"] = "LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(Skill), Int())).",
    ["　　Are you still troubled by not knowing how to speak? \n\n　　Collecting hundreds of quotes from the legendary Intis Emperor Roselle Gustav, recommended by dozens of social critics, this book will answer the art of conversation of Emperor Roselle for you!"] = "Are you still troubled by not knowing how to speak? \n\n　　Collecting hundreds of quotes from the legendary Intis Emperor Roselle Gustav, recommended by dozens of social critics, this book will answer the art of conversation of Emperor Roselle for you!",
    ["《关于“血族”与“吸血鬼”的区分声明》"] = "\"Declaration on the Distinction Between 'Sanguine' and 'Vampire'\"",
    ["　小丑们涌了过来，有的表演踩马车轮子不倒，有的匍匐于巨大的皮球上，有的往天空扔出一个个网球，又以滑稽的动作一一接住。\n　　梅丽莎看着这些表演，神情沉静地就像对方并不存在，班森努力了几次，并大声喝彩，可都没能调动起妹妹的情绪，自己也慢慢低沉。\n　　克莱恩紧抿嘴唇，远远望着这一幕，想要靠近却又不敢。\n　　忽然，他摸了下衣兜里的钱夹，有了一个想法。\n　　班森和梅丽莎继续前行，沉默地观看着各种表演。\n　　过了一阵，他们看到一个涂着红黄白等各色油彩的小丑跑了过来，先是往天上扔出一个个网球，接着在人们的注意力被吸引到半空时，不知从哪里变出了一束花，一束塞维亚菊。\n　　这束花凑到了梅丽莎和班森眼前，颜色金黄，象征着快乐。\n　　梅丽莎和班森略显茫然地望向对面的小丑，只见他满是红黄白等各色油彩的脸上，嘴角高高翘起，固定着一个快乐的笑容，浮夸的笑容，滑稽的笑容。\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第二百一十三章 再看一眼"] = "Клоунs swarmed over, some performing by stepping on carriage wheels without falling, some crawling on huge leather balls, some throwing tennis balls into the sky, and catching them one by one with funny movements. \n Melissa watched these performances, her expression as calm as if the other party didn’t exist. Benson tried several times and cheered loudly, but couldn’t stir up his sister’s emotions, and he himself slowly became depressed. \n Klein pursed his lips, watching this scene from afar, wanting to approach but not daring to. \n Suddenly, he touched the wallet in his pocket and had an idea. \n Benson and Melissa continued to move forward, watching various performances in silence. \n After a while, they saw a Клоун painted with red, yellow, white, and other oil paints run over, first throwing tennis balls into the sky, and then when people’s attention was attracted to the air, he produced a bouquet of flowers from nowhere, a bouquet of Zinnia. \n This bouquet was brought to Melissa and Benson’s eyes, golden in color, symbolizing happiness. \n Melissa and Benson looked at the Клоун opposite with a slightly dazed look, only to see the corners of his mouth, which was full of red, yellow, white, and other oil paints, raised high, fixing a happy smile, an exaggerated smile, a funny smile. \n \n —— Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 213: Take Another Look",
    ["【44】 Hypocritical Husband"] = "【44】 Hypocritical Husband",
    ["reminder触发器"] = "reminder trigger",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <风眷者> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Wind-Blessed> trait",
    ["<Red>Lightning Attraction</>: When the holder triggers lightning on a target, there is a 50% probability that it will also deal lightning damage to themselves, and the lightning has a 50% chance to trigger a 3-second Stagnation effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Lightning Attraction</>: When the holder triggers lightning on a target, there is a 50% probability that it will also deal lightning damage to themselves, and the lightning has a 50% chance to trigger a 3-second Stagnation effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演战士】\n在金秋湖畔的木屋边，你看见两个粗暴的混混正在找一个女孩的麻烦……"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Warrior】 \n Beside the wooden house by Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble...",
    ["——Morning—— \n 8:00-10:30 Work \n 10:30-10:40 Rest \n 10:40-11:00 Radio Calisthenics \n 11:00-12:00 Meal \n ——Lunch Break—— \n 12:00-13:00 \n ——Afternoon—— \n 13:00-15:30 Work \n 15:30-15:40 Rest \n 15:40-16:00 Running Exercise \n 16:00-18:00 Work \n After 18:00 Dinner (Takeout allowed)"] = "——Morning—— \n 8:00-10:30 Work \n 10:30-10:40 Rest \n 10:40-11:00 Radio Calisthenics \n 11:00-12:00 Meal \n ——Lunch Break—— \n 12:00-13:00 \n ——Afternoon—— \n 13:00-15:30 Work \n 15:30-15:40 Rest \n 15:40-16:00 Running Exercise \n 16:00-18:00 Work \n After 18:00 Dinner (Takeout allowed)",
    ["{ {skillTag1, 1.0}, {skillTag2, 2.0}} means increasing the speed of skillTag1 skills by 1x and skillTag2 skills by 2x."] = "{ {skillTag1, 1.0}, {skillTag2, 2.0}} means increasing the speed of skillTag1 skills by 1x and skillTag2 skills by 2x.",
    ["《非凡生物笔记》"] = "Потусторонний Creature Notes",
    ["[True Form] Allies can retain the Acceleration effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range. Enemies retain the Slow effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range."] = "[True Form] Allies can retain the Acceleration effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range. Enemies retain the Slow effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range.",
    ["　　我和几个学员从昨晚开始就在收拾东西，很快就能离开这诡异的地方了。\n　　可就在昨晚，又有两位研究员失踪了，还有几个人因为害怕而跑出了营地。我认为贸然跑出营地并不是理智的选择，因为野外的环境更加恶劣。\n　　我能看得出来曼斯教授也十分不安，但他是我们一行人的主心骨。他今天看起来是强撑着下达的指示，毕竟对于人类而言——未知是最古老最强烈的恐惧。"] = "Я и несколько студентов собираем вещи со вчерашнего вечера, и скоро мы сможем покинуть это жуткое место.\n　　Но буквально вчера вечером пропали еще двое исследователей, а еще несколько человек в страхе сбежали из лагеря. Я не думаю, что опрометчивый побег из лагеря - рациональный выбор, потому что окружающая среда в дикой природе еще более сурова.\n　　Я могу сказать, что профессор Манс тоже очень обеспокоен, но он - костяк нашей группы. Он, казалось, заставлял себя сегодня давать указания; в конце концов, для людей неизвестность — самый древний и самый сильный ужас.",
    ["To Beyonder \n Light is the meaning of everything! \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "To Потусторонний \n Свет – это смысл всего! \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["{{PlayerName}} ，走吧，天快亮了，我带你看看拉姆德城堡的日出。"] = "{{PlayerName}}, let's go. Dawn is almost here; let me show you the sunrise at Lamud Castle.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演小丑】\n儿童病房里有个小女孩，已经很久没笑过了。她最大的愿望是看一场小丑表演。 "] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Клоун】 \n There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a Клоун performance.",
    ["<Reminder_Red>快速击破护盾</>，中断施放全屏伤害技能。"] = "<Reminder_Red> quickly break the shield </> to interrupt the casting of the full-screen damage skill.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗家】\n廷根街头，一个老人慢悠悠地扫着地。两个混混朝他走过去，似乎要找他的麻烦……"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Тинген, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble...",
    ["To Seer \n Divination is not omnipotent. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "Провидеть\n Гадание не всемогуще. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["B级动画：\n克莱恩回想着这段时间的占卜，脑中浮现出黄水晶，突然有一些感悟。"] = "B-grade animation: \n Klein recalls the Гаданиеs of this period, a yellow crystal appears in his mind, and he suddenly has some insights.",
    ["【塔罗会】(6) 全队 +30%攻击力 +800生命 +10%暴击"] = "【Клуб Таро】(6) Вся команда +30% силы атаки +800 здоровья +10% критического удара",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner.",
    ["{\n\"监听销毁（默认）\": \"false\",\n\"监听死亡技能\": \"true\"\n}"] = "{\n\"Listen for destruction (default)\": \"false\", \n\"Listen for Death Skill\": \"true\"\n}",
    ["Thank you, Magician {{Sir|Madam}}."] = "Спасибо, Волшебник {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["I really enjoy the identity of a \"Savant.\" \n A strange thing: when I consider myself a \"Savant\" and do things that fit its positioning, those whispers that almost drove me crazy quieted down quite a bit, my temper, which would erupt from time to time, was also brought under control, and I remembered the matter of the diary. \n Is this the \"Acting\" that the mysterious Mr. Zaratul mentioned to me? This might be the key to solving the hidden dangers of the potion."] = "Мне очень нравится личность «Ученого». \n Странная вещь: когда я считаю себя «Ученым» и делаю вещи, которые соответствуют этому позиционированию, те шепоты, которые почти сводили меня с ума, немного утихли, мой характер, который время от времени вспыхивал, также был взят под контроль, и я вспомнил о дневнике. \n Это та самая «Игра», о которой мне говорил загадочный мистер Заратул? Возможно, это ключ к разгадке скрытой опасности зелья.",
    ["Mr. Fool has grafted a destiny from the future for you, allowing you to use powers of higher Sequences. As you grow stronger, the variety and power of the skills you learn will also increase. Skills are divided into three categories: Normal Skills, Special Skills, and Roleplay Skills. You can equip up to four Normal Skills or Roleplay Skills at once. Special Skills do not need to be equipped and include Basic Attacks, Control Break Skills, and Finisher Skills."] = "Мистер Дурак привил вам судьбу из будущего, позволяя вам использовать силы высших последовательностей. По мере того, как вы становитесь сильнее, разнообразие и сила изучаемых вами навыков также будут увеличиваться. Навыки разделены на три категории: обычные навыки, специальные навыки и навыки ролевой игры. Вы можете использовать до четырех обычных навыков или навыков ролевой игры одновременно. Специальные навыки не требуют использования и включают в себя базовые атаки, навыки контроля и завершающие навыки.",
    ["trigger Trigger Area"] = "trigger Trigger Area",
    ["Buff层数  "] = "Buff layers",
    ["Player Invincibility buff during Cutscene"] = "Player Invincibility buff during Cutscene",
    ["　　从我们毕业到现在，已经过去了五年。战争的阴霾已从家乡的上空离开，一切都回到了最初的模样，甚至比当初更好。我想，贝克兰德一定恢复的比这里更迅速。\n　　听说现在的你成了大经理，我由衷地为你闪耀的前途而感到高兴，小镇出身的姑娘如今走到这样的高度，命运终于恰当的奖赏了应当奖赏的人。\n　　我本想来贝克兰德当面庆贺，但小米勒最近的身体状况不大好，因此你的旅游邀约我不得不暂时拒绝。但别担心，亲爱的，我想我们未来总会有时间再见一面。"] = "It has been five years since we graduated. The shadow of war has lifted from our hometown, and everything has returned to how it was, or even better. I imagine Бэкланд must have recovered even faster than here.\nI heard you have become a great manager now, and I am sincerely happy for your bright future. A girl from a small town has reached such heights; fate has finally rewarded those who deserve it.\nI intended to come to Бэкланд to congratulate you in person, but little Miller's health hasn't been great lately, so I have to decline your travel invitation for now. But don't worry, my dear, I believe we will have time to meet again in the future.",
    ["\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" is the only entrance to Tingen in the Mirror."] = "\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" is the only entrance to Тинген in the Mirror.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Sylvia】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 4-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["Long time no see. \n Since the Tingen Lake anomaly, the Nighthawks have sealed off the area by Tingen Lake to handle the residual corruption. It has now been processed, and the blockade has been lifted. \n However, colleagues on patrol recently told me that a few tables, chairs, and tents have suddenly appeared by the lake. It seems someone has been active here since the blockade was lifted. \n To be safe, the Nighthawks need to investigate whether the people who came here are safe. If you have time, I hope you can come to Tingen Lake to assist us with the investigation. \n New colleague, looking forward to seeing you again."] = "Давно не виделись. \n После аномалии озера Тинген Ночные Ястребы изолировали территорию возле озера Тинген, чтобы справиться с остаточной коррупцией. Сейчас оно обработано, и блокада снята. \n Однако недавно коллеги из патруля рассказали мне, что у озера внезапно появилось несколько столов, стульев и палаток. Кажется, здесь кто-то действовал с момента снятия блокады. \n Чтобы обезопасить себя, «Ночным ястребам» необходимо выяснить, в безопасности ли люди, пришедшие сюда. Если у вас есть время, я надеюсь, вы сможете приехать на озеро Тинген и помочь нам в расследовании. \n Новый коллега, с нетерпением ждем встречи с вами снова.",
    ["C-Rank - Divination Reasoning Altar"] = "C-Rank - Гадание Reasoning Altar",
    ["【塔罗会·侍女】档3增量(+15%)→累计114%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】Tier 3 increment (+15%) → cumulative 114%",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡评分</>\n非凡评分是非凡者战斗能力和养成情况的综合性评价，可以以此为参考评估自身的发展情况。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>养成详情</>\n点击角色展示界面右下方的非凡评分，可以查看自身各个模块的详细养成情况（部分养成上限随赛季推进解锁）。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>评分提升</>\n在非凡评分系统中点击想要提升的模块，可以了解提升养成所需材料的相关信息和获取途径。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Рейтинг Потустороннего </> \n Рейтинг Потустороннего — это всесторонняя оценка боевых способностей и статуса развития Потустороннего, которую можно использовать в качестве ориентира для оценки вашего собственного развития. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Подробности разработки </> \n Нажмите на рейтинг Потусторонний в правом нижнем углу интерфейса отображения персонажей, чтобы просмотреть подробный статус разработки каждого из ваших модулей (некоторые ограничения развития открываются по ходу сезона). \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Улучшение рейтинга </> \n Нажмите на модуль, который вы хотите улучшить, в системе Потусторонний Rating, чтобы узнать о соответствующей информации и каналах получения материалов, необходимых для разработки.",
    ["Both 'Mystery Pryer' and 'Seer' can better master knowledge in the field of mysticism; there might be clues to my home inside."] = "Both 'Подглядывающий за Тайнами' and 'Провидец' can better master knowledge in the field of mysticism; there might be clues to my home inside.",
    ["[Proof] Beacon's Shield amount increased by 10%, Explosion damage increased by 30%."] = "[Proof] Beacon's Shield amount increased by 10%, Explosion damage increased by 30%.",
    ["NPC护盾内标记"] = "NPC shield interior mark",
    ["<img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>伤害减免：<HighLight>90%</>"] = "<img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>Снижение урона: <HighLight>90%</>",
    ["BOSS4-Quality-Right Healing"] = "BOSS4-Качество-Правильное исцеление",
    ["goulu_污秽幼兽mechanic02-点2人（不优先筛T/奶）"] = "goulu_Filthy Cub mechanic02-Target 2 people (No priority on T/Healer)",
    ["<Title_HW> November 18 </> \n It is truly a magical thing. A whimsical experiment and an accidental mistake allowed me to discover a poor guy trapped in a storm and lost in the depths of darkness. He can only get close to the real world during the full moon every month, yet he still cannot convey his cries. \n He is lucky; he met me—the protagonist of this era. \n After writing the above paragraph and reading it myself, I suddenly felt a bit emotional. Even when using Chinese, I unknowingly adopted a strong translation tone. Forty years have passed in a flash; past memories really are like a dream. \n ..."] = "<Title_HW> November 18 </> \n It is truly a magical thing. A whimsical experiment and an accidental mistake allowed me to discover a poor guy trapped in a storm and lost in the depths of darkness. He can only get close to the real world during the full moon every month, yet he still cannot convey his cries. \n He is lucky; he met me—the protagonist of this era. \n After writing the above paragraph and reading it myself, I suddenly felt a bit emotional. Even when using Chinese, I unknowingly adopted a strong translation tone. Forty years have passed in a flash; past memories really are like a dream. \n ...",
    ["<P_Heart>（需要潜入？佛尔思女士借给我的莱埃诺笔记中，灵体之线的能力或许可以派上用场，我可以试试用它操控</><P_Yellow>老鼠</><P_Heart>进去制造混乱……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Нужно пробраться внутрь? Способность духовного тела соединяться в заметках Леано, которую мне одолжила г-жа Форс, может пригодиться. Я могу попробовать использовать ее для управления </> <P_Yellow> мышами </> <P_Heart>, чтобы войти и создать хаос...) </>",
    ["Grade 0 Sealed Artifact?! Then Mr. Leonard left last night..."] = "Grade 0 Запечатанный артефакт?! Then Mr. Leonard left last night...",
    ["“生命天使”是智慧的结晶，是每个人体内永不磨灭的灵性。"] = "The “Angel of Life” is the crystallization of wisdom and the undying Духовность within everyone.",
    ["<Yellow>满月诅咒</>：受到来自<Yellow>8</>米内的敌方伤害时，激活深红月冕，使佩戴者减伤提高<Yellow>*f**</>。对<Yellow>8</>米内攻击过自己的最多<Yellow>3</>个非首领目标维持满月诅咒，使其增伤降低<Yellow>*f**</>；深红月冕效果持续<Yellow>5</>秒，每<Yellow>10</>秒最多被激活<Yellow>1</>次。\n<Yellow>黑暗法术</>：对敌方目标造成伤害时，获得持续<Yellow>5</>秒的腐蚀之爪效果：增伤提高<Yellow>*f**</>、使受到伤害的敌方单位移动速度降低<Yellow>*f**</>，持续<Yellow>4</>秒（对单目标生效1次）。该效果每<Yellow>10</>秒最多触发<Yellow>1</>次。"] = "<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, activate Crimson Moon Crown, increasing the wearer's Снижение урона by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintain Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked you, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spell</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain Corrosive Claw effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage dealt increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units taking damage have their Скорость бега reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (takes effect once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds.",
    ["Entering the spire, Derrick headed straight for the third floor and, based on his memory, found the bookshelf containing mythological materials and corresponding ancient texts. \n He had just taken a fancy to a classic involving creation myths and was about to pull it out when he found a palm with slender fingers, fair skin, and a beautiful shape snatching the book away first. \n Derrick followed the arm and looked up, and after just one glance, he lowered his head, pressed his hand to his chest, and asked in a deep voice: \n \"Hello, Elder Lovia.\" \n The one who took the classic was indeed a member of the \"Six-Member Council,\" the Shepherd Lovia. \n Lovia wore a black robe embroidered with many mysterious purple patterns, and her silver-gray hair was thick but slightly curly. \n Her face was smooth and fair, her features grand and beautiful, and she looked to be only in her early thirties, with a pair of light gray eyes that seemed to be able to pierce through the soul. \n \"Hmm.\" Facing Derrick's greeting, Lovia nodded slightly, didn't say much, and silently walked away between the two rows of bookshelves with the classic. \n Elder Lovia seems to have returned to normal, unlike before, where she was always switching between different states without any pattern, sometimes crying, sometimes sneering, sometimes snorting in anger, sometimes indifferent... Derrick subconsciously flashed such a thought. \n Suddenly, he felt inexplicably afraid. \n Because Elder Lovia was normal... \n Normal... \n ... \n \n —— Volume 2 \"Faceless\", Chapter 102, Returning to the Harvest Church"] = "Entering the spire, Derrick headed straight for the third floor and, based on his memory, found the bookshelf containing mythological materials and corresponding ancient texts. \n He had just taken a fancy to a classic involving creation myths and was about to pull it out when he found a palm with slender fingers, fair skin, and a beautiful shape snatching the book away first. \n Derrick followed the arm and looked up, and after just one glance, he lowered his head, pressed his hand to his chest, and asked in a deep voice: \n \"Hello, Elder Lovia.\" \n The one who took the classic was indeed a member of the \"Six-Member Council,\" the Shepherd Lovia. \n Lovia wore a black robe embroidered with many mysterious purple patterns, and her silver-gray hair was thick but slightly curly. \n Her face was smooth and fair, her features grand and beautiful, and she looked to be only in her early thirties, with a pair of light gray eyes that seemed to be able to pierce through the soul. \n \"Hmm.\" Facing Derrick's greeting, Lovia nodded slightly, didn't say much, and silently walked away between the two rows of bookshelves with the classic. \n Elder Lovia seems to have returned to normal, unlike before, where she was always switching between different states without any pattern, sometimes crying, sometimes sneering, sometimes snorting in anger, sometimes indifferent... Derrick subconsciously flashed such a thought. \n Suddenly, he felt inexplicably afraid. \n Because Elder Lovia was normal... \n Normal... \n ... \n \n —— Volume 2 \"Безликий\", Chapter 102, Returning to the Harvest Church",
    ["<P_Yellow>提示：使用方向键左右移动，躲避攻击</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Tip: Use the arrow keys to move left and right to dodge attacks</>",
    ["<Red>Blood Freezing</>: After entering combat, the wearer's blood will gradually cool, reducing Stamina recovery speed until Stamina cannot be recovered at all. This effect can be alleviated or even eliminated by continuously dealing damage. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material entry attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds."] = "<Red>Blood Freezing</>: After entering combat, the wearer's blood will gradually cool, reducing Stamina recovery speed until Stamina cannot be recovered at all. This effect can be alleviated or even eliminated by continuously dealing damage. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material entry attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["[CS for introducing pathways and Sequences]"] = "[CS for introducing pathways and Последовательностьs]",
    ["    After Dunn and Daly met, Daly built a nest on Dunn's head, using the excuse that 'my feathers have all fallen out, it's so cold,' and repeated every forgotten piece of information to him; Dunn carried it while patrolling the forest, shielding it from the wind with his thick gray fur and picking berries from the highest branches with his antlers. \n\n    Daly liked to lie on the back of his head and often complained that the fur on his forehead wasn't thick enough. \n\n    One day, Daly noticed Dunn picking something up from the ground and fixing it to his antlers, only to realize it was its own fallen feathers. \n\n     'These feathers are too beautiful, I can't bear to let them be forgotten like this.' Dunn shook his head. 'Even if I forget why I'm doing this tomorrow, my antlers will remember this itching sensation.' \n\n    Daly's heart fluttered gently. It circled excitedly between Dunn's two antlers, preparing to show off its voice and shake off a few brand-new feathers. Dunn stopped it from doing something that would make it even colder and asked it to help organize the collected feathers. Daly hung them together with wooden tags, letting them collide in the wind and snow, composing the forest's melody with the sound of deer hooves and bird calls."] = "After Dunn and Daly met, Daly built a nest on Dunn's head, using the excuse that 'my feathers have all fallen out, it's so cold,' and repeated every forgotten piece of information to him; Dunn carried it while patrolling the forest, shielding it from the wind with his thick gray fur and picking berries from the highest branches with his antlers. \n\n    Daly liked to lie on the back of his head and often complained that the fur on his forehead wasn't thick enough. \n\n    One day, Daly noticed Dunn picking something up from the ground and fixing it to his antlers, only to realize it was its own fallen feathers. \n\n     'These feathers are too beautiful, I can't bear to let them be forgotten like this.' Dunn shook his head. 'Even if I forget why I'm doing this tomorrow, my antlers will remember this itching sensation.' \n\n    Daly's heart fluttered gently. It circled excitedly between Dunn's two antlers, preparing to show off its voice and shake off a few brand-new feathers. Dunn stopped it from doing something that would make it even colder and asked it to help organize the collected feathers. Daly hung them together with wooden tags, letting them collide in the wind and snow, composing the forest's melody with the sound of deer hooves and bird calls.",
    ["{{player.name}} condensed a {{item.name}} carrying the <Chat_Highlight>{{relic_word.name}}</> affix during a Beyonder Convergence, receiving the favor of the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck!"] = "{{player.name}} condensed a {{item.name}} carrying the <Chat_Highlight>{{relic_word.name}}</> affix during a Потусторонний Convergence, receiving the favor of the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck!",
    ["Beyonder Creature Notes"] = "Потусторонний Creature Notes",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Beyonder Pathways and Sequence Levels</>\nBeyonder Pathways, also known as Divine Pathways, are a complete advancement system centered around potions. Each pathway is divided into 10 Sequences, from 9 to 0. The lower the Sequence number, the higher the rank and the stronger the ability.\nBeyonders can increase their Sequence level and strength by collecting potion formulas, consuming Sequence potions, and progressing in their digestion of the potions.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Advancement</>\nOnce all prerequisites for advancement are met, you can accept the advancement quest, craft and consume the next Sequence's potion, and increase your Sequence level."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Пути за гранью и уровни последовательности</>\nПути за гранью, также известные как Божественные пути, представляют собой полноценную систему развития, основанную на зельях. Каждый путь разделен на 10 последовательностей, от 9 до 0. Чем ниже номер последовательности, тем выше ранг и тем сильнее способность.\nПотусторонние могут повысить уровень и силу своей последовательности, собирая формулы зелий, потребляя зелья последовательности и прогрессируя в их переваривании.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Advancement</>\nКак только все предварительные условия для продвижения будут выполнены, вы можете принять квест продвижения, создайте и употребите зелье следующей последовательности и повысьте свой уровень последовательности.",
    ["【A占位】伦纳德：克莱恩，我们之间不需要假装。\n伦纳德：我曾经对你说过，这个世界上有很多特殊的人，比如说你，也比如说我。\n伦纳德：我并不认为藏着秘密的非凡者就一定是坏蛋，只要你的行为没有危害到我和值夜者，那你就还是我的队友。"] = "[Placeholder A] Leonard: Klein, there's no need to pretend between us. \nLeonard: I once told you that there are many special people in this world, for example, you, and for example, me. \nLeonard: I don't think a Потусторонний hiding secrets is necessarily a bad person. As long as your actions don't harm me or the Ночные Ястребы, then you are still my teammate.",
    ["<Yellow>Otherworldly Blessing</>: When using spirit vision while in combat, the spirit vision effect is shortened to <Yellow>5 seconds</>, the spirit vision skill Cooldown is extended to <Yellow>20 seconds</>, and you gain the blessing of spirit entities, restoring <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</> of your maximum Health per second and increasing Damage Reduction by <Yellow>*f**</>. \nThis healing effect is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury."] = "<Yellow>Otherworldly Blessing</>: When using spirit vision while in combat, the spirit vision effect is shortened to <Yellow>5 seconds</>, the spirit vision skill Перезарядка is extended to <Yellow>20 seconds</>, and you gain the blessing of spirit entities, restoring <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</> of your maximum Health per second and increasing Снижение урона by <Yellow>*f**</>. \nThis healing effect is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury.",
    ["　　戴莉艰难地笑了笑，对抗着体表不断冒出的白色绒毛和漆黑鳞片道：\n　　“原来是你……\n　　“你之前不是问我，为什么不主动，主动向邓恩表白，将他推到，床上？”\n　　她吸了口气，苦涩笑道：\n　　“我过去有过，太多的放纵，他，他是一个保守的人，我，我很自卑。”\n　　她已快控制不住，即将变成怪物。\n　　这个时候，她听见克莱恩·莫雷蒂回应道：\n　　“队长其实很喜欢你，但你太优秀太年轻了，他也很自卑。”\n　　戴莉笑了，旋即在朦胧的视线里看见了那个身穿黑色风衣，发际线较高，有幽邃灰眸的男人，看见他以手按胸，弯腰伸掌，邀请自己跳舞。\n　　她探出了自己的手，她的思绪随之变得滞涩。\n　　穿黑风衣的灰眸男人拉起了异变逐渐退去的戴莉，在伦纳德的目光中，在喷泉乱流的破败广场里，跳起了轻快的舞蹈。\n　　一样样材料飞出，有金色的葡萄藤，有较为丑陋的橡皮面具，它们在灵性的引导下，逐渐糅合在一起，灌入了一个金属小瓶。\n　　美妙的舞蹈中，戴莉轻轻前靠，倚在了邓恩的怀里。\n\n　　——第四卷《不死者》第二百一十三章 故事的尾声"] = "Дейли с трудом улыбнулась, борясь с белым пухом и черными чешуйками, постоянно появлявшимися на ее коже:\n \"Так это была ты...\n \"Разве ты не спрашивал меня раньше, почему я не взяла на себя инициативу, не взяла на себя инициативу признаться Данну и не толкнула его на кровать?\"\n Она вздохнула и горько улыбнулась:\n \"В прошлом я была слишком снисходительна. Он, он консервативный человек, а я, я очень неуверен в себе.\n Она больше не могла контролировать себя и собиралась превратиться в монстра.\n В этот момент она услышала ответ Кляйн Моретти:\n «Капитану ты действительно очень нравился, но ты был слишком выдающимся и слишком молодым, а он тоже был очень неуверенным в себе».\n Дейли улыбнулась, а затем в своём смутном видении она увидела мужчину в чёрном плаще с высокой линией роста волос и глубокими серыми глазами. Она видела, как он положил руку на грудь, поклонился и протянул ладонь, приглашая ее на танец.\n Она протянула руку, и мысли ее замерли.\n Сероглазый мужчина в черном плаще подтянул Дейли, мутация которого постепенно отступала. Под взглядом Леонарда, на полуразрушенной площади с бурлящей фонтанной водой, они танцевали легкий танец.\n Материалы вылетали один за другим — золотые виноградные лозы, уродливая резиновая маска — и под его руководством духовности, они постепенно слились воедино и были перелиты в маленькую металлическую бутылку.\n В разгар прекрасного танца Дейли осторожно наклонился вперед и отдохнул в объятиях Данна.\n\n — Том 4: Бессмертие, Глава 213: Конец истории",
    ["“注视从星空投来，大地将四分五裂，世间的一切都会不复存在。”"] = "«Взгляд бросится со звездного неба, земля разверзнется, и все на свете перестанет существовать».",
    ["tar：目标；\nself：自己；\nbuffadder：Buff施加者；\ntarlist：目标清单黑板值；\nall：技能/法术场结算筛到的所有对象"] = "tar: Target; \n self: Self; \n buffadder: Buff applier; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by the skill/spell field settlement.",
    ["<Rank1>\"1级\"</>封印物仅在战略服生效，本服生效<Rank2>“2级”</>效果"] = "<Rank1>\"Level 1\"</> Запечатанный артефакт only takes effect in the strategic server, this server takes effect <Rank2>\"Level 2\"</> effect",
    ["...Was my fate divined by a Beast Tamer?"] = "...Was my fate divined by a Beast Tamer?",
    ["GVG High Tower Effect Buff Blood Emperor"] = "GVG High Tower Effect Buff Blood Emperor",
    ["Enum (Sub-skill Orientation)."] = "Enum (Sub-skill Orientation).",
    ["【B占位】镜面聚合，呈现回忆，特里斯和一个戴着兜帽的女人面对面而站。\n兜帽女子：做得不错，廷根变得更动荡了……恐惧和死亡总是最好的养料。\n男子：我已经完成任务，你答应过我，会给我晋升的材料。\n兜帽女子：当然，晋升的下个序列是——女巫。\n男子：女巫？！我要晋升为女巫？开什么玩笑？"] = "[Placeholder B] The mirror surface converges, presenting a memory. Trissy and a hooded woman stand face to face. \nHooded Woman: Well done, Тинген has become even more chaotic... Fear and death are always the best nourishment. \nMan: I have completed the quest. You promised me the materials for advancement. \nHooded Woman: Of course, the next Последовательность for advancement is—Witch. \nMan: Witch?! I'm to advance to a Witch? Are you kidding me?",
    ["<P_Heart>（阿兹克先生竟然能将我也带入冥界，他的非凡层次恐怕远在半神之上。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Мистер Азик действительно смог привести меня в Подземный мир; его уровень Потустороннего, должно быть, намного выше полубога.) </>",
    ["Trigger 1s Invincibility when HP is low"] = "Trigger 1s Invincibility when HP is low",
    [" Ready. The \"Inquisitor\" stole the \"Core of Mechanical Spirit\" from the church and hid it in the steel mill, just waiting for the ritual to start. He now likes to call me \"Master\"; he says that once I successfully advance, I can reshape my body and become a Demigod, and by then he will be my chief enforcer. \n I held the core in my hand; it was bone-chillingly cold. \n For this, many people died, including brothers within the police force, Andy, Old Colin, Little Martha... \n At that moment, I suddenly wanted to ask myself: Is it worth it? \n But the answer is meaningless; I have already gone too far and cannot turn back."] = "Готовый. «Инквизитор» украл «Ядро механического духа» из церкви и спрятал его на сталелитейном заводе, ожидая начала ритуала. Теперь он любит называть меня «Мастер»; он говорит, что как только я успешно продвинусь, я смогу изменить свое тело и стать полубогом, и к тому времени он будет моим главным силовиком. \nЯ держал ядро ​​в руке; было пронизывающе холодно. \n За это погибло много людей, в том числе братья из полиции, Энди, Старый Колин, Маленькая Марта... \n В этот момент мне вдруг захотелось спросить себя: стоит ли оно того? \n Но ответ бессмыслен; Я уже зашел слишком далеко и не могу повернуть назад.",
    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>这一年的最后一天，森林遭遇了百年未遇的暴雪，猫头鹰长老召集起了一场紧急会议。</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>“北边山洞上方的积雪发生了崩塌，那里面还住着冬眠的蝙蝠一家，我们不能放着它们不管。”</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>所有的动物都沉默了，它们基本不和蝙蝠来往，只有邓恩在去年春天去过那个洞穴，但它早就忘记里面什么样了。</>"] = "<InvDefault_HW>On the last day of that year, the forest encountered a blizzard unseen in a century. The Owl Elder convened an emergency meeting.</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>\"The snow above the cave in the north has collapsed. The bat family that hibernates there is still inside; we cannot leave them to their fate.\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>All the animals fell into silence. They basically didn't interact with the bats. Only Dunn had been to that cave last spring, but it had long since forgotten what it looked like inside.</>",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Little Girl Phase 2 Body Effect Buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Little Girl Phase 2 Body Effect Buff",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n主宰争锋为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成3人队伍参与匹配。进入主宰争锋玩法后，所有玩家获得<Highlight>公平</>的属性调整。\n玩家需要击败敌方队伍内的所有玩家，或者限时内伤害更高，才能取得对局胜利。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nDominator's Clash is a team-based competitive mode where you can form a squad of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering Dominator's Clash, all players receive <Highlight>fair</> attribute adjustments. \nPlayers must defeat all members of the opposing team or deal more damage within the time limit to achieve victory.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <Bishop of Fear> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Bishop of Fear> trait",
    ["GTA Serial Killer Armor Break"] = "GTA Serial Killer Armor Break",
    ["Point C Trigger"] = "Point C Trigger",
    ["LuaList(Id(法术场))"] = "LuaList(Id(Spell Field)).",
    ["　　畅销小说家佛尔思·沃尔全新力作<Highlight>《大冒险家》</>第二部火热连载中！一经发表即成为社交舞会必备话题……\n　　佛尔思小姐透露，在第二部中，环游世界的海上冒险家将继续探索未知领域，结识新的同伴，让我们共同期待冒险家先生的崭新旅程！"] = "Совершенно новый шедевр <Highlight> «Великий авантюрист» </> Part 2, написанный бестселлером Форсом Уоллом, сейчас активно выходит в сериале! После публикации она стала важной темой для социальных балов... \n Г-жа Форс рассказала, что во второй части искатель приключений, путешествующий по миру по морю, продолжит исследовать неизведанные территории и встретит новых спутников. Будем с нетерпением ждать нового путешествия искателя приключений!",
