, you irrevocably authorize Kuaishou Games and its affiliated companies (hereinafter referred to as \"we\" or \"official\" or \"Kuaishou Games\") to use the works and data you upload and publish in the 【Dress-up Plaza】 permanently and free of charge. The methods of use include but are not limited to copying, distributing, renting, exhibiting, performing, broadcasting, modifying, adapting, disseminating over information networks, and other methods of use, including both commercial and non-commercial purposes, use inside and outside this game, and use inside and outside the 【Dress-up Plaza】. The aforementioned rights of use are collectively referred to as \"Right of Use,\" and we are also authorized to sub-license or sub-delegate the aforementioned Right of Use to third parties. \n\nArticle 2 Promises and Guarantees \n2.1 The works authorized to the official are created by you completely independently and autonomously, and do not contain content that infringes on others' copyrights, portrait rights, trademark rights, and other rights and interests, such as plagiarism or theft, or you have already obtained legal authorization from the rights holder.",
    ["...<P_Heart> (A Beyonder like Mr. Dunn? No, I am not, and I want to know too.)</>"] = "...<P_Heart> (A Потусторонний like Mr. Dunn? No, I am not, and I want to know too.)</>",
