    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n Battle for the Throne of God is a team competition mode, where up to 6 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, all players use the same <Highlight>Real</> attributes as outside the mode for combat. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning Conditions</>\nDefeat all players in the enemy team within the time limit to win. If both teams have members alive when the match time ends, the side with more kills, more survivors, higher total damage, and higher remaining health will be judged the winner in order. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, each team has <Highlight>2 opportunities to resurrect</> dead teammates."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n Battle for the Throne of God is a team competition mode, where up to 6 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, all players use the same <Highlight>Real</> attributes as outside the mode for combat. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning Conditions</>\nDefeat all players in the enemy team within the time limit to win. If both teams have members alive when the match time ends, the side with more kills, more survivors, higher total damage, and higher remaining health will be judged the winner in order. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, each team has <Highlight>2 opportunities to resurrect</> dead teammates.",
    ["<h>用胸针占卜</>确认方向"] = "<h>Use the brooch for Гадание</> to confirm the direction",
    ["{{player.name}}在命运的剧本中走遍了每一条岔路，将跑团天赋悉数解锁！这位非凡者，已为中最复杂的迷局做好了万全准备——命运无从设伏，他早已预判了一切。"] = "{{player.name}} has walked through every fork in the road of fate's script and unlocked all their tabletop gaming talents! This Потусторонний is fully prepared for the most complex maze—fate cannot set an ambush, as they have already anticipated everything.",
    ["<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, activate Crimson Moon Crown, increasing the wearer's Damage Reduction by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintain Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked you, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spell</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain Corrosive Claw effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage dealt increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units taking damage have their movement speed reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (takes effect once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds."] = "<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, activate Crimson Moon Crown, increasing the wearer's Снижение урона by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintain Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked you, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spell</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain Corrosive Claw effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage dealt increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units taking damage have their Скорость бега reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (takes effect once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds.",
    ["[Roguelike] Exile - Spell Proxy"] = "[Roguelike] Exile - Spell Proxy",
    ["[PrintAppearanceData]: %s 序列化字段拆分失败，数据长度 = %s"] = "[PrintAppearanceData]: не удалось разделить сериализованное поле %s, длина данных = %s",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?",
    ["{{《少男密会警长》|《警长密会神秘女》}}? 'Breaking! University Student Arrested'? 'Carnivore Raids Restaurant at Night, Tremors Felt in Residential Building'?"] = "{{《Young Man Secretly Meets Sheriff》|《Sheriff Secretly Meets Mysterious Woman》}}? 'Breaking! University Student Arrested'? 'Carnivore Raids Restaurant at Night, Tremors Felt in Residential Building'?",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演心理医生】\n深夜的街道上，一个年轻人坐在路灯下，眼神空洞，显然已经很久没有好好睡过一觉了。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Психиатр】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time.",
    ["<h>Divinate if the surroundings are dangerous</>"] = "<h>Divinate if the surroundings are dangerous</>",
    ["【C-level animation placeholder】 The player sees some blurry images through dream divination."] = "【C-level animation placeholder】 The player sees some blurry images through dream Гадание.",
    ["Id (Spell Field)."] = "Id (Spell Field).",
    ["—In that parallel world, Audrey and Susie worked together to solve the case involving Fors's companion. \n\n      Backlund, the Hall family garden. Audrey sat on a hanging chair, sunlight casting dappled light and shadows through the vines. \n      A few days ago, the expression on Fors Wall's face when she visited appeared in her mind again. That lazy-tempered writer had shown a solemn look: \"I have a companion who has been thrown into prison and is waiting for the final verdict. I hope you can save her, no matter what method you use.\" \n      And the accompanying Viscount Glaint had sent someone to consult a well-known lawyer, who said there was a chance for a light sentence, but an acquittal was very difficult unless the defendant could obtain a medical certificate stating they had mental issues or were mentally underdeveloped... \n      Audrey remembered that she had promised Fors she would consider it carefully. When the writer left, she had looked back, anticipation hidden in her light blue eyes. \n      \"Medical certificate...\" Audrey whispered to herself, her brows slightly furrowed. It wasn't that she hadn't thought about using the Hall family's influence to pull strings, but that would expose her relationship with Fors and Xio. Moreover, although the gang leader had issued a statement of forgiveness, the case of grievous injury could still be prosecuted. \n      Susie, lying beside her, pricked up her ears and whispered in a voice only Audrey could hear: \"That gang leader, is he still in the hospital?\" \n      Audrey looked down at her, her gaze flickering. \n      \"I'll go give it a try,\" Susie suggested, wagging her tail. \n      That night, Susie quietly snuck into the hospital room. She used her Spectator ability to gently guide the \"decent gentleman\" to recall—the other party finally remembered that he had struck first and that Xio was only acting in self-defense. After waking up, he took the initiative to correct his testimony to the prosecutor. \n      A few days later, Xio was acquitted. When Fors came to the Hall residence to thank her, she sighed, \"The prosecutor suddenly found new evidence; what good luck.\" \n      Audrey smiled and nodded: \"Yes, what good luck.\" \n      Susie lay at her feet, her tail thumping against the carpet, feeling satisfied."] = "—In that parallel world, Audrey and Susie worked together to solve the case involving Fors's companion. \n\n      Бэкланд, the Hall family garden. Audrey sat on a hanging chair, sunlight casting dappled light and shadows through the vines. \n      A few days ago, the expression on Fors Wall's face when she visited appeared in her mind again. That lazy-tempered writer had shown a solemn look: \"I have a companion who has been thrown into prison and is waiting for the final verdict. I hope you can save her, no matter what method you use.\" \n      And the accompanying Viscount Glaint had sent someone to consult a well-known lawyer, who said there was a chance for a light sentence, but an acquittal was very difficult unless the defendant could obtain a medical certificate stating they had mental issues or were mentally underdeveloped... \n      Audrey remembered that she had promised Fors she would consider it carefully. When the writer left, she had looked back, anticipation hidden in her light blue eyes. \n      \"Medical certificate...\" Audrey whispered to herself, her brows slightly furrowed. It wasn't that she hadn't thought about using the Hall family's influence to pull strings, but that would expose her relationship with Fors and Xio. Moreover, although the gang leader had issued a statement of forgiveness, the case of grievous injury could still be prosecuted. \n      Susie, lying beside her, pricked up her ears and whispered in a voice only Audrey could hear: \"That gang leader, is he still in the hospital?\" \n      Audrey looked down at her, her gaze flickering. \n      \"I'll go give it a try,\" Susie suggested, wagging her tail. \n      That night, Susie quietly snuck into the hospital room. She used her Зритель ability to gently guide the \"decent gentleman\" to recall—the other party finally remembered that he had struck first and that Xio was only acting in self-defense. After waking up, he took the initiative to correct his testimony to the prosecutor. \n      A few days later, Xio was acquitted. When Fors came to the Hall residence to thank her, she sighed, \"The prosecutor suddenly found new evidence; what good luck.\" \n      Audrey smiled and nodded: \"Yes, what good luck.\" \n      Susie lay at her feet, her tail thumping against the carpet, feeling satisfied.",
    ["<Yellow>Misfortune</>: The doll awakens as its master enters combat. When the master's skill hits the primary enemy target, the doll attaches itself to the target, causing them to suffer from the <Yellow>Beset by Misfortune</> effect: buffdisc(*id), lasting 30 seconds. When the master switches targets to attack, the doll will also transfer its attachment to the new target. After a cumulative 30 seconds of attachment, the doll will briefly return to the master until it is transferred again."] = "<Yellow>Misfortune</>: The doll awakens as its master enters combat. When the master's skill hits the primary enemy target, the doll attaches itself to the target, causing them to suffer from the <Yellow>Beset by Misfortune</> effect: buffdisc(*id), lasting 30 seconds. When the master switches targets to attack, the doll will also transfer its attachment to the new target. After a cumulative 30 seconds of attachment, the doll will briefly return to the master until it is transferred again.",
    ["【Tarot Club】(2) Entire team +5% Attack Power"] = "【Клуб Таро】(2) Вся команда +5% к силе атаки.",
    ["<h>Consume</> Potion"] = "<h>Consume</> Potion",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>扮演与消化</>\n通过扮演魔药名称（也即序列名称）代表的角色，完成消化任务，提升消化进度，总结扮演守则。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>扮演守则</>\n非凡者总结出相应的扮演守则，按照守则行事，能帮助非凡者绕过阻碍、瓦解魔药内残余的精神影响，从而降低失控风险、加速消化魔药，掌控非凡能力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting and Digestion</>\nBy acting out the role represented by the potion name (which is also the Последовательность name), you can complete digestion quests, increase your digestion progress, and summarize the Acting Principles.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting Principles</>\nПотустороннийs who summarize the corresponding Acting Principles and act according to them can help bypass obstacles and dissolve the residual mental influence within the potion, thereby reducing the risk of loss of control, accelerating potion digestion, and mastering Потусторонний abilities.",
    ["[Placeholder-Animation] Potion brewing animation."] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Potion brewing animation.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Derrick】Tier 6 increment (+25%) → cumulative 190%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["[Right Stick Mode 3] Use self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front, and release a combo skill; enters cooldown after the combo is completed."] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] Use self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front, and release a combo skill; enters Перезарядка after the combo is completed.",
    ["　　Hey, my dear player! \n　　Since you want to play a choice game with the 'King', you can't do it without knowing the rules. So I personally wrote this ultimate dummy... oh no, the 'Ultimate Poker Crash Course'! \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Five of a Kind </>: Five identical poker cards. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Straight </>: Five poker cards with consecutive numbers. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Flush </>: Five poker cards of the same suit. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Straight Flush </>: Five poker cards of the same suit with consecutive numbers. \n\n　　Good luck... or, I hope you can see through the tricks behind 'good luck'!"] = "Привет, мой дорогой игрок! \n　　Поскольку вы хотите сыграть в игру с «Королем», вы не сможете сделать это, не зная правил. Итак, я лично написал этот идеальный манекен... о нет, «Ускоренный курс покера»! \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Пятерка </>: Пять одинаковых покерных карт. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Straight </>: пять покерных карт с последовательными номерами. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Flush </>: Пять покерных карт одной масти. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Стрит-Флеш </>: Пять покерных карт одной масти с последовательными номерами. \n\n　　Удачи... или, надеюсь, вы сможете разглядеть хитрости, скрывающиеся за «удачей»!",
    ["GTA枪反教学自动释放枪反"] = "GTA Gun Parry Tutorial Auto-Release Gun Parry",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Connection Interruption Buff 2"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Connection Interruption Buff 2",
    ["[True Form] On the 3rd hit of Ritual Magic, damage is increased by an additional 150% for targets with the Death Erosion effect, and there is a 16% chance to apply Death Erosion to targets without it."] = "[True Form] On the 3rd hit of Ritual Magic, damage is increased by an additional 150% for targets with the Death Erosion effect, and there is a 16% chance to apply Death Erosion to targets without it.",
    ["They actually decided to have me engaged to Matilda of the Abel Family without discussing it with me beforehand! \n God, I haven't even met her! \n No, I refuse! \n Even if I run away from home, even if I have to make a living on my own and suffer suppression, I will resist this arranged marriage!"] = "They actually decided to have me engaged to Matilda of the Abel Family without discussing it with me beforehand! \n God, I haven't even met her! \n No, I refuse! \n Even if I run away from home, even if I have to make a living on my own and suffer suppression, I will resist this arranged marriage!",
    ["【投影-占卜家】空气弹"] = "[Projection - Провидец] Воздушная пуля",
    ["<P_Heart>(This lady is really proactive. Participating in a secret organization has its pros and cons... but perhaps I can find clues to get home from this.)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Эта женщина очень активна. Участие в секретной организации имеет свои плюсы и минусы... но, возможно, я смогу найти подсказки, чтобы вернуться домой.) </>",
    ["QTE skill (QTE performance, actually an extra skill button)."] = "QTE skill (QTE performance, actually an extra skill button).",
    ["GTA Fallen Priest Armor Break"] = "GTA Fallen Priest Armor Break",
    ["<P_Yellow>Sealed Artifact · Knowledge Crown</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nLevel 0\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nMystery Pryer\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nA relic formed after Emperor Roselle was assassinated at White Maple Palace, combining the unexpelled Knowledge Emperor characteristic within his body with his crown. It contains the corruption of the ▇▇ Mother Goddess. \n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nMaterializes knowledge, capable of disintegrating physical objects into a Torrent of Knowledge.\nGrants knowledge of most subjects and allows for the direct interpretation of hidden information (including the secrets of deities).\nProvides understanding of cosmic truths and mystical essences that transcend Sequences.\nCan issue commands for Mind Control and cognitive restructuring to those of a lower Sequence. \n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nThe crown continuously instills an unbearable amount of truth and Forbidden Knowledge; interpreting this knowledge results in a random loss of sanity or personality.\nRemoving the crown triggers a backlash of the Torrent of Knowledge, instantly shattering the holder's soul and leaving them an ignorant, empty shell.\n\n<P_Yellow>Sealed Artifact · Magic Mirror of Despair</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nUnknown, Unrated\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nAssassin\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nFormed when the Despair Witch Helga failed her advancement to Sequence 3 and lost control. To prevent her from fully transforming into a monster, the Viscountess ended her life personally. The remaining Beyonder characteristic combined with a mirror and mutated. Helga and the Viscountess were close friends during Helga's lifetime. Her residual will combined with the characteristic to form this Sealed Artifact.\n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nCapable of constructing an independent mirror world.\nPossesses consciousness-sealing abilities, capable of segmenting and sealing powerful spirits or divine wills.\n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nPossesses a strong self-destructive consciousness and misanthropic tendencies; it will induce nearby creatures to destroy the magic mirror. If the mirror surface shatters, it triggers a violent spiritual backlash.\nIndiscriminately absorbs the hope and emotions of surrounding life forms, converting them into nutrients to sustain the mirror world. Creatures within range will gradually feel empty and numb, eventually walking toward self-destruction."] = "<P_Yellow>Запечатанный артефакт · Knowledge Crown</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nLevel 0\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nПодглядывающий за Тайнами\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nA relic formed after Emperor Roselle was assassinated at White Maple Palace, combining the unexpelled Knowledge Emperor characteristic within his body with his crown. It contains the Искажение of the ▇▇ Mother Goddess. \n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nMaterializes knowledge, capable of disintegrating physical objects into a Torrent of Knowledge.\nGrants knowledge of most subjects and allows for the direct interpretation of hidden information (including the secrets of deities).\nProvides understanding of cosmic truths and mystical essences that transcend Последовательностьs.\nCan issue commands for Mind Control and cognitive restructuring to those of a lower Последовательность. \n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nThe crown continuously instills an unbearable amount of truth and Forbidden Knowledge; interpreting this knowledge results in a random loss of Рассудок or personality.\nRemoving the crown triggers a backlash of the Torrent of Knowledge, instantly shattering the holder's soul and leaving them an ignorant, empty shell.\n\n<P_Yellow>Запечатанный артефакт · Magic Mirror of Despair</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nUnknown, Unrated\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nAssassin\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nFormed when the Despair Witch Helga failed her advancement to Последовательность 3 and lost control. To prevent her from fully transforming into a monster, the Viscountess ended her life personally. The remaining Потусторонний characteristic combined with a mirror and mutated. Helga and the Viscountess were close friends during Helga's lifetime. Her residual will combined with the characteristic to form this Запечатанный артефакт.\n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nCapable of constructing an independent mirror world.\nPossesses consciousness-sealing abilities, capable of segmenting and sealing powerful spirits or divine wills.\n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nPossesses a strong self-destructive consciousness and misanthropic tendencies; it will induce nearby creatures to destroy the magic mirror. If the mirror surface shatters, it triggers a violent spiritual backlash.\nIndiscriminately absorbs the hope and emotions of surrounding life forms, converting them into nutrients to sustain the mirror world. Creatures within range will gradually feel empty and numb, eventually walking toward self-destruction.",
    ["<P_Red>'Professor': The mother of all spiritual powers...</>"] = "<P_Red> «Профессор»: Мать всех духовных сил… </>",
    ["<Yellow>Rusty Bullet</>: When an attack hits the primary target, there is a probability of firing a dark green toxin pill at them, causing their body to suffer Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds, with a 5-second Cooldown. During this period, attacking the target triggers the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within <Yellow>8</> meters, with a maximum of one splash per 2 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Rusty Bullet</>: When an attack hits the primary target, there is a probability of firing a dark green toxin pill at them, causing their body to suffer Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds, with a 5-second Перезарядка. During this period, attacking the target triggers the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within <Yellow>8</> meters, with a maximum of one splash per 2 seconds.",
    ["【Rougue】学徒强普法术代理"] = "[Roguelike] Apprentice Strong Базовая атака Spell Proxy",
    ["<h>Wisdom</> is the key to breaking out of prison!"] = "<h>Wisdom</> is the key to breaking out of prison!",
    ["To Seer \n May your pendulum always point in the \n correct direction. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "Чтобы видеть\n Пусть ваш маятник всегда указывает\n в правильном направлении. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["<Yellow>放牧灵魂</>：穿戴者持续攻击主目标一段时间后，可将其灵魂剥离到自己脚下，<Yellow>10秒</>内触碰灵魂可将其吞噬，根据灵魂主人的类型，造成不同效果：\n吞噬非凡者的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并通过囚禁其灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂：\n    战士序列：<Yellow>黎明铠甲</>；\n    歌颂者序列：<Yellow>太阳誓约</>；\n    学徒序列：<Yellow>星云咏叹</>；\n    观众序列：<Yellow>心理暗示</>；\n    占卜家序列：<Yellow>诡秘之境</>；\n    窥秘人序列：<Yellow>星光囚笼</>；\n蠕动的饥饿提升危险等级时，对应技能强度随之提升。\n吞噬怪物的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并获得持续<Yellow>20</>秒的<Yellow>灵魂压制</>效果：buffdisc(*id)\n每20秒最多触发一次剥离灵魂效果，囚禁灵魂被释放之前，无法再次从其主人身上剥离灵魂。最多可同时囚禁<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</>个灵魂。"] = "<Yellow>Graze Soul</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows it to be devoured, causing different effects based on the soul owner's type: \nDevour Потусторонний soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them, and by imprisoning their soul, gain one corresponding Последовательность skill. Using this skill releases their soul: \n Warrior Последовательность: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n Bard Последовательность: <Yellow>Sun Oath</>; \n Apprentice Последовательность: <Yellow>Nebula Chant</>; \n Зритель Последовательность: <Yellow>Psychological Inculcation</>; \n Провидец Последовательность: <Yellow>Mystery Realm</>; \n Secrets Supplicant Последовательность: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \n When Creeping Hunger's danger level increases, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nDevour monster soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them and gains the <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect for <Yellow>20</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Before the imprisoned soul is released, another soul cannot be stripped from its owner. A maximum of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls can be imprisoned simultaneously.",
    ["　　近期，廷根<Highlight>离奇案件频繁发生</>。\n　　一位市民声称头顶长出红色蘑菇。一位富豪家中花房内的花藤疯狂生长，将他勒死在镶金的马桶上……\n　　警方提示，怪异传闻，多为幻觉。如遇此类事件，请立刻报警，或就近前往教堂求助。"] = "Recently, <Highlight> bizarre cases have occurred frequently </> in Тинген. \n A citizen claimed that red mushrooms grew on their head. The vines in a wealthy man's conservatory grew wildly, strangling him on his gold-inlaid toilet... \n The police remind citizens that strange rumors are mostly hallucinations. If you encounter such events, please call the police immediately or go to the nearest church for help.",
    ["\"Seer\" is only Sequence 9; there should be quite a few \"Seers\" in the world."] = "«Провидец» — это только Последовательность 9; в мире должно быть немало «Провидцев».",
    ["First mate of the \"Future,\" titled \"Toxin Expert.\" He has a great interest in biological research and possesses superb techniques. The Magic Mushrooms he cultivated have provided a better living environment for the people in the Forsaken Land of the Gods."] = "Первый помощник «Будущего» по прозвищу «Эксперт по токсинам». Он проявляет большой интерес к биологическим исследованиям и владеет превосходными методами. Волшебные грибы, которые он выращивал, обеспечили лучшую среду обитания людям в Забытой Земле Богов.",
    ["“魔术师”小姐的委托完成了，我也离开这里吧。"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”'s commission is complete, I should leave here too.",
    ["【塔罗会·异化猎犬】档7增量(+30%)→累计220%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Чужая гончая】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗家】\n廷根街头，一个老人慢悠悠地扫着地。两个混混朝他走过去，似乎要找他的麻烦……"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Тинген, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble...",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 蝴蝶外观buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Butterfly Appearance Buff",
    ["【塔罗会·戴里克】档6增量(+25%)→累计190%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["{\n\"无\": \"\",\n\"隐身\": \"Stealth\",\n\"嘲讽\": \"Taunt\",\n\"霸体\": \"Endure\",\n\"恐惧\": \"Terror\",\n\"隐身(仅免疫锁定)\": \"CharacterStealth\",\n\"石化\": \"StoneState\",\n\"通用Boss机制\": \"NormalBossMechanism\"\n}"] = "{\n \"None\": \"\", \n \"Invisibility\": \"Stealth\", \n \"Taunt\": \"Taunt\", \n \"Суперброня\": \"Endure\", \n \"Horror\": \"Terror\", \n \"Invisibility (Lock-on immunity only)\": \"CharacterStealth\", \n \"Petrification\": \"StoneState\", \n \"General Boss Mechanism\": \"NormalBossMechanism\" \n}",
    ["<Red>光芒耗散</>：光芒牢笼反弹伤害时，延长荣耀之证的冷却时间0.5秒，最多触发10次。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Light Dissipation</>: When Cage of Light reflects damage, it extends the Перезарядка of Proof of Glory by 0.5 seconds, triggering up to 10 times. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>你怎么知道？你跟踪我，想撬走我的生意？"] = "<P_Heart> (в шоке) </> Откуда ты знаешь? Вы преследуете меня, пытаетесь украсть мой бизнес?",
    ["<Title>复活次数加成</>\n队伍或团队中，3~8人处于同一家族，获得1次额外复活次数；9人以上处于同一家族，获得2次额外复活次数。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。\n<Title>属性补足加成</>\n队伍或团队中，拥有相同家族成员时，获得属性增益。团队内同家族成员数量越多，增益效果越高。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。"] = "<Title>Resurrection Count Bonus</>\nIf 3–8 people in a party or team belong to the same Family, gain 1 extra resurrection attempt; if 9 or more people belong to the same Family, gain 2 extra resurrection attempts. There is a 24-hour Перезарядка period after leaving a Family.\n<Title>Attribute Supplement Bonus</>\nIf there are members of the same Family in a party or team, gain attribute bonuses. The more members of the same Family in the team, the higher the bonus effect. There is a 24-hour Перезарядка period after leaving a Family.",
    ["【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Mystery Pryer】 \n There is a small house on the old street in the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night."] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Подглядывающий за Тайнами】 \n There is a small house on the old street in the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.",
    ["<Red>弑主</>：恶灵视主人为敌对单位，且主人进入战斗时，会被刻上持续10秒的仇敌印记。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Regicide</>: The Evil Spirit views its master as a hostile unit, and when the master enters combat, they will be marked with an Enemy mark lasting 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["[Adventure] Milgongen Shield (4/4)"] = "[Adventure] Milgongen Shield (4/4)",
    ["To 非凡者\n    祝你的未来和奥黛丽一样富有。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Потусторонний \n Пусть твое будущее будет таким же богатым, как у Одри. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["[Tarot Club Atmosphere] Apprentice"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Ученик",
    ["Boss trigger"] = "Триггер босса",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>俱乐部说明</>\n加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n俱乐部分为休闲俱乐部和战斗俱乐部，可在俱乐部信息修改处进行调整，休闲俱乐部不会在成员列表显示非凡评分。\n俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>创建响应俱乐部</>\n角色等级到达20级，可以选择加入俱乐部或自行创建俱乐部。\n创建俱乐部需要缴纳创建费用，创建后24小时内响应人数达到4人则创建成功，超时将创建失败。\n创建失败和主动取消创建，都不会返还创建费用。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a Club to participate in various Club activities, obtain rich event rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club shop.\nClubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs, which can be adjusted in the Club information modification section. Leisure Clubs will not display Потусторонний ratings in the member list.\nClub member locking rules: During Club-based gameplay activities (such as Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), Clubs do not allow members to join or leave.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating a Responsive Club</>\nWhen your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a Club or create one yourself.\nCreating a Club requires paying a creation fee. If the number of responses reaches 4 within 24 hours after creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor active cancellation of creation will refund the creation fee.",
    ["{\"Buff Type%i\"}"] = "{\"Buff Type%i\"}",
    ["　　不用意外！我预先知道你会到这里，留下了这封信，其他人看不到。\n　　我赶稿实在抽不开身，麻烦帮我把这本新书带给塔罗会的“月亮”先生。书钱我已经付过了！\n　　“月亮”目前以大地母神教会执事的身份，在金秋湖调查“丰饶污染”事件。你们正好可以借此认识一下。\n　　对了，“月亮”先生是血族，请一定不要叫他“吸血鬼”——那很不礼貌！\n　　附一张他自己很满意的画像，方便你辨认。\n（字迹越来越潦草……似乎没时间写更多了。） "] = "Don't be surprised! I knew you would come here, so I left this letter; others cannot see it. \n I'm too busy with my manuscript to get away, so please help me bring this new book to Mr. \"Moon\" of the Клуб Таро. I've already paid for the book! \n \"Moon\" is currently investigating the \"Abundance Искажение\" incident at Golden Autumn Lake under the guise of a deacon of the Earth Mother church. You can take this opportunity to get to know each other. \n By the way, Mr. \"Moon\" is a vampire, please do not call him a \"blood-sucker\"—that's very impolite! \n Attached is a portrait he is quite satisfied with, to help you identify him. \n (The handwriting is becoming increasingly messy... it seems there's no time to write more.)",
    ["BOSS 4 - Quality - After attack - Right"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — После атаки — Справа",
    ["[Roguelike] Apprentice Strong Basic Attack Spell Proxy"] = "[Roguelike] Apprentice Strong Базовая атака Spell Proxy",
    ["BOSS4-品质-攻击后-左"] = "BOSS4-Качество-После Атаки-Слева",
    ["　　寻找我的弟弟——威廉·霍普金斯，三十六岁，褐色卷发，中等身材，身高约一米七五。失踪时身穿黑色风衣、白衬衫、深色长裤和棕色皮鞋。最后出现于<Letter_Highlight>金秋湖农场</>附近，时间约为三天前的傍晚。\n　　妻子去世后，他深受打击，精神恍惚，常自言自语，不愿与人交流。他没有攻击性，但状态极差，独自在外十分危险。\n　　如有任何线索请告知灰鸽旅馆，必有重谢。"] = "Ищу своего младшего брата — Уильяма Хопкинса, 36 лет, каштановые вьющиеся волосы, среднего телосложения, рост примерно 1,75 метра. Когда он пропал, на нем был черный плащ, белая рубашка, темные брюки и коричневые кожаные туфли. В последний раз его видели около <Letter_Highlight>Golden Autumn Lake Farm</> около сумерек три дня назад.\n　　После смерти жены он был глубоко опустошен, психически ошеломлен, часто разговаривал сам с собой и не хотел общаться с другими. Он не агрессивен, но его состояние крайне плохое, и оставаться одному ему очень опасно.\n　　Если у вас есть какие-либо подсказки, пожалуйста, сообщите об этом в отель Grey Pigeon. Будет предложено щедрое вознаграждение.",
    ["Advanced Ritual Magic: Techniques for Praying to Deities"] = "Advanced Ritual Magic: Techniques for Praying to Deities",
    ["【塔罗会·巨斧骑士】档4增量(+25%)→累计140%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["Miss Magician"] = "Miss Фокусник",
    ["<Title>势力对战</>\n参与战略服的俱乐部将以最终确定的势力开启为期一个月的势力对战，参与<Highlight>霜陨领主、战略服猎城战、俱乐部征服宣令、战略服终末猎杀</>等玩法，获取俱乐部神选积分，并根据每周排名与最终排名争夺神选席位。俱乐部获得的神选席位由俱乐部管理在俱乐部内部分配。\n\n<Title>战略战备</>\n本次战略服将开放三项战略服专属战备：\n<Highlight>战略技能：</>每个途径可获得专属战略技能，合理使用将对战局产生重要影响。\n<Highlight>历史结晶：</>玩家可使用历史结晶将封印物提升至1级，并逐步解锁装配非凡物质的额外槽位。\n<Highlight>大帝征途：</>参与各项战略服玩法均可获得征服声望，可用于提升战略服军衔等级。\n<Highlight>以上战备仅在战略服内生效</>。\n\n<Title>神选荣耀</>\n势力对战结束后，将开启<Highlight>胜者宣言大会</>。大会结束后统一发放神选席位奖励与限时顶奢。后续还将根据各俱乐部的神选积分开启本服<Highlight>贸易战争</>，敬请期待。"] = "<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month faction battle with the finally determined factions. Participate in activities such as <Highlight> Frostfall Lord, Strategic Server Hunting City Battle, Club Conquest Declaration, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to earn Club Divine Selection Points and compete for Divine Selection Seats based on weekly and final rankings. The Divine Selection Seats obtained by a club are distributed internally by the club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive strategic skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle situation. \n <Highlight> History Crystals: </> Players can use History Crystals to upgrade Запечатанный артефактs to level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Потусторонний materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server activities can earn Conquest Prestige, which can be used to increase your Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> Divine Selection Glory </> \n After the faction battle ends, the <Highlight> Victory Declaration Ceremony </> will begin. After the ceremony, Divine Selection Seat rewards and limited-time top luxury items will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, <Highlight> Trade Wars </> for this server will be opened based on each club's Divine Selection Points; stay tuned.",
    ["{{player.name}} rolled <Chat_Highlight>a double critical failure!</> It is said that the next time they roll a critical success, all of Tingen will hear their cheers, provided they dare to roll again."] = "{{player.name}} rolled <Chat_Highlight>a double critical failure!</> It is said that the next time they roll a critical success, all of Тинген will hear their cheers, provided they dare to roll again.",
    ["\"Dracula\"? It's a vampire romance novel."] = "\"Dracula\"? It's a vampire romance novel.",
    ["Bot调用此Action时，无法外部传入目标，也没法走技能完整辅选流程，因此需要给一个筛选ID，用来确定技能目标（玩家不执行这个参数）"] = "Когда бот вызывает это действие, он не может передавать цели извне, а также не может пройти полный процесс выбора вспомогательного навыка, поэтому для определения цели навыка необходим идентификатор фильтра (игроки не выполняют этот параметр).",
    ["GTA - Audrey healing - Coffee cup"] = "GTA - Audrey healing - Coffee cup",
    ["……Is the result of your divination correct?"] = "……Is the result of your Гадание correct?",
    ["B-grade animation: \n Klein recalls the divinations of this period, a yellow crystal appears in his mind, and he suddenly has some insights."] = "B-grade animation: \n Klein recalls the Гаданиеs of this period, a yellow crystal appears in his mind, and he suddenly has some insights.",
    ["“魔术师”小姐"] = "Miss Фокусник",
    ["【塔罗会·弓箭骑士】+5%暴击(代替法强)"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】+5% критического удара (заменяет магическую силу)",
    ["GTA - Mechanical Creation - Armor Break Vulnerability"] = "GTA - Mechanical Creation - Armor Break Vulnerability",
    ["Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Chaos Walker></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Health increased.\""] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Chaos Walker></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Health increased.\"",
    ["The iron cigarette case bestowed by Mr. Fool can clear the corruption of knowledge..."] = "Железный портсигар, подаренный мистером Дураком, может очистить порчу знаний...",
    ["BOSS破防标记buff"] = "БОСС: усиление отметки пробития брони",
    ["【塔罗会·弓箭骑士】档7增量(+30%)→累计220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 7-го уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["IdGroup (Skill)"] = "IdGroup (Skill)",
    ["　　阿尔杰再次发问：\n        “你觉得‘牧羊人’洛薇雅长老有可能会对白银城造成危害吗？只用回答是或者否，不要解释。”\n        “……是。”戴里克最终还是无法欺骗自己。\n        阿尔杰轻笑了一声道：\n        “所以，你是唯一知道这件事情，却暂时找不到办法提醒六人议事团其他长老的人，对吧？”\n        “嗯。”戴里克的神情逐渐变得凝重。\n        阿尔杰改变了下坐姿，往后微靠道：“那个任务的风险极大，这一点，你是知道的，如果你死在了那座半毁的神庙里，谁还能想办法揭露‘牧羊人’洛薇雅的古怪？谁还能让白银城免于灾难？‘堕落造物主’可是一位真正的邪神！”\n        “你不是因为自私才假装失控，欺骗其他人，你是为了拯救白银城！”\n\n       ——第五卷《红祭司》第一百二十九章 “老油条”阿尔杰"] = "Alger asked again:\n \"Do you think Shepherd Elder Lovia might pose a threat to the City of Silver? Just answer yes or no, don't explain.\"\n \"...Yes.\" Derrick ultimately could not deceive himself.\n Alger chuckled and said:\n \"So, you are the only one who knows about this, but you can't find a way to warn the other elders of the Six-Member Council for the time being, right?\"\n \"Yeah.\" Derrick's expression gradually became solemn.\n Alger changed his sitting posture and leaned back: \"The risk of that mission is extremely high. You know this. If you die in that half-destroyed temple, who else can find a way to expose Shepherd Lovia's strangeness? Who else can save the City of Silver from disaster? The 'Fallen Creator' is a true evil god!\"\n \"You aren't pretending to lose control and deceiving others out of selfishness; you are doing it to save the City of Silver!\"\n\n — Volume 5: Red Priest, Chapter 129: \"Old Fox\" Alger",
    ["　　今天我在那个遗迹里找到一本旧书！\n　　书上提到一种起死回生的魔法，说是要通过仪式向神祈祷，借助丰饶之树的力量什么的。\n　　神指的是女神吗？仪式需要的东西倒是很简单，用平时攒下的零花钱就能买全了！\n　　等着吧，小云，你回来后，我一定给你摘最甜的树莓吃！\n　　这事可不能告诉妈妈，唉，她太爱大惊小怪。\n　　等我把小云带回家，她肯定会吓一大跳吧，嘿嘿。"] = "Today I found an old book in those ruins! \n The book mentions a magic to bring the dead back to life, saying it requires praying to a god through a ritual, using the power of the Tree of Abundance or something. \n Does the god refer to the Goddess? The things needed for the ritual are quite simple; I can buy them all with the pocket money I've saved up! \n Just you wait, Little Cloud, when you come back, I will definitely pick the sweetest raspberries for you to eat! \n I can't tell Mom about this; sigh, she is too prone to making a fuss. \n When I bring Little Cloud home, she will definitely be shocked, hehe.",
    ["To 非凡者\n    光就是一切的意义！\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Потусторонний \n Свет – это смысл всего! \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["\"A gaze is cast from the starry sky, the earth will be torn apart, and everything in the world will cease to exist.\""] = "«Взгляд бросится со звездного неба, земля разверзнется, и все на свете перестанет существовать».",
    ["[LV5] [Marionette Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon"] = "[LV5] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon",
    ["<Title_HW>十一月十八日</>\n　　真是件神奇的事情，一个异想天开的实验和一个偶然出现的失误，让我发现了一位困于风暴之中、迷失于黑暗深处的可怜家伙，他甚至只能在每个月满月的时候才能稍微靠近现实世界，可依然无法将他的呼喊传递进来。\n　　他是幸运的，他遇见了我——这个时代的主角。\n　　写完上面这段话，自己读了一遍，忽然有点唏嘘，哪怕是用汉字，也不知不觉带上了浓烈的翻译腔，四十年弹指一挥间啊，以往的记忆真的就像梦一样了。\n　　……"] = "<Title_HW> November 18 </> \n It is truly a magical thing. A whimsical experiment and an accidental mistake allowed me to discover a poor guy trapped in a storm and lost in the depths of darkness. He can only get close to the real world during the full moon every month, yet he still cannot convey his cries. \n He is lucky; he met me—the protagonist of this era. \n After writing the above paragraph and reading it myself, I suddenly felt a bit emotional. Even when using Chinese, I unknowingly adopted a strong translation tone. Forty years have passed in a flash; past memories really are like a dream. \n ...",
    ["“愚者”先生赐予的铁质卷烟盒，可以清除知识的污染……"] = "Железный портсигар, подаренный мистером Дураком, может очистить порчу знаний...",
    ["<h>操作角色移动</>，绘制灵性之墙"] = "<h>Move your character</> to draw a wall of Духовность",
    ["{{Sir|Madam}}, I used to be a Magician, skilled at escaping from cages in front of everyone's eyes."] = "{{Sir|Madam}}, I used to be a Фокусник, skilled at escaping from cages in front of everyone's eyes.",
    ["　　说起来，离开伦堡前，我一直研究的是奇异果。毕竟吃一口就获得神奇的非凡力量，如果能大规模量产，是不是对战知识教会时也能用上？\n\n\n　　好，还是种奇异果吧！\n\n\n　　种植培育记录就用之前用过的标题：\n　　《“大地母神”信仰仪式对物种变异性的影响：以不同非凡能力的奇异果为例》"] = "Кстати говоря, перед отъездом из Ленбурга я всегда исследовал киви. В конце концов, после одного укуса вы получаете магические силы Потустороннего. Если бы его можно было производить массово, можно ли было бы использовать его в борьбе с Церковью Знания? \n \n \n Хорошо, давайте посадим киви! \n \n \n В записи о посадке и выращивании будет использовано то же название, которое я использовал ранее: \n «Влияние ритуалов веры «Матери-Земли» на разнообразие видов: пример киви с различными потусторонними способностями»",
    ["<Red>Desire Stripping</>: Every 7 seconds during combat, the carrier also enters the Lost state for 1 second. Taking damage or receiving healing will delay this process. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Desire Stripping</>: Every 7 seconds during combat, the carrier also enters the Lost state for 1 second. Taking damage or receiving healing will delay this process. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【占】玩家和弗莱来到路口，半空的建筑从天而降，二人接连躲闪，被迫分开。"] = "[Placeholder] The player and Frye arrive at the intersection, and buildings from mid-air fall from the sky. The two dodge repeatedly and are forced to separate.",
    ["【增强】战斗开始后<HighLight>25</>秒内获得霸体，免疫控制。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain Суперброня and immunity to crowd control for <HighLight>25</> seconds after combat starts.",
    ["{\"Skill ID%i\"}"] = "{\"Skill ID%i\"}",
    ["【塔罗会·西尔维娅】档3增量(+15%)→累计114%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting and Digestion</>\nBy acting out the role represented by the potion name (which is also the Sequence name), you can complete digestion quests, increase your digestion progress, and summarize the Acting Principles.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting Principles</>\nBeyonders who summarize the corresponding Acting Principles and act according to them can help bypass obstacles and dissolve the residual mental influence within the potion, thereby reducing the risk of loss of control, accelerating potion digestion, and mastering Beyonder abilities."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting and Digestion</>\nBy acting out the role represented by the potion name (which is also the Последовательность name), you can complete digestion quests, increase your digestion progress, and summarize the Acting Principles.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting Principles</>\nПотустороннийs who summarize the corresponding Acting Principles and act according to them can help bypass obstacles and dissolve the residual mental influence within the potion, thereby reducing the risk of loss of control, accelerating potion digestion, and mastering Потусторонний abilities.",
    ["[Proof] The Skill Block weakened by the [Rumor] bond is further increased."] = "[Proof] The Блок навыков weakened by the [Rumor] bond is further increased.",
    ["[Tarot Club Atmosphere] Barrier Fragment - The Fool"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Фрагмент Барьера - Дурак",
    ["“愚者”先生赐予的封印物【乌托邦剧院】，可以帮助非凡者掌握并操控秘偶。\n获得秘偶后，可以使用秘偶的技能（仅限1个），并获得秘偶带来的角色属性提升效果。\n重复获得的秘偶，可以用来进行秘偶培养，提升秘偶的能力。\n星之虫类型的秘偶，可以幻形为其他非凡者的外貌，幻形后可以自由进行装扮。"] = "Запечатанный Артефакт [Театр Утопии], подаренный Мистером Дураком, может помочь Потусторонним управлять марионетками и управлять ими. \n После получения марионетки вы можете использовать один из ее навыков (не более 1) и получить бонусы к атрибутам персонажа, предоставляемые марионеткой. \n Дубликаты марионеток можно использовать для выращивания марионеток, чтобы улучшить их способности. \n Марионетки типа Звездного Червя могут принимать облик других Потусторонних, а после изменения формы их можно свободно одевать.",
    ["【Rogue】漫游者铭刻-周期伤害"] = "[Rogue] Wanderer Inscription - Periodic Damage",
    ["Trigger 3s Invincibility when HP < 40%"] = "Trigger 3s Invincibility when HP < 40%",
    ["<Yellow>厄运</>：布偶随主人进入战斗而唤醒，当主人技能命中敌方主目标时，布偶会附到目标身上，使其遭受<Yellow>厄运缠身</>效果：buffdisc(*id)，持续30秒。主人切换目标进行攻击时，布偶也会随之转移附身到新的目标身上。在外附身时间累计达到30秒后，布偶会短暂回到主人身上，直到再次被转移出去。"] = "<Yellow>Misfortune</>: The doll awakens as its master enters combat. When the master's skill hits the primary enemy target, the doll attaches itself to the target, causing them to suffer from the <Yellow>Beset by Misfortune</> effect: buffdisc(*id), lasting 30 seconds. When the master switches targets to attack, the doll will also transfer its attachment to the new target. After a cumulative 30 seconds of attachment, the doll will briefly return to the master until it is transferred again.",
    ["Ms. “Magician”'s commission is complete, I should leave here too."] = "Ms. “Фокусник”'s commission is complete, I should leave here too.",
    [">>>SceneTurntablePuzzleTrigger 转盘索引不一致，当前索引：%s, 缓存索引：%s"] = ">>>SceneTurntablePuzzleTrigger Несоответствие индекса проигрывателя, текущий индекс: %s, кэшированный индекс: %s",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Trickmaster】 \n The ruffians in the village make a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out, but this time..."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Trickmaster】 \n The ruffians in the village make a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out, but this time...",
    ["[Placeholder] The player fires at the injured Viscountess, and the Magic Mirror of Despair blocks the fatal bullet for her.\n Magic Mirror of Despair: Ugh... goodbye... Helena..."] = "[Placeholder] The player fires at the injured Viscountess, and the Magic Mirror of Despair blocks the fatal bullet for her.\n Magic Mirror of Despair: Ugh... goodbye... Helena...",
    ["【Tarot Club】(5) Entire team +20% Attack Power +600 Health +5% Critical Hit"] = "【Клуб Таро】(5) Вся команда +20% силы атаки +600 здоровья +5% критического удара",
    ["Buff layers are mapped according to the list order. If there is no corresponding element under the current buff layer, return the last element of the list."] = "Слои баффа отображаются в соответствии с порядком списка. Если под текущим слоем усиления нет соответствующего элемента, верните последний элемент списка.",
    ["<P_Heart>（非凡交易？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (За пределами торговли?) </>",
    ["GTA Give Player Execution Skill"] = "GTA Give Player Execution Skill",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗学者】\n巷子里传来一阵骚动。一只大花猫堵住了一只小老鼠，老鼠缩在墙角瑟瑟发抖。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner.",
    ["{{player.name}}释放了“破空裂隙”，召唤出了<Chat_Highlight>名流之殿</>！"] = "{{player.name}} released a \"Space-Breaking Rift\" and summoned the <Chat_Highlight>Hall of Fame</>!",
    ["【Tarot Club · Offspring Protection】+8 Dual Resistance"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】+8 двойное сопротивление",
    ["【塔罗会·巨斧骑士】档5增量(+25%)→累计165%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["Twenty-three bullets recovered… but so many people died. Is it worth it? I don't know. This city is rotten to the core. But someone has to dig out this rotting flesh—even if I'm the only one left.\nIf something like this happens again, I might have to come to you. After all, I have no one else I can trust.\nRecently, I've noticed my shadow seems to be fading; it's probably because I've been drinking too much. You should take care of your health too."] = "Двадцать три пули удалось обнаружить… но погибло так много людей. Стоит ли оно того? Я не знаю. Этот город прогнил до глубины души. Но кто-то должен выкопать эту гниющую плоть — даже если я остался один.\nЕсли что-то подобное произойдет снова, возможно, мне придется прийти к вам. В конце концов, мне больше некому доверять.\nНедавно я заметил, что моя тень, кажется, тускнеет; возможно, это потому, что я слишком много пью. Вам также следует позаботиться о своем здоровье.",
    ["BOSS Invisibility Invincibility buff"] = "БОСС Невидимость Бафф неуязвимости",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】模板7技能的连击，以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，并击退"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, dealing effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center, and knocks back.",
    ["【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Hard, 1250311"] = "【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Hard, 1250311",
    ["【Tarot Club · Archer Knight】Tier 6 increment (+25%) → cumulative 190%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["【Tarot Club · Archer Knight】Tier 5 increment (+25%) → cumulative 165%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["【位置】风车-吉瑞尔布置灵性之墙"] = "[Position] Windmill - Jirel sets up a Wall of Духовность",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.",
    ["BOSS4-品质-攻击后-中"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — После атаки — Средний",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡天赋系统</>\n1.每名非凡者有两种不同的非凡天赋方向，每个方向包含<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>和<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>。\n2.使用<Highlight>天赋点</>升级天赋节点，<Highlight>天赋点</>通过<Highlight>序列晋升</>获得。\n3.升级<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>，能够获得更强的力量。部分<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>升级后，可以解锁<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>。\n4.<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>通常蕴含着特殊的非凡能力，升级后会使自身的某些能力获得强化或改变。\n5.<Highlight>天赋点</>可以同时给两个非凡天赋方向加点，非凡者能够同时在两个方向上强化不同的<Highlight>天赋节点</>。但同一时间内只能激活一个方向，让其发挥作用。\n6.部分<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>的升级受到<Highlight>序列等级</>的限制。但非凡者可以随时重置任意天赋节点，体验不同的强化效果。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Система талантов Потусторонний </> \n 1. Каждый Потусторонний имеет два разных направления талантов Потусторонний, каждое из которых содержит базовые узлы талантов <Highlight> </> и специальные узлы талантов <Highlight> </>. \n 2. Используйте очки талантов <Highlight> </> для улучшения узлов талантов; Очки талантов <Highlight> </> получаются посредством продвижения последовательности <Highlight> </>. \n 3. Обновление базовых узлов талантов <Highlight>. </> дает более высокую мощность. После обновления некоторых базовых узлов талантов <Highlight> </> вы можете разблокировать специальные узлы талантов <Highlight> </>. \n 4. Узлы особых талантов <Highlight> </> обычно содержат особые способности Потусторонний; их улучшение усилит или изменит ваши собственные способности. \n 5. Очки талантов <Highlight> </> можно использовать для добавления очков в оба направления талантов Потусторонний одновременно, позволяя Потусторонний усиливать различные узлы талантов <Highlight> </> в обоих направлениях одновременно. Однако одновременно можно активировать только одно направление, чтобы оно вступило в силу. \n 6. Обновление некоторых базовых узлов талантов <Highlight> </> ограничено уровнем последовательности <Highlight> </>. Однако Потустороннийs может в любой момент сбросить любой узел талантов, чтобы испытать различные эффекты усиления.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Declare War</>\n1. War can be declared during: <Highlight>Monday-Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 11:00-23:00</>.\n2. Available battle time slots: <Highlight>Monday-Thursday 12:00-14:00 and 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00 and 21:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 12:00-18:00 and 22:00-23:00</>.\n3. Declaring war consumes club funds. The amount is based on club level, the difference in strength, and Blood Feud value.\n4. If the declaring side wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the club funds are refunded; no funds are refunded after a loss. If the challenged side loses, funds are deducted according to club level; none are deducted if it wins.\n5. After repeatedly declaring war on and defeating the same club, the cost of declaring war on it again will increase <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n6. After repeatedly being challenged by and losing to the same club, the challenger's cost to declare war again will decrease <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Rules</>\n1. Club War is fought freely on the Hornacis Mountains open-world map. Once it begins, only the two clubs at war enter a combat state with each other.\n2. Planting the flag: the declaring side receives the first right to plant it. After any <Highlight>(President, Vice President, or Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill disappears. Members earn points around the flag based on survival time.\n3. Flag rotation: when a club's ownership period ends, the right to plant the flag rotates to the opposing club. It can also rotate after a <Highlight>successful flag capture</>.\n4. Defeating opponents or assisting in their defeat also awards points.\n5. The war lasts <Highlight>30 minutes</>. The side with more points at settlement wins; if tied, the challenged side wins. If one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the leading side wins immediately.\n6. During Club War, use the <Highlight>\"Rally · Club War\"</> item to <Highlight>start a rally</> in the Hornacis Mountains. The item is available in Companion Shop - Club."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Declare War</>\n1. War can be declared during: <Highlight>Monday-Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 11:00-23:00</>.\n2. Available battle time slots: <Highlight>Monday-Thursday 12:00-14:00 and 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00 and 21:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 12:00-18:00 and 22:00-23:00</>.\n3. Declaring war consumes club funds. The amount is based on club level, the difference in strength, and Blood Feud value.\n4. If the declaring side wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the club funds are refunded; no funds are refunded after a loss. If the challenged side loses, funds are deducted according to club level; none are deducted if it wins.\n5. After repeatedly declaring war on and defeating the same club, the cost of declaring war on it again will increase <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n6. After repeatedly being challenged by and losing to the same club, the challenger's cost to declare war again will decrease <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Rules</>\n1. Club War is fought freely on the Hornacis Mountains open-world map. Once it begins, only the two clubs at war enter a combat state with each other.\n2. Planting the flag: the declaring side receives the first right to plant it. After any <Highlight>(President, Vice President, or Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill disappears. Members earn points around the flag based on survival time.\n3. Flag rotation: when a club's ownership period ends, the right to plant the flag rotates to the opposing club. It can also rotate after a <Highlight>successful flag capture</>.\n4. Defeating opponents or assisting in their defeat also awards points.\n5. The war lasts <Highlight>30 minutes</>. The side with more points at settlement wins; if tied, the challenged side wins. If one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the leading side wins immediately.\n6. During Club War, use the <Highlight>\"Rally · Club War\"</> item to <Highlight>start a rally</> in the Hornacis Mountains. The item is available in Companion Shop - Club.",
    ["“魔术师”小姐？您……还好吗？需要帮忙吗？"] = "Miss Фокусник? Are you... alright? Do you need any help?",
    ["<Red>Depletion</>: When Luck ends, the wearer falls into a state of exhaustion for 4 seconds: movement speed is reduced by *d**, stamina recovery speed is reduced by *d**, and Luck cannot be triggered during this period. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute entry becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Depletion</>: When Luck ends, the wearer falls into a state of exhaustion for 4 seconds: Скорость бега is reduced by *d**, stamina recovery speed is reduced by *d**, and Luck cannot be triggered during this period. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute entry becomes ineffective.",
    ["{{player.name}} has initiated a <Chat_Highlight>\"Divine Descent\" ritual</> at Saint Selena Cathedral in Tingen, praying for the Evernight Goddess's gaze and blessing. Go to assist, and perhaps you too will have a chance to receive Her blessing. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[Go to Assist]</>"] = "{{player.name}} has initiated a <Chat_Highlight>\"Divine Descent\" ritual</> at Saint Selena Cathedral in Тинген, praying for the Evernight Goddess's gaze and blessing. Go to assist, and perhaps you too will have a chance to receive Her blessing. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[Go to Assist]</>",
    ["Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><混乱行者></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Health increased.\""] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Chaos Walker></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Health increased.\"",
    ["<P_Heart>（那只老鼠，是非凡者！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Эта крыса — Потусторонний!) </>",
    ["<Yellow>Healing Minor Wounds</>: When the wearer's Health is not full and is higher than <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?48%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?46%}</>, Green Bloom restores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?4.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?5.5%}</> of the wearer's lost Health per second (the restoration amount is no less than <Yellow>0.5%</> of the maximum Health). If the wearer's Health is full, Green Bloom will instead heal the nearby teammate with the lowest Health. The same unit cannot receive healing from others' Green Bloom more than once per second. \nThe restoration effect of Green Bloom is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury."] = "<Yellow>Healing Minor Wounds</>: When the wearer's Health is not full and is higher than <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?48%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?46%}</>, Green Bloom restores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?4.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?5.5%}</> of the wearer's lost Health per second (the restoration amount is no less than <Yellow>0.5%</> of the maximum Health). If the wearer's Health is full, Green Bloom will instead heal the nearby teammate with the lowest Health. The same unit cannot receive healing from others' Green Bloom more than once per second. \nThe restoration effect of Green Bloom is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury.",
    ["“五月二十六日，我很享受‘通识者’身份。奇怪的是，当我以‘通识者’自居、做的事都与它相符时，让我发疯的耳语安静了不少。这就是查拉图先生提过的<P_Yellow>‘扮演’</>？这或许是解决魔药隐患的关键。​”"] = "«26 мая мне очень нравится статус «Ученого». Как ни странно, когда я идентифицирую себя как «Ученый» и делаю что-то, соответствующее этому, шепот, сводящий меня с ума, немного утих. Это тот <P_Yellow> «Действующий» </>, о котором говорил мистер Заратул? Это может быть ключом к разгадке скрытых опасностей зелий.»",
    ["\"Mystery Pryer\"... Pathway... Sequence 6... Scroll Professor..."] = "\"Подглядывающий за Тайнами\"... Pathway... Последовательность 6... Scroll Professor...",
    ["《震惊，熟食店老板娘竟然在肉中加了那个东西》，这标题让人忍不住想看正文。"] = "《Shocking: Delicatessen Owner Adds That Thing to the Meat》—this headline makes one unable to resist reading the full article.",
    ["【五月庄园-简单】召唤管家幻影召唤锁头小狗-筛任意未被猎犬追踪且没有铃铛的1人加buff"] = "[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter 1 Not Tracked by Hound, No Bell, Add Buff",
    ["LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(Skill), Float()))."] = "LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(Skill), Float())).",
    ["LuaList(Id(Spell Field))."] = "LuaList(Id(Spell Field)).",
    ["<h>占卜仓库内是否危险</>"] = "<h>Divinate if the warehouse is dangerous</>",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Weapon Master】 \n Someone at the market is selling rusty old guns that can only be hung on the wall as decorations. You find it interesting and go over to hunt for treasures."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Weapon Master】 \n Someone at the market is selling rusty old guns that can only be hung on the wall as decorations. You find it interesting and go over to hunt for treasures.",
    ["【塔罗会·异化猎犬】档5增量(+25%)→累计165%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Чужая гончая】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["<P_Heart>（顿了顿）</>我可以教你什么是好的占卜师。跟我来。"] = "<P_Heart> (Пауза) </> Я могу научить тебя тому, что такое хороший прорицатель. Подписывайтесь на меня.",
    ["　　Recently, there have been a series of deaths of young girls at Golden Autumn Lake. All the victims had clear puncture wounds on their necks. \n　　The crime scenes all displayed an eerie consistency: silver candlesticks and a large number of withered rose petals were scattered throughout the rooms, as if they had been deliberately arranged to resemble a classical wedding scene. According to the investigation, all these young girls were avid readers of vampire romance novels such as \"City of Twilight\" and \"Dracula\" before their deaths. <Highlight>vampire</>"] = "Recently, there have been a series of deaths of young girls at Golden Autumn Lake. All the victims had clear puncture wounds on their necks. \n　　The crime scenes all displayed an eerie consistency: silver candlesticks and a large number of withered rose petals were scattered throughout the rooms, as if they had been deliberately arranged to resemble a classical wedding scene. According to the investigation, all these young girls were avid readers of vampire romance novels such as \"City of Twilight\" and \"Dracula\" before their deaths. <Highlight>vampire</>",
    ["<Title>巨龙现身</>\n巨龙·投影于每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，现身<Highlight>猎龙城王城中心</>。若20:00前未被击退，巨龙将离开，且不触发击杀结算。\n\n<Title>归属伤害</>\n仅在巨龙周围<Highlight>40米</>内存活并对其造成伤害时，伤害才会计入玩家当前所在团队。巨龙被击退时，<Highlight>当前有效归属伤害最高的团队</>获得最终归属及拍卖奖励。靠近巨龙后，可实时查看当前归属伤害。\n\n<Title>伤害衰减</>\n玩家死亡、离开巨龙讨伐范围、切换分线或离开团队后，该玩家已为团队累计的归属伤害将开始衰减，并同步影响团队当前的有效归属伤害。\n\n触发衰减后的<Highlight>前5秒</>，归属伤害保持不变；从第6秒开始，<Highlight>每6秒减少原累计归属伤害的5%</>，持续120秒后归零。\n\n重新进入<Highlight>巨龙讨伐范围</>并恢复参战后，衰减停止。当前剩余的归属伤害将被保留，并在此基础上继续累计新造成的伤害。\n\n<Title>拍卖奖励</>\n击退巨龙后，将根据激战值开启对应档位的拍卖。<Highlight>激战值越高，可开启的拍卖奖励档位越高</>。\n\n<Title>资格限制</>\n每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。"] = "<Title>Giant Dragon Appearance</>\nThe Giant Dragon - Projection appears at the <Highlight>center of the Dragon Hunting City Royal City</> 10 minutes after the <Highlight>Hunting Time</> starts on Friday night, which is <Highlight>19:10</>. If it is not repelled before 20:00, the Giant Dragon will leave, and the kill settlement will not be triggered. \n\n<Title>Attribution Damage</>\nDamage is only counted towards the player's current team if they are alive within <Highlight>40 meters</> of the Giant Dragon and dealing damage to it. When the Giant Dragon is repelled, the <Highlight>team with the highest current effective attribution damage</> receives the final attribution and auction rewards. After approaching the Giant Dragon, you can view the current attribution damage in real-time. \n\n<Title>Damage Decay</>\nAfter a player dies, leaves the Giant Dragon crusade range, switches channels, or leaves the team, the attribution damage that player has accumulated for the team will begin to decay, and this will synchronously affect the team's current effective attribution damage. \n\nFor the <Highlight>first 5 seconds</> after decay is triggered, the attribution damage remains unchanged; starting from the 6th second, <Highlight>it decreases by 5% of the original accumulated attribution damage every 6 seconds</>, and reaches zero after 120 seconds. \n\nAfter re-entering the <Highlight>Giant Dragon crusade range</> and resuming combat, the decay stops. The current remaining attribution damage will be retained, and new damage dealt will continue to be accumulated on this basis. \n\n<Title>Auction Rewards</>\nAfter repelling the Giant Dragon, auctions for corresponding tiers will be opened based on the Intense Battle Value. <Highlight>The higher the Intense Battle Value, the higher the tier of auction rewards that can be opened</>. \n\n<Title>Qualification Restrictions</>\nIn each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the qualification for the Giant Dragon - Projection's Final Hunt auction at most <Highlight>1 time</>; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during this event.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Maid】Tier 5 increment (+25%) → cumulative 165%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】Tier 5 increment (+25%) → cumulative 165%",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演祈光人】\n一座老宅夜夜传出异响，它的继承人站在门外，始终不敢推门。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.",
    ["“战士”途径的非凡者拥有高序列以下几乎无人能打破的防御，哪怕步枪子弹也很难伤害到我们。"] = "Потусторонние Пути Воина обладают Защитой, которую почти никто ниже высокого уровня не может сломать; даже винтовочные пули вряд ли могут нам навредить.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Potion Formulas</>\nEssential items for advancing to a higher Sequence, containing main ingredients and auxiliary ingredients. Only after collecting all the potion materials in the next Sequence's potion formula can you craft the corresponding Sequence potion and complete the advancement.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Potion Materials</>\nUpon reaching the corresponding digestion progress, Beyonders will receive spiritual guidance, leading them to complete the corresponding quests and obtain potion materials."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Формулы Зелий</>\nНеобходимые предметы для перехода на более высокую последовательность, содержащую основные ингредиенты и вспомогательные ингредиенты. Только после сбора всех материалов для зелий в формуле зелья следующей последовательности вы сможете создать соответствующее зелье последовательности и завершить продвижение.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Получение материалов для зелий</>\nПосле достижения соответствующего прогресса пищеварения Потусторонние получат духовное руководство, которое поможет им выполнить соответствующие квесты и получить материалы для зелий.",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 移动护盾打碎buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Moving Shield Break Buff",
    ["A letter and a book entrusted by Miss Magician, to be delivered to Mr. Moon as soon as possible."] = "A letter and a book entrusted by Miss Фокусник, to be delivered to Mr. Moon as soon as possible.",
    ["<Tips_GrayTitle> Domain Characteristic Enhancement Unlocked </>"] = "<Tips_GrayTitle> Domain Characteristic Enhancement Unlocked </>",
    ["【废弃】观众攻击形态：对带有洞察易伤状态的目标增伤10%"] = "[Deprecated] Зритель Attack Form: 10% Damage Boost against targets with Insight Vulnerability status",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】屏障碎片-愚者"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Фрагмент Барьера - Дурак",
    ["“窥秘人”……途径……序列6…………卷轴教授……"] = "\"Подглядывающий за Тайнами\"... Pathway... Последовательность 6... Scroll Professor...",
    ["　　……\n　　6月13日\n　　<InvHighlight>金梧桐区</>五十户居民家中<Mark id=\"#159\">下水道</>堵塞，清理时发现管道被<Mark id=\"#159\">植物藤蔓</>塞满。\n\n　　6月14日\n　　富商米格尔死于<InvHighlight>金梧桐区</>的玻璃花房，被发现时身上结满紫红色葡萄。\n\n　　6月18日\n　　纺织工人贝丝在<InvHighlight>南区</>捡到三根蜡烛和一段木头手臂，现场有<Mark id=\"#159\">邪恶仪式</>的痕迹。\n　　……"] = "... \n June 13th \n <InvHighlight> North Borough </> In the homes of fifty residents <Mark id=\"#159\"> sewers </> were blocked, and during cleaning, it was discovered that the pipes were stuffed with <Mark id=\"#159\"> plant vines </>. \n \n June 14th \n Wealthy merchant Miguel died in a <InvHighlight> glass conservatory in the North Borough </>, and when discovered, his body was covered in purple-red grapes. \n \n June 18th \n Textile worker Beth found three candles and a wooden arm in the <InvHighlight> South District </>, and there were traces of an <Mark id=\"#159\"> evil ritual </> at the scene. \n ...",
    ["【模板技能】占编号85000350-85000399"] = "【Template Skill】Гадание ID 85000350-85000399",
    ["GTA牧师投技眩晕"] = "GTA Priest Throw Skill Stun",
    ["[True Form] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, reduce the Cooldown of own Cleanse skills by 3 seconds."] = "[True Form] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, reduce the Перезарядка of own Снятие контроляs by 3 seconds.",
    ["'Selina, happy birthday, this is a gift for you.' Elizabeth handed the amulet to the protagonist of the birthday party, and Selina immediately put it around her neck. \n 'Thank you, Elizabeth! I love this amulet so much.' Selina held her best friend's hand and shook it happily, 'I feel very relaxed now, my body seems to be healthier!' \n 'As long as you like it.' Elizabeth smiled, then accompanied her friend to the door to greet guests. \n She thought that if she had the chance, she must thank the mysterious gentleman in the underground market; it was he who helped her choose this best gift."] = "'Selina, happy birthday, this is a gift for you.' Elizabeth handed the amulet to the protagonist of the birthday party, and Selina immediately put it around her neck. \n 'Thank you, Elizabeth! I love this amulet so much.' Selina held her best friend's hand and shook it happily, 'I feel very relaxed now, my body seems to be healthier!' \n 'As long as you like it.' Elizabeth smiled, then accompanied her friend to the door to greet guests. \n She thought that if she had the chance, she must thank the mysterious gentleman in the underground market; it was he who helped her choose this best gift.",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Delayed Damage Buff 2"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Delayed Damage Buff 2",
    ["　　……\n\n　　使用银制 <Mark id=\"#159\">仪式匕首</>，取<InvHighlight>双腕鲜血少许</>、混合后涂抹于仪式法阵之上，坚定以自身意志主动束缚灵魂的决心……服下不朽苔的汁液，念诵：“躯壳暂归永夜，真名藏于灰烬。” \n\n　　……<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">躯体呈现所有死亡表征</>，七日后恢复如常。"] = "... \n \n Use a silver <Mark id=\"#159\"> Ritual Dagger, </> take <InvHighlight> a little blood from both wrists, </> mix it, and smear it on the ritual magic circle, firming the determination to actively bind the soul with one's own will... Take the juice of the Immortal Moss and chant: \"The shell temporarily returns to the eternal night, the true name is hidden in the ashes.\" \n \n ... <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> The body presents all the signs of death, </> and returns to normal after seven days.",
    ["\"We are guardians, and also a bunch of poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness.\"\n Outside the window, the corridor was sealed and the stone walls were cold. Inside, the lamplight shone bright and yellow. Dunn Smith's retelling lingered in such an environment, striking Klein's heart beat by beat, leaving him momentarily speechless.\n Seeing Klein silent, Dunn shook his head and smiled:\n \"Disappointed? Beyonders aren't what you imagined; we are always walking alongside danger.\"\n \"With gain, there must be a price.\" Klein recovered from the shock and replied, weighing his words.\n He truly hadn't expected that beyond the glorious, extraordinary, and unique aspects of being a Beyonder, there were such hidden dangers. Perhaps it was because he had only heard the description and hadn't truly encountered them yet, or perhaps because he was already caught in this vortex and could face bizarre events at any time, his fear, anxiety, and worry quickly subsided to a controllable level.\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 20: Origin and Reason"] = "\"We are guardians, and also a bunch of poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and Безумие.\"\n Outside the window, the corridor was sealed and the stone walls were cold. Inside, the lamplight shone bright and yellow. Dunn Smith's retelling lingered in such an environment, striking Klein's heart beat by beat, leaving him momentarily speechless.\n Seeing Klein silent, Dunn shook his head and smiled:\n \"Disappointed? Потустороннийs aren't what you imagined; we are always walking alongside danger.\"\n \"With gain, there must be a price.\" Klein recovered from the shock and replied, weighing his words.\n He truly hadn't expected that beyond the glorious, extraordinary, and unique aspects of being a Потусторонний, there were such hidden dangers. Perhaps it was because he had only heard the description and hadn't truly encountered them yet, or perhaps because he was already caught in this vortex and could face bizarre events at any time, his fear, anxiety, and worry quickly subsided to a controllable level.\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 20: Origin and Reason",
    ["<Yellow>公证</>：携带者在战斗中施放普通技能和终结技能时，自动触发对该技能的公证，分别有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</>的概率公证成功，获得<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</>层公证。有10%概率公证失败，失去1层公证。每层公证使携带者提高<Yellow>*f</>攻击和<Yellow>*f</>技能增强。\n公证最多可累积<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</>层。技能触发的公证超出层数上限时，超出的层数自动消耗，每层使该技能本次施放的增伤提高<Yellow>10%</>，治疗增幅提高<Yellow>10%</>。\n离开场景时，清除所有公证层数。"] = "<Yellow>Notarization</>: When the carrier casts basic skills and Finisher Skills in combat, Notarization of the skill is automatically triggered, with a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</> probability of successful Notarization, granting <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</> stack(s) of Notarization. There is a 10% probability of failure, losing 1 stack of Notarization. Each stack of Notarization increases the carrier's Attack by <Yellow>*f</> and Усиление навыков by <Yellow>*f</>. \nNotarization can accumulate up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</> stacks. When the stacks triggered by skills exceed the maximum limit, the excess stacks are automatically consumed, each stack increasing the Damage Boost of the current skill cast by <Yellow>10%</> and Healing Boost by <Yellow>10%</>. \nWhen leaving the scene, all Notarization stacks are cleared.",
    ["reminder触发器3"] = "reminder trigger 3",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 一阶段减伤Buff移除破碎"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Phase 1 Снижение урона Buff Removal Break",
    ["——上午——\n8：00-10：30   工作\n10：30-10：40  休息\n10：40-11：00 广播体操\n11：00-12：00  吃饭\n——午休——\n12：00-13：00\n——下午——\n13：00-15：30  工作\n15：30-15：40  休息\n15：40-16：00 跑操\n16：00-18：00  工作\n18：00后  晚餐（可外带）"] = "——Morning—— \n 8:00-10:30 Work \n 10:30-10:40 Rest \n 10:40-11:00 Radio Calisthenics \n 11:00-12:00 Meal \n ——Lunch Break—— \n 12:00-13:00 \n ——Afternoon—— \n 13:00-15:30 Work \n 15:30-15:40 Rest \n 15:40-16:00 Running Exercise \n 16:00-18:00 Work \n After 18:00 Dinner (Takeout allowed)",
    ["【Unlocked after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Spectator】\n At the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom."] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Зритель】\n At the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.",
    ["Buff Type List"] = "Buff Type List",
    ["<Yellow>异界祝福</>：战斗状态下施放灵视时，灵视效果缩短至<Yellow>5秒</>，灵视技能冷却延长至<Yellow>20秒</>，期间获得灵体生物的祝福，每秒恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</>上限生命值，并降低受到的伤害<Yellow>*f**</>。\n该治疗效果受减疗和重伤效果影响。"] = "<Yellow>Otherworld Blessing</>: When casting Spirit Vision in combat, the Spirit Vision effect is shortened to <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the Spirit Vision skill Перезарядка is extended to <Yellow>20 seconds</>. During this period, gain the blessing of spirit-body creatures, restoring <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</> of Max HP per second and reducing damage taken by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n This healing effect is affected by healing reduction and grievous wound effects.",
    ["Respected {{先生|小姐}}, since you arrived here, I have watched this castle gradually come to life; it is truly gratifying. Look at this rye beer, how fragrant it smells!"] = "Уважаемый {{Sir|Miss}}, с тех пор, как вы прибыли сюда, я наблюдал, как этот замок постепенно оживает; это действительно приятно. Посмотрите на это ржаное пиво, как оно ароматно пахнет!",
    ["【死神装备】额外获得<HighLight>10%</>吸血。"] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Вампиризм.",
    ["LuaList(LuaTuple(Str(), IdGroup(Skill), Str()))."] = "LuaList(LuaTuple(Str(), IdGroup(Skill), Str())).",
    ["Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><教唆者></>: \"Control Dodge increased.\""] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Instigator></>: \"Control Dodge increased.\"",
    ["<h>Ask</> about information on these Sequences"] = "<h>Ask</> about information on these Последовательностьs",
    ["·隐秘羁绊最高等级为7级。达到满级后，溢出的好感度将按照10:1的比例自动折算为【记忆珍匣】，可在【往事陈列馆】商店处兑换各类外观。\n·非凡者与人脉一同参与漫步、邀约、共舞等互动时可消耗【漫忆请柬】并获得好感度。每日首次与人脉互动不消耗邀请券，所有人脉共享该免费次数。\n·与同一人脉进行同一类型互动并邀请券后，当日内再次进行该类型互动将不再消耗邀请券，也不再获得好感度。\n·漫步：仅限大世界场景使用，进入副本等非大世界场景后将自动解除。\n·非凡者与对应人脉角色好感度等级达到2级后，每日可获得2次与该人脉的邀约函集次数（次数随着好感度等级增加），消耗邀约函集次数与对应数量的【漫忆请柬】，非凡者直接完成对应的快速互动次数，直接获得该人脉对应的好感度以及奖励。\n·非凡者每日还可获得5次全人脉共享的邀约函集次数，最高累计15次（全人脉角色共享），但是需要非凡者解锁【愚者福音】才可使用该邀约函集次数。\n·非凡者与人脉角色快速互动时，优先消耗人脉本身的邀约函集次数，再消耗全人脉共享的次数。"] = "· The maximum level for Secret Bonds is 7. Upon reaching the maximum level, excess favorability will be automatically converted into [Memory Caskets] at a 10:1 ratio, which can be exchanged for various appearances at the [Past Exhibition Hall] shop. \n · When Потустороннийs participate in interactions such as strolling, inviting, or dancing with contacts, they can consume [Memory Invitations] and gain favorability. The first interaction with a contact each day does not consume an invitation ticket; this free attempt is shared among all contacts. \n · After interacting with the same contact in the same way and using an invitation ticket, subsequent interactions of the same type on the same day will not consume invitation tickets, nor will they grant favorability. \n · Strolling: Only available in the open world; it will be automatically canceled upon entering dungeons or other non-open-world scenes. \n · Once the favorability level between a Потусторонний and a corresponding contact reaches level 2, you can obtain 2 invitation collection attempts for that contact daily (the number of attempts increases with the favorability level). Consuming these attempts and the corresponding number of [Memory Invitations] allows the Потусторонний to directly complete the corresponding quick interaction and obtain the contact's favorability and rewards. \n · Потустороннийs can also obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Потусторонний to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Потусторонний performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts.",
    ["<Yellow>生命能量</>：携带者每隔<Yellow>20秒</>获得1点生命能量，持有上限为3点。携带者对自身或友方单位造成的累计有效治疗超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>50%</>时，消耗1点生命能量，对目标附加3层<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>效果，持续10秒，并获得1枚<Yellow>生命之种</>，持有上限为3枚。\n\n<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>：生命值不满时，每秒消耗1层，恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</>点生命值。\n<Yellow>生命之种</>：携带者受到伤害时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则自动消耗1枚生命之种，固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。\n身处主宰争锋玩法中时，生命手杖效果降低。"] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The wearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the wearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the wearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds.\n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consumes 1 stack per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP.\n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the wearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP. The effect of the Life Staff is reduced while in the Dominator's Clash mode.",
    ["……都免费，全部免费，一便士都不会收的，请放心。"] = "...It's all free, completely free, not a single penny will be charged, please rest assured.",
    ["<Yellow>Evil Spirit</>: The Evil Spirit awakens as its master enters combat. Starting from the 5th second, every <Yellow>10 seconds</>, the Evil Spirit appears on the field, locking onto a random hostile target to track and move towards. Upon touching a hostile unit, it executes vengeance and then briefly falls asleep. Vengeance deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?*d}</> damage, has a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?1.5}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?2.5}</>-second Stun effect, and marks the target with a 10-second <Yellow>Enemy</> mark, reducing their movement speed by <Yellow>20%</>. When the Evil Spirit appears next, it <Yellow>prioritizes locking onto</> targets with the Enemy mark. \nAt any given time, the Evil Spirit can only mark 1 target as an Enemy."] = "<Yellow>Evil Spirit</>: The Evil Spirit awakens as its master enters combat. Starting from the 5th second, every <Yellow>10 seconds</>, the Evil Spirit appears on the field, locking onto a random hostile target to track and move towards. Upon touching a hostile unit, it executes vengeance and then briefly falls asleep. Vengeance deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?*d}</> damage, has a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?1.5}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?2.5}</>-second Stun effect, and marks the target with a 10-second <Yellow>Enemy</> mark, reducing their Скорость бега by <Yellow>20%</>. When the Evil Spirit appears next, it <Yellow>prioritizes locking onto</> targets with the Enemy mark. \nAt any given time, the Evil Spirit can only mark 1 target as an Enemy.",
    ["　　有点急事，待会回来。\n\n　　你可以在咖啡馆周围看看，旁边<Letter_Highlight_HW>中央广场</>上有一个叫做<Mark id=\"#159\">“旅行尖碑”</>的石碑，那是“魔术师”小姐和工匠制作的，开启后，就能在各地的旅行点之间穿梭。\n\n　　好东西，比走路快。\n\n　　注：不要走太远。\n"] = "Немного спешу, вернусь через минуту. \n\n 　　Вы можете осмотреться в кафе. Рядом с ним, на <Letter_Highlight_HW>Central Plaza</>, есть каменная табличка под названием <Mark id=\"#159\"> «Обелиск путешествий» </>. Его сделали мисс «Волшебница» и мастер. После активации вы сможете перемещаться между точками путешествия по всему миру. \n\n 　　Хорошая штука, быстрее, чем идти пешком. \n\n 　　Примечание: не заходите слишком далеко. \п",
    ["《非凡药剂百科》"] = "Encyclopedia of Потусторонний Potions",
    ["B点触发器"] = "Point B Trigger",
    ["【塔罗会·侍女】档4增量(+25%)→累计140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%",
    ["【实证】明灯的护盾量增加10%，爆炸伤害增加30%。"] = "[Proof] Beacon's Shield amount increased by 10%, Explosion damage increased by 30%.",
    ["Respected {{Sir|Miss}}, since you arrived here, I have watched this castle gradually come to life; it is truly gratifying. Look at this rye beer, how fragrant it smells!"] = "Уважаемый {{Sir|Miss}}, с тех пор, как вы прибыли сюда, я наблюдал, как этот замок постепенно оживает; это действительно приятно. Посмотрите на это ржаное пиво, как оно ароматно пахнет!",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3 Beyonder\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder+2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nreturn Round(baseprice + $4)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3 Потусторонний\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний+2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nreturn Round(baseprice + $4)",
    ["<Yellow>Sule's Self-Defense</>: The carrier's Damage Reduction is increased by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n<Yellow>Wealth of Misery</>: When the carrier takes damage, Defense is increased based on the cumulative damage received, lasting <Yellow>30 seconds</>, with Defense increasing by up to <Yellow>*d</> points."] = "<Yellow>Sule's Self-Defense</>: The carrier's Снижение урона is increased by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n<Yellow>Wealth of Misery</>: When the carrier takes damage, Defense is increased based on the cumulative damage received, lasting <Yellow>30 seconds</>, with Defense increasing by up to <Yellow>*d</> points.",
    ["GTA - Shooting Replay - Interaction Triggers Gameplay"] = "GTA - Shooting Replay - Interaction Triggers Gameplay",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演占星人】\n占星爱好者弗洛最近倒霉透顶，他坚信是星星变了位置导致的。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions.",
    ["GTA-金狼演讲事件-交互触发狙击状态"] = "GTA - Golden Wolf Speech Event - Interaction Triggers Snipe State",
    ["True:监听被动技能；\nFalse:不监听被动技能"] = "Верно: слушайте пассивные навыки; \nЛожь: не слушайте пассивные навыки.",
    ["<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\">布满污迹的纸条上，只剩几行还能辨认的字：</>\n“我终于明白了……”\n“第一轮是<Letter_Highlight_HW>二号</>！二号是<Letter_Highlight_HW>真的</>！”\n“欲念使者说的都是<Letter_Highlight_HW>实话</>，可我们还是会死——”\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">字迹断了</>，<Hide id=\"#157\">后面是一道擦过的暗色污痕。</>                                                                                         "] = "<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\"> On the stained note, only a few lines of legible text remain: </>\n \"I finally understand...\" \n \"The first round is <Letter_Highlight_HW> Number Two </>! Number Two is <Letter_Highlight_HW> real </>!\" \n \"The Messenger of Desire told the <Letter_Highlight_HW> truth </>, but we will still die—\" \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\"> The handwriting breaks off </>, <Hide id=\"#157\"> followed by a smeared dark stain. </>",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <Spirit Medium> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Spirit Medium> trait",
    ["\"Light the Deep Sleep Flower stalk to exorcise evil\"… Some occult folk remedies?"] = "\"Light the Deep Sleep Flower stalk to exorcise evil\"… Some occult folk remedies?",
