    ["　　廷根著名占卜者，俱乐部常驻导师，擅长各种占卜方式，每次收费<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> 4苏勒</>。"] = "Известный прорицатель в Тингене, постоянный наставник Клуба, владеющий различными методами гадания, 4 соль <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> </> за сеанс.",
    ["BOSS 4 - Quality - After Attack - Medium"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — После атаки — Средний",
    ["Battle: Change Boss Armor Break lock."] = "Битва: изменить замок пробития брони босса.",
    ["Boss special mechanism total invincibility"] = "Специальный механизм босса, полная непобедимость",
    ["{{player.name}}'s \"Divine Descent\" ritual has received the Evernight Goddess's blessing—<Chat_Highlight>Embrace of Concealment</>! Praise Her! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[Go to Praise]</>"] = "{{player.name}}'s \"Divine Descent\" ritual has received the Evernight Goddess's blessing—<Chat_Highlight>Embrace of Concealment</>! Praise Her! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[Go to Praise]</>",
    ["《Tingen Drunkard William and the Bloody Adventure: As a drunken rogue, he discovers a vampire nest in Tingen. His landlord, the factory tycoon, and the banker in the city are actually vampires; it tells the story of how he single-handedly pierces the greedy hearts of the vampires with wooden stakes, thus becoming Loen's most renowned vampire hunter.》\n\n Author: Cliff William \n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW> This will be a hit!!! </>\n\n Damn Basil, badmouthing me everywhere, you'll only live for two chapters! \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> This part is made up. This part is made up. This part </>\n<Delete id=\"#158\"> Cats can't talk. </>\n<Delete id=\"#158\"> Neither can pigeons. </>"] = "《Тинген Drunkard William and the Bloody Adventure: As a drunken rogue, he discovers a vampire nest in Тинген. His landlord, the factory tycoon, and the banker in the city are actually vampires; it tells the story of how he single-handedly pierces the greedy hearts of the vampires with wooden stakes, thus becoming Loen's most renowned vampire Охотник.》\n\n Author: Cliff William \n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW> This will be a hit!!! </>\n\n Damn Basil, badmouthing me everywhere, you'll only live for two chapters! \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> This part is made up. This part is made up. This part </>\n<Delete id=\"#158\"> Cats can't talk. </>\n<Delete id=\"#158\"> Neither can pigeons. </>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n在命运时刻战场中，非凡者分为两个阵营，每场对局持续<Highlight>4分钟</>，对局结束时分数较高的一方获胜，积分相同则依次判断击杀数和伤害量，高的一方获胜，均相同则随机一方获胜。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>机制说明</>\n<Highlight>积分获取：</>可通过拾取增益光点、击杀、助攻、进入纷争漩涡争夺来获取。\n<Highlight>汇集锚点：</>对局内会出现汇集锚点并持续<Highlight>15秒</>，届时根据锚点<Highlight>需求人数</>进入锚点，人数达到要求后持续<Highlight>3秒</>后将会将本阵营非凡者集结于此，同时参与集结的非凡者将获得限时属性加成。\n<Highlight>纷争漩涡：</>战场中间会出现纷争漩涡，纷争漩涡<Highlight>倒计时结束时</>留在漩涡内的非凡者将平分积分。\n<Highlight>增益光点：</>战场中会出现增益光点，拾取增益光点会获得<Highlight>积分及属性加成</>。\n<Highlight>命运蘑菇：</>非凡者在命运时刻战场中，连续阵亡三次后会掉落命运蘑菇：友方阵亡将掉落拥有丰饶力量的绿色命运蘑菇，拾取后恢复生命值，敌方阵亡将掉落拥有毁灭力量的红色命运蘑菇，拾取后将扣除生命值，请注意分辨后拾取。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs are divided into two factions. Each match lasts <Highlight> 4 minutes </>. The side with the higher score at the end wins. If scores are tied, the number of kills and then damage dealt are compared; the higher side wins. If all are tied, a random side wins. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mechanism Explanation </>\n<Highlight> Score Acquisition: </> Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete. \n<Highlight> Anchor Convergence: </> Anchor points will appear in the match and last for <Highlight> 15 seconds </>. Based on the <Highlight> required number of people </>, enter the anchor point. Once the requirement is met and held for <Highlight> 3 seconds </>, Потустороннийs of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Потустороннийs will receive a temporary attribute bonus. \n<Highlight> Vortex of Strife: </> A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight> countdown ends </>, Потустороннийs remaining in the vortex will split the points equally. \n<Highlight> Buff Orbs: </> Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield; picking them up grants <Highlight> points and attribute bonuses </>. \n<Highlight> Fate Mushrooms: </> In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs will drop Fate Mushrooms after dying three consecutive times: allies drop green Fate Mushrooms with Abundance power, which restore health when picked up; enemies drop red Fate Mushrooms with Destruction power, which deduct health when picked up. Please distinguish carefully before picking them up.",
    ["To 非凡者\n    我们都是时代的囚徒，\n    但总有人试图在牢笼里起舞。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Потусторонний \n Мы все пленники эпохи,\n но всегда найдутся те, кто попытается потанцевать в клетке. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Secret Treasure Introduction</>\n1. Secret Treasures are divided into <Highlight>World Adventure Secret Treasures</>, <Highlight>War-to-War Secret Treasures</>, and <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</>. The progress and rewards for different Secret Treasures are independent of each other. \n2. Opening Secret Treasures can grant equipment of the corresponding item level. <Highlight>World Adventure and War-to-War Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>abundant cultivation resources</>, while <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>tradable resources</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Secret Treasures </>\n1. Participate in corresponding gameplay to <Highlight>accumulate Secret Treasure progress</>. Once the progress is full, it will automatically convert into obtaining the corresponding type of Secret Treasure. \n2. There is a limit to the number of times Secret Treasure progress can be converted for item levels 35, 45, and 55, up to a maximum of <Highlight>10</> times. Excess progress will be <Highlight>automatically stored</> and <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> after the new item level Secret Treasures are unlocked. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cumulative Opening Times </>\nStarting from Monday, new shared opening times are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. If the times for the current week are not used, they will be cleared. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server launch, there is <Highlight>no limit</> on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server launch, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret Treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new Secret Treasures. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Vitality Consumption Rules </>\nThe Vitality consumed by shared opening times will increase as the Beyonder's number of openings increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> Vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> Vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> Vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> Vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> Vitality."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Secret Treasure Introduction</>\n1. Secret Treasures are divided into <Highlight>World Adventure Secret Treasures</>, <Highlight>War-to-War Secret Treasures</>, and <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</>. The progress and rewards for different Secret Treasures are independent of each other. \n2. Opening Secret Treasures can grant equipment of the corresponding item level. <Highlight>World Adventure and War-to-War Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>abundant cultivation resources</>, while <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>tradable resources</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Secret Treasures </>\n1. Participate in corresponding gameplay to <Highlight>accumulate Secret Treasure progress</>. Once the progress is full, it will automatically convert into obtaining the corresponding type of Secret Treasure. \n2. There is a limit to the number of times Secret Treasure progress can be converted for item levels 35, 45, and 55, up to a maximum of <Highlight>10</> times. Excess progress will be <Highlight>automatically stored</> and <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> after the new item level Secret Treasures are unlocked. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cumulative Opening Times </>\nStarting from Monday, new shared opening times are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. If the times for the current week are not used, they will be cleared. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server launch, there is <Highlight>no limit</> on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server launch, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret Treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new Secret Treasures. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Vitality Consumption Rules </>\nThe Vitality consumed by shared opening times will increase as the Потусторонний's number of openings increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> Vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> Vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> Vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> Vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> Vitality.",
    ["BUFF effect reminder test text test text test text."] = "Текст напоминания об эффекте BUFF Тестовый текст Тестовый текст.",
    ["[Rogue] Nebula Aria - Spell Proxy"] = "[Rogue] Nebula Aria - Spell Proxy",
    ["Buff stacks meet conditions"] = "Buff stacks meet conditions",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里曾是拉姆德男爵的领土，核心建筑便是这座以家族命名的古堡。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Когда-то это была территория барона Ламуда, и основным зданием является замок, названный в честь Семьи.)</>",
    [">>>SceneTurntablePuzzleTrigger 上一个转盘转动还没结束 %s"] = ">>>SceneTurntablePuzzleTrigger Предыдущее вращение проигрывателя еще не завершилось %s",
    ["　　占卜可以按获得“启示”的方式分为三类：\n　　第一类，借助询问人自身的“力量”，通过“感应”获得启示，比如塔罗占卜和扑克占卜。\n　　第二类，由占卜人主导，通过对自然界或询问人提供的信息进行计算和推测来获得启示，如灵数、占星。\n　　第三类，向第三者寻求答案，常见的是“魔镜占卜”。这种占卜方式实在太有趣了！通常是向七位正神祈求答案，如果我向其他存在祈求会怎么样？\n\n备注：\n　　今天格拉西斯先生说这里曾有一位真正的占卜家，那位只是看了他一眼，就知道他肺部有问题，这又是什么原理？真希望有机会见见那位莫雷蒂先生。"] = "Гадание можно разделить на три категории в зависимости от способа получения «откровений»: \n Первая категория — получение откровений посредством «ощущений» с использованием «силы» спрашивающего, например гадание на Таро и гадание в покере. \n Вторую категорию возглавляют прорицатели, получающие откровения посредством вычислений и предположений, основанных на информации, предоставленной природой или спрашивающим человеком, например нумерологии и астрологии. \n Третья категория — это поиск ответов от третьей стороны, наиболее распространенным из которых является «Гадание по волшебному зеркалу». Этот метод гадания действительно интересен! Обычно за ответом молятся семи ортодоксальным богам. Что бы произошло, если бы я помолился другим существам? \n \n Примечание: \n Сегодня мистер Гласис сказал, что когда-то здесь жил настоящий Провидец. Этот человек только взглянул на него и понял, что у него проблемы с легкими. Какой принцип стоит за этим? Я очень надеюсь, что мне представится возможность встретиться с этим мистером Моретти.",
    ["{\n\"全体玩家\": \"0\",\n\"技能/buff持有者\": \"1\",\n\"锁定目标\": \"2\"\n}"] = "{\n \"All players\": \"0\", \n \"Skill/buff holder\": \"1\", \n \"Locked target\": \"2\" \n}",
    ["To Beyonder \n There are always things that are higher than others! \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "To Потусторонний \n Всегда есть вещи, которые выше других! \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["... \n I do not know when it started, but the <Mark id=\"#159\"> Hidden Sage </> is suspected to have become active. \n It madly pursues every member of the Moses Ascetic Order, and even every \"Mystery Pryer.\" This phenomenon is known as <Mark id=\"#159\"> \"Knowledge Pursuit.\" </> \n When the tidal wave of knowledge pours in, the recipient must either open their mental defenses and accept Its <Hide id=\"#157\"> transformation, </> or support themselves with willpower. \n The moment the infusion of knowledge breaks through the defense of willpower, it triggers <Hide id=\"#157\"> loss of control. </> \n However, I think Its infusion may not be without its uses."] = "... \n I do not know when it started, but the <Mark id=\"#159\"> Hidden Sage </> is suspected to have become active. \n It madly pursues every member of the Moses Ascetic Order, and even every \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами.\" This phenomenon is known as <Mark id=\"#159\"> \"Knowledge Pursuit.\" </> \n When the tidal wave of knowledge pours in, the recipient must either open their mental defenses and accept Its <Hide id=\"#157\"> transformation, </> or support themselves with willpower. \n The moment the infusion of knowledge breaks through the defense of willpower, it triggers <Hide id=\"#157\"> loss of control. </> \n However, I think Its infusion may not be without its uses.",
    ["People these days will do anything against their conscience for profit. May the Earth Mother bless you with health, {{Sir|Madam}}."] = "People these days will do anything against their conscience for profit. May the Earth Mother bless you with health, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    [" \"Don't mind the 'Poison Expert' thing; I am a very friendly person, as long as I'm not facing those damn guys! My biggest hobby is researching soil, crops, and cross-breeding technology. Believe me, this is the future of humanity.\" \n \"But the people of the Earth Mother Church don't believe it.\" Cattleya introduced Klein in a very subtle way. \n Originally from the Earth Mother Church? Cross-breeding technology is quite good. Only by increasing production can we feed more people, raise the bottom line of poverty... Klein looked at Frank Lee and said calmly, half-politely and half-sincerely: \n \"This is a good thing.\" \n \"...You really are an adventurer who doesn't care about worldly views! Very good, very good! There are too few people like you in this world!\" Frank Lee's blue eyes showed obvious surprise. \"I just tried to cross-breed bulls, cows, and wheat together so that calves could grow like wheat, and I was almost sent to the tribunal by the Mother Church. Merciful Mother, they didn't really understand your will at all!\" \n Cross-breeding bulls, cows, and wheat... You devil... Klein only then realized that the cross-breeding technology he understood was completely different from what the other party was talking about. \n \n —— Volume 3 \"Traveler\", Chapter 156, Poison Expert"] = "\"Don't mind the 'Poison Expert' thing; I am a very friendly person, as long as I'm not facing those damn guys! My biggest hobby is researching soil, crops, and cross-breeding technology. Believe me, this is the future of humanity.\" \n \"But the people of the Earth Mother Church don't believe it.\" Cattleya introduced Klein in a very subtle way. \n Originally from the Earth Mother Church? Cross-breeding technology is quite good. Only by increasing production can we feed more people, raise the bottom line of poverty... Klein looked at Frank Lee and said calmly, half-politely and half-sincerely: \n \"This is a good thing.\" \n \"...You really are an adventurer who doesn't care about worldly views! Very good, very good! There are too few people like you in this world!\" Frank Lee's blue eyes showed obvious surprise. \"I just tried to cross-breed bulls, cows, and wheat together so that calves could grow like wheat, and I was almost sent to the tribunal by the Mother Church. Merciful Mother, they didn't really understand your will at all!\" \n Cross-breeding bulls, cows, and wheat... You devil... Klein only then realized that the cross-breeding technology he understood was completely different from what the other party was talking about. \n \n —— Volume 3 \"Traveler\", Chapter 156, Poison Expert",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions.",
    ["IdGroup(技能)"] = "IdGroup (Skill)",
    ["\"May 26th, I quite enjoy the status of a 'Savant'. Strangely, when I identify as a 'Savant' and do things consistent with it, the whispers that drive me mad have quieted down quite a bit. Is this the <P_Yellow>'Acting'</> that Mr. Zarathul mentioned? This might be the key to solving the hidden dangers of potions.\""] = "«26 мая мне очень нравится статус «Ученого». Как ни странно, когда я идентифицирую себя как «Ученый» и делаю что-то, соответствующее этому, шепот, сводящий меня с ума, немного утих. Это тот <P_Yellow> «Действующий» </>, о котором говорил мистер Заратул? Это может быть ключом к разгадке скрытых опасностей зелий.»",
    ["I knew it, {{sir|madam}}, you look like the kind of person who cares about health, so naturally you would mind those vegetables watered with industrial wastewater."] = "I knew it, {{sir|madam}}, you look like the kind of person who cares about health, so naturally you would mind those vegetables watered with industrial wastewater.",
    ["{{PlayerName}}, you should have noticed that the corruption caused by the Crown of Knowledge is more serious than we expected."] = "{{PlayerName}}, you should have noticed that the Искажение caused by the Crown of Knowledge is more serious than we expected.",
    ["【家族副本】【火龙】毒爪点名"] = "【Family Dungeon】【Fire Dragon】Poison Claw Target",
    ["[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, using self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front and knock enemies into the air."] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, using self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front and knock enemies into the air.",
    ["{\n \"Light Attack\": \"LightHit\", \n \"Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Drag\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stiff Attack\": \"HitStiff\", \n \"Boxing light hit\": \"BoxHitLight\", \n \"Boxing heavy hit\": \"BoxHitHeavy\" \n}"] = "{\n \"Light Attack\": \"LightHit\", \n \"Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Drag\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stiff Attack\": \"HitStiff\", \n \"Boxing light hit\": \"BoxHitLight\", \n \"Boxing heavy hit\": \"BoxHitHeavy\" \n}",
    ["Point A Trigger"] = "Точка триггера",
    ["{\n\"随state结束而打断\": \"0\",\n\"随技能结束而打断\": \"1\",\n\"不打断\": \"2\"\n}"] = "{\n \"Interrupt with state end\": \"0\", \n \"Interrupt with skill end\": \"1\", \n \"Do not interrupt\": \"2\" \n}",
    ["\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" dossier"] = "\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" dossier",
    ["The BOSS deals high damage to the tank; need to rotate the person taking damage!"] = "БОСС наносит высокий урон танку; нужно вращать человека, получающего урон!",
    ["【Death Sect】(3) Entire team +10% Attack Power"] = "【Death Sect】(3) Entire team +10% Attack Power",
    ["· The maximum level for Secret Bonds is 7. Upon reaching the maximum level, excess favorability will be automatically converted into [Memory Caskets] at a 10:1 ratio, which can be exchanged for various appearances at the [Past Exhibition Hall] shop. \n · When Beyonders participate in interactions such as strolling, inviting, or dancing with contacts, they can consume [Memory Invitations] and gain favorability. The first interaction with a contact each day does not consume an invitation ticket; this free attempt is shared among all contacts. \n · After interacting with the same contact in the same way and using an invitation ticket, subsequent interactions of the same type on the same day will not consume invitation tickets, nor will they grant favorability. \n · Strolling: Only available in the open world; it will be automatically canceled upon entering dungeons or other non-open-world scenes. \n · Once the favorability level between a Beyonder and a corresponding contact reaches level 2, you can obtain 2 invitation collection attempts for that contact daily (the number of attempts increases with the favorability level). Consuming these attempts and the corresponding number of [Memory Invitations] allows the Beyonder to directly complete the corresponding quick interaction and obtain the contact's favorability and rewards. \n · Beyonders can also obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Beyonder to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Beyonder performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts."] = "· The maximum level for Secret Bonds is 7. Upon reaching the maximum level, excess favorability will be automatically converted into [Memory Caskets] at a 10:1 ratio, which can be exchanged for various appearances at the [Past Exhibition Hall] shop. \n · When Потустороннийs participate in interactions such as strolling, inviting, or dancing with contacts, they can consume [Memory Invitations] and gain favorability. The first interaction with a contact each day does not consume an invitation ticket; this free attempt is shared among all contacts. \n · After interacting with the same contact in the same way and using an invitation ticket, subsequent interactions of the same type on the same day will not consume invitation tickets, nor will they grant favorability. \n · Strolling: Only available in the open world; it will be automatically canceled upon entering dungeons or other non-open-world scenes. \n · Once the favorability level between a Потусторонний and a corresponding contact reaches level 2, you can obtain 2 invitation collection attempts for that contact daily (the number of attempts increases with the favorability level). Consuming these attempts and the corresponding number of [Memory Invitations] allows the Потусторонний to directly complete the corresponding quick interaction and obtain the contact's favorability and rewards. \n · Потустороннийs can also obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Потусторонний to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Потусторонний performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts.",
    ["self.HasOverHeal is true when the Healing you caused overflows"] = "self.HasOverHeal is true when the Healing you caused overflows",
    ["<img id=\"03\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>Damage: <HighLight>130%</>* attack"] = "<img id=\"03\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>Damage: <HighLight>130%</>* attack",
