    ["Alger asked again:\n \"Do you think Shepherd Elder Lovia might pose a threat to the City of Silver? Just answer yes or no, don't explain.\"\n \"...Yes.\" Derrick ultimately could not deceive himself.\n Alger chuckled and said:\n \"So, you are the only one who knows about this, but you can't find a way to warn the other elders of the Six-Member Council for the time being, right?\"\n \"Yeah.\" Derrick's expression gradually became solemn.\n Alger changed his sitting posture and leaned back: \"The risk of that mission is extremely high. You know this. If you die in that half-destroyed temple, who else can find a way to expose Shepherd Lovia's strangeness? Who else can save the City of Silver from disaster? The 'Fallen Creator' is a true evil god!\"\n \"You aren't pretending to lose control and deceiving others out of selfishness; you are doing it to save the City of Silver!\"\n\n — Volume 5: Red Priest, Chapter 129: \"Old Fox\" Alger"] = "Alger asked again:\n \"Do you think Shepherd Elder Lovia might pose a threat to the City of Silver? Just answer yes or no, don't explain.\"\n \"...Yes.\" Derrick ultimately could not deceive himself.\n Alger chuckled and said:\n \"So, you are the only one who knows about this, but you can't find a way to warn the other elders of the Six-Member Council for the time being, right?\"\n \"Yeah.\" Derrick's expression gradually became solemn.\n Alger changed his sitting posture and leaned back: \"The risk of that mission is extremely high. You know this. If you die in that half-destroyed temple, who else can find a way to expose Shepherd Lovia's strangeness? Who else can save the City of Silver from disaster? The 'Fallen Creator' is a true evil god!\"\n \"You aren't pretending to lose control and deceiving others out of selfishness; you are doing it to save the City of Silver!\"\n\n — Volume 5: Red Priest, Chapter 129: \"Old Fox\" Alger",
    ["True:无视反伤伤害；\nFalse:不无视"] = "Верно: игнорировать отражение урона; \nЛожь: не игнорировать",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演小丑】\n儿童病房里有个小女孩，已经很久没笑过了。她最大的愿望是看一场小丑表演。 "] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Клоун】 \n There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a Клоун performance.",
    ["<h>智慧</>才是越狱的关键！"] = "<h>Wisdom</> is the key to breaking out of prison!",
