    ["{\n\"技能/buff对象目标(持有者/始作俑者)\": \"0\",\n\"关卡/场景为目标\": \"1\",\n\"范围内对象为目标\": \"2\",\n\"目标筛选为目标\": \"3\",\n\"黑板 tarlist\":\"4\"\n}"] = "{\n \"Skill/buff object target (holder/originator)\": \"0\", \n \"Level/scene as target\": \"1\", \n \"Objects in range as target\": \"2\", \n \"Target filter as target\": \"3\", \n \"Blackboard tarlist\": \"4\" \n}",
    ["《Critique of Pure Reason》"] = "《Critique of Pure Reason》",
    ["<Yellow>治愈轻伤</>：佩戴者生命值不满，且高于<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?48%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?46%}</>时，绿华每秒为佩戴者恢复已损失生命值的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?4.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?5.5%}</>（恢复量不低于生命值上限的<Yellow>0.5%</>）。如果佩戴者生命值已满，绿华会转而治疗周围生命值最低的队友，同一单位在1秒内无法多次受到来自他人绿华的治疗。\n绿华的恢复效果受减疗和重伤影响。"] = "<Yellow>Healing Minor Wounds</>: When the wearer's Health is not full and is higher than <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?48%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?46%}</>, Green Bloom restores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?4.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?5.5%}</> of the wearer's lost Health per second (the restoration amount is no less than <Yellow>0.5%</> of the maximum Health). If the wearer's Health is full, Green Bloom will instead heal the nearby teammate with the lowest Health. The same unit cannot receive healing from others' Green Bloom more than once per second. \nThe restoration effect of Green Bloom is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury.",
    ["【成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演战士】\n在金秋湖畔的木屋边，你看见两个粗暴的混混正在找一个女孩的麻烦……"] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Warrior】\n By the wooden house on the shore of Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble...",
    ["　　“啊对，有个前提，你必须牢记，并严格遵守！”\n　　老尼尔放好两根蜡烛，侧过身体，看向克莱恩，非常严肃地说道：\n　　“低序列者本身还不够强大，能进行的几乎所有仪式魔法都是向外在祈求力量，请求帮助，所以，只能考虑女神、风暴之主等正统神灵，绝对，绝对不要试图沟通未知的、难以预料的存在，哪怕有人信奉祂们，哪怕记载的承诺充满诱惑！”\n　　“相信我，不要抱有侥幸的心态，只要尝试过一次，你就会不可避免地滑向深渊，一切的努力，一切的抗争，都只能延缓速度，无法扭转趋势。”\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第五十三章 接地气的仪式魔法"] = "\"Oh right, there is a prerequisite that you must keep in mind and strictly follow!\" \n Old Neil placed the two candles, turned his body to look at Klein, and said very seriously: \n \"Low-Последовательность Потустороннийs are not yet powerful enough, and almost all Ritual Magic that can be performed is to beg for power and request help from the outside. Therefore, you can only consider orthodox gods like the Goddess and the Lord of Storms. Absolutely, absolutely do not try to communicate with unknown, unpredictable existences, even if someone worships them, and even if the recorded promises are full of temptation!\" \n \"Believe me, do not hold a lucky mindset. As long as you try it once, you will inevitably slide into the abyss. All efforts and all struggles can only delay the speed, not reverse the trend.\" \n \n —— Volume 1 \"Клоун\", Chapter 53, Grounded Ritual Magic",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】模板7技能的连击，以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，并挑飞"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, using self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front and knock enemies into the air.",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Transform into Little Elephant Knockdown"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Transform into Little Elephant Knockdown",
    ["A famous diviner in Tingen, a resident mentor at the Club, skilled in various divination methods, 4 sol <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> </> per session."] = "Известный прорицатель в Тингене, постоянный наставник Клуба, владеющий различными методами гадания, 4 соль <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> </> за сеанс.",
    ["[Rogue] Exile - Finish"] = "[Rogue] Exile - Finish",
    ["【Tarot Club · Alienated Hound】Tier 5 increment (+25%) → cumulative 165%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Чужая гончая】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["Necessary material to upgrade a Grade 2 Sealed Artifact to a Grade 1 Sealed Artifact."] = "Necessary material to upgrade a Grade 2 Запечатанный артефакт to a Grade 1 Запечатанный артефакт.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Battlefield Background</>\nA historical projection originating from the ancient battlefields of the Fourth Epoch, which can only be activated during <Highlight>specific periods</>. When not active, the battlefield is under the dominance of the residual power of the Red Emperor Alista Tudor, filled with <Highlight>distortion and slaughter</>. Beyonders within it are all affected by it, craving the baptism of iron and blood, and experiencing <Highlight>the thrill of slaughter</>."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Battlefield Background</>\nA Историческая проекция originating from the ancient battlefields of the Fourth Epoch, which can only be activated during <Highlight>specific periods</>. When not active, the battlefield is under the dominance of the residual power of the Red Emperor Alista Tudor, filled with <Highlight>distortion and slaughter</>. Потустороннийs within it are all affected by it, craving the baptism of iron and blood, and experiencing <Highlight>the thrill of slaughter</>.",
    ["To 非凡者\n    不要相信过去，\n          不要畏惧未来。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Потусторонний\n Не доверяй прошлому,\n не бойся будущего. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个感觉是……我消化了部分魔药？为什么……因为我成功扮演了一次占卜家？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Это чувство... переварил ли я часть зелья? Почему... потому что однажды я успешно действовал как Провидец?)</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>封印物·知识皇冠</>\n\n<P_Yellow>等级</>\n0级\n<P_Yellow>途径</>\n窥秘人\n<P_Yellow>来源</>\n罗塞尔大帝在白枫宫被刺杀后，体内未排除的知识皇帝特性与其皇冠结合形成的遗物，蕴含▇▇母神的污染。 \n\n<P_Yellow>正面效果</>\n知识具象化，可将实物瓦解为知识洪流。\n通晓大部分知识，并直接解读隐秘信息（包括神灵的隐秘）。\n理解超越序列的宇宙真理与神秘本质。\n能对低位格者下达精神控制与认知重塑的指令。 \n\n<P_Yellow>负面效果</>\n皇冠会持续灌输无法承受的海量真理与禁忌知识，解读知识会随机失去一部分理智或人格。\n摘下皇冠会触发知识洪流反噬，导致持有者灵魂被瞬间冲散，成为无知无识的空壳。\n\n<P_Yellow>封印物·绝望魔镜</>\n\n<P_Yellow>等级</>\n不明，未定级\n<P_Yellow>途径</>\n刺客\n<P_Yellow>来源</>\n绝望魔女赫尔嘉晋升序列3时失败而失控，为避免其彻底化为怪物，子爵夫人亲手终结其生命，其遗留的非凡特性与一枚镜子结合并异化。赫尔嘉生前与子爵夫人相识，二人情谊深厚。其死后残存意志与特性结合，形成此封印物。\n\n<P_Yellow>正面效果</>\n可构建独立的镜中空间。\n具备意识封印能力，可将强大的精神体或神性意志分割封印。\n\n<P_Yellow>负面效果</>\n具有强烈的自毁意识与厌世倾向，会诱导周边生物摧毁魔镜，镜面破碎会爆发强烈的灵性反噬。\n无差别地吸收周围生命的希望与情感，将其转化为维持镜中世界的养分，范围内的生物会逐渐感到空虚、麻木，最终主动走向自我毁灭。"] = "<P_Yellow>Запечатанный артефакт · Knowledge Crown</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nLevel 0\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nПодглядывающий за Тайнами\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nA relic formed after Emperor Roselle was assassinated at White Maple Palace, combining the unexpelled Knowledge Emperor characteristic within his body with his crown. It contains the Искажение of the ▇▇ Mother Goddess. \n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nMaterializes knowledge, capable of disintegrating physical objects into a Torrent of Knowledge.\nGrants knowledge of most subjects and allows for the direct interpretation of hidden information (including the secrets of deities).\nProvides understanding of cosmic truths and mystical essences that transcend Последовательностьs.\nCan issue commands for Mind Control and cognitive restructuring to those of a lower Последовательность. \n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nThe crown continuously instills an unbearable amount of truth and Forbidden Knowledge; interpreting this knowledge results in a random loss of Рассудок or personality.\nRemoving the crown triggers a backlash of the Torrent of Knowledge, instantly shattering the holder's soul and leaving them an ignorant, empty shell.\n\n<P_Yellow>Запечатанный артефакт · Magic Mirror of Despair</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nUnknown, Unrated\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nAssassin\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nFormed when the Despair Witch Helga failed her advancement to Последовательность 3 and lost control. To prevent her from fully transforming into a monster, the Viscountess ended her life personally. The remaining Потусторонний characteristic combined with a mirror and mutated. Helga and the Viscountess were close friends during Helga's lifetime. Her residual will combined with the characteristic to form this Запечатанный артефакт.\n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nCapable of constructing an independent mirror world.\nPossesses consciousness-sealing abilities, capable of segmenting and sealing powerful spirits or divine wills.\n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nPossesses a strong self-destructive consciousness and misanthropic tendencies; it will induce nearby creatures to destroy the magic mirror. If the mirror surface shatters, it triggers a violent spiritual backlash.\nIndiscriminately absorbs the hope and emotions of surrounding life forms, converting them into nutrients to sustain the mirror world. Creatures within range will gradually feel empty and numb, eventually walking toward self-destruction.",
    ["{\"法术场ID%i\"}"] = "{\"Spell Field ID%i\"}",
    ["Attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><天灾化身></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Critical Hit increased.\""] = "Атакуйте <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с аффиксом <Highlight><Avatar of Disaster></>: «Все уровни навыков +1, критический удар увеличен».",
    ["When true: Returns true even when the charges of a chargeable skill are reduced to 0."] = "When true: Returns true even when the charges of a chargeable skill are reduced to 0.",
    ["　　你睁开眼睛，看见熟悉的廷根湖——一切起始之地。\n　　可你清楚地记得，<M_Red>自己已经失去了最后一点理智。记忆在疯狂中碎裂，意识被黑暗吞没，某种冰冷的力量甚至开始抹去你身为“人”的痕迹。</>\n　　在坠入疯狂深渊的最后，你看见了无边无际的灰雾。而那灰雾穿过冥界，来到永暗之河前，将你从永眠的尽头拉回。\n\n　　你目前的理智值为<M_Orange>30</>，理智值上限暂时降至<M_Orange>70</>。精神上的裂痕无法自行消失，但<M_Orange>其他非凡者施予的安魂</>能够帮助你恢复理智值上限。\n　　在接下来的<M_Orange>一个月</>里，那道来自灰雾的力量仍会跟随着你，守护着你的清醒，使你的理智值不会降至<M_Orange>1</>以下。\n\n　　<M_Link>这是一场由愚者亲手赋予的奇迹。</>\n　　　<M_Link>赞美愚者！</>"] = "You open your eyes and see the familiar Тинген Lake—the place where everything began. \n　　But you clearly remember <M_Red> that you had already lost your last bit of Рассудок. Memories shattered in Безумие, consciousness was swallowed by darkness, and a certain cold power even began to erase the traces of you being \"human.\" </>\n　　At the very end of falling into the abyss of Безумие, you saw the boundless gray fog. And that gray fog passed through the Underworld, arrived before the River of Eternal Darkness, and pulled you back from the end of eternal sleep. \n\n　　Your current Рассудок value is <M_Orange>30</>, and your maximum Рассудок value has temporarily dropped to <M_Orange>70</>. The cracks in your spirit cannot disappear on their own, but <M_Orange>the Soul Soothing bestowed by other Потустороннийs</> can help you restore your maximum Рассудок value. \n　　In the next <M_Orange>month</>, that power from the gray fog will still follow you, guarding your clarity and ensuring your Рассудок value will not drop below <M_Orange>1</>. \n\n　　<M_Link>This is a miracle personally bestowed by Шут. </>\n　　　<M_Link>Praise Шут! </>",
    ["【塔罗会·西尔维娅】+60生命"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】+60 здоровья",
    ["<Yellow>满月</>：强化自身以及队友的战斗技能，使其等级<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>，可叠加生效；\n<Yellow>召唤之门</>：强化秘偶，使秘偶技能的伤害和治疗效果提高<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>。当秘偶技能处于冷却中时，对目标施放普攻攻击和战斗技能，有概率强制召出秘偶，施放一次秘偶技能。秘偶技能的单次冷却周期内，强制召出效果最多触发<Yellow>1</>次。"] = "<Yellow>Full Moon</>: Strengthens your own and your teammates' Боевой навыкs, increasing their level by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>, which can stack; \n<Yellow>Gate of Summoning</>: Strengthens the Марионетка, increasing the damage and healing effects of Марионетка Skills by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>. When a Марионетка Skill is on Перезарядка, using Базовая атакаs and Боевой навыкs on a target has a chance to force the Марионетка to be summoned, casting one Марионетка Skill. Within a single Перезарядка cycle of a Марионетка Skill, the forced summon effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time.",
    ["<Yellow>Transfer Damage</>: If you take damage exceeding <Yellow>30%</> of your maximum Health within a short period, you gain the Frame ability for <Yellow>5 seconds</>. After casting Frame on a selected hostile target, <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=1?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=3?90%}</> of the direct damage you take over the next <Yellow>8 seconds</> will be transferred to that target. The total transferred damage cannot exceed <Yellow>2</> times your maximum Health and will be invalidated if the target is too far away. The Frame ability can be obtained at most once every <Yellow>30 seconds</>. \n<Yellow>Danger Intuition</>: When about to be controlled, you have a <Yellow>100%</> base probability to evade the control effect. If this is triggered <Yellow>3 times</> within a short period (3 seconds), it will enter a <Yellow>10-second</> Cooldown."] = "<Yellow>Transfer Damage</>: If you take damage exceeding <Yellow>30%</> of your maximum Health within a short period, you gain the Frame ability for <Yellow>5 seconds</>. After casting Frame on a selected hostile target, <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=1?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=3?90%}</> of the direct damage you take over the next <Yellow>8 seconds</> will be transferred to that target. The total transferred damage cannot exceed <Yellow>2</> times your maximum Health and will be invalidated if the target is too far away. The Frame ability can be obtained at most once every <Yellow>30 seconds</>. \n<Yellow>Danger Intuition</>: When about to be controlled, you have a <Yellow>100%</> base probability to evade the control effect. If this is triggered <Yellow>3 times</> within a short period (3 seconds), it will enter a <Yellow>10-second</> Перезарядка.",
    ["LuaList(IdGroup(Skill))"] = "LuaList(IdGroup(Skill))",
    ["【困难难度】已出现，你可以反复向噩梦中的敌人发起挑战！这一次，“头狼”鲁珀彻底疯狂，向你亮出了獠牙。"] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your Кошмарs! This time, \"Alpha Wolf\" Luper has gone completely mad and bared his fangs at you.",
    ["\"My head is about to explode... Ritual Magic, occult knowledge...\""] = "«Моя голова вот-вот взорвется... Ритуальная магия, оккультные знания...»",
    ["<P_Yellow>Divination</>... Is she an occult enthusiast?"] = "<P_Yellow>Гадание</>... Она энтузиаст оккультизма?",
    ["[Roguelike] Trick Performance - Spell Proxy"] = "[Roguelike] Trick Performance - Spell Proxy",
    ["【增强】暴击后有额外<HighLight>50%</>暴击伤害，持续<HighLight>3</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] Critical hits deal an additional <HighLight>50%</> Critical Damage for <HighLight>3</> seconds.",
    ["“赛琳娜伍德偶然间 巧合地从她的神秘学老师海纳斯处看到了魔镜占卜的真正咒文……”"] = "\"Selina Wood accidentally and coincidentally saw the true incantation for mirror Гадание from her occult teacher, Haines……\"",
    ["...Something happened so soon? You should indeed become a Beyonder so that you can deal with those strange and eerie events more calmly."] = "...Something happened so soon? You should indeed become a Потусторонний so that you can deal with those strange and eerie events more calmly.",
    ["<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Beyonder soul the wearer imprisons, their own Max HP is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: When the wearer devours a monster soul and gains Soul Suppression, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Потусторонний soul the wearer imprisons, their own Max HP is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: When the wearer devours a monster soul and gains Soul Suppression, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<P_Heart> (hands it over) </> Is this the travel charm you lost?"] = "<P_Heart> (передает его) </> Это талисман путешествия, который ты потерял?",
    ["……This reminds me of that line from Roselle's diary, where the Emperor said: “Seers” always say half and hide half, never explaining things clearly?"] = "……This reminds me of that line from Roselle's diary, where the Emperor said: “Провидецs” always say half and hide half, never explaining things clearly?",
    ["[Projection - Seer] Air Bullet"] = "[Projection - Провидец] Воздушная пуля",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演祈光人】\n一座老宅夜夜传出异响，它的继承人站在门外，始终不敢推门。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Beyonder Talent System </> \n 1. Each Beyonder has two different Beyonder talent directions, each containing <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> and <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </>. \n 2. Use <Highlight> Talent Points </> to upgrade talent nodes; <Highlight> Talent Points </> are obtained through <Highlight> Sequence advancement </>. \n 3. Upgrading <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> grants stronger power. After upgrading certain <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </>, you can unlock <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </>. \n 4. <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </> usually contain special Beyonder abilities; upgrading them will strengthen or change certain abilities of your own. \n 5. <Highlight> Talent Points </> can be used to add points to both Beyonder talent directions simultaneously, allowing a Beyonder to strengthen different <Highlight> Talent Nodes </> in both directions at the same time. However, only one direction can be activated at a time to take effect. \n 6. The upgrade of some <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> is restricted by the <Highlight> Sequence level </>. However, Beyonders can reset any talent node at any time to experience different strengthening effects."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Система талантов Потусторонний </> \n 1. Каждый Потусторонний имеет два разных направления талантов Потусторонний, каждое из которых содержит базовые узлы талантов <Highlight> </> и специальные узлы талантов <Highlight> </>. \n 2. Используйте очки талантов <Highlight> </> для улучшения узлов талантов; Очки талантов <Highlight> </> получаются посредством продвижения последовательности <Highlight> </>. \n 3. Обновление базовых узлов талантов <Highlight>. </> дает более высокую мощность. После обновления некоторых базовых узлов талантов <Highlight> </> вы можете разблокировать специальные узлы талантов <Highlight> </>. \n 4. Узлы особых талантов <Highlight> </> обычно содержат особые способности Потусторонний; их улучшение усилит или изменит ваши собственные способности. \n 5. Очки талантов <Highlight> </> можно использовать для добавления очков в оба направления талантов Потусторонний одновременно, позволяя Потусторонний усиливать различные узлы талантов <Highlight> </> в обоих направлениях одновременно. Однако одновременно можно активировать только одно направление, чтобы оно вступило в силу. \n 6. Обновление некоторых базовых узлов талантов <Highlight> </> ограничено уровнем последовательности <Highlight> </>. Однако Потустороннийs может в любой момент сбросить любой узел талантов, чтобы испытать различные эффекты усиления.",
    ["\"We are a group of poor souls constantly fighting against danger and madness, and we are also the Guardians of Tingen.\""] = "«Мы — группа бедных душ, постоянно борющихся с опасностью и безумием, а также мы — Стражи Тингена».",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with {荒芜主母} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with {Matriarch of Depravity} entry",
    ["\"Seer\" potion materials"] = "Материалы для зелья «Провидец»",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nFool's Gambit is a team competition gameplay where up to 8 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. After entering the Fool's Gambit gameplay, all Beyonders <Highlight>choose chess pieces to fight</> and increase their strength by <Highlight>collecting bonds and upgrading the star level of the chess pieces</>, eventually defeating all opponents. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning conditions </>\nAfter entering the gameplay, eliminated Beyonders can remain on the field to <Highlight>spectate</> other Beyonders. Beyonders need to use chess piece battles to defeat the chess piece lineups of all other Beyonders to win the match. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Team formation rules </>\nWhen forming a team with multiple people, matchmaking will begin according to the level of the <Highlight>highest-ranked Beyonder in the team</>. If the number of people in the team is 6 or more, Beyonders cannot obtain victory points."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nFool's Gambit is a team competition gameplay where up to 8 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. After entering Шут's Gambit gameplay, all Потустороннийs <Highlight>choose chess pieces to fight</> and increase their strength by <Highlight>collecting bonds and upgrading the star level of the chess pieces</>, eventually defeating all opponents. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning conditions </>\nAfter entering the gameplay, eliminated Потустороннийs can remain on the field to <Highlight>spectate</> other Потустороннийs. Потустороннийs need to use chess piece battles to defeat the chess piece lineups of all other Потустороннийs to win the match. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Team formation rules </>\nWhen forming a team with multiple people, matchmaking will begin according to the level of the <Highlight>highest-ranked Потусторонний in the team</>. If the number of people in the team is 6 or more, Потустороннийs cannot obtain victory points.",
    ["trigger1号"] = "Trigger No. 1",
    ["[Right Stick Mode 7] Attacks enemies within a circular range in front. Note that the target filtering offset and radius parameters are related to the Right Stick Mode warning parameters."] = "[Right Stick Mode 7] Attacks enemies within a circular range in front. Note that the target filtering offset and radius parameters are related to the Right Stick Mode warning parameters.",
    ["{{player.name}}从FowChart触发了事件，啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊"] = "{{player.name}} triggered an event from FowChart, ahhhhhhhhhhhhh",
    ["Triggered when Boss Berserk timer ends"] = "Срабатывает, когда заканчивается таймер Берсерка Босса.",
    ["……喂，你借封印物的时候，尽量对他们好点……不要淋到雨。"] = "…Hey, when you borrow a Запечатанный артефакт, try to be nice to them… don't let them get rained on.",
    ["Buff增加"] = "Добавлен бафф",
    ["【Tarot Club · Archer Knight】Tier 3 increment (+15%) → cumulative 114%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["\"Testimony.\" When you construct a complete logical chain, you must use firm will and spirituality to \"present\" your deduction."] = "«Свидетельство». Когда вы строите полную логическую цепочку, вы должны использовать твердую волю и духовность, чтобы «представить» свой вывод.",
    ["ring2 correction incoming trigger"] = "ring2 correction incoming trigger",
    ["\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress %s %%"] = "\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress %s %%",
    ["<Yellow>黑面草之地</>：使携带者进入濒临诅咒状态，持续5分钟后，转化为<Yellow>背负诅咒</>状态。该状态下死亡时，会在原地长出一片半径8米的活化土地，持续10秒，对范围内的最多10名友方玩家施加下述效果：\n每秒恢复携带者生命值上限<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</>的生命值，优先选择剩余生命值较低的友方，超过5人则治疗量衰减；\n获得攻击提升效果，提升值为携带者攻击的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</>，最多对10人生效；\n免除<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</>人次控制效果。\n效果触发后，或者切换场景时，濒临诅咒重新开始生效。"] = "<Yellow>Land of Black-Faced Grass</>: Causes the carrier to enter a near-cursed state, which transforms into the <Yellow>Bearing the Curse</> state after 5 minutes. When dying in this state, an activated land with a radius of 8 meters will grow on the spot, lasting 10 seconds, applying the following effects to up to 10 friendly players in the range: \nRestores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</> of the carrier's maximum Health per second, prioritizing friendly units with lower remaining Health; if there are more than 5 people, the healing amount is reduced; \nGains an Attack Boost effect, with the increase value being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</> of the carrier's Attack, effective for up to 10 people; \nExempts <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</> instances of control effects. \nAfter the effect is triggered, or when switching scenes, the near-cursed state begins to take effect again.",
    ["[Proof] Damage from detonating shadow energy increased by 20%."] = "[Proof] Damage from detonating shadow energy increased by 20%.",
    ["【占卜家】(6) +25%攻击力"] = "【Провидец】(6) +25% Attack Power",
    ["BOSS4-品质-左攻击"] = "BOSS4-Качество-Левая атака",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <Hypnotist> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Hypnotist> trait",
    ["……<P_Heart>（沉默了许久）</>因为我要为我的朋友复仇，所以选择了离开这里，去成长，去变强。"] = "……<P_Heart>(Silent for a long time)</>Because I want to take revenge for my friend, so I chose to leave here, to grow, to become stronger.",
    ["The effect of [Paradox of Luck]: When spirituality is full, it can block the Viscountess's critical hit."] = "The effect of [Paradox of Luck]: When Духовность is full, it can block the Viscountess's critical hit.",
    ["【五月庄园副本】先祖铠甲-奶可被治疗标记"] = "【May Manor Dungeon】Ancestor Armor - Healable mark",
    ["buffdisc(*id), lasts for *f seconds, simultaneously gaining 1 point of <HighLight>Card Energy</> and one <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Card</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Fate Yellow Card</>/<FaintYellow>Spirituality Blue Card</>: When 3 <HighLight>Fate Yellow Cards</>/<HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</> are obtained, consume all cards to cause the <HighLight>Finisher Skill Shuffle Cards</> to switch to <HighLight>Fooling of Fate</>/<HighLight>Spirituality Burst</>. \n<FaintYellow>Card Energy</>: Can hold up to 5 points; when reaching 5 points, the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> switches and locks to <HighLight>Shuffle Cards</>."] = "buffdisc(*id), длится *f секунд, одновременно получая 1 очко <HighLight>Card Energy</> и одну <HighLight>Духовность Blue Card</>. \n\nЖелтая карта <FaintYellow>Fate</>/<FaintYellow>Синяя карта духовности</>: когда получены 3 <HighLight>Желтые карты Fate</>/<HighLight>Синие карты духовности</>, израсходуйте все карты, чтобы <HighLight>Finisher Skill Shuffle Cards</> переключился на <HighLight>Обман Судьба</>/<HighLight>Всплеск духовности</>. \n<FaintYellow>Card Energy</>: вмещает до 5 баллов; при достижении 5 очков <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> переключается и фиксируется на <HighLight>Shuffle Cards</>.",
    ["boss特殊机制全无敌"] = "Специальный механизм босса, полная непобедимость",
    ["【成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演窥秘人】\n东区老街上有一间小屋，主人去世三个月了。邻居说每晚都能听见屋里有人翻东西的声音。"] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Провидец】\n There is a small house on the old street in the East District. The owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.",
    ["BOSS Mark Buff"] = "БОСС Марк Бафф",
    ["“我说过一万遍了，魔药的关键不是掌握和挖掘，而是消化和扮演。”"] = "«Я говорил это десять тысяч раз: ключ к зелью — не мастерство и раскопки, а пищеварение и действие».",
    ["[Enhanced] When Health is below <HighLight>40%</>, gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>35%</> Max Health for <HighLight>5</> seconds."] = "[Enhanced] When Health is below <HighLight>40%</>, gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>35%</> Max Health for <HighLight>5</> seconds.",
    ["<P_Yellow>占卜家</>俱乐部……"] = "Клуб <P_Yellow>Провидец</>...",
    ["Tab轮选测试配置-距离优先（退化2）-奶妈"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет расстояния (ухудшенный 2) — Целитель",
    ["【Unlocked after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as an Apprentice】\n In an old apartment, the locksmith master's child locked himself in the room, and even the master himself couldn't open it."] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as an Apprentice】\n In an old apartment, the locksmith master's child locked himself in the room, and even the master himself couldn't open it.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Pauses) </> I can teach you what a good diviner is. Follow me."] = "<P_Heart> (Пауза) </> Я могу научить тебя тому, что такое хороший прорицатель. Подписывайтесь на меня.",
    ["The Hidden Sage was initially just an impersonal deity. \n Compared to a god, It was closer to a concept, a natural law. \n The Moses Ascetic Order, which believes in It, possesses the potions and advancement methods of the \"Hermit\" pathway. Its members adhere to morality and precepts, persist in the pursuit of knowledge, and strictly maintain secrecy. After becoming a \"Mystery Pryer,\" initiates must remain silent for five years, learning to be quiet in order to cultivate and improve focus, or even to resist loss of control. \n A maxim circulates within the order—Do what you will, but do no harm—which is also believed in and practiced by many \"Mystery Pryers\"... Her Highness Bernadette seems to appreciate this maxim as well."] = "The Hidden Sage was initially just an impersonal deity. \n Compared to a god, It was closer to a concept, a natural law. \n The Moses Ascetic Order, which believes in It, possesses the potions and advancement methods of the \"Hermit\" pathway. Its members adhere to morality and precepts, persist in the pursuit of knowledge, and strictly maintain secrecy. After becoming a \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами,\" initiates must remain silent for five years, learning to be quiet in order to cultivate and improve focus, or even to resist loss of control. \n A maxim circulates within the order—Do what you will, but do no harm—which is also believed in and practiced by many \"Подглядывающий за Тайнамиs\"... Her Highness Bernadette seems to appreciate this maxim as well.",
    ["{{PlayerName}}! Thank the Goddess for letting you appear. The imitators of the Bloody Butcher have controlled Bonaparte. The tasting party is a trap, and there are at least two Sequence 8 Beyonders inside."] = "{{PlayerName}}! Thank the Goddess for letting you appear. The imitators of the Bloody Butcher have controlled Bonaparte. The tasting party is a trap, and there are at least two Последовательность 8 Потустороннийs inside.",
    ["The power grafted for you by Mr. Fool also includes some commonly used Beyonder abilities."] = "Сила, переданная вам Мистером Дураком, также включает в себя некоторые часто используемые способности Потустороннего.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>积分说明</>\n在<Highlight>战略服筛选阶段</>的联赛前两轮，将启用战略服筛选积分规则。战略服筛选积分与用于判定当前比赛胜负的<Highlight>局内积分相互独立</>。局内积分用于决定当前比赛的胜负与名次；战略服筛选积分根据每场比赛名次及每轮最终排名累计，用于决定俱乐部的战略服筛选排名与晋级资格。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>单场名次积分</>\n每场比赛结束后，根据俱乐部在该场比赛中的最终名次获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：30分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：15分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：10分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：5分</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>第一轮最终排名积分</>\n第一轮全部比赛结束后，根据俱乐部最终排名额外获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：60分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：50分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：45分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：40分</>\n<Highlight>第5至第8名：10分</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>第二轮最终排名积分</>\n第二轮全部比赛结束后，根据俱乐部最终排名额外获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：200分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：100分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：70分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：50分</>\n<Highlight>第5至第8名：15分</>\n战略服筛选阶段的联赛前两轮结束后，将根据各俱乐部累计获得的<Highlight>战略服筛选总积分</>进行排名。本赛区战略服筛选总积分<Highlight>前4名</>的俱乐部将晋级<Highlight>四方联赛天启组</>，并获得<Highlight>参与战略服</>的资格。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>同分排序规则</>\n战略服筛选排名优先按照<Highlight>战略服筛选总积分</>由高到低排列。总积分相同时：第一轮或第二轮联赛结束后，按照俱乐部在本轮的<Highlight>最终排名</>排序，排名靠前者优先；四方联赛每轮第一场比赛结束后，本轮尚未产生最终排名，同分俱乐部暂不区分排名先后，当前展示顺序不代表本轮最终排名。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Points Explanation</>\nDuring the first two rounds of the league in the <Highlight>Strategic Server Screening Phase</>, the Strategic Server Screening points rules will be enabled. Strategic Server Screening points are independent of the <Highlight>In-match Points</> used to determine the outcome of the current match. In-match Points are used to determine the victory and ranking of the current match; Strategic Server Screening points are accumulated based on the ranking of each match and the final ranking of each round, and are used to determine the club's Strategic Server Screening ranking and qualification for advancement.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Single Match Ranking Points</>\nAfter each match, Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking in that match:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 30 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 15 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 10 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 5 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>First Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the first round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 60 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 45 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 40 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 10 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Second Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the second round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 200 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 100 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 70 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 15 points</>\nAfter the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server Screening phase are completed, rankings will be based on the <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</> accumulated by each club. The top <Highlight>4 clubs</> in total Strategic Server Screening points for this division will advance to the <Highlight>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> and gain the qualification to <Highlight>participate in the Strategic Server</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Tie-breaking Rules</>\nThe Strategic Server Screening ranking is primarily ordered from high to low based on <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</>. When total points are tied: After the first or second round of the league, clubs are ranked according to their <Highlight>Final Ranking</> in that round, with higher rankings taking precedence; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, if a final ranking for the round has not yet been determined, tied clubs will not be distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking for the round.\n",
    ["[Tarot Club Atmosphere] Pulse of Life"] = "[Клуб Таро Atmosphere] Pulse of Life",
    ["[Insight] The Imperial Flag stacks 1 layer of Distortion effect on targets within range every 4 seconds (Distortion: reduces Control resistance), up to 3 layers."] = "[Insight] The Imperial Flag stacks 1 layer of Distortion effect on targets within range every 4 seconds (Distortion: reduces Control resistance), up to 3 layers.",
    ["An exquisite wallet gifted by Miss Justice, capable of bringing subconscious and spiritual protection, resisting some Beyonder damage. But the negative effect is... generating a strong urge to spend money!"] = "An exquisite wallet gifted by Miss Justice, capable of bringing subconscious and spiritual protection, resisting some Потусторонний damage. But the negative effect is... generating a strong urge to spend money!",
    ["GTA堕落神父霸体"] = "GTA Fallen Priest Суперброня",
    ["GTA-通用回血药品回血30%"] = "GTA - Universal Healing Item Heal 30%",
    ["“堕落的终极，悖逆的君王，统御一切失序的最终敕令。 ”欢迎加入【黑皇帝】势力！诸君，该开启战争了！"] = "«Высшая степень разврата, мятежный монарх, последний указ, управляющий любым беспорядком». Добро пожаловать во фракцию [Черного Императора]! Господа, пора начинать войну!",
    ["Buff control status list"] = "Список статусов контроля баффов",
    ["true仅监听暴击伤害"] = "true: Only listen for critical damage",
    ["　　代号3-888，罗塞尔大帝时期命名为“莫比乌斯环”，又称“无尽的迷途”。\n\n　　……长方形金箔纸，一端扭转180度后，与另一端相接，形成只有一个平面的环形…… \n……起点即是终点。\n\n由一位“通识者”途径序列6的机械专家制作而成……\n……在一场仪式中因失误而沟通邪神，进一步失控变为怪物……\n……封印物3-888被其死后的血污染，特性改变。\n\n\n原本由塔罗学派接管，近期在执行任务过程中<Mark id=\"#159\">失踪</>。"] = "Codename 3-888, named \"Mobius Strip\" during the era of Emperor Roselle, also known as the \"Endless Lost Path.\" \n \n ... A rectangular piece of gold foil, with one end twisted 180 degrees and then connected to the other end, forming a ring with only one plane... \n ... The starting point is the end point. \n \n Created by a Последовательность 6 mechanical expert of the \"Savant\" pathway... \n ... Due to a mistake during a ritual, he communicated with an evil god, further losing control and turning into a monster... \n ... Запечатанный артефакт 3-888 was contaminated by his blood after death, and its characteristics changed. \n \n \n Originally taken over by the Клуб Таро, it went missing recently while executing a mission <Mark id=\"#159\"> </>.",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：所有灵性力量的母亲……</>"] = "<P_Red> «Профессор»: Мать всех духовных сил… </>",
    ["【暗影斗篷】+5%伤害减免"] = "【Shadow Cloak】+5% Снижение урона",
    ["Buff表里的BuffType列，该参数填写后，会免疫所有该BuffType的buff。"] = "BuffType column in the Buff table. After filling in this parameter, it will be immune to all buffs of this BuffType.",
    ["【Unlocked after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Bard】\n On the street corner bench, the young man's shoulders trembled slightly. He had a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he couldn't bring himself to reach out."] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Bard】\n On the street corner bench, the young man's shoulders trembled slightly. He had a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he couldn't bring himself to reach out.",
    ["Tab Selection Test Configuration - Distance Priority (Degraded 2) - Healer"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет расстояния (ухудшенный 2) — Целитель",
    ["【20】Initiate Conversation"] = "【20】Initiate Conversation",
    ["……The damage caused by the war has yet to subside."] = "……The damage caused by the war has yet to subside.",
    ["【占卜家】(4) 距离越远伤害越高，最高追加30%攻击力的距离增伤。"] = "【Провидец】(4) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 30% Attack Power distance damage bonus.",
    ["BOSS4-品质-需攻击"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — требует атаки",
    ["　　隐匿贤者最初只是一名非人格化的神灵。 \n　　相比起神灵，祂更接近于一种理念，一种自然法则。\n　　信仰祂的摩斯苦修会掌握着“隐者”途径的魔药与晋升方式，成员坚持着道德和戒律，坚持着对知识的追求，并严格守秘。入会者在成为“窥秘人”后，都要禁语五年，学会静默，以便修行和提高专注，甚至是对抗失控。\n　　会内流传着一句格言——为所欲为，但勿伤害——这也为许多“窥秘人”所信奉并践行……贝尔纳黛殿下似乎也很欣赏这句格言。"] = "The Hidden Sage was initially just an impersonal deity. \n Compared to a god, It was closer to a concept, a natural law. \n The Moses Ascetic Order, which believes in It, possesses the potions and advancement methods of the \"Hermit\" pathway. Its members adhere to morality and precepts, persist in the pursuit of knowledge, and strictly maintain secrecy. After becoming a \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами,\" initiates must remain silent for five years, learning to be quiet in order to cultivate and improve focus, or even to resist loss of control. \n A maxim circulates within the order—Do what you will, but do no harm—which is also believed in and practiced by many \"Подглядывающий за Тайнамиs\"... Her Highness Bernadette seems to appreciate this maxim as well.",
    ["<P_Heart>（非凡世界对普通人来说，太危险了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Необыкновенный мир слишком опасен для обычных людей.)</>",
    ["[Enhanced] Deals <HighLight>15%</> increased damage to targets with higher than <HighLight>50%</> Health."] = "[Enhanced] Deals <HighLight>15%</> increased damage to targets with higher than <HighLight>50%</> Health.",
    ["<Red>脆弱</>：庇护效果结束时，纸人所承受溢出伤害的15%会重新作用到主人身上，并使主人在接下来的15秒内，减伤降低15%。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Fragile</>: When the protection effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage absorbed by the Бумажный человечек is reapplied to the master, and the master's Снижение урона is lowered by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["After opening, you can choose to receive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with one of the following affixes: <Highlight><荒芜主母></>, <Highlight><隐秘之仆></>, <Highlight><混乱行者></>, or <Highlight><沉默门徒></>."] = "После открытия вы можете получить <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с одним из следующих аффиксов: <Highlight><Matriarch of Desolation></>, <Highlight><Servant of Concealment></>, <Highlight><Chaos Walker></> или <Highlight><Silent Disciple></>.",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演巫师】\n午夜时分，居然还有营业的书店？"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?",
    ["Letter from Miss Magician"] = "Letter from Miss Фокусник",
    ["\"The initial choice was still too rash. Now it seems that whether it's an Apprentice, a Seer, or a Marauder, they would all be better.\""] = "«Первоначальный выбор все еще был слишком опрометчивым. Теперь кажется, что будь то Ученик, Провидец или Мародёр, все они будут лучше.»",
    ["　　Searching for my younger brother—William Hopkins, 36 years old, brown curly hair, medium build, approximately 1.75 meters tall. When he went missing, he was wearing a black trench coat, a white shirt, dark trousers, and brown leather shoes. He was last seen near <Letter_Highlight>Golden Autumn Lake Farm</> around dusk three days ago.\n　　After his wife passed away, he was deeply devastated, mentally dazed, often talking to himself, and unwilling to communicate with others. He is not aggressive, but his condition is extremely poor, and it is very dangerous for him to be out alone.\n　　If you have any clues, please inform the Gray Pigeon Hotel. A generous reward will be offered."] = "Ищу своего младшего брата — Уильяма Хопкинса, 36 лет, каштановые вьющиеся волосы, среднего телосложения, рост примерно 1,75 метра. Когда он пропал, на нем был черный плащ, белая рубашка, темные брюки и коричневые кожаные туфли. В последний раз его видели около <Letter_Highlight>Golden Autumn Lake Farm</> около сумерек три дня назад.\n　　После смерти жены он был глубоко опустошен, психически ошеломлен, часто разговаривал сам с собой и не хотел общаться с другими. Он не агрессивен, но его состояние крайне плохое, и оставаться одному ему очень опасно.\n　　Если у вас есть какие-либо подсказки, пожалуйста, сообщите об этом в отель Grey Pigeon. Будет предложено щедрое вознаграждение.",
    ["<h>准备仪式</>前往灰雾之上"] = "<h>Prepare the ritual</> to head above the gray fog.",
    ["……Must……break free……otherwise……I will die……"] = "……Must……break free……otherwise……I will die……",
    ["LuaList(Id(Monster Armor Break))."] = "LuaList(Id(Monster Armor Break)).",
    ["Harper said barley is easier to grow than rice and gave me a bottle of growth-promoting potion. It makes sense; making a paddy field underground is a bit troublesome... \n \n \n The planting and cultivation record needs to be changed: \n \"Research on the Promotion of Crop Seed Germination and Seedling Growth by 'Life's Word' Beyonder Potion: A Case Study of a Barley Field That Refuses to Sprout\""] = "Харпер сказал, что ячмень выращивать легче, чем рис, и дал мне бутылку зелья, стимулирующего рост. Это имеет смысл; создать рисовое поле под землей немного хлопотно... \n \n \n Необходимо изменить записи о посадке и выращивании: \n \"Исследование по стимуляции прорастания семян сельскохозяйственных культур и роста рассады с помощью зелья Потусторонний \"Слово жизни\": пример ячменного поля, которое отказывается прорастать\"",
    ["……我必须确认，湖灵会造成什么危害？它是否损伤过你们的身体或精神？"] = "...I must confirm, what harm does the Lake Spirit cause? Has it damaged your body or mind?",
    ["ASASkillAsset listens for whether the \"Covered\" buff is triggered"] = "ASASkillAsset отслеживает, срабатывает ли бафф «Покрытие».",
    ["Today I found an old book in those ruins! \n The book mentions a magic to bring the dead back to life, saying it requires praying to a god through a ritual, using the power of the Tree of Abundance or something. \n Does the god refer to the Goddess? The things needed for the ritual are quite simple; I can buy them all with the pocket money I've saved up! \n Just you wait, Little Cloud, when you come back, I will definitely pick the sweetest raspberries for you to eat! \n I can't tell Mom about this; sigh, she is too prone to making a fuss. \n When I bring Little Cloud home, she will definitely be shocked, hehe."] = "Today I found an old book in those ruins! \n The book mentions a magic to bring the dead back to life, saying it requires praying to a god through a ritual, using the power of the Tree of Abundance or something. \n Does the god refer to the Goddess? The things needed for the ritual are quite simple; I can buy them all with the pocket money I've saved up! \n Just you wait, Little Cloud, when you come back, I will definitely pick the sweetest raspberries for you to eat! \n I can't tell Mom about this; sigh, she is too prone to making a fuss. \n When I bring Little Cloud home, she will definitely be shocked, hehe.",
    ["【本相】新增二段—合奏诗篇：释放后获得合奏效果：若自身和合奏效果的友方对同一个目标造成伤害，则额外造成目标已损失血量10%的伤害（不超过自身攻击23.7%），同一个目标2秒只能触发1次，持续10秒。"] = "[True Form] Adds a second-stage skill—Ensemble Poem: After release, gain the Ensemble effect: If self and allies with the Ensemble effect deal damage to the same target, deal an additional 10% of the target's lost Health as damage (not exceeding 23.7% of own Attack). The same target can only trigger this once every 2 seconds, lasting 10 seconds.",
    ["<h>调配魔药</>"] = "<h>Concoct Potion</>",
    ["“这样的币制简直违背直觉，它一定是世界上最愚蠢的币制之一。”克莱恩困惑地调侃鲁恩的货币体质。\n“不，没有之一。”班森严肃纠正，“你应该明白，要制定合理又简单的币制需要一个前提，那就是懂得数数！可惜，在那些大人物里面，这样的人才太稀少了。”"] = "'Such a currency system is simply counter-intuitive; it must be one of the stupidest currency systems in the world.' Klein teased the Loen currency system in confusion. \n 'No, not one of.' Benson corrected seriously, 'You should understand that to formulate a reasonable and simple currency system, there is a prerequisite, which is knowing how to count! Unfortunately, among those big shots, such talents are too rare.'",
    ["True: Listen to Passive Skills; \nFalse: Do not listen to Passive Skills"] = "Верно: слушайте пассивные навыки; \nЛожь: не слушайте пассивные навыки.",
    ["The <P_Yellow>Mother Goddess of Depravity</> is too powerful, even if it is just the residual corruption in the Newborn's dream..."] = "<P_Yellow>Мать-Богиня Разврата</> слишком сильна, даже если это всего лишь остаточная порча во сне Новорожденного...",
    ["[May Manor]-[Believer Number One]- Transform into Hamster Knockdown"] = "[May Manor]-[Believer Number One]- Transform into Hamster Knockdown",
    ["【Tarot Club · Axe Knight】Tier 5 increment (+25%) → cumulative 165%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["　　他们竟然在事先没找我商量的情况下，决定让我和阿贝尔家族的玛蒂尔达订婚！\n　　天啊，我甚至都还没有见过她！\n　　不行，我要拒绝！\n　　我就算离家出走，就算从此自力更生，受尽打压，也要反抗这桩包办婚姻！"] = "They actually decided to have me engaged to Matilda of the Abel Family without discussing it with me beforehand! \n God, I haven't even met her! \n No, I refuse! \n Even if I run away from home, even if I have to make a living on my own and suffer suppression, I will resist this arranged marriage!",
    ["Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>50</>. Gains additional effects based on the total corruption value of nearby squad members. \nTotal corruption value <Mark>30</>: Attack increased by <Mark>30</>{1,2,（已激活）}\nTotal corruption value <Mark>60</>: Crit rate increased by <Mark>30</>{1,3,（已激活）}\nTotal corruption value <Mark>120</>: Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>30</>{1,4,（已激活）}"] = "Улучшение навыков увеличено на <Mark>50</>. Получает дополнительные эффекты в зависимости от общего значения порчи ближайших членов отряда. \nОбщее значение коррупции <Mark>30</>: атака увеличено на <Mark>30</>{1,2,（Activated）} \nОбщее значение коррупции <Mark>60</>: вероятность критического удара увеличено на <Mark>30</>{1,3,（Activated）} \nОбщее значение коррупции <Mark>120</>: специализация монстров увеличена на <Mark>30</>{1,4,（Activated）}",
    ["none：不需要目标；\nowner：技能和buff的始作俑者；\ntar：技能和buff的作用目标\ntarlist：黑板中的目标；"] = "none: No target required; \n owner: The originator of the skill and buff; \n tar: The target of the skill and buff; \n tarlist: Targets in the blackboard.",
    ["Trigger: Voiceover 2"] = "Trigger: Voiceover 2",
    [" \"Oh right, there is a prerequisite that you must keep in mind and strictly follow!\" \n Old Neil placed the two candles, turned his body to look at Klein, and said very seriously: \n \"Low-sequence Beyonders are not yet powerful enough, and almost all Ritual Magic that can be performed is to beg for power and request help from the outside. Therefore, you can only consider orthodox gods like the Goddess and the Lord of Storms. Absolutely, absolutely do not try to communicate with unknown, unpredictable existences, even if someone worships them, and even if the recorded promises are full of temptation!\" \n \"Believe me, do not hold a lucky mindset. As long as you try it once, you will inevitably slide into the abyss. All efforts and all struggles can only delay the speed, not reverse the trend.\" \n \n —— Volume 1 \"Clown\", Chapter 53, Grounded Ritual Magic"] = "\"Oh right, there is a prerequisite that you must keep in mind and strictly follow!\" \n Old Neil placed the two candles, turned his body to look at Klein, and said very seriously: \n \"Low-Последовательность Потустороннийs are not yet powerful enough, and almost all Ritual Magic that can be performed is to beg for power and request help from the outside. Therefore, you can only consider orthodox gods like the Goddess and the Lord of Storms. Absolutely, absolutely do not try to communicate with unknown, unpredictable existences, even if someone worships them, and even if the recorded promises are full of temptation!\" \n \"Believe me, do not hold a lucky mindset. As long as you try it once, you will inevitably slide into the abyss. All efforts and all struggles can only delay the speed, not reverse the trend.\" \n \n —— Volume 1 \"Клоун\", Chapter 53, Grounded Ritual Magic",
    ["HP<50%额外20%伤减"] = "Additional 20% Снижение урона when HP < 50%",
    ["\"Magician\": The twentieth time, failed again? There are simply too many unexpected situations."] = "\"Фокусник\": The twentieth time, failed again? There are simply too many unexpected situations.",
    ["{{player.name}} has successfully performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. The other party's restless spirituality has returned to tranquility, restoring <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</> points of Sanity. Praise the Goddess, for the destination of all things is peace!"] = "{{player.name}} has successfully performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. The other party's restless Духовность has returned to tranquility, restoring <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</> points of Рассудок. Praise the Goddess, for the destination of all things is peace!",
    ["<h>Divinate</> to confirm safety"] = "<h>Divinate</> to confirm safety",
    ["<Red>引雷</>：持有者对目标触发闪电时，有50%概率对自己也施加闪电造成伤害，闪电有50%几率触发3秒的滞涩效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Lightning Attraction</>: When the holder triggers lightning on a target, there is a 50% probability that it will also deal lightning damage to themselves, and the lightning has a 50% chance to trigger a 3-second Stagnation effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Offspring Protection】Tier 6 increment (+25%) → cumulative 190%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】屏障碎片"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Фрагмент барьера",
    ["【塔罗会·弓箭骑士】档3增量(+15%)→累计114%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["【Tarot Club · Alienated Hound】+12% Attack Power (replaces Attack Speed)"] = "【Кубина Таро · Чужая гончая】+12% силы атаки (заменяет скорость атаки)",
    ["<P_Heart>(This situation is more suitable for astrolabe divination, but I didn't bring an astrolabe today, so I can only use pendulum divination.)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Эта ситуация больше подходит для гадания по астролябии, но я сегодня не взял с собой астролябию, поэтому могу использовать только гадание с маятником.) </>",
    ["<Yellow>Rust Bullet</>: When an attack hits the main target, there is a chance to fire a dark green venom pellet, causing their body to suffer from Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds. Cooldown is 5 seconds. Attacking the target during this period will trigger the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within a <Yellow>8</>-meter radius. Splash damage can occur at most once every 2 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Rust Bullet</>: When an attack hits the main target, there is a chance to fire a dark green venom pellet, causing their body to suffer from Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds. Перезарядка is 5 seconds. Attacking the target during this period will trigger the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within a <Yellow>8</>-meter radius. Splash damage can occur at most once every 2 seconds.",
    ["The Sealed Artifact [Utopia Theater] bestowed by Mr. Fool can help Beyonders master and control marionettes. \n After obtaining a marionette, you can use one of its skills (limited to 1) and gain the character attribute bonuses provided by the marionette. \n Duplicate marionettes can be used for marionette cultivation to improve their abilities. \n Star Worm-type marionettes can shapeshift into the appearance of other Beyonders and can be freely dressed up after shapeshifting."] = "Запечатанный Артефакт [Театр Утопии], подаренный Мистером Дураком, может помочь Потусторонним управлять марионетками и управлять ими. \n После получения марионетки вы можете использовать один из ее навыков (не более 1) и получить бонусы к атрибутам персонажа, предоставляемые марионеткой. \n Дубликаты марионеток можно использовать для выращивания марионеток, чтобы улучшить их способности. \n Марионетки типа Звездного Червя могут принимать облик других Потусторонних, а после изменения формы их можно свободно одевать.",
    ["\"Saw the clear image of the True Creator and suffered immense damage……\""] = "\"Saw the clear image of the True Creator and suffered immense damage……\"",
    ["{\n \"None\": \"\", \n \"Invisibility\": \"Stealth\", \n \"Taunt\": \"Taunt\", \n \"Super Armor\": \"Endure\", \n \"Horror\": \"Terror\", \n \"Invisibility (Lock-on immunity only)\": \"CharacterStealth\", \n \"Petrification\": \"StoneState\", \n \"General Boss Mechanism\": \"NormalBossMechanism\" \n}"] = "{\n \"None\": \"\", \n \"Invisibility\": \"Stealth\", \n \"Taunt\": \"Taunt\", \n \"Суперброня\": \"Endure\", \n \"Horror\": \"Terror\", \n \"Invisibility (Lock-on immunity only)\": \"CharacterStealth\", \n \"Petrification\": \"StoneState\", \n \"General Boss Mechanism\": \"NormalBossMechanism\" \n}",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Sun Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Sun Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner.",
    ["　　塔罗学派必读榜前五的优秀作品，贝尔纳黛会长倾心推荐！\n　　《观众的自我修养》据说是一位半神级观众领域的导师指导编纂的。\n　　《赞美太阳》“赞美太阳”不应流于表面，而该发自内心。\n　　《海上八万里》一本讲述海上生活的小说，书籍粉丝常因为作者是真水手还是假水手争论不休。\n　　《秘密的秘密》一本加入了神秘学元素的侦探小说，其开放式结局引发了巨大的争议。\n　　《学会看书》白塔途径学员的必修书目，同时是塔罗学派最热门的通识书籍。"] = "Пять лучших произведений из списка обязательных к прочтению Клуба Таро, настоятельно рекомендованных президентом Бернадетт! \n　　Сообщается, что книга «Самосовершенствование зрителя» была составлена ​​под руководством наставника уровня полубога на пути наблюдателя. \n　　 «Хвала солнцу»: «Хвала солнцу» не должна быть поверхностной, а идти от сердца. \n　　\"Восемьдесят тысяч миль в море\": Роман о жизни на море, в котором любители книг часто спорят о том, настоящий ли автор моряк или фальшивый. \n　　 «Тайна тайн»: Детективный роман с оккультными элементами, его открытый финал вызвал огромные споры. \n　　 «Учимся читать»: обязательная книга для учеников пути Белой Башни, а также самая популярная книга общего знания в Клубе Таро.",
    ["<Yellow>霸体</>，减伤提高50%，并对攻击者反弹<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</>倍伤害，攻击者超过8米之外时，反弹伤害随距离衰减。"] = "<Yellow> Суперброня </>, Снижение урона increased by 50%, and reflects <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times damage to the attacker. If the attacker is more than 8 meters away, reflected damage decays with distance.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with {混乱行者} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with {Chaos Walker} entry",
    ["\"It's a great helper for Spirit Mediumship, and also a charming flower spirit...\"\n As Daly spoke, Klein felt her voice coming from all directions.\n Looking around in confusion, Klein found that everything was swaying and blurring, as if shrouded in layers of thick fog. Even his own body was swaying, blurring, floating, and losing its weight.\n The reds became redder, the blues bluer, and the blacks blacker, the colors mixing like an impressionist oil painting, hazy and dreamlike. The fragmented, overlapping whispers around him came in waves, as if countless invisible people were discussing.\n \"This is similar to the feeling I had when I did the 'Fortune-Turning Ritual', but without that flavor that makes people go crazy or want to explode...\" Klein thought, looking at all this in confusion.\n Just then, his gaze was drawn to a pair of eyes as crystalline as emeralds. Daly, dressed in a black robe, sat on a blurry \"sofa,\" her gaze strangely focused on the top of Klein's head, her voice smiling gently:\n \"Let's get to know each other formally. I am the 'Spirit Medium', Daly.\"\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 14: Letter"] = "\"It's a great helper for Spirit Mediumship, and also a charming flower spirit...\"\n As Daly spoke, Klein felt her voice coming from all directions.\n Looking around in confusion, Klein found that everything was swaying and blurring, as if shrouded in layers of thick fog. Even his own body was swaying, blurring, floating, and losing its weight.\n The reds became redder, the blues bluer, and the blacks blacker, the colors mixing like an impressionist oil painting, hazy and dreamlike. The fragmented, overlapping whispers around him came in waves, as if countless invisible people were discussing.\n \"This is similar to the feeling I had when I did the 'Fortune-Turning Ritual', but without that flavor that makes people go crazy or want to explode...\" Klein thought, looking at all this in confusion.\n Just then, his gaze was drawn to a pair of eyes as crystalline as emeralds. Daly, dressed in a black robe, sat on a blurry \"sofa,\" her gaze strangely focused on the top of Klein's head, her voice smiling gently:\n \"Let's get to know each other formally. I am the 'Spirit Medium', Daly.\"\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 14: Letter",
    ["{{先生|女士}} Look, it's truly magical"] = "{{Sir|Madam}} Look, it's truly magical",
    ["[Placeholder] The player and Frye arrive at the intersection, and buildings from mid-air fall from the sky. The two dodge repeatedly and are forced to separate."] = "[Placeholder] The player and Frye arrive at the intersection, and buildings from mid-air fall from the sky. The two dodge repeatedly and are forced to separate.",
    ["Move: Spin crazily."] = "Move: Spin crazily.",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演歌颂者】\n街角长椅上，年轻人的肩膀微微发抖。他面前摆着一束花和一封信，但手怎么都伸不出去。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Bard】 \n On the street corner bench, the young man's shoulders are trembling slightly. He has a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he can't bring himself to reach out.",
    ["{\"%i号法术场的数量\"}"] = "{\"Quantity of %ist Spell Field\"}",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案</>\n方案分为非凡方案与装备方案，非凡方案是角色技能、天赋、封印物组成的搭配，装备方案是角色装备、恩赐、套装效果组成的搭配。当前方案会随玩家的当前搭配实时变动。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案切换</>\n通过技能-非凡方案或装备-装备方案，将特定的搭配保存为方案后，即可通过方案切换，一键更改当前的搭配。战斗状态下无法进行方案切换。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>成组切换</>\n可将特定的非凡方案和装备方案打包为成组方案，切换成组方案时可以同时切换装备和非凡方案。可以为成组方案设置自动切换，前往特定场景时自动切为特定的成组方案。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Schemes</>\n Schemes are divided into Потусторонний Schemes and Equipment Schemes. Потусторонний Schemes consist of character skills, talents, and Запечатанный артефактs, while Equipment Schemes consist of character equipment, gifts, and set effects. The current scheme updates in real-time based on the player's current setup.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Scheme Switching</>\n Through Skills-Потусторонний Schemes or Equipment-Equipment Schemes, you can save specific setups as schemes and then switch them with one click. You cannot switch schemes while in combat.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Group Switching</>\n You can bundle specific Потусторонний Schemes and Equipment Schemes into Group Schemes. When switching Group Schemes, you can change both equipment and Потусторонний schemes simultaneously. You can set up automatic switching for Group Schemes to automatically change to a specific scheme when entering certain areas.",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 连线打断buff2"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Connection Interruption Buff 2",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演占卜家】\n霍纳奇斯花海，一位女士站在许愿树下，着急地四处张望着……"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Провидец】 \n At the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands under the wishing tree, looking around anxiously...",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nIn the Fate Moment battlefield, Beyonders are divided into two factions. Each match lasts for <Highlight>4 minutes</>. The side with the higher score at the end of the match wins. If scores are tied, the side with more kills wins; if kills are also tied, the side with more damage wins. If all are equal, a random side wins.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Mechanism Explanation</>\n<Highlight>Score Acquisition: </>Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete.\n<Highlight>Gathering Anchors: </>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Highlight>15 seconds</>. When they appear, Beyonders must enter the anchor based on the <Highlight>required number of people</>. Once the requirement is met, after <Highlight>3 seconds</>, the Beyonders of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Beyonders will receive a temporary attribute bonus.\n<Highlight>Vortex of Strife: </>A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight>countdown ends</>, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Highlight>Buff Orbs: </>Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield. Picking them up grants <Highlight>points and attribute bonuses</>."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nIn the Fate Moment battlefield, Потустороннийs are divided into two factions. Each match lasts for <Highlight>4 minutes</>. The side with the higher score at the end of the match wins. If scores are tied, the side with more kills wins; if kills are also tied, the side with more damage wins. If all are equal, a random side wins.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Mechanism Explanation</>\n<Highlight>Score Acquisition: </>Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete.\n<Highlight>Gathering Anchors: </>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Highlight>15 seconds</>. When they appear, Потустороннийs must enter the anchor based on the <Highlight>required number of people</>. Once the requirement is met, after <Highlight>3 seconds</>, the Потустороннийs of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Потустороннийs will receive a temporary attribute bonus.\n<Highlight>Vortex of Strife: </>A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight>countdown ends</>, Потустороннийs remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Highlight>Buff Orbs: </>Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield. Picking them up grants <Highlight>points and attribute bonuses</>.",
    ["After opening, you can choose to receive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with one of the following affixes: <Highlight><Matriarch of Desolation></>, <Highlight><Servant of Concealment></>, <Highlight><Chaos Walker></>, or <Highlight><Silent Disciple></>."] = "После открытия вы можете получить <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с одним из следующих аффиксов: <Highlight><Matriarch of Desolation></>, <Highlight><Servant of Concealment></>, <Highlight><Chaos Walker></> или <Highlight><Silent Disciple></>.",
    ["<img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>Damage Reduction: <HighLight>90%</>"] = "<img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>Снижение урона: <HighLight>90%</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>Tip: Use the arrow keys to move left and right to dodge attacks</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Tip: Use the arrow keys to move left and right to dodge attacks</>",
    ["—Excerpted from the Court Poetry Collection, page 1859.\nThe classic Roselle-style rhythm vividly expresses the weight of knowledge, leaving everyone present in silence."] = "—Excerpted from the Court Poetry Collection, page 1859.\nThe classic Roselle-style rhythm vividly expresses the weight of knowledge, leaving everyone present in silence.",
    ["《占星入门》、《手相大全》、《三天学会塔罗》，都是些不入流的书。"] = "\"Introduction to Astrology\", \"Complete Guide to Palmistry\", \"Learn Tarot in Three Days\"; all are low-quality books.",
    ["HP低触发1秒无敌"] = "Trigger 1s Invincibility when HP is low",
    ["BUFF生效reminder测试文本测试文本测试文本"] = "Текст напоминания об эффекте BUFF Тестовый текст Тестовый текст.",
    ["...This tragicomedy mask is called 'Drama Master', corresponding to Sequence 8, Trickmaster. It contains the residual power of the late Drama Master Monterey, making it quite dangerous. Upon wearing the mask, the user gains a series of not-so-powerful tricks, including summoning wind, creating fog, and bursting flashes. However, as long as it is carried on one's person, there is a certain chance of getting lost. Furthermore, while wearing it, the user will increasingly feel like a true drama master, and those around them will uncontrollably perform a comedy or tragedy according to the user's will, so it must not be worn for more than two hours."] = "...This tragicomedy mask is called 'Drama Master', corresponding to Последовательность 8, Trickmaster. It contains the residual power of the late Drama Master Monterey, making it quite dangerous. Upon wearing the mask, the user gains a series of not-so-powerful tricks, including summoning wind, creating fog, and bursting flashes. However, as long as it is carried on one's person, there is a certain chance of getting lost. Furthermore, while wearing it, the user will increasingly feel like a true drama master, and those around them will uncontrollably perform a comedy or tragedy according to the user's will, so it must not be worn for more than two hours.",
    ["【成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演歌颂者】\n街角长椅上，年轻人的肩膀微微发抖。他面前摆着一束花和一封信，但手怎么都伸不出去。"] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Bard】\n On the street corner bench, the young man's shoulders trembled slightly. He had a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he couldn't bring himself to reach out.",
    ["<Yellow>伤害转移</>：短时间受到超过生命值上限<Yellow>30%</>的伤害，会获得持续<Yellow>5秒</>的嫁祸能力，对选中的敌对目标施放嫁祸后，接下来<Yellow>8秒</>内自身受到的直接伤害的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=1?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=3?90%}</>会被转移到该目标身上。转移伤害总量不能超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>2</>倍，且会随目标过远而失效。嫁祸能力每<Yellow>30秒</>内最多获得1次。\n<Yellow>危险直觉</>：即将受到控制时，有<Yellow>100%</>的基础概率规避该次控制，短时间（3秒）内若触发<Yellow>3次</>，则会进入<Yellow>10秒</>的冷却时间。"] = "<Yellow>Transfer Damage</>: If you take damage exceeding <Yellow>30%</> of your maximum Health within a short period, you gain the Frame ability for <Yellow>5 seconds</>. After casting Frame on a selected hostile target, <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=1?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=3?90%}</> of the direct damage you take over the next <Yellow>8 seconds</> will be transferred to that target. The total transferred damage cannot exceed <Yellow>2</> times your maximum Health and will be invalidated if the target is too far away. The Frame ability can be obtained at most once every <Yellow>30 seconds</>. \n<Yellow>Danger Intuition</>: When about to be controlled, you have a <Yellow>100%</> base probability to evade the control effect. If this is triggered <Yellow>3 times</> within a short period (3 seconds), it will enter a <Yellow>10-second</> Перезарядка.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Alienated Hound】Tier 6 increment (+25%) → cumulative 190%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Чужая гончая】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["BOSS标记buff"] = "БОСС Марк Бафф",
    ["A Covenant is not easily made, and breaking it requires even more caution. This is a promise you wove together; do you really want to tear it up now? Think about it again, {{先生|女士}}."] = "Завет нелегко заключить, и его нарушение требует еще большей осторожности. Это обещание, которое вы сплели вместе; ты действительно хочешь разорвать его сейчас? Подумай об этом еще раз, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Buff mapping: Map Buff with ID 'A' to Buff with ID 'B' (continuous)."] = "Buff mapping: Map Buff with ID 'A' to Buff with ID 'B' (continuous).",
    ["The God of Knowledge and Wisdom is casting his gaze upon you."] = "The God of Knowledge and Wisdom is casting his gaze upon you.",
    ["【本相】释放二段技能灰雾加持或者灰雾压制后，降低自身解控技能冷却时间3秒。"] = "[True Form] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, reduce the Перезарядка of own Снятие контроляs by 3 seconds.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>友敌关系</>\n相同队伍、团队或俱乐部的成员视为友方，<Highlight>其余玩家均为敌对关系</>，可自由攻击。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>团队结算</>\n击败敌对玩家时，击杀者及最多<Highlight>29名</>符合助攻条件的同团队成员参与本次猩红遗物与段位胜点结算。\n本次可分配的猩红遗物按参与人数平均分配并向下取整。存在余数时，击杀者优先额外获得1个，其余部分在其他参与者中随机分配，每人最多额外获得1个。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>掠夺规则</>\n击败敌对玩家后，可从目标处掠夺<Highlight>段位胜点</>与其持有的<Highlight>猩红遗物</>。玩家头顶显示的碎片数量越多，抢夺猩红遗物的比例越高；头顶碎片数每提高<Highlight>500个</>，抢夺比例相应提升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位保护</>\n段位低于<Highlight>伯爵1阶</>的玩家，被击杀时不扣除段位胜点。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位胜点衰减</>\n每日<Highlight>01:00—08:00</>，击杀玩家获得的段位胜点调整为正常值的<Highlight>10%</>，猎杀进度提供的段位胜点不受影响。\n同一玩家在10分钟内重复击杀同一目标时，第1—3次获得100%段位胜点，第4次获得50%，第5次获得20%，第6次及以后不再获得。两项衰减规则同时生效时，最终结果按比例乘算。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Friend/Enemy Relationship </> \n Members of the same team, group, or Club are considered allies; <Highlight> all other players are hostile </> and can be attacked freely. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Team Settlement </> \n When defeating a hostile player, the killer and up to <Highlight> 29 </> team members who meet the assist criteria participate in this Crimson Relic and Rank Point settlement. \n The distributable Crimson Relics are divided equally among the participants and rounded down. If there is a remainder, the killer gets priority for 1 extra, and the rest are distributed randomly among other participants, with each person receiving at most 1 extra. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Plunder Rules </> \n After defeating a hostile player, you can plunder <Highlight> Rank Points </> and the <Highlight> Crimson Relics </> they hold from the target. The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Crimson Relics that can be plundered; for every <Highlight> 500 </> fragments above the head, the plunder percentage increases accordingly. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Protection </> \n Players with a rank lower than <Highlight> Earl Tier 1 </> will not lose Rank Points when killed. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Point Decay </> \n Daily <Highlight> 01:00—08:00 </>, Rank Points obtained from killing players are adjusted to <Highlight> 10% </> of the normal value; Rank Points provided by hunting progress are not affected. \n When the same player kills the same target repeatedly within 10 minutes, the 1st—3rd times grant 100% Rank Points, the 4th time grants 50%, the 5th time grants 20%, and the 6th time and onwards grant none. When both decay rules are in effect simultaneously, the final result is calculated by multiplying the proportions.",
    ["<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposure</> effect, revealing up to 1 layer per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> layers. Every <Yellow>15</> layers consumed allows the wearer to pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's spirit body, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, <Yellow>3 seconds</> of 70% healing reduction <Yellow>70%</>, and <Yellow>1 second</> of 90% movement speed reduction <Yellow>90%</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Super Armor state, re-apply <Yellow>5</> layers of Weakness Exposure to them."] = "<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposure</> effect, revealing up to 1 layer per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> layers. Every <Yellow>15</> layers consumed allows the wearer to pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's Духовное тело, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, <Yellow>3 seconds</> of 70% healing reduction <Yellow>70%</>, and <Yellow>1 second</> of 90% Скорость бега reduction <Yellow>90%</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Суперброня state, re-apply <Yellow>5</> layers of Weakness Exposure to them.",
    ["　　几年过去了，我从序列9一步步爬到序列5，成了“天文学家”。每天晚上观测星象，计算仪式节点，离“炼金术士”只剩一步之遥。\n　　但这一步需要的东西太多，钱，资源，还有……人。\n　　子弹的事是我经手的，三百发特种弹药，我叫它们“金弹”，能让人短暂获得强大的力量。\n　　我亲手改档案，报消耗，分批次运出去。“审判官”现在已经是我忠诚的仆人，他会用这些金弹来吸引足够多的人——小偷、流氓、杀手……管他是谁，让那些对现状不满的底层们有个投奔的地方。等他们聚集起来，仪式就能启动。\n　　他们会成为祭品。没关系，反正都是些渣滓，腐肉，清理掉也对廷根有好处。"] = "Прошли годы, и я шаг за шагом поднялся от Последовательности 9 к Последовательности 5, став «Астрономом». Каждую ночь я наблюдаю за звездами и рассчитываю ритуальные узлы, и я всего в одном шаге от того, чтобы стать «Алхимиком». \n Но этот шаг требует слишком многого: денег, ресурсов и... людей. \n Вопрос о пулях решал я; триста специальных боеприпасов, я называю их «Золотыми пулями», которые могут позволить людям ненадолго обрести мощную силу. \nЯ лично изменял файлы, сообщал об их использовании и отправлял их партиями. «Инквизитор» теперь мой верный слуга; он будет использовать эти золотые пули, чтобы привлечь достаточное количество людей — воров, хулиганов, убийц… кем бы они ни были, пусть тем, кто внизу, недовольным статус-кво, будет куда пойти. Как только они соберутся, можно начинать ритуал. \n Они станут жертвами. Это не имеет значения; все равно они все отбросы и гниль, и очистка их пойдет на пользу Тингену.",
    ["《非凡生物在哪里》"] = "Where to Find Потусторонний Creatures",
    ["【Placeholder】 Flashback to the scene before Winnie went missing in the dream divination."] = "【Placeholder】 Flashback to the scene before Winnie went missing in the dream Гадание.",
    ["{{player.name}}'s \"Divine Descent\" ritual has received Mr. Fool's blessing—<Chat_Highlight>Monarch's Flame</>! Praise Him! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},444460680\">[Go to Praise]</>"] = "{{player.name}}'s \"Divine Descent\" ritual has received Mr. Fool's blessing—<Chat_Highlight>Monarch's Flame</>! Praise Him! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},444460680\">[Go to Praise]</>",
    ["{\n\"无\": \"\",\n\"减速\": \"SpeedDown\",\n\"睡眠\": \"Sleep\",\n\"禁锢\": \"Stuck\",\n\"眩晕\": \"Dizzy\",\n\"沉默\": \"Silent\",\n\"滞涩\": \"DodgeLimit\"\n}"] = "{\n \"None\": \"\", \n \"Slow\": \"SpeedDown\", \n \"Sleep\": \"Sleep\", \n \"Imprisonment\": \"Stuck\", \n \"Stun\": \"Dizzy\", \n \"Silence\": \"Silent\", \n \"Stagnation\": \"DodgeLimit\" \n}",
    ["<P_Yellow>占卜</>……她是神秘学爱好者？"] = "<P_Yellow>Гадание</>... Она энтузиаст оккультизма?",
    ["GTA-奥黛丽疗愈-坐下"] = "GTA - Audrey Healing - Sit Down",
    ["【Tarot Club · Maid】Tier 7 increment (+30%) → cumulative 220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】Tier 7 increment (+30%) → cumulative 220%",
    ["\"Introduction to Astrology\", \"Complete Guide to Palmistry\", \"Learn Tarot in Three Days\"; all are low-quality books."] = "\"Introduction to Astrology\", \"Complete Guide to Palmistry\", \"Learn Tarot in Three Days\"; all are low-quality books.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>猎杀时刻活动时间</>\n<Highlight>每日19:00—20:00</>开放；每周六、周日额外开放<Highlight>14:00—15:00</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>王城区域限时事件</>\n猎杀时刻期间，可在王城中心【异变营地】限时召唤<Highlight>命运人偶</>，击败后可获得猩红遗物材料。\n每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>巨龙·投影</>。击退巨龙时，当前有效归属伤害最高的团队获得拍卖奖励。每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。\n除周五晚场外，其他猎杀时刻开始<Highlight>10分钟后</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>王城守卫者</>。击败王城守卫者后，完成最后一击的团队成员共享对应奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位胜点双倍收益</>\n猎杀时刻期间，击杀敌对玩家可掠夺<Highlight>双倍段位胜点</>；被击杀时，损失的段位胜点同样翻倍。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Hunting Time event time</>\n<Highlight>Open daily from 19:00—20:00; additionally open every Saturday and Sunday from </><Highlight>14:00—15:00</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Royal City area limited-time event</>\nDuring Hunting Time, you can summon a limited-time <Highlight>Fate Марионетка</> at the [Mutated Camp] in the center of the Royal City. Defeating it will grant Crimson Relic materials.\n10 minutes after<Highlight> the Hunting Time event begins on Friday night</>, i.e., at <Highlight>19:10</>, a <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. When the dragon is repelled, the team with the highest effective damage contribution will receive auction rewards. During each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the final kill auction qualification for the <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> at most 1 time; players who have already obtained this qualification cannot obtain it again during the current event.\nExcept for the Friday night session, 10 minutes after<Highlight> other Hunting Time events begin</>, a <Highlight>Royal City Guardian</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. After defeating the Royal City Guardian, the team members who land the final blow will share the corresponding rewards.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Double Rank Point Gains</>\nDuring Hunting Time, killing hostile players allows you to plunder <Highlight>double Rank Points</>; when killed, the Rank Points lost are also doubled.",
    ["Enum(Buff分配)"] = "Enum (Buff distribution)",
    ["“11月18日。真是件神奇的事情，一个异想天开的实验，我发现了一位困于风暴之中、迷失于黑暗深处的可怜家伙。”"] = "\"November 18th. What a magical thing. Through a whimsical experiment, I discovered a poor fellow trapped in a storm and lost in the depths of darkness.\"",
    ["<Yellow>Shepherd Souls</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period of time, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows them to consume it, causing different effects based on the soul's type: \nConsume a Beyonder's soul: Deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to it and gain one skill of the corresponding Sequence by imprisoning its soul. Using this skill releases the soul: \n    Warrior Sequence: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n    Bard Sequence: <Yellow>Solar Oath</>; \n    Apprentice Sequence: <Yellow>Nebula Aria</>; \n    Spectator Sequence: <Yellow>Psychological Suggestion</>; \n    Seer Sequence: <Yellow>Realm of Mysteries</>; \n    Mystery Pryer Sequence: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \nWhen Creeping Hunger increases its danger level, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nConsume a monster's soul: Instantly shatter the soul, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to the target and <Yellow>5</> surrounding monsters, and apply <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect to the target for <Yellow>5</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Until the imprisoned soul is released, you cannot strip a soul from its owner again. You can imprison up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls simultaneously."] = "<Yellow>Shepherd Souls</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period of time, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows them to consume it, causing different effects based on the soul's type: \nConsume a Потусторонний's soul: Deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to it and gain one skill of the corresponding Последовательность by imprisoning its soul. Using this skill releases the soul: \n    Warrior Последовательность: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n    Bard Последовательность: <Yellow>Solar Oath</>; \n    Apprentice Последовательность: <Yellow>Nebula Aria</>; \n    Зритель Последовательность: <Yellow>Psychological Suggestion</>; \n    Провидец Последовательность: <Yellow>Realm of Mysteries</>; \n    Подглядывающий за Тайнами Последовательность: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \nWhen Creeping Hunger increases its danger level, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nConsume a monster's soul: Instantly shatter the soul, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to the target and <Yellow>5</> surrounding monsters, and apply <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect to the target for <Yellow>5</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Until the imprisoned soul is released, you cannot strip a soul from its owner again. You can imprison up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls simultaneously.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Archer Knight】+5% Critical Hit (replaces Magic Power)"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】+5% критического удара (заменяет магическую силу)",
    ["【C级动画占位】玩家通过梦境占卜，看到了一些模糊的画面。"] = "【C-level animation placeholder】 The player sees some blurry images through dream Гадание.",
    ["Ms. “Magician”, I have read your “Storm Villa”, it is very wonderful!"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, I have read your “Storm Villa”, it is very wonderful!",
    ["NPC Overhead Health"] = "NPC Overhead Health",
    ["[Proof] Each time a Distortion effect is stacked, it simultaneously deals damage. If the target has a Shield, the damage becomes 1.5 times."] = "[Proof] Each time a Distortion effect is stacked, it simultaneously deals damage. If the target has a Shield, the damage becomes 1.5 times.",
    ["NPC老尼尔--灵体材质"] = "NPC Old Neil - Духовное тело Material",
    ["“闪现”的极致是“无处不在”。"] = "The ultimate form of Flash is \"omnipresence.\"",
    ["【Tarot Club · Derrick】Tier 5 increment (+25%) → cumulative 165%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["Place Spell Field (N choose 1)."] = "Place Spell Field (N choose 1).",
    ["……你占卜的结果是对的吗？"] = "……Is the result of your Гадание correct?",
    ["<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Accept room sharing: </>\n Day shift and night shift workers can share one bed. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Security guarantee: </>\n Administrator patrols 24 hours a day, only guarantees your personal safety, does not guarantee your financial safety. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Complete facilities: </>\n Hot water price is only double that of cold water, stove is public, charged by the hour. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Affordable price: </>\n \"Only 8 pence per week, 10 pence deposit, young workers are welcome to move in. \n For inquiries, please find the administrator Old Tom—he is in the first room on the left on the first floor, waiting at any time!"] = "<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Accept room sharing: </>\n Day shift and night shift workers can share one bed. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Security guarantee: </>\n Administrator patrols 24 hours a day, only guarantees your personal safety, does not guarantee your financial safety. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Complete facilities: </>\n Hot water price is only double that of cold water, stove is public, charged by the hour. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Affordable price: </>\n \"Only 8 pence per week, 10 pence deposit, young workers are welcome to move in. \n For inquiries, please find the administrator Old Tom—he is in the first room on the left on the first floor, waiting at any time!",
    ["HitBack , -- 击退\nHitDown, -- 击倒\nHitFly, -- 击飞\nHitFloat, -- 挑空\nHitDrag, -- 拖拽\nHitStiff, -- 僵直攻击"] = "HitBack, -- Knockback \nHitDown, -- Knockdown \nHitFly, -- Knockup \nHitFloat, -- Aerial \nHitDrag, -- Drag \nHitStiff, -- Stiff Attack",
    ["“愚者”先生从历史中定位到了无数神话生物，利用“嫁接”将力量转移到源堡，得到了神话织茧。"] = "Мистер Дурак обнаружил бесчисленное количество мифических существ из истории и использовал «прививку», чтобы передать их силу замку Сефиры, получив Мифическую Ткань.",
    ["[True Form] After Nightmare hits an enemy target, it inflicts a Tranquility aura on the enemy target for 6 seconds. This aura reduces the Skill Block of surrounding enemy targets."] = "[True Form] After Кошмар hits an enemy target, it inflicts a Tranquility aura on the enemy target for 6 seconds. This aura reduces the Блок навыков of surrounding enemy targets.",
    ["Attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Hand of God></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Armor Break increased.\""] = "Атакуйте <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с аффиксом <Highlight><Hand of God></>: «Все уровни навыков +1, пробитие брони увеличено».",
    ["【副本系统buff】占编号81002050-81002099"] = "[Dungeon System buff] Occupies ID 81002050-81002099.",
    ["“愚者”先生为你嫁接的力量中，还包含常用的非凡能力。"] = "Сила, переданная вам Мистером Дураком, также включает в себя некоторые часто используемые способности Потустороннего.",
    ["……这让我想到罗塞尔日记里，大帝说过的那句话：“占卜家”总是说一半藏一半，从来不把事情讲明白吗？"] = "……This reminds me of that line from Roselle's diary, where the Emperor said: “Провидецs” always say half and hide half, never explaining things clearly?",
    ["【右摇杆模式4】对身前矩形范围内敌人攻击。"] = "[Right Stick Mode 4] Attack enemies in a rectangle in front.",
    ["【增强】对<HighLight>3</>格内敌方持续施加<HighLight>25%</>防御削减。"] = "[Enhanced] Continuously inflict <HighLight>25%</> Defense reduction on enemies within <HighLight>3</> tiles.",
    ["<P_Yellow>Core members of the \"Moon Servants\"</>\nCodename \"Professor\", real identity unknown, whereabouts unknown, suspected to be the mastermind behind the entire sacrificial plan.\nCodename \"Viscountess\", owner of May Manor, Sequence 4 of the Corpse Collector pathway, presides over the sacrifice and rebirth rituals.\nCodename \"Butler\", Sequence 5 of the Mystery Pryer pathway, direct holder of the Knowledge Crown.\nCodename \"Hyacinth\"...\nCodename \"Dandelion\"..."] = "<P_Yellow>Основные члены «Лунных Слуг» </>\nКодовое имя «Профессор», настоящая личность неизвестна, местонахождение неизвестно, предположительно является вдохновителем всего плана жертвоприношения.\nКодовое имя «Виконтесса», владелица Мэйского поместья, последовательность 4 пути Собирателя трупов, руководит ритуалами жертвоприношения и возрождения.\nКодовое имя «Дворецкий», Последовательность 5 пути Тайного Жреца, непосредственный обладатель Короны Знаний.\nКодовое имя \"Гиацинт\"...\nКодовое имя \"Одуванчик\"...",
    ["“阁下，我们该怎么称呼您？”\n　　阿尔杰微微点头，跟着庄重问道：\n　　“阁下，我们该怎么称呼您？”\n　　周明瑞听得愣了一下，放在青铜长桌上的手指轻轻敲动起来，脑海内霍然闪过了之前占卜的内容。\n　　他往后一靠，收回右手，十指交叉着抵于下巴，微笑看着两人道：\n　　“你们可以称呼我……”\n　　说到这里，他顿了顿，语气轻和而平淡地开口：\n　　“愚者。”\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第六章 非凡者"] = "\"Your Excellency, how should we address you?\" \n Alger nodded slightly and followed up solemnly: \n \"Your Excellency, how should we address you?\" \n Zhou Mingrui was stunned for a moment, his fingers tapping gently on the bronze long table, and the content of his previous Гадание flashed through his mind. \n He leaned back, withdrew his right hand, clasped his fingers together against his chin, and looked at the two of them with a smile: \n \"You may address me as...\" \n Having said this, he paused, and spoke in a gentle and calm tone: \n \"Шут.\" \n \n —Volume 1 \"Клоун\", Chapter 6: Потусторонний",
    ["He looked at Xiga and said:\n \"I intend to apply to join the 'Red Gloves'.\"\n \"'Red Gloves'? But their minimum requirement is Sequence 7... and the dangers the 'Red Gloves' face are exponentially higher than those of a standard Nighthawk team.\" Xiga said, her voice filled with confusion and concern.\n Leonard sketched a smile that didn't reach his eyes:\n \"I'm almost ready for advancement.\"\n His eyes turned cold, and he muttered silently through gritted teeth:\n I must have my revenge!\n Ince Zangwill, you must stay alive until I become strong enough!\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 211: Funeral"] = "He looked at Xiga and said:\n \"I intend to apply to join the 'Red Gloves'.\"\n \"'Red Gloves'? But their minimum requirement is Последовательность 7... and the dangers the 'Red Gloves' face are exponentially higher than those of a standard Nighthawk team.\" Xiga said, her voice filled with confusion and concern.\n Leonard sketched a smile that didn't reach his eyes:\n \"I'm almost ready for advancement.\"\n His eyes turned cold, and he muttered silently through gritted teeth:\n I must have my revenge!\n Ince Zangwill, you must stay alive until I become strong enough!\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 211: Funeral",
    ["“伟大母亲”，现已确认为▇▇▇▇的化身，繁衍与生育的象征，掌握生命孕育与血肉繁衍，占据▇▇▇▇权柄。信仰祂的组织包括▇▇母亲、玫瑰学派、原始月亮。\n向祂祈求会获得旺盛的繁衍能力，但会逐渐丧失理智，性情狂热，探求生命与灵性本质的禁忌，陷入对生育与繁衍的欲望……\n献祭的密契仪式需要大量的血肉与生命，过程伴随着极致的疯狂和混乱……\n廷根危机中，月亮仆从以献祭整座城市为代价，制造邪神子嗣降临的容器，带来毁灭性的灾难……"] = "«Великая Мать», теперь подтвержденная как аватар ▇▇▇▇, символа воспроизводства и плодородия, овладевшая концепцией жизни и размножением плоти и крови, занимающая власть ▇▇▇▇. Организации, которые верят в Нее, включают ▇▇ Мать, Школу мысли Розы и Первичную Луну.\nМолитва Ей дарует энергичную репродуктивную способность, но человек постепенно теряет рассудок, становится фанатичным, ищет табу жизни и сущности духовности и впадает в желание рождения и размножения...\nТайный ритуал жертвоприношения требует большого количества плоти, крови и жизни, и этот процесс сопровождается крайним безумием и хаос...\nВо время кризиса Тингена Лунный Слуга пожертвовал всем городом в качестве платы за создание корабля для спуска потомков злого бога, что привело к разрушительной катастрофе...",
    ["　　银雾森林迎来了今年的第一场雪，东边的雾气也越发浓厚，掉落了不少羽毛的戴莉在窝里冻得直发抖。枝头小小的巢穴无法抵御寒冷，顶上抖落的一坨雪将巢穴砸落下去，戴莉还没来得及发出叫声，就发现自己被温暖的灰色皮毛包裹——它落在了一只灰麋鹿的头顶。\n\n 　　“我察觉到这里有动物需要帮助，是你吗？”那只灰麋鹿这么说道。\n\n 　　“如果你是来给我带来温暖的，那确实是我。”恢复了体温的戴莉在麋鹿的头顶蹦跶了几下，继续说道：“我叫戴莉， 你的名字是什么？”\n\n　　 “我是……抱歉，我忘记了我的名字。”\n\n　　戴莉这才注意到，麋鹿的角上挂着许多小木牌，上面写着“我叫邓恩”、我是森林的守护者”、“每天巡逻看谁需要帮助”……\n\n　　 “你叫邓恩，”戴莉轻声说，她听树洞里的松鼠一家提起过这头每到冬天就会失忆的麋鹿，曾一天给他们送了三次松子，“你是银雾森林的守护者。”"] = "The Silver Mist Forest welcomed its first snow of the year, and the mist in the east became thicker. Daly, having lost many feathers, shivered in the nest. The small nest on the branch could not resist the cold, and a lump of snow shaken from above knocked the nest down. Before Daly could even make a sound, she found herself wrapped in warm gray fur—it had landed on the head of a gray elk. \n\n \"I sensed that an animal here needed help, is it you?\" the gray elk said. \n\n \"If you are here to bring me warmth, then it is indeed me.\" Having regained her body temperature, Daly hopped a few times on the elk's head and continued: \"My name is Daly, what is your name?\" \n\n \"I am... sorry, I forgot my name.\" \n\n Daly then noticed that the elk's antlers were hung with many small wooden signs, which read \"My name is Dunn\", \"I am the guardian of the forest\", \"Patrol every day to see who needs help\"... \n\n \"Your name is Dunn,\" Daly said softly. She had heard the squirrel family in the tree hole mention this elk that would lose its memory every winter, who had once delivered pine nuts to them three times in one day, \"You are the guardian of the Silver Mist Forest.\"",
    ["【常驻触发】采集物"] = "[Permanent Trigger] Collectible",
    ["\"I want to build a floating kingdom driven by steam; it should possess the ability to think and have emotions, embodying the supreme aesthetics of machinery and steam,\" Roselle said. At that time, he had just become a Sequence 2 Knowledge Mentor of the Savant pathway, standing at the pinnacle of the world, his eyes filled with infinite possibilities. \nBut this wish never had the chance to be realized. Even Roselle himself, standing at the crest of the era, never imagined that the moment he envisioned this future would be the peak of his life. The bloody storms of power followed closely behind; the tides of the era could carry him to the sky, but they could also sink him into the abyss. \nThe Kingdom of Steam eventually became a divine kingdom that existed only in concept; only the crown he wore when he died remembers all of this—is this fortune or misfortune? The awakened crown relied on the power of corruption to manifest it into reality, and the newborn City of Machinery grew without a moment's pause. The sounds of roaring, gears, and clockwork replaced the sound of pulses and heartbeats. Roselle's ambition continued to spread after his death in an unexpected way..."] = "«Я хочу построить летающее королевство, приводимое в движение паром; оно должно обладать способностью думать и испытывать эмоции, воплощая высшую эстетику машин и пара», — сказала Розель. В то время он только что стал Наставником Знаний Последовательности 2 пути Саванта, стоя на вершине мира, его глаза были полны безграничных возможностей. \nНо этому желанию так и не удалось осуществиться. Даже сам Розель, стоявший на вершине эпохи, никогда не предполагал, что момент, когда он представил себе это будущее, станет пиком его жизни. Кровавые бури власти последовали за ним; приливы эпохи могли унести его на небо, но могли и потопить в бездну. \nКоролевство Steam со временем стало божественным королевством, существовавшим лишь в теории; обо всем этом помнит только корона, которую он носил, когда умер, — счастье это или несчастье? Пробужденная корона полагалась на силу порчи, чтобы воплотить ее в реальность, и новорожденный Город Машин рос без малейшей паузы. Звуки рева, шестерёнок и часового механизма заменили звуки пульса и сердцебиения. Амбиции Розеллы продолжили распространяться после его смерти неожиданным образом...",
    ["\"Magician\": Miss Justice, according to the plan, the door has been opened."] = "\"Фокусник\": Miss Justice, according to the plan, the door has been opened.",
    ["—In that world, no one sacrificed their life in the battle against Megose. The Cathedral subsequently gave the Nighthawks squad that guarded all of Tingen the opportunity to take up posts in Backlund, but Dunn and Frye both refused. \n\n      Daly returned from Backlund late at night; she brought a bottle of the wine that both Dunn and Frye loved, as was her custom. \n      \"So, you really refused the Cathedral's invitation?\" She leaned against the table, her gaze resting on Dunn's face. \n      Dunn looked up at her. The firelight flickered gently in his gray eyes. \n      \"You are more suited for that place than I am,\" he said, his voice calm and heavy. \"In Tingen, the people here know me, and I know every street, every window. I want to stay here and continue guarding it.\" \n      Frye silently poured himself a glass and raised it: \"Me too.\" \n      Daly was silent for a moment, then laughed softly: \"I knew you would say that.\" \n      She grabbed the bottle and filled her own glass. Three glasses clinked together in front of the fireplace with a crisp sound. \n      Outside the window, Tingen slept quietly under the watchful eyes of the sleepless Guardians."] = "—In that world, no one sacrificed their life in the battle against Megose. The Cathedral subsequently gave the Ночные Ястребы squad that guarded all of Тинген the opportunity to take up posts in Бэкланд, but Dunn and Frye both refused. \n\n      Daly returned from Бэкланд late at night; she brought a bottle of the wine that both Dunn and Frye loved, as was her custom. \n      \"So, you really refused the Cathedral's invitation?\" She leaned against the table, her gaze resting on Dunn's face. \n      Dunn looked up at her. The firelight flickered gently in his gray eyes. \n      \"You are more suited for that place than I am,\" he said, his voice calm and heavy. \"In Тинген, the people here know me, and I know every street, every window. I want to stay here and continue guarding it.\" \n      Frye silently poured himself a glass and raised it: \"Me too.\" \n      Daly was silent for a moment, then laughed softly: \"I knew you would say that.\" \n      She grabbed the bottle and filled her own glass. Three glasses clinked together in front of the fireplace with a crisp sound. \n      Outside the window, Тинген slept quietly under the watchful eyes of the Бессонный Guardians.",
    ["[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Attack."] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Attack.",
    ["Divination can be divided into three categories based on how \"revelations\" are obtained: \n The first category is to obtain revelations through \"sensing\" by using the \"power\" of the person asking, such as Tarot divination and poker divination. \n The second category is led by the diviner, obtaining revelations through calculation and speculation based on information provided by nature or the person asking, such as numerology and astrology. \n The third category is seeking answers from a third party, the most common being \"Magic Mirror Divination.\" This method of divination is really interesting! Usually, one prays to the seven orthodox gods for answers. What would happen if I prayed to other existences? \n \n Note: \n Today, Mr. Glacis said that there was once a real Seer here. That person only took one look at him and knew he had lung problems. What is the principle behind this? I really hope to have the chance to meet that Mr. Moretti."] = "Гадание можно разделить на три категории в зависимости от способа получения «откровений»: \n Первая категория — получение откровений посредством «ощущений» с использованием «силы» спрашивающего, например гадание на Таро и гадание в покере. \n Вторую категорию возглавляют прорицатели, получающие откровения посредством вычислений и предположений, основанных на информации, предоставленной природой или спрашивающим человеком, например нумерологии и астрологии. \n Третья категория — это поиск ответов от третьей стороны, наиболее распространенным из которых является «Гадание по волшебному зеркалу». Этот метод гадания действительно интересен! Обычно за ответом молятся семи ортодоксальным богам. Что бы произошло, если бы я помолился другим существам? \n \n Примечание: \n Сегодня мистер Гласис сказал, что когда-то здесь жил настоящий Провидец. Этот человек только взглянул на него и понял, что у него проблемы с легкими. Какой принцип стоит за этим? Я очень надеюсь, что мне представится возможность встретиться с этим мистером Моретти.",
    ["<Yellow>Sule's Protection</>: Damage taken by the carrier is reduced by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n<Yellow>Suffering Wealth</>: When the carrier takes damage, Defense is increased based on the accumulated damage taken, lasting <Yellow>30 seconds</>, with Defense increasing by up to <Yellow>*d</> points."] = "<Yellow>Sule's Protection</>: Damage taken by the carrier is reduced by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n<Yellow>Suffering Wealth</>: When the carrier takes damage, Defense is increased based on the accumulated damage taken, lasting <Yellow>30 seconds</>, with Defense increasing by up to <Yellow>*d</> points.",
    ["Mr. Fool is a true God recognized by all churches, and the successful construction of the Tarot Club is also thanks to his help."] = "Господин Дурак — истинный Бог, признанный всеми церквями, и успешное строительство Клуба Таро также произошло благодаря его помощи.",
    ["{\"Skill Type%i\"}"] = "{\"Skill Type%i\"}",
    ["　　她眸中已多了一抹疯狂，看起来用不了多久灵体就会被彻底污染，完全失控。\n　　但是，洛薇雅这一刻的目光里更多是理智和决绝。\n　　她知道自己在做什么，也很清楚自己现在的状态和之后的结局。\n　　呜的风声里，她崩溃的身体连带那阴影“斗篷”落在了“暗天使”萨斯利尔体表。\n　　蠕动的血肉侵蚀了进去，浓厚的阴影飞快扩张，将两道身影一起束缚。\n　　无需洛薇雅开口，科林·伊利亚特已明白了她的意图，当即低沉吼了一声：\n　　“进攻！”\n　　砰！\n　　他的两把晨曦直剑同时斩破虚空，让银白的光芒在纠缠于一的洛薇雅和“暗天使”萨斯利尔身周爆发开来。\n　　笼罩着森然阴影的宫殿一下变亮，布满神圣火焰的巨大光球凭空浮现，将“暗天使”和洛薇雅包容于内，飞快消融着他们，点燃了血肉。\n　　“阳炎”！\n　　这灿烂的光辉里，洛薇雅那双淡灰的眼眸流露出了实质般的痛苦，她的声音虚幻飘渺地回荡了起来：\n　　“我没有背叛白银城……”\n\n　　——第六卷《逐光者》 第一百一十三章 最后的守护"] = "В ее глазах уже было легкое безумие, и казалось, что скоро ее духовное тело будет полностью испорчено, и она полностью потеряет контроль. \n Однако во взгляде Ловии в этот момент было больше разума и решимости. \n Она знала, что делает, и очень четко представляла себе свое нынешнее состояние и последующий конец. \n Под завывающим ветром ее рушащееся тело вместе с теневым «плащом» упало на поверхность Темного Ангела Сасрира. \n Извивающаяся плоть и кровь впились в него, и густые тени быстро расширились, связывая две фигуры вместе. \n Даже не нуждаясь в словах Ловии, Колин Илиада уже понял ее намерение и тут же проревел тихим голосом: \n «Атака!» \n Бац! \n Его два Больших Меча Зари одновременно пронзили пустоту, заставив серебристо-белый свет вспыхнуть вокруг запутанной Ловии и Темного Ангела Сасрира. \n Дворец, окутанный мрачными тенями, внезапно прояснился, и из воздуха появился огромный шар света, наполненный священным пламенем, окутывая Темного Ангела и Ловию, быстро растворяя их и воспламеняя их плоть. \n «Солнечный свет»! \n В этом блестящем сиянии пара светло-серых глаз Ловии выражала сильную боль, а ее голос эхом отдавался призрачным и неземным эхом: \n «Я не предавала Серебряный Город...» \n \n —— Том 6 «Охотник за светом», Глава 113, Последний страж",
    ["　　我很享受“通识者”这个身份。\n　　一件奇怪的事情，当我以“通识者”自居，做的事情都符合它的定位时，那些让我几乎发疯的耳语安静了不少，我时不时爆发的脾气也得到了控制，并想起了日记这件事情。​\n　　这就是那位神秘的查拉图先生对我提过的“扮演”吗？这或许是解决魔药隐患的关键。​"] = "Мне очень нравится личность «Ученого». \n Странная вещь: когда я считаю себя «Ученым» и делаю вещи, которые соответствуют этому позиционированию, те шепоты, которые почти сводили меня с ума, немного утихли, мой характер, который время от времени вспыхивал, также был взят под контроль, и я вспомнил о дневнике. \n Это та самая «Игра», о которой мне говорил загадочный мистер Заратул? Возможно, это ключ к разгадке скрытой опасности зелья.",
    ["“占卜家”只是序列9，世界上应该有不少“占卜家”。"] = "«Провидец» — это только Последовательность 9; в мире должно быть немало «Провидцев».",
    ["【Tarot Club · Derrick】Tier 7 increment (+30%) → cumulative 220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["　伦纳德玩世不恭般地笑笑道：“克莱恩，我们之间不需要假装，我目睹过你摆脱封印物‘2-049’的控制，知道你的特殊，而你也应该模糊感觉得出来我和一般非凡者不同。”\n　　他收敛笑容，迎着克莱恩的目光道：\n　　“我曾经对你说过，这个世界上有很多特殊的人，总是能做到别人做不到的事情，比如说你，也比如说我。”\n　　“这个世界拥有漫长的历史，存在这样或者那样的神奇物品，总会有人得到它们，掌握它们，成为不同戏剧的主角，这样的人不会太多，但肯定不可能只有那么一两位。”\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第一百二十一章 伦纳德的“猜测”"] = "Leonard smiled cynically and said, \"Klein, there's no need for us to pretend. I witnessed you break free from the control of the mystical item '2-049', so I know you're special. You should also be able to vaguely sense that I'm different from the average Потусторонний.\"\n He reined in his smile and, meeting Klein's gaze, said:\n \"I once told you that there are many special people in this world who can always do things others cannot—like you, and like me.\"\n \"This world has a long history, and there are all sorts of mystical items. There will always be people who obtain them, master them, and become the protagonists of different dramas. There aren't many such people, but it's impossible for there to be only one or two.\"\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 121: Leonard's \"Guess\"",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide divisions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs on <Highlight> the Sunday at 12:00 PM of the first week </> after the server opens, and the divisions and groups will be announced at <Highlight> 6:00 PM that same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) will start at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week, and subsequent Four-Way Leagues will be adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams in the group will be placed into different match groups and <Highlight> randomly assigned </>, provided this rule is met. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the Winners' Bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the Losers' Bracket. The second match will feature matchups within the Winners' and Losers' Brackets respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place on Saturday at 9:00 PM: <Highlight> For the Holy Name Group and above </>, the top two in the group promote to the higher group, and the bottom two relegate to the lower group; <Highlight> For the Hero Group and below </>, the first place in the group promotes two groups, the second place promotes one group, the seventh place relegates one group, and the eighth place relegates two groups. Among them, <Highlight> Legendary Group, Epic Group, and Traveler Group </> are special groups: Legendary Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 6th and 7th both relegate one group, 8th relegates two groups; Epic Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 7th relegates one group, 8th relegates two groups; Traveler Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd promotes one group, 7th and 8th relegate two groups; Challenger Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd and 3rd promote one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler Group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger Group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance Group </> (<Highlight> Alliance Group does not participate in promotion/relegation </>) based on <Highlight> total club Beyonder rating </>. Before each league match, clubs in the Alliance Group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance and participate in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battlefield, and the <Highlight> President of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically receive <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide divisions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to construct new divisions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide divisions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs on <Highlight> the Sunday at 12:00 PM of the first week </> after the server opens, and the divisions and groups will be announced at <Highlight> 6:00 PM that same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) will start at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week, and subsequent Four-Way Leagues will be adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams in the group will be placed into different match groups and <Highlight> randomly assigned </>, provided this rule is met. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the Winners' Bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the Losers' Bracket. The second match will feature matchups within the Winners' and Losers' Brackets respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place on Saturday at 9:00 PM: <Highlight> For the Holy Name Group and above </>, the top two in the group promote to the higher group, and the bottom two relegate to the lower group; <Highlight> For the Hero Group and below </>, the first place in the group promotes two groups, the second place promotes one group, the seventh place relegates one group, and the eighth place relegates two groups. Among them, <Highlight> Legendary Group, Epic Group, and Traveler Group </> are special groups: Legendary Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 6th and 7th both relegate one group, 8th relegates two groups; Epic Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 7th relegates one group, 8th relegates two groups; Traveler Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd promotes one group, 7th and 8th relegate two groups; Challenger Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd and 3rd promote one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler Group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger Group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance Group </> (<Highlight> Alliance Group does not participate in promotion/relegation </>) based on <Highlight> total club Потусторонний rating </>. Before each league match, clubs in the Alliance Group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance and participate in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battlefield, and the <Highlight> President of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically receive <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide divisions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to construct new divisions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
    ["<Yellow>毒雾弥漫</>：携带者受到8米内的敌人攻击时，有<Yellow>100%</>的基础概率使其随机染上3种毒素之一，持续<Yellow>8秒</>，每种毒素最多叠加<Yellow>5层</>。染毒效果每0.5秒最多触发1次，对单个目标每2秒最多触发1次。\n<Yellow>毒素侵染</>：携带此封印物5分钟后，进入<Yellow>毒素入骨</>状态，携带者在该状态下死亡时会残留持续<Yellow>10秒</>的毒池。毒池出现时，有<Yellow>100%</>基础概率禁锢范围内的敌人<Yellow>3秒</>，并每秒尝试给范围内的敌人各施加1层3种毒素，身处毒池内时，移动速度降低<Yellow>50%</>，毒池最多影响<Yellow>10</>人。\n三种毒素具体效果如下：\n\n<Yellow>麻痹毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>攻击速度，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的滞涩状态；\n<Yellow>虚弱毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>攻击力，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的沉默状态；\n<Yellow>疲劳毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>移动速度，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的减速50%状态。"] = "<Yellow>Poison Mist Filling</>: When the carrier is attacked by an enemy within 8 meters, there is a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of causing them to be randomly infected with one of 3 toxins, lasting <Yellow>8 seconds</>, with each toxin stacking up to <Yellow>5 layers</>. The poisoning effect can trigger at most once every 0.5 seconds, and at most once every 2 seconds for a single target. \n<Yellow>Toxin Infection</>: After carrying this Запечатанный артефакт for 5 minutes, you enter the <Yellow>Toxin into Bone</> state. When the carrier dies in this state, they leave behind a poison pool lasting <Yellow>10 seconds</>. When the poison pool appears, there is a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of Imprisonment on enemies within the range for <Yellow>3 seconds</>, and it attempts to apply 1 layer of each of the 3 toxins to enemies in the range every second. While in the poison pool, Скорость бега is reduced by <Yellow>50%</>, and the poison pool affects at most <Yellow>10</> people. \nThe specific effects of the three toxins are as follows: \n\n<Yellow>Paralytic Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> Скорость атаки, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second Stagnation state; \n<Yellow>Weakening Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> Attack, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second Silence state; \n<Yellow>Fatigue Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> Скорость бега, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second 50% Slow state.",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 恐惧技能buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Horror Skill Buff",
    ["【增强】每秒恢复<HighLight>4</>点生命值。"] = "[Enhanced] Restores <HighLight>4</> Health per second.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Archer Knight】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["trigger6号"] = "Trigger No. 6",
    ["{{\"Resource name of the %ind button\", \"Corresponding Skill ID\", \"Corresponding keyboard key (can only be Q/W/E/R/A/S/D/F)\"}}"] = "{{\"Resource name of the %ind button\", \"Corresponding Skill ID\", \"Corresponding keyboard key (can only be Q/W/E/R/A/S/D/F)\"}}",
    ["“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "«Я вспомню те сны, которые мы вместе исследовали, вспомню каждый случай Потустороннего или Запечатанный Артефакт, который когда-то беспокоил нас, вспомню направление ветра, а также форму и цвет луны».",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Magician】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Tingen who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat..."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Фокусник】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Тинген who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...",
    ["【浅见】死亡侵蚀期间目标获得66%重伤。"] = "[Insight] During Death Erosion, the target gains 66% Grievous Injury.",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】屏障碎片-彩窗"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Фрагмент Барьера – Витраж",
    ["\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" corresponds to the Sequence 4 Despair Witch Beyonder characteristic, which is easier to solve than the Sequence 1 \"Knowledge Crown\"."] = "\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" corresponds to the Последовательность 4 Despair Witch Потусторонний characteristic, which is easier to solve than the Последовательность 1 \"Knowledge Crown\".",
    ["　　新生者，再次新生。\n　　这是他的第二十次噩梦，他已经在梦中死去十九次。\n　　这一次，他翻开了不该出现在此地的安提哥努斯笔记，死于污染后的失控。\n　　新生者，再次新生。\n　　这是他的第二十一次新生，他路过安提哥努斯笔记，带走了一张⬛⬛牌。\n　　……\n　　……\n　　新生者来到了开满鲜花的祭坛旁，他/她必须做点什么，他/她的内心有搞清楚一切真相的渴求。\n　　他/她观察了祭坛，获得了一张记载着滑稽言语的羊皮纸。\n　　羊皮纸上记录着一首规则之书。”"] = "Новорожденный, рожденный свыше. \n Это его двадцатый кошмар; он уже девятнадцать раз умирал во сне. \n На этот раз он открыл Блокнот Антигона, который не должен был здесь появиться, и умер от потери контроля после порчи. \n Новорожденный, рожденный свыше. \n Это его двадцать первое перерождение; он прошел мимо Записной книжки Антигона и забрал ⬛⬛ карточку. \n ... \n ... \n Новорожденный пришёл к алтарю, полному цветов; он/она должен что-то сделать. У него/нее есть желание выяснить всю правду. \n Он/она осмотрел алтарь и получил кусок пергамента, на котором были записаны забавные слова. \n На пергаменте записана «Книга правил».",
    ["“正义”小姐馈赠的精致钱包，能够带来潜意识和心灵的守护，抵御部分非凡伤害。但负面效果是……产生强烈的花钱冲动！"] = "An exquisite wallet gifted by Miss Justice, capable of bringing subconscious and spiritual protection, resisting some Потусторонний damage. But the negative effect is... generating a strong urge to spend money!",
    ["{\n \"None\": \"\", \n \"Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Pull\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stagger\": \"HitStiff\" \n}"] = "{\n \"None\": \"\", \n \"Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Pull\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stagger\": \"HitStiff\" \n}",
    ["[Permanent Trigger] Collectible"] = "[Permanent Trigger] Collectible",
    ["Move:疯狂转圈"] = "Move: Spin crazily.",
    ["<Team_Target> [Help] Requiem Request </> My sanity is too low, requesting <Chat_Highlight> Requiem Poetry Society </> members to assist me in restoring tranquility."] = "<Team_Target> [Help] Requiem Request </> My Рассудок is too low, requesting <Chat_Highlight> Requiem Poetry Society </> members to assist me in restoring tranquility.",
    ["<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The carrier gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a holding limit of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing the carrier causes to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own Max HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 layers of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 6 seconds, and 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</> is gained, with a holding limit of 3. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consume 1 layer per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the carrier takes damage, if HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of Max HP."] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The carrier gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a holding limit of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing the carrier causes to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own Max HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 layers of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 6 seconds, and 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</> is gained, with a holding limit of 3. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consume 1 layer per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the carrier takes damage, if HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of Max HP.",
    ["[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter Any 1, Add Buff"] = "[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter Any 1, Add Buff",
    ["　　Life is too <Letter_RedBig>hard</>. For poor people like us, we seem to be born just to toil.\n　　If we don't toil, once we finish today's meal, we have to worry about where tomorrow's will come from.\n　　If we are lucky and the factory gives me a chance to work, once today's work is done, I have to worry about tomorrow's work.\n　　When it's cold, sores grow on my hands, <Letter_RedBig>sores</> that slowly freeze away my flesh.\n　　When it's hot, cotton fibers drill into my lungs, making me cough out my <Letter_RedBig>soul</> bit by bit.\n　　For someone like me, tomorrow is a burden.\n　　\"Candle of Eternal Darkness, Indestructible Body,\" I want to ignore everything, not care about anything... and just fall asleep."] = "Жизнь слишком <Letter_RedBig>hard</>. Для таких бедных людей, как мы, мы, кажется, рождены только для того, чтобы трудиться.\n　　Если мы не трудимся, то, закончив сегодняшнюю еду, нам приходится беспокоиться о том, откуда придет завтрашняя.\n　　Если нам повезет и фабрика даст мне возможность работать, то, как только сегодняшняя работа будет сделана, мне придется беспокоиться о завтрашней работе.\n　　Когда холодно, на моих руках растут язвы, <Letter_RedBig>раны</>, которые медленно замораживают мою плоть.\n　　Когда жарко, хлопковые волокна проникают в мои легкие, заставляя меня постепенно откашливать мою <Letter_RedBig>душу</>.\n　　Для кого-то вроде меня завтрашний день - это бремя.\n　　\"Свеча вечной тьмы, нерушимое тело\", я хочу игнорировать все, ни о чем не заботиться... и просто упасть спит.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n Dominator's Clash is a team competition mode where you can form a team of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering, all players receive <Highlight> fair </> attribute adjustments, and <Highlight> Sealed Artifacts are standardized to \"Level 3\" </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n Once in the mode, players who die <Highlight> cannot </> be resurrected by the Spectator <Highlight> pathway </>. Players must defeat all members of the enemy team or have higher damage output within the time limit to win the match."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n Dominator's Clash is a team competition mode where you can form a team of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering, all players receive <Highlight> fair </> attribute adjustments, and <Highlight> Запечатанный артефактs are standardized to \"Level 3\" </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n Once in the mode, players who die <Highlight> cannot </> be resurrected by the Зритель <Highlight> pathway </>. Players must defeat all members of the enemy team or have higher damage output within the time limit to win the match.",
    ["To 占卜家\n    愿你的灵摆永远指向\n    正确的方向。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "Чтобы видеть\n Пусть ваш маятник всегда указывает\n в правильном направлении. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["\"The ultimate of depravity, the rebellious monarch, the final decree that governs all disorder.\" Welcome to the [Black Emperor] faction! Gentlemen, it is time to start the war!"] = "«Высшая степень разврата, мятежный монарх, последний указ, управляющий любым беспорядком». Добро пожаловать во фракцию [Черного Императора]! Господа, пора начинать войну!",
    ["Speaking of which, before leaving Lenburg, I was always researching kiwifruit. After all, you gain magical Beyonder powers after one bite. If it could be mass-produced, could it be used when fighting the Church of Knowledge? \n \n \n Okay, let's plant kiwifruit! \n \n \n The planting and cultivation record will use the title I used before: \n \"Effects of 'Earth Mother' Faith Rituals on Species Variation: A Case Study of Kiwifruit with Different Beyonder Abilities\""] = "Кстати говоря, перед отъездом из Ленбурга я всегда исследовал киви. В конце концов, после одного укуса вы получаете магические силы Потустороннего. Если бы его можно было производить массово, можно ли было бы использовать его в борьбе с Церковью Знания? \n \n \n Хорошо, давайте посадим киви! \n \n \n В записи о посадке и выращивании будет использовано то же название, которое я использовал ранее: \n «Влияние ритуалов веры «Матери-Земли» на разнообразие видов: пример киви с различными потусторонними способностями»",
    ["<P_Heart>(chuckles softly)</>Tired? I've been watching you... Watching you struggle to stay awake is truly heartbreaking."] = "<P_Heart> (тихо посмеивается) </>TУстал? Я наблюдал за тобой... Наблюдать за тем, как ты изо всех сил пытаешься не заснуть, действительно душераздирающе.",
    ["【幸运悖论】的作用，灵性充盈时能挡子爵夫人的致命一击。"] = "The effect of [Paradox of Luck]: When Духовность is full, it can block the Viscountess's critical hit.",
    ["BOSS 4 - Quality - Right attack"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — Правильная атака",
    ["<Red>Lingering Fear</>: Within 10 seconds after the Frame effect ends, Damage Reduction is lowered by 10%. During the Cooldown period after continuously triggering Danger Intuition, control hit and control resistance are reduced. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Lingering Fear</>: Within 10 seconds after the Frame effect ends, Снижение урона is lowered by 10%. During the Перезарядка period after continuously triggering Danger Intuition, control hit and control resistance are reduced. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【占】玩家对受伤的子爵夫人开枪，绝望魔镜替子爵夫人挡住致命的子弹。\n绝望魔镜：唔……再见……海伦……娜……"] = "[Placeholder] The player fires at the injured Viscountess, and the Magic Mirror of Despair blocks the fatal bullet for her.\n Magic Mirror of Despair: Ugh... goodbye... Helena...",
    ["ASASkillAsset监听是否触发被掩护Buff"] = "ASASkillAsset отслеживает, срабатывает ли бафф «Покрытие».",
    ["<P_Heart>（那种被注视的感觉没有消失，非凡者能跑的比马车还快？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Ощущение, что за тобой наблюдают, не исчезло. Может ли Потусторонний бежать быстрее кареты?)</>",
    ["Tab轮选测试配置-距离优先（退化1）-奶妈"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет расстояния (пониженный 1) — Целитель",
    ["“What happened?” Klein’s heart skipped a beat. \n He was afraid that this crazy “Hybridizer’s” experiment had gone wrong, causing the people on the Future to fall into a terrifying ecological disaster. \n Frank shook his head dully and said: \n “Didn’t I tell you about those little things? \n They originally needed to slumber for a period of time before they could grow and reproduce, but as a result…” \n “As a result of what?” Klein’s expression had become grave. \n Frank, who was squatting, looked up and said: \n “They just completed large-scale reproduction, and a mutation occurred. \n This, this is simply a miracle!” \n “Then what? Where did they go? Are they still in your ‘laboratory’?” Klein intuitively felt that this was not a good thing. \n Frank took two seconds to digest the question, rolled up his sleeves, and revealed his hairy arms. \n He knocked on the deck in front of him and said with a puzzled smile. \n “They drilled in here, it seems they are, they are modifying the Future…” \n Amidst the dull knocking sound, a milky white fountain suspected to be milk suddenly gushed out from the deck, splashing Frank Lee all over his head and face. \n He licked the liquid by his mouth and said in surprise: \n “The Future, the Future is producing milk!” \n \n —— Volume 3: Traveler, Chapter 174: Crazy Mutation"] = "“What happened?” Klein’s heart skipped a beat. \n He was afraid that this crazy “Hybridizer’s” experiment had gone wrong, causing the people on the Future to fall into a terrifying ecological disaster. \n Frank shook his head dully and said: \n “Didn’t I tell you about those little things? \n They originally needed to slumber for a period of time before they could grow and reproduce, but as a result…” \n “As a result of what?” Klein’s expression had become grave. \n Frank, who was squatting, looked up and said: \n “They just completed large-scale reproduction, and a mutation occurred. \n This, this is simply a miracle!” \n “Then what? Where did they go? Are they still in your ‘laboratory’?” Klein intuitively felt that this was not a good thing. \n Frank took two seconds to digest the question, rolled up his sleeves, and revealed his hairy arms. \n He knocked on the deck in front of him and said with a puzzled smile. \n “They drilled in here, it seems they are, they are modifying the Future…” \n Amidst the dull knocking sound, a milky white fountain suspected to be milk suddenly gushed out from the deck, splashing Frank Lee all over his head and face. \n He licked the liquid by his mouth and said in surprise: \n “The Future, the Future is producing milk!” \n \n —— Volume 3: Traveler, Chapter 174: Crazy Mutation",
    ["“赛琳娜·伍德偶然间、巧合地从她的神秘学老师海纳斯处看到了魔镜占卜的真正咒文……\n大胆的尝试恰好遇上了克莱恩，后者成功解决了这起超凡案件……"] = "\"Selina Wood accidentally and coincidentally saw the true incantation for mirror Гадание from her occult teacher, Haines... \n Her bold attempt happened to encounter Klein, and the latter successfully solved this Потусторонний case...",
    ["【塔罗学院氛围】屏障碎片-彩窗"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Barrier Fragment - Stained Glass",
    ["[Enhanced] Gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>30%</> Max Health for <HighLight>8</> seconds at the start of combat."] = "[Enhanced] Gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>30%</> Max Health for <HighLight>8</> seconds at the start of combat.",
