    ["HP<60%触发50%最大生命护盾"] = "Trigger 50% Max Health Shield when HP < 60%",
    ["【塔罗会·西尔维娅】档5增量(+25%)→累计165%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["【施工中】队伍中序列种类数目等于6玩家属性提升"] = "[Under Construction] Player attributes increased when the number of Последовательность types in the party equals 6.",
    ["I knew it, {{先生|女士}}, you look like the kind of person who cares about health, so naturally you would mind those vegetables watered with industrial wastewater."] = "I knew it, {{sir|madam}}, you look like the kind of person who cares about health, so naturally you would mind those vegetables watered with industrial wastewater.",
    ["[Acting Mission · Seer] Bring Your Dear One"] = "[Acting Mission · Провидец] Bring Your Dear One",
