    ["【文字】生命"] = "[Text] Health",
    ["<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\"> On the stained note, only a few lines of legible text remain: </>\n \"I finally understand...\" \n \"The first round is <Letter_Highlight_HW> Number Two </>! Number Two is <Letter_Highlight_HW> real </>!\" \n \"The Messenger of Desire told the <Letter_Highlight_HW> truth </>, but we will still die—\" \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\"> The handwriting breaks off </>, <Hide id=\"#157\"> followed by a smeared dark stain. </>"] = "<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\"> On the stained note, only a few lines of legible text remain: </>\n \"I finally understand...\" \n \"The first round is <Letter_Highlight_HW> Number Two </>! Number Two is <Letter_Highlight_HW> real </>!\" \n \"The Messenger of Desire told the <Letter_Highlight_HW> truth </>, but we will still die—\" \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\"> The handwriting breaks off </>, <Hide id=\"#157\"> followed by a smeared dark stain. </>",
