    ["A three-stage combo that pacifies the minds of allies, each stage restoring *d/*d/*d Health to allied targets. \n Only available in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Consciousness Shock </> in <HighLight> Nightmare Stance </>."] = "A three-stage combo that pacifies the minds of allies, each stage restoring *d/*d/*d Health to allied targets. \n Only available in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Consciousness Shock </> in <HighLight> Кошмар Stance </>.",
