    ["An attempt... let's try it, the feeling of mastering Beyonder powers."] = "An attempt... let's try it, the feeling of mastering Потусторонний powers.",
    ["一旦成为天使，自身将不可避免地被非凡特性影响，越来越冷酷，越来越残忍，越来越漠视生命，因此必须有足够的锚，通用的锚是凡人的信仰。"] = "Once one becomes an Angel, they are inevitably affected by their Потусторонний characteristic, becoming increasingly cold, cruel, and indifferent to life. Therefore, one must have sufficient anchors, and the universal anchor is the faith of mortals.",
