    ["不瞒你说，我略懂些灵摆占卜和塔罗占卜。 "] = "To be honest, I know a little bit about Pendulum Гадание and Tarot Гадание.",
    ["I wonder which Pathway this Beyonder belongs to; they are so outstanding!"] = "I wonder which Pathway this Потусторонний belongs to; they are so outstanding!",
    ["【秘偶技】河豚子弹LV1"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Pufferfish Bullet LV1",
    ["一缕朦胧的非凡特性碎屑，握在手心的瞬间，有一股沉甸甸的重量，像是握住了某种还没说完的意志。"] = "A wisp of hazy Потусторонний characteristic fragments. The moment it is held in the palm, it carries a heavy weight, as if holding a will that has yet to be fully expressed.",
    ["一棵沉默的柏树，枝叶在风中纹丝不动。它听不懂人类的期盼，只会把那些愿望变成柏籽掉在地上。"] = "A silent cypress tree, its branches and leaves motionless in the wind. It does not understand human expectations, only turning those wishes into cypress seeds that fall to the ground.",
    ["Believer Number One - Close-Range Damage Boost Aura - No Visuals"] = "Believer Number One - Close-Range Damage Boost Aura - No Visuals",
    ["不填或填0则代表读取《技能表》里指定的标称CD值。如果在技能表内部CDType为时间轴触发时，含义为在本CD点的位置触发CD。"] = "If left blank or filled with 0, it means reading the nominal CD value specified in the 'Skill Table'. If CDType inside the skill table is triggered by the timeline, it means triggering the CD at the position of this CD point.",
