    ["【Trigger】Uninvited Poem"] = "【Trigger】Uninvited Poem",
    ["[Rumor] During the gray fog Blessing duration, each skill cast increases own Health by 4 points, triggering at most once every 2 seconds."] = "[Rumor] During the gray fog Blessing duration, each skill cast increases own Health by 4 points, triggering at most once every 2 seconds.",
    ["One-Stroke - Start Ritual"] = "One-Stroke - Start Ritual",
    ["I don't know if it's just my imagination, but ever since you arrived, the frequency of Beyonder incidents in the area seems to be skyrocketing."] = "I don't know if it's just my imagination, but ever since you arrived, the frequency of Потусторонний incidents in the area seems to be skyrocketing.",
    ["At first, I was wary of it. It would strip away the user's sanity, causing them to lose their corresponding emotional capabilities; in severe cases, they could even be corrupted or die."] = "At first, I was wary of it. It would strip away the user's Рассудок, causing them to lose their corresponding emotional capabilities; in severe cases, they could even be corrupted or die.",
