    ["下一批疯狂的猎龙帮成员即将抵达……"] = "The next batch of crazy Dragon Охотник gang members is about to arrive...",
    ["[Auto-Chess] - Giant Dragon Inheritance Bond - Dragon Breath Bonus Damage"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Giant Dragon Inheritance Bond - Dragon Breath Bonus Damage",
    ["不走技能检查，所有逻辑在单帧里执行完毕，非独立技能，可以理解为调用方（父技能、Buff）的一部分"] = "Does not go through skill checks; all logic is executed in a single frame. It is not an independent skill and can be understood as part of the caller (parent skill, Buff).",
    ["不要误撞命运同色能量！"] = "Do not collide with fate energy of the same color!",
    ["A stack of yellowed manuscripts recording meditation methods for Mystery Pryers, advanced techniques for spiritual perception, and research on the Hidden Sage."] = "A stack of yellowed manuscripts recording meditation methods for Подглядывающий за Тайнамиs, advanced techniques for spiritual perception, and research on the Hidden Sage.",
    ["One-click boost character to whale player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions."] = "One-click boost character to whale player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
    ["不要乱扔秘偶，会被追踪的。"] = "Don't throw Марионеткаs around randomly; you will be tracked.",
    ["A three-stage combo that launches mental energy attacks, each stage dealing bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id) magic damage to enemies. \n Only available in <HighLight> Nightmare Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Pacify </> in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>."] = "A three-stage combo that launches mental energy attacks, each stage dealing bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id) Магический урон to enemies. \n Only available in <HighLight> Кошмар Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Pacify </> in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>.",
    ["不再流浪的期许·污染"] = "Expectant No Longer Wandering - Искажение",
    ["【Trigger】(Left Path) Wall Collision Prompt Area"] = "【Trigger】(Left Path) Wall Collision Prompt Area",
    ["A health amulet made of gold, with sunlight patterns engraved on the edges, warm to the touch, symbolizing the blessing of the Sun."] = "A health amulet made of gold, with sunlight patterns engraved on the edges, warm to the touch, symbolizing the blessing of the Sun.",
    ["一起跳舞-中心舞阵标记buff"] = "Dance Together - Central Dance Formation Mark Buff",
    ["Generally speaking, potion formulas and ingredients, especially the main ingredients, are very expensive."] = "Generally speaking, potion formulas and ingredients, especially the main ingredients, are very expensive.",
    ["However, this notebook is currently with the Nighthawks, and... I saw in the Nighthawks' confidential documents that they didn't provide the potion names for Seer Sequence 8 and 7. Could there be some hidden secret inside?"] = "However, this notebook is currently with the Ночные Ястребы, and... I saw in the Ночные Ястребы' confidential documents that they didn't provide the potion names for Провидец Последовательность 8 and 7. Could there be some hidden secret inside?",
    ["Next Divinity Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. After players reach the Acting Level cap, the Cognitive Experience gained will be converted to continue increasing the Divinity Level. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nAfter the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be converted at a certain ratio to increase the Divinity Level. When a Beyonder's Divinity Level reaches the current cap, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Divinity Level is opened. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nBeyonders continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Beyonders will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage."] = "Next Divinity Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. After players reach the Acting Level cap, the Cognitive Experience gained will be converted to continue increasing the Divinity Level. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nAfter the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be converted at a certain ratio to increase the Divinity Level. When a Потусторонний's Divinity Level reaches the current cap, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Divinity Level is opened. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nПотустороннийs continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Потустороннийs will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage.",
