    ["A silent cypress tree, its branches and leaves motionless in the wind. It does not understand human expectations, only turning those wishes into cypress seeds that fall to the ground."] = "A silent cypress tree, its branches and leaves motionless in the wind. It does not understand human expectations, only turning those wishes into cypress seeds that fall to the ground.",
