    ["不对啊！我得到的启示是太阳升起时对着城堡鞠躬十次，丢失的物品就会自动回来。"] = "That's not right! The revelation I received was to bow to the castle ten times when the sun rises, and the lost items will automatically return.",
    ["A water-damaged missing person notice with a faded photo. \n It reads: \"Looking for my younger brother, last seen near Golden Autumn Lake Farm. If you have any clues, please contact Gray Pigeon Inn.\" \n Half of the notice has been torn off."] = "A water-damaged missing person notice with a faded photo. \n It reads: \"Looking for my younger brother, last seen near Golden Autumn Lake Farm. If you have any clues, please contact Gray Pigeon Inn.\" \n Half of the notice has been torn off.",
    ["Unforgotten Guard - Corruption"] = "Unforgotten Guard - Искажение",
    ["[Performance] Spirit Mrs. Smith 2"] = "[Performance] Spirit Mrs. Smith 2",
    ["A strange fragrance permeated the potion room, and a figure \"whooshed\" into view, looking at the potion with intoxication, completely unaware that it had been caught."] = "A strange fragrance permeated the potion room, and a figure \"whooshed\" into view, looking at the potion with intoxication, completely unaware that it had been caught.",
    ["A stele left here by someone unknown, recording several regional locations with Beyonder powers."] = "A stele left here by someone unknown, recording several regional locations with Потусторонний powers.",
    ["That's not right! The revelation I received was to bow to the castle ten times when the sun rises, and the lost items will automatically return."] = "That's not right! The revelation I received was to bow to the castle ten times when the sun rises, and the lost items will automatically return.",
    ["不论如何，我得先找个地方藏起来……要是被发现靠着魔药偷偷通宵学习的事就糟了。"] = "Anyway, I have to find a place to hide first... it would be bad if I were caught studying all night secretly relying on potions.",
