    ["一支羽毛笔书写：\n“子嗣的仪式成功了！尽管克莱恩发现了贫民区的连续死亡，但这并不影响故事的继续。"] = "A fountain pen writes: \n \"The ritual for the offspring was a success! Although Klein discovered the serial deaths in the slums, this does not affect the continuation of the story.",
    ["An iron-black revolver, one of Klein's most cherished weapons. \n Simple to operate and devastating in power, from the moment it is loaded, blood and wails become constant companions. \n In truth, Klein longed for an outcome that required no bloodshed, but reality always defied his wishes. \n Many living beings were pushed by fate beneath its muzzle. \n \"Please, spare me...\" the ugly soul begged. The figure in the tall silk hat stepped closer; Ince Zangwill stared into those brown eyes, yet saw nothing reflected within them, only the shadow of death. \n Bang! \n For whom does the death knell toll? \n The death knell tolls for him."] = "An iron-black revolver, one of Klein's most cherished weapons. \n Simple to operate and devastating in power, from the moment it is loaded, blood and wails become constant companions. \n In truth, Klein longed for an outcome that required no bloodshed, but reality always defied his wishes. \n Many living beings were pushed by fate beneath its muzzle. \n \"Please, spare me...\" the ugly soul begged. The figure in the tall silk hat stepped closer; Ince Zangwill stared into those brown eyes, yet saw nothing reflected within them, only the shadow of death. \n Bang! \n For whom does the death knell toll? \n The death knell tolls for him.",
