    ["【秘偶技】犬魂跃击-猎犬召唤物跳砸"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Hound Soul Leap - Hound Summon Jump Smash",
    ["一般来说，魔药配方和材料，尤其是主材料，都非常昂贵。"] = "Generally speaking, potion formulas and ingredients, especially the main ingredients, are very expensive.",
    ["【超凡生物】棋子造成的伤害提高<HighLight>50%</>；参战<HighLight>4</>个玩家对战回合后，额外获得<HighLight>25%</>伤害减免。"] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>50%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>25%</> Снижение урона.",
    ["不要介意，我只是喜欢这个，但我的占卜和解读有时候都挺准，真的……"] = "Don't mind it; I just enjoy this, but my Гаданиеs and interpretations are sometimes quite accurate, really...",
