    ["一只海精灵怒气冲冲地出现了，难以置信在比拼运气上自己居然输了，然而当它出现的时候，它才是真的输了。"] = "A Sea Spirit appeared in a rage, unable to believe that it had actually lost in a luck competition. However, the moment it appeared, it had truly lost.",
