    ["不好，是被那个女孩困在了这个城堡吗，得设法离开！"] = "Oh no, am I trapped in this castle by that girl? I must find a way to leave!",
    ["Three waves of Spirit World Bombardment deal <HighLight>140%/140%/280%</> attack damage respectively; the first wave pulls, and the second reduces attack by 15%."] = "Three waves of Spirit World Bombardment deal <HighLight>140%/140%/280%</> attack damage respectively; the first wave pulls, and the second reduces attack by 15%.",
    ["The divination you did for Anna last time has already spread throughout the club."] = "The Гадание you did for Anna last time has already spread throughout the club.",
    ["[Auto Chess] - Derrick - Ally Healing"] = "[Auto Chess] - Derrick - Ally Healing",
    ["一定是<P_Yellow>赛琳娜</>寄来的，她说过要邀请我们一家人去参加晚宴，还说学习了新占卜要展示给我看。"] = "It must be from <P_Yellow>Selena</>. She said she wanted to invite our family to a dinner party and also said she learned a new Гадание to show me.",
    ["一笔画-启动仪式魔法"] = "One-Stroke Drawing - Start Ritual Magic",
    ["三费战团：攻击速度+5%。"] = "Three-Cost Battle Group: Скорость атаки +5%.",
    ["不良的生活严重影响了他的健康，看来需要作为心理医生对他进行干预了。"] = "His poor lifestyle has severely affected his health. It seems I need to intervene as his Психиатр.",
    ["[Secret Lore] Recovery amount increased by 10%, not exceeding 24% of the caster's Max HP."] = "[Secret Lore] Recovery amount increased by 10%, not exceeding 24% of the caster's Max HP.",
    ["【秘偶技】-放逐-光环"] = "【Марионетка Skill】 - Exile - Aura",
    ["一个质感厚重的小箱子，里面装着一些奇异的材料：银色花纹的锡罐、装着黑色粉末的试管、深色小瓶等等。材料们摆得整整齐齐，箱子上有写着“占卜家魔药材料”的标签。"] = "A heavy, sturdy small box containing some strange materials: tin cans with silver patterns, test tubes filled with black powder, dark vials, and more. The materials are arranged neatly, and the box has a label that reads \"Провидец Potion Materials.\"",
    ["一键连招开关"] = "One-click combo switch",
    ["A wealthy merchant has entrusted you with finding her missing daughter, Oros. The clues point to a mysterious tea party held only at midnight. You find the venue, and after drinking a special tea, you find you can understand cat-speak. You bribe the kittens with scratches to lead you to the host of the tea party. After talking, you discover that the Oros you struggled so hard to find is the host herself—a potion genius who is chasing freedom and fleeing her vampire family."] = "A wealthy merchant has entrusted you with finding her missing daughter, Oros. The clues point to a mysterious tea party held only at midnight. You find the venue, and after drinking a special tea, you find you can understand cat-speak. You bribe the kittens with scratches to lead you to the host of the tea party. After talking, you discover that the Oros you struggled so hard to find is the host herself—a potion genius who is chasing freedom and fleeing her vampire family.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Baboon Blessing - Squad Random Buff LV3"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Baboon Blessing - Squad Random Buff LV3",
    ["不要伤害她！"] = "Don't hurt her!",
    ["一股神奇的冲动促使你迫切地想要尝试下。 “去拿起来试试吧”他说, 恶魔的语言在你心底挠痒痒"] = "A magical urge compels you to desperately want to try it. 'Go pick it up and try,' he says, the devil's language tickling your heart.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Hound Charge LV1"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Hound Charge LV1",
    ["下一扮演等级解锁时间：<Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>认知经验获取</>\n足够的认知有利于扮演的推进。完成主线、支线、时代与漫游任务，以及参与各类日常玩法（包括<Yellow>轻松躺赢、以战养战、世界冒险</>等），均可获得大量认知经验。当你重历“愚者”先生的历史时，受“嫁接”的力量影响，同样可以获取属于自己的那份认知经验。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>等级限制规则</>\n当非凡者的扮演等级达到当前上限，且认知经验已满时，将无法继续获取认知经验。直到开放新的扮演等级限制，方可继续提升。当扮演等级提升至最终上限后，继续积累的认知经验将用于开启神性等级——超越限度的认知，人性将越来越淡薄，离神越来越近。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>扮演中的人性与神性</>\n“万物皆有神性，当扮演超出限度，你将逐步走向最初的神性。”\n非凡者通过日常的体验、任务与探索，不断接受关于这个世界的认知，并将其转化为<Yellow>认知经验</>。积累认知经验，可逐步提升自我的<Yellow>扮演等级</>，通过扮演以巩固精神与存在的稳定性。\n然而，认知与扮演本身蕴含风险，扮演的每一步也在支付着代价。当扮演等级提升至最终上限后，人性将无法维持扮演带来的影响——后续的扮演将开始塑造神性。非凡者将在扮演中逐步走向神性，从而提升<Yellow>神性等级</>。\n为防止短时间内接收过量认知导致精神崩溃，您被“愚者”先生赋予了限制等级的保护性祝福。在当前的扮演等级或神性等级下，身体与精神必须经历足够的适应与沉淀，方能突破等级限制，承受更高层次的认知，迈向下一阶段。"] = "Next Acting Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nWhen a Потусторонний's Acting Level reaches the current cap and Cognitive Experience is full, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Acting Level limit is opened. After the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be used to unlock Divinity Level—cognition beyond the limit makes humanity increasingly faint, bringing you closer to God. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nПотустороннийs continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Потустороннийs will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage.",
    ["下午<InvHighlight>两点五十五分</>，管家正在餐厅整理银器，听见卧室里传来男女主人的争吵声。\n<InvHighlight>三点</>左右，他亲眼看到男爵夫人离开卧室。\n随后，霍克斯男爵感到心脏不适，呼唤管家进入书房送药。管家两分钟后离开。\n<InvHighlight>三点二十分</>左右，管家去找霍克斯男爵，发现霍克斯男爵始终没有回应，于是叫人一起撞开房门。\n霍克斯男爵倒在书桌旁，地上是打翻的茶。"] = "At 2:55 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler was in the dining room organizing the silverware when he heard the master and mistress arguing in the bedroom. </>\nAround 3:00 PM <InvHighlight>, he saw the Baroness leave the bedroom with his own eyes. </>Shortly after, Baron Hawkes felt discomfort in his heart and called for the butler to enter the study to deliver medicine. The butler left two minutes later. \n\nAround 3:20 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler went to find Baron Hawkes and discovered that he was not responding, so he called for others to help him break down the door. </>Baron Hawkes was lying next to the desk with spilled tea on the floor. \n",
    ["However—you have the favor of Mr. Fool. Completing the ritual under the protection and gaze of a powerful deity, nothing will go wrong."] = "However—you have the favor of Mr. Fool. Completing the ritual under the protection and gaze of a powerful deity, nothing will go wrong.",
    ["Don't hurt her!"] = "Don't hurt her!",
    ["不过，你是怎么摆脱封印物影响的？你只是个普通人，却在迷雾中找到了正确的方向。"] = "However, how did you get rid of the influence of the Запечатанный артефакт? You are just an ordinary person, yet you found the correct direction in the fog.",
    ["One Pot Sweep - Rotten Tomato - Apply Trap BUFF to Self"] = "One Pot Sweep - Rotten Tomato - Apply Trap BUFF to Self",
    ["不用紧张，这是一种“入学仪式”。让我们通过这种方式，增进彼此的了解。"] = "Don't be nervous, this is a kind of \"entrance ceremony.\" Let us use this method to increase our mutual understanding.",
    ["Once this happens, your Beyonder powers cannot be used normally and stably, and you will face serious danger."] = "Once this happens, your Потусторонний powers cannot be used normally and stably, and you will face serious danger.",
    ["[Rumor] Grasp of Death generates a Ritual Magic at the target's location, dealing 3 hits of damage, with the damage increasing each time."] = "[Rumor] Grasp of Death generates a Ritual Magic at the target's location, dealing 3 hits of damage, with the damage increasing each time.",
    ["一个被诡异力量侵蚀的宝箱，正等待净化。完成仪式，驱散污染，看看里面究竟藏着什么。"] = "A treasure chest eroded by strange power is waiting to be purified. Complete the ritual, dispel the Искажение, and see what is hidden inside.",
    ["【秘偶技】隐匿刺击LV5"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Hidden Stab LV5",
    ["【自走棋】-\"审判官\"布莱克-裂地子技能"] = "[Auto Chess] - \"Inquisitor\" Blake - Ground Fracture Sub-skill",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-烈阳颂歌-伤害"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Solar Anthem - Damage",
    ["It's not that I wanted to sing; it was a requirement of the potion. To digest the 'Sea King' potion, one must sing at sea, using the voice to trigger storms."] = "It's not that I wanted to sing; it was a requirement of the potion. To digest the 'Sea King' potion, one must sing at sea, using the voice to trigger storms.",
    ["【秘偶技】幻化身形"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Phantom Form",
    ["[Secret] Damage of Grasp of Death. increased by an additional 30%."] = "[Secret] Damage of Grasp of Death. increased by an additional 30%.",
    ["Three-Cost Battle Group: Max Health +300, Attack Speed +25%."] = "Three-Cost Battle Group: Max Health +300, Скорость атаки +25%.",
    ["No, no, no, if you light it, it will disappear, and disappearance is death."] = "No, no, no, if you light it, it will disappear, and disappearance is death.",
    ["【秘偶技】命运湍流二段-白"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Fate Turbulence Second Stage - White",
    ["【秘偶技】命运湍流一段-黑"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Fate Turbulence First Stage - Black",
    ["Trinity Target Buff - Error"] = "Trinity Target Buff - Error",
    ["一张画着生日蛋糕的贺卡，上面写着一行生日\n祝福，如同一句尚未说破的密语。\n\n“<P_Yellow>生日快乐</>，健康成长——爱你的，哥哥。”\n\n贺卡背面用赫密斯文写下了鲜红的文字：\n<P_Red>“噩梦！拒绝……逃离！拒绝……逃……”</>"] = "A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday \n blessings written on it, like a secret code that hasn't been spoken yet.\n\n\"<P_Yellow>Happy Birthday</>, grow up healthy—Love, your brother.\"\n\nOn the back of the card, bright red words are written in Hermes:\n<P_Red>\"Кошмар! Refuse... escape! Refuse... escape...\"</>",
    ["不处于途径转换的冷却期"] = "Not in the Перезарядка period for pathway conversion",
    ["一键将角色提升到大R玩家的属性，并解锁系统，提升序列，添加药品。"] = "One-click boost character to whale player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
    ["To be honest, I know a little bit about Pendulum Divination and Tarot Divination."] = "To be honest, I know a little bit about Pendulum Гадание and Tarot Гадание.",
    ["A huge trigger with parameters removed"] = "A huge trigger with parameters removed",
    ["一种特殊的材料，能够作为调配魔药的基底，此为众人觊觎的财富，无人不争。"] = "A special material that can serve as a base for concocting potions; this is wealth coveted by all, which everyone fights for.",
    ["Triple Jump - Spell Proxy"] = "Triple Jump - Spell Proxy",
    ["[Hidden] Targets affected by the Beacon's Shield Explosion take Burn damage every second for 4 seconds."] = "[Hidden] Targets affected by the Beacon's Shield Explosion take Burn damage every second for 4 seconds.",
    ["【隐迹】明灯的护盾爆炸影响到的目标每秒受到灼烧伤害，持续4秒。"] = "[Hidden] Targets affected by the Beacon's Shield Explosion take Burn damage every second for 4 seconds.",
    ["【采集】风车-灵性之墙"] = "[Collection] Windmill - Wall of Духовность",
    ["一旦进入战斗，厄运布偶就会伺机作祟。技能命中敌人时，布偶会附身到他身上，降低其防御与抗暴击，并随你切换目标转移。它回到你身上时，厄运便由你承担。"] = "Once entering battle, the Misfortune Doll will wait for an opportunity to cause trouble. When a skill hits an enemy, the doll will possess them, reducing their Defense and critical resistance, and transfer as you Switch targets. When it returns to you, you bear the misfortune.",
    ["Next Acting Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nWhen a Beyonder's Acting Level reaches the current cap and Cognitive Experience is full, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Acting Level limit is opened. After the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be used to unlock Divinity Level—cognition beyond the limit makes humanity increasingly faint, bringing you closer to God. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nBeyonders continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Beyonders will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage."] = "Next Acting Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nWhen a Потусторонний's Acting Level reaches the current cap and Cognitive Experience is full, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Acting Level limit is opened. After the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be used to unlock Divinity Level—cognition beyond the limit makes humanity increasingly faint, bringing you closer to God. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nПотустороннийs continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Потустороннийs will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-回旋斩击"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Spinning Slash",
    ["【Trigger】Company Entrance Grumbling"] = "【Trigger】Company Entrance Grumbling",
    ["【秘辛】削弱技能抵挡、滞涩效果的持续时间增加1秒。"] = "[Secret] Duration of the Блок навыков and Stagnation weakening effects increased by 1 second.",
    ["【秘偶技】子爵夫人幽灵-死亡随机选目标-第2次"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Viscountess Ghost - Death Random Target Selection - 2nd Time",
    ["不可通过Action的方式手动配置，该Action是程序处理技能表里的后摇配置时，自动生成所依托的模板Action（类似DoFightAction）"] = "Cannot be manually configured via Action; this Action is a template Action (similar to DoFightAction) automatically generated when the program processes the post-swing configuration in the skill table.",
    ["不过，不少野生非凡者很忌惮他们，所以记得隐蔽身份。"] = "However, many wild Потустороннийs are wary of them, so remember to conceal your identity.",
    ["The three-part honorific name is not just a name, it is closer to a divine gaze, a spell of summoning."] = "The three-part honorific name is not just a name, it is closer to a divine gaze, a spell of summoning.",
    ["【秘偶技】骑士守护LV3-减伤效果提升"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Knight Guard LV3 - Снижение урона Effect Increase",
    ["【金秋湖-困难】-德鲁伊-点治疗分散"] = "[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark Healer for Dispersion",
    ["一年晋升序列8，再一年序列7，三年到序列6，是非常有天赋的非凡者。"] = "Advancing to Последовательность 8 in one year, Последовательность 7 in another, and Последовательность 6 in three years—that is a very talented Потусторонний.",
    ["一位富商委托你寻找她失踪的女儿欧洛斯，线索指向只在午夜举办的神秘茶会。你找到会场，喝下特殊的茶后，竟能听懂猫言咪语。你用挠痒痒贿赂了小猫，让它们带你去找茶会的主人。交谈后你发现，苦苦寻找到的欧洛斯，竟是茶会主人本人——一位追逐自由，逃离血族家族的魔药天才。"] = "A wealthy merchant has entrusted you with finding her missing daughter, Oros. The clues point to a mysterious tea party held only at midnight. You find the venue, and after drinking a special tea, you find you can understand cat-speak. You bribe the kittens with scratches to lead you to the host of the tea party. After talking, you discover that the Oros you struggled so hard to find is the host herself—a potion genius who is chasing freedom and fleeing her vampire family.",
    ["Three-Cost Battle Group: Attack Speed +5%."] = "Three-Cost Battle Group: Скорость атаки +5%.",
    ["不要直接在最下面加新buff"] = "Do not add new buffs directly at the bottom",
    ["不眠者途径 | 序列9“不眠者”"] = "Бессонный Pathway | Последовательность 9 \"Бессонный\"",
    ["A card containing vast spirituality. The holder can use this medium to communicate with the Spirit World, exchange luck and fate, and obtain treasures from the Spirit World."] = "A card containing vast Духовность. The holder can use this medium to communicate with the Spirit World, exchange luck and fate, and obtain treasures from the Spirit World.",
    ["一个被诡异力量侵蚀的宝箱，正等待净化。"] = "A treasure chest eroded by strange power, awaiting purification.",
    ["【秘辛】回复量增加10%，不超过施法者血量上限24%。"] = "[Secret Lore] Recovery amount increased by 10%, not exceeding 24% of the caster's Max HP.",
    ["【表演】灵体凯瑟琳"] = "[Performance] Spirit Catherine",
    ["[Evernight Goddess] executes enemy targets with Health below <HighLight>18%</>."] = "[Evernight Goddess] executes enemy targets with Health below <HighLight>18%</>.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Nebula Slash - Full Tier Charged Version"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Nebula Slash - Full Tier Charged Version",
    ["【秘偶技】河豚子弹LV5"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Pufferfish Bullet LV5",
    ["【自走棋】-梅林-区域友军护盾"] = "[Auto Chess] - Merlin - Area Ally Shield",
    ["三脚猫占卜师满地乱跑，我只想要真正可靠的占卜家……"] = "Amateur diviners are running around everywhere; I only want a truly reliable Провидец...",
    ["一定要打断皮特的仪式！"] = "Must interrupt Pete's ritual!",
    ["一张塔罗牌浮现在半空中"] = "A Tarot card floats in mid-air",
    ["【秘偶技】骑士守护LV1"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Knight Guard LV1",
    ["【黑夜女神】斩杀生命值低于<HighLight>12%</>的敌方目标"] = "[Evernight Goddess] executes enemy targets with Health below <HighLight>12%</>.",
    ["Buff conditions not met; cannot cast this skill."] = "Buff conditions not met; cannot cast this skill.",
    ["A complete ritual of prayer. Whether it was heard belongs to the realm of the unknowable."] = "A complete ritual of prayer. Whether it was heard belongs to the realm of the unknowable.",
    ["三烛仪式"] = "Three-Candle Ritual",
    ["【采集】生命"] = "[Collect] Health",
    ["A **strange** toilet. Its previous owner clearly conducted some kind of ritual here. The results of the ritual remain inside, emitting a **weird** odor, and it refuses to be acknowledged by civilized society."] = "A **strange** toilet. Its previous owner clearly conducted some kind of ritual here. The results of the ritual remain inside, emitting a **weird** odor, and it refuses to be acknowledged by civilized society.",
    ["[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark Dispersion without Sharing Buff"] = "[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark Dispersion without Sharing Buff",
    ["[Auto-Chess] - Susie - Area Ally Healing"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Susie - Area Ally Healing",
    ["一张被水浸过的寻人启事，贴着褪色的照片。\n上面写着：\"寻找我弟弟，最后出现在金秋湖农场附近。如有线索请联系灰鸽旅馆。\"\n启事边缘被人撕掉了一半。"] = "A water-damaged missing person notice with a faded photo. \n It reads: \"Looking for my younger brother, last seen near Golden Autumn Lake Farm. If you have any clues, please contact Gray Pigeon Inn.\" \n Half of the notice has been torn off.",
    ["[Rumor] After completing the Fortune-Turning Ritual., release Historical Beacon to surrounding allies, granting them a small Shield for 10 seconds and the Historical Beacon mark."] = "[Rumor] After completing the Fortune-Turning Ritual., release Historical Beacon to surrounding allies, granting them a small Shield for 10 seconds and the Historical Beacon mark.",
    ["不要，非凡者很危险，你做文职吧。"] = "No, Потустороннийs are dangerous, you should do clerical work.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-日冕裁决"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Corona Verdict",
    ["[Evernight Goddess] executes enemy targets with Health below <HighLight>12%</>."] = "[Evernight Goddess] executes enemy targets with Health below <HighLight>12%</>.",
    ["[Auto-Chess] - Megose - Basic Attack - Mourning Shock"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Megose - Базовая атака - Mourning Shock",
    ["In case they really are out-of-control Beyonders... better go take a look."] = "In case they really are out-of-control Потустороннийs... better go take a look.",
    ["【自走棋】-巨龙传承羁绊-全屏伤害700"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Giant Dragon Inheritance Bond - Full-screen Damage 700",
    ["【浅见】释放通灵仪式时（仅释放瞬间）驱散范围内友方身上的减速效果。"] = "[Insight] When releasing the Spirit Mediumship Ritual (only at the moment of release), dispel Slow effects on allies within range.",
    ["一号信徒_延迟伤害buff"] = "Believer Number One_Delayed damage buff",
    ["Unexplained humming... missing students... my spiritual intuition tells me that these seem to be connected..."] = "Unexplained humming... missing students... my spiritual intuition tells me that these seem to be connected...",
    ["不知是学艺不精还是运气不佳，本次安魂失败了，你的理智降低了%s。"] = "Whether due to lack of skill or bad luck, this Requiem failed, and your Рассудок decreased by %s.",
    ["【隐迹】死亡之握对敌方及其周围6米范围内目标均造成相同伤害。"] = "[Hidden] Grasp of Death. deals the same amount of damage to the enemy and targets within a 6-meter radius.",
    ["【秘辛】明灯的护盾量增加10%，爆炸伤害增加30%。"] = "[Secret] Beacon's Shield amount increased by 10%, Explosion damage increased by 30%.",
    ["His poor lifestyle has severely affected his health. It seems I need to intervene as his psychiatrist."] = "His poor lifestyle has severely affected his health. It seems I need to intervene as his Психиатр.",
    ["However—you have the favor of Mr. Fool. Completing the ritual under the protection and gaze of a powerful God, there won't be any problems."] = "However—you have the favor of Mr. Fool. Completing the ritual under the protection and gaze of a powerful God, there won't be any problems.",
    ["不仅黛丝的死和占卜结果有关，这个回答也在暗示和<P_Yellow>前来占卜的顾客</>有关！"] = "Not only is Daisy's death related to the Гадание result, but this answer also implies it's related to the <P_Yellow>customer who came for a Гадание</>!",
    ["【自走棋】-特莉丝-普攻-近身连斩"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Trissy - Базовая атака - Melee Combo",
    ["Before long, multiple magical lakes appeared in the chaotic world, and new orderly worlds split off from beneath the lakes again..."] = "Before long, multiple magical lakes appeared in the chaotic world, and new orderly worlds split off from beneath the lakes again...",
    ["【自走棋】-怪物纹章-1格每秒最大生命AoE"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Monster Emblem - 1 Grid Per Second Max Health AoE",
    ["[Auto-Chess] - Giant Dragon Inheritance Bond - Full-screen Damage 350"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Giant Dragon Inheritance Bond - Full-screen Damage 350",
    ["一键将角色提升到月卡战令玩家的属性，并解锁系统，提升序列，添加药品。"] = "One-click boost character to monthly card/battle pass player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
    ["Trigger Paper Doll on next hit"] = "Trigger Paper Doll on next hit",
    ["一一八四年一月一日 盛大的新年晚会 弗洛纳尔夫人真是一个尤物啊"] = "January 1st, 1184. A grand New Year's party. Mrs. Flonal is truly a stunner.",
    ["一旦出现这种情况，非凡力量无法正常稳定使用，你将面临严重危险。"] = "Once this happens, your Потусторонний powers cannot be used normally and stably, and you will face serious danger.",
    ["【猎人】(2) 暴击+15%"] = "[Охотник] (2) Crit +15%",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Frost Breath - Spell Agent"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Frost Breath - Spell Agent",
    ["Don't mind it, I just like this, but my divinations and interpretations are sometimes really accurate, really..."] = "Don't mind it, I just like this, but my Гаданиеs and interpretations are sometimes really accurate, really...",
    ["一条血统不那么纯正的金毛大狗，一个购买猎狐犬的赠品。她的世界一度很简单：阳光、庭院、饼干，和那个总是笑着蹲下来摸她脑袋的小女孩。\n直到那瓶魔药被意外打翻。\n命运从不征求谁的同意。当非凡特性渗入她的皮毛、血液、骨骼，以及那颗懵懂跳动的心脏时，苏茜拥有了第一缕“意识”。她能听懂更多了——那些话语之下的沉默，笑容背后的疲惫，还有奥黛丽在深夜独处时、连她自己都未必察觉的孤独。\n她从不掩饰自己是一条狗。这是她的骄傲。狗能嗅出谎言，而人类只能听见语言；狗能用尾巴告诉你所有真心话，而人类学会了用微笑筑墙。当她趴在霍尔家的地毯上，守望着来往的客人时，她看见的比任何一位宾客都多——那些虚伪的殷勤、算计的眼神、隐藏在赞美之下的嫉妒。\n她曾思考过：作为一条拥有了智慧的狗，你觉得自己更像人，还是更像狗？\n她摇了摇尾巴，得出了自己的答案。\n“我更像我自己。一条学会了说话却依然喜欢追尾巴的金毛犬，一条读完了心理学中的人性却依然相信善良的非凡生物。不必成为人，依旧可以用一双与众不同的眼睛，为所有孤独的心灵，带来一片温暖的安宁。”\n\n“毕竟，我只是一条狗。而这，恰恰是我最擅长的事。”"] = "A golden retriever of not-so-pure blood, a freebie from buying a foxhound. Her world was once very simple: sunshine, the courtyard, biscuits, and the little girl who always smiled and squatted down to pat her head. \n Until that bottle of potion was accidentally knocked over. \n Fate never asks for anyone's consent. When the Потусторонний characteristic seeped into her fur, blood, bones, and that innocently beating heart, Susie gained her first glimmer of \"consciousness.\" She could understand more—the silence beneath those words, the exhaustion behind the smiles, and the loneliness Audrey felt when alone late at night, which perhaps even Audrey herself hadn't noticed. \n She never hides the fact that she is a dog. This is her pride. Dogs can sniff out lies, while humans can only hear language; dogs can use their tails to tell you all their true feelings, while humans have learned to build walls with smiles. When she lay on the Hall family's carpet, watching the guests come and go, she saw more than any guest—the hypocritical obsequiousness, the calculating eyes, and the jealousy hidden beneath praise. \n She once pondered: As a dog with wisdom, do you feel more like a human or more like a dog? \n She wagged her tail and reached her own answer. \n \"I am more like myself. A golden retriever who learned to speak but still likes to chase her tail, a Потусторонний creature who has read about human nature in psychology books but still believes in kindness. There is no need to become human; one can still use a pair of unique eyes to bring a piece of warm peace to all lonely hearts.\" \n \n \"After all, I am just a dog. And that is exactly what I am best at.\"",
    ["一个由黄金制作的健康护符，边缘镌刻着阳光的纹路，触感温润，象征着太阳的祝福。"] = "A health amulet made of gold, with sunlight patterns engraved on the edges, warm to the touch, symbolizing the blessing of the Sun.",
    ["The first stage of sword energy has a 60% chance to cause knockback on the target hit."] = "The first stage of sword energy has a 60% chance to cause knockback on the target hit.",
    ["No amount of money can redeem the injustice and torment I swallowed in the dark prison, nor can it bear the sword of revenge I cast with my own blood and polished with my bones."] = "No amount of money can redeem the injustice and torment I swallowed in the dark prison, nor can it bear the sword of revenge I cast with my own blood and polished with my bones.",
    ["Health recovery not affected by the healer's or the target's attribute bonuses or reductions."] = "Health recovery not affected by the healer's or the target's attribute bonuses or reductions.",
    ["A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday \n blessings written on it, like a secret code that hasn't been spoken yet.\n\n\"<P_Yellow>Happy Birthday</>, grow up healthy—Love, your brother.\"\n\nOn the back of the card, bright red words are written in Hermes:\n<P_Red>\"Nightmare! Refuse... escape! Refuse... escape...\"</>"] = "A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday \n blessings written on it, like a secret code that hasn't been spoken yet.\n\n\"<P_Yellow>Happy Birthday</>, grow up healthy—Love, your brother.\"\n\nOn the back of the card, bright red words are written in Hermes:\n<P_Red>\"Кошмар! Refuse... escape! Refuse... escape...\"</>",
    ["不眠者途径 | 序列7“梦魇”"] = "Бессонный Pathway | Последовательность 7 \"Кошмар\"",
    ["[Rumor] Using the Spirit Mediumship Ritual will summon Dunn's spirit body, providing 10% Acceleration to allies in range and reducing the movement speed of enemies in range by 10%."] = "[Rumor] Using the Spirit Mediumship Ritual will summon Dunn's Духовное тело, providing 10% Acceleration to allies in range and reducing the Скорость бега of enemies in range by 10%.",
    ["One-stroke drawing - Start ritual new"] = "One-stroke drawing - Start ritual new",
    ["A reward of 10 pounds, enough to pay the annual fee for the Divination Club."] = "A reward of 10 pounds, enough to pay the annual fee for the Гадание Club.",
    ["A divination, a coincidence."] = "A Гадание, a coincidence.",
    ["However, they probably didn't expect that the 'Fool' as the leader had just finished digesting the 'Seer' potion."] = "However, they probably didn't expect that the 'Fool' as the leader had just finished digesting the 'Провидец' potion.",
