    ["【自走棋】-梅高欧丝-普攻-哀恸震击"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Megose - Базовая атака - Mourning Shock",
    ["一，是计数的起源。\n\n很不幸也成为这位死者的终点，除了一本笔记外，包括他本人在内的一切信息均已被他身上的污染消除。"] = "One is the origin of counting. \n \n Unfortunately, it also became the end for this deceased person; except for a notebook, all information including the person himself has been erased by the Искажение on him.",
    ["Listed marionettes have refreshed."] = "Listed Марионеткаs have refreshed.",
