    ["不会触发 CD 相关 event"] = "Will not trigger CD-related events.",
    ["Don't hurt her, don't scare her. The Nightingale is a good bird, the Nightingale's song is beautiful!"] = "Don't hurt her, don't scare her. The Nightingale is a good bird, the Nightingale's song is beautiful!",
    ["【表演】灵体史密斯太太1"] = "【Performance】Spirit Mrs. Smith 1",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Druid Spirit Body - 2nd Stage LV1 (Discarded)"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Druid Духовное тело - 2nd Stage LV1 (Discarded)",
    ["【风闻】审视效果存在时若目标血量低于20%则立刻恢复目标最大生命值的15%，不超过施法者生命20%，只能生效一次。若没触发效果，则施法者在5秒内可以使用一个二段技能为目标立刻进行治疗。"] = "[Rumor] If the target's Health is below 20% while the Scrutiny effect is active, it immediately restores 15% of the target's max Health, not exceeding 20% of the caster's Health, and can only take effect once. If the effect is not triggered, the caster can use a second-stage skill within 5 seconds to immediately heal the target.",
    ["不明嗡鸣……失踪学生……灵性直觉告诉我，这似乎有所联系……"] = "Unexplained humming... missing students... my spiritual intuition tells me that these seem to be connected...",
    ["A foul stench from the sewers? What does that have to do with the councilman... Is this also a Beyonder incident?"] = "A foul stench from the sewers? What does that have to do with the councilman... Is this also a Потусторонний incident?",
    ["The gift of July, letting spirituality flow like wine."] = "The gift of July, letting Духовность flow like wine.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-惩戒"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Punishment",
    ["One-click boost character to monthly card/battle pass player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions."] = "One-click boost character to monthly card/battle pass player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
    ["不好……罗珊在镜中廷根待的时间也到了临界点，她的意识开始混乱了。"] = "Not good... Rozanne's time in Тинген in the Mirror has also reached a critical point, her consciousness has begun to become chaotic.",
    ["一小片营养美味的面包，满足胃口，更疗愈伤口。"] = "A small piece of nutritious and delicious bread. It satisfies the appetite and heals wounds.",
    ["A Sea Spirit appeared in a rage, unable to believe that it had actually lost in a luck competition. However, the moment it appeared, it had truly lost."] = "A Sea Spirit appeared in a rage, unable to believe that it had actually lost in a luck competition. However, the moment it appeared, it had truly lost.",
    ["Not changing the divination itself. It's changing the way I \"interpret\" the Tarot."] = "Not changing the Гадание itself. It's changing the way I \"interpret\" the Tarot.",
    ["一些和你来历类似的人，我们考虑在合适的时候邀请他们加入塔罗学院。"] = "For people with origins similar to yours, we are considering inviting them to join the Tarot Academy when the time is right.",
    ["一代又一代的人们坚持了下来，期待造物主能重新将目光投向这个被祂遗弃的地方。"] = "Generation after generation of people persisted, hoping that the Creator would once again cast His gaze upon this place He had abandoned.",
    ["A <P_Yellow>young lady in a foreign-style dress</> stepped onto the grass, effortlessly breaking the game of hide-and-seek."] = "A <P_Yellow>young lady in a foreign-style dress</> stepped onto the grass, effortlessly breaking the game of hide-and-seek.",
    ["[Auto Chess] - Viscountess - Dual Circular Slash - AOE 2 - New Skill Case - Sub Skill"] = "[Auto Chess] - Viscountess - Dual Circular Slash - AOE 2 - New Skill Case - Sub Skill",
    ["【自走棋】-戴莉·西蒙妮-普攻-灵摆冲击"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Daly Simone - Базовая атака - Pendulum Shock",
    ["However, the abilities of Sequence 9 are limited, and it's mostly theoretical knowledge."] = "However, the abilities of Последовательность 9 are limited, and it's mostly theoretical knowledge.",
    ["一股奇异的香气弥漫在魔药房中，一个身影“嗖”地浮现，陶醉地看着药剂，丝毫没意识到自己被捉住了。"] = "A strange fragrance permeated the potion room, and a figure \"whooshed\" into view, looking at the potion with intoxication, completely unaware that it had been caught.",
    ["Not-so-sharp Mr. Seer, this shelf is clearly closer to me. If it weren't for you blocking the way..."] = "Not-so-sharp Mr. Провидец, this shelf is clearly closer to me. If it weren't for you blocking the way...",
    ["一段震地伤害提升60%。"] = "First-stage ground stomp damage increased by 60%.",
    ["[Trigger] (Left path) Trigger chant area 1"] = "[Trigger] (Left path) Trigger chant area 1",
    ["A Tarot card? How did it get stuck in here..."] = "A Tarot card? How did it get stuck in here...",
    ["【自走棋】-戴里克-友军治疗"] = "[Auto Chess] - Derrick - Ally Healing",
    ["A magical potion with special effects that can bring peace of mind to those who take it."] = "A magical potion with special effects that can bring peace of mind to those who take it.",
    ["【雾林眷族】棋子每次普攻获得<HighLight>1</>层【苔影汲取】，每层获得<HighLight>2%</>吸血和<HighLight>1%</>最大生命，最多叠加<HighLight>6</>层。"] = "Each Базовая атака from a [Fog Forest Kin] piece grants <HighLight>1</> stack(s) of [Moss Shadow Absorption], with each stack granting <HighLight>2%</> Вампиризм and <HighLight>1%</> Max Health, stacking up to <HighLight>6</> times.",
    ["一位灾难的幸存者，一抹被污染的知识。越接近真相，就越接近扭曲和疯狂……"] = "A survivor of disaster, a smear of corrupted knowledge. The closer one gets to the truth, the closer one gets to distortion and Безумие...",
    ["一个**奇怪**的马桶。他上一位主人显然在这里进行过某种仪式。仪式的结果仍留在里面，散发着**诡异**的气味，并且拒绝被文明社会承认。"] = "A **strange** toilet. Its previous owner clearly conducted some kind of ritual here. The results of the ritual remain inside, emitting a **weird** odor, and it refuses to be acknowledged by civilized society.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Exile - Finish"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Exile - Finish",
    ["Three-stage heavy punch dealing a total of 180% attack damage, with the final stage knocking up the target and granting a 12% max health shield."] = "Three-stage heavy punch dealing a total of 180% attack damage, with the final stage knocking up the target and granting a 12% max health shield.",
    ["[Secret] During the gray fog Blessing duration, releasing a skill increases own Health by an additional 2 points."] = "[Secret] During the gray fog Blessing duration, releasing a skill increases own Health by an additional 2 points.",
    ["[Hidden] Allies and self within the Poetic aura gain increased Critical Hit rate for self and allies."] = "[Hidden] Allies and self within the Poetic aura gain increased Critical Hit rate for self and allies.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-放逐"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Exile",
    ["【通用】给怪物的霸体"] = "[General] Суперброня for monsters",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-星云斩击-法术代理"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Nebula Slash - Spell Agent",
    ["上行链路：生命值+120，法力恢复+2。"] = "Uplink: Health +120, Mana recovery +2.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-梦境分析-法术代理"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis - Spell Agent",
    ["[Auto-Chess] Astrolabe User Skill - [Normal] - Double Kick"] = "[Auto-Chess] Astrolabe User Skill - [Normal] - Double Kick",
    ["下午好！“正义”小姐、“魔术师”小姐、“星星”先生，你们怎么都在？"] = "Good afternoon! Miss \"Justice,\" Miss \"Фокусник,\" Mr. \"The Star,\" why are you all here?",
    ["三费战团：最大生命值+300，攻击速度+25%。"] = "Three-Cost Battle Group: Max Health +300, Скорость атаки +25%.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis - Spell Agent"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis - Spell Agent",
    ["【自走棋】星象仪者技能-【普通】-二连踢"] = "[Auto-Chess] Astrolabe User Skill - [Normal] - Double Kick",
    ["【自走棋】-子爵夫人-三连斩-普攻1-新技能案例-子技能-范围Atk1"] = "[Auto Chess] - Viscountess - Triple Slash - Базовая атака 1 - New Skill Case - Sub Skill - Range Atk 1",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n你与%s的灵性在万千人群中产生了共鸣。\n七日誓约已经缔结。在此期间，你们将共享缘分带来的祝福。\n愿这段时光成为非凡之路上的一段珍贵记忆。\n愿女神的光辉照耀你的前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour Духовность has resonated with %s among the thousands of people. \nThe Seven-Day Covenant has been concluded. During this period, you will share the blessings brought by fate. \nMay this time become a precious memory on your Extraordinary journey. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path.",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf summons several rows of wandering <Disable>Shadows of Darkness</>. After the <Disable>Shadows of Darkness</> appear, they will enter an <Disable>Invisibility</> state and continue to move forward, knocking up and damaging players in their path."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf summons several rows of wandering <Disable>Shadows of Darkness</>. After the <Disable>Shadows of Darkness</> appear, they will enter an <Disable>Invisibility</> state and continue to move forward, knocking up and damaging players in their path.",
    ["乌托邦剧院是“愚者”先生留下的封印物，但内部回廊最近发生了异变，希望里面的“演员”还认得自己的剧本。"] = "The Utopia Theater is a Запечатанный артефакт left by Mr. Fool, but the internal corridors have recently undergone mutations; I hope the \"actors\" inside still recognize their scripts.",
    ["Connected to the aura of another core: after breaking one, you must break the other within 3 seconds, otherwise it will trigger a screen-wide devastating explosion."] = "Connected to the aura of another core: after breaking one, you must break the other within 3 seconds, otherwise it will trigger a screen-wide devastating explosion.",
    ["Energy extracted from spiritual enemies, can use energy to summon minions on special ritual circles to help fight."] = "Energy extracted from spiritual enemies, can use energy to summon minions on special ritual circles to help fight.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n      我们留意到，关于调研问卷2，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n      若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷2</>\n      感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 2, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 2</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["Pursuing spiritual aura in the fog..."] = "Pursuing spiritual aura in the fog...",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：观众、序列8：读心者、序列7：心理医生、序列6：催眠师、序列5：梦境行者、序列4：操纵师、序列3：织梦人、序列2：洞察者、序列1：作家、序列0：空想家"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Зритель, Последовательность 8: Телепат, Последовательность 7: Психиатр, Последовательность 6: Hypnotist, Последовательность 5: Dreamwalker, Последовательность 4: Manipulator, Последовательность 3: Dream Weaver, Последовательность 2: Discerner, Последовательность 1: Author, Последовательность 0: Visionary",
    ["Minimum Movement Distance Between Two Aura Placements"] = "Minimum Movement Distance Between Two Aura Placements",
    ["主教他们怎么样了？我们有赢吗？封印物还在吗？"] = "How are the Bishop and the others? Did we win? Is the Запечатанный артефакт still there?",
    ["The aura of the dead is eroding the bodies of the living—stamina recovery has slowed down!"] = "The aura of the dead is eroding the bodies of the living—stamina recovery has slowed down!",
    ["Go to the castle platform with Beliv"] = "Go to the castle platform with Beliv",
    ["两次放置光环的最小移动距离"] = "Minimum Movement Distance Between Two Aura Placements",
    ["他在与污染对抗，我们需要帮助他！"] = "He is fighting against the Искажение. We need to help him!",
    ["丰饶之藤会持续攻击，请迅速转火击杀！"] = "The Vine of Abundance will attack continuously; please switch targets and kill it quickly!",
    ["Personal Score buff"] = "Personal Score buff",
    ["仔细观察头顶宣传口号气泡，迅速站到<Highlight>反诈区域</>。倒计时结束后，危险区域将<Disable>爆炸并大幅削减生命</>。"] = "Carefully observe the slogan bubbles above your head and quickly stand in the <Highlight>anti-fraud area</>. After the countdown ends, the danger zone will <Disable>explode and significantly reduce health</>.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nA new season has begun. You have %s unused currency in your inventory, which has now been automatically converted to %s currency at a 1:%s ratio."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nA new season has begun. You have %s unused currency in your inventory, which has now been automatically converted to %s currency at a 1:%s ratio.",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf hides in the shadows and summons several <Disable>Demon Wolf Statues</>. The shadows will gradually cover the field and devour all players within them; the Dark Demonic Wolf will continuously use charges to attack players while in the shadows."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf hides in the shadows and summons several <Disable>Demon Wolf Statues</>. The shadows will gradually cover the field and devour all players within them; the Dark Demonic Wolf will continuously use charges to attack players while in the shadows.",
    ["Successfully restore sanity to Beyonders 20 times in total."] = "Successfully restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs 20 times in total.",
    ["Today's recommended dessert is carrot cake, sweet but not greasy, healthy and nutritious."] = "Today's recommended dessert is carrot cake, sweet but not greasy, healthy and nutritious.",
    ["令人胆寒的阴冷气息，像墓园刚被挖出的尸体，被祂注视的可怜的羔羊，被仪式引诱的阴影。"] = "A chilling and cold aura, like a corpse just dug up from a cemetery, a poor lamb watched by Him, a shadow lured by a ritual.",
    ["Actively attacking green or yellow-named Beyonders increases loss of control by 10."] = "Actively attacking green or yellow-named Потустороннийs increases loss of control by 10.",
    ["乌黯魔狼拉动所有玩家的灵体之线并将其拉至身边，玩家之间两两被扰乱的灵体之线相连，会不断对对方造成伤害"] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf pulls the Нити духовного тела of all players and draws them to its side. The Нити духовного тела of players connected in pairs are disrupted, continuously dealing damage to each other.",
    ["He pushed for the Industrial Revolution, invented the steam engine, and improved many technologies. He overthrew the Intis Kingdom to establish a Republic, later reformed it into an Empire, self-proclaimed as \"Emperor Caesar,\" and finally switched pathways to advance to Sequence 0 \"Black Emperor\"."] = "He pushed for the Industrial Revolution, invented the steam engine, and improved many technologies. He overthrew the Intis Kingdom to establish a Republic, later reformed it into an Empire, self-proclaimed as \"Emperor Caesar,\" and finally switched pathways to advance to Последовательность 0 \"Black Emperor\".",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nYour club's activity today is %s. If the activity remains below %s for %s consecutive days, the club will be dissolved. Please increase your club's activity as soon as possible. Remaining time: %s days."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour club's activity today is %s. If the activity remains below %s for %s consecutive days, the club will be dissolved. Please increase your club's activity as soon as possible. Remaining time: %s days.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nYour pre-order for the item <M_Link>%s</> failed. The currency paid for the pre-order has been returned to your mailbox.\n(Pre-order rules: After the item listing period ends, a 1-minute pre-order period begins. All players can place bids. When the pre-order period ends, the item is randomly assigned to one bidder, and the currency of other bidders will be fully refunded.)"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour pre-order for the item <M_Link>%s</> failed. The currency paid for the pre-order has been returned to your mailbox.\n(Pre-order rules: After the item listing period ends, a 1-minute pre-order period begins. All players can place bids. When the pre-order period ends, the item is randomly assigned to one bidder, and the currency of other bidders will be fully refunded.)",
    ["Connection Topic - Audrey 5: About Psychotherapy"] = "Connection Topic - Audrey 5: About Psychotherapy",
    ["主宰争锋·初露锋芒"] = "Dominator's Clash · Emerging Talent",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008612"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008612",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n恭喜您的等级达到59级！我们为您准备了等级奖励，用于版本测试升级养成使用，请查收！祝愿您在诡秘世界冒险愉快！"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nCongratulations on reaching level 59! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Повелитель Тайн!",
    ["之前我们帮人提行李可以收3便士，现在他们收2便士了。"] = "We used to charge 3 pence for carrying luggage, now they charge 2 pence.",
    ["World channel chat cooldown reduced"] = "World channel chat Перезарядка reduced",
    ["Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes in the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Beyonder level, and the recommended Beyonder rating will also change with the Beyonder level."] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs in the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a secret channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the Искажение. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Потусторонний level, and the recommended Потусторонний rating will also change with the Потусторонний level.",
    ["二连击"] = "Double Strike",
    ["He really is a Beyonder... and that <P_Yellow> necktie </> is a mystical item."] = "He really is a Потусторонний... and that <P_Yellow> necktie </> is a mystical item.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n祝贺您在%s排行榜中排名前%d%%，现为您奉上丰厚的奖励，希望您再接再厉，在诡秘世界中闯出一番天地。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n Congratulations on ranking in the top %d of the %s leaderboard %%. We have prepared generous rewards for you. We hope you will continue your efforts and carve out your own path in the world of Повелитель Тайн.",
    ["Rebecca Skill 1 Normal"] = "Rebecca Skill 1 Normal",
    ["人脉话题-克莱恩1关于占卜"] = "Connection Topic - Klein 1: About Гадание",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于PVE专题的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷-PVE专题</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the PVE survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVE Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["Jonar Skill 3"] = "Jonar Skill 3",
    ["Today I'm going to try every divination method! Where are the diviners?"] = "Today I'm going to try every Гадание method! Where are the diviners?",
    ["乔纳尔不知道塔罗学派……现在，我们可以坦诚地聊聊了。"] = "Jonar doesn't know about the Клуб Таро... Now, we can talk honestly.",
    ["二级防御跑塔"] = "Level 2 Defense Tower",
    ["他入梦了，抓紧时间击破护盾！"] = "He has entered a dream, hurry and break the shield!",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008608"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008608",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n在这轮誓约的灵性共振中，未有与你完全契合的对象。\n请不要灰心，或许下一个七日，命运的丝线会将你引向对的人。\n愿女神的光辉照耀你的前路。\n萨默尔太太\n敬上"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nIn this round of spiritual resonance for the Covenant, there was no partner perfectly compatible with you. \nPlease do not be discouraged; perhaps in the next seven days, the threads of fate will lead you to the right person. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path. \nMrs. Sammer\nSincerely",
    ["What, you want to go to the Tarot Club? No problem! I am a mature Apprentice, and my teleportation success rate is a full thirty percent!"] = "What, you want to go to the Клуб Таро? No problem! I am a mature Apprentice, and my teleportation success rate is a full thirty percent!",
    ["Micro-crystalline structures coexisting with cursed crystals, capable of synchronizing and amplifying the spiritual frequency of the Curse source."] = "Micro-crystalline structures coexisting with cursed crystals, capable of synchronizing and amplifying the spiritual frequency of the Curse source.",
    ["He told me that if I wore these ritualized dancing shoes, everyone would fall in love with me."] = "He told me that if I wore these ritualized dancing shoes, everyone would fall in love with me.",
    ["两个问题的答案一次在占卜桌的椅子上，一次在桌面……<P_Yellow>线索似乎仍然在指向占卜这件事</>？"] = "The answers to the two questions were once on the chair of the Гадание table, and once on the tabletop... <P_Yellow>The clues seem to still be pointing to the act of Гадание</>?",
    ["Awaken oneself from the dream and restore 50% of health."] = "Awaken oneself from the dream and restore 50% of health.",
    ["人脉话题-阿尔杰4关于冲激冲激"] = "Connection Topic - Alger 4: About Shocking News",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n祝贺您在%s排行榜中排名%s，现为您奉上丰厚的奖励，希望您再接再厉，在诡秘世界中闯出一番天地。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nCongratulations on ranking %s on the %s leaderboard. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries.",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：占卜家、序列8：小丑、序列7：魔术师、序列6：无面人、序列5：秘偶大师、序列4：诡法师、序列3：古代学者、序列2：奇迹师、序列1：诡秘侍者、序列0：愚者"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Провидец, Последовательность 8: Клоун, Последовательность 7: Фокусник, Последовательность 6: Безликий, Последовательность 5: Марионеточник, Последовательность 4: Маг Непостижимого, Последовательность 3: Учёный Прошлого, Последовательность 2: Творец Чудес, Последовательность 1: Служитель Тайн, Последовательность 0: Шут",
    ["Dark Demonic Wolf Ascend-Invincibility Effect"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf Ascend-Invincibility Effect",
    ["亡灵的絮语在此低徊指引，是所有死亡归寂的渡口。 "] = "The whispers of the undead linger here as guidance, the ferry crossing where all death finds silence.",
    ["仅监听首技能"] = "Only listen to the first Skill",
    ["Do What Thou Wilt, But Harm None"] = "Do What Thou Wilt, But Harm None",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Apprentice, Sequence 8: Trickmaster, Sequence 7: Astrologer, Sequence 6: Scribe, Sequence 5: Traveler, Sequence 4: Secrets Sorcerer, Sequence 3: Wanderer, Sequence 2: Planeswalker, Sequence 1: Key of Stars, Sequence 0: Door"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Apprentice, Последовательность 8: Trickmaster, Последовательность 7: Astrologer, Последовательность 6: Scribe, Последовательность 5: Traveler, Последовательность 4: Secrets Sorcerer, Последовательность 3: Wanderer, Последовательность 2: Planeswalker, Последовательность 1: Key of Stars, Последовательность 0: Door",
    ["Joanna drew the Ten of Swords. I told her it meant finish and failure, and that no matter how well she practiced, she would never make it to the big city stage."] = "Joanna drew the Ten of Swords. I told her it meant finish and failure, and that no matter how well she practiced, she would never make it to the big city stage.",
    ["Materials required for upgrading Connection Skills."] = "Materials required for upgrading Connection Skills.",
    ["临时属性buff"] = "Temporary attribute buff",
    ["主界面技能悬浮显示提示"] = "Skill Floating Display Tips on Main Interface",
    ["Liana, my duty is not only to solve the case but also to bring back the Sealed Artifact and eliminate potential dangers."] = "Liana, my duty is not only to solve the case but also to bring back the Запечатанный артефакт and eliminate potential dangers.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or transfer of gold (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights, please do not participate in offline trading. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing dungeon auctions, etc.)."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or transfer of gold (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights, please do not participate in offline trading. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing dungeon auctions, etc.).",
    ["丰饶之树_5200139_藤棘绽放B_代理_1_随机灵体AOE"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Thorn Bloom B_Proxy_1_Random Духовное тело AOE",
    ["Main Story Disable Skill and Movement"] = "Main Story Disable Skill and Movement",
    ["No traces were left behind; there must be the influence and interference of Beyonder powers behind it."] = "No traces were left behind; there must be the influence and interference of Потусторонний powers behind it.",
    ["He is teaching <P_Yellow>Mirror Divination</>..."] = "He is teaching <P_Yellow>Mirror Гадание</>...",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf makes a wish to itself, adding a <Disable>Dark Light</> effect to all players. Dark Light will continuously deal damage to players and gradually strip away their light."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf makes a wish to itself, adding a <Disable>Dark Light</> effect to all players. Dark Light will continuously deal damage to players and gradually strip away their light.",
    ["他是最棒的小丑，无需涂抹厚重的油彩，便能奉上最浮夸的笑容。这笑容如同一张完美的面具，与他的脸严丝合缝，请将嘴角咧到最大，笑容最为无可挑剔，哪怕眼神空洞无比。\n他的表演无人能及，他的荒诞如此可笑。他的一举一动皆能触及到观众最精准的神经，每次出糗都能引发人群歇斯底里的大笑。孩子们爱他，大人们在他身上找到生活压力的发泄，他用自己的笑容为整个世界带来欢乐！\n然而幕布落下，笑声散去，独处时面对镜中永远笑着的自己，他只能以沉默，以夸张的笑容回应。\n最后的舞台来临，他将故事中君主赐死弄臣的酒换成真实的毒酒，一饮而尽。当他带着笑容倒下时，全场响起排山倒海的欢呼与笑声。\n\n演出，落幕了……再次祝你们……永远开心。"] = "He was the best Клоун, needing no thick oil paint to offer the most exaggerated smile. This smile was like a perfect mask, fitting his face seamlessly. Please stretch the corners of your mouth to the maximum; the smile was impeccable, even if his eyes were completely hollow. \n His performance was unmatched, his absurdity so laughable. Every move he made could touch the most precise nerves of the audience, and every blunder could trigger hysterical laughter from the crowd. Children loved him, adults found an outlet for the pressures of life in him, and he brought joy to the whole world with his own smile! \n However, when the curtain fell and the laughter dispersed, facing himself in the mirror who was always smiling while alone, he could only respond with silence and an exaggerated smile. \n The final stage arrived; he replaced the poisoned wine the monarch gave the jester in the story with real poisoned wine and drank it in one gulp. When he fell with a smile, thunderous cheers and laughter erupted throughout the arena. \n \n The show... has come to a curtain call... Wishing you all again... to be happy forever.",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：学徒、序列8：戏法大师、序列7：占星人、序列6：记录官、序列5：旅行家、序列4：秘法师、序列3：漫游者、序列2：旅法师、序列1：星之匙、序列0：门"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Apprentice, Последовательность 8: Trickmaster, Последовательность 7: Astrologer, Последовательность 6: Scribe, Последовательность 5: Traveler, Последовательность 4: Secrets Sorcerer, Последовательность 3: Wanderer, Последовательность 2: Planeswalker, Последовательность 1: Key of Stars, Последовательность 0: Door",
    ["How are the Bishop and the others? Did we win? Is the Sealed Artifact still there?"] = "How are the Bishop and the others? Did we win? Is the Запечатанный артефакт still there?",
    ["Undead Disappear Trigger"] = "Undead Disappear Trigger",
    ["Raise sword buff ID (if left blank, raising sword is not checked, same effect as default attack)."] = "Raise sword buff ID (if left blank, raising sword is not checked, same effect as default attack).",
    ["Awaken a dissipated teammate from the dream and restore 50% of their health."] = "Awaken a dissipated teammate from the dream and restore 50% of their health.",
    ["丰盛的大份营养面包，经由特殊的仪式焙烤而成，为您提供澎湃的生命力！"] = "A hearty, large portion of nutritious bread, baked through a special ritual to provide you with surging vitality!",
    ["Keynote Speaker: Dr. Conrad \n Location: Tingen University Auditorium \n Guarding Health, Ensuring Safety, Cherishing Life \n Let the Light of Medicine Benefit Tingen \n Participate in the lecture to receive a home medical kit on-site! \n No admission fee | All citizens are welcome to attend | No food or drink provided"] = "Keynote Speaker: Dr. Conrad \n Location: Тинген University Auditorium \n Guarding Health, Ensuring Safety, Cherishing Life \n Let the Light of Medicine Benefit Тинген \n Participate in the lecture to receive a home medical kit on-site! \n No admission fee | All citizens are welcome to attend | No food or drink provided",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008627"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008627",
    ["Abaddon's Attack and Attack Speed increased by 3%, stacking up to 5 times."] = "Abaddon's Attack and Скорость атаки increased by 3%, stacking up to 5 times.",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008607"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008607",
    ["为知识奔走的旅人，旷野点燃的孤灯，风的方向答案飘扬……"] = "A traveler running for knowledge, a lone lamp lit in the wilderness, the answer fluttering in the direction of the wind...",
    ["Actively casting Spear of Longinus once reduces the Cooldown of Gambit of the Ages by 1 second."] = "Actively casting Spear of Longinus once reduces the Перезарядка of Gambit of the Ages by 1 second.",
    ["乌黯魔狼冲锋临时删除隐身"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf Charge Temporary Invisibility Removal",
    ["从塔罗学派获得很多帮助，或许可以经常回去，协助处理一些事件。"] = "I've received a lot of help from the Клуб Таро; perhaps I can return often to assist in handling some events.",
    ["什么时候才能成为正式的咖啡师呢？要不下班后去占卜俱乐部算算……"] = "When will I be able to become a formal barista? Maybe I should go to the Гадание Club after work and calculate...",
    ["他现在越来越忙了，能力越大责任越大，但我依然希望他爱惜身体。"] = "He is getting busier and busier now; with great power comes great responsibility, but I still hope he takes care of his health.",
    ["于心湖投石，漾开名为疯狂的涟漪。 "] = "Cast a stone into the lake of the heart, rippling with Безумие.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Based on a comprehensive evaluation of your Club, the City of Dragon Hunting drill battlefield awaits your arrival. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - City of Dragon Hunting interface in time. Please note that a single Club can have a maximum of <M_Orange>16 people</> from a single Pathway as official members on the field; plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n    Participate in the City of Dragon Hunting war to receive gifts such as connections, marionette drawing items, Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Based on a comprehensive evaluation of your Club, the City of Dragon Hunting drill battlefield awaits your arrival. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - City of Dragon Hunting interface in time. Please note that a single Club can have a maximum of <M_Orange>16 people</> from a single Pathway as official members on the field; plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n    Participate in the City of Dragon Hunting war to receive gifts such as connections, Марионетка drawing items, Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!",
    ["2-piece set\nUpon entering combat, gain 400 points of Block for 3 seconds."] = "2-piece set\nUpon entering combat, gain 400 points of Block for 3 seconds.",
    ["与贝利夫一起前往城堡月台"] = "Go to the castle platform with Beliv",
    ["When true, Damage Reflection damage will not trigger this event"] = "When true, Damage Reflection damage will not trigger this event",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于首日体验的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷1</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    We have noticed that regarding the first-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 1</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["事情已经很清晰了：这里是个黑市交易点，有非凡者介入了这起案件。"] = "The situation is already very clear: this is a black market trading point, and a Потусторонний has intervened in this case.",
    ["Only affects charge skills, changing their charge count."] = "Only affects charge skills, changing their charge count.",
    ["不过，我要提醒你一下，“神降”仪式还需要准备其他材料，记得收集齐再来开启仪式。"] = "However, I must remind you that the 'divine descent' ritual also requires other materials; remember to collect them all before starting the ritual.",
    ["他那时候总说，戴莉，你很有天赋。"] = "He always used to say back then, 'Daly, you have a lot of talent.'",
    ["他说，只有非凡者可以发挥它“保护”的力量。"] = "He said only a Потусторонний can unleash its power of \"protection\".",
    ["什么，你想去塔罗学派？没问题！我可是一名成熟的学徒，传送成功率有足足百分之三十呢！"] = "What, you want to go to the Клуб Таро? No problem! I am a mature Apprentice, and my teleportation success rate is a full thirty percent!",
    ["He was the best Clown, needing no thick oil paint to offer the most exaggerated smile. This smile was like a perfect mask, fitting his face seamlessly. Please stretch the corners of your mouth to the maximum; the smile was impeccable, even if his eyes were completely hollow. \n His performance was unmatched, his absurdity so laughable. Every move he made could touch the most precise nerves of the audience, and every blunder could trigger hysterical laughter from the crowd. Children loved him, adults found an outlet for the pressures of life in him, and he brought joy to the whole world with his own smile! \n However, when the curtain fell and the laughter dispersed, facing himself in the mirror who was always smiling while alone, he could only respond with silence and an exaggerated smile. \n The final stage arrived; he replaced the poisoned wine the monarch gave the jester in the story with real poisoned wine and drank it in one gulp. When he fell with a smile, thunderous cheers and laughter erupted throughout the arena. \n \n The show... has come to a curtain call... Wishing you all again... to be happy forever."] = "He was the best Клоун, needing no thick oil paint to offer the most exaggerated smile. This smile was like a perfect mask, fitting his face seamlessly. Please stretch the corners of your mouth to the maximum; the smile was impeccable, even if his eyes were completely hollow. \n His performance was unmatched, his absurdity so laughable. Every move he made could touch the most precise nerves of the audience, and every blunder could trigger hysterical laughter from the crowd. Children loved him, adults found an outlet for the pressures of life in him, and he brought joy to the whole world with his own smile! \n However, when the curtain fell and the laughter dispersed, facing himself in the mirror who was always smiling while alone, he could only respond with silence and an exaggerated smile. \n The final stage arrived; he replaced the poisoned wine the monarch gave the jester in the story with real poisoned wine and drank it in one gulp. When he fell with a smile, thunderous cheers and laughter erupted throughout the arena. \n \n The show... has come to a curtain call... Wishing you all again... to be happy forever.",
    ["Master is a potion genius! It's truly a blessing to work for her!"] = "Master is a potion genius! It's truly a blessing to work for her!",
    ["不，在现实世界我有很多身份，你如果想找我，可以去鲁恩慈善基金会。至于心理治疗，这是“观众”途径的非凡能力。"] = "No, I have many identities in the real world. If you want to find me, you can go to the Loen Charity Foundation. As for psychotherapy, this is an Extraordinary ability of the 'Зритель' pathway.",
    ["From the students of the Tarot Club, that is, you all, I have gained much help that I once struggled to obtain, and have also unraveled many mysteries that I could not solve."] = "From the students of the Клуб Таро, that is, you all, I have gained much help that I once struggled to obtain, and have also unraveled many mysteries that I could not solve.",
    ["Main Story Chapter 1 - Male Treant - Bloom Spell Proxy - NoSpawn"] = "Main Story Chapter 1 - Male Treant - Bloom Spell Proxy - NoSpawn",
    ["His family is so rich, he can get whatever he wants, yet he still wants to go for divination? I can't imagine what he would ask..."] = "His family is so rich, he can get whatever he wants, yet he still wants to go for Гадание? I can't imagine what he would ask...",
    ["乌黯魔狼，序列2“奇迹师”，祂在这里躲藏了几千年，最终被我主驱逐。"] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf, Последовательность 2 \"Творец Чудес\", hid here for thousands of years before finally being expelled by my Lord.",
    ["为丹尼斯占卜"] = "Гадание for Dennis",
    ["No, the corruption hasn't completely disappeared—there is still something hidden deep within the painting!"] = "No, the Искажение hasn't completely disappeared—there is still something hidden deep within the painting!",
    ["Five Soles to take you on a trip to the castle. Anything you find is yours, how about it?"] = "Five Soles to take you on a trip to the castle. Anything you find is yours, how about it?",
    ["乌托邦剧院秘偶刷新时，如果出现与许愿秘偶同品质的秘偶，有80%概率是许愿秘偶。如果本次没有出现许愿秘偶，则下一次必定是许愿秘偶。"] = "When Марионеткаs refresh in the Utopia Theater, if a Марионетка of the same quality as the Wish Марионетка appears, there is an 80% probability that it is the Wish Марионетка. If the Wish Марионетка does not appear this time, the next one is guaranteed to be the Wish Марионетка.",
    ["Swap positions with a detached skill created by self."] = "Swap positions with a detached skill created by self.",
    ["他举着盾牌顶在最前面，弹开了所有龙焰。"] = "He held his shield at the very front and deflected all the dragon fire.",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：收尸人、序列8：掘墓人、序列7：通灵者、序列6：死灵导师、序列5：看门人、序列4：不死者、序列3：摆渡人、序列2：死亡执政官、序列1：苍白皇帝、序列0：死神"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Corpse Collector, Последовательность 8: Gravedigger, Последовательность 7: Spirit Medium, Последовательность 6: Spirit Guide, Последовательность 5: Gatekeeper, Последовательность 4: Undying, Последовательность 3: Ferryman, Последовательность 2: Death Consul, Последовательность 1: Pale Emperor, Последовательность 0: Death",
    ["亵渎魔女真镜子buff"] = "Profane Witch True Mirror Buff",
    ["世界频道聊天CD降低"] = "World channel chat Перезарядка reduced",
    ["他推动工业革命，发明蒸汽机并改良多项技术，推翻因蒂斯王国建立共和国，后改制为帝国自封“凯撒大帝”，最终转途径晋升序列0“黑皇帝” 。"] = "He pushed for the Industrial Revolution, invented the steam engine, and improved many technologies. He overthrew the Intis Kingdom to establish a Republic, later reformed it into an Empire, self-proclaimed as \"Emperor Caesar,\" and finally switched pathways to advance to Последовательность 0 \"Black Emperor\".",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nThe Beyonder with ID [%s] that you reported on XXXX-XX-XX has been reviewed by the Police Department. The behavior [%s] has been confirmed, and we have imposed a penalty of %s. Thank you for your contribution to maintaining the environment!"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nThe Потусторонний with ID [%s] that you reported on XXXX-XX-XX has been reviewed by the Police Department. The behavior [%s] has been confirmed, and we have imposed a penalty of %s. Thank you for your contribution to maintaining the environment!",
    ["什么痕迹也没留下，背后一定有非凡力量的影响和干扰。"] = "No traces were left behind; there must be the influence and interference of Потусторонний powers behind it.",
    ["乌黯魔狼-暗寂无垠法术代理"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf - Boundless Dark Silence Spell Proxy",
    ["不错，很有舞蹈天赋嘛！"] = "Not bad, you have a real talent for dancing!",
    ["不，多半会被评估定级，成为封印物。幸好它的负面影响并不严重，经过一些处理，也可以完全避免。"] = "No, it will most likely be evaluated and classified as a Запечатанный артефакт. Fortunately, its negative effects are not severe, and with some processing, they can be completely avoided.",
    ["Poisoned · I"] = "Poisoned · I",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于三日体验的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷3</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    We have noticed that regarding the three-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 3</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["从塔罗的学员，也就是你们这里，我获得了许多曾经苦求不得的帮助，也解开了许多不得其解的谜团。"] = "From the students of the Клуб Таро, that is, you all, I have gained much help that I once struggled to obtain, and have also unraveled many mysteries that I could not solve.",
    ["Dominator's Clash fairness mechanism, all Beyonders receive attribute balancing."] = "Dominator's Clash fairness mechanism, all Потустороннийs receive attribute balancing.",
    ["No! Why, why are we destined to bear such a curse from birth, and to have to end our parents' lives with our own hands?"] = "No! Why, why are we destined to bear such a curse from birth, and to have to end our parents' lives with our own hands?",
    ["Main Interface HUD Skill Wheel"] = "Main Interface HUD Skill Wheel",
    ["For Gourmet - Trigger"] = "For Gourmet - Trigger",
    ["仅影响充能技能，改变其充能次数"] = "Only affects charge skills, changing their charge count.",
    ["Connections Marionette Rating"] = "Connections Марионетка Rating",
    ["Five instances of *d damage."] = "Five instances of *d damage.",
    ["也是厄难与恐惧的女皇，安眠和寂静的领主。"] = "She is also the Empress of Disaster and Horror, and the Lord of Slumber and Silence.",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008621"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008621",
    ["他是“星之女王”嘉德丽雅麾下的大副，“未来号”上令人闻风丧胆的“毒素专家”。但弗兰克·李从不认为自己是危险人物——他只是一个热爱土壤、作物和品种杂交技术的农业研究者，一个试图用最直接的方式解决人类饥饿问题的理想主义者。\n在他的世界里，公牛与小麦之间没有不可逾越的鸿沟，牛奶与甲板之间也不存在本质的区别。万物皆可杂交，一切皆有可能。这是他对“母亲”的意志最为虔诚的解读。\n\n弗兰克·李的疯狂，是一种纯粹的、近乎天真的疯狂。他从不觉得自己在做危险的事，就像孩子从不觉得把积木搭成奇怪形状有什么不对。他只是看见了饥饿，看见了贫困，然后想出了一个最直接的解决方案——让食物自己长出来，以任何可能的形式，在任何可能的地方。\n他试图让牛像麦子一样从地里长出来，这样农民就不需要费心饲养；他培育的蘑菇在“未来号”的甲板下疯狂繁殖，让这艘船开始产奶——对他来说，这是“神迹”，是“仁慈的母亲”对他研究的肯定。他从未想过，一个普通人看见甲板缝隙里渗出乳白色液体时，第一反应会是恐惧而非惊喜。\n他是“未来号”上最危险的存在，却也是最无害的灵魂。危险的是他的造物，无害的是他的心。他从不怀有任何恶意，他站在疯狂与天真之间那条模糊的边界上，他坚信，总有一天，世界会理解他的。\n\n“我只是想喂饱所有人。”他会这样说，蓝色的眼睛里满是真诚。"] = "He is the First mate under the command of the “Queen of Stars” Cattleya, and the dreaded “Toxin Expert” on the Future. But Frank Lee never considered himself a dangerous person—he is just an agricultural researcher who loves soil, crops, and cross-breeding technology, an idealist who tries to solve human hunger in the most direct way. \n In his world, there is no insurmountable gap between bulls and wheat, and there is no essential difference between milk and the deck. Everything can be hybridized, and anything is possible. This is his most devout interpretation of the “Mother’s” will. \n \n Frank Lee’s Безумие is a pure, almost naive Безумие. He never feels that he is doing something dangerous, just as a child never feels that there is anything wrong with building blocks into strange shapes. He just saw hunger, saw poverty, and then came up with the most direct solution—let food grow itself, in any possible form, in any possible place. \n He tried to make cows grow out of the ground like wheat so that farmers wouldn’t need to worry about raising them; the mushrooms he cultivated reproduced wildly under the deck of the Future, making the ship start to produce milk—to him, this is a “miracle,” a confirmation of his research by the “merciful Mother.” He never thought that when an ordinary person saw milky white liquid seeping out of the cracks in the deck, the first reaction would be fear rather than surprise. \n He is the most dangerous existence on the Future, but also the most harmless soul. What is dangerous is his creation, and what is harmless is his heart. He never harbors any malice; he stands on the blurred boundary between Безумие and innocence, and he firmly believes that one day, the world will understand him. \n \n “I just want to feed everyone.” He would say this, his blue eyes full of sincerity.",
    ["Attack from the rear left"] = "Attack from the rear left",
    ["不，她非常警惕，也很强大……至少是序列7的非凡者，追她需要花费一些时间。"] = "No, she is very vigilant and also very powerful... at least a Последовательность 7 Extraordinary. It will take some time to track her.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Based on a comprehensive evaluation of your Club, the Star Plateau battlefield awaits your arrival. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - Plateau War interface in time and sign up to participate on time. \n    Participate in the Plateau War to receive gifts such as connections, marionette drawing items, Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Based on a comprehensive evaluation of your Club, the Star Plateau battlefield awaits your arrival. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - Plateau War interface in time and sign up to participate on time. \n    Participate in the Plateau War to receive gifts such as connections, Марионетка drawing items, Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!",
    ["When will I be able to become a formal barista? Maybe I should go to the Divination Club after work and calculate..."] = "When will I be able to become a formal barista? Maybe I should go to the Гадание Club after work and calculate...",
    ["Not bad, this is the preliminary Spirit Vision. As expected of a \"Seer,\" only slightly worse than I was back then."] = "Not bad, this is the preliminary Spirit Vision. As expected of a \"Провидец,\" only slightly worse than I was back then.",
    ["两侧石碑均占领，可攻击城门"] = "Both stone tablets captured, you can attack the city gate",
    ["从知识中汲取力量，在目标身边召唤一个无敌的神秘幻象持续对敌人造成伤害，二段可与幻象互换位置。释放后获得神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Draw power from knowledge to summon an invincible mysterious illusion beside the target, continuously dealing damage to enemies. The second stage allows you to swap positions with the illusion. Gain mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills) after release.",
    ["今天就让你知道“终结者”的厉害。我会让你后悔来到这个场上！"] = "Today I'll show you the power of the 'Terminator'. I'll make you regret coming to this field!",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n新赛季已开启，您背包里有%s货币未使用，现已按照1:%s的转换比例自动兑换成%s货币。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nA new season has begun. You have %s unused currency in your inventory, which has now been automatically converted to %s currency at a 1:%s ratio.",
    ["与誓约组队完成各类日常玩法即可获得誓约值与同行纹章，誓约值可用于自动提升誓约等级。\n誓约等级共设多级，达到指定等级可领取等级奖励。\n非凡者每日与单个誓约最多可获取600誓约值，每周最多可获取2000誓约值。与誓约对象组队参与指定活动，还可额外获得同行纹章。\n双人模式下和誓约伙伴一起进入乌托邦剧院，可提升至副本达标评分，还会获得更多誓约值与同行纹章。\n同行纹章可用于在同行商店购买物品（誓约相关的奖励需要与誓约的等级达到指定要求）。\n非凡者可点击更换展台，进入与对应誓约对象的主页编辑功能，非凡者可更换自己角色的动作（不可编辑对方的），更换双人主页的展台，摆放摆件。\n非凡者可以在萨默尔太太处申请单人解契，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间发起申请的非凡者可以取消解契。\n非凡者也可组队前往萨默尔太太处申请双人解除解约，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳少量苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间双方可以取消解契。"] = "Forming a team with a Covenant partner to complete various daily activities can earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase the Covenant level. \nThere are multiple Covenant levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching the specified level. \nПотустороннийs can obtain a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner, and a maximum of 2000 Covenant Points per week. Forming a team with a Covenant partner to participate in designated activities can also earn additional Companion Emblems. \nIn duo mode, entering the Utopia Theater with a Covenant partner can increase the dungeon standard score and also earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require the Covenant level to reach the specified requirements). \nПотустороннийs can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function with the corresponding Covenant partner. Потустороннийs can change their character's actions (cannot edit the other party's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \nПотустороннийs can apply for a solo Covenant dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution. \nПотустороннийs can also form a team to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Covenant dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
    ["He collapsed in a locked bedroom; it was the butler who had people break down the door. The scene is still as it was; I haven't let anyone touch anything."] = "He collapsed in a locked bedroom; it was the butler who had people break down the door. The scene is still as it was; I haven't let anyone touch anything.",
    ["为什么选择“占卜家”？提醒你，一旦服用了魔药，就没有后悔的机会了。"] = "Why choose \"Провидец\"? I remind you, once you consume the potion, there is no chance to regret it.",
    ["也可以自行选择2个非凡物质作为聚合素材，消耗素材生成新的非凡物质，快来试试吧！"] = "You can also manually select 2 Потусторонний materials as aggregation ingredients, consuming them to generate new Потусторонний materials. Come and try it!",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nYou have successfully purchased the item <M_Link>%s</>. Please claim the corresponding item."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nYou have successfully purchased the item <M_Link>%s</>. Please claim the corresponding item.",
    ["Divination for <h>Mary</>"] = "Гадание for <h>Mary</>",
    ["Since last spring, I write a few lines during my night shift breaks. Look, this is my notebook."] = "Since last spring, I write a few lines during my night shift breaks. Look, this is my notebook.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\n Registration for the Peak of the Gods is now open. Prestigious titles, bound gold pounds, Soles, bound Soles, Triumph Badges, and other generous rewards are waiting for you. The regional champion can also have an honorary statue displayed!<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250113\"> [Click to Register] </>"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n Registration for the Peak of the Gods is now open. Prestigious titles, bound gold pounds, Soles, bound Soles, Triumph Badges, and other generous rewards are waiting for you. The regional champion can also have an honorary statue displayed!<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250113\"> [Click to Register] </>",
    ["什么？灵性被禁止了——先冲出禁令范围！"] = "What? Духовность has been suppressed—rush out of the suppression zone first!",
    ["从法术场id列表里面随机一个在地面创建法术场"] = "Randomly create a Spell Field on the ground from a list of Spell Field IDs.",
    ["Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has permeated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes within the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a hidden channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to influence the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former town of Utopia, clear out the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and ultimately cut off the source of the corruption."] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has permeated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs within the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a hidden channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to influence Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former town of Utopia, clear out the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and ultimately cut off the source of the Искажение.",
    ["他果然是非凡者……而且那条<P_Yellow>领带</>还是神奇物品。"] = "He really is a Потусторонний... and that <P_Yellow> necktie </> is a mystical item.",
    ["Desk trigger"] = "Desk trigger",
    ["主祭的护盾需要太阳圣徽才能击破"] = "The High Priest's shield requires the Sun Holy Emblem to be broken",
    ["主线仪式法阵"] = "Main Story Ritual Circle",
    ["When the secondary skill deals damage, it triggers an Explosion, dealing additional damage to surrounding enemies."] = "When the secondary skill deals damage, it triggers an Explosion, dealing additional damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["He hoarded his own blood, attempting to initiate a life-transmutation and resurrection ritual, but he lost control because of it and turned into a monster."] = "He hoarded his own blood, attempting to initiate a life-transmutation and resurrection ritual, but he lost control because of it and turned into a monster.",
    ["主动释放一次朗基努斯之枪后会使岁月的棋局的冷却时间减少1秒。"] = "Actively casting Spear of Longinus once reduces the Перезарядка of Gambit of the Ages by 1 second.",
    ["Clothing fragments torn from the victims of the mystical murder case in the ancient castle town, with the words \"Look at the bed\" seemingly written on them."] = "Clothing fragments torn from the victims of the mystical murder case in the ancient castle town, with the words \"Look at the bed\" seemingly written on them.",
    ["Zombie effect buff"] = "Zombie effect buff",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n     众神之巅已经开放报名，尊贵称号、绑定金镑、苏勒、绑定苏勒、凯旋徽章等丰厚奖励等你来拿，赛区冠军还可获得荣誉雕像展示！<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250113\">【点击前往报名】</>"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n Registration for the Peak of the Gods is now open. Prestigious titles, bound gold pounds, Soles, bound Soles, Triumph Badges, and other generous rewards are waiting for you. The regional champion can also have an honorary statue displayed!<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250113\"> [Click to Register] </>",
    ["丽贝卡提供的线索很及时，这枚小铜镜就是突破口，罗珊应该也有一个。"] = "The clues provided by Rebecca are very timely. This small copper mirror is the breakthrough point, Rozanne should have one too.",
    ["He held his shield at the very front and deflected all the dragon fire."] = "He held his shield at the very front and deflected all the dragon fire.",
    ["主楼梯已损毁无法前进，向楼梯左侧偏门探索"] = "The main staircase is damaged and impassable; explore the side door to the left of the staircase.",
    ["Main Story 1-5: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence"] = "Main Story 1-5: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["五次*d点伤害"] = "Five instances of *d damage.",
    ["May Manor · Castle · Normal"] = "May Manor · Castle · Normal",
    ["今天也没发现正规且有效的仪式魔法……"] = "Still haven't found any formal and effective Ritual Magic today...",
    ["主线1_8民居惊逢尸体"] = "Main Story 1-8: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nYour club's activity today is %s. If the activity remains below <Highlight>%s</> for <Highlight>%s</> consecutive days, the club will be dissolved. Please increase your club's activity as soon as possible. Remaining time: <Highlight>%s</> days."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour club's activity today is %s. If the activity remains below <Highlight>%s</> for <Highlight>%s</> consecutive days, the club will be dissolved. Please increase your club's activity as soon as possible. Remaining time: <Highlight>%s</> days.",
    ["丢失塔罗牌的女魔术师"] = "The Фокусник who lost her Tarot cards",
    ["After they left, two things changed. One was the castle; that strange feeling disappeared. The second was Old Jack—oh, that's the madman guarding the train tracks now."] = "After they left, two things changed. One was the castle; that strange feeling disappeared. The second was Old Jack—oh, that's the madman guarding the train tracks now.",
    ["二阶段-小子爵·给玩家加安全区buff"] = "Stage 2 - Little Viscount · Give player safe zone buff",
    ["丰饶之树_5200139_德鲁伊_筛选攻击信号B"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Druid_Filter Attack Signal B",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has permeated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs within the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a hidden channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to influence Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former town of Utopia, clear out the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and ultimately cut off the source of the Искажение.",
    ["为你提供相当于你最大生命值20%的护盾。此护盾每30秒刷新一次。"] = "Provides a shield equivalent to 20% of your maximum Health. This shield refreshes every 30 seconds.",
    ["书店trigger"] = "Bookstore trigger",
    ["Why is no one willing to let me perform a divination? Am I really that bad at it?"] = "Why is no one willing to let me perform a Гадание? Am I really that bad at it?",
    ["仅能配合Event：OnBeforeBuffAdd使用"] = "Can only be used in conjunction with Event: OnBeforeBuffAdd.",
    ["主界面技能长按显示提示"] = "Skill Long-Press Display Tips on Main Interface",
    ["Transmit lightning from the activated Conductive Holy Beacon to charge all beacons and break the insulation barrier."] = "Transmit lightning from the activated Conductive Holy Beacon to charge all beacons and break the insulation barrier.",
    ["人脉秘偶非凡评分"] = "Connections Марионетка Потусторонний Rating",
    ["Their spirit bodies took a photo with the current tranquility; for them, it can be considered a fulfillment."] = "Their spirit bodies took a photo with the current tranquility; for them, it can be considered a fulfillment.",
    ["之前有个打扮奇怪的女士，来咖啡厅找人，看上去怒气冲冲的，感觉不是什么好事。"] = "A strangely dressed lady came to the cafe to look for someone earlier, looking furious. It didn't feel like anything good.",
    ["亵渎魔女Boss-刺骨冰寒召唤子弹buff"] = "Profane Witch Boss - Bone-Chilling Cold Summon Bullet Buff",
    ["Do what you will, but do no harm."] = "Do what you will, but do no harm.",
    ["与指定门进行交互  对象自身添加Buff  对象自身添加Buff  "] = "Interact with the specified Door; object adds Buff to itself; object adds Buff to itself.",
    ["Connection Skill"] = "Connection Skill",
    ["Main Story Chapter 1 - Male Treant - Bloom Spell Proxy - Spawn"] = "Main Story Chapter 1 - Male Treant - Bloom Spell Proxy - Spawn",
    ["他是我们俱乐部的一位老朋友，曾经是我们这的占卜家导师。"] = "He was an old friend of our club and once served as our Гадание mentor.",
    ["Liana is also a member of the Tarot Club, but most of her energy is focused on her family, so she has always been a Sequence 9."] = "Liana is also a member of the Клуб Таро, but most of her energy is focused on her family, so she has always been a Последовательность 9.",
    ["Provide support charge to allies, dispelling their soft crowd control and slow, and providing them with damage reduction and acceleration buffs. You gain a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Unlocks Royal Court Command after use."] = "Provide support charge to allies, dispelling their soft crowd control and slow, and providing them with Снижение урона and acceleration buffs. You gain a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Unlocks Royal Court Command after use.",
    ["主讲医师：康拉德医生\n地点：廷根大学大礼堂\n守护健康 保障安全 珍惜生命\n让医疗之光普惠廷根\n参与讲座可以在现场领取家用医疗包一份！\n无需入场费 | 欢迎全市朋友听讲 | 不提供餐饮"] = "Keynote Speaker: Dr. Conrad \n Location: Тинген University Auditorium \n Guarding Health, Ensuring Safety, Cherishing Life \n Let the Light of Medicine Benefit Тинген \n Participate in the lecture to receive a home medical kit on-site! \n No admission fee | All citizens are welcome to attend | No food or drink provided",
    ["The price was also quite high; the first few sequences were completely unable to fight, and up to Sequence 6, they were all scholar-types."] = "The price was also quite high; the first few Последовательностьs were completely unable to fight, and up to Последовательность 6, they were all scholar-types.",
    ["他曾给伐木工缝合过手臂，用三剂药就治好了卡斯特肝部的隐痛。"] = "He once stitched up a lumberjack's arm and cured Castor's hidden liver pain with just three doses of medicine.",
    ["他花了很多年，才用窥秘之眼看懂那一夜。\n星象从不说谎，它只是把已经发生的事，用光写在天上。 他仰头看见了真相，也仰头看见了自己的罪孽—— 没有他念出那句咒语，一切都不会发生。\n所以他要变强，要看得更远，更准，更深， 直到帷幕后面的东西无处遁形， 直到再也不会有他看不见的危险。\n星辰告诉他：你看见了多少，你就能改变多少。\n他把这句话记下来， 后来又在旁边加了一行： \"只差一步。只要得到那个皇冠，就够了。\""] = "It took him many years to understand that night with his Eyes of Mystery Prying. \n The stars never lie; they simply write what has already happened in the sky with light. He looked up and saw the truth, and he also looked up and saw his own sins—if he hadn't chanted that spell, none of it would have happened. \n So he must become stronger, see further, more accurately, and deeper, until the things behind the curtain have nowhere to hide, until there is no longer any danger he cannot see. \n The stars told him: You can change as much as you can see. \n He wrote this down, and later added a line next to it: \"Just one step away. As long as I get that crown, it will be enough.\"",
    ["Stage 2 - Little Viscount · Give player safe zone buff"] = "Stage 2 - Little Viscount · Give player safe zone buff",
    ["He has entered a dream, hurry and break the shield!"] = "He has entered a dream, hurry and break the shield!",
    ["乌托邦剧院中失控秘偶死亡后凝结形成的秘偶精粹，可在精粹收集者商人处换购商品。"] = "Марионетка essence formed after the death of a lost-of-control Марионетка in Utopia Theater, which can be used to purchase goods from the Essence Collector merchant.",
    ["Still haven't found any formal and effective Ritual Magic today..."] = "Still haven't found any formal and effective Ritual Magic today...",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n This Final Hunt auction has ended. The dividend you received from the Final Hunt auction is %s; please check it."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n This Final Hunt auction has ended. The dividend you received from the Final Hunt auction is %s; please check it.",
    ["令人惊叹的能力，这就是非凡力量？"] = "An astonishing ability—is this Потусторонний power?",
    ["No, it also requires spirituality... I have a new idea!"] = "No, it also requires Духовность... I have a new idea!",
    ["临界救赎"] = "Critical Redemption",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Corpse Collector, Sequence 8: Gravedigger, Sequence 7: Spirit Medium, Sequence 6: Spirit Guide, Sequence 5: Gatekeeper, Sequence 4: Undying, Sequence 3: Ferryman, Sequence 2: Death Consul, Sequence 1: Pale Emperor, Sequence 0: Death"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Corpse Collector, Последовательность 8: Gravedigger, Последовательность 7: Spirit Medium, Последовательность 6: Spirit Guide, Последовательность 5: Gatekeeper, Последовательность 4: Undying, Последовательность 3: Ferryman, Последовательность 2: Death Consul, Последовательность 1: Pale Emperor, Последовательность 0: Death",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nWe regret to inform you that the club <M_Orange> %s </> you responded to could not be successfully established. Please look for another club to join."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nWe regret to inform you that the club <M_Orange> %s </> you responded to could not be successfully established. Please look for another club to join.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n你关注的商品<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</>已可购买，快前去看看吧。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe item <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</> you are following is now available for purchase. Go check it out!",
    ["与灵性追溯光球交互"] = "Interact with the Spiritual Retrospection orb.",
    ["He always used to say back then, 'Daly, you have a lot of talent.'"] = "He always used to say back then, 'Daly, you have a lot of talent.'",
    ["Produced from a mine in Coniston, Midseashire, Loen Kingdom. Although the entire city was severely devastated by the war, it possesses a large amount of materials containing spirituality. Because of the strange rumors often surrounding the mine, workers only dare to dig for the flint on the outermost layer."] = "Produced from a mine in Coniston, Midseashire, Loen Kingdom. Although the entire city was severely devastated by the war, it possesses a large amount of materials containing Духовность. Because of the strange rumors often surrounding the mine, workers only dare to dig for the flint on the outermost layer.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the game experience survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 4</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the game experience survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 4</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["个人持有能量：%s"] = "Personal energy held: %s",
    ["Main Quest Component - Acceleration Ring (Leap of Spirituality)"] = "Main Quest Component - Acceleration Ring (Leap of Духовность)",
    ["从遥远的星空投下庇护的光华，绯红意志在范围里<Disable>难以受到伤害</>。"] = "Casting protective radiance from the distant starry sky, the Crimson Will is <Disable>difficult to damage</> while within the range.",
    ["The 'Master' he mentioned is likely performing a ritual inside. We must go in and stop him immediately!"] = "The 'Master' he mentioned is likely performing a ritual inside. We must go in and stop him immediately!",
    ["事情没那么简单，我在梦中感受到了被污染的气息。"] = "It's not that simple. I felt the scent of Искажение in my dream.",
    ["仅Buff可用，免疫死亡一次，触发后移除buff"] = "Only available for Buffs; immune to death once, removes the buff after triggering.",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Bard, Sequence 8: Light Suppliant, Sequence 7: Solar High Priest, Sequence 6: Notary, Sequence 5: Priest of Light, Sequence 4: Unshadowed, Sequence 3: Justice Mentor, Sequence 2: Lightseeker, Sequence 1: White Angel, Sequence 0: Sun"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Bard, Последовательность 8: Light Suppliant, Последовательность 7: Solar High Priest, Последовательность 6: Notary, Последовательность 5: Priest of Light, Последовательность 4: Unshadowed, Последовательность 3: Justice Mentor, Последовательность 2: Lightseeker, Последовательность 1: White Angel, Последовательность 0: Sun",
    ["Today I'll show you the power of the 'Terminator'. I'll make you regret coming to this field!"] = "Today I'll show you the power of the 'Terminator'. I'll make you regret coming to this field!",
    ["The interest he charges is too high..."] = "The interest he charges is too high...",
    ["中序列之门"] = "Mid-Последовательность Door",
    ["Only effective within Link Buffs; if true, deals damage to both the buff holder and the linked target; if false, only deals damage to the Action target"] = "Only effective within Link Buffs; if true, deals damage to both the buff holder and the linked target; if false, only deals damage to the Action target",
    ["为友方提供助攻次数最多的非凡者"] = "The Потусторонний who provided the most assists to allies.",
    ["之前塔罗学派工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试偷走他奋斗的想法。"] = "The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Клуб Таро artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try stealing his idea of working hard.",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf summons 2 <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</>. After the <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</> spawn, they will enter an invisibility state, continue to move along the edge of the field, and periodically release field-wide damage that becomes increasingly higher. While the <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</> exist, they will protect the <Disable>Dark Demonic Wolf</>, keeping it in an invincible state."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf summons 2 <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</>. After the <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</> spawn, they will enter an invisibility state, continue to move along the edge of the field, and periodically release field-wide damage that becomes increasingly higher. While the <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</> exist, they will protect the <Disable>Dark Demonic Wolf</>, keeping it in an invincible state.",
    ["主线第一章-男树人-盛开法术代理-NoSpawn"] = "Main Story Chapter 1 - Male Treant - Bloom Spell Proxy - NoSpawn",
    ["Dark Demonic Wolf Charge Temporary Invisibility Removal"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf Charge Temporary Invisibility Removal",
    ["Ritual successfully interrupted"] = "Ritual successfully interrupted",
    ["他应该是在用古老的仪式吸收笔记的力量，就像我们直接服用高序列的魔药一样，这充满危险、也需要时间，他需要呆在一个安全的地方。"] = "He should be using an ancient ritual to absorb the power of the notebook, just like how we directly consume high-Последовательность potions. This is full of danger and requires time; he needs to stay in a safe place.",
    ["丰饶污染让你受到的伤害提高100%，最多叠加3层"] = "Abundance Искажение increases damage taken by 100%, stacks up to 3 times",
    ["Connection Topic - Alger 4: About Shocking News"] = "Connection Topic - Alger 4: About Shocking News",
    ["and also a group that constantly fights against danger and madness."] = "and also a group that constantly fights against danger and Безумие.",
    ["他们短期内变不回来，我也可以继续研究那些“浪费天赋”的药剂了。"] = "They won't be able to change back for a while, and I can continue researching those 'talent-wasting' potions.",
    ["他曾靠吃怪物勉强求生，但积累的毒素扭曲了他的神志和身体。"] = "He once barely survived by eating monsters, but the accumulated toxins distorted his Рассудок and body.",
    ["Formed by natural cooling from high-temperature magma, retaining some fire and earth attributes."] = "Formed by natural cooling from high-temperature magma, retaining some fire and earth attributes.",
    ["从职员们的谈话来看，终结了开膛手的角色应该是<P_Yellow>警察队长</>，在剧本上记录一下吧。"] = "Judging from the staff's conversation, the character who ended the Ripper should be <P_Yellow>the police captain</>; record it in the script.",
    ["丧钟：眩晕"] = "Death Knell: Stun",
    ["Starting today, I, the new, \"Supreme Breakdance King\"!"] = "Starting today, I, the new, \"Supreme Breakdance King\"!",
    ["乔纳尔技能3"] = "Jonar Skill 3",
    ["为了普通人的安全，非凡事件的真相无法公布出去，但我还是希望更多人知道他们的故事。"] = "For the safety of ordinary people, the truth about Потусторонний incidents cannot be made public, but I still hope more people know their stories.",
    ["书架怪的持续伤害"] = "Bookshelf Monster Continuous Damage",
    ["他就倒在一间反锁的卧室里，是管家叫人撞开的门。目前现场还保持着原来的样子，我没有让人动过任何地方。"] = "He collapsed in a locked bedroom; it was the butler who had people break down the door. The scene is still as it was; I haven't let anyone touch anything.",
    ["Interrupted Ritual"] = "Interrupted Ritual",
    ["乔纳尔医生，你的职业是治病救人，我的职责也是保护更多的人免于厄运。"] = "Dr. Jonar, your profession is to heal the sick and save people, and my duty is also to protect more people from misfortune.",
    ["Carefully observe the slogan bubbles above your head and quickly stand in the <Highlight>anti-fraud area</>. After the countdown ends, the danger zone will <Disable>explode and significantly reduce health</>."] = "Carefully observe the slogan bubbles above your head and quickly stand in the <Highlight>anti-fraud area</>. After the countdown ends, the danger zone will <Disable>explode and significantly reduce health</>.",
    ["也可以通过<Highlight>模板</>功能建造城堡，点击此处进入。"] = "You can also build a castle through the <Highlight>Template</> function. Click here to enter.",
    ["My dear lady, if a doctor could invent a surgery that treats hair loss without any cost, he would immediately become the richest man in Loen."] = "My dear lady, if a doctor could invent a surgery that treats hair loss without any cost, he would immediately become the richest man in Loen.",
    ["从序列9开始，越往上走，越接近神位。非凡之路如同海洋上的冒险，充满挑战与疯狂……"] = "From Последовательность 9 onwards, the higher you go, the closer you get to the throne of God. The path of the Потусторонний is like an adventure on the ocean, full of challenges and Безумие...",
    ["They are simply such a bargain! And they are especially diligent; if the child's grades aren't good, they even take the initiative to offer a refund. Goddess bless!"] = "They are simply such a bargain! And they are especially diligent; if the child's grades aren't good, they even take the initiative to offer a refund. Goddess bless!",
    ["East District Lunch Break Atmosphere"] = "East District Lunch Break Atmosphere",
    ["Converse with NPC. Player teleports across scenes to the specified Trigger."] = "Converse with NPC. Player teleports across scenes to the specified Trigger.",
    ["两份银白的魔药，两个新生的“观众”。"] = "Two silver-white potions, two newborn \"Зрительs\".",
    ["The Tree of Abundance was initially just a tiny seed. \n It slept in the Church of the Earth Mother, carefully kept by a Saint. The Saint knew that it carried two powerful forces, Vitality and Desolation, and could not be planted easily. \n Until the war that betrayed the oath arrived. The earth turned into scorched earth, and vitality was annihilated one after another. The Saint stood between the corpses of companions and enemies and shed a tear. \n At least, let this land be reborn. \n After the seed entered the soil, it grew rapidly. When vitality descended suddenly, desolation also stretched out its claws—so the Saint stepped forward and took all the endless desolation into her body. \n The turmoil finally subsided, and the Tree of Abundance opened its eyes. \n She turned into a human-shaped spirit, ignorant as an infant, wrapped in a golden cloak. \n A distant voice echoed in her heart: \n This is the gift of the earth. \n This is the call of Harvest."] = "The Tree of Abundance was initially just a tiny seed. \n It slept in the Church of the Earth Mother, carefully kept by a Saint. The Saint knew that it carried two powerful forces, Vitality and Desolation, and could not be planted easily. \n Until the war that betrayed the oath arrived. The earth turned into scorched earth, and vitality was annihilated one after another. The Saint stood between the corpses of companions and enemies and shed a tear. \n At least, let this land be reborn. \n After the seed entered the soil, it grew rapidly. When vitality descended suddenly, desolation also stretched out its claws—so the Saint stepped forward and took all the endless desolation into her body. \n The turmoil finally subsided, and the Tree of Abundance opened its eyes. \n She turned into a human-shaped spirit, ignorant as an infant, wrapped in a golden cloak. \n A distant voice echoed in her heart: \n This is the gift of the earth. \n This is the call of Harvest.",
    ["亚伯拉罕家族遗留的传送之杖。为目标刻下星痕标记，射程不足时消耗标记瞬移到位再出手，闪避之后还能追加一次瞬移。但触发越多，越可能失控迷路。"] = "The Teleport staff left behind by the Abraham family. Carve a star mark on the target; when the range is insufficient, consume the mark to Teleport into position before attacking, and you can add another Teleport after a Dodge. But the more it is triggered, the more likely you are to lose control and get Lost.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe item you were selling on the Exchange has been delisted. Please check it."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe item you were selling on the Exchange has been delisted. Please check it.",
    ["产生治疗时，对周身大范围内的敌人造成一次伤害，此效果有2秒内置冷却。"] = "When healing is generated, deal damage to enemies in a large area around you; this effect has a 2-second internal Перезарядка.",
    ["举起相机的刹那，时间在取景框里绊了一跤，于是定格成永恒。"] = "The moment the camera is raised, time trips in the viewfinder and freezes into eternity.",
    ["书桌触发"] = "Desk trigger",
    ["不，不，那危险的东西就在城堡的废墟里，等待人放松警惕，等我们以为安全了，然后就会……杀了所有人！"] = "No, no, that dangerous thing is in the ruins of the castle, waiting for people to let their guard down. Once we think we're safe, then it will... kill everyone!",
    ["乔纳尔的非凡特性"] = "Jonar's Потусторонний characteristic",
    ["乌黯魔狼冲锋随机筛选目标"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf Charge Random Filter Target",
    ["He was a very promising Seer, but unfortunately, I haven't seen him for several years."] = "He was a very promising Провидец, but unfortunately, I haven't seen him for several years.",
    ["为目标提供护盾、治疗"] = "Provide Shield and Healing to targets",
    ["They are too crazy, I really can't keep up with them."] = "They are too crazy, I really can't keep up with them.",
    ["Abundance Corruption"] = "Abundance Искажение",
    ["Jonar's Beyonder characteristic"] = "Jonar's Потусторонний characteristic",
    ["Communicating with the carriage driver reveals that the Ripper was likely ended <P_Yellow>outside the police station</>; record it in the script."] = "Communicating with the carriage driver reveals that the Ripper was likely ended <P_Yellow>outside the police station</>; record it in the script.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nCongratulations to your club for ranking %s on the %s leaderboard. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nCongratulations to your club for ranking %s on the %s leaderboard. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries.",
    ["丧钟：弱点攻击按钮"] = "Death Knell: Weakness attack button",
    ["从而撬动现实，实现特定的目的——无论是祈求、召唤、封印、占卜，或是其他。"] = "thereby leveraging reality to achieve specific goals—whether it be praying, summoning, sealing, Гадание, or others.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 4, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 4</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 4, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 4</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["Grafting the ability from your future fate onto you—a power sufficient to resist the nightmare's corruption."] = "Grafting the ability from your future fate onto you—a power sufficient to resist the Кошмар's Искажение.",
    ["Draw power from knowledge to summon an invincible mysterious illusion beside the target, continuously dealing damage to enemies. The second stage allows you to swap positions with the illusion. Gain mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills) after release."] = "Draw power from knowledge to summon an invincible mysterious illusion beside the target, continuously dealing damage to enemies. The second stage allows you to swap positions with the illusion. Gain mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills) after release.",
    ["Main Story 1-4: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence"] = "Main Story 1-4: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您在XXXX-XX-XX举报的ID为[%s]的非凡者，经警察厅审查，确实存在[%s]的行为，因此我们给予了%s的惩罚。感谢您为维护环境所作出的贡献！"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nThe Потусторонний with ID [%s] that you reported on XXXX-XX-XX has been reviewed by the Police Department. The behavior [%s] has been confirmed, and we have imposed a penalty of %s. Thank you for your contribution to maintaining the environment!",
    ["He has forgotten many things, a bit like me... Radio gymnastics, free boxed lunches, class schedules, and this diary full of secrets—these all bring me a sense of familiarity. Perhaps I can go to the <P_Yellow>Tarot Academy</> to look for clues."] = "He has forgotten many things, a bit like me... Radio gymnastics, free boxed lunches, class schedules, and this diary full of secrets—these all bring me a sense of familiarity. Perhaps I can go to the <P_Yellow>Tarot Academy</> to look for clues.",
    ["The above are partner buffs"] = "The above are partner buffs",
    ["亚瑟附近trigger"] = "Trigger near Arthur",
    ["Actively casting Spear of Longinus once will reduce the Cooldown of Gambit of the Ages by 3 seconds."] = "Actively casting Spear of Longinus once will reduce the Перезарядка of Gambit of the Ages by 3 seconds.",
    ["举行仪式中"] = "Performing ritual...",
    ["Why choose \"Seer\"? I remind you, once you consume the potion, there is no chance to regret it."] = "Why choose \"Провидец\"? I remind you, once you consume the potion, there is no chance to regret it.",
    ["个人得分buff"] = "Personal Score buff",
    ["Connection Skill TAB"] = "Connection Skill TAB",
    ["Attack from the front right"] = "Attack from the front right",
    ["从亲手击败的敌人身上取得，常用于血腥誓约或仇恨指向仪式。"] = "Obtained from an enemy defeated by one's own hands, often used in bloody Covenants or hatred-pointing rituals.",
    ["之前从塔罗会那里拿到了格罗塞尔游记的复制品，应该能在这里派上用场。"] = "I previously obtained a replica of the Groselle's Travels from the Клуб Таро; it should come in handy here.",
    ["Two Beyonders gather! A secret path will be formed in front of you!"] = "Two Потустороннийs gather! A secret path will be formed in front of you!",
    ["他们整队人就那么进到城堡里面去，然后……光，还有声音！所有人像睡着了似的，那场面太诡异了……"] = "Their whole team just went into the castle, and then... light, and sounds! Everyone looked like they were asleep; that scene was too eerie...",
    ["主人是位魔药天才！能为她工作真是幸福啊！"] = "Master is a potion genius! It's truly a blessing to work for her!",
    ["Divination for Mary"] = "Гадание for Mary",
    ["Profane Witch Boss: Comes with effect buff"] = "Profane Witch Boss: Comes with effect buff",
    ["Uninvited Sound acceptance trigger"] = "Uninvited Sound acceptance trigger",
    ["Tree of Abundance_5200139_Thorn Bloom B_Proxy_1_Random Spirit Body AOE"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Thorn Bloom B_Proxy_1_Random Духовное тело AOE",
    ["Forming a team with a Covenant partner to complete various daily activities can earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase the Covenant level. \nThere are multiple Covenant levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching the specified level. \nBeyonders can obtain a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner, and a maximum of 2000 Covenant Points per week. Forming a team with a Covenant partner to participate in designated activities can also earn additional Companion Emblems. \nIn duo mode, entering the Utopia Theater with a Covenant partner can increase the dungeon standard score and also earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require the Covenant level to reach the specified requirements). \nBeyonders can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function with the corresponding Covenant partner. Beyonders can change their character's actions (cannot edit the other party's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \nBeyonders can apply for a solo Covenant dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution. \nBeyonders can also form a team to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Covenant dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution."] = "Forming a team with a Covenant partner to complete various daily activities can earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase the Covenant level. \nThere are multiple Covenant levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching the specified level. \nПотустороннийs can obtain a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner, and a maximum of 2000 Covenant Points per week. Forming a team with a Covenant partner to participate in designated activities can also earn additional Companion Emblems. \nIn duo mode, entering the Utopia Theater with a Covenant partner can increase the dungeon standard score and also earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require the Covenant level to reach the specified requirements). \nПотустороннийs can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function with the corresponding Covenant partner. Потустороннийs can change their character's actions (cannot edit the other party's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \nПотустороннийs can apply for a solo Covenant dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution. \nПотустороннийs can also form a team to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Covenant dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
    ["从未修炼过俱乐部技能"] = "Never cultivated any club skills.",
    ["从始作俑者处分担伤害"] = "Share damage from perpetrator",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您抢购道具<M_Link>%s</>成功，请领取对应道具。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nYou have successfully purchased the item <M_Link>%s</>. Please claim the corresponding item.",
    ["举刀buffID（不填则不检查举刀，和默认attack效果一样"] = "Raise sword buff ID (if left blank, raising sword is not checked, same effect as default attack).",
    ["The ranges of the two attacks will definitely not be the same. <Highlight>Observe the initial attack range prompt</> and move to dodge."] = "The ranges of the two attacks will definitely not be the same. <Highlight>Observe the initial attack range prompt</> and move to dodge.",
    ["二段技能伤害增加85%。"] = "Second-stage skill damage increased by 85%.",
    ["他关爱着每位生灵，哪怕你没有信仰“愚者”，依然可以享受塔罗学院的一切。"] = "He cares for every living soul; even if you do not believe in \"Шут,\" you can still enjoy everything the Tarot Academy has to offer.",
    ["今夜琴声温柔-求婚情侣哭成一团"] = "Gentle Piano Music Tonight - The couple proposing breaks down in tears",
    ["Their whole team just went into the castle, and then... light, and sounds! Everyone looked like they were asleep; that scene was too eerie..."] = "Their whole team just went into the castle, and then... light, and sounds! Everyone looked like they were asleep; that scene was too eerie...",
    ["Tree of Abundance_5200139_Druid_Filter Attack Signal A"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Druid_Filter Attack Signal A",
    ["临时测试：攻击速度+200%。"] = "Temporary Test: Скорость атаки +200%.",
    ["五个苏勒，带你上城堡里走一遭。淘到的东西都归你，怎么样？"] = "Five Soles to take you on a trip to the castle. Anything you find is yours, how about it?",
    ["Profane Witch Drag Stun"] = "Profane Witch Drag Stun",
    ["A blank page drifting down from above the gray fog, injected with spirituality by the power of fate. When two covenants resonate, the hidden text will appear."] = "A blank page drifting down from above the gray fog, injected with Духовность by the power of fate. When two covenants resonate, the hidden text will appear.",
    ["The clouds are ignited by you, blooming into roses."] = "The clouds are ignited by you, blooming into roses.",
    ["中毒男子"] = "Poisoned Man",
    ["He replaces words with silence and writes loyalty with actions."] = "He replaces words with silence and writes loyalty with actions.",
    ["主动使用8次朗基努斯之枪后展开真理裂隙。"] = "After actively using Spear of Longinus 8 times, deploy Rift of Truth.",
    ["Divination for <h>Dennis</>"] = "Гадание for <h>Dennis</>",
    ["五月庄园出现非凡异变，伴随着大量的污染。"] = "An extraordinary mutation has occurred at May Manor, accompanied by a large amount of Искажение.",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Mystery Pryer, Sequence 8: Melee Scholar, Sequence 7: Warlock, Sequence 6: Scrolls Professor, Sequence 5: Constellations Master, Sequence 4: Mysticologist, Sequence 3: Clairvoyant, Sequence 2: Sage, Sequence 1: Knowledge Emperor, Sequence 0: Hermit"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Подглядывающий за Тайнами, Последовательность 8: Melee Scholar, Последовательность 7: Warlock, Последовательность 6: Scrolls Professor, Последовательность 5: Constellations Master, Последовательность 4: Mysticologist, Последовательность 3: Clairvoyant, Последовательность 2: Sage, Последовательность 1: Knowledge Emperor, Последовательность 0: Hermit",
    ["Center's Ambition: Damage Boost +15%, maximum Health +25%."] = "Center's Ambition: Damage Boost +15%, maximum Health +25%.",
    ["亵渎魔女Boss的Buff号段尾"] = "Profane Witch Boss Buff ID Range End",
    ["Dialogue Triggered by Main Statue Treasure Chest Reward"] = "Dialogue Triggered by Main Statue Treasure Chest Reward",
    ["亵渎魔女拖拽眩晕"] = "Profane Witch Drag Stun",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The gold for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The gold for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["Dr. Jonar, your profession is to heal the sick and save people, and my duty is also to protect more people from misfortune."] = "Dr. Jonar, your profession is to heal the sick and save people, and my duty is also to protect more people from misfortune.",
    ["The human heart is the most clamorous silence."] = "The human heart is the most clamorous silence.",
    ["Both stone tablets captured, you can attack the city gate"] = "Both stone tablets captured, you can attack the city gate",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    很遗憾的通知您，由于您所管理俱乐部的活跃度未达到四方联赛的参与条件，将冻结后续四方联赛的参与资格（当您所在俱乐部满足参与条件后，将于下轮联赛开启前恢复四方联赛参与资格）。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n We regret to inform you that because the activity of the club you manage did not meet the participation conditions for the Four-Way League, your eligibility for subsequent Four-Way League participation will be frozen (once your club meets the participation conditions, your Four-Way League participation eligibility will be restored before the next league starts).",
    ["Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes in the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Beyonder level, and the recommended Beyonder rating will also change with the Beyonder level. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 1.5 times that of normal difficulty."] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs in the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a secret channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the Искажение. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Потусторонний level, and the recommended Потусторонний rating will also change with the Потусторонний level. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 1.5 times that of normal difficulty.",
    ["丰饶之树_5200139_运动会_代理_2_蘑菇+藤蔓+场地污染"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Sports Meet_Proxy_2_Mushroom+Vine+Field Искажение",
    ["不错，那我们开始今天的课程——制作符咒。"] = "Not bad, then let's start today's lesson—making charms.",
    ["人皮的封面、写满了仪式魔法的书……"] = "A cover made of human skin, a book filled with Ritual Magic...",
    ["今天开始，我，新的，“至尊霹雳舞王”！"] = "Starting today, I, the new, \"Supreme Breakdance King\"!",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the leisure gameplay survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - Leisure Gameplay Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the leisure gameplay survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - Leisure Gameplay Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您在挑战BOSS时因加入了中途本或网络原因未领取奖励，我们为您临时储存于邮箱中，请及时领取。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYou did not receive rewards while challenging the BOSS due to joining a session in progress or network issues. We have temporarily stored them in your mailbox; please collect them in time.",
    ["The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Tarot Club artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try that."] = "The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Клуб Таро artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try that.",
    ["Causes party members within 25 meters to gain a <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</>, lasting for *f seconds. If the distance between the holder of the <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</> and the caster exceeds 70 meters, the holder will lose the <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</>. This skill has a 20-second party Cooldown. \nOnly available in <HighLight>Imagination Stance</>; switches to <HighLight>Frenzy</> under <HighLight>Nightmare Stance</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Heart Healing Mark</>: The holder gains *d** Damage Reduction. When the caster of the mark uses a combat skill to perform Healing, the holder of the mark recovers Health equal to 80% of the healing amount (affected by the target's Healing Reduction)."] = "Causes party members within 25 meters to gain a <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</>, lasting for *f seconds. If the distance between the holder of the <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</> and the caster exceeds 70 meters, the holder will lose the <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</>. This skill has a 20-second party Перезарядка. \nOnly available in <HighLight>Imagination Stance</>; switches to <HighLight>Frenzy</> under <HighLight>Кошмар Stance</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Heart Healing Mark</>: The holder gains *d** Снижение урона. When the caster of the mark uses a Боевой навык to perform Healing, the holder of the mark recovers Health equal to 80% of the healing amount (affected by the target's Healing Reduction).",
    ["The situation is already very clear: this is a black market trading point, and a Beyonder has intervened in this case."] = "The situation is already very clear: this is a black market trading point, and a Потусторонний has intervened in this case.",
    ["与誓约组队完成各类日常玩法即可获得誓约值与同行纹章，誓约值可用于自动提升誓约等级。\n誓约等级共设多级，达到指定等级可领取等级奖励。\n非凡者每日与单个誓约最多可获取600誓约值，每周最多可获取2000誓约值。与誓约对象组队参与指定活动，还可额外获得同行纹章。\n双人模式下和誓约伙伴一起进入乌托邦剧院，可提升至副本达标评分，还会获得更多誓约值与同行纹章。\n同行纹章可用于在同行商店购买物品（誓约相关的奖励需要与誓约的等级达到指定要求）。\n非凡者可点击更换展台，进入与对应誓约对象的主页编辑功能，非凡者可更换自己角色的动作（不可编辑对方的），更换双人主页的展台，摆放摆件。\n非凡者可以在萨默尔太太处申请单人解契，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳绑定苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间发起申请的非凡者可以取消解契。\n非凡者也可组队前往萨默尔太太处申请双人解除解约，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳少量绑定苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间双方可以取消解契。"] = "Team up with your Covenant partner to complete various daily activities to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase your Covenant Level.\nThere are multiple Covenant Levels; reach the specified level to claim level rewards.\nПотустороннийs can earn a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner and a maximum of 2000 per week. Teaming up with your Covenant partner to participate in designated activities will also grant additional Companion Emblems.\nEntering the Utopia Theater with your Covenant partner in duo mode allows you to reach the dungeon's target rating and earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems.\nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require reaching the specified Covenant Level).\nПотустороннийs can click to change the display stand, enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Covenant partner, change their character's pose (cannot edit the other person's), change the duo homepage display stand, and place ornaments.\nПотустороннийs can apply for a solo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution.\nПотустороннийs can also team up to apply for a duo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
    ["Successfully restore sanity to Beyonders 200 times in total."] = "Successfully restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs 200 times in total.",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Warrior, Sequence 8: Pugilist, Sequence 7: Weapon Master, Sequence 6: Dawn Paladin, Sequence 5: Guardian, Sequence 4: Demon Hunter, Sequence 3: Silver Knight, Sequence 2: Glory, Sequence 1: Hand of God, Sequence 0: Twilight Giant"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Warrior, Последовательность 8: Pugilist, Последовательность 7: Weapon Master, Последовательность 6: Dawn Paladin, Последовательность 5: Guardian, Последовательность 4: Demon Охотник, Последовательность 3: Silver Knight, Последовательность 2: Glory, Последовательность 1: Hand of God, Последовательность 0: Twilight Giant",
    ["Trigger near Arthur"] = "Trigger near Arthur",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期副本%s中参与的拍卖涉及线下交易（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>）。为保障您的权益，请勿参与线下交易，如果继续出现类似行为，账号将会受到进一步处罚（包括但不限于冻结货币、封印副本拍卖等）。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights, please do not participate in offline trading. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing dungeon auctions, etc.).",
    ["中级非凡物质礼包"] = "Mid-level Потусторонний Material Pack",
    ["Bookshelf Monster Continuous Damage"] = "Bookshelf Monster Continuous Damage",
    ["He passed away some time ago. Even though he was a very powerful divination master, he couldn't foresee his own fate."] = "He passed away some time ago. Even though he was a very powerful Гадание master, he couldn't foresee his own fate.",
    ["中间trigger和滑轨"] = "Middle trigger and slide rail",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008626"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008626",
    ["二段连击"] = "Two-Stage Combo",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nYour pre-order for the item <M_Link>%s</> was successful. Please claim your item."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour pre-order for the item <M_Link>%s</> was successful. Please claim your item.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>), which did not pass the audit. The Sol amount for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide details to the customer service platform."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>), which did not pass the audit. The Sol amount for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide details to the customer service platform.",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008606"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008606",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nIn this round of spiritual resonance for the Covenant, there was no partner perfectly compatible with you. \nPlease do not be discouraged; perhaps in the next seven days, the threads of fate will lead you to the right person. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path. \nMrs. Sammer\nSincerely"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nIn this round of spiritual resonance for the Covenant, there was no partner perfectly compatible with you. \nPlease do not be discouraged; perhaps in the next seven days, the threads of fate will lead you to the right person. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path. \nMrs. Sammer\nSincerely",
    ["从去年春天开始，每次夜班休息时写几句。看，这是我的笔记本。"] = "Since last spring, I write a few lines during my night shift breaks. Look, this is my notebook.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. Dungeon auctions have been banned until %s. You can unfreeze them early by paying a security deposit of %s pounds in the dungeon auction interface. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. Dungeon auctions have been banned until %s. You can unfreeze them early by paying a security deposit of %s pounds in the dungeon auction interface. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["他遗忘了很多东西，和我有点像……广播体操、免费盒饭、课程表还有这本充满秘密的日记，这些都给我带来熟悉的感觉，或许可以去<P_Yellow>塔罗学院</>找找线索。"] = "He has forgotten many things, a bit like me... Radio gymnastics, free boxed lunches, class schedules, and this diary full of secrets—these all bring me a sense of familiarity. Perhaps I can go to the <P_Yellow>Tarot Academy</> to look for clues.",
    ["主动前往<Highlight>法阵中集合分摊</>，可以阻止奥赛库斯造成灭团伤害。"] = "Proactively go to the <Highlight>magic circle to gather and share damage</>, which can prevent Osekus from causing a party wipe.",
    ["主线1_3源堡解围"] = "Main Story 1-3: Relief from Sefirah Castle",
    ["仅仅是魔药配方这一项，就能将人推向不可预知的漩涡。"] = "Just the potion formula alone can push people into an unpredictable vortex.",
    ["人类想要成为非凡者，一般都需要服用魔药。"] = "Humans who want to become Потустороннийs generally need to consume potions.",
    ["为了获得胜利，各势力需要争夺战场中央平台上的<Highlight>死亡骑士</>。战斗结束时，会根据四皇势力积分排名获得不同档次的奖励，通过多次引领<Highlight>死亡骑士</>到达本阵营<Highlight>广场</>，获得大量势力积分，可提前结束战场，获得完胜奖励。\n以俱乐部为单位进行分配，将筛选非凡者人数、活跃度、非凡评分符合要求的俱乐部参与，获得资格的俱乐部非凡者可在以战养战-势力-高原战界面查看赛程安排。"] = "To achieve victory, each faction needs to compete for the <Highlight> Death Knight </> on the central platform of the battlefield. When the battle ends, different levels of rewards will be awarded based on the ranking of the Four Emperors faction points. By leading the <Highlight> Death Knight </> to your faction's <Highlight> plaza </> multiple times, you can obtain a large number of faction points, end the battlefield early, and obtain complete victory rewards. \n Allocation is done by club. Clubs that meet the requirements for the number of Потустороннийs, activity, and Потусторонний score will be selected to participate. Qualified club Потустороннийs can view the schedule in the War-for-War - Faction - Plateau Battle interface.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n      我们留意到，关于调研问卷4，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n      若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷4</>\n      感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 4, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 4</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["No, my point—what I mean is, Your Excellency, what must I do to become a Beyonder?"] = "No, my point—what I mean is, Your Excellency, what must I do to become a Потусторонний?",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the PVE survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVE Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the PVE survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVE Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n恭喜您的等级达到38级！我们为您准备了等级奖励，用于版本测试升级养成使用，请查收！祝愿您在诡秘世界冒险愉快！"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nCongratulations on reaching level 38! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Повелитель Тайн!",
    ["Use only the visual representation of this spell field, not its logic."] = "Use only the visual representation of this spell field, not its logic.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n战令活动已结束，战令额外背包内的道具暂存在邮件，请及时查收。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe Battle Pass event has ended. Items in the extra Battle Pass inventory are temporarily stored in your mail; please check them in time.",
    ["After actively using Spear of Longinus 3 times, unfold Rift of Truth; damage is increased by 50% when hitting only one target."] = "After actively using Spear of Longinus 3 times, unfold Rift of Truth; damage is increased by 50% when hitting only one target.",
    ["I heard before that as long as you have an item related to the person, you can try to divine their whereabouts?"] = "I heard before that as long as you have an item related to the person, you can try to divine their whereabouts?",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n祝贺您达成[%s]成就，现为您奉上丰厚的奖励，希望您再接再厉，在诡秘世界中闯出一番天地。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nCongratulations on achieving the [%s] achievement. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries.",
    ["Form a team with your Oath partner to complete various daily activities to earn Oath Points and Companion Emblems. Oath Points can be used to automatically increase your Oath Level. \n There are multiple Oath Levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching specified levels. \n A Beyonder can earn a maximum of 600 Oath Points per day with a single Oath partner, and a maximum of 2000 per week. Participate in designated activities while teamed up with your Oath partner to earn additional Companion Emblems. \n Teaming up with your Oath partner for the Utopia Theater Duo Mode will grant more Oath Points and Companion Emblems, along with additional ability bonuses during the activity. \n Companion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Oath-related rewards require your Oath Level to meet specific requirements). \n Beyonders can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Oath partner. Beyonders can change their own character's actions (you cannot edit the other person's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \n Beyonders can apply for a solo Oath dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can Cancel the dissolution. \n Beyonders can also team up to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Oath dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, both parties can Cancel the dissolution."] = "Form a team with your Oath partner to complete various daily activities to earn Oath Points and Companion Emblems. Oath Points can be used to automatically increase your Oath Level. \n There are multiple Oath Levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching specified levels. \n A Потусторонний can earn a maximum of 600 Oath Points per day with a single Oath partner, and a maximum of 2000 per week. Participate in designated activities while teamed up with your Oath partner to earn additional Companion Emblems. \n Teaming up with your Oath partner for the Utopia Theater Duo Mode will grant more Oath Points and Companion Emblems, along with additional ability bonuses during the activity. \n Companion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Oath-related rewards require your Oath Level to meet specific requirements). \n Потустороннийs can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Oath partner. Потустороннийs can change their own character's actions (you cannot edit the other person's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \n Потустороннийs can apply for a solo Oath dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can Cancel the dissolution. \n Потустороннийs can also team up to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Oath dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, both parties can Cancel the dissolution.",
    ["丰饶的污染还有残留……"] = "There is still some residual Искажение of the Mother Tree of Desire...",
    ["When the Dominator's Clash match reaches one minute and two minutes, attack power will increase; you can use this effect to win the match."] = "When the Dominator's Clash match reaches one minute and two minutes, attack power will increase; you can use this effect to win the match.",
    ["Never cultivated any club skills."] = "Never cultivated any club skills.",
    ["丽埃娜也是塔罗学派的成员，但大部分精力都放在了家庭上，所以一直是序列9。"] = "Liana is also a member of the Клуб Таро, but most of her energy is focused on her family, so she has always been a Последовательность 9.",
    ["Pulling a card from the pages of the book. It looks like a Tarot card, with a blood moon depicted on it."] = "Pulling a card from the pages of the book. It looks like a Tarot card, with a blood moon depicted on it.",
    ["Main Interface Skill Long-Press Display Instructions"] = "Main Interface Skill Long-Press Display Instructions",
    ["仅肉鸽使用，用于实现复活不消耗次数"] = "Only used in Roguelike, used to implement resurrection without consuming charges.",
    ["丰收、富饶、生机勃勃。持有一段时间后背负诅咒，你死去时原地长出活化土地，为友方持续回血、提升攻击并免疫控制。但土地存在期间，你无法复活。"] = "Harvest, richness, and vitality. After holding it for a period of time, you bear a Curse; when you die, activated land grows on the spot, continuously healing teammates, increasing Attack, and granting immunity to control. But while the land exists, you cannot be Resurrected.",
    ["Team up with your Covenant partner to complete various daily activities to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase your Covenant Level.\nThere are multiple Covenant Levels; reach the specified level to claim level rewards.\nBeyonders can earn a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner and a maximum of 2000 per week. Teaming up with your Covenant partner to participate in designated activities will also grant additional Companion Emblems.\nEntering the Utopia Theater with your Covenant partner in duo mode allows you to reach the dungeon's target rating and earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems.\nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require reaching the specified Covenant Level).\nBeyonders can click to change the display stand, enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Covenant partner, change their character's pose (cannot edit the other person's), change the duo homepage display stand, and place ornaments.\nBeyonders can apply for a solo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution.\nBeyonders can also team up to apply for a duo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution."] = "Team up with your Covenant partner to complete various daily activities to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase your Covenant Level.\nThere are multiple Covenant Levels; reach the specified level to claim level rewards.\nПотустороннийs can earn a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner and a maximum of 2000 per week. Teaming up with your Covenant partner to participate in designated activities will also grant additional Companion Emblems.\nEntering the Utopia Theater with your Covenant partner in duo mode allows you to reach the dungeon's target rating and earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems.\nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require reaching the specified Covenant Level).\nПотустороннийs can click to change the display stand, enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Covenant partner, change their character's pose (cannot edit the other person's), change the duo homepage display stand, and place ornaments.\nПотустороннийs can apply for a solo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution.\nПотустороннийs can also team up to apply for a duo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
    ["他已经去世有一段时间了。明明是一位很厉害的占卜大师，却也无法探知自己的命运呀。"] = "He passed away some time ago. Even though he was a very powerful Гадание master, he couldn't foresee his own fate.",
    ["乌托邦剧院是和“愚者”先生记忆相关的封印物，母神试图污染它，以影响祂的精神……"] = "The Utopia Theater is a Запечатанный артефакт related to Mr. Fool's memories. The Mother Goddess is attempting to corrupt it to influence His spirit...",
    ["不，我的重点，我的意思是，阁下，我该怎样做才能成为非凡者？"] = "No, my point—what I mean is, Your Excellency, what must I do to become a Потусторонний?",
    ["乌黯魔狼很擅长躲藏，深谙占卜家途径的生存之道，直到祂遇到愚者。"] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf is very good at hiding and understands the survival ways of the Провидец Pathway, until He met Шут.",
    ["The Utopia Theater is a Sealed Artifact related to Mr. Fool's memories. The Mother Goddess is attempting to corrupt it to influence His spirit..."] = "The Utopia Theater is a Запечатанный артефакт related to Mr. Fool's memories. The Mother Goddess is attempting to corrupt it to influence His spirit...",
    ["世界灾厄中，队伍成员变更，将在本局中失去进入排行榜的资格，且只能以个人伤害量结算奖励，是否仍同意新队员进队？"] = "In World Calamity, changing team members will disqualify you from the leaderboard for this match, and rewards will only be settled based on individual damage. Do you still agree to let the new member join the team?",
    ["Because of his near-drowning, his memories are in chaos and his mental state is not mature enough; we have lost the foundation for communication. The Tarot Academy has already been secretly observing and protecting him, preparing to find an opportunity to establish contact."] = "Because of his near-drowning, his memories are in chaos and his mental state is not mature enough; we have lost the foundation for communication. The Tarot Academy has already been secretly observing and protecting him, preparing to find an opportunity to establish contact.",
    ["为<h>老约翰</>占卜"] = "Гадание for <h>Old John</>",
    ["主线-占卜家失控精英怪"] = "Main Story - Провидец Out-of-Control Elite Monster",
    ["Judging from the staff's conversation, the character who ended the Ripper should be <P_Yellow>the police captain</>; record it in the script."] = "Judging from the staff's conversation, the character who ended the Ripper should be <P_Yellow>the police captain</>; record it in the script.",
    ["Bookstore trigger"] = "Bookstore trigger",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the PVP survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVP Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the PVP survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVP Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["To help you better adapt to the Beyonder world, Mr. Fool guided us to establish the Tarot Academy."] = "To help you better adapt to the Потусторонний world, Mr. Fool guided us to establish the Tarot Academy.",
    ["A young man came to you for divination today, carrying a cat."] = "A young man came to you for Гадание today, carrying a cat.",
    ["也是一群 时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的"] = "and also a group that constantly fights against danger and Безумие.",
    ["When the World Calamity dies, Beyonders who participated in the battle can receive rewards. Rewards can only be obtained <Highlight>once</> per week."] = "When the World Calamity dies, Потустороннийs who participated in the battle can receive rewards. Rewards can only be obtained <Highlight>once</> per week.",
    ["为玩家角色添加永久免疫伤害及受击效果buff"] = "Add permanent damage immunity and hit effect buff to player character",
    ["When healing is generated, deal damage to enemies in a large area around you; this effect has a 2-second internal cooldown."] = "When healing is generated, deal damage to enemies in a large area around you; this effect has a 2-second internal Перезарядка.",
    ["他们好像只是睡着了，看来仪式并非完全安全。希望他们可以长记性吧。"] = "They seem to have just fallen asleep; it appears the ritual wasn't entirely safe. I hope they learn their lesson.",
    ["他在教授<P_Yellow>魔镜占卜</>……"] = "He is teaching <P_Yellow>Mirror Гадание</>...",
    ["Diviner who lost Tarot cards"] = "Diviner who lost Tarot cards",
    ["The Utopia Theater is a Sealed Artifact left by Mr. Fool, but the internal corridors have recently undergone mutations; I hope the \"actors\" inside still recognize their scripts."] = "The Utopia Theater is a Запечатанный артефакт left by Mr. Fool, but the internal corridors have recently undergone mutations; I hope the \"actors\" inside still recognize their scripts.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    “势力战”已经拉开帷幕， 您的俱乐部在战区筛选中积分排名前四，获得进入猎城战决胜战场的资格。\n    请及时在以战养战-势力-猎城战界面查看赛程赛制。请您务必留意，同一俱乐部单个途径的正式成员最多上场<M_Orange>16人</>，合理规划阵容配置。\n    决胜战场将决定此次势力战各势力的胜负，参与可收获人脉和秘偶抽取道具、更高苏勒分红、战场称号等馈赠。\n    愿您在四皇注视下主宰战场，稍后再见！"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Your Club ranked in the top four in the war zone screening, earning the qualification to enter the City of Dragon Hunting decisive battlefield. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - City of Dragon Hunting interface in time. Please note that a single Club can have a maximum of <M_Orange>16 people</> from a single Pathway as official members on the field; plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n    The decisive battlefield will determine the outcome of this Faction War for each faction. Participating can yield gifts such as connections, Марионетка drawing items, higher Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!",
    ["丽埃娜技能"] = "Liana Skill",
    ["For the safety of ordinary people, the truth about Beyonder incidents cannot be made public, but I still hope more people know their stories."] = "For the safety of ordinary people, the truth about Потусторонний incidents cannot be made public, but I still hope more people know their stories.",
    ["Uante, I know you, a second-rate playwright, a mediocre \"Spectator.\" Even with Beyonder power, you still linger in secular evaluation, thinking that your talent is beyond anyone's reach. You have written countless manuscripts, waiting for an opportunity to be appreciated; you loudly criticize the vulgarity of hit dramas; you are jealous of the words of those authors; you hate this world, yet you long for the eyes of the whole world to focus on you; you want to be satisfied, no matter what the price. \n Sitting in the audience is not for you; I have a ritual that can allow you to pray to the Gods. You only need to please Him with a sufficiently flamboyant death, and you will be able to fulfill your wish."] = "Uante, I know you, a second-rate playwright, a mediocre \"Зритель.\" Even with Потусторонний power, you still linger in secular evaluation, thinking that your talent is beyond anyone's reach. You have written countless manuscripts, waiting for an opportunity to be appreciated; you loudly criticize the vulgarity of hit dramas; you are jealous of the words of those authors; you hate this world, yet you long for the eyes of the whole world to focus on you; you want to be satisfied, no matter what the price. \n Sitting in the audience is not for you; I have a ritual that can allow you to pray to the Gods. You only need to please Him with a sufficiently flamboyant death, and you will be able to fulfill your wish.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期交易涉嫌线下交易或苏勒转移（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>），未通过审核。该笔订单苏勒已永久扣除。如有疑问，请通过用户中心-联系客服反馈详细情况。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that your recent transaction is suspected of being an offline trade or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The gold for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["乌黯魔狼上天-无敌效果"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf Ascend-Invincibility Effect",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于PVP专题的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷-PVP专题</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the PVP survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVP Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["The Utopia Theater stage will refresh with 3 marionettes available for selection each time. If only purple marionettes remain on the stage after selection, the stage will automatically refresh. \nPrologue Selection: Consumes 3 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 3 marionettes on stage. \nMid-Act Selection: Consumes 6 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 2 remaining marionettes on stage. \nCurtain Call Selection: Consumes 12 [Gold Spun Threads] to guaranteed obtain the 1 remaining marionette on stage."] = "The Utopia Theater stage will refresh with 3 Марионеткаs available for selection each time. If only purple Марионеткаs remain on the stage after selection, the stage will automatically refresh. \nPrologue Selection: Consumes 3 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 3 Марионеткаs on stage. \nMid-Act Selection: Consumes 6 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 2 remaining Марионеткаs on stage. \nCurtain Call Selection: Consumes 12 [Gold Spun Threads] to guaranteed obtain the 1 remaining Марионетка on stage.",
    ["Total damage of nine hits: <HighLight>162%</> attack"] = "Total damage of nine hits: <HighLight>162%</> attack",
    ["Talk to the Breakdance King"] = "Talk to the Breakdance King",
    ["之前从塔罗会那里拿到了2-049的复制品，应该能在这里派上用场。"] = "I previously obtained a replica of 2-049 from the Клуб Таро; it should come in handy here.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    “势力战”已经拉开帷幕，通过对您俱乐部的综合评判，猎龙之城演兵战场将静候您的到来。\n    请及时在以战养战-势力-猎城战界面查看赛程赛制。请您务必留意，同一俱乐部单个途径的正式成员最多上场<M_Orange>16人</>，合理规划阵容配置。\n    参与猎城战，可收获人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红、战场称号等馈赠。\n    愿您在四皇注视下主宰战场，稍后再见！"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Based on a comprehensive evaluation of your Club, the City of Dragon Hunting drill battlefield awaits your arrival. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - City of Dragon Hunting interface in time. Please note that a single Club can have a maximum of <M_Orange>16 people</> from a single Pathway as official members on the field; plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n    Participate in the City of Dragon Hunting war to receive gifts such as connections, Марионетка drawing items, Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!",
    ["于迷雾中追寻灵性气息……"] = "Pursuing spiritual aura in the fog...",
    ["与马车夫交流可以知道，开膛手应该是在<P_Yellow>警局外</>被终结，在剧本上记录一下吧。"] = "Communicating with the carriage driver reveals that the Ripper was likely ended <P_Yellow>outside the police station</>; record it in the script.",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008609"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008609",
    ["二阶段-管家标记buff"] = "Phase 2 - Butler Mark Buff",
    ["Critical Limit"] = "Critical Limit",
    ["与另一枚果核气息相连：击破其中之一后，须在 3 秒内击破另一枚，逾期将引发全屏毁灭性爆炸。"] = "Connected to the aura of another core: after breaking one, you must break the other within 3 seconds, otherwise it will trigger a screen-wide devastating explosion.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nYour Covenant partner:%s has entered into a new Covenant with someone else. \nLove and bonds are never limited. May your respective stories become even richer."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour Covenant partner:%s has entered into a new Covenant with someone else. \nLove and bonds are never limited. May your respective stories become even richer.",
    ["May Manor · Castle"] = "May Manor · Castle",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nCongratulations on reaching level 59! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Lord of Mysteries!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nCongratulations on reaching level 59! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Повелитель Тайн!",
    ["Ouroboros will simultaneously assign a random fate effect to all players, Medici, and Alista, which are <Disable>Success</> and <Disable>Failure</>. If players attack an enemy with the same fate as themselves, they will take massive <Disable>reflected damage</>."] = "Ouroboros will simultaneously assign a random fate effect to all players, Medici, and Alista, which are <Disable>Success</> and <Disable>Failure</>. If players attack an enemy with the same fate as themselves, they will take massive <Disable>reflected damage</>.",
    ["Not bad, then let's start today's lesson—making charms."] = "Not bad, then let's start today's lesson—making charms.",
    ["人类总觉得治疗是单向的——医生治疗病人，强者帮助弱者。但奥黛丽教会我：真正的关系，是互相看见。"] = "Humans always think that healing is one-way—doctors heal patients, the strong help the weak. But Audrey taught me: true relationships are about seeing each other.",
    ["之前塔罗学院工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试偷走他奋斗的想法。"] = "The Запечатанный артефакт 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Клуб Таро's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try stealing his desire to strive.",
    ["主线2-2任务触发"] = "Main quest 2-2 trigger",
    ["主宰争锋对局达到一分钟和两分钟时，攻击力将获得提升，可利用该效果拿下对局。"] = "When the Dominator's Clash match reaches one minute and two minutes, attack power will increase; you can use this effect to win the match.",
    ["The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Tarot Club artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try stealing his idea of working hard."] = "The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Клуб Таро artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try stealing his idea of working hard.",
    ["Phase 2 - Butler Mark Buff"] = "Phase 2 - Butler Mark Buff",
    ["为所欲为，但勿伤害。"] = "Do what you will, but do no harm.",
    ["Perhaps understanding the Beyonder world under proper guidance is safer than knowing nothing or only knowing half-truths."] = "Perhaps understanding the Потусторонний world under proper guidance is safer than knowing nothing or only knowing half-truths.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe item <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</> you are following is now available for purchase. Go check it out!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe item <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</> you are following is now available for purchase. Go check it out!",
    ["亡灵消失trigger"] = "Undead Disappear Trigger",
    ["Protagonist Quest Heal"] = "Protagonist Quest Heal",
    ["主宰争锋公平机制，所有非凡者获得属性平衡。"] = "Dominator's Clash fairness mechanism, all Потустороннийs receive attribute balancing.",
    ["仅当  LevelByOtherSkill 为职业/伙伴/秘偶技能有效.\nCastAttack释放的等级取自 LevelByOtherSkill 技能本身."] = "Only valid when LevelByOtherSkill is a Class Skill, Partner Skill, or Марионетка Skill. \n The level of the released CastAttack is taken from the LevelByOtherSkill skill itself.",
    ["Abaddon releases a forbidden spell, summoning a large number of meteors infused with evil energy to fall from the sky. If a meteor hits the ground, it will explode, dealing damage to all players and applying an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect. If a player catches a meteor before it hits the ground, it will only deal damage to that player and apply an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect."] = "Abaddon releases a forbidden spell, summoning a large number of meteors infused with evil energy to fall from the sky. If a meteor hits the ground, it will explode, dealing damage to all players and applying an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect. If a player catches a meteor before it hits the ground, it will only deal damage to that player and apply an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect.",
    ["Main Interface Skill Hover Display Instructions"] = "Main Interface Skill Hover Display Instructions",
    ["东区午休氛围"] = "East District Lunch Break Atmosphere",
    ["In World Calamity, changing team members will disqualify you from the leaderboard for this match, and rewards will only be settled based on individual damage. Do you still agree to let the new member join the team?"] = "In World Calamity, changing team members will disqualify you from the leaderboard for this match, and rewards will only be settled based on individual damage. Do you still agree to let the new member join the team?",
    ["习得后的小光环"] = "Small aura after learning",
    ["Skill Floating Display Tips on Main Interface"] = "Skill Floating Display Tips on Main Interface",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n你关注的商品<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</>已下架。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe item <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</> you are following has been delisted.",
    ["从迷雾树人本体剥离的核心根部，极具灵性。"] = "The core root stripped from the main body of a mist treant, possessing great Духовность.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：很抱歉的通知您，众神之巅玩法由于不可抗力，改为19时准时开始，请各位非凡者下线午休，祝好梦。发件人：系统"] = "Dear Потусторонний: We regret to inform you that, due to circumstances beyond our control, the Peak of the Gods event will now begin promptly at 19. Please log off and take an afternoon break. Sweet dreams. Sender: System",
    ["Second-stage sword energy damage increased by 20%. If the second stage misses the target, 10% of the skill cooldown is refunded."] = "Second-stage sword energy damage increased by 20%. If the second stage misses the target, 10% of the skill Перезарядка is refunded.",
    ["It took him many years to understand that night with his Eyes of Mystery Prying. \n The stars never lie; they simply write what has already happened in the sky with light. He looked up and saw the truth, and he also looked up and saw his own sins—if he hadn't chanted that spell, none of it would have happened. \n So he must become stronger, see further, more accurately, and deeper, until the things behind the curtain have nowhere to hide, until there is no longer any danger he cannot see. \n The stars told him: You can change as much as you can see. \n He wrote this down, and later added a line next to it: \"Just one step away. As long as I get that crown, it will be enough.\""] = "It took him many years to understand that night with his Eyes of Mystery Prying. \n The stars never lie; they simply write what has already happened in the sky with light. He looked up and saw the truth, and he also looked up and saw his own sins—if he hadn't chanted that spell, none of it would have happened. \n So he must become stronger, see further, more accurately, and deeper, until the things behind the curtain have nowhere to hide, until there is no longer any danger he cannot see. \n The stars told him: You can change as much as you can see. \n He wrote this down, and later added a line next to it: \"Just one step away. As long as I get that crown, it will be enough.\"",
    ["Mid-level Beyonder Material Pack"] = "Mid-level Потусторонний Material Pack",
    ["主动释放一次朗基努斯之枪后会使岁月的棋局的冷却时间减少3秒。"] = "Actively casting Spear of Longinus once will reduce the Перезарядка of Gambit of the Ages by 3 seconds.",
    ["他们简直是太划算了！而且特别认真，孩子成绩不好还会主动提出退钱。女神保佑！"] = "They are simply such a bargain! And they are especially diligent; if the child's grades aren't good, they even take the initiative to offer a refund. Goddess bless!",
    ["为<h>玛丽</>占卜"] = "Гадание for <h>Mary</>",
    ["Provide Shield and Healing to targets"] = "Provide Shield and Healing to targets",
    ["The whispers of the undead linger here as guidance, the ferry crossing where all death finds silence."] = "The whispers of the undead linger here as guidance, the ferry crossing where all death finds silence.",
    ["什么……仪式？我们不是来过生日的吗？"] = "What... ritual? Aren't we here for a birthday party?",
    ["Interact with the specified Door; object adds Buff to itself; object adds Buff to itself."] = "Interact with the specified Door; object adds Buff to itself; object adds Buff to itself.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n    We have noticed that regarding the first-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 1</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your spirituality guide your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    We have noticed that regarding the first-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 1</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["主角任务回血"] = "Protagonist Quest Heal",
    ["No, she is very vigilant and also very powerful... at least a Sequence 7 Extraordinary. It will take some time to track her."] = "No, she is very vigilant and also very powerful... at least a Последовательность 7 Extraordinary. It will take some time to track her.",
    ["中锋之志：伤害增幅+15%，最大生命值+25%。"] = "Center's Ambition: Damage Boost +15%, maximum Health +25%.",
    ["人脉技能升级所需的材料。"] = "Materials required for upgrading Connection Skills.",
    ["亚巴顿的攻击和攻速提高3%，最多叠加5层。"] = "Abaddon's Attack and Скорость атаки increased by 3%, stacking up to 5 times.",
    ["他用沉默代替言语，用行动书写忠诚。"] = "He replaces words with silence and writes loyalty with actions.",
    ["Personal energy held: %s"] = "Personal energy held: %s",
    ["Performing ritual..."] = "Performing ritual...",
    ["不错，这就是初步的窥密之眼，不愧是“占卜家”，只比我当初差一点点。"] = "Not bad, this is the preliminary Spirit Vision. As expected of a \"Провидец,\" only slightly worse than I was back then.",
    ["The Sealed Artifact 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Tarot Club's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try that."] = "The Запечатанный артефакт 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Клуб Таро's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try that.",
    ["从秋水仙中提炼的高毒性精华，常用于抑制或扭曲生命力。"] = "A highly toxic essence extracted from colchicum, often used to suppress or distort Health.",
    ["East District Atmosphere - Mysterious Ritual"] = "East District Atmosphere - Mysterious Ritual",
    ["Attack from the rear right"] = "Attack from the rear right",
    ["介入神秘非凡事件，对抗失控与疯狂，守护这个世界。"] = "Intervene in mysterious Потусторонний incidents, resist loss of control and Безумие, and guard this world.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe Battle Pass event has ended. Items in the extra Battle Pass inventory are temporarily stored in your mail; please check them in time."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe Battle Pass event has ended. Items in the extra Battle Pass inventory are temporarily stored in your mail; please check them in time.",
    ["Applies Rhythm of Light to allies within range, increasing their Attack for 15 seconds."] = "Applies Rhythm of Light to allies within range, increasing their Attack for 15 seconds.",
    ["为非凡者恢复理智时累计成功200次"] = "Successfully restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs 200 times in total.",
    ["主线1_4民居惊逢尸体"] = "Main Story 1-4: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["There is still some residual corruption of the Mother Tree of Desire..."] = "There is still some residual Искажение of the Mother Tree of Desire...",
    ["令25米内小队成员获得<HighLight>愈心标记</>，持续*f秒。<HighLight>愈心标记</>的持有者与施法者之间的距离超过70米时，持有者将失去<HighLight>愈心标记</>。此技能拥有20秒小队公共冷却时间。\n仅<HighLight>空想姿态</>可用，<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>狂乱</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>愈心标记</>：持有者获得*d**减伤。当标记的施法者使用战斗技能造成治疗效果时，标记的持有者回复效果量80%的生命（受目标减疗影响）。"] = "Causes party members within 25 meters to gain a <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</>, lasting for *f seconds. If the distance between the holder of the <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</> and the caster exceeds 70 meters, the holder will lose the <HighLight>Heart Healing Mark</>. This skill has a 20-second party Перезарядка. \nOnly available in <HighLight>Imagination Stance</>; switches to <HighLight>Frenzy</> under <HighLight>Кошмар Stance</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Heart Healing Mark</>: The holder gains *d** Снижение урона. When the caster of the mark uses a Боевой навык to perform Healing, the holder of the mark recovers Health equal to 80% of the healing amount (affected by the target's Healing Reduction).",
    ["They tried to make contact with a Beyonder item. That thing possessed living characteristics, and in the end... not a single person survived."] = "They tried to make contact with a Потусторонний item. That thing possessed living characteristics, and in the end... not a single person survived.",
    ["I previously obtained a replica of 2-049 from the Tarot Club; it should come in handy here."] = "I previously obtained a replica of 2-049 from the Клуб Таро; it should come in handy here.",
    ["Harvest, richness, and vitality. After holding it for a period of time, you bear a Curse; when you die, activated land grows on the spot, continuously healing teammates, increasing Attack, and granting immunity to control. But while the land exists, you cannot be Resurrected."] = "Harvest, richness, and vitality. After holding it for a period of time, you bear a Curse; when you die, activated land grows on the spot, continuously healing teammates, increasing Attack, and granting immunity to control. But while the land exists, you cannot be Resurrected.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n很遗憾地通知您，因为迷雾残影结算奖励时您的贡献度倒计时已结束，本次结算不发放奖励，祝您下次获得好成绩。 "] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We regret to inform you that because your contribution countdown had already ended when the Mist Phantom rewards were being calculated, no rewards will be issued for this settlement. We wish you better results next time.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n与你缔结誓约的非凡者%s已注销角色，你们之间的誓约关系因此解除。\n愿你在接下来的旅途中，再次遇见值得托付誓言的人。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The Потусторонний %s with whom you formed a Covenant has deleted their character, and the Covenant relationship between you has been dissolved as a result. \n May you meet someone worthy of your trust again on your future Journey.",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008621"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008621",
    ["I've received a lot of help from the Tarot Club; perhaps I can return often to assist in handling some events."] = "I've received a lot of help from the Клуб Таро; perhaps I can return often to assist in handling some events.",
    ["为了美食-触发器"] = "For Gourmet - Trigger",
    ["二段技能的伤害增加50%。"] = "Damage of the secondary skill increased by 50%.",
    ["不需要的话，填0；填了攻击ID不是指执行相应的Attack；而是为了播一下对应Attack对应的攻击特效；不需要的话，填0"] = "If not needed, fill in 0; filling in an attack ID does not mean executing the corresponding Attack, but rather playing the attack effect corresponding to that Attack; if not needed, fill in 0.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于休闲玩法的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷-休闲玩法专题</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the leisure gameplay survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - Leisure Gameplay Topic</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf is very good at hiding and understands the survival ways of the Seer Pathway, until He met the Fool."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf is very good at hiding and understands the survival ways of the Провидец Pathway, until He met Шут.",
    ["丰饶之树最初只是一粒小小的种子。\n它沉眠于大地母神教会中，由圣者精心保管。圣者知晓它身负生机与荒芜两种强大的力量，不能被轻易种下。\n直到那场背弃誓言的战争降临。大地化为焦土，生机纷纷湮灭，圣者站在同伴和敌人的尸体间，落下了一滴泪。 \n至少，要让这片大地重生。 \n种子进入泥土后迅速生长，生机怦然降临之时，荒芜也伸出爪牙——于是圣者挺身而出，将无尽的荒芜统统纳入身躯。\n变动终于平息，丰饶之树睁开了眼睛。\n她化为人形的灵体，懵懂如婴孩，裹着一袭金色的披风。 \n一个遥远的声音在她心头回荡： \n这是大地的礼物。\n这是丰饶的呼唤。"] = "The Tree of Abundance was initially just a tiny seed. \n It slept in the Church of the Earth Mother, carefully kept by a Saint. The Saint knew that it carried two powerful forces, Vitality and Desolation, and could not be planted easily. \n Until the war that betrayed the oath arrived. The earth turned into scorched earth, and vitality was annihilated one after another. The Saint stood between the corpses of companions and enemies and shed a tear. \n At least, let this land be reborn. \n After the seed entered the soil, it grew rapidly. When vitality descended suddenly, desolation also stretched out its claws—so the Saint stepped forward and took all the endless desolation into her body. \n The turmoil finally subsided, and the Tree of Abundance opened its eyes. \n She turned into a human-shaped spirit, ignorant as an infant, wrapped in a golden cloak. \n A distant voice echoed in her heart: \n This is the gift of the earth. \n This is the call of Harvest.",
    ["Causes a target party member to gain a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>, lasting for *f seconds. A Spectator can only have one target with a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> at a time, and a target can only have a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> from one Spectator at a time. If the distance between the holder of the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> and the caster exceeds 70 meters, the holder will lose the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>. \nOnly available in <HighLight>Imagination Stance</>; switches to <HighLight>Frenzy</> under <HighLight>Nightmare Stance</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Mind Reading Mark</>: When the holder's Health drops below 30%, they gain, for *f seconds, buffdisc(*id); this effect has a 20-second Cooldown. When the caster of the mark uses a combat skill to perform Healing, the holder of the mark recovers Health equal to 30% of the healing amount (affected by the target's Healing Reduction)."] = "Causes a target party member to gain a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>, lasting for *f seconds. A Зритель can only have one target with a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> at a time, and a target can only have a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> from one Зритель at a time. If the distance between the holder of the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> and the caster exceeds 70 meters, the holder will lose the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>. \nOnly available in <HighLight>Imagination Stance</>; switches to <HighLight>Frenzy</> under <HighLight>Кошмар Stance</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Mind Reading Mark</>: When the holder's Health drops below 30%, they gain, for *f seconds, buffdisc(*id); this effect has a 20-second Перезарядка. When the caster of the mark uses a Боевой навык to perform Healing, the holder of the mark recovers Health equal to 30% of the healing amount (affected by the target's Healing Reduction).",
    ["Divination for Dennis"] = "Гадание for Dennis",
    ["East Safe Zone trigger"] = "East Safe Zone trigger",
    ["When marionettes refresh in the Utopia Theater, if a marionette of the same quality as the Wish Marionette appears, there is an 80% probability that it is the Wish Marionette. If the Wish Marionette does not appear this time, the next one is guaranteed to be the Wish Marionette."] = "When Марионеткаs refresh in the Utopia Theater, if a Марионетка of the same quality as the Wish Марионетка appears, there is an 80% probability that it is the Wish Марионетка. If the Wish Марионетка does not appear this time, the next one is guaranteed to be the Wish Марионетка.",
    ["主界面技能长按显示说明"] = "Main Interface Skill Long-Press Display Instructions",
    ["Trigger only when effective Healing is caused"] = "Trigger only when effective Healing is caused",
    ["两件套\r\n进入战斗时,为自身增加400点格挡,持续3秒"] = "2-piece set\nUpon entering combat, gain 400 points of Block for 3 seconds.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n We have noted that regarding Survey 5, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this survey will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n If you wish to leave your feedback again using your current identity, you may continue to pass on your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\"> Open Beta Survey 5 </>\n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that regarding Survey 5, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this survey will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n If you wish to leave your feedback again using your current identity, you may continue to pass on your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\"> Open Beta Survey 5 </>\n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["thereby leveraging reality to achieve specific goals—whether it be praying, summoning, sealing, divination, or others."] = "thereby leveraging reality to achieve specific goals—whether it be praying, summoning, sealing, Гадание, or others.",
    ["丢蛋糕技能ui提示"] = "Throw Cake skill UI prompt",
    ["Abaddon's lair, the source of the undead. End all of this, or become another one of his collections."] = "Abaddon's lair, the source of the undead. End all of this, or become another one of his collections.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：根据%s活动，您通过势力战拍卖获得的分红是%s，请查收。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: According to the %s event, the dividend you obtained through the faction war auction is %s. Please check it.",
    ["Rebecca Skill 1 Berserk"] = "Rebecca Skill 1 Berserk",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n      我们留意到，关于调研问卷5，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n      若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷5</>\n      感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that regarding Survey 5, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this survey will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n If you wish to leave your feedback again using your current identity, you may continue to pass on your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\"> Open Beta Survey 5 </>\n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：歌颂者、序列8：祈光人、序列7：太阳神官、序列6：公证人、序列5：光之祭司、序列4：无暗者、序列3：正义导师、序列2：逐光者、序列1：纯白天使、序列0：太阳"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Bard, Последовательность 8: Light Suppliant, Последовательность 7: Solar High Priest, Последовательность 6: Notary, Последовательность 5: Priest of Light, Последовательность 4: Unshadowed, Последовательность 3: Justice Mentor, Последовательность 2: Lightseeker, Последовательность 1: White Angel, Последовательность 0: Sun",
    ["与Npc进行对话  玩家跨场景传送到指定Trigger  "] = "Converse with NPC. Player teleports across scenes to the specified Trigger.",
    ["从右前攻击"] = "Attack from the front right",
    ["主理人"] = "Person in Charge",
    ["他说的“主人”恐怕正在里面举行仪式。我们要赶快进去阻止他！"] = "The 'Master' he mentioned is likely performing a ritual inside. We must go in and stop him immediately!",
    ["Proactively go to the <Highlight>magic circle to gather and share damage</>, which can prevent Osekus from causing a party wipe."] = "Proactively go to the <Highlight>magic circle to gather and share damage</>, which can prevent Osekus from causing a party wipe.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe system has detected voice violations in your character, and you have been banned from voice chat. \nA good gaming environment requires the joint protection of all players, and we hope you can consciously abide by the rules. If the violation continues, the penalty will be upgraded, including but not limited to extending the mute time/permanent mute. If you have other questions and requests, you can contact game customer service for feedback and appeals."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected voice violations in your character, and you have been banned from voice chat. \nA good gaming environment requires the joint protection of all players, and we hope you can consciously abide by the rules. If the violation continues, the penalty will be upgraded, including but not limited to extending the mute time/permanent mute. If you have other questions and requests, you can contact game customer service for feedback and appeals.",
    ["Main Story 1-6: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence"] = "Main Story 1-6: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["A lost Sealed Artifact named \"See Me\"; what will the Spectator see?"] = "A lost Запечатанный артефакт named \"See Me\"; what will the Зритель see?",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n We regret to inform you that because your contribution countdown had already ended when the Mist Phantom rewards were being calculated, no rewards will be issued for this settlement. We wish you better results next time."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We regret to inform you that because your contribution countdown had already ended when the Mist Phantom rewards were being calculated, no rewards will be issued for this settlement. We wish you better results next time.",
    ["The Tree of Abundance was originally a Sealed Artifact of the Church of the Earth Mother, and it has existed here since the War of the Broken Oath."] = "The Tree of Abundance was originally a Запечатанный артефакт of the Church of the Earth Mother, and it has existed here since the War of the Broken Oath.",
    ["Main Menu - Skill Button Unlock"] = "Main Menu - Skill Button Unlock",
    ["东区氛围-神秘仪式"] = "East District Atmosphere - Mysterious Ritual",
    ["与誓约组队完成各类日常玩法即可获得誓约值与同行纹章，誓约值可用于自动提升誓约等级。\n誓约等级共设多级，达到指定等级可领取等级奖励。\n非凡者每日与单个誓约最多可获取600誓约值，每周最多可获取2000誓约值。与誓约对象组队参与指定活动，还可额外获得同行纹章。\n与誓约对象组队参与乌托邦剧院双人模式，会获得更多誓约值与同行纹章，玩法中还会有额外能力加成。\n同行纹章可用于在同行商店购买物品（誓约相关的奖励需要与誓约的等级达到指定要求）。\n非凡者可点击更换展台，进入与对应誓约对象的主页编辑功能，非凡者可更换自己角色的动作（不可编辑对方的），更换双人主页的展台，摆放摆件。\n非凡者可以在萨默尔太太处申请单人解契，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间发起申请的非凡者可以取消解契。\n非凡者也可组队前往萨默尔太太处申请双人解除解约，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳少量苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间双方可以取消解契。"] = "Form a team with your Oath partner to complete various daily activities to earn Oath Points and Companion Emblems. Oath Points can be used to automatically increase your Oath Level. \n There are multiple Oath Levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching specified levels. \n A Потусторонний can earn a maximum of 600 Oath Points per day with a single Oath partner, and a maximum of 2000 per week. Participate in designated activities while teamed up with your Oath partner to earn additional Companion Emblems. \n Teaming up with your Oath partner for the Utopia Theater Duo Mode will grant more Oath Points and Companion Emblems, along with additional ability bonuses during the activity. \n Companion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Oath-related rewards require your Oath Level to meet specific requirements). \n Потустороннийs can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Oath partner. Потустороннийs can change their own character's actions (you cannot edit the other person's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \n Потустороннийs can apply for a solo Oath dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can Cancel the dissolution. \n Потустороннийs can also team up to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Oath dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, both parties can Cancel the dissolution.",
    ["为非凡者恢复理智时累计成功20次"] = "Successfully restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs 20 times in total.",
    ["May Manor · Castle · Hard"] = "May Manor · Castle · Hard",
    ["为什么没人愿意让我的占卜？难道我真的不行吗？"] = "Why is no one willing to let me perform a Гадание? Am I really that bad at it?",
    ["Northeast safe zone trigger"] = "Northeast safe zone trigger",
    ["也就是说，你用灵视除了能直接看到一些灵体、鬼魂和怨灵，还能看到“以太体”，可以通过气场不同的状态来判断对方的健康和情绪。"] = "In other words, besides being able to directly see some spirits, ghosts, and vengeful spirits with spirit vision, you can also see the 'Ether Body', and you can judge the other party's health and emotions through the different states of the aura.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n      我们留意到，关于调研问卷3，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n      若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷3</>\n      感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 3, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 3</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["Herbs that only grow in midsummer, containing vigorous Health, often used to enhance physique or in health-related formulas."] = "Herbs that only grow in midsummer, containing vigorous Health, often used to enhance physique or in health-related formulas.",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf pulls the spirit body threads of all players and draws them to its side. The spirit body threads of players connected in pairs are disrupted, continuously dealing damage to each other."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf pulls the Нити духовного тела of all players and draws them to its side. The Нити духовного тела of players connected in pairs are disrupted, continuously dealing damage to each other.",
    ["Profane Witch Boss Buff ID Range End"] = "Profane Witch Boss Buff ID Range End",
    ["为老约翰占卜"] = "Гадание for Old John",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n恭喜您的等级达到62级！我们为您准备了等级奖励，用于版本测试升级养成使用，请查收！祝愿您在诡秘世界冒险愉快！"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nCongratulations on reaching level 62! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Повелитель Тайн!",
    ["二段技能造成伤害时，会产生爆炸，对周围敌方额外造成伤害。"] = "When the secondary skill deals damage, it triggers an Explosion, dealing additional damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["He should be using an ancient ritual to absorb the power of the notebook, just like how we directly consume high-sequence potions. This is full of danger and requires time; he needs to stay in a safe place."] = "He should be using an ancient ritual to absorb the power of the notebook, just like how we directly consume high-Последовательность potions. This is full of danger and requires time; he needs to stay in a safe place.",
    ["Main Talent Tree"] = "Main Talent Tree",
    ["The answers to the two questions were once on the chair of the divination table, and once on the tabletop... <P_Yellow>The clues seem to still be pointing to the act of divination</>?"] = "The answers to the two questions were once on the chair of the Гадание table, and once on the tabletop... <P_Yellow>The clues seem to still be pointing to the act of Гадание</>?",
    ["Connection Topic - Klein 1: About Divination"] = "Connection Topic - Klein 1: About Гадание",
    ["为处于失控或失控边缘的非凡者恢复理智"] = "Restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs who are experiencing or on the verge of loss of control.",
    ["他收的利息也太高了……"] = "The interest he charges is too high...",
    ["从左前攻击"] = "Attack from the front left",
    ["二楼灵性追溯保底"] = "Second floor Spiritual Retrospection safety net",
    ["主动使用3次朗基努斯之枪后展开真理裂隙，只命中一个目标时伤害提高50%。"] = "After actively using Spear of Longinus 3 times, unfold Rift of Truth; damage is increased by 50% when hitting only one target.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: We regret to inform you that, due to circumstances beyond our control, the Peak of the Gods event will now begin promptly at 19. Please log off and take an afternoon break. Sweet dreams. Sender: System"] = "Dear Потусторонний: We regret to inform you that, due to circumstances beyond our control, the Peak of the Gods event will now begin promptly at 19. Please log off and take an afternoon break. Sweet dreams. Sender: System",
    ["From Sequence 9 onwards, the higher you go, the closer you get to the throne of God. The path of the Beyonder is like an adventure on the ocean, full of challenges and madness..."] = "From Последовательность 9 onwards, the higher you go, the closer you get to the throne of God. The path of the Потусторонний is like an adventure on the ocean, full of challenges and Безумие...",
    ["五月庄园·城堡·普通"] = "May Manor · Castle · Normal",
    ["东安全区trigger"] = "East Safe Zone trigger",
    ["Obtained from an enemy defeated by one's own hands, often used in bloody Covenants or hatred-pointing rituals."] = "Obtained from an enemy defeated by one's own hands, often used in bloody Covenants or hatred-pointing rituals.",
    ["The Beyonder who provided the most assists to allies."] = "The Потусторонний who provided the most assists to allies.",
    ["Marionette essence formed after the death of a lost-of-control marionette in Utopia Theater, which can be used to purchase goods from the Essence Collector merchant."] = "Марионетка essence formed after the death of a lost-of-control Марионетка in Utopia Theater, which can be used to purchase goods from the Essence Collector merchant.",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008609"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008609",
    ["In other words, besides being able to directly see some spirits, ghosts, and vengeful spirits with spirit vision, you can also see the 'Ether Body', and you can judge the other party's health and emotions through the different states of the aura."] = "In other words, besides being able to directly see some spirits, ghosts, and vengeful spirits with spirit vision, you can also see the 'Ether Body', and you can judge the other party's health and emotions through the different states of the aura.",
    ["Randomly create a Spell Field on the ground from a list of Spell Field IDs."] = "Randomly create a Spell Field on the ground from a list of Spell Field IDs.",
    ["The Beyonder characteristic left behind by Liana, emitting a soft dawn-like light."] = "The Потусторонний characteristic left behind by Liana, emitting a soft dawn-like light.",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Seer, Sequence 8: Clown, Sequence 7: Magician, Sequence 6: Faceless, Sequence 5: Marionettist, Sequence 4: Bizarro Sorcerer, Sequence 3: Scholar of Yore, Sequence 2: Miracle Invoker, Sequence 1: Attendant of Mysteries, Sequence 0: The Fool"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Провидец, Последовательность 8: Клоун, Последовательность 7: Фокусник, Последовательность 6: Безликий, Последовательность 5: Марионеточник, Последовательность 4: Маг Непостижимого, Последовательность 3: Учёный Прошлого, Последовательность 2: Творец Чудес, Последовательность 1: Служитель Тайн, Последовательность 0: Шут",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nCongratulations on reaching level 38! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Lord of Mysteries!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nCongratulations on reaching level 38! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Повелитель Тайн!",
    ["中心区域额外造成33%的伤害。"] = "The central area deals an additional 33% damage.",
    ["主界面HUD技能轮盘"] = "Main Interface HUD Skill Wheel",
    ["五月庄园·城堡副本开启"] = "May Manor · Castle dungeon opened",
    ["He is a member of the Moon Servant and even held a sacrificial ritual in a dream... Should I continue to investigate?"] = "He is a member of the Moon Servant and even held a sacrificial ritual in a dream... Should I continue to investigate?",
    ["丽贝卡技能1狂暴"] = "Rebecca Skill 1 Berserk",
    ["主要模型半径和高度变化，影响攻击盒判定"] = "Main model radius and height changes, affecting attack box judgment.",
    ["The Beyonder characteristic left behind by Jonar, emitting a twilight-like glow."] = "The Потусторонний characteristic left behind by Jonar, emitting a twilight-like glow.",
    ["为友方提供援护冲锋，解除其受到的弱控和减速，并为其提供减伤和加速增益，自身获得黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能）。使用后解锁王庭号令。"] = "Provide support charge to allies, dispelling their soft crowd control and slow, and providing them with Снижение урона and acceleration buffs. You gain a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Unlocks Royal Court Command after use.",
    ["A cover made of human skin, a book filled with Ritual Magic..."] = "A cover made of human skin, a book filled with Ritual Magic...",
    ["Only listen to the first Skill"] = "Only listen to the first Skill",
    ["乔纳尔夫妇受到反噬伤害，陷入虚弱"] = "The Jonar couple receives Backlash Damage and falls into a weakened state.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您在缴纳保证金后未再次违规，之前缴纳的保证金已返还到您邮箱内。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nYou have not committed any further violations after paying the security deposit, and the previously paid deposit has been returned to your mailbox.",
    ["Death Knell: Stun"] = "Death Knell: Stun",
    ["Poisoned Man"] = "Poisoned Man",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：仲裁人、序列8：治安官、序列7：审讯者、序列6：法官、序列5：惩戒骑士、序列4：律令法师、序列3：混乱猎手、序列2：平衡者、序列1：秩序之手、序列0：审判者"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Arbiter, Последовательность 8: Sheriff, Последовательность 7: Interrogator, Последовательность 6: Judge, Последовательность 5: Disciplinary Paladin, Последовательность 4: Imperative Mage, Последовательность 3: Chaos Охотник, Последовательность 2: Balancer, Последовательность 1: Hand of Order, Последовательность 0: Justiciar",
    ["仅使用该法术场的表现，不使用其逻辑"] = "Use only the visual representation of this spell field, not its logic.",
    ["为所欲为，但勿伤害"] = "Do What Thou Wilt, But Harm None",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期交易涉嫌线下交易或苏勒转移（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>），未通过审核。现已封禁交易所到%s，并冻结%s苏勒。您可以在交易所界面通过缴纳保证金%s金镑提前解冻。如有疑问，请通过用户中心-联系客服反馈详细情况。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that your recent transaction is suspected of being an offline trade or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The exchange has been banned until %s, and %s gold has been frozen. You can unfreeze it early by paying a security deposit of %s pounds in the exchange interface. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["为友方提供治疗量最高的非凡者"] = "The Потусторонний who provided the most healing to allies.",
    ["The High Priest's shield requires the Sun Holy Emblem to be broken"] = "The High Priest's shield requires the Sun Holy Emblem to be broken",
    ["与任意非凡者同乘座驾30秒以上"] = "Ride along with any Потусторонний in a vehicle for more than 30 seconds",
    ["Provides a shield equivalent to 20% of your maximum Health. This shield refreshes every 30 seconds."] = "Provides a shield equivalent to 20% of your maximum Health. This shield refreshes every 30 seconds.",
    ["中断仪式"] = "Interrupted Ritual",
    ["Main Story 1-8: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence"] = "Main Story 1-8: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["他是月亮仆从的成员，还在梦里举行过祭祀仪式……我是不是该继续追查下去？"] = "He is a member of the Moon Servant and even held a sacrificial ritual in a dream... Should I continue to investigate?",
    ["Exclusive Sequence Quest"] = "Exclusive Последовательность Quest",
    ["Two silver-white potions, two newborn \"Spectators\"."] = "Two silver-white potions, two newborn \"Зрительs\".",
    ["他给出了答案，让他们进入了“知识领域”，但进去的人，再也没有回来。"] = "He gave the answer, leading them into the \"Domain of Knowledge,\" but those who went in never returned.",
    ["五月庄园·城堡困难难度已解锁"] = "May Manor · Castle hard difficulty unlocked.",
    ["从场中打碎箱子，寻找物资，合成物资。使用物资，帮助穷人吧！"] = "Break boxes in the field to find supplies and synthesize them. Use the supplies to help the poor!",
    ["Buy Newspaper Trigger"] = "Buy Newspaper Trigger",
    ["五月庄园·城堡·困难"] = "May Manor · Castle · Hard",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008626"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008626",
    ["临时数值，请GM加攻击和气血"] = "Temporary values, please have the GM add Attack and Health",
    ["Attack from the rear"] = "Attack from the rear",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008606"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008606",
    ["从灵性敌人身上抽离的能量，可以使用能量在特殊的仪式法阵上召唤仆从帮助自己战斗。"] = "Energy extracted from spiritual enemies, can use energy to summon minions on special ritual circles to help fight.",
    ["Mid-Sequence Door"] = "Mid-Последовательность Door",
    ["Vincent, who had served the Wetherell family for generations, activated the Ancestor Armor on the night the manor was attacked, but the armor was eroded by unknown corruption and turned to slaughter the manor in return. In despair, he discovered that Helena was still alive. She was the only survivor, and she did not know the truth about the armor's loss of control. Vincent swallowed his confession and repentance, vowing to spend the rest of his life making amends. He sealed the armor and pursued the enemies and the source of the corruption alone, stopping at nothing to gain power. Until someone told him about the existence of the 'Crown of Knowledge,' he saw hope. \n \"Knowledge is Power.\""] = "Vincent, who had served the Wetherell family for generations, activated the Ancestor Armor on the night the manor was attacked, but the armor was eroded by unknown Искажение and turned to slaughter the manor in return. In despair, he discovered that Helena was still alive. She was the only survivor, and she did not know the truth about the armor's loss of control. Vincent swallowed his confession and repentance, vowing to spend the rest of his life making amends. He sealed the armor and pursued the enemies and the source of the Искажение alone, stopping at nothing to gain power. Until someone told him about the existence of the 'Crown of Knowledge,' he saw hope. \n \"Knowledge is Power.\"",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期副本%s中参与的拍卖涉及线下交易（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>），未通过审核。该笔订单苏勒已永久扣除。如有疑问，请到客服平台反馈详细情况。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>), which did not pass the audit. The Sol amount for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide details to the customer service platform.",
    ["Profane Witch True Mirror Buff"] = "Profane Witch True Mirror Buff",
    ["Spirit Body of a Middle-Aged Nobleman"] = "Духовное тело of a Middle-Aged Nobleman",
    ["A hearty, large portion of nutritious bread, baked through a special ritual to provide you with surging vitality!"] = "A hearty, large portion of nutritious bread, baked through a special ritual to provide you with surging vitality!",
    ["主线1_5民居惊逢尸体"] = "Main Story 1-5: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nYou have not committed any further violations after paying the security deposit, and the previously paid deposit has been returned to your mailbox."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nYou have not committed any further violations after paying the security deposit, and the previously paid deposit has been returned to your mailbox.",
    ["丰饶污染"] = "Abundance Искажение",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Your Club ranked in the top four in the war zone screening, earning the qualification to enter the City of Dragon Hunting decisive battlefield. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - City of Dragon Hunting interface in time. Please note that a single Club can have a maximum of <M_Orange>16 people</> from a single Pathway as official members on the field; plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n    The decisive battlefield will determine the outcome of this Faction War for each faction. Participating can yield gifts such as connections, marionette drawing items, higher Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Your Club ranked in the top four in the war zone screening, earning the qualification to enter the City of Dragon Hunting decisive battlefield. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - City of Dragon Hunting interface in time. Please note that a single Club can have a maximum of <M_Orange>16 people</> from a single Pathway as official members on the field; plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n    The decisive battlefield will determine the outcome of this Faction War for each faction. Participating can yield gifts such as connections, Марионетка drawing items, higher Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您抢购道具<M_Link>%s</>失败，抢购支付的货币已返还到您邮箱内。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nYour purchase of the item <M_Link>%s</> failed. The currency paid for the purchase has been returned to your mailbox.",
    ["Jonar doesn't know about the Tarot Club... Now, we can talk honestly."] = "Jonar doesn't know about the Клуб Таро... Now, we can talk honestly.",
    ["不，还需要灵性……我有了新的思路！"] = "No, it also requires Духовность... I have a new idea!",
    ["Profane Witch Boss - Bone-Chilling Cold Summon Bullet Buff"] = "Profane Witch Boss - Bone-Chilling Cold Summon Bullet Buff",
    ["He used 'Kindling' to steal the corruption from an item."] = "He used 'Kindling' to steal the Искажение from an item.",
    ["The Vine of Abundance will attack continuously; please switch targets and kill it quickly!"] = "The Vine of Abundance will attack continuously; please switch targets and kill it quickly!",
    ["Call of Abundance - Corruption"] = "Call of Abundance - Искажение",
    ["丢失塔罗牌的占卜师"] = "Diviner who lost Tarot cards",
    ["Pavilion trigger"] = "Pavilion trigger",
    ["中断仪式成功"] = "Ritual successfully interrupted",
    ["In the hidden corners of the Relics of the God War, many lost relics and Forbidden Knowledge are buried. Use <Highlight> Seed of Sighs </> to start the ritual, follow the guidance to complete the ritual, and you will collect <Highlight> Hunting Progress </> and <Highlight> Scarlet Relics </>. Present them to the pale figure who calls himself the <Highlight> Hunting Butler </> to exchange for <Highlight> that Beyonder gift belonging to you </>."] = "In the hidden corners of the Relics of the God War, many lost relics and Forbidden Knowledge are buried. Use <Highlight> Seed of Sighs </> to start the ritual, follow the guidance to complete the ritual, and you will collect <Highlight> Hunting Progress </> and <Highlight> Scarlet Relics </>. Present them to the pale figure who calls himself the <Highlight> Hunting Butler </> to exchange for <Highlight> that Потусторонний gift belonging to you </>.",
    ["交互物-塔罗牌"] = "Interaction Object - Tarot Card",
    ["之前塔罗学院工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试。"] = "The Запечатанный артефакт 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Клуб Таро's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try that.",
    ["乌黯魔狼对自己许愿，给所有玩家添加<Disable>暗光</>效果，暗光会持续对玩家造成伤害并逐渐夺去玩家的光明。"] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf makes a wish to itself, adding a <Disable>Dark Light</> effect to all players. Dark Light will continuously deal damage to players and gradually strip away their light.",
    ["为<h>丹尼斯</>占卜"] = "Гадание for <h>Dennis</>",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nAccording to the %s event, the dividend you received through club auctions is %s. Please check it."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nAccording to the %s event, the dividend you received through club auctions is %s. Please check it.",
    ["九次总伤害：<HighLight>162%</>攻击"] = "Total damage of nine hits: <HighLight>162%</> attack",
    ["Add permanent damage immunity and hit effect buff to player character"] = "Add permanent damage immunity and hit effect buff to player character",
    ["他家里那么有钱，想要什么都能得到，居然也要去占卜吗？想不到他会问些啥呢……"] = "His family is so rich, he can get whatever he wants, yet he still wants to go for Гадание? I can't imagine what he would ask...",
    ["Manual Search"] = "Manual Search",
    ["主动攻击绿、黄名非凡者增加10失控度"] = "Actively attacking green or yellow-named Потустороннийs increases loss of control by 10.",
    ["Can only be used in conjunction with Event: OnBeforeBuffAdd."] = "Can only be used in conjunction with Event: OnBeforeBuffAdd.",
    ["专属序列任务"] = "Exclusive Последовательность Quest",
    ["Dark Demonic Wolf - Boundless Dark Silence Spell Proxy"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf - Boundless Dark Silence Spell Proxy",
    ["The second is to find other ways to obtain the 'Clown' potion through divination."] = "The second is to find other ways to obtain the 'Клоун' potion through Гадание.",
    ["为非凡者恢复理智时累计失败20次"] = "Fail to restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs 20 times in total.",
    ["不错，不从众，和我当年一样有性格。而且足够幸运，占卜家的魔药材料还剩两份，否则就要等很久了。"] = "Not bad, not following the crowd, you have character just like I did back then. And you're lucky enough, there are two portions of Провидец potion materials left, otherwise you would have to wait a long time.",
    ["Do as you please, but never harbor a heart of malice."] = "Do as you please, but never harbor a heart of malice.",
    ["买报纸trigger"] = "Buy Newspaper Trigger",
    ["与门交互（激活时加BUFF）"] = "Interact with the door (add BUFF when activated)",
    ["No, it's not a problem with the divination; it's that I overestimated the Captain's memory..."] = "No, it's not a problem with the Гадание; it's that I overestimated the Captain's memory...",
    ["为了让你们更好地适应非凡世界，“愚者”先生指引我们创立了塔罗学院。"] = "To help you better adapt to the Потусторонний world, Mr. Fool guided us to establish the Tarot Academy.",
    ["人脉技能TAB"] = "Connection Skill TAB",
    ["A burst of black energy suddenly erupts in the crowd, and the people around retreat in terror."] = "A burst of black energy suddenly erupts in the crowd, and the people around retreat in terror.",
    ["他们是贝克兰德教区的同行，护送着封印物“2-049”过来，同时支援我们完成任务。"] = "They are colleagues from the Бэкланд Diocese, escorting the Запечатанный артефакт 2-049 here while supporting us in completing the mission.",
    ["The High Priest's shield has been broken; focus fire!"] = "The High Priest's shield has been broken; focus fire!",
    ["Poisoned"] = "Poisoned",
    ["主要是鲁恩的钱贬值的厉害！会员可以免费使用俱乐部的会议室和各种占卜房、占卜工具，免费享用我们提供的咖啡和茶水，免费阅读我们订的报纸和杂志。"] = "Mainly because the Loen currency has depreciated significantly! Members can use the club's conference room and various Гадание rooms and tools for free, enjoy our provided coffee and tea for free, and read the newspapers and magazines we subscribe to for free.",
    ["Interact with the Spiritual Retrospection orb."] = "Interact with the Spiritual Retrospection orb.",
    ["两名非凡者集合！将于身前密契门径！"] = "Two Потустороннийs gather! A secret path will be formed in front of you!",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您所在的俱乐部今日活跃度为%s，若连续<Highlight>%s</>天活跃度低于<Highlight>%s</>，俱乐部将被解散。请尽快提升俱乐部活跃度。剩余时间：<Highlight>%s</>天。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour club's activity today is %s. If the activity remains below <Highlight>%s</> for <Highlight>%s</> consecutive days, the club will be dissolved. Please increase your club's activity as soon as possible. Remaining time: <Highlight>%s</> days.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nCongratulations on reaching level 62! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Lord of Mysteries!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nCongratulations on reaching level 62! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Повелитель Тайн!",
    ["仅在盛夏生长的草药，蕴含旺盛生命力，常用于增强体魄或生命相关配方。"] = "Herbs that only grow in midsummer, containing vigorous Health, often used to enhance physique or in health-related formulas.",
    ["乌洛琉斯将同时对场上的所有玩家、梅迪奇、奥赛库斯随机赋予一种命运效果，分别为<Disable>顺遂</>和<Disable>挫败</>。玩家如果攻击与自身相同的敌人时将会受到巨额<Disable>反弹伤害</>。"] = "Ouroboros will simultaneously assign a random fate effect to all players, Medici, and Alista, which are <Disable>Success</> and <Disable>Failure</>. If players attack an enemy with the same fate as themselves, they will take massive <Disable>reflected damage</>.",
    ["丽埃娜留下的非凡特性，散发出晨曦般的柔光。"] = "The Потусторонний characteristic left behind by Liana, emitting a soft dawn-like light.",
    ["丽埃娜激发3-888的循环力量，二人受到伤害大幅降低，优先破除3-888护盾！"] = "Liana activates the cyclic power of 3-888; both receive significantly reduced damage; prioritize breaking the 3-888 shield!",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n The Beyonder %s with whom you formed a Covenant has deleted their character, and the Covenant relationship between you has been dissolved as a result. \n May you meet someone worthy of your trust again on your future Journey."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The Потусторонний %s with whom you formed a Covenant has deleted their character, and the Covenant relationship between you has been dissolved as a result. \n May you meet someone worthy of your trust again on your future Journey.",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008620"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008620",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n The system has detected that your recent transaction is suspected of being an offline trade or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The exchange has been banned until %s, and %s gold has been frozen. You can unfreeze it early by paying a security deposit of %s pounds in the exchange interface. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that your recent transaction is suspected of being an offline trade or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The exchange has been banned until %s, and %s gold has been frozen. You can unfreeze it early by paying a security deposit of %s pounds in the exchange interface. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["Liana Skill"] = "Liana Skill",
    ["丽埃娜，我的职责不仅是查清案件，还有带回封印物，消除潜在的危险。"] = "Liana, my duty is not only to solve the case but also to bring back the Запечатанный артефакт and eliminate potential dangers.",
    ["Main Story 1-7: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence"] = "Main Story 1-7: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["Mainly because the Loen currency has depreciated significantly! Members can use the club's conference room and various divination rooms and tools for free, enjoy our provided coffee and tea for free, and read the newspapers and magazines we subscribe to for free."] = "Mainly because the Loen currency has depreciated significantly! Members can use the club's conference room and various Гадание rooms and tools for free, enjoy our provided coffee and tea for free, and read the newspapers and magazines we subscribe to for free.",
    ["Humans always think that healing is one-way—doctors heal patients, the strong help the weak. But Audrey taught me: true relationships are about seeing each other."] = "Humans always think that healing is one-way—doctors heal patients, the strong help the weak. But Audrey taught me: true relationships are about seeing each other.",
    ["乌安特，我知道你，二流的剧作家，不入流的“观众”，即使有了非凡的力量，你仍徘徊于世俗的评价中，认为自己的才华无人可以超越。你写了无数手稿，等待一个被欣赏的机会；你大声批评热剧的庸俗，你嫉妒那些作者的文字；你憎恶这个世界，又渴望让全世界的目光都聚焦于你；你想要获得满足，无论付出什么样的代价。\n坐在台下的观众不适合你，我有一个仪式，可以让你向神明祈求。只需要你用足够张扬的死亡取悦祂，你就能实现愿望。"] = "Uante, I know you, a second-rate playwright, a mediocre \"Зритель.\" Even with Потусторонний power, you still linger in secular evaluation, thinking that your talent is beyond anyone's reach. You have written countless manuscripts, waiting for an opportunity to be appreciated; you loudly criticize the vulgarity of hit dramas; you are jealous of the words of those authors; you hate this world, yet you long for the eyes of the whole world to focus on you; you want to be satisfied, no matter what the price. \n Sitting in the audience is not for you; I have a ritual that can allow you to pray to the Gods. You only need to please Him with a sufficiently flamboyant death, and you will be able to fulfill your wish.",
    ["他因为愤怒已经失去理智了！得赶紧拦住他！"] = "He has lost his mind due to anger! Must stop him quickly!",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe system has detected that your recent transactions are suspected of being offline transactions (item <M_Link>%s</>, with a total transaction amount of <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights and interests, please do not participate in offline transactions. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing the Exchange, etc.)."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that your recent transactions are suspected of being offline transactions (item <M_Link>%s</>, with a total transaction amount of <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights and interests, please do not participate in offline transactions. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing the Exchange, etc.).",
    ["Death Knell: Weakness attack button"] = "Death Knell: Weakness attack button",
    ["从右后攻击"] = "Attack from the rear right",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n Congratulations on ranking in the top %d of the %s leaderboard %%. We have prepared generous rewards for you. We hope you will continue your efforts and carve out your own path in the world of Lord of the Mysteries."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n Congratulations on ranking in the top %d of the %s leaderboard %%. We have prepared generous rewards for you. We hope you will continue your efforts and carve out your own path in the world of Повелитель Тайн.",
    ["从梦境中唤醒自身，并回复50%生命值。"] = "Awaken oneself from the dream and restore 50% of health.",
    ["Main Story 1-3: Relief from Sefirah Castle"] = "Main Story 1-3: Relief from Sefirah Castle",
    ["Cast a stone into the lake of the heart, rippling with madness."] = "Cast a stone into the lake of the heart, rippling with Безумие.",
    ["丰饶之树_5200139_德鲁伊_筛选攻击信号A"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Druid_Filter Attack Signal A",
    ["No, it will most likely be evaluated and classified as a Sealed Artifact. Fortunately, its negative effects are not severe, and with some processing, they can be completely avoided."] = "No, it will most likely be evaluated and classified as a Запечатанный артефакт. Fortunately, its negative effects are not severe, and with some processing, they can be completely avoided.",
    ["The Beyonder who provided the most healing to allies."] = "The Потусторонний who provided the most healing to allies.",
    ["丰饶之树原是大地母神教会的封印物，自背誓之战后，就一直存在于此地。"] = "The Tree of Abundance was originally a Запечатанный артефакт of the Church of the Earth Mother, and it has existed here since the War of the Broken Oath.",
    ["乔纳尔留下的非凡特性，散发出黄昏般的辉光。"] = "The Потусторонний characteristic left behind by Jonar, emitting a twilight-like glow.",
    ["He was an old friend of our club and once served as our divination mentor."] = "He was an old friend of our club and once served as our Гадание mentor.",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n剧院中的敌人等级将会随非凡者等级同步提升，推荐非凡评分也会跟随非凡者等级变化。\n此难度下，舞台余韵获取效率是普通难度的1.5倍。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs in the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a secret channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the Искажение. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Потусторонний level, and the recommended Потусторонний rating will also change with the Потусторонний level. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 1.5 times that of normal difficulty.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nYour spirituality has resonated with %s among the thousands of people. \nThe Seven-Day Covenant has been concluded. During this period, you will share the blessings brought by fate. \nMay this time become a precious memory on your Extraordinary journey. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour Духовность has resonated with %s among the thousands of people. \nThe Seven-Day Covenant has been concluded. During this period, you will share the blessings brought by fate. \nMay this time become a precious memory on your Extraordinary journey. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path.",
    ["She is also the Empress of Disaster and Horror, and the Lord of Slumber and Silence."] = "She is also the Empress of Disaster and Horror, and the Lord of Slumber and Silence.",
    ["Temporary values, please have the GM add Attack and Health"] = "Temporary values, please have the GM add Attack and Health",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您所在的俱乐部今日活跃度为%s，若连续%s天活跃度低于%s，俱乐部将被解散。请尽快提升俱乐部活跃度。剩余时间：%s天。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour club's activity today is %s. If the activity remains below %s for %s consecutive days, the club will be dissolved. Please increase your club's activity as soon as possible. Remaining time: %s days.",
    ["亭子trigger"] = "Pavilion trigger",
    ["乌托邦剧院戏台每次刷新会上架3个秘偶，可供抽选。若抽选后戏台上只剩紫色秘偶，戏台会自动刷新。\n序幕抽选：消耗【金纺线】*3，从台上3个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n中幕抽选：消耗【金纺线】*6，从台上剩余2个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n落幕抽选：消耗【金纺线】*12，必定获得台上剩余的1个秘偶。"] = "The Utopia Theater stage will refresh with 3 Марионеткаs available for selection each time. If only purple Марионеткаs remain on the stage after selection, the stage will automatically refresh. \nPrologue Selection: Consumes 3 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 3 Марионеткаs on stage. \nMid-Act Selection: Consumes 6 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 2 remaining Марионеткаs on stage. \nCurtain Call Selection: Consumes 12 [Gold Spun Threads] to guaranteed obtain the 1 remaining Марионетка on stage.",
    ["Double Strike"] = "Double Strike",
    ["从古堡小镇的秘术杀人事件的受害居民身上扯下来的衣服碎片，上面似乎写着“看床”两个字。"] = "Clothing fragments torn from the victims of the mystical murder case in the ancient castle town, with the words \"Look at the bed\" seemingly written on them.",
    ["Dominator's Clash · Emerging Talent"] = "Dominator's Clash · Emerging Talent",
    ["今天有个年轻男人来找你占卜，抱着猫来的。"] = "A young man came to you for Гадание today, carrying a cat.",
    ["No, I want to find out what the remnant shadow is to prevent any Extraordinary power from leaking here. It seems you are also a Beyonder?"] = "No, I want to find out what the remnant shadow is to prevent any Extraordinary power from leaking here. It seems you are also a Потусторонний?",
    ["今日活跃度已满，无法重新占卜"] = "Daily activity is full; cannot re-divine.",
    ["两次攻击的范围必定不相同，<Highlight>观察初始攻击的范围提示</>并移动闪避。"] = "The ranges of the two attacks will definitely not be the same. <Highlight>Observe the initial attack range prompt</> and move to dodge.",
    ["Damage of the secondary skill increased by 50%."] = "Damage of the secondary skill increased by 50%.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于游戏体验的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷4</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the game experience survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 4</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["Fire a continuous stream of phantom energy missiles at the target from medium range."] = "Fire a continuous stream of phantom energy missiles at the target from medium range.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    “势力战”已经拉开帷幕，通过对您俱乐部的综合评判，星星高原战场静候您的到来。\n    请及时在以战养战-势力-高原战界面查看赛程赛制，准时报名参与。\n    参与高原战，即可收获人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红、战场称号等馈赠。\n    愿您在四皇注视下主宰战场，稍后再见！"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    The \"Faction War\" has begun. Based on a comprehensive evaluation of your Club, the Star Plateau battlefield awaits your arrival. \n    Please check the schedule and rules in the War-by-War - Faction - Plateau War interface in time and sign up to participate on time. \n    Participate in the Plateau War to receive gifts such as connections, Марионетка drawing items, Sol dividends, and battlefield titles. \n    May you dominate the battlefield under the gaze of the Four Emperors, see you later!",
    ["亚瑟是鲁恩的英雄。他带我们在间海抗击弗萨克军队。"] = "Arthur is a hero of Loen. He led us in resisting the Feysac army in Midseashire.",
    ["Attack from the front left"] = "Attack from the front left",
    ["He said only a Beyonder can unleash its power of \"protection\"."] = "He said only a Потусторонний can unleash its power of \"protection\".",
    ["Two-Stage Combo"] = "Two-Stage Combo",
    ["Divination for Old John"] = "Гадание for Old John",
    ["You can also manually select 2 Beyonder materials as aggregation ingredients, consuming them to generate new Beyonder materials. Come and try it!"] = "You can also manually select 2 Потусторонний materials as aggregation ingredients, consuming them to generate new Потусторонний materials. Come and try it!",
    ["They are colleagues from the Backlund Diocese, escorting the Sealed Artifact 2-049 here while supporting us in completing the mission."] = "They are colleagues from the Бэкланд Diocese, escorting the Запечатанный артефакт 2-049 here while supporting us in completing the mission.",
    ["与我有缘者“困于东侧摇篮的时光”？占卜师说话真狗屁不通！"] = "'Destined to be trapped in the cradle on the east side'? Diviners really talk nonsense!",
    ["The clues provided by Rebecca are very timely. This small copper mirror is the breakthrough point, Rozanne should have one too."] = "The clues provided by Rebecca are very timely. This small copper mirror is the breakthrough point, Rozanne should have one too.",
    ["Rebecca casts Astrology; her skills are enhanced!"] = "Rebecca casts Astrology; her skills are enhanced!",
    ["The core root stripped from the main body of a mist treant, possessing great spirituality."] = "The core root stripped from the main body of a mist treant, possessing great Духовность.",
    ["However, I must remind you that the 'divine descent' ritual also requires other materials; remember to collect them all before starting the ritual."] = "However, I must remind you that the 'divine descent' ritual also requires other materials; remember to collect them all before starting the ritual.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期副本%s中参与的拍卖涉及线下交易（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>），未通过审核。现已封禁副本拍卖到%s，您可以通过缴纳保证金%s金镑提前解冻。如有疑问，请到客服平台反馈详细情况。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>), which did not pass the audit. Dungeon auctions are now banned until %s. You can unfreeze them early by paying a deposit of %s Pounds. If you have any questions, please provide details to the customer service platform.",
    ["The central area deals an additional 33% damage."] = "The central area deals an additional 33% damage.",
    ["从左后攻击"] = "Attack from the rear left",
    ["主界面技能悬浮显示说明"] = "Main Interface Skill Hover Display Instructions",
    ["今天我要把所有占卜法都试一遍！ 占卜师们在哪里？"] = "Today I'm going to try every Гадание method! Where are the diviners?",
    ["My dear, you are truly talented..."] = "My dear, you are truly talented...",
    ["Divination for <h>Old John</>"] = "Гадание for <h>Old John</>",
    ["He gave the answer, leading them into the \"Domain of Knowledge,\" but those who went in never returned."] = "He gave the answer, leading them into the \"Domain of Knowledge,\" but those who went in never returned.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nYou did not receive rewards while challenging the BOSS due to joining a session in progress or network issues. We have temporarily stored them in your mailbox; please collect them in time."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYou did not receive rewards while challenging the BOSS due to joining a session in progress or network issues. We have temporarily stored them in your mailbox; please collect them in time.",
    ["Rebecca is investigating the small copper mirror and has obtained clues about another Sealed Artifact, the \"Magic Mirror of Despair.\" Tingen in the Mirror is constructed by the \"Crown of Knowledge\" and is not a true mirror world."] = "Rebecca is investigating the small copper mirror and has obtained clues about another Запечатанный артефакт, the \"Magic Mirror of Despair.\" Тинген in the Mirror is constructed by the \"Crown of Knowledge\" and is not a true mirror world.",
    ["从激活的导电圣标处传递雷电，充能所有圣标，击破绝缘屏罩。"] = "Transmit lightning from the activated Conductive Holy Beacon to charge all beacons and break the insulation barrier.",
    ["Second-stage skill explosion damage increased by 100%."] = "Second-stage skill explosion damage increased by 100%.",
    ["从书页中抽出一张牌。造型像是一张塔罗牌，上面绘制着一轮血月"] = "Pulling a card from the pages of the book. It looks like a Tarot card, with a blood moon depicted on it.",
    ["他是一位很有前途的占卜师，可惜已经好些年没见到他了。"] = "He was a very promising Провидец, but unfortunately, I haven't seen him for several years.",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n每周竞速通关成绩进入本途径前100名的玩家将会获得专属头衔，为保证竞速公平，剧院中的敌人等级将会在每周一早上8:00更新。\n此难度下，舞台余韵获取效率是普通难度的2倍。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs in the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a secret channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the Искажение. \n\n Players whose weekly speedrun results enter the top 100 of this Pathway will receive an exclusive title. To ensure fairness in speedrunning, the level of enemies in the theater will be updated every Monday at 8:00 AM. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 2 times that of normal difficulty.",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n剧院中的敌人等级将会随非凡者等级同步提升，推荐非凡评分也会跟随非凡者等级变化。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs in the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a secret channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the Искажение. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Потусторонний level, and the recommended Потусторонний rating will also change with the Потусторонний level.",
    ["They won't be able to change back for a while, and I can continue researching those 'talent-wasting' potions."] = "They won't be able to change back for a while, and I can continue researching those 'talent-wasting' potions.",
    ["不过，我需要提醒你一点。如果遇见非凡事件，记得及时上报教会，也算是为你自己着想。"] = "However, I need to remind you of one thing. If you encounter Потусторонний incidents, remember to report them to the Church in time; it's for your own good.",
    ["主线第一章-男树人-盛开法术代理-Spawn"] = "Main Story Chapter 1 - Male Treant - Bloom Spell Proxy - Spawn",
    ["Interact with the door (add BUFF when activated)"] = "Interact with the door (add BUFF when activated)",
    ["亚巴顿释放禁忌咒语，在场上召唤大量附带邪恶能量的陨星从天而降。若陨星坠落至地面则会爆炸，对全场玩家造成伤害并附加<Disable>邪恶印记</>效果，若陨星在落地前被玩家接住，则只对该名玩家造成伤害和附加<Disable>邪恶印记</>效果。"] = "Abaddon releases a forbidden spell, summoning a large number of meteors infused with evil energy to fall from the sky. If a meteor hits the ground, it will explode, dealing damage to all players and applying an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect. If a player catches a meteor before it hits the ground, it will only deal damage to that player and apply an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect.",
    ["Threads of spirituality extracted from the \"gaps of history,\" entwined with countless possible fates."] = "Threads of Духовность extracted from the \"gaps of history,\" entwined with countless possible fates.",
    ["It's not that simple. I felt the scent of corruption in my dream."] = "It's not that simple. I felt the scent of Искажение in my dream.",
    ["'Destined to be trapped in the cradle on the east side'? Diviners really talk nonsense!"] = "'Destined to be trapped in the cradle on the east side'? Diviners really talk nonsense!",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：不眠者、序列8：午夜诗人、序列7：梦魇、序列6：安魂师、序列5： 灵巫、序列4： 守夜人、序列3： 恐惧主教、序列2： 隐秘之仆、序列1： 厄难骑士、序列0： 黑暗"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Бессонный, Последовательность 8: Полуночный Поэт, Последовательность 7: Кошмар, Последовательность 6: Soul Assurer, Последовательность 5: Spirit Warlock, Последовательность 4: Nightwatcher, Последовательность 3: Horror Bishop, Последовательность 2: Servant of Concealment, Последовательность 1: Knight of Misfortune, Последовательность 0: Darkness",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nIt is a pity that you did not complete the formalization of the Covenant with your Seven-Day Covenant partner, and your Seven-Day Covenant relationship has been dissolved. \nPlease do not be discouraged; perhaps in the next seven days, the threads of fate will lead you to the right person. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path. \nMrs. Sammer\nSincerely"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nIt is a pity that you did not complete the formalization of the Covenant with your Seven-Day Covenant partner, and your Seven-Day Covenant relationship has been dissolved. \nPlease do not be discouraged; perhaps in the next seven days, the threads of fate will lead you to the right person. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path. \nMrs. Sammer\nSincerely",
    ["May Manor · Castle dungeon opened"] = "May Manor · Castle dungeon opened",
    ["Today I'll show you the power of the Terminator. You'll regret coming to this arena!"] = "Today I'll show you the power of the Terminator. You'll regret coming to this arena!",
    ["亚巴顿的老巢，亡灵的源头。终结这一切，或是成为他的又一件收藏。"] = "Abaddon's lair, the source of the undead. End all of this, or become another one of his collections.",
    ["为范围内友方附加光之律动，提高其攻击，持续15秒。"] = "Applies Rhythm of Light to allies within range, increasing their Attack for 15 seconds.",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008620"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008620",
    ["为抗争者加冕，不朽的火焰永燃于王座之上。"] = "Crown the resister, the immortal flame burns forever on the throne.",
    ["乌托邦剧院中无法进行非凡方案切换"] = "Потусторонний loadouts cannot be switched within Utopia Theater.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n    We have noticed that regarding the two-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 2</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your spirituality guide your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    We have noticed that regarding the two-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 2</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: According to the %s event, the dividend you obtained through the faction war auction is %s. Please check it."] = "Dear Потусторонний: According to the %s event, the dividend you obtained through the faction war auction is %s. Please check it.",
    ["However, I need to remind you of one thing. If you encounter Beyonder incidents, remember to report them to the Church in time; it's for your own good."] = "However, I need to remind you of one thing. If you encounter Потусторонний incidents, remember to report them to the Church in time; it's for your own good.",
    ["主宰争锋玩法内非凡者的实力水平是经过平衡的，非常公平。"] = "The strength of Потустороннийs in the Dominator's Clash mode is balanced and very fair.",
    ["严打乱排废水"] = "Strictly prohibit illegal wastewater discharge",
    ["主线1_6民居惊逢尸体"] = "Main Story 1-6: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["May Manor · Castle · Hard dungeon opened"] = "May Manor · Castle · Hard dungeon opened",
    ["The above are dungeon monster buffs"] = "The above are dungeon monster buffs",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\n We regret to inform you that because the activity of the club you manage did not meet the participation conditions for the Four-Way League, your eligibility for subsequent Four-Way League participation will be frozen (once your club meets the participation conditions, your Four-Way League participation eligibility will be restored before the next league starts)."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n We regret to inform you that because the activity of the club you manage did not meet the participation conditions for the Four-Way League, your eligibility for subsequent Four-Way League participation will be frozen (once your club meets the participation conditions, your Four-Way League participation eligibility will be restored before the next league starts).",
    ["以上为伙伴buff"] = "The above are partner buffs",
    ["于神战遗迹的隐秘角落，埋藏着诸多失落遗物与禁忌知识。使用<Highlight>叹息之种</>开启仪式，循着指引完成仪式，你将收集到<Highlight>猎杀进度</>与<Highlight>猩红遗物</>。将其呈递给那位自称<Highlight>猎杀管家</>的苍白身影，即可换取<Highlight>属于你的那份非凡馈赠</>。"] = "In the hidden corners of the Relics of the God War, many lost relics and Forbidden Knowledge are buried. Use <Highlight> Seed of Sighs </> to start the ritual, follow the guidance to complete the ritual, and you will collect <Highlight> Hunting Progress </> and <Highlight> Scarlet Relics </>. Present them to the pale figure who calls himself the <Highlight> Hunting Butler </> to exchange for <Highlight> that Потусторонний gift belonging to you </>.",
    ["No! My heart will break if I don't see Fur Ball for a day. Go put up more notices."] = "No! My heart will break if I don't see Fur Ball for a day. Go put up more notices.",
    ["人造死神标记buff"] = "Artificial Death Marker buff",
    ["Throw Cake skill UI prompt"] = "Throw Cake skill UI prompt",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n祝贺您的俱乐部在%s排行榜中排名%s，现为您奉上丰厚的奖励，希望您再接再厉，在诡秘世界中闯出一番天地。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nCongratulations to your club for ranking %s on the %s leaderboard. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries.",
    ["Aggressive monster"] = "Aggressive monster",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期副本%s中参与的拍卖涉及线下交易或苏勒转移（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>）。为保障您的权益，请勿参与线下交易，如果继续出现类似行为，账号将会受到进一步处罚（包括但不限于冻结货币、封印副本拍卖等）。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or transfer of gold (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights, please do not participate in offline trading. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing dungeon auctions, etc.).",
    ["Tree of Abundance_5200139_Sports Meet_Proxy_2_Mushroom+Vine+Field Corruption"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Sports Meet_Proxy_2_Mushroom+Vine+Field Искажение",
    ["五月庄园·城堡·困难副本开启"] = "May Manor · Castle · Hard dungeon opened",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期交易涉嫌线下交易（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>）。为保障您的权益，请勿参与线下交易，如果继续出现类似行为，账号将会受到进一步处罚（包括但不限于冻结货币、封印交易所等）。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that your recent transactions are suspected of being offline transactions (item <M_Link>%s</>, with a total transaction amount of <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights and interests, please do not participate in offline transactions. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing the Exchange, etc.).",
    ["Secondary sword energy damage increased by 25%. If the secondary hit misses, 10% of the skill's Cooldown is refunded."] = "Secondary sword energy damage increased by 25%. If the secondary hit misses, 10% of the skill's Перезарядка is refunded.",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Arbiter, Sequence 8: Sheriff, Sequence 7: Interrogator, Sequence 6: Judge, Sequence 5: Disciplinary Paladin, Sequence 4: Imperative Mage, Sequence 3: Chaos Hunter, Sequence 2: Balancer, Sequence 1: Hand of Order, Sequence 0: Justiciar"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Arbiter, Последовательность 8: Sheriff, Последовательность 7: Interrogator, Последовательность 6: Judge, Последовательность 5: Disciplinary Paladin, Последовательность 4: Imperative Mage, Последовательность 3: Chaos Охотник, Последовательность 2: Balancer, Последовательность 1: Hand of Order, Последовательность 0: Justiciar",
    ["为true时，反伤伤害不会触发该event"] = "When true, Damage Reflection damage will not trigger this event",
    ["Humans who want to become Beyonders and continue on the path of the extraordinary can only rely on potions."] = "Humans who want to become Потустороннийs and continue on the path of the extraordinary can only rely on potions.",
    ["仅在连线buff里面生效；true的化，对buff的持有者和连线目标同时造成伤害；false，仅对action的target造成伤害"] = "Only effective within Link Buffs; if true, deals damage to both the buff holder and the linked target; if false, only deals damage to the Action target",
    ["Liana's Beyonder characteristic"] = "Liana's Потусторонний characteristic",
    ["Compete with other Beyonders and demonstrate your power and strategy in battle."] = "Compete with other Потустороннийs and demonstrate your power and strategy in battle.",
    ["了解具体<h>非凡觉醒内容</>"] = "Understand the specific <h>Потусторонний awakening details</>",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf, Sequence 2 \"Miracle Invoker\", hid here for thousands of years before finally being expelled by my Lord."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf, Последовательность 2 \"Творец Чудес\", hid here for thousands of years before finally being expelled by my Lord.",
    ["An extraordinary mutation has occurred at May Manor, accompanied by a large amount of corruption."] = "An extraordinary mutation has occurred at May Manor, accompanied by a large amount of Искажение.",
    ["人脉技能"] = "Connection Skill",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n      我们留意到，关于调研问卷1，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n      若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷1</>\n      感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 1, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 1</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["Southeast safe zone trigger"] = "Southeast safe zone trigger",
    ["之前塔罗学派工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试。"] = "The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Клуб Таро artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try that.",
    ["不，污染还没有彻底消失——画的深处还藏着什么东西！"] = "No, the Искажение hasn't completely disappeared—there is still something hidden deep within the painting!",
    ["Divination for Young Couple"] = "Гадание for Young Couple",
    ["Attack from the right"] = "Attack from the right",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n根据%s活动，您通过俱乐部拍卖获得的分红是%s，请查收。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nAccording to the %s event, the dividend you received through club auctions is %s. Please check it.",
    ["Second floor Spiritual Retrospection safety net"] = "Second floor Spiritual Retrospection safety net",
    ["Connections Marionette Beyonder Rating"] = "Connections Марионетка Потусторонний Rating",
    ["他们太疯狂，我实在追不上他们。"] = "They are too crazy, I really can't keep up with them.",
    ["他们走后，两件事变了。一是城堡，那种奇怪的感觉消失了；二是老杰克——哦，就是现在守在铁轨那边的疯子。"] = "After they left, two things changed. One was the castle; that strange feeling disappeared. The second was Old Jack—oh, that's the madman guarding the train tracks now.",
    ["An astonishing ability—is this Beyonder power?"] = "An astonishing ability—is this Потусторонний power?",
    ["For example, if you are a \"Seer,\" you could consider going to a Divination Club or setting up a divination stall on the street to divine for others and receive feedback."] = "For example, if you are a \"Провидец,\" you could consider going to a Гадание Club or setting up a Гадание stall on the street to divine for others and receive feedback.",
    ["Level 2 Defense Tower"] = "Level 2 Defense Tower",
    ["Not bad, you have a real talent for dancing!"] = "Not bad, you have a real talent for dancing!",
    ["Daily activity is full; cannot re-divine."] = "Daily activity is full; cannot re-divine.",
    ["He has lost his mind due to anger! Must stop him quickly!"] = "He has lost his mind due to anger! Must stop him quickly!",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n很遗憾地通知您，您响应的俱乐部<M_Orange> %s </>未能成功建立，请寻找其他俱乐部加入吧。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nWe regret to inform you that the club <M_Orange> %s </> you responded to could not be successfully established. Please look for another club to join.",
    ["Main Story - Seer Out-of-Control Elite Monster"] = "Main Story - Провидец Out-of-Control Elite Monster",
    ["Second floor trigger"] = "Second floor trigger",
    ["May Manor · Castle hard difficulty unlocked."] = "May Manor · Castle hard difficulty unlocked.",
    ["Not bad, not following the crowd, you have character just like I did back then. And you're lucky enough, there are two portions of Seer potion materials left, otherwise you would have to wait a long time."] = "Not bad, not following the crowd, you have character just like I did back then. And you're lucky enough, there are two portions of Провидец potion materials left, otherwise you would have to wait a long time.",
    ["临界超限"] = "Critical Limit",
    ["也许在正确的引导下了解非凡，比一无所知或一知半解更加安全。"] = "Perhaps understanding the Потусторонний world under proper guidance is safer than knowing nothing or only knowing half-truths.",
    ["他告诉我，穿上这双经过仪式的舞鞋，所有人都会爱上我。"] = "He told me that if I wore these ritualized dancing shoes, everyone would fall in love with me.",
    ["亡者气息侵蚀着生者的躯壳——体力恢复变慢了！"] = "The aura of the dead is eroding the bodies of the living—stamina recovery has slowed down!",
    ["他们尝试去接触一个非凡物品，那东西具备活着的特性，最终……没有一个人幸存。"] = "They tried to make contact with a Потусторонний item. That thing possessed living characteristics, and in the end... not a single person survived.",
    ["举个例子，假如你是“占卜家”，就可以考虑去占卜俱乐部，或是到街边支个占卜摊子，替人占卜，收获反馈。"] = "For example, if you are a \"Провидец,\" you could consider going to a Гадание Club or setting up a Гадание stall on the street to divine for others and receive feedback.",
    ["A highly toxic essence extracted from colchicum, often used to suppress or distort Health."] = "A highly toxic essence extracted from colchicum, often used to suppress or distort Health.",
    ["Strictly prohibit illegal wastewater discharge"] = "Strictly prohibit illegal wastewater discharge",
    ["中年男性贵族灵体"] = "Духовное тело of a Middle-Aged Nobleman",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n本次终末猎杀拍卖已结束，您通过终末猎杀拍卖获得的分红是%s，请查收。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n This Final Hunt auction has ended. The dividend you received from the Final Hunt auction is %s; please check it.",
    ["亵渎魔女Boss-自带特效buff"] = "Profane Witch Boss: Comes with effect buff",
    ["The Teleport staff left behind by the Abraham family. Carve a star mark on the target; when the range is insufficient, consume the mark to Teleport into position before attacking, and you can add another Teleport after a Dodge. But the more it is triggered, the more likely you are to lose control and get Lost."] = "The Teleport staff left behind by the Abraham family. Carve a star mark on the target; when the range is insufficient, consume the mark to Teleport into position before attacking, and you can add another Teleport after a Dodge. But the more it is triggered, the more likely you are to lose control and get Lost.",
    ["Abundance Corruption increases damage taken by 100%, stacks up to 3 times"] = "Abundance Искажение increases damage taken by 100%, stacks up to 3 times",
    ["不！我一天见不到毛球心就要碎了，你再去多贴几张告示。"] = "No! My heart will break if I don't see Fur Ball for a day. Go put up more notices.",
    ["主动怪"] = "Aggressive monster",
    ["东南安全区trigger"] = "Southeast safe zone trigger",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008625"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008625",
    ["To achieve victory, each faction needs to compete for the <Highlight> Death Knight </> on the central platform of the battlefield. When the battle ends, different levels of rewards will be awarded based on the ranking of the Four Emperors faction points. By leading the <Highlight> Death Knight </> to your faction's <Highlight> plaza </> multiple times, you can obtain a large number of faction points, end the battlefield early, and obtain complete victory rewards. \n Allocation is done by club. Clubs that meet the requirements for the number of Beyonders, activity, and Beyonder score will be selected to participate. Qualified club Beyonders can view the schedule in the War-for-War - Faction - Plateau Battle interface."] = "To achieve victory, each faction needs to compete for the <Highlight> Death Knight </> on the central platform of the battlefield. When the battle ends, different levels of rewards will be awarded based on the ranking of the Four Emperors faction points. By leading the <Highlight> Death Knight </> to your faction's <Highlight> plaza </> multiple times, you can obtain a large number of faction points, end the battlefield early, and obtain complete victory rewards. \n Allocation is done by club. Clubs that meet the requirements for the number of Потустороннийs, activity, and Потусторонний score will be selected to participate. Qualified club Потустороннийs can view the schedule in the War-for-War - Faction - Plateau Battle interface.",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008605"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008605",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期副本%s中参与的拍卖涉及线下交易或苏勒转移（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>），未通过审核。该笔订单苏勒已永久扣除。如有疑问，请通过用户中心-联系客服反馈详细情况。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The gold for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["临时触发点"] = "Temporary Trigger Point",
    ["The magician who lost her Tarot cards"] = "The Фокусник who lost her Tarot cards",
    ["不速之音接取trigger"] = "Uninvited Sound acceptance trigger",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您预购道具<M_Link>%s</>失败，预购支付的货币已返还到您邮箱内。\n（预购规则：商品公示结束后，进入1分钟的预购期，所有玩家都可以出价，预购期结束时，商品随机分配给一位出价者，其他出价者的货币将全额返还。）"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour pre-order for the item <M_Link>%s</> failed. The currency paid for the pre-order has been returned to your mailbox.\n(Pre-order rules: After the item listing period ends, a 1-minute pre-order period begins. All players can place bids. When the pre-order period ends, the item is randomly assigned to one bidder, and the currency of other bidders will be fully refunded.)",
    ["他关爱着每位生灵，哪怕你没有信仰“愚者”，依然可以享受塔罗学派的一切。"] = "He cares for every living being; even if you don't believe in the \"Fool\", you can still enjoy everything the Клуб Таро has to offer.",
    ["Crown the resister, the immortal flame burns forever on the throne."] = "Crown the resister, the immortal flame burns forever on the throne.",
    ["He cares for every living being; even if you don't believe in the \"Fool\", you can still enjoy everything the Tarot Club has to offer."] = "He cares for every living being; even if you don't believe in the \"Fool\", you can still enjoy everything the Клуб Таро has to offer.",
    ["他积攒自己的鲜血，尝试启动生命炼成和复活仪式，却也因此失控，变成了怪物。"] = "He hoarded his own blood, attempting to initiate a life-transmutation and resurrection ritual, but he lost control because of it and turned into a monster.",
    ["从右侧攻击"] = "Attack from the right",
    ["Tree of Abundance_5200139_Druid_Filter Attack Signal B"] = "Tree of Abundance_5200139_Druid_Filter Attack Signal B",
    ["What... ritual? Aren't we here for a birthday party?"] = "What... ritual? Aren't we here for a birthday party?",
    ["五月庄园·城堡普通难度已解锁"] = "May Manor · Castle normal difficulty unlocked.",
    ["亲爱的小姐，如果一个医生能发明出不需要任何代价，就能治疗脱发的手术，他马上就能成为鲁恩的首富。"] = "My dear lady, if a doctor could invent a surgery that treats hair loss without any cost, he would immediately become the richest man in Loen.",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nCongratulations on achieving the [%s] achievement. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nCongratulations on achieving the [%s] achievement. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries.",
    ["亲爱的，你真有才华……"] = "My dear, you are truly talented...",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n    We have noticed that regarding the three-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 3</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your spirituality guide your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    We have noticed that regarding the three-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 3</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["To help Azik Eggers recover his past, Klein established a long-term correspondence with him. The letters mostly consist of sharing historical clues, asking about Beyonder knowledge, or informing him of travel plans, serving as an important bond for this mentor-friend relationship."] = "To help Azik Eggers recover his past, Klein established a long-term correspondence with him. The letters mostly consist of sharing historical clues, asking about Потусторонний knowledge, or informing him of travel plans, serving as an important bond for this mentor-friend relationship.",
    ["Profane Witch False Mirror Buff"] = "Profane Witch False Mirror Buff",
    ["Beyonder loadouts cannot be switched within Utopia Theater."] = "Потусторонний loadouts cannot be switched within Utopia Theater.",
    ["Restore 100 SAN points to allies within a 30-meter radius around the user, randomly increase Erudition, Charisma, Martial Strength, or Intuition, and apply <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </> and <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>, lasting for <HighLight> 1800 </> seconds. <HighLight> (Only castable on the ground) </> \n <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </>: Increases all five dimensions by <HighLight> 4 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Crimson Essence. \n <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>: Increases Attack by <HighLight> 25 </> points and Skill Enhancement by <HighLight> 5 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Berserk Potion."] = "Restore 100 SAN points to allies within a 30-meter radius around the user, randomly increase Erudition, Charisma, Martial Strength, or Intuition, and apply <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </> and <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>, lasting for <HighLight> 1800 </> seconds. <HighLight> (Only castable on the ground) </> \n <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </>: Increases all five dimensions by <HighLight> 4 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Crimson Essence. \n <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>: Increases Attack by <HighLight> 25 </> points and Усиление навыков by <HighLight> 5 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Berserk Potion.",
    ["No, no, that dangerous thing is in the ruins of the castle, waiting for people to let their guard down. Once we think we're safe, then it will... kill everyone!"] = "No, no, that dangerous thing is in the ruins of the castle, waiting for people to let their guard down. Once we think we're safe, then it will... kill everyone!",
    ["What? Spirituality has been suppressed—rush out of the suppression zone first!"] = "What? Духовность has been suppressed—rush out of the suppression zone first!",
    ["Person in Charge"] = "Person in Charge",
    ["Artificial Death Marker buff"] = "Artificial Death Marker buff",
    ["他已经完全失去了理智。"] = "He has completely lost his mind.",
    ["Small aura after learning"] = "Small aura after learning",
    ["Liana activates the cyclic power of 3-888; both receive significantly reduced damage; prioritize breaking the 3-888 shield!"] = "Liana activates the cyclic power of 3-888; both receive significantly reduced damage; prioritize breaking the 3-888 shield!",
    ["A traveler running for knowledge, a lone lamp lit in the wilderness, the answer fluttering in the direction of the wind..."] = "A traveler running for knowledge, a lone lamp lit in the wilderness, the answer fluttering in the direction of the wind...",
    ["We used to charge 3 pence for carrying luggage, now they charge 2 pence."] = "We used to charge 3 pence for carrying luggage, now they charge 2 pence.",
    ["令人心动的未来-布置仪式"] = "A Heart-Stirring Future - Setting up the ritual",
    ["人脉话题-奥黛丽5关于心理治疗"] = "Connection Topic - Audrey 5: About Psychotherapy",
    ["从后侧攻击"] = "Attack from the rear",
    ["今天就让你知道终结者的厉害。你会后悔来到这个场上！"] = "Today I'll show you the power of the Terminator. You'll regret coming to this arena!",
    ["中距离连续发射魅影能量弹打击目标。"] = "Fire a continuous stream of phantom energy missiles at the target from medium range.",
    ["从左侧攻击"] = "Attack from the left",
    ["Casting protective radiance from the distant starry sky, the Crimson Will is <Disable>difficult to damage</> while within the range."] = "Casting protective radiance from the distant starry sky, the Crimson Will is <Disable>difficult to damage</> while within the range.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights, please do not participate in offline trading. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing dungeon auctions, etc.)."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>). To protect your rights, please do not participate in offline trading. If similar behavior continues, your account will be subject to further penalties (including but not limited to freezing currency, sealing dungeon auctions, etc.).",
    ["主菜单-技能按钮解锁"] = "Main Menu - Skill Button Unlock",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008625"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008625",
    ["Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes in the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n Players whose weekly speedrun results enter the top 100 of this Pathway will receive an exclusive title. To ensure fairness in speedrunning, the level of enemies in the theater will be updated every Monday at 8:00 AM. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 2 times that of normal difficulty."] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some Марионеткаs in the theater. These corrupted Марионеткаs are attempting to establish a secret channel to Шут's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect Шут's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control Марионеткаs, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the Искажение. \n\n Players whose weekly speedrun results enter the top 100 of this Pathway will receive an exclusive title. To ensure fairness in speedrunning, the level of enemies in the theater will be updated every Monday at 8:00 AM. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 2 times that of normal difficulty.",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008605"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008605",
    ["今日推荐的甜点有胡萝卜蛋糕，甜而不腻，健康营养。"] = "Today's recommended dessert is carrot cake, sweet but not greasy, healthy and nutritious.",
    ["主线组件-加速圈（灵性之跃）"] = "Main Quest Component - Acceleration Ring (Leap of Духовность)",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Spectator, Sequence 8: Telepathist, Sequence 7: Psychiatrist, Sequence 6: Hypnotist, Sequence 5: Dreamwalker, Sequence 4: Manipulator, Sequence 3: Dream Weaver, Sequence 2: Discerner, Sequence 1: Author, Sequence 0: Visionary"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Зритель, Последовательность 8: Телепат, Последовательность 7: Психиатр, Последовательность 6: Hypnotist, Последовательность 5: Dreamwalker, Последовательность 4: Manipulator, Последовательность 3: Dream Weaver, Последовательность 2: Discerner, Последовательность 1: Author, Последовательность 0: Visionary",
    ["Main quest 2-2 trigger"] = "Main quest 2-2 trigger",
    ["Both greatswords have been collected. You can now go to investigate the Castle of the Court of Convergence; perhaps there is a way to return to reality there. (Hint: Board the rail to reach the castle gate quickly.)"] = "Both greatswords have been collected. You can now go to investigate the Castle of the Court of Convergence; perhaps there is a way to return to reality there. (Hint: Board the rail to reach the castle gate quickly.)",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 3, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 3</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 3, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 3</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["从高温熔浆中自然冷却形成，保留部分火焰与大地属性。"] = "Formed by natural cooling from high-temperature magma, retaining some fire and earth attributes.",
    ["乌龟振刀相机"] = "Turtle parry camera",
    ["The moment the camera is raised, time trips in the viewfinder and freezes into eternity."] = "The moment the camera is raised, time trips in the viewfinder and freezes into eternity.",
    ["Fail to restore sanity to Beyonders 20 times in total."] = "Fail to restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs 20 times in total.",
    ["二是通过占卜寻找其它获取“小丑”魔药的途径。"] = "The second is to find other ways to obtain the 'Клоун' potion through Гадание.",
    ["产自鲁恩王国间海郡康斯顿城的某座矿山，尽管整座城市受战争摧残严重，但也因此拥有了大量含有灵性的材料。因矿山周围常有一些诡异的传闻，工人们只敢挖掘最外层的燧石。"] = "Produced from a mine in Coniston, Midseashire, Loen Kingdom. Although the entire city was severely devastated by the war, it possesses a large amount of materials containing Духовность. Because of the strange rumors often surrounding the mine, workers only dare to dig for the flint on the outermost layer.",
    ["Factions with a difference of <Highlight> 3000 </> faction points from the top-ranked faction are considered disadvantaged factions and can receive the following mechanism support: \n <Highlight> Tripwire </>: Every <Highlight> 5 minutes </>, a Tripwire item will be dropped in front of the disadvantaged faction's plaza. Only Beyonders of this faction can pick it up. After picking it up, they gain a Special Skill that can be used against Knights to Slow them. \n <Highlight> Group Teleport </>: Every <Highlight> 8 minutes </>, a gathering mechanism will be activated at the disadvantaged faction's plaza. It requires <Highlight> 1 </> Beyonder to go to the plaza area to activate it. Once successfully activated, all Beyonders of that faction can Teleport to the plaza area and gain a powerful buff."] = "Factions with a difference of <Highlight> 3000 </> faction points from the top-ranked faction are considered disadvantaged factions and can receive the following mechanism support: \n <Highlight> Tripwire </>: Every <Highlight> 5 minutes </>, a Tripwire item will be dropped in front of the disadvantaged faction's plaza. Only Потустороннийs of this faction can pick it up. After picking it up, they gain a Особый навык that can be used against Knights to Slow them. \n <Highlight> Group Teleport </>: Every <Highlight> 8 minutes </>, a gathering mechanism will be activated at the disadvantaged faction's plaza. It requires <Highlight> 1 </> Потусторонний to go to the plaza area to activate it. Once successfully activated, all Потустороннийs of that faction can Teleport to the plaza area and gain a powerful buff.",
    ["亵渎魔女假镜子buff"] = "Profane Witch False Mirror Buff",
    ["Intersection maximum damage: <HighLight>360%</> attack"] = "Intersection maximum damage: <HighLight>360%</> attack",
    ["乌黯魔狼召唤2只<Disable>魔狼眷族</>，<Disable>魔狼眷族</>出生后会进入隐身状态，持续延场边移动并间隔释放伤害越来越高的全场伤害，<Disable>魔狼眷族</>存在期间会保护<Disable>乌黯魔狼</>，使其处于无敌状态"] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf summons 2 <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</>. After the <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</> spawn, they will enter an invisibility state, continue to move along the edge of the field, and periodically release field-wide damage that becomes increasingly higher. While the <Disable>Demon Wolf Kin</> exist, they will protect the <Disable>Dark Demonic Wolf</>, keeping it in an invincible state.",
    ["The Jonar couple receives Backlash Damage and falls into a weakened state."] = "The Jonar couple receives Backlash Damage and falls into a weakened state.",
    ["Critical Redemption"] = "Critical Redemption",
    ["为帮助阿兹克·艾格斯找回过去，克莱恩与他建立了长期的书信联系。信件内容多为分享历史线索、询问非凡知识或告知行程，是维系这段亦师亦友关系的重要纽带。"] = "To help Azik Eggers recover his past, Klein established a long-term correspondence with him. The letters mostly consist of sharing historical clues, asking about Потусторонний knowledge, or informing him of travel plans, serving as an important bond for this mentor-friend relationship.",
    ["No, I have many identities in the real world. If you want to find me, you can go to the Loen Charity Foundation. As for psychotherapy, this is an Extraordinary ability of the 'Spectator' pathway."] = "No, I have many identities in the real world. If you want to find me, you can go to the Loen Charity Foundation. As for psychotherapy, this is an Extraordinary ability of the 'Зритель' pathway.",
    ["丽贝卡施放占星术，技能得到增强！"] = "Rebecca casts Astrology; her skills are enhanced!",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 1, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 1</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 1, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 1</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["They seem to have just fallen asleep; it appears the ritual wasn't entirely safe. I hope they learn their lesson."] = "They seem to have just fallen asleep; it appears the ritual wasn't entirely safe. I hope they learn their lesson.",
    ["May Manor · Castle normal difficulty unlocked."] = "May Manor · Castle normal difficulty unlocked.",
    ["世代效忠威瑟尔家族的文森特，在庄园遇袭之夜启动了先祖铠甲，铠甲却被未知污染侵蚀，反过来屠尽了庄园。绝望中，他发现海伦娜还活着。她是唯一的幸存者，她不知道铠甲失控的真相。文森特咽下了坦白与忏悔，发誓用余生弥补。他将铠甲封锁，独自追查仇敌与污染源头，为获取力量不择手段。直到某人告诉他“知识皇冠”的存在，他看见了希望。\n“知识就是力量。”"] = "Vincent, who had served the Wetherell family for generations, activated the Ancestor Armor on the night the manor was attacked, but the armor was eroded by unknown Искажение and turned to slaughter the manor in return. In despair, he discovered that Helena was still alive. She was the only survivor, and she did not know the truth about the armor's loss of control. Vincent swallowed his confession and repentance, vowing to spend the rest of his life making amends. He sealed the armor and pursued the enemies and the source of the Искажение alone, stopping at nothing to gain power. Until someone told him about the existence of the 'Crown of Knowledge,' he saw hope. \n \"Knowledge is Power.\"",
    ["与其他非凡者较量，在对抗中展现力量与策略。"] = "Compete with other Потустороннийs and demonstrate your power and strategy in battle.",
    ["Skill Long-Press Display Tips on Main Interface"] = "Skill Long-Press Display Tips on Main Interface",
    ["为所欲为，但绝不可有伤害之心。"] = "Do as you please, but never harbor a heart of malice.",
    ["与霹雳舞王谈谈"] = "Talk to the Breakdance King",
    ["从灰雾之上飘落的空白书页，被命运的力量注入了灵性。当两份誓约产生共鸣时，隐藏的文字就会显现。"] = "A blank page drifting down from above the gray fog, injected with Духовность by the power of fate. When two covenants resonate, the hidden text will appear.",
    ["两把大剑收集完毕，可以去探查城堡·归一之庭了，或许那里有回归现实的方法。（提示：乘上滑轨，快速抵达城堡门前。）"] = "Both greatswords have been collected. You can now go to investigate the Castle of the Court of Convergence; perhaps there is a way to return to reality there. (Hint: Board the rail to reach the castle gate quickly.)",
    ["为年轻男女占卜"] = "Гадание for Young Couple",
    ["Attack from the left"] = "Attack from the left",
    ["Break boxes in the field to find supplies and synthesize them. Use the supplies to help the poor!"] = "Break boxes in the field to find supplies and synthesize them. Use the supplies to help the poor!",
    ["He once stitched up a lumberjack's arm and cured Castor's hidden liver pain with just three doses of medicine."] = "He once stitched up a lumberjack's arm and cured Castor's hidden liver pain with just three doses of medicine.",
    ["Turtle parry camera"] = "Turtle parry camera",
    ["二段剑气伤害提升20%。若二段未命中目标，返还10%技能冷却。"] = "Second-stage sword energy damage increased by 20%. If the second stage misses the target, 10% of the skill Перезарядка is refunded.",
    ["他们的灵体与现在的宁静合了影，对他们来说，也算是圆满了。"] = "Their spirit bodies took a photo with the current tranquility; for them, it can be considered a fulfillment.",
    ["He is fighting against the corruption. We need to help him!"] = "He is fighting against the Искажение. We need to help him!",
    ["主动查找"] = "Manual Search",
    ["Temporary attribute buff"] = "Temporary attribute buff",
    ["丽贝卡技能1普通"] = "Rebecca Skill 1 Normal",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n很遗憾您没有和您的七日誓约对象完成誓约转正，您和对方的七日誓约关系已经解除。\n请不要灰心，或许下一个七日，命运的丝线会将你引向对的人。\n愿女神的光辉照耀你的前路。\n萨默尔太太\n敬上"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nIt is a pity that you did not complete the formalization of the Covenant with your Seven-Day Covenant partner, and your Seven-Day Covenant relationship has been dissolved. \nPlease do not be discouraged; perhaps in the next seven days, the threads of fate will lead you to the right person. \nMay the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path. \nMrs. Sammer\nSincerely",
    ["Understand the specific <h>Beyonder awakening details</>"] = "Understand the specific <h>Потусторонний awakening details</>",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008627"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008627",
    ["与受诅水晶共生的微晶结构，能够同步并放大诅咒源的灵性频率。"] = "Micro-crystalline structures coexisting with cursed crystals, capable of synchronizing and amplifying the spiritual frequency of the Curse source.",
    ["五月庄园_子嗣守护_1目标_Buff84008607"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008607",
    ["May Manor Castle mechanics"] = "May Manor Castle mechanics",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>), which did not pass the audit. Dungeon auctions are now banned until %s. You can unfreeze them early by paying a deposit of %s Pounds. If you have any questions, please provide details to the customer service platform."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected that the auction you participated in during your recent dungeon %s involved offline trading (Item <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>), which did not pass the audit. Dungeon auctions are now banned until %s. You can unfreeze them early by paying a deposit of %s Pounds. If you have any questions, please provide details to the customer service platform.",
    ["为你嫁接未来命运中的能力，一份足以对抗噩梦污染的力量。"] = "Grafting the ability from your future fate onto you—a power sufficient to resist the Кошмар's Искажение.",
    ["Restore sanity to Beyonders who are experiencing or on the verge of loss of control."] = "Restore Рассудок to Потустороннийs who are experiencing or on the verge of loss of control.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您近期副本%s中参与的拍卖涉及线下交易或苏勒转移（道具<M_Link>%s</>，总计交易金额<M_Link>%s</>），未通过审核。现已封禁副本拍卖到%s。您可以在副本拍卖界面通过缴纳保证金%s金镑提前解冻。如有疑问，请通过用户中心-联系客服反馈详细情况。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that the auction you participated in during the dungeon %s involved offline trading or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. Dungeon auctions have been banned until %s. You can unfreeze them early by paying a security deposit of %s pounds in the dungeon auction interface. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["二段剑气伤害提升25%。若二段未命中目标，返还10%技能冷却。"] = "Secondary sword energy damage increased by 25%. If the secondary hit misses, 10% of the skill's Перезарядка is refunded.",
    ["东北安全区trigger"] = "Northeast safe zone trigger",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：战士、序列8：格斗家、序列7：武器大师、序列6：黎明骑士、序列5：守护者、序列4：猎魔者、序列3：银骑士、序列2：荣耀者、序列1：神明之手、序列0：黄昏巨人"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Warrior, Последовательность 8: Pugilist, Последовательность 7: Weapon Master, Последовательность 6: Dawn Paladin, Последовательность 5: Guardian, Последовательность 4: Demon Охотник, Последовательность 3: Silver Knight, Последовательность 2: Glory, Последовательность 1: Hand of God, Последовательность 0: Twilight Giant",
    ["不，不是占卜的问题，是我高估了队长的记忆力……"] = "No, it's not a problem with the Гадание; it's that I overestimated the Captain's memory...",
    ["主祭的护盾被击破了，集火！"] = "The High Priest's shield has been broken; focus fire!",
    ["人脉秘偶评分"] = "Connections Марионетка Rating",
    ["After actively using Spear of Longinus 8 times, deploy Rift of Truth."] = "After actively using Spear of Longinus 8 times, deploy Rift of Truth.",
    ["Consumable material for upgrading Connection Skills, obtainable through Sequence advancement."] = "Consumable material for upgrading Connection Skills, obtainable through Последовательность advancement.",
    ["丧尸特效buff"] = "Zombie effect buff",
    ["丢失的封印物，名为“看见我”，而观众将会看见什么？"] = "A lost Запечатанный артефакт named \"See Me\"; what will the Зритель see?",
    ["二段技能的爆炸伤害增加100%。"] = "Second-stage skill explosion damage increased by 100%.",
    ["中毒"] = "Poisoned",
    ["A Heart-Stirring Future - Setting up the ritual"] = "A Heart-Stirring Future - Setting up the ritual",
    ["Temporary Test: Attack Speed +200%."] = "Temporary Test: Скорость атаки +200%.",
    ["He cares for every living soul; even if you do not believe in \"The Fool,\" you can still enjoy everything the Tarot Academy has to offer."] = "He cares for every living soul; even if you do not believe in \"Шут,\" you can still enjoy everything the Tarot Academy has to offer.",
    ["Second-stage skill damage increased by 85%."] = "Second-stage skill damage increased by 85%.",
    ["五连击"] = "Five-Hit Combo",
    ["交叉点最高伤害：<HighLight>360%</>攻击"] = "Intersection maximum damage: <HighLight>360%</> attack",
    ["不，我是想弄清楚残影是什么，防止这里有非凡力量外泄。看来，您也是非凡者？"] = "No, I want to find out what the remnant shadow is to prevent any Extraordinary power from leaking here. It seems you are also a Потусторонний?",
    ["He has completely lost his mind."] = "He has completely lost his mind.",
    ["A chilling and cold aura, like a corpse just dug up from a cemetery, a poor lamb watched by Him, a shadow lured by a ritual."] = "A chilling and cold aura, like a corpse just dug up from a cemetery, a poor lamb watched by Him, a shadow lured by a ritual.",
    ["从梦境中唤醒消散的队友，并回复其50%生命值。"] = "Awaken a dissipated teammate from the dream and restore 50% of their health.",
    ["五月庄园城堡怎么打"] = "How to clear May Manor Castle",
    ["Humans who want to become Beyonders generally need to consume potions."] = "Humans who want to become Потустороннийs generally need to consume potions.",
    ["Dark Demonic Wolf Charge Random Filter Target"] = "Dark Demonic Wolf Charge Random Filter Target",
    ["人群中突然冒出一阵黑气，周围人惊恐的退后"] = "A burst of black energy suddenly erupts in the crowd, and the people around retreat in terror.",
    ["Main Story Ritual Circle"] = "Main Story Ritual Circle",
    ["中毒·I"] = "Poisoned · I",
    ["Main model radius and height changes, affecting attack box judgment."] = "Main model radius and height changes, affecting attack box judgment.",
    ["主线1_7民居惊逢尸体"] = "Main Story 1-7: Shocking Discovery of a Corpse in the Residence",
    ["Middle trigger and slide rail"] = "Middle trigger and slide rail",
    ["他因为溺水记忆混乱，心智也不够成熟，我们失去了沟通的基础。塔罗学院已经在暗中观察保护他，准备找机会和他建立联系。"] = "Because of his near-drowning, his memories are in chaos and his mental state is not mature enough; we have lost the foundation for communication. The Tarot Academy has already been secretly observing and protecting him, preparing to find an opportunity to establish contact.",
    ["Just the potion formula alone can push people into an unpredictable vortex."] = "Just the potion formula alone can push people into an unpredictable vortex.",
    ["The strength of Beyonders in the Dominator's Clash mode is balanced and very fair."] = "The strength of Потустороннийs in the Dominator's Clash mode is balanced and very fair.",
    ["How to clear May Manor Castle"] = "How to clear May Manor Castle",
    ["The Sealed Artifact 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Tarot Club's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try stealing his desire to strive."] = "The Запечатанный артефакт 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Клуб Таро's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try stealing his desire to strive.",
    ["人脉技能升级的消耗材料，可通过序列晋升获得。"] = "Consumable material for upgrading Connection Skills, obtainable through Последовательность advancement.",
    ["与自己创建的脱手技能互换位置"] = "Swap positions with a detached skill created by self.",
    ["I previously obtained a replica of the Groselle's Travels from the Tarot Club; it should come in handy here."] = "I previously obtained a replica of the Groselle's Travels from the Клуб Таро; it should come in handy here.",
    ["五月庄园城堡机制"] = "May Manor Castle mechanics",
    ["丽埃娜的非凡特性"] = "Liana's Потусторонний characteristic",
    ["世界灾厄死亡时，参与战斗的非凡者可获得奖励。奖励每周仅可获得<Highlight>1次</>。"] = "When the World Calamity dies, Потустороннийs who participated in the battle can receive rewards. Rewards can only be obtained <Highlight>once</> per week.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nYour purchase of the item <M_Link>%s</> failed. The currency paid for the purchase has been returned to your mailbox."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nYour purchase of the item <M_Link>%s</> failed. The currency paid for the purchase has been returned to your mailbox.",
    ["为自身周围30米半径范围内的友方恢复100点SAN值，随机提升学识、魅力、武力、直觉，并施加<HighLight>龙之体魄</>和<HighLight>龙之怒意</>，持续<HighLight>1800</>秒。<HighLight>（仅限地面施放）</>\n<HighLight>龙之体魄</>：增加<HighLight>4</>点所有五维，与高级深红精粹效果不可叠加。\n<HighLight>龙之怒意</>：增加<HighLight>25</>点攻击，<HighLight>5</>点技能加强，与高级狂暴药剂效果不可叠加。"] = "Restore 100 SAN points to allies within a 30-meter radius around the user, randomly increase Erudition, Charisma, Martial Strength, or Intuition, and apply <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </> and <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>, lasting for <HighLight> 1800 </> seconds. <HighLight> (Only castable on the ground) </> \n <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </>: Increases all five dimensions by <HighLight> 4 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Crimson Essence. \n <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>: Increases Attack by <HighLight> 25 </> points and Усиление навыков by <HighLight> 5 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Berserk Potion.",
    ["他用“火种”窃取了一件物品里的污染。"] = "He used 'Kindling' to steal the Искажение from an item.",
    ["If not needed, fill in 0; filling in an attack ID does not mean executing the corresponding Attack, but rather playing the attack effect corresponding to that Attack; if not needed, fill in 0."] = "If not needed, fill in 0; filling in an attack ID does not mean executing the corresponding Attack, but rather playing the attack effect corresponding to that Attack; if not needed, fill in 0.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您的角色存在语音违规行为，现已被禁止语音发言。\n良好的游戏环境需要广大玩家共同守护，也希望您能自觉遵守规则。若违规持续，处罚将会升级，包括但不限于延长禁麦时间/永久禁麦。如果您还有其他疑问和诉求，可联系游戏客服反馈申诉。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe system has detected voice violations in your character, and you have been banned from voice chat. \nA good gaming environment requires the joint protection of all players, and we hope you can consciously abide by the rules. If the violation continues, the penalty will be upgraded, including but not limited to extending the mute time/permanent mute. If you have other questions and requests, you can contact game customer service for feedback and appeals.",
    ["乘坐长途马车，前往拉姆德古堡。"] = "Take a long-distance carriage to Lamud Castle.",
    ["代价也挺大，前面好几个序列完全不能打，到序列六都是学者型。"] = "The price was also quite high; the first few Последовательностьs were completely unable to fight, and up to Последовательность 6, they were all scholar-types.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \nThe item <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</> you are following has been delisted."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe item <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250047\">%s</> you are following has been delisted.",
    ["Ride along with any Beyonder in a vehicle for more than 30 seconds"] = "Ride along with any Потусторонний in a vehicle for more than 30 seconds",
    ["The main staircase is damaged and impassable; explore the side door to the left of the staircase."] = "The main staircase is damaged and impassable; explore the side door to the left of the staircase.",
    ["令目标小队成员获得<HighLight>读心标记</>，持续*f秒。观众同一时间只能令一位目标获得<HighLight>读心标记</>，且目标同一时间只能获得一位观众的<HighLight>读心标记</>。<HighLight>读心标记</>的持有者与施法者之间的距离超过70米时，持有者将失去<HighLight>读心标记</>。\n仅<HighLight>空想姿态</>可用，<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>狂乱</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>读心标记</>：持有者生命低于30%时，获得持续*f秒的buffdisc(*id)，此效果存在20秒冷却。当标记的施法者使用战斗技能造成治疗效果时，标记的持有者回复效果量30%的生命（受目标减疗影响）。"] = "Causes a target party member to gain a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>, lasting for *f seconds. A Зритель can only have one target with a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> at a time, and a target can only have a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> from one Зритель at a time. If the distance between the holder of the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> and the caster exceeds 70 meters, the holder will lose the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>. \nOnly available in <HighLight>Imagination Stance</>; switches to <HighLight>Frenzy</> under <HighLight>Кошмар Stance</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Mind Reading Mark</>: When the holder's Health drops below 30%, they gain, for *f seconds, buffdisc(*id); this effect has a 20-second Перезарядка. When the caster of the mark uses a Боевой навык to perform Healing, the holder of the mark recovers Health equal to 30% of the healing amount (affected by the target's Healing Reduction).",
    ["A strangely dressed lady came to the cafe to look for someone earlier, looking furious. It didn't feel like anything good."] = "A strangely dressed lady came to the cafe to look for someone earlier, looking furious. It didn't feel like anything good.",
    ["人类想要成为非凡者，并在非凡之路上持续走下去，只能依靠魔药。"] = "Humans who want to become Потустороннийs and continue on the path of the extraordinary can only rely on potions.",
    ["主天赋树"] = "Main Talent Tree",
    ["You can also build a castle through the <Highlight>Template</> function. Click here to enter."] = "You can also build a castle through the <Highlight>Template</> function. Click here to enter.",
    ["Only used in Roguelike, used to implement resurrection without consuming charges."] = "Only used in Roguelike, used to implement resurrection without consuming charges.",
    ["之前听说，只要有对方的相关物品，就可以尝试占卜他的下落？"] = "I heard before that as long as you have an item related to the person, you can try to divine their whereabouts?",
    ["One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Sleepless, Sequence 8: Midnight Poet, Sequence 7: Nightmare, Sequence 6: Soul Assurer, Sequence 5: Spirit Warlock, Sequence 4: Nightwatcher, Sequence 3: Horror Bishop, Sequence 2: Servant of Concealment, Sequence 1: Knight of Misfortune, Sequence 0: Darkness"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Бессонный, Последовательность 8: Полуночный Поэт, Последовательность 7: Кошмар, Последовательность 6: Soul Assurer, Последовательность 5: Spirit Warlock, Последовательность 4: Nightwatcher, Последовательность 3: Horror Bishop, Последовательность 2: Servant of Concealment, Последовательность 1: Knight of Misfortune, Последовательность 0: Darkness",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008612"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008612",
    ["与势力积分第一名的势力相差<Highlight>3000</>势力积分的势力会被视为劣势势力，可以获得以下机制辅助\n<Highlight>绊马索</>，每过<Highlight>5分钟</>，劣势势力广场前将会投放绊马索道具，只有本势力非凡者可以拾取，拾取后获得特殊技能，对骑士使用可以减速骑士。\n<Highlight>集合传送</>，每过<Highlight>8分钟</>，劣势势力广场将会开启集合机制，需要<Highlight>1名</>非凡者前往广场区域激活，成功激活后该势力所有非凡者可以传送至广场区域并获得强力buff。"] = "Factions with a difference of <Highlight> 3000 </> faction points from the top-ranked faction are considered disadvantaged factions and can receive the following mechanism support: \n <Highlight> Tripwire </>: Every <Highlight> 5 minutes </>, a Tripwire item will be dropped in front of the disadvantaged faction's plaza. Only Потустороннийs of this faction can pick it up. After picking it up, they gain a Особый навык that can be used against Knights to Slow them. \n <Highlight> Group Teleport </>: Every <Highlight> 8 minutes </>, a gathering mechanism will be activated at the disadvantaged faction's plaza. It requires <Highlight> 1 </> Потусторонний to go to the plaza area to activate it. Once successfully activated, all Потустороннийs of that faction can Teleport to the plaza area and gain a powerful buff.",
    ["二楼触发器"] = "Second floor trigger",
    ["乌黯魔狼召唤数排游荡的<Disable>乌暗之影</>，<Disable>乌暗之影</>出现后会进入<Disable>隐身</>状态，并且持续向前移动，对路径上的玩家造成击飞和伤害"] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf summons several rows of wandering <Disable>Shadows of Darkness</>. After the <Disable>Shadows of Darkness</> appear, they will enter an <Disable>Invisibility</> state and continue to move forward, knocking up and damaging players in their path.",
    ["Five-Hit Combo"] = "Five-Hit Combo",
    ["人心是最喧嚣的寂静。"] = "The human heart is the most clamorous silence.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n The system has detected that your recent transaction is suspected of being an offline trade or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The gold for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n The system has detected that your recent transaction is suspected of being an offline trade or gold transfer (Items <M_Link>%s</>, total transaction amount <M_Link>%s</>) and has failed the review. The gold for this order has been permanently deducted. If you have any questions, please provide detailed information via User Center - Contact Customer Service.",
    ["My dear, this is our engagement ceremony, how can you start a fight..."] = "My dear, this is our engagement ceremony, how can you start a fight...",
    ["Only valid when LevelByOtherSkill is a Class Skill, Partner Skill, or Marionette Skill. \n The level of the released CastAttack is taken from the LevelByOtherSkill skill itself."] = "Only valid when LevelByOtherSkill is a Class Skill, Partner Skill, or Марионетка Skill. \n The level of the released CastAttack is taken from the LevelByOtherSkill skill itself.",
    ["仅造成有效治疗才触发"] = "Trigger only when effective Healing is caused",
    ["Share damage from perpetrator"] = "Share damage from perpetrator",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您预购道具<M_Link>%s</>成功，请领取对应道具。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour pre-order for the item <M_Link>%s</> was successful. Please claim your item.",
    ["He is getting busier and busier now; with great power comes great responsibility, but I still hope he takes care of his health."] = "He is getting busier and busier now; with great power comes great responsibility, but I still hope he takes care of his health.",
    ["不！为什么，为什么我们出生就注定要背负这样的诅咒，要亲手终结自己父母的生命？"] = "No! Why, why are we destined to bear such a curse from birth, and to have to end our parents' lives with our own hands?",
    ["乔安娜抽到宝剑十。我告诉她，这是终结和失败，练得再好也上不了大城市的舞台。"] = "Joanna drew the Ten of Swords. I told her it meant finish and failure, and that no matter how well she practiced, she would never make it to the big city stage.",
    ["主线禁止放技能和移动"] = "Main Story Disable Skill and Movement",
    ["云朵被你点燃，盛放作玫瑰。"] = "The clouds are ignited by you, blooming into roses.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n你的誓约对象:%s已与其他人缔结了新的誓约。\n爱与羁绊从不设限，愿你们各自的故事都更加丰盈。"] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nYour Covenant partner:%s has entered into a new Covenant with someone else. \nLove and bonds are never limited. May your respective stories become even richer.",
    ["主神像触发宝箱奖励的对话"] = "Dialogue Triggered by Main Statue Treasure Chest Reward",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 2, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 2</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\n      We have noticed that regarding Survey 2, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World Messenger. Please check it. \n      If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 2</>\n      Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["Gentle Piano Music Tonight - The couple proposing breaks down in tears"] = "Gentle Piano Music Tonight - The couple proposing breaks down in tears",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：窥秘人、序列8：格斗学家、序列7：巫师、序列6：卷轴教师、序列5：星象师、序列4：神秘学家、序列3：预言大师、序列2：贤者、序列1：知识皇帝、序列0：隐者"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nПоследовательность 9: Подглядывающий за Тайнами, Последовательность 8: Melee Scholar, Последовательность 7: Warlock, Последовательность 6: Scrolls Professor, Последовательность 5: Constellations Master, Последовательность 4: Mysticologist, Последовательность 3: Clairvoyant, Последовательность 2: Sage, Последовательность 1: Knowledge Emperor, Последовательность 0: Hermit",
    ["从“历史孔隙”中抽取的灵性之线，缠绕着无数可能的命运。"] = "Threads of Духовность extracted from the \"gaps of history,\" entwined with countless possible fates.",
    ["Temporary Trigger Point"] = "Temporary Trigger Point",
    ["Dear Beyonder:\nCongratulations on ranking %s on the %s leaderboard. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries."] = "Dear Потусторонний:\nCongratulations on ranking %s on the %s leaderboard. We have provided generous rewards. We hope you continue your efforts and make a name for yourself in the world of Mysteries.",
    ["May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008608"] = "May Manor_Offspring Protection_1 Target_Buff84008608",
    ["乌黯魔狼隐入暗影之中，并召唤数个<Disable>魔狼雕像</>。暗影会逐渐覆盖场地，并吞噬所有处于其中的玩家，乌黯魔狼在暗影中会不断使用冲锋攻击玩家。"] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf hides in the shadows and summons several <Disable>Demon Wolf Statues</>. The shadows will gradually cover the field and devour all players within them; the Dark Demonic Wolf will continuously use charges to attack players while in the shadows.",
    ["丰饶的呼唤·污染"] = "Call of Abundance - Искажение",
    ["五月庄园·城堡"] = "May Manor · Castle",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于两日体验的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷2</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    We have noticed that regarding the two-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 2</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your Духовность guide your path.",
    ["Arthur is a hero of Loen. He led us in resisting the Feysac army in Midseashire."] = "Arthur is a hero of Loen. He led us in resisting the Feysac army in Midseashire.",
    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n您在交易所出售道具已被下架，请查收。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nThe item you were selling on the Exchange has been delisted. Please check it.",
    ["Only available for Buffs; immune to death once, removes the buff after triggering."] = "Only available for Buffs; immune to death once, removes the buff after triggering.",
    ["丽贝卡在调查小铜镜，得到了另一件封印物“绝望魔镜”的线索。镜中廷根由“知识皇冠”构建，并非是真正的镜中世界。"] = "Rebecca is investigating the small copper mirror and has obtained clues about another Запечатанный артефакт, the \"Magic Mirror of Despair.\" Тинген in the Mirror is constructed by the \"Crown of Knowledge\" and is not a true mirror world.",
    ["He is the First mate under the command of the “Queen of Stars” Cattleya, and the dreaded “Toxin Expert” on the Future. But Frank Lee never considered himself a dangerous person—he is just an agricultural researcher who loves soil, crops, and cross-breeding technology, an idealist who tries to solve human hunger in the most direct way. \n In his world, there is no insurmountable gap between bulls and wheat, and there is no essential difference between milk and the deck. Everything can be hybridized, and anything is possible. This is his most devout interpretation of the “Mother’s” will. \n \n Frank Lee’s madness is a pure, almost naive madness. He never feels that he is doing something dangerous, just as a child never feels that there is anything wrong with building blocks into strange shapes. He just saw hunger, saw poverty, and then came up with the most direct solution—let food grow itself, in any possible form, in any possible place. \n He tried to make cows grow out of the ground like wheat so that farmers wouldn’t need to worry about raising them; the mushrooms he cultivated reproduced wildly under the deck of the Future, making the ship start to produce milk—to him, this is a “miracle,” a confirmation of his research by the “merciful Mother.” He never thought that when an ordinary person saw milky white liquid seeping out of the cracks in the deck, the first reaction would be fear rather than surprise. \n He is the most dangerous existence on the Future, but also the most harmless soul. What is dangerous is his creation, and what is harmless is his heart. He never harbors any malice; he stands on the blurred boundary between madness and innocence, and he firmly believes that one day, the world will understand him. \n \n “I just want to feed everyone.” He would say this, his blue eyes full of sincerity."] = "He is the First mate under the command of the “Queen of Stars” Cattleya, and the dreaded “Toxin Expert” on the Future. But Frank Lee never considered himself a dangerous person—he is just an agricultural researcher who loves soil, crops, and cross-breeding technology, an idealist who tries to solve human hunger in the most direct way. \n In his world, there is no insurmountable gap between bulls and wheat, and there is no essential difference between milk and the deck. Everything can be hybridized, and anything is possible. This is his most devout interpretation of the “Mother’s” will. \n \n Frank Lee’s Безумие is a pure, almost naive Безумие. He never feels that he is doing something dangerous, just as a child never feels that there is anything wrong with building blocks into strange shapes. He just saw hunger, saw poverty, and then came up with the most direct solution—let food grow itself, in any possible form, in any possible place. \n He tried to make cows grow out of the ground like wheat so that farmers wouldn’t need to worry about raising them; the mushrooms he cultivated reproduced wildly under the deck of the Future, making the ship start to produce milk—to him, this is a “miracle,” a confirmation of his research by the “merciful Mother.” He never thought that when an ordinary person saw milky white liquid seeping out of the cracks in the deck, the first reaction would be fear rather than surprise. \n He is the most dangerous existence on the Future, but also the most harmless soul. What is dangerous is his creation, and what is harmless is his heart. He never harbors any malice; he stands on the blurred boundary between Безумие and innocence, and he firmly believes that one day, the world will understand him. \n \n “I just want to feed everyone.” He would say this, his blue eyes full of sincerity.",
    ["以上为副本怪物buff"] = "The above are dungeon monster buffs",
    ["亲爱的，这可是我们的订婚仪式，你怎么能动手呢……"] = "My dear, this is our engagement ceremony, how can you start a fight...",
    ["He once barely survived by eating monsters, but the accumulated toxins distorted his sanity and body."] = "He once barely survived by eating monsters, but the accumulated toxins distorted his Рассудок and body.",
    ["为玛丽占卜"] = "Гадание for Mary",
    ["Take a long-distance carriage to Lamud Castle."] = "Take a long-distance carriage to Lamud Castle.",
    ["Intervene in mysterious Beyonder incidents, resist loss of control and madness, and guard this world."] = "Intervene in mysterious Потусторонний incidents, resist loss of control and Безумие, and guard this world.",
    ["Interaction Object - Tarot Card"] = "Interaction Object - Tarot Card",
    ["<LevelText_Special>神性等级%d级</>"] = "<LevelText_Special> Divinity Level %d </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【枯叶蝶】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得枯叶蝶套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dead Leaf Butterfly】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Dead Leaf Butterfly outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【What the Mourner Says】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In front of the old house deep in the grape trellis, a man seems to be looking for something...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>65</>, go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(373,197)]|27149;9014;1136;2;5200085;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【What the Mourner Says】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In front of the old house deep in the grape trellis, a man seems to be looking for something...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>65</>, go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(373,197)]|27149;9014;1136;2;5200085;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["5200238 Clock Shop Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200238 Clock Shop Multiplayer Scene",
    ["1. <Highlight> The large map </> displays the location of the flag in real-time. \n 2. <Highlight> The mini-map in the top right corner </> will also continuously display the direction of the flag; you can follow the guidance to find the flag."] = "1. <Highlight> The large map </> displays the location of the flag in real-time. \n 2. <Highlight> The mini-map in the top right corner </> will also continuously display the direction of the flag; you can follow the guidance to find the flag.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【玫瑰藤杖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得玫瑰藤杖，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Rose Vine Staff】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Rose Vine Staff. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["1.召唤4个撞击蘑菇;\n2.扇形AOE*4;\n3.全屏击退AOE"] = "1. Summon 4 impact mushrooms;\n 2. Fan-shaped AOE*4;\n 3. Full-screen knockback AOE",
    ["1: Show, 0: Close."] = "1: Show, 0: Close.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Are they giving that girl a hard time? Go up and help her!) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Are they giving that girl a hard time? Go up and help her!) </>",
    ["Level 62 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard"] = "Level 62 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【明心】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得明心，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Clear Mind】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Clear Mind after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Story Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Story Events record various cases that occur in Sinful Tingen. Completing Story Events advances the main storyline of Sinful Tingen, gradually unlocking new side quests and uncovering secrets hidden in the dark side of the city. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event. \n2. Some events have level requirements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. Prioritize completing Story Events when first entering the gameplay. \n2. Story Events will unlock new Challenge Events, Competition Events, and more story content, advancing your gameplay progress."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Story Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Story Events record various cases that occur in Sinful Тинген. Completing Story Events advances the main storyline of Sinful Тинген, gradually unlocking new side quests and uncovering secrets hidden in the dark side of the city. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event. \n2. Some events have level requirements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. Prioritize completing Story Events when first entering the gameplay. \n2. Story Events will unlock new Challenge Events, Competition Events, and more story content, advancing your gameplay progress.",
    ["1: Enable, 0: Disable; once enabled, you can click the top of the main interface in PVP to open data statistics."] = "1: Enable, 0: Disable; once enabled, you can click the top of the main interface in PVP to open data statistics.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【New Store Opening】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A new store has opened on the street, but neither the owner nor the customers seem very happy...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[廷根(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the shopkeeper </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【New Store Opening】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A new store has opened on the street, but neither the owner nor the customers seem very happy...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Тинген(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the shopkeeper </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Fungal Whispers of the Dark Forest】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fungal Whispers of the Dark Forest. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Accessories\n.<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress unlock."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fungal Whispers of the Dark Forest】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fungal Whispers of the Dark Forest. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Accessories\n.<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress unlock.",
    ["<EquipHighLight>更换装备时，</>无损转移<EquipHighLight>强化效果</>"] = "<EquipHighLight>When changing equipment, </>transfer Strengthening effects without loss<EquipHighLight></>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Utopia Theater】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Dungeon Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Solo/Duo Dungeon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Features: </>\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragments: </>Players have a chance to obtain residual memories dropped by defeated marionettes that have suffered a loss of control. You can choose various memory fragments to strengthen your abilities, constantly growing and changing to face stronger challenges on each floor.\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragment Gifting: </>In duo mode, players can use the Memory Retrace function in the memory fragment interface to convert their own memory fragments into a retraceable form that teammates can pick up, allowing you to share fragments and grow together.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Normal Difficulty: </>Level 30\n    <Assistant_Property1>Hard Difficulty: </>Level 30, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n    <Assistant_Property1>Nightmare Difficulty: </>Level 61, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - </>{JumpToUI:[乌托邦剧院]|1302351}to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Party Size: </>Enter solo or as a duo.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Random Marionette Fragment Box, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>First-Clear Rewards for Each Difficulty: </>Bound Pounds, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n    <Assistant_Property1>Weekly Progress Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n<Assistant_Red>Each difficulty provides 1 first-clear reward; you can earn progress rewards up to a limit of 1200 Stage Echoes per week.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Bonus: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Players who form a Covenant relationship</>and enter duo mode will receive extra resurrection counts and extra Marionette Essence (used for purchasing important items within the dungeon)."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Utopia Theater】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Dungeon Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Solo/Duo Dungeon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Features: </>\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragments: </>Players have a chance to obtain residual memories dropped by defeated Марионеткаs that have suffered a loss of control. You can choose various memory fragments to strengthen your abilities, constantly growing and changing to face stronger challenges on each floor.\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragment Gifting: </>In duo mode, players can use the Memory Retrace function in the memory fragment interface to convert their own memory fragments into a retraceable form that teammates can pick up, allowing you to share fragments and grow together.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Normal Difficulty: </>Level 30\n    <Assistant_Property1>Hard Difficulty: </>Level 30, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n    <Assistant_Property1>Кошмар Difficulty: </>Level 61, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - </>{JumpToUI:[Utopia Theater]|1302351}to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Party Size: </>Enter solo or as a duo.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Random Марионетка Fragment Box, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>First-Clear Rewards for Each Difficulty: </>Bound Pounds, Purple/Gold Random Марионетка Fragment Box\n    <Assistant_Property1>Weekly Progress Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Purple/Gold Random Марионетка Fragment Box\n<Assistant_Red>Each difficulty provides 1 first-clear reward; you can earn progress rewards up to a limit of 1200 Stage Echoes per week.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Bonus: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Players who form a Covenant relationship</>and enter duo mode will receive extra resurrection counts and extra Марионетка Essence (used for purchasing important items within the dungeon).",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·蹲姿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·蹲姿，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Squat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Squat. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Social·Showing Off Wealth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Weekly Gameplay Reward Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Social·Showing Off Wealth. You can click <Assistant_System>Action Emotes</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop-General Merchandise-Reimbursement Shop</> using invoice receipts to redeem"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social·Showing Off Wealth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Weekly Gameplay Reward Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Social·Showing Off Wealth. You can click <Assistant_System>Action Emotes</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop-General Merchandise-Reimbursement Shop</> using invoice receipts to redeem",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>It's You I Choose</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>Leisure-Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Deploy a phantom whose identity is a close relationship (Covenant, Family) once"] = "<Assistant_Title1>It's You I Choose</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>Leisure-Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Deploy a phantom whose identity is a close relationship (Covenant, Family) once",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Loen Socialite</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Have 50 friends"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Loen Socialite</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Have 50 friends",
