    ["<Chat_Highlight> {{eventMessageParams.loserName}} </> has fallen under the absolute charm of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</> and is willing to become a captive of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</>. (Status lasts for <Chat_Highlight>15</> minutes)"] = "<Chat_Highlight> {{eventMessageParams.loserName}} </> has fallen under the absolute charm of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</> and is willing to become a captive of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</>. (Status lasts for <Chat_Highlight>15</> minutes)",
    ["<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Embossed Leather, Silver Rivet Light Armor, & Lightweight Battle Gear\nThe unmoving twilight lingers on the pauldrons; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, it still holds the ambition to awaken the dawn."] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Embossed Leather, Silver Rivet Light Armor, & Lightweight Battle Gear\nThe unmoving twilight lingers on the pauldrons; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, it still holds the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>神话装备</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n\n1、获得神话织茧后，可接取任务【隐秘之拥】，解锁铸造神话武器的方法。\n\n2、可先使用织茧游丝打造红色（神话）品质武器【夜幕之颂】，待获取神话织茧后，再补充材料进行【隐秘之拥】的铸造。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Mythical Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </>\n\n 1. After obtaining a Mythical Cocoon, you can accept the quest [Embrace of Concealment] to unlock the method for forging mythical weapons. \n\n 2. You can first use Cocoon Silk to craft a Red (Mythical) quality weapon [Ode to Nightfall], and once you obtain a Mythical Cocoon, supplement the materials to perform the [Embrace of Concealment] forging.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>社团核心</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-教团\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>任意教团等级达到10级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Organization Core</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Group Play-Organization\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Any Organization reaches Level 10",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Dividends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Dividends</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>You can claim club dividend rewards once a week.\nClub dividend rewards are affected by the club's activity level and your personal activity in the current club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00 AM; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Dividends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Dividends</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>You can claim club dividend rewards once a week.\nClub dividend rewards are affected by the club's activity level and your personal activity in the current club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00 AM; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> has left the club; hope to see you again."] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> has left the club; hope to see you again.",
    ["<ChatTag_Team>[Team]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Team>[Team]</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle - Tabs】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Following Tab: </>The Following tab displays dynamic updates from players and NPCs you follow. \n<Assistant_Title2>Discover Tab: </>The Discover tab automatically pushes currently trending Mysteries Circle updates based on popularity. You can manually adjust the sorting to display by post time. \n<Assistant_Title2>Topics Tab: </>You can view the current topic rankings. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-动态]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-关系]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle - Tabs】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Following Tab: </>The Following tab displays dynamic updates from players and NPCs you follow. \n<Assistant_Title2>Discover Tab: </>The Discover tab automatically pushes currently trending Mysteries Circle updates based on popularity. You can manually adjust the sorting to display by post time. \n<Assistant_Title2>Topics Tab: </>You can view the current topic rankings. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}",
    ["Level 68 Adventure Equipment Selection Box"] = "Level 68 Adventure Equipment Selection Box",
    ["1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Heartbeat Signal voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. Players on the mic sequence automatically gain Guest status; the player on mic #1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their \"Light Up\" status. You can view the current speech and \"Light Up\" status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner. \n 4. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 5. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar."] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Heartbeat Signal voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. Players on the mic Последовательность automatically gain Guest status; the player on mic #1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their \"Light Up\" status. You can view the current speech and \"Light Up\" status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner. \n 4. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 5. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["20_清空指定背包页签下的所有物品"] = "20_Clear All Items in Specified Inventory Tab",
    ["5231136   贝克兰德   单人位面"] = "5231136 Бэкланд Single-Player Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The Twelfth One】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A blizzard is coming, and a man claiming to be a guide knows a shortcut down the mountain... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 64</>, go to {Location:[Hornacis Mountains(294,449)]|19910;34435;652;2;5200086;0}the location and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Twelfth One】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A blizzard is coming, and a man claiming to be a guide knows a shortcut down the mountain... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 64</>, go to {Location:[Hornacis Mountains(294,449)]|19910;34435;652;2;5200086;0}the location and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-策略卡与路线】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>策略卡：</>每次前往下一站前可选择一张策略卡，抵达下一站后按条件生效，常见效果包括获得商会票券、获得货物、货物转化，大部分卡片都和猜中站点类型有关，理解了站点顺序能大幅提高策略卡的生效概率。\n<Assistant_Title2>路线提示：</>选择策略卡时，可以根据当前和剩余站点，推理最有可能出现的下一站类型；低难度会给出更明确的后续站点信息，且不会出现连续相同的站点，可以以此判断后续站点类型；高难度下没有区域概念，你只能看到未来3站最多的站点类型，此时则可能需要结合前面数站的预测信息，综合判定站点类型。\n<Assistant_Title2>小技巧：</>确定下一站类型时优先选猜站类卡；不确定时可考虑选稳定收益卡。部分卡片需要组合才能发挥更大作用，有了好的买卖货物铺垫，部分卡片的强度会明显提升"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Strategy Cards and Routes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategy Cards: </>Before heading to the next station, you can choose a strategy card, which will take effect upon arrival based on specific conditions. Common effects include gaining Chamber of Commerce tickets, obtaining cargo, or cargo conversion. Most cards are related to guessing the station type; understanding the station Последовательность can significantly increase the success rate of your strategy cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Route Tips: </>When choosing a strategy card, you can deduce the most likely next station type based on your current and remaining stations. Low-difficulty modes provide clearer information about subsequent stations and will not feature consecutive identical stations, which you can use to determine the next station type. In high-difficulty modes, there is no concept of regions, and you can only see the most frequent station types for the next 3 stops. At this point, you may need to combine predictive information from previous stations to make a comprehensive judgment on the station type. \n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize cards that involve guessing stations when you are certain of the next type; consider choosing stable income cards when uncertain. Some cards require combinations to exert greater effects; once you have laid the groundwork for buying and selling cargo, the strength of certain cards will significantly increase.",
    ["5200014 Level Objective Function Test Instance"] = "5200014 Level Objective Function Test Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Gentle Piano Music Tonight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Invited back to Blackthorn to have coffee, only to hear that there was once a pale green spring in Old Neil's life.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 53</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Threads, Bound Gold Pounds, display ornaments, etc."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gentle Piano Music Tonight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Invited back to Blackthorn to have coffee, only to hear that there was once a pale green spring in Old Neil's life.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 53</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Threads, Bound Gold Pounds, display ornaments, etc.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Land Without Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Outside the factory, a worker seems to be cursing something... \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After completing the main plot Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red> 19 </>, head to {Location: [Tingen (868,940)] | 5929;26008;-2479;2;5200002;0 } and speak with <Assistant_Red>Rovt</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Land Without Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Outside the factory, a worker seems to be cursing something... \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After completing the main plot Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red> 19 </>, head to {Location: [Тинген (868,940)] | 5929;26008;-2479;2;5200002;0 } and speak with <Assistant_Red>Rovt</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction:</>\nUse Historical Beacons to befriend Connections in the Befriend Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Method:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Befriend Connection</> to enter the befriending interface, then click Befriend 1 time/5 times to proceed.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Cost:</>\nEach time you befriend, you need to consume one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Befriend in the Befriend Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will pop up.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-Mall-Treasury Display</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-General Store-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Gift of Fate</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through some <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction:</>\nUse Historical Beacons to befriend Connections in the Befriend Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Method:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Befriend Connection</> to enter the befriending interface, then click Befriend 1 time/5 times to proceed.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Cost:</>\nEach time you befriend, you need to consume one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Befriend in the Befriend Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will pop up.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-Mall-Treasury Display</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-General Store-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Gift of Fate</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through some <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的滋味真不错】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>近日的廷根并不太平。作为值夜者小队的新人，你也被分派了一桩奇异的案件。而它指向的，是廷根北区的某个沙龙，以及留驻其中的神秘倩影……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>50级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备、挂画·春夜之邀、双人·牵手"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Тинген have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Ночные Ястребы squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Тинген's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of the Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>狒狒绒毛・精致缝纫\n银色的柔绒小包。（非常适合存放香蕉！）"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Baboon Fur · Exquisite Sewing \n A small, soft silver bag. (Very suitable for storing bananas!)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【End-Time Hunt】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>End-Time Hunt</> is a <Assistant_Property1>500-player free-for-all</> field gameplay taking place in the <Assistant_Red>City of Dragon Hunting</>. You can defeat supernatural creatures or hostile players to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> and Rank Points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</>Submit <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> to the <Assistant_System>Hunting Butler</> to advance the hunting progress and unlock stage rewards. Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting and will be automatically invalidated and cleared upon leaving.\n<Assistant_Title2>Hunting Time:</>The gameplay is open all day; daily <Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</> is Hunting Time, with additional sessions on Saturday and Sunday from <Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>. During Hunting Time, the amount of Rank Points involved in killing or being killed is doubled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Royal City Event:</>10 minutes after the start of the Friday night Hunting Time, i.e., <Assistant_Red>19:10</>, the Dragon - Projection will refresh in the center of the Royal City; outside of Friday night sessions, the Royal City Guardian will refresh 10 minutes after the start of other Hunting Times.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Settlement:</>The killer and up to 29 team members who meet the assist conditions participate in the reward settlement. Scarlet Relics are distributed equally among the participants, with remainders prioritized to the killer, and the rest randomly distributed among other participants.\n<Assistant_Title2>Plunder Rules:</>The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the proportion of Scarlet Relics that can be plundered; for every 500 fragments increased, the plunder proportion increases accordingly.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rank Rules:</>When your rank is below <Assistant_Red>Count Tier 1</>, you will not lose Rank Points when killed. Rank Points obtained by killing players will be reduced according to rules during 01:00—08:00 daily and when repeatedly killing the same target within a short period.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to End-Time Hunt]|1250342}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【End-Time Hunt】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>End-Time Hunt</> is a <Assistant_Property1>500-player free-for-all</> field gameplay taking place in the <Assistant_Red>City of Dragon Hunting</>. You can defeat supernatural creatures or hostile players to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> and Rank Points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</>Submit <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> to the <Assistant_System>Hunting Butler</> to advance the hunting progress and unlock stage rewards. Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting and will be automatically invalidated and cleared upon leaving.\n<Assistant_Title2>Hunting Time:</>The gameplay is open all day; daily <Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</> is Hunting Time, with additional sessions on Saturday and Sunday from <Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>. During Hunting Time, the amount of Rank Points involved in killing or being killed is doubled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Royal City Event:</>10 minutes after the start of the Friday night Hunting Time, i.e., <Assistant_Red>19:10</>, the Dragon - Projection will refresh in the center of the Royal City; outside of Friday night sessions, the Royal City Guardian will refresh 10 minutes after the start of other Hunting Times.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Settlement:</>The killer and up to 29 team members who meet the assist conditions participate in the reward settlement. Scarlet Relics are distributed equally among the participants, with remainders prioritized to the killer, and the rest randomly distributed among other participants.\n<Assistant_Title2>Plunder Rules:</>The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the proportion of Scarlet Relics that can be plundered; for every 500 fragments increased, the plunder proportion increases accordingly.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rank Rules:</>When your rank is below <Assistant_Red>Count Tier 1</>, you will not lose Rank Points when killed. Rank Points obtained by killing players will be reduced according to rules during 01:00—08:00 daily and when repeatedly killing the same target within a short period.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to End-Time Hunt]|1250342}",
    ["Level 60 Weapon Box"] = "Level 60 Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>未曾谋面的朋友</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-时代百态\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成百态《消失的午餐》。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>A Friend Never Met</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Era Anecdotes\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the anecdote \"The Disappearing Lunch\".",
