    ["2-049的投影赋予了你附身的能力，点击菜单查看。"] = "The projection of 2-049 grants you the ability to possess. Click the menu to view it.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 演唱会语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Concert voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["The <Chat_Highlight>%s</> faction has breached <Chat_Highlight>%s</>."] = "The <Chat_Highlight>%s</> faction has breached <Chat_Highlight>%s</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（你伸手触碰宝箱的锁扣，指尖却传来一阵寒意——这让你感到，某种存在正注视着你。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (You reach out to touch the lock of the treasure chest, but a chill runs through your fingertips—this makes you feel that some existence is watching you.) </>",
    ["1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Concert voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar."] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Concert voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精鞣皮革\n身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the City of Cities.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>象牙缎面・珠链点缀・宫廷骑装\n宫廷马场的大门再次敞开时，步伐与仪态，同样不曾松懈半分。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Ivory Satin · Bead Chain Accents · Court Riding Habit\nWhen the gates of the royal stables open once more, the pace and poise remain as impeccable as ever.",
    ["35级标准活跃玩家+少量钱"] = "Level 35 standard active player + small amount of money.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Waiting for Godot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Let's go. We can't. We're waiting for Godot.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 65</> in Acting, go to {Location:[Water Lily Town(170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0}talk to <Assistant_Red>Esther</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Waiting for Godot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Let's go. We can't. We're waiting for Godot.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 65</> in Acting, go to {Location:[Water Lily Town(170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0}talk to <Assistant_Red>Esther</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Sincere Praise】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Sincere Praise after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sincere Praise】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Sincere Praise after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<ChatTag_Chatroom>[语音房]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Chatroom>[Voice Room]</>",
    ["5200222 Nightclub Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200222 Nightclub Multiplayer Scene",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【How to Join a Covenant】</>\nAfter a Covenant is unlocked, you can enter the joining process via the <Assistant_System>Run Group</> entrance or by finding the corresponding Covenant NPC.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Joining Process: </>\n1. Open the Covenant selection interface.\n2. Select the Covenant you wish to join.\n3. View the abilities, faith, and recommended attributes of that Covenant.\n4. Confirm after completing attribute point allocation.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Selection and Attribute Allocation]|1274}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【How to Join a Covenant】</>\nAfter a Covenant is unlocked, you can enter the joining process via the <Assistant_System>Run Group</> entrance or by finding the corresponding Covenant NPC.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Joining Process: </>\n1. Open the Covenant selection interface.\n2. Select the Covenant you wish to join.\n3. View the abilities, faith, and recommended attributes of that Covenant.\n4. Confirm after completing attribute point allocation.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Selection and Attribute Allocation]|1274}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>已向<HighLight>[%s]</>发起俱乐部宣战——战火将起，胜负未定。"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> has declared a club war against <HighLight>[%s]</>—the flames of war are about to rise, and the outcome is uncertain.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【命运】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得命运，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fate】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After character creation, you will obtain Fate. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>You can choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via the <Assistant_System>Mall</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Lily and Knight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Lily and Knight set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>, or exchanged in the <Assistant_System>Gifts of the Beauty God Shop</> using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lily and Knight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Lily and Knight set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>, or exchanged in the <Assistant_System>Gifts of the Beauty God Shop</> using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards",
    ["94级12人本BOSS困难"] = "Level 94 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Master</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 5"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Master</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 5",
    ["The <Chat_Red> unknown target </> defeated you."] = "The <Chat_Red> unknown target </> defeated you.",
    ["Level 62 Orange Competition Weapon Box"] = "Level 62 Orange Competition Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【自省之心】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得自省之心，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Heart of Introspection】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Heart of Introspection. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>历史明灯</>\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍：</>\n使用历史明灯可在结交人脉界面结交人脉。\n<Assistant_Title2>结交方式：</>\n点击<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-结交人脉</>进入结交界面，而后点击结交1次/5次，即可进行结交。\n<Assistant_Title2>结交消耗：</>\n每一次结交需要消耗一盏历史明灯。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取方式：</>\n1、在结交人脉界面点击结交，历史明灯不足时会弹出快捷购买。\n2、进入<Assistant_System>商城-商城-秘藏陈列</>购买。\n3、进入<Assistant_System>商城-百货-报销商店/冒险商店</>购买。\n4、通过<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-兑换</>打开人脉商店兑换。\n5、通过<Assistant_System>命运的馈赠</>或<Assistant_System>段位天梯</>获得。\n6、通过部分<Assistant_System>跑团</>玩法或<Assistant_System>任务</>获得。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Description:</>\nUse a Historical Beacon to make connections in the Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Connect:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Make Connections</> to enter the connection interface, then click Connect 1x/5x to perform a connection.\n<Assistant_Title2>Connection Cost:</>\nEach connection consumes one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Connect in the Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will appear.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-Shop-Secret Collection</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-General-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Fate's Gift</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through certain <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Connection]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity Allowance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Activity Allowance</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250320}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>Complete activity allowance quests to earn Peer Emblems, Club activity, and Club fund rewards.\nClub activity is the sum of individual activity values of current Club members; reaching corresponding values allows you to claim extra rewards.\nActivity allowance rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Dividends]|1405}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity Allowance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Activity Allowance</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250320}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>Complete activity allowance quests to earn Peer Emblems, Club activity, and Club fund rewards.\nClub activity is the sum of individual activity values of current Club members; reaching corresponding values allows you to claim extra rewards.\nActivity allowance rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Dividends]|1405}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【悬赏值】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>参与罪恶廷根各类事件可获取悬赏值，累计可兑换各种奖励，<Assistant_Red>每周上限1000</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取来源：</>{JumpToUI:【城市暗面】|1302443}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Тинген to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards, <Assistant_Red>with a weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Source: </>{JumpToUI:【Dark Side of the City】|1302443}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Meow Squid】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Meow Squid. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Meow Squid】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Meow Squid. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>历史学者·一</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-成长\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>解锁1个有“原著”标签的关系"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historian I</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Progression-Growth\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Unlock 1 relationship with the \"Original Work\" tag",
    ["1. In the same Club, every player owns the same projections. \n2. Each projection can only be fielded once per competition and cannot be reused."] = "1. In the same Club, every player owns the same projections. \n2. Each projection can only be fielded once per competition and cannot be reused.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Cypress】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Cypress display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cypress】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Cypress display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<P_Heart>(But why are brand-new household items floating in the river!)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But why are brand-new household items floating in the river!)</>",
