    ["66装等冒险装备自选箱"] = "Level 66 Adventure Equipment Selection Box",
    ["1. <Highlight> Rapport and Level: </> Complete weekly Family quests to gain Rapport and increase the Family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Highlight> 2000 points </>. \n 2. <Highlight> Weekly Quests: </> Family members can form teams to participate in corresponding gameplay to earn Rapport. Completing each quest for the first <Highlight> several times </> in the current week grants <Highlight> high-multiplier Rapport </>. After exceeding the high-multiplier count, only standard Rapport bonuses can be obtained. Quests <Highlight> refresh weekly </>."] = "1. <Highlight> Rapport and Level: </> Complete weekly Family quests to gain Rapport and increase the Family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Highlight> 2000 points </>. \n 2. <Highlight> Weekly Quests: </> Family members can form teams to participate in corresponding gameplay to earn Rapport. Completing each quest for the first <Highlight> several times </> in the current week grants <Highlight> high-multiplier Rapport </>. After exceeding the high-multiplier count, only standard Rapport bonuses can be obtained. Quests <Highlight> refresh weekly </>.",
