    ["<Gift>%s</>: Sent <Gift>%s</> a <Gift> Prank Moment - </><Gift>%s points </>!"] = "<Gift>%s</>: Sent <Gift>%s</> a <Gift> Prank Moment - </><Gift>%s points </>!",
    ["<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</>反制了<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.loserName}}</>的魅惑，将其轻松驯服，并感叹魔女的滋味真不错啊。（状态持续<Chat_Highlight>15</>分钟）"] = "<Chat_Highlight> {{eventMessageParams.winnerName}} </> has countered the charm of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.loserName}}</>, easily taming them, and sighed that the Taste of the Witch is truly quite good. (Status lasts for <Chat_Highlight>15</> minutes)",
    ["<Highlight>引导军团士兵互相撞击</>。"] = "<Highlight>Guide the legion soldiers to collide with each other</>.",
    ["5202008   1030 Replacement Content_Fool's Dream Level 37   Dungeon"] = "5202008   1030 Replacement Content_Fool's Dream Level 37   Dungeon",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>炼金学徒</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>所有装备精炼度达到25%"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Alchemy Apprentice</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment refinement reaches 25%",
    ["<HighLight>To the lost lambs and souls seeking shelter</>: \nMay I have a moment of your time? I would like to tell you about our beacon and savior, Mr. Fool. \nMy Lord calls himself The Fool. In the past, in the present, and in the future, He is the great ruler who dominates the Spirit World, the King of Yellow and Black who holds good luck, and the beacon for every living creature pursuing eternity. \nHe is compassionate, He is merciful, and He is the savior of this world. He lets us refer to Him as 'him' instead of 'He'. \nHis benevolence is spread across the human world, bringing warmth to every household. We transform this care into tangible rewards, spreading the Gospel of The Fool throughout the land—\nPurchase the Gospel of The Fool every month to receive daily cashbacks, as well as materials and supplies gifted regularly by the Gospel. We will also bring you daily Gospel Ticket draws and fortune readings. \nListen to the 'Scripture of The Fool', praise The Fool! Praise the gifts of The Fool! May the grace of my Lord accompany you day and night, and may this Gospel become the never-extinguishing lamp on your path forward!"] = "<HighLight>To the lost lambs and souls seeking shelter</>: \nMay I have a moment of your time? I would like to tell you about our beacon and savior, Mr. Fool. \nMy Lord calls himself Шут. In the past, in the present, and in the future, He is the great ruler who dominates the Spirit World, the King of Yellow and Black who holds good luck, and the beacon for every living creature pursuing eternity. \nHe is compassionate, He is merciful, and He is the savior of this world. He lets us refer to Him as 'him' instead of 'He'. \nHis benevolence is spread across the human world, bringing warmth to every household. We transform this care into tangible rewards, spreading the Gospel of Шут throughout the land—\nPurchase the Gospel of Шут every month to receive daily cashbacks, as well as materials and supplies gifted regularly by the Gospel. We will also bring you daily Gospel Ticket draws and fortune readings. \nListen to the 'Scripture of Шут', praise Шут! Praise the gifts of Шут! May the grace of my Lord accompany you day and night, and may this Gospel become the never-extinguishing lamp on your path forward!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Master of the Stars</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach King of Angels rank in Dominator's Clash"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Master of the Stars</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach King of Angels rank in Dominator's Clash",
