    ["66装等竞技烙印装备自选箱"] = "Level 66 Competitive Brand Equipment Selection Box",
    ["<Highlight> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement · Short Cape Set \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost."] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement · Short Cape Set \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【繁花一隅】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得繁花一隅，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【A Corner of Flowers】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain A Corner of Flowers. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Clear Mind】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Clear Mind after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Clear Mind】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Clear Mind after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>I Have an Announcement</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Speak in the World Channel for the first time"] = "<Assistant_Title1>I Have an Announcement</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Speak in the World Channel for the first time",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Level: </>Club activity levels are divided from high to low into \nQuiet Affairs (<720)\nRoutine Operations (720~2400)\nProsperous Affairs (>2400)\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Activity: </>Activity Allowance\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </>The higher the Club activity, the higher the weekly Club dividend reward.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Consumption: </>Daily Club maintenance will deduct 5% of the current activity. If the activity remains at 'Quiet Affairs' for 7 consecutive days, the Council Hall level will be reduced by 1.<Assistant_Red>If the Council Hall level is lower than level 1, the Club will be automatically disbanded.</>\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Dividends]|1405}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Level: </>Club activity levels are divided from high to low into \nQuiet Affairs (<720)\nRoutine Operations (720~2400)\nProsperous Affairs (>2400)\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Activity: </>Activity Allowance\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </>The higher the Club activity, the higher the weekly Club dividend reward.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Consumption: </>Daily Club maintenance will deduct 5% of the current activity. If the activity remains at 'Quiet Affairs' for 7 consecutive days, the Council Hall level will be reduced by 1.<Assistant_Red>If the Council Hall level is lower than level 1, the Club will be automatically disbanded.</>\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Dividends]|1405}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【焕然衣新】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得焕然衣新套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角后自动获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fresh Look】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation outfit.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain the Fresh Look outfit after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Automatically obtained after character creation.",
    ["Insufficient <Highlight>%s</>. Do you want to choose to offset <Highlight>%d</> <Highlight>%s</>?"] = "Insufficient <Highlight>%s</>. Do you want to choose to offset <Highlight>%d</> <Highlight>%s</>?",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【成就】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-收藏-成就</>即可查看成就。\n<Assistant_Title2>使用指南：</>进入成就系统后，左侧列表可以切换成就<Assistant_Red>大类、小类</>。上方输入框可以查找该大类内的<Assistant_Red>成就名称</>。当有可领取的成就奖励时，可以点击右下角<Assistant_Red>“一键领取”</>领取该大类内的所有奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>成就奖励：</>大量<Assistant_Red>绑定金镑</>、<Assistant_Red>称号</>等。\n<Assistant_Title2>查询指南：</>在攻略助手中输入对应成就名，可以查询到具体成就。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Achievement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Description: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Collection - Achievement</> to view achievements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the achievement system, the list on the left can switch between achievement <Assistant_Red>categories and subcategories</>. The input box above can be used to search for <Assistant_Red>achievement names</> within that category. When there are claimable achievement rewards, you can click <Assistant_Red>\"Claim All\"</> in the bottom right corner to claim all rewards within that category. \n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Rewards: </>A large amount of <Assistant_Red>Bound Gold Pound</>, <Assistant_Red>Titles</>, etc. \n<Assistant_Title2>Inquiry Guide: </>Enter the corresponding achievement name in the Strategy Assistant to query specific achievements.",
    ["<Brown> Pre-stored items </> for club members to take; rewards can be obtained after they are claimed."] = "<Brown> Pre-stored items </> for club members to take; rewards can be obtained after they are claimed.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Is she insisting on recording even while enduring extreme pain? Logically, I should persuade her to stop investigating and confiscate the records.)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is she insisting on recording even while enduring extreme pain? Logically, I should persuade her to stop investigating and confiscate the records.)</>",
    ["53 新俱乐部"] = "53 New Club",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·思考】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Thought】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["1. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 2. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item."] = "1. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 2. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
    ["1. You must select one custom content (action, expression, audio, or camera) when uploading. \n2. Currently, only custom content can be uploaded; system actions and preset camera movements cannot be uploaded yet. \n3. After uploading, you can modify or delete it in [Mine - Select Corresponding Work - Edit]."] = "1. You must select one custom content (action, expression, audio, or camera) when uploading. \n2. Currently, only custom content can be uploaded; system actions and preset camera movements cannot be uploaded yet. \n3. After uploading, you can modify or delete it in [Mine - Select Corresponding Work - Edit].",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【第七小组制服】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>主线奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得第七小组制服套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>剧情</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Seventh Group Uniform】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Main Quest Reward Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Seventh Group Uniform set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Plot</>",
    ["1：显示，0：关闭"] = "1: Show, 0: Close.",
