    ["<Assistant_Title1>【衔尾】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得衔尾，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-公会</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ouroboros】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Ouroboros. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Guild</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Relationship</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nThere are special <Assistant_Property1>relationships</> between different Connections. Collect the corresponding {SendAnswer:Connections|550} to unlock/upgrade the relationship and refine your research into history. \nDepending on the level of <Assistant_Property2>Historical Research</>, you can obtain certain attribute bonuses. \nRelationships are divided into two categories: <Assistant_Property1>Co-op Relationship</> and <Assistant_Property1>Historical Relationship</>; both can improve Historical Research. \nFor Co-op Relationships, unlocking them can also provide certain ability enhancements for some Connections. A Connection Skill can only have one Co-op Relationship enhancement effect active at a time. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Wishing]|555}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Relationship</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nThere are special <Assistant_Property1>relationships</> between different Connections. Collect the corresponding {SendAnswer:Connections|550} to unlock/upgrade the relationship and refine your research into history. \nDepending on the level of <Assistant_Property2>Historical Research</>, you can obtain certain attribute bonuses. \nRelationships are divided into two categories: <Assistant_Property1>Co-op Relationship</> and <Assistant_Property1>Historical Relationship</>; both can improve Historical Research. \nFor Co-op Relationships, unlocking them can also provide certain ability enhancements for some Connections. A Connection Skill can only have one Co-op Relationship enhancement effect active at a time. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Wishing]|555}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Morse Small Town】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Morse Small Town set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Morse Small Town】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Morse Small Town set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>鲁恩交际王</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>拥有50个好友"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Loen Socialite</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Have 50 friends",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【死亡咏叹】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>黑荆棘安保公司接到一桩复杂的寻人委托，弗莱希望你加入一起调查。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>61级</>后，在任务栏可接取支线任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务说明：</>在跟随烛光的指引前进步骤中，第一个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(33663,61051)]|33663;61051;145;2;5231160;0}，第二个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(31670,63540)]|31670;63540;453;2;5231160;0}，第三个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(33690,66955)]|33690;66955;343;2;5231160;0}，第四个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(38130,66653)]|38130;66653;400;2;5231160;0}，第五个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(45100,66387)]|45100;66387;380;2;5231160;0}。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励：</>绑定金镑、金纺线、绑定苏勒、认知经验、腰饰【永暗蜡烛】、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Death's Aria】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person case, and Frye hopes you will join the investigation.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 61</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Instructions: </>During the steps of following the candlelight's guidance, the first candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33663,61051)]|33663;61051;145;2;5231160;0}, the second candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(31670,63540)]|31670;63540;453;2;5231160;0}, the third candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33690,66955)]|33690;66955;343;2;5231160;0}, the fourth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(38130,66653)]|38130;66653;400;2;5231160;0}, the fifth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(45100,66387)]|45100;66387;380;2;5231160;0}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards:</>Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Bound Sol, Cognition EXP, Waist Accessory [Everdark Candle], Title",
