    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·坐姿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·坐姿，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Sitting】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Sitting. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
