    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Relationships】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Following: </>Mystery Circle follows NPCs by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>One-Way Following: </>You can see updates posted by players you follow on the Following tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mutual Following: </>When both parties follow each other, they become friends and are set to follow each other's Mystery Circle by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>Unfollow: </>After unfollowing, you will no longer see updates posted by that player on the Following tab. Deleting a friend or blocking them will automatically cancel the mutual following.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Operations: </>You can view your Mystery Circle following list and fan list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302}, and perform quick operations like unfollowing or removing fans.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Relationships】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Following: </>Mystery Circle follows NPCs by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>One-Way Following: </>You can see updates posted by players you follow on the Following tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mutual Following: </>When both parties follow each other, they become friends and are set to follow each other's Mystery Circle by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>Unfollow: </>After unfollowing, you will no longer see updates posted by that player on the Following tab. Deleting a friend or blocking them will automatically cancel the mutual following.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Operations: </>You can view your Mystery Circle following list and fan list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302}, and perform quick operations like unfollowing or removing fans.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Confession Time!】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Listening to gossip is a bit shameful, but telling only half of it is even more shameful!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>59</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(936,990)]|-6317;-903;-1611;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red>Dan</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Thread, Bound Gold Pound, Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Title"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Confession Time!】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Listening to gossip is a bit shameful, but telling only half of it is even more shameful!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>59</>, head to {Location:[Тинген(936,990)]|-6317;-903;-1611;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red>Dan</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Thread, Bound Gold Pound, Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Title",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>战旗织锦・常胜肩甲\n常胜的勇士出征，为其授勋的是下一场胜利。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Battle Flag Brocade & Ever-Victorious Pauldrons\nThe ever-victorious warrior sets out, decorated for the next victory.",
    ["1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Newbie Guide voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar."] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Newbie Guide voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Chaser of Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow. Is he resting, or does he need help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountain Range(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and speak with the <Assistant_Red>Old Gentleman</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chaser of Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow. Is he resting, or does he need help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountain Range(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and speak with the <Assistant_Red>Old Gentleman</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["Level 64 Orange Competition Weapon Box"] = "Level 64 Orange Competition Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【枪械获取】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开启规则：</>在<Assistant_System>剧情任务</>和<Assistant_System>罪恶廷根</>的<Assistant_Property1>部分特定关卡</>中，枪械功能会随关卡进程激活。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[枪械玩法简介]|898}，{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Firearm Acquisition】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Тинген</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific stages</>, firearm functions will be activated as the stage progresses.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Firearm Gameplay Introduction]|898}, {SendAnswer:[Aiming Shot]|903}",
    ["<Chat_Red> Disband Group </>"] = "<Chat_Red> Disband Group </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹息）</>我不愿意回到那个状态。所以，我选择了现在这样，即使还要重复死而复生和失忆，但至少我保有过去和人性。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I don't want to return to that state. So, I chose to be like this now. Even if I have to repeat resurrection and amnesia, at least I retain my past and my humanity.",
    ["46级6人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 46 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【花镜绮宴】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得花镜绮宴套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Floral Mirror Banquet】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Floral Mirror Banquet outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
