    ["64装等冒险装备自选箱"] = "Level 64 Adventure Equipment Selection Box",
    ["1. Merger requests cannot be initiated or accepted during Club activities. When accepting a merger request, the total number of members of both Clubs must not exceed the maximum member limit of the receiving Club. If it exceeds the limit, the merger will fail; you must remove members before merging."] = "1. Merger requests cannot be initiated or accepted during Club activities. When accepting a merger request, the total number of members of both Clubs must not exceed the maximum member limit of the receiving Club. If it exceeds the limit, the merger will fail; you must remove members before merging.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Devout Echo】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Gameplay Reward Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Devout Echo set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Guild</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Devout Echo】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Gameplay Reward Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Devout Echo set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Guild</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Explanation: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Tingen to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards. <Assistant_Red>Weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Sources: </>{JumpToUI:【Dark Side of the City】|1302443}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Explanation: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Тинген to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards. <Assistant_Red>Weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Sources: </>{JumpToUI:【Dark Side of the City】|1302443}",
    ["56级6人本Boss普通"] = "Level 56 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</>接受了我方俱乐部发起的宣战，决斗将在<M_Orange>[明天%s]</>开启。战火已至，胜负即将揭晓——霍纳奇斯山脉将见证这场决斗的结局。为了共同的荣耀，全员就位。\n可点击<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【俱乐部宣战玩法攻略】</>查看玩法攻略！"] = "<M_Orange> [%s]</> has accepted the declaration of war initiated by our club. The duel will begin on <M_Orange>[Tomorrow%s]</>. The flames of war have arrived, and the outcome is about to be revealed—the Hornacis Mountain Range will witness the end of this duel. For our shared glory, all members, take your positions. \nYou can click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【Club Declaration of War Gameplay Guide】</> to view the gameplay guide!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Water Lily Town welcomes you.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town (134, -14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red>read the notes</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Water Lily Town welcomes you.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town (134, -14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red>read the notes</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["Level 62 Competitive Brand Equipment Selection Box"] = "Level 62 Competitive Brand Equipment Selection Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Aria and Recitative】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Aria and Recitative set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Aria and Recitative】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Aria and Recitative set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Positions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>President: </>The President is the leader of the Club, holding the highest authority and representing the Club in handling internal management and diplomatic rights.\n<Assistant_Title2>Vice President: </>The Vice President is an important position assisting the President, holding high authority second only to the President, and can exercise some internal management and diplomatic rights on behalf of the President, appointed by the President.\n<Assistant_Title2>Director: </>Directors are management positions in the Club with a certain degree of management authority, appointed by the President, up to 3 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Group Leader: </>Group Leaders are the core management for Club activities, responsible for the appointment and dismissal of members within the group, and organizing activities like league team formation. Each Club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 people; members within a group automatically gain qualification for league participation.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Star: </>Club Stars are the face of the Club, responsible for recruiting and entertaining new members, appointed by the President, up to 2 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Official Member: </>Official Members are the backbone of the Club and can participate in Club activities.<Assistant_Red>Some activities only support Official Members participating</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Reserve Member: </>Reserve Members are the reserve force of the Club and cannot participate in some Club activities. Keep working hard, stay active, and contact management to join as an Official Member.\n<Assistant_Title2>Position Adjustment: </>Club members can hold management positions, group positions, and Club Star positions simultaneously; management positions include President, Vice President, and Director.\n<Assistant_Title2>Permission Adjustment: </>The Club President can adjust the permission allocation for different positions in the permission adjustment interface.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部建筑和资金]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Positions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>President: </>The President is the leader of the Club, holding the highest authority and representing the Club in handling internal management and diplomatic rights.\n<Assistant_Title2>Vice President: </>The Vice President is an important position assisting the President, holding high authority second only to the President, and can exercise some internal management and diplomatic rights on behalf of the President, appointed by the President.\n<Assistant_Title2>Director: </>Directors are management positions in the Club with a certain degree of management authority, appointed by the President, up to 3 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Group Leader: </>Group Leaders are the core management for Club activities, responsible for the appointment and dismissal of members within the group, and organizing activities like league team formation. Each Club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 people; members within a group automatically gain qualification for league participation.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Star: </>Club Stars are the face of the Club, responsible for recruiting and entertaining new members, appointed by the President, up to 2 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Official Member: </>Official Members are the backbone of the Club and can participate in Club activities.<Assistant_Red>Some activities only support Official Members participating</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Reserve Member: </>Reserve Members are the reserve force of the Club and cannot participate in some Club activities. Keep working hard, stay active, and contact management to join as an Official Member.\n<Assistant_Title2>Position Adjustment: </>Club members can hold management positions, group positions, and Club Star positions simultaneously; management positions include President, Vice President, and Director.\n<Assistant_Title2>Permission Adjustment: </>The Club President can adjust the permission allocation for different positions in the permission adjustment interface.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["<M_Default>Dear Chamber of Commerce member: </>\nThe Railway Tycoon season has ended. Unclaimed season quest and regular quest rewards have been sent via email. Please check them in time."] = "<M_Default>Dear Chamber of Commerce member: </>\nThe Railway Tycoon season has ended. Unclaimed season quest and regular quest rewards have been sent via email. Please check them in time.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【午夜焦点】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得午夜焦点，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Midnight Focus] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Pool accessory \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Midnight Focus; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: Exchange using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Relationships】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Following: </>Mystery Circle follows NPCs by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>One-Way Following: </>You can see updates posted by players you follow on the Following tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mutual Following: </>When both parties follow each other, they become friends and are set to follow each other's Mystery Circle by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>Unfollow: </>After unfollowing, you will no longer see updates posted by that player on the Following tab. Deleting a friend or blocking them will automatically cancel the mutual following.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Operations: </>You can view your Mystery Circle following list and fan list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302302}, and perform quick operations like unfollowing or removing fans.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-动态]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-页签]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Relationships】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Following: </>Mystery Circle follows NPCs by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>One-Way Following: </>You can see updates posted by players you follow on the Following tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mutual Following: </>When both parties follow each other, they become friends and are set to follow each other's Mystery Circle by default.\n<Assistant_Title2>Unfollow: </>After unfollowing, you will no longer see updates posted by that player on the Following tab. Deleting a friend or blocking them will automatically cancel the mutual following.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Operations: </>You can view your Mystery Circle following list and fan list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302}, and perform quick operations like unfollowing or removing fans.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}",
    ["0: \"Default to the line between the first offset point and the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\", 3: \"Bullet orientation depends only on Action configuration\", 4: \"Bullet starting orientation is input_dir\"."] = "0: \"Default to the line between the first offset point and the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\", 3: \"Bullet orientation depends only on Action configuration\", 4: \"Bullet starting orientation is input_dir\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Lost Glory】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Lost Glory. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Garden</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lost Glory】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Lost Glory. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Garden</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【语音房-普通语音房】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>10级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>聊天面板 - 语音房</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>人数上限：</>语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n<Assistant_Title2>默认发言模式：</>普通语音房间默认是自由发言模式，点击输入框旁边的开麦按钮即可自动开麦。若当前语音房间模式为房主设置发言权限模式或房主设置发言顺序模式，则需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n<Assistant_Title2>房主操作：</>房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言模式，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息和类型，进行转让房主操作。\n<Assistant_Title2>其他操作：</>在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-常驻房间]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Normal Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level<Assistant_Red> 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity: </>A voice room can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speaking Mode: </>Normal voice rooms default to free-speaking mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the current voice room mode is set to host-controlled speaking permissions or speaking order, you must click the microphone button to request to speak, and you can unmute after the host approves.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speaking mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and also adjust room information and types or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share voice room links or distribute voice room gifts in the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Gameplay Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<P_Heart> (I have to say, a life like this is still quite blissful...) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (I have to say, a life like this is still quite blissful...) </>",
    ["Level 45 Footwear Affix"] = "Level 45 Footwear Affix",
    ["68装等竞技装备自选箱"] = "Level 68 Competitive Equipment Selection Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Competition Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Competition Events include modes such as Resource Contention and Racing. Compete in the same arena with other players and receive rewards based on your final ranking. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event. \n2. Opens at fixed times daily. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. It is recommended to pay attention to the opening times in advance. \n2. Competition challenges have ranking rewards; the higher your rank, the more generous the rewards."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Competition Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Competition Events include modes such as Resource Contention and Racing. Compete in the same arena with other players and receive rewards based on your final ranking. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event. \n2. Opens at fixed times daily. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. It is recommended to pay attention to the opening times in advance. \n2. Competition challenges have ranking rewards; the higher your rank, the more generous the rewards.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>回绝了<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战，不战而退，选择认输。"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> rejected the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, retreating without a fight and choosing to concede.",
