    ["70级12人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 70 12-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时代的传奇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得时代的传奇，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌购买"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Legend of the Era] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Legend of the Era; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<M_Default>尊敬的教团成员：</>\n\n       原初的恩赐已从你身上消失。\n       由于你上周缺席了两次魅惑邀约，这让你的魅力在镜中世界里逐渐黯淡。根据教团守则，自下周起，你的魅力将暂时蒙尘（魅力属性-5），直至你重新参与两次魅惑邀约并获得胜利，方可恢复魔女的青睐。\n       莫要让镜中那个完美的自己彻底消失。"] = "<M_Default>Respected member of the Church: </>\n\n The gift of the Primordial has disappeared from you. \n Because you missed two Charm Invitations last week, your charm has gradually dimmed in the Mirror World. According to the Church's code, starting next week, your charm will be temporarily tarnished (Charm attribute -5) until you participate in two Charm Invitations again and achieve victory, only then can you restore the favor of the Witch. \n Do not let that perfect self in the mirror disappear completely.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>驼色软呢・外出便服\n晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<HighLight_L>[%s]</>已向本俱乐部发起宣战。会长可<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【点击前往俱乐部宣战】</>应战或认输——若<HighLight_L>1小时内未响应</>，将视为自动认输，并扣除相应资金。"] = "<HighLight_L>[%s]</> has declared war on this Club. The President can <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【Click to go to Club War】</> accept the challenge or concede—if there is no response within <HighLight_L> 1 hour </>, it will be treated as an automatic concession, and the corresponding funds will be deducted.",
    ["1. Cancel collision after monster dies."] = "1. Cancel collision after monster dies.",
    ["45品武器箱"] = "Level 45 Weapon Box",
    ["5件随机装备 + 随机5费棋子 + 30金币"] = "5 random Equipment + Random 5-cost piece + 30 Gold Coins",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Witch and Beast</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Life in the Era\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the Life in the Era quest \"Witch and Beast\"."] = "<Assistant_Title1>Witch and Beast</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Life in the Era\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the Life in the Era quest \"Witch and Beast\".",
    ["5230173   战斗引导测试关卡   位面"] = "5230173 Combat Tutorial Test Level Plane",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>神话之巅</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>俱乐部在四方联赛中取得神话组第一名成绩"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Peak of Myth</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Club achieves first place in the Mythical Group of the Four-Way League",
    ["<Chat_Highlight>%s</>势力占领了<Chat_Highlight>%s</>，最高据点倍率达到了%s，势不可挡！"] = "The <Chat_Highlight>%s</> faction has occupied <Chat_Highlight>%s</>, and the highest stronghold multiplier has reached %s. Unstoppable!",
    ["<ChatTag_Server>[跨服]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Server>[Cross-Server]</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>那是自然！以感官解构文字，正是我创造的一种全新的话语体系，别看这出戏剧叫做《夏夜之梦》，其实隐喻的是完全相反的内容！"] = "<P_Heart> (Excitedly) </> That's natural! Deconstructing text through the senses is a brand-new discourse system I created. Don't look at this play called 'A Midsummer Night's Dream'; it actually metaphors the exact opposite content!",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</>已向你的俱乐部发起宣战，静候回应。 请在<M_Orange>1小时内</>前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【俱乐部宣战】</>作出裁决——逾期未应，将视为自动认输，<M_Orange>并扣除相应俱乐部资金</>。\n可点击<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【俱乐部宣战玩法攻略】</>查看玩法攻略！"] = "<M_Orange> [%s] </> has declared war on your Club. We await your response. Please proceed to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\"> [Club War] </> within <M_Orange> 1 hour </> to make a judgment—failure to respond within the time limit will be considered an automatic forfeiture, <M_Orange> and the corresponding Club funds will be deducted </>. \n You can click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\"> [Club War Strategy Guide] </> to view the guide!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>特别时刻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>与任意好友的好友度达到520"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Special Moment</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach 520 friendship points with any friend",
    ["3级-厚积"] = "Level 3 - Accumulated",
    ["5200014   关卡目标功能测试   副本"] = "5200014 Level Objective Function Test Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Maple】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Maple display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Maple】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Maple display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Utopia Theater】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Dungeon Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Solo/Duo Dungeon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Features: </>\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragments: </>Players have a chance to obtain residual memories dropped by defeated marionettes that have suffered a loss of control. You can choose various memory fragments to strengthen your abilities, constantly growing and changing to face stronger challenges on each floor.\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragment Gifting: </>In duo mode, players can use the Memory Retrace function in the memory fragment interface to convert their own memory fragments into a retraceable form that teammates can pick up, allowing you to share fragments and grow together.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Normal Difficulty: </>Level 30\n    <Assistant_Property1>Hard Difficulty: </>Level 30, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n    <Assistant_Property1>Nightmare Difficulty: </>Level 61, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - </>{JumpToUI:[Utopia Theater]|1302351}to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Party Size: </>Enter solo or as a duo.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Random Marionette Fragment Box, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>First-Clear Rewards for Each Difficulty: </>Bound Pounds, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n    <Assistant_Property1>Weekly Progress Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n<Assistant_Red>Each difficulty provides 1 first-clear reward; you can earn progress rewards up to a limit of 1200 Stage Echoes per week.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Bonus: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Players who form a Covenant relationship</>and enter duo mode will receive extra resurrection counts and extra Marionette Essence (used for purchasing important items within the dungeon)."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Utopia Theater】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Dungeon Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Solo/Duo Dungeon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Features: </>\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragments: </>Players have a chance to obtain residual memories dropped by defeated Марионеткаs that have suffered a loss of control. You can choose various memory fragments to strengthen your abilities, constantly growing and changing to face stronger challenges on each floor.\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragment Gifting: </>In duo mode, players can use the Memory Retrace function in the memory fragment interface to convert their own memory fragments into a retraceable form that teammates can pick up, allowing you to share fragments and grow together.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Normal Difficulty: </>Level 30\n    <Assistant_Property1>Hard Difficulty: </>Level 30, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n    <Assistant_Property1>Кошмар Difficulty: </>Level 61, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - </>{JumpToUI:[Utopia Theater]|1302351}to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Party Size: </>Enter solo or as a duo.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Random Марионетка Fragment Box, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>First-Clear Rewards for Each Difficulty: </>Bound Pounds, Purple/Gold Random Марионетка Fragment Box\n    <Assistant_Property1>Weekly Progress Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Purple/Gold Random Марионетка Fragment Box\n<Assistant_Red>Each difficulty provides 1 first-clear reward; you can earn progress rewards up to a limit of 1200 Stage Echoes per week.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Bonus: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Players who form a Covenant relationship</>and enter duo mode will receive extra resurrection counts and extra Марионетка Essence (used for purchasing important items within the dungeon).",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【家的担当】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>人脉玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得家的担当套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-往事陈列馆</>使用记忆珍匣兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family Responsibility】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Reward outfit from social gameplay.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Family Responsibility outfit. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Memory Caskets in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>.",
    ["<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, find and defeat the <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Guardians </> wandering the map.|Defeat Guardians: <Highlight>%d</>/2"] = "<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, find and defeat the <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Guardians </> wandering the map.|Defeat Guardians: <Highlight>%d</>/2",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【好友】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>2级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>系统介绍：</>在好友界面，可以进行查找、添加、管理好友、查看好友个人信息和在线状态，与好友私聊和赠礼等操作。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友添加：</><Assistant_System>好友-添加</>页签下，输入角色昵称或角色数字ID可以搜索本服和跨服好友。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友申请：</><Assistant_System>好友-申请</>页签下，可以操作好友申请信息。 \n<Assistant_Title2>好友推荐：</><Assistant_System>好友-添加</>页签下，系统自动推荐本服好友。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友弹条设置：</><Assistant_System>设置-社交-信息设置</>中，可以操作是否显示好友申请弹条。\n<Assistant_Title3>基础功能细节规则：</>{SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}，{SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}，{SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}，{SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}，{SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the Friends interface, you can search for, add, and manage friends, view their personal information and online status, send private messages, and give gifts.\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Add</> tab, enter a character nickname or numeric ID to search for friends on the current server or cross-server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Requests: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request notifications. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Add</> tab, the system will automatically recommend friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Notification Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings-Social-Message Settings</>, you can toggle whether to display friend request notifications.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends-Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Friendship Level]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["<P_Heart> (Shy) </> This {{handsome gentleman|elegant lady}}, please forgive me, I... haven't thought about this question yet."] = "<P_Heart> (Shy) </> This {{handsome gentleman|elegant lady}}, please forgive me, I... haven't thought about this question yet.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The Hand Behind the Stocks】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There seems to be a sound under the tree...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Tingen(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the man stuck in the tree </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Hand Behind the Stocks】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There seems to be a sound under the tree...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Тинген(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the man stuck in the tree </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
