    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Thought】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Thought】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["5202006   1030替代内容_愚者之梦20级   副本"] = "5202006   1030 Replacement Content_Fool's Dream Level 20   Dungeon",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Judgment of the Star Chart] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Judgment of the Star Chart set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Judgment of the Star Chart] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Judgment of the Star Chart set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level",
    ["3月4日：翻完了前三十六任的全部维护日志，没有发现任何异常。但那一夜它确实出了问题。答案不在日志里。那答案在哪里？\n\n3月11日：典籍里关于知识皇冠的记载只有只言片语——为什么这么少？是被删掉了吗？谁删的？必须找到更原始的文本。\n\n3月19日：十一本。还差一本。\n\n3月26日：不能停。停下来就会，就会？不能停。\n\n4月2日：它就在某个地方。找到它找到它找到它——\n\n4月3日：一定要找到它。\n\n（后面还有很多页，但字迹越来越潦草，到最后已经很难辨认。）"] = "March 4th: Finished reading all maintenance logs of the previous thirty-six predecessors, found nothing unusual. But that night, it did malfunction. The answer is not in the logs. Where is the answer? \n \n March 11th: Records about the Knowledge Radiance in the classics are only fragments—why so few? Was it deleted? Who deleted it? Must find more original texts. \n \n March 19th: Eleven books. Still missing one. \n \n March 26th: Cannot stop. If I stop, then, then? Cannot stop. \n \n April 2nd: It is somewhere. Find it, find it, find it— \n \n April 3rd: Must find it. \n \n (There are many pages left, but the handwriting becomes increasingly sloppy, and by the end, it is hard to decipher.)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【New Store Opening】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>A new store has opened on the street, but neither the owner nor the customers look very happy...\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>Store Owner</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【New Store Opening】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>A new store has opened on the street, but neither the owner nor the customers look very happy...\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Тинген(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>Store Owner</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["1 Select B"] = "1 Select B",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【告解时间到！】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>听八卦有些可耻，但讲八卦只讲一半更可耻！\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>59级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(936,990)]|-6317;-903;-1611;2;5200002;0}与<Assistant_Red>丹</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：金纺线、绑定金镑、认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Confession Time!】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Listening to gossip is shameful, but telling only half of it is even more shameful!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>59</>, go to {Location:[Тинген(936,990)]|-6317;-903;-1611;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red>Dan</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Thread, Bound Gold Pounds, Cognition EXP, Bound Soule.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【社交赠礼】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</>在<Assistant_System>商场 - 形象铭刻 - 社交人气</>中可以消耗绑定金镑和非绑金镑，购买社交礼物，赠送给好友或其他玩家。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友赠礼：</>在<Assistant_System>好友私聊 - 右下角赠礼</>可以赠送好友度礼物，赠送后会增加双方好友度。\n<Assistant_Title2>个人主页赠礼：</>在<Assistant_System>个人主页 - 右下角赠礼</>可以赠送主页礼物，赠送后会增加对方的个人主页名望值。若双方是好友关系，则会额外增加好友度。\n<Assistant_Title2>语音房赠礼：</>在<Assistant_System>语音房 - 点击玩家头像 - 语音房赠礼</>可以赠送语音房礼物，赠送后会增加当前语音房间热度和对方的个人主页名望值。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social Gifts】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </>In <Assistant_System>Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity</>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to give to friends or other players.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Friend Chat - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send friendship gifts, which will increase the friendship level between both parties.\n<Assistant_Title2>Personal Homepage Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send homepage gifts, which will increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If both parties are friends, it will additionally increase the friendship level.\n<Assistant_Title2>Voice Room Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gift</>, you can send voice room gifts, which will increase the current voice room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friend-Friendship]|1410}",
    ["02_End Audio Performance Analysis"] = "02_End Audio Performance Analysis",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Bottle of Enslavement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Battle Pass reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Bottle of Enslavement. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via Battle Pass"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bottle of Enslavement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Battle Pass reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Bottle of Enslavement. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via Battle Pass",
