    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Small Round Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Small Round Glasses. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Small Round Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Small Round Glasses. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Standard Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Standard voice rooms default to Free Speech Mode; click the unmute button next to the input box to unmute automatically. If the current room is set to Host-Set Speech Permissions or Host-Set Speech Order, you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information and type or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-常驻房间]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Standard Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Standard voice rooms default to Free Speech Mode; click the unmute button next to the input box to unmute automatically. If the current room is set to Host-Set Speech Permissions or Host-Set Speech Order, you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information and type or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["60 Item Level Orange Equipment Box"] = "60 Item Level Orange Equipment Box",
    ["<Highlight_L> War Bulletin </>: Our club member <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has successfully defeated <HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> of the <Reminder_Red>[%s]</> club at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[Hornacis Mountain Range (%d, %d) Sub-channel %s]</> and gained %s war points! Click to pursue!"] = "<Highlight_L> War Bulletin </>: Our club member <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has successfully defeated <HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> of the <Reminder_Red>[%s]</> club at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[Hornacis Mountain Range (%d, %d) Sub-channel %s]</> and gained %s war points! Click to pursue!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·遮阳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·遮阳，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Shade Eyes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Shade Eyes. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 有声读书语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Audio Reading voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The One Chasing the Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow, not sure if he is resting or needs help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[霍纳奇斯山脉(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the old gentleman </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The One Chasing the Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow, not sure if he is resting or needs help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountains(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the old gentleman </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["40级6人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 40 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Courage to Confess】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>On a bench at the street corner, a young man's shoulders are trembling slightly. He has a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he can't bring himself to reach out.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\", advance to Sequence 9, head to {Location:[Tingen(982,778)]|-1990;-22115;-1300;2;5200002;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Fraser </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Courage to Confess】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>On a bench at the street corner, a young man's shoulders are trembling slightly. He has a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he can't bring himself to reach out.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\", advance to Последовательность 9, head to {Location:[Тинген(982,778)]|-1990;-22115;-1300;2;5200002;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Fraser </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人脉许愿</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n在<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-结交人脉</>界面的常驻结交活动中，点击视频左下方许愿按钮可进入许愿界面。\n<Assistant_Property2>许愿</>指定人脉后，可提升结交时获得对应人脉的概率。\n<Assistant_Title2>许愿规则：</>\n可许愿的人脉为可结交的传说人脉。\n许愿后，获得传说人脉时，获取许愿目标的概率提高到<Assistant_Property1>80%</>。如果获得的传说人脉不是许愿目标，那下次获得的传说人脉必定为许愿目标。\n常驻结交中，<Assistant_Property1>每周</>可以生效<Assistant_Property1>2次</>许愿效果，周一重置。每当结交人脉<Assistant_Property1>110次</>，可额外获得一次许愿次数。该次数不会被重置，且消耗优先级低于每周重置的次数。\n许愿一位人脉后，若误操作选错许愿目标，可点击取消许愿按钮取消许愿。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wishing</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </>\nIn the permanent connection event in the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Make Connections</> interface, click the wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the wishing interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>Wishing </> for a specific connection can increase the probability of obtaining that connection when making connections. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wishing Rules: </>\nConnections that can be wished for are legendary connections that can be made. \nAfter wishing, when you obtain a legendary connection, the probability of getting the wished target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the legendary connection obtained is not the wished target, the next legendary connection obtained is guaranteed to be the wished target. \nIn permanent connections, you can have <Assistant_Property1>2</> wish effects take effect <Assistant_Property1>per week</>, resetting on Monday. Every time you make <Assistant_Property1>110</> connections, you can obtain one additional wish attempt. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset attempts. \nAfter wishing for a connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the cancel wish button to cancel the wish. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationships]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Stepping into the Kingdom of God</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Top 16 honorary title after participating in the Peak of the Gods gameplay"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Stepping into the Kingdom of God</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Top 16 honorary title after participating in the Peak of the Gods gameplay",
    ["<Italic>—You begin to hear some unspeakable whispers; they are like fragments of speech leaking from the depths of your consciousness, directionless and meaningless, yet impossible to ignore. Whenever you try to move quickly, those sounds suddenly amplify, and the world briefly rotates, tilts, and resets in your eyes. But you dare not be certain that the next time, and the time after that, the world will reset as usual.</>"] = "<Italic>—You begin to hear some unspeakable whispers; they are like fragments of speech leaking from the depths of your consciousness, directionless and meaningless, yet impossible to ignore. Whenever you try to move quickly, those sounds suddenly amplify, and the world briefly rotates, tilts, and resets in your eyes. But you dare not be certain that the next time, and the time after that, the world will reset as usual.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Appearance Hiding in Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>In Story Mode, you can hide certain large appearances: wings, body rings, and shoulder ornaments. You can set this to enable or disable in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Display Large Appearances in Story Mode</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Story Mode]|1323}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Appearance Hiding in Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>In Story Mode, you can hide certain large appearances: wings, body rings, and shoulder ornaments. You can set this to enable or disable in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Display Large Appearances in Story Mode</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Story Mode]|1323}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>强化入门</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>所有装备强化1级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Beginner</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 1",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蔷薇之缚】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蔷薇之缚，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Rose Binding】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Rose Binding. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the Friends interface, you can search for, add, and manage friends, view their personal information and online status, send private messages, and give gifts.\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Add</> tab, enter a character nickname or numeric ID to search for friends on the current server or cross-server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Requests: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request notifications. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Add</> tab, the system will automatically recommend friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Notification Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings-Social-Message Settings</>, you can toggle whether to display friend request notifications.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends-Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Friendship Level]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Delete/Block]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the Friends interface, you can search for, add, and manage friends, view their personal information and online status, send private messages, and give gifts.\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Add</> tab, enter a character nickname or numeric ID to search for friends on the current server or cross-server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Requests: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request notifications. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends-Add</> tab, the system will automatically recommend friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Notification Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings-Social-Message Settings</>, you can toggle whether to display friend request notifications.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends-Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Friendship Level]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Delete/Block]|1412}",
