    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Bard】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction:</>When exploring various places, you will occasionally hear whispers with a clear sense of direction echoing in your ears. Follow the sound to gradually approach its source, and you will find the Bard.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Find the Bard</>\nYou can go to the Bard in any of the following ways:\n<Assistant_Property2>TRPG Entrance:</>Open the menu to enter 【TRPG】, join any sect, select 【Bard】 in the 【Order World】, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entrance:</>Open the map, switch to the 【Exploration】 tab, click the Bard icon on the map to track and automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Listen to the Melody</>\nAfter arriving at the target location, follow the sound waves at your feet to find the source of the sound, talk to the Bard, and choose the corresponding interaction method.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Complete the Challenge</>\nFind the melody: Turn on <Assistant_System>spirit vision</>, find the three musical notes scattered nearby, and after collecting them, you can open the reward chest.\nHum the melody or analyze the melody: Complete the throwing check according to the prompts; if the check is successful, you can complete the challenge and receive rewards."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bard】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction:</>When exploring various places, you will occasionally hear whispers with a clear sense of direction echoing in your ears. Follow the sound to gradually approach its source, and you will find the Bard.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Find the Bard</>\nYou can go to the Bard in any of the following ways:\n<Assistant_Property2>TRPG Entrance:</>Open the menu to enter 【TRPG】, join any sect, select 【Bard】 in the 【Order World】, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entrance:</>Open the map, switch to the 【Exploration】 tab, click the Bard icon on the map to track and automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Listen to the Melody</>\nAfter arriving at the target location, follow the sound waves at your feet to find the source of the sound, talk to the Bard, and choose the corresponding interaction method.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Complete the Challenge</>\nFind the melody: Turn on <Assistant_System>spirit vision</>, find the three musical notes scattered nearby, and after collecting them, you can open the reward chest.\nHum the melody or analyze the melody: Complete the throwing check according to the prompts; if the check is successful, you can complete the challenge and receive rewards.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Golden Legend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Equip 8 items of Gold quality or higher"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Golden Legend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Equip 8 items of Gold quality or higher",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [today %s]!"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [today %s]!",
    ["<Highlight>重点文本</>一般文本一般文本一般文本"] = "<Highlight>Key Text</> Normal text normal text normal text.",
    ["System will automatically assign and confirm after <Highlight>05:23:38</>"] = "System will automatically assign and confirm after <Highlight>05:23:38</>",
    ["<DecH> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost."] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost.",
    ["8! I choose 8!"] = "8! I choose 8!",
    ["1、每周每个副本会获得一定的<Highlight>讨伐奖励次数</>，玩家在击杀副本首领后，会增加<Highlight>讨伐奖励进度</>\n2、讨伐奖励进度<Highlight>积累满</>后，可领取一件当前副本<Highlight>未拥有的烙印装备或者外观奖励</>\n3、领取后，对应的进度将会扣除领奖所需的次数\n4、烙印装备的讨伐奖励次数增加规则：共次数的副本，共享讨伐奖励次数，每周每个首领增加1次\n5、外观的讨伐奖励次数增加规则：每个副本，每周每个首领增加2次，普通和困难难度共享次数"] = "1. Each dungeon will receive a certain number of <Highlight>Crusade Reward Counts</> every week. Players will increase their <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> after killing the dungeon boss. \n2. After the <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> is fully accumulated, you can claim a piece of <Highlight>unowned Imprint Equipment or cosmetic reward</> from the current dungeon. \n3. After claiming, the corresponding progress will deduct the number of counts required for claiming the reward. \n4. Imprint Equipment Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Dungeons with shared counts share Crusade Reward Counts, and each boss adds 1 count per week. \n5. Cosmetic Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Each dungeon adds 2 counts per boss per week, and Normal and Hard difficulties share counts.",
    ["5200055 QA Combat Test Template Level Open World"] = "5200055 QA Combat Test Template Level Open World",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Tingen to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards, <Assistant_Red>with a weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Source: </>{JumpToUI:【Dark Side of the City】|1302443}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Тинген to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards, <Assistant_Red>with a weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Source: </>{JumpToUI:【Dark Side of the City】|1302443}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Organization Core</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Group Play-Organization\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Any Organization reaches Level 10"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Organization Core</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Group Play-Organization\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Any Organization reaches Level 10",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mail】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Mail Instructions: </>\n1. Click the <Assistant_System>Social - Mail</> icon in the bottom left of the main interface, or the <Assistant_System>Menu - Mail</> sidebar in the top right to open your mailbox.\n2. Click the star icon to bookmark mail; bookmarked mail goes to the Favorites folder. Mail in Favorites is permanent and can be viewed unless manually cleared (attachments cannot be bookmarked).\n3. Mail can only be sent by the system or a Club; for communication with friends, use <Assistant_System>Chat</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Attachment Instructions: </>\n1. The mailbox has a capacity limit; mail exceeding this limit will be <Assistant_Red>automatically cleared</>. Please claim your mail promptly.\n2. Some mail has an <Assistant_Red>expiration date</>; after this time, it will <Assistant_Red>be impossible to claim</>. Please check your mail promptly.\n3. Once deleted, mail <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</> (bookmarked mail can still be viewed in the Favorites folder after deletion).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Mass Mail]|501}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mail】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Mail Instructions: </>\n1. Click the <Assistant_System>Social - Mail</> icon in the bottom left of the main interface, or the <Assistant_System>Menu - Mail</> sidebar in the top right to open your mailbox.\n2. Click the star icon to bookmark mail; bookmarked mail goes to the Favorites folder. Mail in Favorites is permanent and can be viewed unless manually cleared (attachments cannot be bookmarked).\n3. Mail can only be sent by the system or a Club; for communication with friends, use <Assistant_System>Chat</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Attachment Instructions: </>\n1. The mailbox has a capacity limit; mail exceeding this limit will be <Assistant_Red>automatically cleared</>. Please claim your mail promptly.\n2. Some mail has an <Assistant_Red>expiration date</>; after this time, it will <Assistant_Red>be impossible to claim</>. Please check your mail promptly.\n3. Once deleted, mail <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</> (bookmarked mail can still be viewed in the Favorites folder after deletion).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Mass Mail]|501}",
    ["<EquipHighLight>可通过恩赐方案</>无损切换<EquipHighLight>重塑词条</>"] = "<EquipHighLight>Can be switched without loss via Gift Scheme </> and reshaped entries <EquipHighLight></>",
    ["<Chat_Highlight>%s</>势力攻占了<Chat_Highlight>%s</>"] = "The <Chat_Highlight>%s</> faction has captured <Chat_Highlight>%s</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Coven/TRPG】</>\n<Assistant_System>Coven </> is the core growth and faction system in the TRPG system. After joining a Coven, you can obtain an independent <Assistant_Property1>Coven Level</>, <Assistant_Property1>Coven Attributes</>, and exclusive gameplay for that Coven. \n\n<Assistant_Title2>Main Content: </>\n1. Choose a Coven and complete attribute configuration. \n2. Obtain Coven Action Points and various rewards through Coven gameplay. \n3. Increase Coven Level to unlock rewards like actions, appearances, and titles. \n4. Use attributes like Charisma, Intuition, Knowledge, and Might for checks during exploration and Coven gameplay. \n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[How to Join a Coven]|1273}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Attribute Explanation]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Coven/TRPG】</>\n<Assistant_System>Coven </> is the core growth and faction system in the TRPG system. After joining a Coven, you can obtain an independent <Assistant_Property1>Coven Level</>, <Assistant_Property1>Coven Attributes</>, and exclusive gameplay for that Coven. \n\n<Assistant_Title2>Main Content: </>\n1. Choose a Coven and complete attribute configuration. \n2. Obtain Coven Action Points and various rewards through Coven gameplay. \n3. Increase Coven Level to unlock rewards like actions, appearances, and titles. \n4. Use attributes like Charisma, Intuition, Knowledge, and Might for checks during exploration and Coven gameplay. \n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[How to Join a Coven]|1273}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Attribute Explanation]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Confidence】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Confidence】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["5230408   压力板测试   文案副本"] = "5230408 Pressure Plate Test - Copy",
    ["<P_Heart> (speaking in a deliberately lowered voice) </> That Camilla, she's the mistress you're secretly keeping! The tabloids are all true!"] = "<P_Heart> (speaking in a deliberately lowered voice) </> That Camilla, she's the mistress you're secretly keeping! The tabloids are all true!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【遗失盟约】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得遗失盟约，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lost Covenant】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Lost Covenant. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress",
    ["<Chat_Red>解散群组</>"] = "<Chat_Red> Disband Group </>",
    ["5200260 Antique Shop Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200260 Antique Shop Multiplayer Scene",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部乱斗-玩法规则】</>\n开放报名时，玩法将从帮会成员中随机挑选<Assistant_Red>16</>名玩家作为<Assistant_Property1>幻象投影</>供参与者使用。所有的参与者使用的投影种类相同。\n比赛分为多轮，玩家可以挑选投影投入<Assistant_Property1>任意轮次</>参与比赛，已经投入的投影不可<Assistant_Property1>重复使用</>。\n当指定的轮次开战时，该轮次的投影将被召唤并<Assistant_Property1>自动战斗</>，参与者可以前往俱乐部驻地进行<Assistant_Property1>观战</>。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗]|8}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗-得分规则]|10}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl-Gameplay Rules】</>\nWhen registration is open, the gameplay will randomly select <Assistant_Red>16</> players from the guild members as <Assistant_Property1>Phantom Projections</> for participants to use. All participants use the same type of projection.\nThe competition is divided into multiple rounds. Players can choose a projection to enter into <Assistant_Property1>any round</> to participate in the competition. Projections that have already been entered cannot be <Assistant_Property1>reused</>.\nWhen the designated round begins, the projection for that round will be summoned and <Assistant_Property1>fight automatically</>. Participants can go to the Club Base to <Assistant_Property1>watch the battle</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl-Scoring Rules]|10}",
    ["50级6人本Boss普通"] = "Level 50 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Italic>——你感受到了久违的、不可控的力量在身体里翻涌。 它让你的血液流速加快，每一拳落下都比从前更重——可你是否确定，那真的是力量？还是只是你对疼痛的感知，正在悄然发生变化？你开始不再在意对疼痛的感知，不在意视野会在某些瞬间发生无声地抖动，就像一张被人轻轻撕过一角的画。</>"] = "<Italic>—You feel a long-lost, uncontrollable power surging within your body. It makes your blood flow faster, and every punch you throw lands heavier than before—but are you sure it's really power? Or is it just that your perception of pain is quietly changing? You begin to no longer care about the perception of pain, nor do you care that your vision shakes silently at certain moments, like a painting with a corner torn off by someone.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Glory of the First Victory</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Win 1 Four-Way League match."] = "<Assistant_Title1>Glory of the First Victory</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Win 1 Four-Way League match.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Sunset Swimwear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Sunset Swimwear outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sunset Swimwear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Sunset Swimwear outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["Level 47 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal"] = "Level 47 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.loserName}}</>沉沦于<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</>的绝对魅力之下，甘愿成为<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</>的俘虏。（状态持续<Chat_Highlight>15</>分钟）"] = "<Chat_Highlight> {{eventMessageParams.loserName}} </> has fallen under the absolute charm of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</> and is willing to become a captive of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.winnerName}}</>. (Status lasts for <Chat_Highlight>15</> minutes)",
    ["19级6人本Boss普通"] = "Level 19 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Gentle Piano Music Tonight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Invited back to Blackthorn to have coffee, only to hear that there was once a pale green spring in Old Neil's life.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 53</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Thread, Bound Gold Pound, Display Ornament, Title"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gentle Piano Music Tonight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Invited back to Blackthorn to have coffee, only to hear that there was once a pale green spring in Old Neil's life.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 53</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Thread, Bound Gold Pound, Display Ornament, Title",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【First Dawn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【First Dawn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Seemingly shaking its head) </> I didn't create it; Father did. He used this to store everyone's confessions."] = "<P_Heart> (Seemingly shaking its head) </> I didn't create it; Father did. He used this to store everyone's confessions.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Display Stand Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry:</><Assistant_System>Menu - Family - Edit Display Stand</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Editing Permissions:</>Different family members have different permissions for changing display stand content.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Ordinary Member:</>Only their own character.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Chief:</>All member characters (action range configurable based on the corresponding player's unlock range), <Assistant_Property1>Camera</>, <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (configurable range based on Chief's unlock range), <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (configurable range based on Chief's unlock range), <Assistant_Property1>Wind Direction</>, <Assistant_Property1>Color Grading</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Display Stand Removal:</>When a family member leaves the family, the following content for that player will be automatically removed from the display stand:\n    <Assistant_Property1>Display Stand Character</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (if used)\n    <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (if used)\n<Assistant_Title2>Display Stand Unlock:</>As the family level increases, exclusive family display stand scenes are unlocked at levels 2 and 6. These scenes can only be used in the family display stand.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Contract Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Explanation]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Level Rules]|668}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Display Stand Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry:</><Assistant_System>Menu - Family - Edit Display Stand</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Editing Permissions:</>Different family members have different permissions for changing display stand content.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Ordinary Member:</>Only their own character.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Chief:</>All member characters (action range configurable based on the corresponding player's unlock range), <Assistant_Property1>Camera</>, <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (configurable range based on Chief's unlock range), <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (configurable range based on Chief's unlock range), <Assistant_Property1>Wind Direction</>, <Assistant_Property1>Color Grading</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Display Stand Removal:</>When a family member leaves the family, the following content for that player will be automatically removed from the display stand:\n    <Assistant_Property1>Display Stand Character</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (if used)\n    <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (if used)\n<Assistant_Title2>Display Stand Unlock:</>As the family level increases, exclusive family display stand scenes are unlocked at levels 2 and 6. These scenes can only be used in the family display stand.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Contract Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Explanation]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Level Rules]|668}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> Unstuck </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Story - Roaming \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Help Carmen get out of trouble in the Roaming quest"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Unstuck </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Story - Roaming \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Help Carmen get out of trouble in the Roaming quest",
    ["5分钟内只能进行一次一键申请，请稍后再试"] = "You can only use one-click application once every 5 minutes. Please try again later.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部-俱乐部活跃津贴】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-俱乐部-福利-活跃津贴</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250320}\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>完成活跃津贴任务可获得同行纹章、俱乐部活跃和俱乐部资金奖励。\n俱乐部活跃是当前俱乐部成员个人活跃值累加之和，达到对应值可领取额外奖励。\n活跃津贴的奖励将会在每周一8:00刷新，请及时领取奖励。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部分红]|1405}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity Allowance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Welfare - Activity Allowance</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250320}\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </>Complete Activity Allowance quests to earn Companion Emblems, Club Activity, and Club Fund rewards. \nClub Activity is the sum of individual activity points of current club members; reaching corresponding values allows you to claim extra rewards. \nActivity Allowance rewards refresh every Monday at 8:00 AM. Please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Dividends]|1405}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>红绒菱格\n像旧宅走廊铺了一冬的地砖，踩上无声，却藏着说不清的安稳与温存。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Red Velvet Diamond Pattern\nLike the floor tiles laid for a winter in the hallway of an old house, stepping on them is silent, yet they hide an indescribable stability and warmth.",
    ["<P_Heart> (But just standing here chatting? It's a bit low-class... A mysterious gathering like this should be in an ancient, magnificent temple, right.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (But just standing here chatting? It's a bit low-class... A mysterious gathering like this should be in an ancient, magnificent temple, right.) </>",
    ["60装等橙色竞技武器箱"] = "Level 60 Orange Competition Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【阳光普照】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得阳光普照，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sunshine】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Sunshine. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-经销协议】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>开局会签订区域经销协议，并获得阶段性业绩目标。每经过固定数量站点，商会会检查你的业绩。\n<Assistant_Title2>达标结果：</>达成目标后，可选择维持当前协议或升级协议。升级后的协议目标更高，但会提供更强的货物数量加成和价格加成。\n<Assistant_Title2>未达标结果：</>若检查时未达到目标，本局会提前结算，最终业绩会受到折扣影响。协议等级只能提升，不能下降；"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Distribution Agreement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>At the start, you will sign a regional distribution agreement and receive phased performance targets. After passing a fixed number of stations, the Chamber of Commerce will check your performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Met: </>Once the target is reached, you can choose to maintain the current agreement or upgrade it. Upgraded agreements have higher targets but provide stronger bonuses to cargo quantity and prices. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Not Met: </>If the target is not met during the check, the current session will end early, and the final performance will be affected by a discount. Agreement levels can only be increased, not decreased;",
    ["<ChatTag_Server>[Cross-Server]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Server>[Cross-Server]</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【告解时间到！】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>听八卦有些可耻，但讲八卦只讲一半更可耻！\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>59级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(936,990)]|-6317;-903;-1611;2;5200002;0}与<Assistant_Red>丹</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：金纺线、绑定金镑、认知经验、绑定苏勒、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Confession Time!】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Listening to gossip is a bit shameful, but telling only half of it is even more shameful!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>59</>, head to {Location:[Тинген(936,990)]|-6317;-903;-1611;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red>Dan</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Thread, Bound Gold Pound, Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Title",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the Friends interface, you can search for, add, and manage friends, view friend personal information and online status, and perform operations such as private chatting and gifting.\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, enter a character nickname or numeric ID to search for friends on the current server or cross-server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Requests: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request information. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, the system automatically recommends friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Pop-up Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings - Social - Information Settings</>, you can manage whether to display friend request pop-ups.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete and Block]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the Friends interface, you can search for, add, and manage friends, view friend personal information and online status, and perform operations such as private chatting and gifting.\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, enter a character nickname or numeric ID to search for friends on the current server or cross-server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Requests: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request information. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, the system automatically recommends friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Pop-up Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings - Social - Information Settings</>, you can manage whether to display friend request pop-ups.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete and Block]|1412}",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎在自言自语）</>老头，下次能不能偷点牌运给我，多少让我赢一回啊……"] = "<P_Heart> (Seemingly talking to himself) </> Old man, can you steal some card luck for me next time? Just let me win once...",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>后系统将自动分配并确认"] = "<Highlight> %s </> System will automatically assign and confirm after",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>The Taste of the Witch Is Really Good</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Side Quests\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the side quest \"The Taste of the Witch Is Really Good\""] = "<Assistant_Title1>The Taste of the Witch Is Really Good</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Side Quests\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the side quest \"The Taste of the Witch Is Really Good\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Marionette Travel</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>\n1. Travel accumulates rewards over time, up to a maximum of 24 hours. You can obtain <Assistant_Property1>Bound Soule, World Adventure Chest progress, potion materials</>, etc.\n2. Dispatching <Assistant_Property1>Marionettes</> on travels can significantly increase travel rewards. The number of dispatchable slots will gradually increase with the <Assistant_Property1>Season Time</>.\n3. Using <Assistant_Property1>Spirit Line</> items can boost travel rewards and allow marionettes on travel to automatically complete <Assistant_Property1>Order World Exploration</> in designated areas.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[灵线]|544}, {SendAnswer:[探秘]|560}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Марионетка Travel</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>\n1. Travel accumulates rewards over time, up to a maximum of 24 hours. You can obtain <Assistant_Property1>Bound Soule, World Adventure Chest progress, potion materials</>, etc.\n2. Dispatching <Assistant_Property1>Марионеткаs</> on travels can significantly increase travel rewards. The number of dispatchable slots will gradually increase with the <Assistant_Property1>Season Time</>.\n3. Using <Assistant_Property1>Spirit Line</> items can boost travel rewards and allow Марионеткаs on travel to automatically complete <Assistant_Property1>Order World Exploration</> in designated areas.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Spirit Line]|544}, {SendAnswer:[World Exploration]|560}",
    ["<P_Heart> (You notice the light surging in her eyes gradually calm down.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (You notice the light surging in her eyes gradually calm down.) </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Becoming a Mushroom】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\", advance to Sequence 9, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(358,89)]|25856;-1082;192;2;5200085;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Puffball </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Becoming a Mushroom】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\", advance to Последовательность 9, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(358,89)]|25856;-1082;192;2;5200085;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Puffball </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Dividends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Dividends</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>You can claim Club dividend rewards once a week.\nClub dividend rewards are affected by the Club's activity level and your personal activity in the current Club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Dividends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Dividends</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>You can claim Club dividend rewards once a week.\nClub dividend rewards are affected by the Club's activity level and your personal activity in the current Club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部和<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部因为俱乐部资金不足被强制合并，望各位成员团结一心，一起发展新的俱乐部！"] = "<M_Orange>%s </> Club and <M_Orange>%s </> Club have been forcibly merged due to insufficient club funds. We hope all members will unite and develop the new club together!",
    ["<Highlight>【Rank Reward Description】</>\n\n 1. Ranked modes include: Adventure, Companion, Dungeon, Fun Fight, Dominator's Clash, Battle for the Throne of God, Moment of Fate, and Final Hunt.\n\n 2. Playing each mode accumulates corresponding victory points, which increase your rank and grant rank rewards.\n\n 3. Rewards for each rank can be claimed <Highlight>up to three times</>. You can freely choose 3 modes you enjoy; <Highlight>you do not need to play all of them</>.\n\n 4. The system automatically lists the three modes with your highest rank in the primary positions. Click on each module to quickly navigate to the corresponding mode interface.\n\n 5. Rank rewards will reset when the rank resets."] = "<Highlight>【Rank Reward Description】</>\n\n 1. Ranked modes include: Adventure, Companion, Dungeon, Fun Fight, Dominator's Clash, Battle for the Throne of God, Moment of Fate, and Final Hunt.\n\n 2. Playing each mode accumulates corresponding victory points, which increase your rank and grant rank rewards.\n\n 3. Rewards for each rank can be claimed <Highlight>up to three times</>. You can freely choose 3 modes you enjoy; <Highlight>you do not need to play all of them</>.\n\n 4. The system automatically lists the three modes with your highest rank in the primary positions. Click on each module to quickly navigate to the corresponding mode interface.\n\n 5. Rank rewards will reset when the rank resets.",
    ["Level 53 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal"] = "Level 53 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<DecH> Craft: </> Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost."] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost.",
    ["<P_Heart>（仔细检查过后，好像只有这一个护身符比较特别。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (After a careful inspection, it seems only this one amulet is quite special.) </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Setting Off for the Peak</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Development\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Acting Level 70"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Setting Off for the Peak</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Development\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Acting Level 70",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Cat-Seeking Adventure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>On the streets of Tingen, you can occasionally encounter a spirit cat that engages in amusing \"Loen-style humor\" dialogue.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Spirit Cat</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Cat-Seeking Adventure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Cat-Seeking Adventure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Discovering the Spirit Cat</>\nAfter arriving at the target area, eavesdrop on the nearby NPC's dialogue to obtain clues about the spirit cat, and follow the camera guidance to find it.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Interaction</>\nSpeak with the spirit cat and complete the dice check.\n<Assistant_Red>Check Success:</>You can obtain the treasure chest reward directly.\n<Assistant_Red>Check Failure:</>Follow the spirit cat to finish the conversation, and you can still obtain the corresponding reward."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cat-Seeking Adventure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>On the streets of Тинген, you can occasionally encounter a spirit cat that engages in amusing \"Loen-style humor\" dialogue.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Spirit Cat</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Cat-Seeking Adventure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Cat-Seeking Adventure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Discovering the Spirit Cat</>\nAfter arriving at the target area, eavesdrop on the nearby NPC's dialogue to obtain clues about the spirit cat, and follow the camera guidance to find it.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Interaction</>\nSpeak with the spirit cat and complete the dice check.\n<Assistant_Red>Check Success:</>You can obtain the treasure chest reward directly.\n<Assistant_Red>Check Failure:</>Follow the spirit cat to finish the conversation, and you can still obtain the corresponding reward.",
    ["5230043   恶龙酒吧后巷   位面"] = "5230043 Iron Dragon Bar Back Alley Plane",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>我重生了……</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-时代百态\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成时代逸闻《睡莲镇漫游指南》"] = "<Assistant_Title1> I Have Been Reborn... </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Story - Era Anecdotes \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Complete the Era Anecdote \"Roaming Guide to Water Lily Town\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Sunshine】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Sunshine. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sunshine】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Sunshine. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather・Lightweight Cut・Urban Stroll Outfit\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the corners of the City of Cities."] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather・Lightweight Cut・Urban Stroll Outfit\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the corners of the City of Cities.",
