    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部-建筑和资金】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-俱乐部-建筑升级</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250318}\n<Assistant_Title2>资金来源：</>俱乐部活跃津贴和俱乐部活动。\n<Assistant_Title2>资金说明：</>可用于俱乐部建筑升级，提升俱乐部实力、福利和规模。\n<Assistant_Title2>俱乐部资金消耗：</>建筑升级需要消耗俱乐部资金，并且需要等待一定时间。每个建筑都有对应的等级提升效果，其他建筑等级不能超过议事厅的等级。\n<Assistant_Title2>建筑升级上限随服务器时间逐步开放</>3级：开服第7天早晨8点后\n4级：开服第14天早晨8点后\n5级：开服第21天早晨8点后\n6级：开服第30天早晨8点后\n7级：开服第45天早晨8点后\n8级：开服第60天早晨8点后 \n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部职位]|1402}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃津贴]|1404}，"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club-Buildings and Funds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Club-Building Upgrade</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250318}\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Funds: </>Club Activity Allowance and Club Activities.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fund Description: </>Can be used for Club building upgrades to increase Club strength, benefits, and scale.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Fund Consumption: </>Building upgrades consume Club funds and require a certain amount of time to complete. Each building has corresponding level-up effects, and other building levels cannot exceed the level of the Council Hall.\n<Assistant_Title2>Building upgrade caps are gradually unlocked based on server time:</>Level 3: After 8 AM on the 7th day of the server launch\nLevel 4: After 8 AM on the 14th day of the server launch\nLevel 5: After 8 AM on the 21st day of the server launch\nLevel 6: After 8 AM on the 30th day of the server launch\nLevel 7: After 8 AM on the 45th day of the server launch\nLevel 8: After 8 AM on the 60th day of the server launch \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Positions]|1402}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404},",
    ["<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部已完成响应，成功建立！\n· 加入俱乐部后每天可以参与特色玩法。\n· 可获得专属的俱乐部领地。\n· 还能带领会员参与联赛，赢取最高荣耀。\n· 参与活动前请先确认职位分配情况，正式会员是俱乐部的中坚力量，可以参与俱乐部内的玩法活动；候补成员是俱乐部的储备力量，部分俱乐部活动无法参与，可以保持活跃状态，联系管理转正为会员。"] = "<M_Orange>%s </> Club has finished responding and was successfully established! \n· After joining a club, you can participate in special gameplay every day. \n· You can obtain exclusive club territory. \n· You can also lead members to participate in leagues and win the highest glory. \n· Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in club activities; reserve members are the reserve force of the club and cannot participate in some club activities. You can maintain activity and contact management to be promoted to an official member.",
    ["Level 60 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal"] = "Level 60 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["1. Players who open the gift need to input the correct password to claim the gift. \n 2. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 3. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item."] = "1. Players who open the gift need to input the correct password to claim the gift. \n 2. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 3. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>战旗织锦・常胜肩甲\n常胜的勇士出征，为其授勋的是下一场胜利。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Battle Flag Brocade · Ever-Victorious Shoulder Armor\nThe ever-victorious warrior sets out, and it is the next victory that bestows the honor upon them.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> has joined the club. Let's welcome the new member~ <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"guildWelcome\"> [Click to welcome] </>"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> has joined the club. Let's welcome the new member~ <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"guildWelcome\"> [Click to welcome] </>",
