    ["1. You can enter dungeons solo or in a party of two; choosing solo/duo mode does not affect rewards. \n2. Warriors and Spectators will be forced to switch to Offensive Stance upon entering a dungeon."] = "1. You can enter dungeons solo or in a party of two; choosing solo/duo mode does not affect rewards. \n2. Warriors and Зрительs will be forced to switch to Offensive Stance upon entering a dungeon.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【穹星】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷翅膀\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得穹星，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装-翅膀</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dome Star】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Wings\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Dome Star. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit - Wings</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Goddess's Gift Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【盛装舞步】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>家族时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得盛装舞步套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-家族</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Grand Waltz】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Family Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Grand Waltz set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Family</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁誓】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得铁誓，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Iron Oath】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Iron Oath. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["5月23日\n　　尼尔说这条路他走过七次。\n　　一路上他说了三遍，我不信——如果他真的走过七次，为什么连帐篷都不会搭？我蹲在他身后，看他第三次把帐篷布穿反，雪水渗进手套，冷得像在舔我的骨头。\n　　万幸，我们在天黑前支起了帐篷。\n\n剩余物资：\n面包6份    佩姬为我们准备了18磅分成了8份\n肉干和肉肠5份\n糖1罐\n黄油4块\n酒3瓶      酒3瓶 → 2瓶（晚上庆祝消耗1瓶）\n水5瓶      暂时充足，路上可以留意水源"] = "May 23rd\n　　Neil said he has walked this path seven times.\n　　He said it three times along the way, but I don't believe it—if he really had walked it seven times, why wouldn't he even know how to set up a tent? I crouched behind him, watching him put the tent fabric on backward for the third time. Snow water seeped into my gloves, cold as if it were licking my bones.\n　　Fortunately, we set up the tent before dark.\n\nRemaining supplies:\nBread: 6 portions (Peggy prepared 18 lbs for us, divided into 8 portions)\nDried meat and sausages: 5 portions\nSugar: 1 jar\nButter: 4 blocks\nWine: 3 bottles (Wine: 3 bottles → 2 bottles (1 consumed for the evening celebration))\nWater: 5 bottles (Temporarily sufficient; can keep an eye out for water sources on the way)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Dead Leaf Butterfly】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Dead Leaf Butterfly outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dead Leaf Butterfly】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Dead Leaf Butterfly outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
