    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Waiting for Godot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Let's go. We can't. We're waiting for Godot.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 65</> in Acting, go to {Location:[睡莲小镇(170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0}talk to <Assistant_Red>Esther</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Waiting for Godot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Let's go. We can't. We're waiting for Godot.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 65</> in Acting, go to {Location:[Water Lily Town(170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0}talk to <Assistant_Red>Esther</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【寻猫奇遇记】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>廷根的街头，偶尔能遇到一只充满趣味的“鲁恩式幽默”对话的灵猫。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找灵猫</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【寻猫奇遇记】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【寻猫奇遇记】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 发现灵猫</>\n到达目标区域后，旁听附近NPC的对话，获得灵猫的线索，并根据镜头指引找到灵猫。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 完成互动</>\n与灵猫对话并完成骰子检定。\n<Assistant_Red>检定成功：</>可直接获得宝箱奖励。\n<Assistant_Red>检定失败：</>跟随灵猫继续完成对话，仍可获得对应奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cat-Seeking Adventure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>On the streets of Тинген, you can occasionally encounter a spirit cat that engages in amusing \"Loen-style humor\" dialogue.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Spirit Cat</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Cat-Seeking Adventure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Cat-Seeking Adventure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Discovering the Spirit Cat</>\nAfter arriving at the target area, eavesdrop on the nearby NPC's dialogue to obtain clues about the spirit cat, and follow the camera guidance to find it.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Interaction</>\nSpeak with the spirit cat and complete the dice check.\n<Assistant_Red>Check Success:</>You can obtain the treasure chest reward directly.\n<Assistant_Red>Check Failure:</>Follow the spirit cat to finish the conversation, and you can still obtain the corresponding reward.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Firearm Shooting Gameplay】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Tingen</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific levels</>, the firearm function will be activated as the level progresses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Introduction: </>After activating firearms, use the Basic Attack button to shoot directly, and use skills to switch between different firearms, aim down sights, and perform auxiliary knockback effects. \nIn different levels, the types of activated firearms will vary; please use them reasonably to defeat enemies. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Aiming and Shooting]|903}, {SendAnswer:[Pistol]|899}, {SendAnswer:[Shotgun]|900}, {SendAnswer:[Sniper Rifle]|901}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Firearm Shooting Gameplay】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Тинген</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific levels</>, the firearm function will be activated as the level progresses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Introduction: </>After activating firearms, use the Базовая атака button to shoot directly, and use skills to switch between different firearms, aim down sights, and perform auxiliary knockback effects. \nIn different levels, the types of activated firearms will vary; please use them reasonably to defeat enemies. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Aiming and Shooting]|903}, {SendAnswer:[Pistol]|899}, {SendAnswer:[Shotgun]|900}, {SendAnswer:[Sniper Rifle]|901}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Chat - Emoticons】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat - Emoticon button next to input box</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticons: </>Includes emojis, system emoticons, and custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Upload Custom Emoticons: </>In the Custom Emoticons tab, click the + button to upload your own; they can be used after approval. \n<Assistant_Title2>Custom Emoticon Limit: </>Limit is 50 custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticon Sync: </>All characters under the same account sync all emoticons by default. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Chat]|1413}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chat - Emoticons】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat - Emoticon button next to input box</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticons: </>Includes emojis, system emoticons, and custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Upload Custom Emoticons: </>In the Custom Emoticons tab, click the + button to upload your own; they can be used after approval. \n<Assistant_Title2>Custom Emoticon Limit: </>Limit is 50 custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticon Sync: </>All characters under the same account sync all emoticons by default. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Chat]|1413}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>朋友们，听我说一句！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-俱乐部\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>第一次在俱乐部频道发言"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Friends, listen to me!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Club\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Speak in the Club channel for the first time",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Standard Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Standard voice rooms default to Free Speech Mode; click the unmute button next to the input box to unmute automatically. If the current room is set to Host-Set Speech Permissions or Host-Set Speech Order, you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information and type or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Standard Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Standard voice rooms default to Free Speech Mode; click the unmute button next to the input box to unmute automatically. If the current room is set to Host-Set Speech Permissions or Host-Set Speech Order, you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information and type or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["0：（缺省值）对Target里的每一个对象，都发射全部子弹\n1：（排队枪毙）从子弹List里逐个发射子弹，对象为Target列表里按顺序选取，直至Target耗尽，或者子弹耗尽\n2：（随机发放）从子弹List里逐个发射子弹，对象从Target列表里随机选取（可重复选取），直到子弹耗尽"] = "0: (Default) Fire all bullets at every object in Target \n 1: (Queue execution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects from the Target list in order until the Target list is exhausted or bullets are exhausted \n 2: (Random distribution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects randomly from the Target list (can be selected repeatedly) until bullets are exhausted.",
