    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Level Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rapport Value and Level: </>Complete weekly family quests to gain Rapport Value and increase the family level. The weekly cap for Rapport Value is <Assistant_Red>2000 points</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Quests: </>Family members team up to participate in corresponding activities to earn Rapport Value.\n    <Assistant_Property1>High-Multiplier Rapport Value: </>Earned when completing each quest for the first few times during the week; after exceeding this limit, only the normal multiplier is earned.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Refresh Time: </>Quests refresh weekly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Covenant Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Description]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Display Stand Rules]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Level Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rapport Value and Level: </>Complete weekly family quests to gain Rapport Value and increase the family level. The weekly cap for Rapport Value is <Assistant_Red>2000 points</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Quests: </>Family members team up to participate in corresponding activities to earn Rapport Value.\n    <Assistant_Property1>High-Multiplier Rapport Value: </>Earned when completing each quest for the first few times during the week; after exceeding this limit, only the normal multiplier is earned.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Refresh Time: </>Quests refresh weekly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Covenant Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Description]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Display Stand Rules]|669}",
