    ["<ChatTag_Current>[附近]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Current>[Nearby]</>",
    ["1. 消耗金镑可发送绑金礼金，领取礼金可获得等价绑定金镑；\n2. 绑金礼金发出24小时后，未被领取的礼金将返还等额绑金；\n3. 外观馈赠若有时装在24小时后未领取完，则会返还购买该时装时消耗的等额金镑与赠礼额度；\n4. 外观馈赠获得的道具为绑定道具。"] = "1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Items obtained from appearance gifts are bound items.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Tingen have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Nighthawks squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Tingen's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands, Title"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Тинген have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Ночные Ястребы squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Тинген's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands, Title",
    ["1: Ignore, 0: Restore."] = "1: Ignore, 0: Restore.",
    ["1. Players who open the gift need to input the correct ciphertext via voice to claim the gift. \n 2. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 3. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item."] = "1. Players who open the gift need to input the correct ciphertext via voice to claim the gift. \n 2. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 3. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
    ["<Highlight_L>宣战捷报</>：我方俱乐部成员<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>已在<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[霍纳奇斯山脉(%d,%d) 分线%s]</>成功击败<Reminder_Red>[%s]</>俱乐部的<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>并获得宣战积分%s分！点击前往追击！"] = "<Highlight_L> War Bulletin </>: Our club member <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has successfully defeated <HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> of the <Reminder_Red>[%s]</> club at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[Hornacis Mountain Range (%d, %d) Sub-channel %s]</> and gained %s war points! Click to pursue!",
