    ["<Assistant_Title1>【座驾】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>名词介绍：</>外观类型的一种\n<Assistant_Title2>获取方式：</>座驾可以通过任务、活动、商城或特定玩法奖励获得等等多种多样的方式都有机会获取。\n<Assistant_Title2>查看切换：</>点击菜单-外观-座驾就可以预览和切换其他座驾，还能更换座驾外观\n<Assistant_Title2>召唤座驾：</>点击右下角坐骑按钮可以召唤座驾，PC端还可以用快捷键T召唤坐骑"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Vehicle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>A type of cosmetic.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>Vehicles can be obtained in various ways, such as through quests, events, the Mall, or specific gameplay rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>View and Switch: </>Click Menu - Cosmetics - Vehicle to preview and switch vehicles, or change their appearance.\n<Assistant_Title2>Summon Vehicle: </>Click the mount button in the bottom right to summon your vehicle; on PC, you can also use the shortcut key T to summon it.",
    ["66装等橙色竞技武器箱"] = "Level 66 Orange Competition Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Camping Story】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Camping Story outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Camping Story】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Camping Story outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
