    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Warmth Through the Wall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>It seems like it's not very warm inside one family's house...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, go to {Location:[金秋湖(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0} and interact with the <Assistant_Red>Voice Inside the House</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warmth Through the Wall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>It seems like it's not very warm inside one family's house...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0} and interact with the <Assistant_Red>Voice Inside the House</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Elegant Club Member</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Club\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Join a Club"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Elegant Club Member</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Club\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Join a Club",
    ["Level 96 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard"] = "Level 96 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["5200239 Jewelry Store Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200239 Jewelry Store Multiplayer Scene",
    ["1. 在部分副本中，队伍人数没有组满时可发布求援\n2. 成功完成他人的求援帮助可获得一定的绑定苏勒奖励\n3. 应援失败也会获得少量绑定苏勒奖励"] = "1. In some dungeons, if the team is not full, you can post a request for help. \n 2. Successfully helping others with their requests grants a certain amount of bound Gold Pounds. \n 3. Failing to provide support also grants a small amount of bound Gold Pounds.",
    ["3 questions"] = "3 questions",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Enlightenment of the Star Chart】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Enlightenment of the Star Chart set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Enlightenment of the Star Chart】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Enlightenment of the Star Chart set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Quality: </> Purple, Gold, Orange, Red (Mythical). \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Slots: </> The equipment slots available for the current season are Weapon, Brooch, Ring, Amulet, Hat, Cloak, Shoes, and Armor. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Sources: </> Equipment can be obtained by opening World Adventure/War-forged/Social Gift treasures, challenging various dungeons, and participating in large-scale competition activities."] = "<Assistant_Title1> Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Quality: </> Purple, Gold, Orange, Red (Mythical). \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Slots: </> The equipment slots available for the current season are Weapon, Brooch, Ring, Amulet, Hat, Cloak, Shoes, and Armor. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Sources: </> Equipment can be obtained by opening World Adventure/War-forged/Social Gift treasures, challenging various dungeons, and participating in large-scale competition activities.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</> 我说了很多次了，我不是什么毒素专家。我只是比较擅长让植物和动物产生一些特殊的化合物。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I've said it many times, I'm not a Toxin Expert. I'm just quite good at getting plants and animals to produce certain special compounds.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>First Friend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Have 1 friend"] = "<Assistant_Title1>First Friend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Have 1 friend",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Lion Head】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Golden Lion Head; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Lion Head】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Golden Lion Head; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【原著瞬间】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍</>\n伟大的”愚者“先生也曾在这里生活，往日记忆和足迹凝结成值得铭记的瞬间。欢迎来到老地方，见见老朋友，探寻原著中的那场旧梦。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1.进入玩法</>\n可通过以下方式前往【原著旧梦】：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任一教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择玩法【原著瞬间】，选中点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【原著瞬间】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2.完成交互</>\n到达目标地点后，交互点击【触摸】，重温过往的记忆。\n<Assistant_Title3>3.获得奖励</>\n【触摸】后即可获得奖励，并增加对应地图秩序世界完成度。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Moments from the Original Work】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction</>\nThe great Mr. Fool also lived here once; past memories and footprints have condensed into moments worth remembering. Welcome back to the old place, meet old friends, and explore that old dream from the original work. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Enter Gameplay</>\nYou can head to 【Original Work's Old Dream】 via the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TRPG Entry:</>Open the menu to enter 【TRPG】, join any organization, select the 【Moments from the Original Work】 gameplay in the 【Order World】, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry: Open the map, switch to the 【Exploration】 tab, view the 【Moments from the Original Work】 gameplay icon in 【World Details】, follow the icon's guidance to find the corresponding marker on the map, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Complete Interaction</>\nAfter reaching the target location, interact by clicking 【Touch】 to relive past memories.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Obtain Rewards</>\nAfter 【Touching】, you will receive rewards and increase the completion progress of the corresponding Order World map.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>旅迹裁量\n星空浩瀚，凡门皆达。披戴此身，愿旅途的星辉指引你们永不迷失。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低笑）</>……我没有要提问的，<P_Yellow>无论命运给出什么样的指示，我都会回答“好”</>。这才是我们这些羔羊该做的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Low chuckle)</>... I have no questions to ask. <P_Yellow>No matter what instructions fate gives, I will answer 'good'</>. This is what we lambs should do.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Gameplay Rules】</>\n When registration opens, the mode will randomly select <Assistant_Red>16</> players from the club members to serve as <Assistant_Property1>Illusion Projections</> for participants to use. All participants use the same types of projections. \n The competition is divided into multiple rounds. Players can choose projections to enter into <Assistant_Property1>any round</> to participate in the competition. Projections that have already been entered cannot be <Assistant_Property1>reused</>. \n When the designated round begins, the projections for that round will be summoned and <Assistant_Property1>fight automatically</>. Participants can go to the club headquarters to <Assistant_Property1>watch the battle</>.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗]|8}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗-得分规则]|10}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Gameplay Rules】</>\n When registration opens, the mode will randomly select <Assistant_Red>16</> players from the club members to serve as <Assistant_Property1>Illusion Projections</> for participants to use. All participants use the same types of projections. \n The competition is divided into multiple rounds. Players can choose projections to enter into <Assistant_Property1>any round</> to participate in the competition. Projections that have already been entered cannot be <Assistant_Property1>reused</>. \n When the designated round begins, the projections for that round will be summoned and <Assistant_Property1>fight automatically</>. Participants can go to the club headquarters to <Assistant_Property1>watch the battle</>.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl - Scoring Rules]|10}",
    ["<P_Heart> (But things like this happen often here, and I'm powerless to help. It's a speculator's game; win, and you might be rich overnight, lose, and everything is turned upside down.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (But things like this happen often here, and I'm powerless to help. It's a speculator's game; win, and you might be rich overnight, lose, and everything is turned upside down.) </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>让我先来！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在第五章主线中试图插队买票。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Let Me Go First!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Reality Main Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Attempt to cut in line to buy tickets in the Chapter 5 main quest.",
