    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Twilight Mist】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Twilight Mist after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Twilight Mist】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Twilight Mist after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【剧情模式】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统设置：</>菜单-设置-视角-剧情模式{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>系统介绍：</>剧情模式开启后，在剧情位面中，镜头会被拉近为剧情镜头视角，以提升剧情沉浸感。可在屏幕左侧下方拍照按钮下点击开关手动开启/关闭，也可在<Highlight>设置-视角-剧情模式-动态开启剧情模式</>中永久关闭，关闭后再次进入剧情位面将不再开启剧情模式（部分战斗场景除外）。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[剧情模式下外观隐藏]|1324}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Settings: </>Menu-Settings-Camera-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2> System Introduction: </>After Story Mode is enabled, the camera will zoom in to a cinematic perspective within story instances to enhance immersion. You can manually toggle it on/off by clicking the switch under the camera button on the bottom left of the screen, or permanently disable it in <Highlight>Settings-Camera-Story Mode-Enable Story Mode Dynamically</>. Once disabled, Story Mode will not activate when entering story instances again (except for some combat scenes).\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Hiding Appearance in Story Mode]|1324}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【自然柔顺】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得自然柔顺发型，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Naturally Smooth] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Mall Direct-Sale Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After purchasing in the Mall, gain the Naturally Smooth hairstyle, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained through <Assistant_System> Mall </>",
    ["<P_Heart>我明白了，是因为这里的食谱有限，单卖丝瓜也缺少噱头，我有办法了。</>"] = "<P_Heart>I understand now. It's because the menu here is limited, and selling luffa alone lacks a gimmick. I have an idea.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【光暗双生】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得光暗双生套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Light and Dark Twins】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Light and Dark Twins set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暗涌的危机】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>根据现有线索，和伦纳德弗莱分头行动，协助调查从警察厅移交过来的失踪案。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第三天解锁。完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>46级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、45品武器箱、初级深红精粹、初级狂暴药剂、中级生命纯露"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Undercurrent Crisis】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Based on existing clues, split up with Leonard and Frye to assist in investigating the missing persons case transferred from the police department.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>46</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Level 45 Weapon Box, Primary Crimson Essence, Primary Berserk Potion, Intermediate Life Dew",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>压纹皮革·银铆轻铠·轻便战甲\n永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Embossed Leather · Silver Rivet Light Armor · Lightweight Battle Armor \n The never-flowing twilight lingers on the pauldrons; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there is still the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【风暴之泪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得风暴之泪，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Storm Tear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Storm Tear. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction:</>\nUse Historical Beacons to befriend Connections in the Befriend Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Method:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Befriend Connection</> to enter the befriending interface, then click Befriend 1 time/5 times to proceed.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Cost:</>\nEach time you befriend, you need to consume one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Befriend in the Befriend Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will pop up.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-Mall-Treasury Display</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-General Store-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Gift of Fate</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through some <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}, {SendAnswer:[关系]|551}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction:</>\nUse Historical Beacons to befriend Connections in the Befriend Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Method:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Befriend Connection</> to enter the befriending interface, then click Befriend 1 time/5 times to proceed.\n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Cost:</>\nEach time you befriend, you need to consume one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Befriend in the Befriend Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will pop up.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-Mall-Treasury Display</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Mall-General Store-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Gift of Fate</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through some <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}",
    ["<P_Heart>（不能把窥探者引回去，这会把梅丽莎他们也拉入危险！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I can't lead the stalker back. That would put Melissa and the others in danger!)</>",
