    ["<Assistant_Title1>心灵共鸣</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>与任意好友的好友度达到心灵共鸣"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Spiritual Resonance</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Spiritual Resonance with any friend",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【聊天】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>HUD左下角-聊天</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250050}\n<Assistant_Title2>聊天频道：</>可在左侧列表切换不同的频道聊天。\n<Assistant_Title2>聊天设置：</>可以通过<Assistant_System>聊天面板-下方设置按钮</>，进行聊天频道设置。在<Assistant_System>综合设置 - 聊天频道显示</>可以设置需要显示的聊天频道。在<Assistant_System>频道设置</>可以控制HUD左下角显示的聊天频道。\n<Assistant_Title2>综合频道：</>综合频道聚集了多个频道消息的信息，可以在其中进行快捷查看。在<Assistant_System>频道设置</>可以控制综合频道内包含的频道信息。\n<Assistant_Title2>聊天小窗：</>在聊天界面右下角，点击小窗按钮可打开小窗模式，小窗模式下可自由拖动小窗位置。\n<Assistant_Title3>基础功能细节规则：</>{SendAnswer:[聊天-表情包]|1414}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Bottom left of HUD-Chat</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250050}\n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Channels: </> You can switch between different channels to chat in the list on the left. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Settings: </> You can perform chat channel settings via <Assistant_System>Chat Panel-Settings Button at the bottom</>. In <Assistant_System>General Settings - Chat Channel Display</>, you can set the chat channels you want to display. In <Assistant_System>Channel Settings</>, you can control the chat channels displayed in the bottom left of the HUD. \n<Assistant_Title2> General Channel: </> The General Channel gathers information from multiple channel messages, allowing for quick viewing. In <Assistant_System>Channel Settings</>, you can control the channel information included in the General Channel. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Mini-Window: </> In the chat interface, click the mini-window button in the bottom right to open mini-window mode; in mini-window mode, you can freely drag the window position. \n<Assistant_Title3> Basic Function Detail Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Chat-Emoticons]|1414}",
    ["Level 68 Equipment Random Box"] = "Level 68 Equipment Random Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen in the Mirror】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>More and more citizens are going missing; the source of the disaster must be found as soon as possible... First, go and check the strange lakeside in your dream. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the fourth day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 3 of the main story, \"Crisis of Dark Currents,\" and reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 52</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Weapon Box"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Тинген in the Mirror】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>More and more citizens are going missing; the source of the disaster must be found as soon as possible... First, go and check the strange lakeside in your dream. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the fourth day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 3 of the main story, \"Crisis of Dark Currents,\" and reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 52</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Silver Baboon Backpack】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Direct-purchase bundle accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Silver Baboon Backpack. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock through Mall bundles."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Silver Baboon Backpack】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Direct-purchase bundle accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Silver Baboon Backpack. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock through Mall bundles.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>初临战场</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>参与1次四方联赛。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>First Arrival on the Battlefield</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Participate in 1 Four-Way League match.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【股后黑手】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>树下似乎有什么声音……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往前往{Location:[廷根(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>卡在树上的男子</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Hidden Hand Behind the Stock】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There seems to be some sound under the tree...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then go to {Location:[Тинген(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man stuck in the tree</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【窥秘人】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Подглядывающий за Тайнами】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Level:</>Club activity levels are categorized from high to low as:\nQuiet Affairs (<720)\nRoutine Operations (720~2400)\nProsperous Affairs (>2400)\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Sources:</>Activity Allowance\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description:</>The higher the club activity, the higher the weekly club dividend rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Consumption:</>Daily club maintenance will deduct 5% of current activity. If activity remains at Quiet Affairs for 7 consecutive days, the Council Hall level will decrease by 1.<Assistant_Red>If the Council Hall level falls below level 1, the club will be automatically disbanded.</>\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Dividends]|1405}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Level:</>Club activity levels are categorized from high to low as:\nQuiet Affairs (<720)\nRoutine Operations (720~2400)\nProsperous Affairs (>2400)\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Sources:</>Activity Allowance\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description:</>The higher the club activity, the higher the weekly club dividend rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Consumption:</>Daily club maintenance will deduct 5% of current activity. If activity remains at Quiet Affairs for 7 consecutive days, the Council Hall level will decrease by 1.<Assistant_Red>If the Council Hall level falls below level 1, the club will be automatically disbanded.</>\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Dividends]|1405}",
    ["64级大R玩家+大量钱"] = "Level 64 big spender + large amount of money.",
    ["The <PVPHighlight> Giant Dragon - Projection </> has collapsed! Our team worked together to repel it and successfully secured the final auction reward for this round <PVPHighlight> belonging to </>!"] = "The <PVPHighlight> Giant Dragon - Projection </> has collapsed! Our team worked together to repel it and successfully secured the final auction reward for this round <PVPHighlight> belonging to </>!",
    ["Level 57 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard"] = "Level 57 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【莫尔斯小镇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得莫尔斯小镇套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Morse Small Town】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Morse Small Town set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>美梦成真</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-支线剧情\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成支线《美梦成真》。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Dreams Come True</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Side Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the side quest \"Dreams Come True\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>《我回来了》</>\n<Assistant_Title2>称号说明：</>此人曾与死亡擦肩而过，但奇迹般存活于此。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取方式：</>完成成就{SendAnswer:[死而复生就是奇迹]|1361}后，使用道具<Assistant_Property1>称号·我回来了</>即可装备。\n<Assistant_Title2>称号稀有度：</><Assistant_Property1>普通（稀有度1）</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>《I'm Back》</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Title Description: </>This person once brushed shoulders with death but miraculously survived.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>After completing the achievement {SendAnswer:[Resurrection is a Miracle]|1361}, use the item <Assistant_Property1>Title: I'm Back</> to equip it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Title Rarity: </><Assistant_Property1>Normal (Rarity 1)</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【小夜曲】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得小夜曲，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌购买"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Serenade] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Serenade; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Blooming Waiting】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Gallery Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Blooming Waiting. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via <Assistant_System>Fashion Gallery</> collection progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blooming Waiting】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Gallery Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Blooming Waiting. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via <Assistant_System>Fashion Gallery</> collection progress",
    ["11_弗兰奇公寓"] = "11_Frankie Apartment",
    ["<Highlight> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost."] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【如何加入教团】</>\n教团解锁后，可通过<Assistant_System>跑团</>入口或对应找教团 NPC 进入加入流程。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>加入流程：</>\n1. 打开教团选择界面。\n2. 选择想加入的教团。\n3. 查看该教团的能力、信仰与推荐属性。\n4. 完成属性加点后确认。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团选择与属性加点]|1274}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【How to Join a Covenant】</>\nAfter a Covenant is unlocked, you can enter the joining process via the <Assistant_System>Run Group</> entrance or by finding the corresponding Covenant NPC.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Joining Process: </>\n1. Open the Covenant selection interface.\n2. Select the Covenant you wish to join.\n3. View the abilities, faith, and recommended attributes of that Covenant.\n4. Confirm after completing attribute point allocation.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Selection and Attribute Allocation]|1274}",
    ["56级6人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 56 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Hunt! Eternal Reign</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach the Conquest Emperor rank in Final Hunt"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hunt! Eternal Reign</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach the Conquest Emperor rank in Final Hunt",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>柔光软绸・蕾丝轻纱・修身睡裙\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨，现下品鉴确实别有风味。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Soft Light Silk/Lace Tulle/Slim-fit Nightgown\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished remark in his diary, which is indeed quite tasteful to appreciate now.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【虚境】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台场景\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Void Realm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Midsummer Night】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Midsummer Night outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Midsummer Night】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Midsummer Night outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暗涌的危机】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>根据现有线索，和伦纳德弗莱分头行动，协助调查从警察厅移交过来的失踪案。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第三天解锁。完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>46级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、武器箱"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Undercurrent Crisis】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Based on existing clues, split up with Leonard and Frye to assist in investigating the missing persons case transferred from the police department.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>46</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【壳中的宇宙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得壳中的宇宙，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌购买"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Universe in a Shell] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Universe in a Shell; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Highlight>黑荆棘商店</>兑换获得"] = "Obtained by exchanging at the <Highlight> Blackthorn Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【盛放的等待】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得盛放的等待，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blooming Waiting】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Gallery Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Blooming Waiting. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via <Assistant_System>Fashion Gallery</> collection progress",
