    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Scoring Rules】</>\n Players will accumulate scores based on the performance of their projections on the battlefield: \n According to the survival ranking, the top three projections will receive <Assistant_Red>60, 40, 30</> points respectively, \n for every other projection that dies, your own projection gains <Assistant_Red>3</> points, \n and killing other projections grants <Assistant_Red>5</> points. \n Players must enter at least <Assistant_Red>8</> projections to receive rewards. After the competition ends, those with excellent total scores and those with outstanding projection data will receive additional <Assistant_Property1>title</> rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl - Gameplay Rules]|9}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Scoring Rules】</>\n Players will accumulate scores based on the performance of their projections on the battlefield: \n According to the survival ranking, the top three projections will receive <Assistant_Red>60, 40, 30</> points respectively, \n for every other projection that dies, your own projection gains <Assistant_Red>3</> points, \n and killing other projections grants <Assistant_Red>5</> points. \n Players must enter at least <Assistant_Red>8</> projections to receive rewards. After the competition ends, those with excellent total scores and those with outstanding projection data will receive additional <Assistant_Property1>title</> rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl - Gameplay Rules]|9}",
    ["<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I don't want to return to that state. So, I chose to be like this now. Even if I have to repeat resurrection and amnesia, at least I retain my past and my humanity."] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I don't want to return to that state. So, I chose to be like this now. Even if I have to repeat resurrection and amnesia, at least I retain my past and my humanity.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诚颂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得诚颂，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sincere Praise】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Sincere Praise after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Permanent Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Play Voice Room - Settings (Bottom Right) - Permanent Button (Top Right)</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Permanent Item: </>You can purchase a Permanent Contract in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</>. Using it converts a Play Voice Room into a permanent room and adds 30 days of permanent duration. A single item can extend the duration by 30 days, with a maximum cumulative extension of 90 days.\n<Assistant_Title2>Function Introduction: </>After converting to a permanent room, the voice room will be retained even after you <Assistant_Red>exit the permanent voice room or go offline</>, and the host will retain their host status.<Assistant_Red>Permanent voice rooms cannot have their host status transferred.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quantity Limit: </>Each character can own a maximum of <Assistant_Red>1 permanent voice room</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disbanding the Room: </>A permanent voice room can be disbanded by the host; once disbanded, it <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</>;\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Permanent Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Play Voice Room - Settings (Bottom Right) - Permanent Button (Top Right)</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Permanent Item: </>You can purchase a Permanent Contract in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</>. Using it converts a Play Voice Room into a permanent room and adds 30 days of permanent duration. A single item can extend the duration by 30 days, with a maximum cumulative extension of 90 days.\n<Assistant_Title2>Function Introduction: </>After converting to a permanent room, the voice room will be retained even after you <Assistant_Red>exit the permanent voice room or go offline</>, and the host will retain their host status.<Assistant_Red>Permanent voice rooms cannot have their host status transferred.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quantity Limit: </>Each character can own a maximum of <Assistant_Red>1 permanent voice room</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disbanding the Room: </>A permanent voice room can be disbanded by the host; once disbanded, it <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</>;\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}",
