    ["<Assistant_Title1>Projection Fragment</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction:</>\nThese are points obtained when {SendAnswer:Befriend Connections|554}obtaining duplicates{SendAnswer:Connections|550}, which can be used to {SendAnswer:Connection Shop|558}exchange for various rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\nYou can obtain Projection Fragments when you obtain duplicate Connections through befriending. The higher the quality of the duplicate Connection, the more you obtain.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Consume:</>\nYou can open the <Assistant_System>Connection Shop</> via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Exchange</> to exchange for corresponding items.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Shop]|558}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Projection Fragment</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction:</>\nThese are points obtained when {SendAnswer:Befriend Connections|554}obtaining duplicates{SendAnswer:Connections|550}, which can be used to {SendAnswer:Connection Shop|558}exchange for various rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\nYou can obtain Projection Fragments when you obtain duplicate Connections through befriending. The higher the quality of the duplicate Connection, the more you obtain.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Consume:</>\nYou can open the <Assistant_System>Connection Shop</> via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connection-Exchange</> to exchange for corresponding items.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Shop]|558}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Phantom of the Opera</> is a gameplay where clubs compete in appearance coordination. The overall tournament format is similar to the Club League, but everyone needs to coordinate their appearances and compete in the Phantom Corridor. The gameplay will proceed by season/round, keeping pace with the Club League. \n<Assistant_Title2>Core Process: </>Announce the theme for the round at a specified time each week → Members perform fashion coordination and form a score ranking → Lock the top 5 scoring contestants before the start of the match → Club management adjusts the appearance order → The match takes place in the evening with 5 confrontations between clubs → Settle wins, losses, and rewards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Conditions: </>Clubs must meet division/level conditions, and members must be official members; substitute members cannot participate. \n<Assistant_Title2>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[歌剧魅影-搭配规则]|910}, {SendAnswer:[歌剧魅影-比赛与奖励]|911}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Phantom of the Opera</> is a gameplay where clubs compete in appearance coordination. The overall tournament format is similar to the Club League, but everyone needs to coordinate their appearances and compete in the Phantom Corridor. The gameplay will proceed by season/round, keeping pace with the Club League. \n<Assistant_Title2>Core Process: </>Announce the theme for the round at a specified time each week → Members perform fashion coordination and form a score ranking → Lock the top 5 scoring contestants before the start of the match → Club management adjusts the appearance order → The match takes place in the evening with 5 confrontations between clubs → Settle wins, losses, and rewards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Conditions: </>Clubs must meet division/level conditions, and members must be official members; substitute members cannot participate. \n<Assistant_Title2>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera-Coordination Rules]|910}, {SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera-Matches and Rewards]|911}",
    ["<Gift>%s</>:为<Gift>%s</>送出<Gift>捣蛋时刻-</><Gift>%s分</>！"] = "<Gift>%s</>: Sent <Gift>%s</> a <Gift> Prank Moment - </><Gift>%s points </>!",
    ["Level 97 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard"] = "Level 97 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【好友-私聊】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>好友置顶：</><Assistant_System>好友-私聊-右下角设置</>聊天设置中，可以将好友设置为置顶。无论该好友是否在线，都会优先显示在好友列表中。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友备注：</><Assistant_System>好友-私聊-右下角设置</>聊天设置中，可以自行设置好友的备注。\n<Assistant_Title2>免打扰：</><Assistant_System>好友-私聊-右下角设置</>聊天设置中，可以调整免打扰开关，开启免打扰后，该玩家的信息将不再出现弹条和红点提醒。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}，{SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}，{SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}，{SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends-Private Chat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>Pin Friend: </><Assistant_System>Friends-Private Chat-Settings in the bottom right corner</>In Chat Settings, you can pin a friend. Regardless of whether the friend is online, they will be displayed at the top of your friend list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Nickname: </><Assistant_System>Friends-Private Chat-Settings in the bottom right corner</>In Chat Settings, you can set a custom nickname for your friend.\n<Assistant_Title2>Do Not Disturb: </><Assistant_System>Friends-Private Chat-Settings in the bottom right corner</>In Chat Settings, you can toggle the Do Not Disturb switch. Once enabled, you will no longer receive pop-up notifications or red dot alerts for messages from this player.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Friendship Level]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends-Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["5231062   新俱乐部NPC测试   单人位面"] = "5231062 New Club NPC Test Single-Player Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Distribution Agreement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>At the start, you will sign a regional distribution agreement and receive phased performance targets. After passing a fixed number of stations, the Chamber of Commerce will check your performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Met: </>Once the target is reached, you can choose to maintain the current agreement or upgrade it. Upgraded agreements have higher targets but provide stronger bonuses to cargo quantity and prices. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Not Met: </>If the target is not met during the check, the current session will end early, and the final performance will be affected by a discount. Agreement levels can only be increased, not decreased;"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Distribution Agreement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>At the start, you will sign a regional distribution agreement and receive phased performance targets. After passing a fixed number of stations, the Chamber of Commerce will check your performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Met: </>Once the target is reached, you can choose to maintain the current agreement or upgrade it. Upgraded agreements have higher targets but provide stronger bonuses to cargo quantity and prices. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Not Met: </>If the target is not met during the check, the current session will end early, and the final performance will be affected by a discount. Agreement levels can only be increased, not decreased;",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Description:</>\nUse a Historical Beacon to make connections in the Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Connect:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Make Connections</> to enter the connection interface, then click Connect 1x/5x to perform a connection.\n<Assistant_Title2>Connection Cost:</>\nEach connection consumes one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Connect in the Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will appear.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-Shop-Secret Collection</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-General-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Fate's Gift</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through certain <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Connection]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Description:</>\nUse a Historical Beacon to make connections in the Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Connect:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Make Connections</> to enter the connection interface, then click Connect 1x/5x to perform a connection.\n<Assistant_Title2>Connection Cost:</>\nEach connection consumes one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Connect in the Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will appear.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-Shop-Secret Collection</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-General-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Fate's Gift</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through certain <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Connection]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>十战征途</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>参与10次四方联赛。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Ten-Battle Journey</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Participate in 10 Four-Way League matches.",
