    ["<Assistant_Title1>见证众神之战</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>参与众神之巅玩法后取得八强荣誉称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Witnessing the Battle of the Gods</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Top 8 honorary title after participating in the Peak of the Gods gameplay",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Unspoken Poem】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Unspoken Poem set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Unspoken Poem】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Unspoken Poem set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Green Field Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Green Field Journey outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Green Field Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Green Field Journey outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Shade Eyes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Shade Eyes. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Shade Eyes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Shade Eyes. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Highlight>Craft: </>Mist-light Draped Veil/Elegant Embroidery\nThe fabric is like clouds and mist, and also like the ending a lady is helpless to face but must eventually confront."] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mist-light Draped Veil/Elegant Embroidery\nThe fabric is like clouds and mist, and also like the ending a lady is helpless to face but must eventually confront.",
    ["02_结束音频性能分析"] = "02_End Audio Performance Analysis",
    ["May 23rd\n　　Neil said he has walked this path seven times.\n　　He said it three times along the way, but I don't believe it—if he really had walked it seven times, why wouldn't he even know how to set up a tent? I crouched behind him, watching him put the tent fabric on backward for the third time. Snow water seeped into my gloves, cold as if it were licking my bones.\n　　Fortunately, we set up the tent before dark.\n\nRemaining supplies:\nBread: 6 portions (Peggy prepared 18 lbs for us, divided into 8 portions)\nDried meat and sausages: 5 portions\nSugar: 1 jar\nButter: 4 blocks\nWine: 3 bottles (Wine: 3 bottles → 2 bottles (1 consumed for the evening celebration))\nWater: 5 bottles (Temporarily sufficient; can keep an eye out for water sources on the way)"] = "May 23rd\n　　Neil said he has walked this path seven times.\n　　He said it three times along the way, but I don't believe it—if he really had walked it seven times, why wouldn't he even know how to set up a tent? I crouched behind him, watching him put the tent fabric on backward for the third time. Snow water seeped into my gloves, cold as if it were licking my bones.\n　　Fortunately, we set up the tent before dark.\n\nRemaining supplies:\nBread: 6 portions (Peggy prepared 18 lbs for us, divided into 8 portions)\nDried meat and sausages: 5 portions\nSugar: 1 jar\nButter: 4 blocks\nWine: 3 bottles (Wine: 3 bottles → 2 bottles (1 consumed for the evening celebration))\nWater: 5 bottles (Temporarily sufficient; can keep an eye out for water sources on the way)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【End-Time Hunt】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>End-Time Hunt</> is a <Assistant_Property1>500-player free-for-all</> field gameplay taking place in the <Assistant_Red>City of Dragon Hunting</>. You can defeat supernatural creatures or hostile players to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> and Rank Points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</>Submit <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> to the <Assistant_System>Hunting Butler</> to advance the hunting progress and unlock stage rewards. Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting and will be automatically invalidated and cleared upon leaving.\n<Assistant_Title2>Hunting Time:</>The gameplay is open all day; daily <Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</> is Hunting Time, with additional sessions on Saturday and Sunday from <Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>. During Hunting Time, the amount of Rank Points involved in killing or being killed is doubled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Royal City Event:</>10 minutes after the start of the Friday night Hunting Time, i.e., <Assistant_Red>19:10</>, the Dragon - Projection will refresh in the center of the Royal City; outside of Friday night sessions, the Royal City Guardian will refresh 10 minutes after the start of other Hunting Times.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Settlement:</>The killer and up to 29 team members who meet the assist conditions participate in the reward settlement. Scarlet Relics are distributed equally among the participants, with remainders prioritized to the killer, and the rest randomly distributed among other participants.\n<Assistant_Title2>Plunder Rules:</>The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the proportion of Scarlet Relics that can be plundered; for every 500 fragments increased, the plunder proportion increases accordingly.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rank Rules:</>When your rank is below <Assistant_Red>Count Tier 1</>, you will not lose Rank Points when killed. Rank Points obtained by killing players will be reduced according to rules during 01:00—08:00 daily and when repeatedly killing the same target within a short period.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[前往终末猎杀]|1250342}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【End-Time Hunt】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>End-Time Hunt</> is a <Assistant_Property1>500-player free-for-all</> field gameplay taking place in the <Assistant_Red>City of Dragon Hunting</>. You can defeat supernatural creatures or hostile players to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> and Rank Points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</>Submit <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> to the <Assistant_System>Hunting Butler</> to advance the hunting progress and unlock stage rewards. Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting and will be automatically invalidated and cleared upon leaving.\n<Assistant_Title2>Hunting Time:</>The gameplay is open all day; daily <Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</> is Hunting Time, with additional sessions on Saturday and Sunday from <Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>. During Hunting Time, the amount of Rank Points involved in killing or being killed is doubled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Royal City Event:</>10 minutes after the start of the Friday night Hunting Time, i.e., <Assistant_Red>19:10</>, the Dragon - Projection will refresh in the center of the Royal City; outside of Friday night sessions, the Royal City Guardian will refresh 10 minutes after the start of other Hunting Times.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Settlement:</>The killer and up to 29 team members who meet the assist conditions participate in the reward settlement. Scarlet Relics are distributed equally among the participants, with remainders prioritized to the killer, and the rest randomly distributed among other participants.\n<Assistant_Title2>Plunder Rules:</>The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the proportion of Scarlet Relics that can be plundered; for every 500 fragments increased, the plunder proportion increases accordingly.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rank Rules:</>When your rank is below <Assistant_Red>Count Tier 1</>, you will not lose Rank Points when killed. Rank Points obtained by killing players will be reduced according to rules during 01:00—08:00 daily and when repeatedly killing the same target within a short period.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to End-Time Hunt]|1250342}",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>接受了<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战，决斗将在[今天%s]开启！"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [today %s]!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【True Sight Crystal Ball】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the True Sight Crystal Ball. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【True Sight Crystal Ball】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the True Sight Crystal Ball. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<Highlight_L>[%s]</>接受了我方俱乐部发起的宣战，开战时间为<Highlight_L>[今天%s]</>！"] = "<Highlight_L>[%s]</> has accepted the war declared by our club. The start time is <Highlight_L>[Today %s]</>!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Old Days Legacy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Old Days Legacy set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Old Days Legacy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Old Days Legacy set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<DecH>Craft: </>Ivory Satin Finish\nWhen the gates of the court stables open once more, neither one's pace nor one's poise shall falter in the slightest."] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Ivory Satin Finish\nWhen the gates of the court stables open once more, neither one's pace nor one's poise shall falter in the slightest.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【家族-等级规则】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>默契值与等级：</>完成家族每周任务可获取默契值提升家族等级，每周默契值获取上限为<Assistant_Red>2000点</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>每周任务：</>家族成员组队参与对应玩法可获得默契值。\n    <Assistant_Property1>高倍默契值：</>每个任务当周前若干次完成时获得，超出次数后仅获得普通倍率。\n    <Assistant_Property1>刷新时间：</>任务每周刷新。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[家族]|665}，{SendAnswer:[家族-契约方式]|666}，{SendAnswer:[家族-奖励说明]|667}，{SendAnswer:[家族-展台规则]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Level Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rapport Value and Level: </>Complete weekly family quests to gain Rapport Value and increase the family level. The weekly cap for Rapport Value is <Assistant_Red>2000 points</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Quests: </>Family members team up to participate in corresponding activities to earn Rapport Value.\n    <Assistant_Property1>High-Multiplier Rapport Value: </>Earned when completing each quest for the first few times during the week; after exceeding this limit, only the normal multiplier is earned.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Refresh Time: </>Quests refresh weekly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Covenant Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Description]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Display Stand Rules]|669}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Star Marrow Crystal Ball】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor display stand component\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Star Marrow Crystal Ball display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Star Marrow Crystal Ball】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor display stand component\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Star Marrow Crystal Ball display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Land Without Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Outside the factory, a worker seems to be cursing something...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[廷根(868,940)]|5929;26008;-2479;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> Rove </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Land Without Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Outside the factory, a worker seems to be cursing something...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Тинген(868,940)]|5929;26008;-2479;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> Rove </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["Level 66 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard"] = "Level 66 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["0: (Default) Fire all bullets at every object in Target \n 1: (Queue execution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects from the Target list in order until the Target list is exhausted or bullets are exhausted \n 2: (Random distribution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects randomly from the Target list (can be selected repeatedly) until bullets are exhausted."] = "0: (Default) Fire all bullets at every object in Target \n 1: (Queue execution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects from the Target list in order until the Target list is exhausted or bullets are exhausted \n 2: (Random distribution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects randomly from the Target list (can be selected repeatedly) until bullets are exhausted.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Squat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Squat. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Squat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Squat. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>装备强化</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n\n1、每个部位都可以通过消耗强化材料进行强化，最多强化至8阶。\n\n2、每个阶段都可以提升角色的属性能力，提升的属性展示在装备的基础属性部分。\n\n3、更换装备时，强化效果无损转移；未穿戴对应部位装备时，强化效果不生效。\n\n4、每个部位的强化阶段同时达到对应要求后，将激活强化套装，进一步提升角色能力。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>道具获取：</>强化材料可通过报销商店兑换、开启世界冒险/以战养战/社交馈赠秘宝获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Equipment Strengthening </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </>\n\n 1. Each slot can be strengthened by consuming strengthening materials, up to a maximum of Tier 8. \n\n 2. Each stage increases the character's attribute capabilities, which are displayed in the base attribute section of the equipment. \n\n 3. When changing equipment, the strengthening effect is transferred without loss; the effect is not active if the corresponding slot is empty. \n\n 4. Once the strengthening stages of all slots reach the corresponding requirements, the strengthening set will be activated, further enhancing character capabilities. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Acquisition: </> Strengthening materials can be obtained via Reimbursement Shop exchanges or by opening World Adventure/War-forged/Social Gift treasures.",
    ["Insufficient <Highlight>【%s】</>. Go to the mall to purchase?"] = "Insufficient <Highlight>【%s】</>. Go to the mall to purchase?",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Task\" u=\"guildTaskHelp=%s,%d,%s,%s,%s,%s\">点击帮助</>"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Task\" u=\"guildTaskHelp=%s,%d,%s,%s,%s,%s\"> Click for help </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The Unfinished Letter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a small house on the old street of the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era,\" advance to Sequence 9, go to {Location:[Tingen(1294,979)]|29459;-2027;-2121;2;5200002;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Edith</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Unfinished Letter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a small house on the old street of the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era,\" advance to Последовательность 9, go to {Location:[Тинген(1294,979)]|29459;-2027;-2121;2;5200002;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Edith</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Half-Bloomed Flower】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Half-Bloomed Flower; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Half-Bloomed Flower】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Half-Bloomed Flower; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Projection Fragments</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Introduction: </>\n These are points obtained when {SendAnswer:Making Connections| 554 } results in obtaining a duplicate {SendAnswer:Connection| 550 }. They can be used to exchange for various rewards in the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop| 558 }. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Obtain: </>\n When making connections and obtaining a duplicate connection, you can receive Projection Fragments. The higher the quality of the duplicate connection, the more you receive. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Consume: </>\n You can open the <Assistant_System>Connection Shop</> via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to exchange for corresponding items. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Shop]|558}, {SendAnswer:[Making Connections]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Projection Fragments</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Introduction: </>\n These are points obtained when {SendAnswer:Making Connections| 554 } results in obtaining a duplicate {SendAnswer:Connection| 550 }. They can be used to exchange for various rewards in the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop| 558 }. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Obtain: </>\n When making connections and obtaining a duplicate connection, you can receive Projection Fragments. The higher the quality of the duplicate connection, the more you receive. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Consume: </>\n You can open the <Assistant_System>Connection Shop</> via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to exchange for corresponding items. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Shop]|558}, {SendAnswer:[Making Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【银蔷薇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得银蔷薇，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Silver Rose】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Silver Rose. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
