    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾光垂纱・优雅刺绣\n织物如云如雾，也像一位女士无可奈何却终将面对的结局。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mist Light Draping Gauze - Elegant Embroidery \n The fabric is like clouds and mist, and also like the ending that a lady is helpless to face but will eventually face.",
