    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen Times】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Tingen Times set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Тинген Times】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Тинген Times set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
