    ["64装等橙色竞技武器箱"] = "Level 64 Orange Competition Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The Twelfth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A blizzard is approaching, and a man claiming to be a guide knows a shortcut down the mountain...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountain Range (294,449)]|19910;34435;652;2;5200086;0} and speak with the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Twelfth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A blizzard is approaching, and a man claiming to be a guide knows a shortcut down the mountain...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountain Range (294,449)]|19910;34435;652;2;5200086;0} and speak with the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["......Knowledge has guided me here."] = "......Knowledge has guided me here.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Seems quite interesting, should I take a look?)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Seems quite interesting, should I take a look?)</>",
    ["No. 3 - Zouteland Shooting Club"] = "No. 3 - Zouteland Shooting Club",
    ["1. Each dungeon will receive a certain number of <Highlight>Crusade Reward Counts</> every week. Players will increase their <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> after killing the dungeon boss. \n2. After the <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> is fully accumulated, you can claim a piece of <Highlight>unowned Imprint Equipment or cosmetic reward</> from the current dungeon. \n3. After claiming, the corresponding progress will deduct the number of counts required for claiming the reward. \n4. Imprint Equipment Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Dungeons with shared counts share Crusade Reward Counts, and each boss adds 1 count per week. \n5. Cosmetic Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Each dungeon adds 2 counts per boss per week, and Normal and Hard difficulties share counts."] = "1. Each dungeon will receive a certain number of <Highlight>Crusade Reward Counts</> every week. Players will increase their <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> after killing the dungeon boss. \n2. After the <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> is fully accumulated, you can claim a piece of <Highlight>unowned Imprint Equipment or cosmetic reward</> from the current dungeon. \n3. After claiming, the corresponding progress will deduct the number of counts required for claiming the reward. \n4. Imprint Equipment Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Dungeons with shared counts share Crusade Reward Counts, and each boss adds 1 count per week. \n5. Cosmetic Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Each dungeon adds 2 counts per boss per week, and Normal and Hard difficulties share counts.",
    ["<P_Heart>(I can't lead the stalker back. That would put Melissa and the others in danger!)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I can't lead the stalker back. That would put Melissa and the others in danger!)</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·转腕】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·转腕，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Wrist Turn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand action rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand · Wrist Turn. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<InvHighlight>歌谣仅供参考，谨慎尝试。</>\n\n                       远航去\n                       漩涡里\n                 狂暴波涛寂静心\n\n                       勇激荡\n                       狂翻涌\n                 海浪深处存安宁\n\n                       闪闪鳞光\n                       照耀浪花\n                 梦境汹涌永远的家\n\n                       怒吼求救\n                       无奈放纵\n                 海风味的一抹乡愁"] = "<InvHighlight> The ballad is for reference only; proceed with caution. </> \n \n Sailing away \n Into the whirlpool \n Violent waves, silent heart \n \n Bravely surging \n Wildly churning \n Peace exists in the depths of the sea waves \n \n Glittering scales \n Shining on the spray \n Dreams surging, an eternal home \n \n Roaring for help \n Helplessly indulging \n A touch of homesickness with the scent of sea breeze",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>命运交汇</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>与任意好友的好友度达到命运交汇"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Fate Intersection</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Fate Intersection with any friend",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>我的书呆子哥哥</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-时代百态\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成百态《送你一朵塞维亚菊》。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>My Bookworm Brother</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Life in the Era\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the Life in the Era quest \"Sending You a Sevia Daisy\".",
    ["55品武器箱"] = "Level 55 Weapon Box",
    ["1 Stamina restored after <Highlight>%s</>, use items to restore stamina quickly"] = "1 Stamina restored after <Highlight>%s</>, use items to restore stamina quickly",
    ["76级6人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 76 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【晨雾仙踪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得晨雾仙踪套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Morning Mist Fairy Trail】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Morning Mist Fairy Trail outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Appearance gifts obtained are bound items."] = "1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Appearance gifts obtained are bound items.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friendliness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends - Private Chat - Heart icon in the top right corner</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition Source: </>Teaming up with friends to defeat 1 team/squad dungeon BOSS, teaming up to defeat a world BOSS, teaming up to complete 1 competitive activity, chatting privately with friends, completing 1 duo social action, or riding together can all increase Friendliness. You can also increase Friendliness by gifting social items and appearances.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friendliness Reset: </><Assistant_Red>Deleting or blocking a friend will clear the Friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered</>, so please proceed with caution.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friendliness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends - Private Chat - Heart icon in the top right corner</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition Source: </>Teaming up with friends to defeat 1 team/squad dungeon BOSS, teaming up to defeat a world BOSS, teaming up to complete 1 competitive activity, chatting privately with friends, completing 1 duo social action, or riding together can all increase Friendliness. You can also increase Friendliness by gifting social items and appearances.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friendliness Reset: </><Assistant_Red>Deleting or blocking a friend will clear the Friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered</>, so please proceed with caution.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Undercurrent Crisis】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Based on existing clues, split up with Leonard and Frye to assist in investigating the missing persons case transferred from the police department.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>46</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Level 45 Weapon Box, Primary Crimson Essence, Primary Berserk Potion, Intermediate Life Dew"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Undercurrent Crisis】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Based on existing clues, split up with Leonard and Frye to assist in investigating the missing persons case transferred from the police department.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>46</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Level 45 Weapon Box, Primary Crimson Essence, Primary Berserk Potion, Intermediate Life Dew",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【特剪·烈日】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得特剪·烈日，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装累计召唤解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Special Cut - Scorching Sun] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Special Cut - Scorching Sun; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </><Assistant_System> Unlocked via cumulative summons in Summon - Astral Strange Attire",
    ["1.准备视频"] = "1. Prepare Video",
    ["<Orange>Swipe the screen</> to rotate the item and search for <Orange>Investigation Clues</>."] = "<Orange>Swipe the screen</> to rotate the item and search for <Orange>Investigation Clues</>.",
    ["45级可解锁"] = "Unlocks at level 45",
    ["<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow."] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["45装等装备随机箱"] = "Level 45 Equipment Random Box",
    ["1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Voice rooms default to Free Speech mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the room is set to Host-Controlled Speech Permission or Speech Order mode, you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech modes, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, type, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar."] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Voice rooms default to Free Speech mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the room is set to Host-Controlled Speech Permission or Speech Order mode, you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech modes, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, type, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["<Letter_Highlight>采摘草药</>：在第三个月升日采摘铁筷子草，6镑。\n<Letter_Highlight>短期雇佣</>：雇佣一位有航海经验的保镖，为期一月，600镑。\n<Letter_Highlight>金梧桐区案件</>：本周金梧桐区发生一起恶性入室抢劫杀人案，提供相关线索者，一经核实有效，即可获得10镑奖励。\n<Letter_Highlight>通缉悬赏</>：通缉犯海盗格斯出现于廷根，每条有效线索5镑。\n<Letter_Highlight>寻狗启事</>：三日前爱犬维纳于水仙花街走丢，通体黑色面部白色，若有线索，重金酬谢！"] = "<Letter_Highlight> Pick Herbs </>: Pick Hellebore during the sunrise in the third month, 6 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Short-term Employment </>: Hire a bodyguard with sailing experience for one month, 600 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Golden Indus District Case </>: A vicious home invasion and murder occurred in the Golden Indus District this week. Anyone who provides relevant clues that are verified as effective will receive a 10-pound reward. \n <Letter_Highlight> Wanted Bounty </>: Wanted pirate Gus has appeared in Тинген. 5 pounds per effective clue. \n <Letter_Highlight> Lost Dog Notice </>: My beloved dog, Vina, went missing on Daffodil Street three days ago. She is all black with a white face. If you have any clues, a generous reward will be given!",
    ["1 Exit Guidance Camera"] = "1 Exit Guidance Camera",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Spirit Vision】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Function: </>Spirit Vision helps you discover important hidden information during exploration, including treasure chests, quest clues, and interactive puzzle points. \n<Assistant_Title2>2. Operation: </>During exploration, tap the Spirit Vision button to enter the Spirit Vision state. \n<Assistant_Title2>3. Applicable Scenarios: </>You can use Spirit Vision to assist exploration when exploring maps, searching for treasure chests, tracking quest targets, or solving environmental mechanisms. \n<Assistant_Title1>【Warm Tips】</>\nIf you encounter trouble finding targets, cannot continue exploring, or suspect hidden content nearby, try activating Spirit Vision to check the surrounding environment."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spirit Vision】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Function: </>Spirit Vision helps you discover important hidden information during exploration, including treasure chests, quest clues, and interactive puzzle points. \n<Assistant_Title2>2. Operation: </>During exploration, tap the Spirit Vision button to enter the Spirit Vision state. \n<Assistant_Title2>3. Applicable Scenarios: </>You can use Spirit Vision to assist exploration when exploring maps, searching for treasure chests, tracking quest targets, or solving environmental mechanisms. \n<Assistant_Title1>【Warm Tips】</>\nIf you encounter trouble finding targets, cannot continue exploring, or suspect hidden content nearby, try activating Spirit Vision to check the surrounding environment.",
    ["55装等金色武器箱"] = "Level 55 Gold Weapon Box",
    ["5230227 House of the Woman Seeking Help Plane"] = "5230227 House of the Woman Seeking Help Plane",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【庇佑者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件庇佑者，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Protector】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Protector display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<ChatTag_Profession>[Pathway]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Profession>[Pathway]</>",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>珍珠华饰\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Бэкланд; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Dividends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Dividends</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>You can claim Club dividend rewards once a week.\nClub dividend rewards are affected by the Club's activity level and your personal activity in the current Club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃津贴]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Dividends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Dividends</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>You can claim Club dividend rewards once a week.\nClub dividend rewards are affected by the Club's activity level and your personal activity in the current Club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["3问题"] = "3 questions",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Will's Ice Cream】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Will's Ice Cream. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain through <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Family</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Will's Ice Cream】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Will's Ice Cream. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain through <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Family</>.",
    ["44级6人本Boss普通"] = "Level 44 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<ChatTag_Server>[战略服]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Server>[Strategy Server]</>",
    ["<Highlight>躺赢</>中含有各类玩法，点击此处打开。"] = "<Highlight>Idle Win</> contains various gameplay modes; click here to open.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Greeting】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Greeting. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Greeting】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Greeting. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["<Highlight>许愿</>指定人脉后，可提升结交时获得对应人脉的概率。\n可许愿的人脉为可结交的传说人脉。\n许愿后，获得传说人脉时，获取许愿目标的概率提高到<Highlight>80%</>。如果未获取许愿目标，那下次获得的传说人脉必定为许愿目标。\n\n常驻结交中，<Highlight>每周</>可以生效<Highlight>2次</>许愿效果，周一重置。\n每当结交人脉<Highlight>110次</>，可额外获得一次许愿次数。该次数不会被重置，且消耗优先级低于每周重置的次数。"] = "<Highlight>Wishing</> for a designated Connection can increase the probability of obtaining the corresponding Connection during Socializing. \nThe Connections that can be wished for are Legendary Connections that can be socialized with. \nAfter Wishing, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of obtaining the Wish target increases to <Highlight>80%</>. If you do not obtain the Wish target, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be the Wish target. \n\nIn permanent Socializing, <Highlight>every week</> you can have <Highlight>2</> Wishing effects take effect, resetting on Monday. \nEvery <Highlight>110 Socializing attempts</>, you can obtain one additional Wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Glory of Battle-Hardened] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Competition gameplay accessory \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Glory of Battle-Hardened; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via Final Hunt auction"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Glory of Battle-Hardened] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Competition gameplay accessory \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Glory of Battle-Hardened; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via Final Hunt auction",
    ["2问题"] = "2 Questions",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand·Crossed Arms】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand·Crossed Arms. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand·Crossed Arms】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand·Crossed Arms. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的滋味】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>城市暗面玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得魔女的滋味套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>城市暗面悬赏值解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for City of Shadows gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Taste of the Witch set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via City of Shadows Bounty Value.",
    ["Level 4 - Abundant"] = "Level 4 - Abundant",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Slumber】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Slumber set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Slumber】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Slumber set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["The <Chat_Red> unknown target </>'s <Chat_Highlight> %s </> dealt <Chat_Highlight> %s </> <Chat_Highlight> %s </> to you."] = "The <Chat_Red> unknown target </>'s <Chat_Highlight> %s </> dealt <Chat_Highlight> %s </> <Chat_Highlight> %s </> to you.",
    ["<DecH> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\""] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Бэкланд; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["2、合并后，申请方的剩余俱乐部资金全部并入接受方俱乐部，俱乐部名、俱乐部等级、建筑等级等俱乐部信息以接收的俱乐部为准，申请方的俱乐部成员被迁移至目标俱乐部后，不再拥有职位，全部成为普通会员，原俱乐部学徒在现俱乐部仍然为学徒。"] = "2. After the merger, the remaining Club funds of the applicant Club are merged into the receiving Club. Club information such as Club name, Club level, and building levels will be based on the receiving Club. After the applicant Club's members are migrated to the target Club, they will no longer hold positions and will all become ordinary members. Original Club Apprentices remain Apprentices in the new Club.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【今夜琴声温柔】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>受邀回到黑荆棘喝咖啡，却听说老尼尔的人生中，曾有一个淡绿色的春天。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>53级</>后，在任务栏可接取支线任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：金纺线、绑定金镑、展台摆件、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gentle Piano Music Tonight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Invited back to Blackthorn to have coffee, only to hear that there was once a pale green spring in Old Neil's life.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 53</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Gold Thread, Bound Gold Pound, Display Ornament, Title",
    ["<P_Heart>（吉瑞尔出海回来了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Girel is back from sea?)</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Buildings and Funds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Building Upgrade</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250318}\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Funds: </>Club Activity Allowance and Club activities.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fund Description: </>Can be used for Club building upgrades to improve Club strength, benefits, and scale.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Fund Consumption: </>Building upgrades consume Club funds and require a certain amount of time. Each building has corresponding level-up effects, and other buildings cannot exceed the level of the Council Hall.\n<Assistant_Title2>Building upgrade caps are gradually opened based on server time:</>Level 3: After 8:00 AM on the 7th day of server launch\nLevel 4: After 8:00 AM on the 14th day of server launch\nLevel 5: After 8:00 AM on the 21st day of server launch\nLevel 6: After 8:00 AM on the 30th day of server launch\nLevel 7: After 8:00 AM on the 45th day of server launch\nLevel 8: After 8:00 AM on the 60th day of server launch \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Position]|1402}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Buildings and Funds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Building Upgrade</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250318}\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Funds: </>Club Activity Allowance and Club activities.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fund Description: </>Can be used for Club building upgrades to improve Club strength, benefits, and scale.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Fund Consumption: </>Building upgrades consume Club funds and require a certain amount of time. Each building has corresponding level-up effects, and other buildings cannot exceed the level of the Council Hall.\n<Assistant_Title2>Building upgrade caps are gradually opened based on server time:</>Level 3: After 8:00 AM on the 7th day of server launch\nLevel 4: After 8:00 AM on the 14th day of server launch\nLevel 5: After 8:00 AM on the 21st day of server launch\nLevel 6: After 8:00 AM on the 30th day of server launch\nLevel 7: After 8:00 AM on the 45th day of server launch\nLevel 8: After 8:00 AM on the 60th day of server launch \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Position]|1402}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}",
    ["0: \"Default to the line connecting the first offset point to the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\"."] = "0: \"Default to the line connecting the first offset point to the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Aftertaste of the Witch] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Aftertaste of the Witch set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Aftertaste of the Witch] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Aftertaste of the Witch set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level",
    ["3号佐特兰\r\n射击俱乐部\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"10\">Zouteland Shooting Club</>"] = "No. 3 Zouteland\nShoot Club\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"10\">Zouteland Shooting Club</>",
    ["<Highlight> Craft: </> Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost."] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost.",
    ["<ChatTag_Team>[联盟]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Team>[Alliance]</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>猎杀！荣耀授勋</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-竞逐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>终末猎杀达到公爵段位"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hunt! Honorary Investiture</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach the Duke rank in Final Hunt",
    ["60 Item Level Gold Equipment"] = "60 Item Level Gold Equipment",
    ["<Highlight_L>宣战告急</>：我方俱乐部成员<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>在<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[霍纳奇斯山脉(%d,%d) 分线%s]</>惨遭<Reminder_Red>[%s]</>俱乐部的<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>击败，这是对本俱乐部的公然挑衅！点击前往支援！"] = "<Highlight_L> War Emergency </>: Our club member <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> was defeated by <HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> of the <Reminder_Red>[%s]</> club at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[Hornacis Mountain Range (%d, %d) Sub-channel %s]</>. This is an open provocation to our club! Click to provide support!",
    ["4件随机装备 + 20金币"] = "4 random Equipment + 20 Gold Coins",
    ["<Chat_Aim> Looking for DPS </>"] = "<Chat_Aim> Looking for DPS </>",
    ["2049筛npc&玩家滞涩"] = "2049 Filter NPC & Player Stagnation",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>时光的誓约</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>与任意好友的好友度达到1314"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Covenant of Time</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach a friendship level of 1314 with any friend",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>命运的初次回响</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-趣味\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>与任意一位人脉好感达到3级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>First Echo of Fate</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Leisure - Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Favorability Level 3 with any contact",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【风尚沙龙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>在鲁恩王国的上流社会,对时尚的品鉴是身份与数养的象征。绅士淑女们对服饰有着苛刻追求。根据场合、身份与季节,塔配得体的眼装,方能在社交圈中贏得尊重。通过品鉴挑战,展现你的审美,在上流圈声名鹊起。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找风尚沙龙</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【风尚沙龙】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【风尚沙龙】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 时装搭配PK</>\n与NPC对话后开启挑战，可以根据风格与评分进行搭配，PK胜利获得对应奖励。\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n风尚沙龙不会计入秩序世界的完成度哟~"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fashion Salon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>In the high society of the Loen Kingdom, an appreciation for fashion is a symbol of status and cultivation. Gentlemen and ladies have exacting standards for their attire. By coordinating appropriate outfits according to the occasion, status, and season, you can earn respect in social circles. Show off your aesthetic sense through appreciation challenges and make a name for yourself in high society.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Fashion Salon</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Fashion Salon] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Fashion Salon] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Fashion Coordination PK</>\nStart the challenge after speaking with the NPC; you can coordinate based on style and ratings, and winning the PK will grant corresponding rewards.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\nThe Fashion Salon does not count towards the completion progress of the Orderly World~",
    ["2049不可选中"] = "2049 Untargetable",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Beginner</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 1"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Beginner</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 1",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Play Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Play voice rooms default to Host-Set Speech Order mode; you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Heartbeat Signal: </>Players on the mic sequence automatically gain guest status; the player on Mic 1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their 'Light Up' status. You can view the current speaking and 'Light Up' status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner of the room.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech order in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information, extend the duration of a permanent room, or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Play Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Play voice rooms default to Host-Set Speech Order mode; you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Heartbeat Signal: </>Players on the mic Последовательность automatically gain guest status; the player on Mic 1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their 'Light Up' status. You can view the current speaking and 'Light Up' status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner of the room.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech order in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information, extend the duration of a permanent room, or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时虫宝藏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>“恶作剧之神”阿蒙藏有时之虫的宝藏散落在各处，触碰时之裂隙能唤出阿蒙的谜题。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找时虫宝藏</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【时虫宝藏】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【时虫宝藏】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 开启寻宝</>\n与时之裂隙互动，并完成与单片眼镜虚影的对话后，即可开启寻宝挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 收集宝藏</>\n根据指引寻找散落的宝箱，收集全部宝箱后即可开启最终宝箱，获得奖励。\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n<Assistant_Red>灵视</>可以帮助发现隐藏的宝箱，建议在寻找过程中使用哦~\n部分隐藏宝箱需要完成挑战后才能开启。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Worm of Time Treasure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>The \"God of Mischief\" Amon has hidden treasures of Worms of Time scattered everywhere. Touching a Rift of Time can summon Amon's puzzles.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Worm of Time Treasure</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Worm of Time Treasure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Worm of Time Treasure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Starting the Treasure Hunt</>\nInteract with the Rift of Time and complete the conversation with the monocle phantom shadow to start the treasure hunt challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Collecting the Treasure</>\nFollow the guidance to find the scattered treasure chests; after collecting all of them, you can open the final treasure chest to receive your reward.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\n<Assistant_Red>spirit vision</> can help you discover hidden treasure chests; it is recommended to use it during your search~\nSome hidden treasure chests can only be opened after completing a challenge.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Hunter's Harvest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 200 Victory Points in Final Hunt rank"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Охотник's Harvest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 200 Victory Points in Final Hunt rank",
