    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friend List】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Limit: </>The limit for friends on the current server is 200, and cross-server friends have an independent group with a limit of 50.\n<Assistant_Title2>Visibility Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Friends - Settings (Top Right)</>, you can set the visibility range of your online status. You can choose from four states: Visible to All, Invisible to All, Invisible to Specific People, or Partially Visible. You can also adjust visibility and invisibility ranges in the settings. If there are players in a group chat who are not your friends, this visibility setting will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Groups: </><Assistant_System>Below Menu - Friends</>, click <Assistant_System>Create Group</> to create custom friend groups; you can create up to 6 groups. After creating a group, you can sort and quickly delete them via <Assistant_System>Manage Groups</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Members: </>This group list displays current Club members who are not your friends by default.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friend List】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Limit: </>The limit for friends on the current server is 200, and cross-server friends have an independent group with a limit of 50.\n<Assistant_Title2>Visibility Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Friends - Settings (Top Right)</>, you can set the visibility range of your online status. You can choose from four states: Visible to All, Invisible to All, Invisible to Specific People, or Partially Visible. You can also adjust visibility and invisibility ranges in the settings. If there are players in a group chat who are not your friends, this visibility setting will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Groups: </><Assistant_System>Below Menu - Friends</>, click <Assistant_System>Create Group</> to create custom friend groups; you can create up to 6 groups. After creating a group, you can sort and quickly delete them via <Assistant_System>Manage Groups</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Members: </>This group list displays current Club members who are not your friends by default.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete and Block]|1412}",
