    ["<Highlight> Craft: </> Emerald Brocade · Pearl Ornament · Elegant Indoor Skirt \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\""] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Emerald Brocade · Pearl Ornament · Elegant Indoor Skirt \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Бэкланд; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["1. There is a weekly cap on Conquest Prestige acquisition, which can be accumulated for two weeks; \n2. Conquest Prestige obtained through the strategic server's Final Hunt has a weekly cap and cannot be accumulated; \n3. After equipping the ring \"Law Decree Page (Head),\" you will receive additional Conquest Prestige when gaining War Merit. This method of obtaining Conquest Prestige does not count towards the cap."] = "1. There is a weekly cap on Conquest Prestige acquisition, which can be accumulated for two weeks; \n2. Conquest Prestige obtained through the strategic server's Final Hunt has a weekly cap and cannot be accumulated; \n3. After equipping the ring \"Law Decree Page (Head),\" you will receive additional Conquest Prestige when gaining War Merit. This method of obtaining Conquest Prestige does not count towards the cap.",
