    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Heart Sugar Cookie】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Heart Sugar Cookie. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Heart Sugar Cookie】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Heart Sugar Cookie. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["<M_Orange>%s </> Club welcomes you! \n· After joining a club, you can participate in special gameplay every day. \n· You can obtain exclusive club territory. \n· You can also lead members to participate in leagues and win the highest glory. \n· Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation and activity pathway participant limits. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in club activities; reserve members are the reserve force of the club and cannot participate in some club activities. You can maintain activity and contact management to be promoted to an official member."] = "<M_Orange>%s </> Club welcomes you! \n· After joining a club, you can participate in special gameplay every day. \n· You can obtain exclusive club territory. \n· You can also lead members to participate in leagues and win the highest glory. \n· Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation and activity pathway participant limits. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in club activities; reserve members are the reserve force of the club and cannot participate in some club activities. You can maintain activity and contact management to be promoted to an official member.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friend List】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Limit: </>The limit for friends on the current server is 200, and cross-server friends have an independent group with a limit of 50.\n<Assistant_Title2>Visibility Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Friends - Settings (Top Right)</>, you can set the visibility range of your online status. You can choose from four states: Visible to All, Invisible to All, Invisible to Specific People, or Partially Visible. You can also adjust visibility and invisibility ranges in the settings. If there are players in a group chat who are not your friends, this visibility setting will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Groups: </><Assistant_System>Below Menu - Friends</>, click <Assistant_System>Create Group</> to create custom friend groups; you can create up to 6 groups. After creating a group, you can sort and quickly delete them via <Assistant_System>Manage Groups</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Members: </>This group list displays current Club members who are not your friends by default.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete and Block]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friend List】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Limit: </>The limit for friends on the current server is 200, and cross-server friends have an independent group with a limit of 50.\n<Assistant_Title2>Visibility Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Friends - Settings (Top Right)</>, you can set the visibility range of your online status. You can choose from four states: Visible to All, Invisible to All, Invisible to Specific People, or Partially Visible. You can also adjust visibility and invisibility ranges in the settings. If there are players in a group chat who are not your friends, this visibility setting will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Groups: </><Assistant_System>Below Menu - Friends</>, click <Assistant_System>Create Group</> to create custom friend groups; you can create up to 6 groups. After creating a group, you can sort and quickly delete them via <Assistant_System>Manage Groups</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Members: </>This group list displays current Club members who are not your friends by default.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete and Block]|1412}",
