    ["<Assistant_Title1>【剧情模式下外观隐藏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统设置：</>菜单-设置-视角-剧情模式{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>系统介绍：</>剧情模式下可以隐藏部分大型外观：翅膀、环身、肩饰。可在<Highlight>设置-视角-剧情模式-剧情模式下大型外观显示</>中设置开启和关闭\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[剧情模式]|1323}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hide Appearance in Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings: </>Menu - Settings - View - Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In Story Mode, you can hide certain large-scale appearances: wings, body rings, and shoulder ornaments. You can set this to enable or disable in <Highlight>Settings - View - Story Mode - Display Large Appearances in Story Mode</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Story Mode]|1323}",
    ["<Highlight>05时23分38秒</>后系统将自动分配并确认"] = "System will automatically assign and confirm after <Highlight>05:23:38</>",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>香槟金属・手工镶嵌\n由鲁恩顶级珠宝商推出的化装舞会面饰，据说灵感来自于佛尔思·沃尔女士那篇患者面部开花的恐怖小说。当然，他们做了不少美化。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Champagne Metal & Hand-Inlaid\nA masquerade mask launched by a top Loen jeweler, said to be inspired by Ms. Fors Wall's horror novel about a patient whose face blooms with flowers. Of course, they made quite a few aesthetic adjustments.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Scoring Rules】</>\nPlayers will accumulate scores based on the performance of their projections on the battlefield:\nAccording to the survival ranking, the top three projections receive <Assistant_Red>60, 40, 30</> points respectively. \nFor every other projection that falls, your own projection gains <Assistant_Red>3</> points, \nand killing other projections grants <Assistant_Red>5</> points.\nPlayers must deploy at least <Assistant_Red>8</> projections to be eligible for rewards. After the match, those with excellent total scores and outstanding projection data will receive additional <Assistant_Property1>Title</> rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl-Gameplay Rules]|9}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Scoring Rules】</>\nPlayers will accumulate scores based on the performance of their projections on the battlefield:\nAccording to the survival ranking, the top three projections receive <Assistant_Red>60, 40, 30</> points respectively. \nFor every other projection that falls, your own projection gains <Assistant_Red>3</> points, \nand killing other projections grants <Assistant_Red>5</> points.\nPlayers must deploy at least <Assistant_Red>8</> projections to be eligible for rewards. After the match, those with excellent total scores and outstanding projection data will receive additional <Assistant_Property1>Title</> rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl-Gameplay Rules]|9}",
