    ["<Assistant_Title1>【无暗十字】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>首充奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得无暗十字，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>首次充值奖励"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cross of No Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>First-top-up reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Cross of No Darkness. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>First-top-up reward",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蝶之吻】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蝶之吻，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Butterfly Kiss】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Butterfly Kiss. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["<Highlight> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World Creature, the Meow Thief enlightened by the \"Orange Light\" \n (Actively wiggling) (Crawling brightly and moderately) (Advancing generously) \n (Floating with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathing in sunlight) "] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World Creature, the Meow Thief enlightened by the \"Orange Light\" \n (Actively wiggling) (Crawling brightly and moderately) (Advancing generously) \n (Floating with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathing in sunlight)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Bloody Coronation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Bloody Prince rank in Dominator's Clash"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Bloody Coronation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Bloody Prince rank in Dominator's Clash",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Nightingale Silver Whistle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Plot Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Nightingale Silver Whistle. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via the Dreams Come True side quest"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Nightingale Silver Whistle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Plot Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Nightingale Silver Whistle. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via the Dreams Come True side quest",
    ["1. <Highlight>默契值和等级：</>完成家族每周任务可获取默契值提升家族等级，每周默契值获取上限为<Highlight>2000点</>。\n2. <Highlight>每周任务：</>家族成员组队参与对应玩法可获得默契值。每个任务在当周前<Highlight>若干次</>完成可获得<Highlight>高倍默契值</>，超出高倍次数后只可获得普通默契值加成，任务<Highlight>每周刷新</>。"] = "1. <Highlight> Rapport and Level: </> Complete weekly Family quests to gain Rapport and increase the Family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Highlight> 2000 points </>. \n 2. <Highlight> Weekly Quests: </> Family members can form teams to participate in corresponding gameplay to earn Rapport. Completing each quest for the first <Highlight> several times </> in the current week grants <Highlight> high-multiplier Rapport </>. After exceeding the high-multiplier count, only standard Rapport bonuses can be obtained. Quests <Highlight> refresh weekly </>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【好友-好友列表】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>好友上限：</>本服好友上限200个，跨服好友拥有独立的分组，上限为50个。\n<Assistant_Title2>范围设置：</><Assistant_System>好友-右上角设置</>可以设置在线状态可见范围，可选择全部在线、全部隐身、对谁隐身、部分可见4个状态。并可以在设置中，调整可见范围和隐身范围。若群聊中有非好友关系的玩家，则该范围设置不生效。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友分组：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友</>下方，点击<Assistant_System>创建分组</>可以创建自定义好友分组，最多可创建6个分组。创建分组后，可以通过<Assistant_System>管理分组</>进行排序和快捷删除操作。\n<Assistant_Title2>俱乐部成员：</>此分组列表默认显示非好友关系的当前俱乐部成员。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}，{SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}，{SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}，{SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}，{SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friend List】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Limit: </>The friend limit for this server is 200. Cross-server friends have a separate group with a limit of 50.\n<Assistant_Title2>Visibility Settings: </><Assistant_System>Friends - Settings in the top right corner</>You can set the visibility of your online status. There are 4 available states: All Online, All Invisibility, Invisible to Specific Players, and Partially Visible. You can also adjust the visibility and invisibility ranges in the settings. If there are players in a group chat who are not on your friend list, these visibility settings will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Groups: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>At the bottom, click <Assistant_System>Create Group</> to create custom friend groups. You can create up to 6 groups. After creating a group, you can use <Assistant_System>Manage Groups</> to sort or quickly delete them.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Members: </>This group list displays current Club members who are not on your friend list by default.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Becoming a Mushroom】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\", advance to Sequence 9, head to {Location:[金秋湖(358,89)]|25856;-1082;192;2;5200085;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Puffball </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Becoming a Mushroom】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\", advance to Последовательность 9, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(358,89)]|25856;-1082;192;2;5200085;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Puffball </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【社交·喝咖啡】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>每周玩法奖励动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得社交·喝咖啡，可点击<Assistant_System>动作表情</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-报销商店</>使用发票单据兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social·Drinking Coffee】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Weekly Gameplay Reward Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Social·Drinking Coffee. You can click <Assistant_System>Action Emotes</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop-General Merchandise-Reimbursement Shop</> using invoice receipts to redeem",
    ["5230216   QA资源测试模版关卡   位面"] = "5230216 QA Resource Test Template Level Plane",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Afternoon Coffee】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Gameplay Reward Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Afternoon Coffee set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay-Covenant</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Afternoon Coffee】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Gameplay Reward Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Afternoon Coffee set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay-Covenant</>",
