    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Hide Appearance in Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings: </>Menu - Settings - View - Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In Story Mode, you can hide certain large-scale appearances: wings, body rings, and shoulder ornaments. You can set this to enable or disable in <Highlight>Settings - View - Story Mode - Display Large Appearances in Story Mode</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Story Mode]|1323}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hide Appearance in Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings: </>Menu - Settings - View - Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In Story Mode, you can hide certain large-scale appearances: wings, body rings, and shoulder ornaments. You can set this to enable or disable in <Highlight>Settings - View - Story Mode - Display Large Appearances in Story Mode</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Story Mode]|1323}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Organization Selection and Attribute Point Allocation】</>\nWhen joining an organization, you will enter a process similar to TRPG character creation, mainly divided into three steps: <Assistant_Property1>Organization</>, <Assistant_Property1>Belief</>, <Assistant_Property1>Attributes</>.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Rule Description:</>\n1. After selecting an organization, its abilities and beliefs will be automatically determined.\n2. Each organization has recommended attribute schemes, which you can use directly.\n3. The base attribute value is at least 8 and at most 16, with a total of 44 attribute points.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Organization Attribute Description]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[How to Join an Organization]|1273}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Organization Selection and Attribute Point Allocation】</>\nWhen joining an organization, you will enter a process similar to TRPG character creation, mainly divided into three steps: <Assistant_Property1>Organization</>, <Assistant_Property1>Belief</>, <Assistant_Property1>Attributes</>.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Rule Description:</>\n1. After selecting an organization, its abilities and beliefs will be automatically determined.\n2. Each organization has recommended attribute schemes, which you can use directly.\n3. The base attribute value is at least 8 and at most 16, with a total of 44 attribute points.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Organization Attribute Description]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[How to Join an Organization]|1273}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the Friends interface, you can search for, add, and manage friends, view friend personal information and online status, and perform operations such as private chatting and gifting.\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, enter a character nickname or numeric ID to search for friends on the current server or cross-server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Requests: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request information. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, the system automatically recommends friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Pop-up Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings - Social - Information Settings</>, you can manage whether to display friend request pop-ups.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250030}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>In the Friends interface, you can search for, add, and manage friends, view friend personal information and online status, and perform operations such as private chatting and gifting.\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, enter a character nickname or numeric ID to search for friends on the current server or cross-server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Requests: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request information. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, the system automatically recommends friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Pop-up Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings - Social - Information Settings</>, you can manage whether to display friend request pop-ups.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete and Block]|1412}",
