    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>友好的灵界生物，经过“橘光”启蒙的喵呜贼\n（积极地扭动）（光明且适度地爬行）（大方地前进）\n（随风飘荡）（脚步轻盈）（沐浴阳光） "] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World Creature, the Meow Thief enlightened by the \"Orange Light\" \n (Actively wiggling) (Crawling brightly and moderately) (Advancing generously) \n (Floating with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathing in sunlight)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Positions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>President: </>The President is the leader of the club, holding the highest authority and capable of representing the club in handling all internal management and diplomatic rights. \n<Assistant_Title2>Vice President: </>The Vice President is an important position that supports the President, holding high-level authority second only to the President. They can act on behalf of the President to exercise certain internal management and diplomatic rights, and are appointed by the President. \n<Assistant_Title2>Director: </>A Director is a management position within the club, possessing a certain degree of management authority. They are appointed by the President, with a maximum of 3. \n<Assistant_Title2>Group Leader: </>A Group Leader is the core management for club activities, responsible for the appointment and dismissal of members within the group, organizing league teams, and other gameplay activities. Each club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 members. Members within a group automatically gain eligibility to participate in the league. \n<Assistant_Title2>Club Star: </>The Club Star is the face of the club, responsible for recruiting and welcoming new members. They are appointed by the President, with a maximum of 2. \n<Assistant_Title2>Full Member: </>Full Members are the backbone of the club and can participate in guild gameplay activities. <Assistant_Red>Some activities only support participation by Full Members</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Probationary Member: </>Probationary members are the reserve force of the club. They cannot participate in some guild gameplay. They can continue to work hard, stay active, and contact management to join as a member. \n<Assistant_Title2>Position Adjustment: </>Club members can concurrently hold management positions, group positions, and the Club Star position; management positions include President, Vice President, and Director. \n<Assistant_Title2>Permission Adjustment: </>The Club President can adjust the permission distribution for different positions in the permission adjustment interface. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Positions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>President: </>The President is the leader of the club, holding the highest authority and capable of representing the club in handling all internal management and diplomatic rights. \n<Assistant_Title2>Vice President: </>The Vice President is an important position that supports the President, holding high-level authority second only to the President. They can act on behalf of the President to exercise certain internal management and diplomatic rights, and are appointed by the President. \n<Assistant_Title2>Director: </>A Director is a management position within the club, possessing a certain degree of management authority. They are appointed by the President, with a maximum of 3. \n<Assistant_Title2>Group Leader: </>A Group Leader is the core management for club activities, responsible for the appointment and dismissal of members within the group, organizing league teams, and other gameplay activities. Each club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 members. Members within a group automatically gain eligibility to participate in the league. \n<Assistant_Title2>Club Star: </>The Club Star is the face of the club, responsible for recruiting and welcoming new members. They are appointed by the President, with a maximum of 2. \n<Assistant_Title2>Full Member: </>Full Members are the backbone of the club and can participate in guild gameplay activities. <Assistant_Red>Some activities only support participation by Full Members</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Probationary Member: </>Probationary members are the reserve force of the club. They cannot participate in some guild gameplay. They can continue to work hard, stay active, and contact management to join as a member. \n<Assistant_Title2>Position Adjustment: </>Club members can concurrently hold management positions, group positions, and the Club Star position; management positions include President, Vice President, and Director. \n<Assistant_Title2>Permission Adjustment: </>The Club President can adjust the permission distribution for different positions in the permission adjustment interface. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}",
