    ["<Assistant_Title1>Relationship</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nThere are special <Assistant_Property1>relationships</> between different Connections. Collect the corresponding {SendAnswer:人脉|550} to unlock/upgrade the relationship and refine your research into history. \nDepending on the level of <Assistant_Property2>Historical Research</>, you can obtain certain attribute bonuses. \nRelationships are divided into two categories: <Assistant_Property1>Co-op Relationship</> and <Assistant_Property1>Historical Relationship</>; both can improve Historical Research. \nFor Co-op Relationships, unlocking them can also provide certain ability enhancements for some Connections. A Connection Skill can only have one Co-op Relationship enhancement effect active at a time. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}, {SendAnswer:[人脉许愿]|555}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Relationship</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nThere are special <Assistant_Property1>relationships</> between different Connections. Collect the corresponding {SendAnswer:Connections|550} to unlock/upgrade the relationship and refine your research into history. \nDepending on the level of <Assistant_Property2>Historical Research</>, you can obtain certain attribute bonuses. \nRelationships are divided into two categories: <Assistant_Property1>Co-op Relationship</> and <Assistant_Property1>Historical Relationship</>; both can improve Historical Research. \nFor Co-op Relationships, unlocking them can also provide certain ability enhancements for some Connections. A Connection Skill can only have one Co-op Relationship enhancement effect active at a time. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Wishing]|555}",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>工作很繁琐，单据堆成山，还要应付各种关系。有时候加班到深夜，看着窗外的雾气，我会想……这一切值得吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighs)</> The work is very tedious, documents are piled up like a mountain, and I have to deal with all kinds of relationships. Sometimes working overtime until late at night, looking at the fog outside the window, I think... is all this worth it?",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部-俱乐部职位】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>会长：</>会长是俱乐部的领袖，拥有最高权限，可代表俱乐部行使各项内部管理和外交权利的处理。\n<Assistant_Title2>副会长：</>副会长是辅助会长的重要职位，拥有仅次于会长的高等权限，可代替会长行使部分内部管理权限和外交权利，由会长任命。\n<Assistant_Title2>理事：</>理事是俱乐部中的管理职位，拥有一定程度的管理权限，由会长任命，最多3位。\n<Assistant_Title2>组长：</>组长是俱乐部活动的核心管理，负责组内会员的任免、联赛组团等玩法活动组织。每个俱乐部下有4个分组，每个分组最多30人，分组内的成员自动获得联赛的参赛资格。\n<Assistant_Title2>俱乐部之星：</>俱乐部之星是俱乐部的门面，负责招募和招待新入会员，由会长任命，最多2位。\n<Assistant_Title2>正式会员：</>正式会员是俱乐部的中坚力量，可以参与公会内的玩法活动。<Assistant_Red>部分活动仅支持正式会员参赛</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>候补会员：</>候补是俱乐部的储备力量，有部分公会玩法无法参与，可继续努力，保持活跃联系管理加入会员。\n<Assistant_Title2>职位调整：</>俱乐部会员可以兼任管理职位、分组职位、俱乐部之星；管理职位包括会长、副会长、理事。\n<Assistant_Title2>权限调整：</>俱乐部会长可以在权限调整界面，调整不同职位的权限分配。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部建筑和资金]|1401}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Positions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>President: </>The President is the leader of the club, holding the highest authority and capable of representing the club in handling all internal management and diplomatic rights. \n<Assistant_Title2>Vice President: </>The Vice President is an important position that supports the President, holding high-level authority second only to the President. They can act on behalf of the President to exercise certain internal management and diplomatic rights, and are appointed by the President. \n<Assistant_Title2>Director: </>A Director is a management position within the club, possessing a certain degree of management authority. They are appointed by the President, with a maximum of 3. \n<Assistant_Title2>Group Leader: </>A Group Leader is the core management for club activities, responsible for the appointment and dismissal of members within the group, organizing league teams, and other gameplay activities. Each club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 members. Members within a group automatically gain eligibility to participate in the league. \n<Assistant_Title2>Club Star: </>The Club Star is the face of the club, responsible for recruiting and welcoming new members. They are appointed by the President, with a maximum of 2. \n<Assistant_Title2>Full Member: </>Full Members are the backbone of the club and can participate in guild gameplay activities. <Assistant_Red>Some activities only support participation by Full Members</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Probationary Member: </>Probationary members are the reserve force of the club. They cannot participate in some guild gameplay. They can continue to work hard, stay active, and contact management to join as a member. \n<Assistant_Title2>Position Adjustment: </>Club members can concurrently hold management positions, group positions, and the Club Star position; management positions include President, Vice President, and Director. \n<Assistant_Title2>Permission Adjustment: </>The Club President can adjust the permission distribution for different positions in the permission adjustment interface. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}",
