    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团选择与属性加点】</>\n加入教团时会进入类似跑团角色创建的流程，主要分为<Assistant_Property1>教团</>、<Assistant_Property1>信仰</>、<Assistant_Property1>属性</>三步。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>规则说明：</>\n1. 选择教团后，该教团的能力与信仰会自动确定。\n2. 每个教团有推荐属性方案，可以直接使用推荐加点。\n3. 属性基础值最低为 8，最高为 16，总属性点为 44。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团属性说明]|1275}，{SendAnswer:[如何加入教团]|1273}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Covenant Selection and Attribute Points] </>\n When joining a Covenant, you will enter a process similar to tabletop RPG character creation, mainly divided into three steps: <Assistant_Property1> Covenant </>, <Assistant_Property1> Faith </>, and <Assistant_Property1> Attributes </>. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Rules Explanation: </>\n 1. After selecting a Covenant, the abilities and faith of that Covenant will be automatically determined. \n 2. Each Covenant has a recommended attribute scheme, which you can use directly. \n 3. The base attribute value is at least 8 and at most 16, with a total of 44 attribute points. \n\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </> {SendAnswer: [Covenant Attribute Explanation] | 1275 }, {SendAnswer: [How to Join a Covenant] | 1273 }",
    ["<Highlight>\"Law Command Page\"</> Conquest prestige bonus"] = "<Highlight>\"Law Command Page\"</> Conquest prestige bonus",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 语音房间默认是自由发言模式，点击输入框旁边的开麦按钮即可自动开麦。若当前语音房间模式为房主设置发言权限模式或房主设置发言顺序模式，则需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言模式，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息和类型，进行转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Voice rooms default to Free Speech mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the room is set to Host-Controlled Speech Permission or Speech Order mode, you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech modes, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, type, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wishing</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </>\nIn the permanent connection event in the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Make Connections</> interface, click the wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the wishing interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>Wishing </> for a specific connection can increase the probability of obtaining that connection when making connections. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wishing Rules: </>\nConnections that can be wished for are legendary connections that can be made. \nAfter wishing, when you obtain a legendary connection, the probability of getting the wished target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the legendary connection obtained is not the wished target, the next legendary connection obtained is guaranteed to be the wished target. \nIn permanent connections, you can have <Assistant_Property1>2</> wish effects take effect <Assistant_Property1>per week</>, resetting on Monday. Every time you make <Assistant_Property1>110</> connections, you can obtain one additional wish attempt. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset attempts. \nAfter wishing for a connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the cancel wish button to cancel the wish. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationships]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wishing</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </>\nIn the permanent connection event in the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Make Connections</> interface, click the wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the wishing interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>Wishing </> for a specific connection can increase the probability of obtaining that connection when making connections. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wishing Rules: </>\nConnections that can be wished for are legendary connections that can be made. \nAfter wishing, when you obtain a legendary connection, the probability of getting the wished target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the legendary connection obtained is not the wished target, the next legendary connection obtained is guaranteed to be the wished target. \nIn permanent connections, you can have <Assistant_Property1>2</> wish effects take effect <Assistant_Property1>per week</>, resetting on Monday. Every time you make <Assistant_Property1>110</> connections, you can obtain one additional wish attempt. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset attempts. \nAfter wishing for a connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the cancel wish button to cancel the wish. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationships]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Tingen have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Nighthawks squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Tingen's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of the Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Тинген have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Ночные Ястребы squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Тинген's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of the Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands",
    ["02_Backlund"] = "02_Бэкланд",
    ["1. 领取绑金礼金的玩家会获得随机数额的绑金\n2. 领取外观馈赠的玩家会获得随机类型的外观道具"] = "1. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 2. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【烈日沙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得烈日沙套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blazing Sun Sand】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Blazing Sun Sand set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>春天见</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-支线剧情\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成支线《今夜琴声温柔》。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>See You in Spring</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Side Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the side quest \"The Piano Sounds Gentle Tonight\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>After Story Mode is enabled, the camera will zoom in to a cinematic perspective within story planes to enhance immersion. You can manually toggle it on/off by clicking the switch under the photo button on the lower left of the screen, or permanently disable it in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Dynamic Story Mode Activation</>. Once disabled, Story Mode will no longer activate upon entering story planes (except for some combat scenes).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Hide Appearance in Story Mode]|1324}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>After Story Mode is enabled, the camera will zoom in to a cinematic perspective within story planes to enhance immersion. You can manually toggle it on/off by clicking the switch under the photo button on the lower left of the screen, or permanently disable it in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Dynamic Story Mode Activation</>. Once disabled, Story Mode will no longer activate upon entering story planes (except for some combat scenes).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Hide Appearance in Story Mode]|1324}",
