    ["45 Item Level Gold Equipment"] = "45 Item Level Gold Equipment",
    ["<Highlight>伦纳德·米切尔</>，前值夜者小队成员，现任黑夜教会高级执事。性格散漫随性，有诗人一般的气质，被克莱恩称为“诗人同学”，身体里寄宿着“偷盗者”途径的天使帕列斯·索罗亚斯德。"] = "<Highlight>Leonard Mitchell</>, a former member of the Ночные Ястребы squad, currently a high-ranking deacon of the Church of the Evernight. He has a laid-back and casual personality with a poet-like temperament. He is called \"Poet Classmate\" by Klein and hosts the angel Pallez Zoroast of the Marauder pathway in his body.",
    ["Level 66 Competitive Equipment Selection Box"] = "Level 66 Competitive Equipment Selection Box",
    ["35 Item Level Gold Equipment"] = "35 Item Level Gold Equipment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【异阳圣徽】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>战令奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得异阳圣徽，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>战令解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Alien Sun Holy Emblem】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Battle Pass reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Alien Sun Holy Emblem. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via Battle Pass",
    ["<ChatTag_Friend>[好友]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Friend>[Friend]</>",
    ["1. 默认关闭，关闭情况下会过滤环境音、增强人声，语音聊天效果更佳。\n2. 开启后，会增强环境音，若使用其他设备外放音乐，收音效果更佳。\n3. 退出当前聊天房间后，此开关会重置为关闭状态。"] = "1. Default is off; when off, it filters ambient noise and enhances human voices for better voice chat quality. \n 2. When turned on, it enhances ambient noise, which is better if you are using other devices to play music. \n 3. This switch resets to off after exiting the current chat room.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Ode Dress】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ode Dress set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ode Dress】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ode Dress set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["75PVE装备"] = "75 PVE Equipment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【旧日遗风】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得旧日遗风套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Old Days Legacy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Old Days Legacy set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<P_Heart> (You reach out to touch the lock of the treasure chest, but a chill runs through your fingertips—this makes you feel that some existence is watching you.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (You reach out to touch the lock of the treasure chest, but a chill runs through your fingertips—this makes you feel that some existence is watching you.) </>",
    ["<InvDefault>1.【俱乐部宣战】</>\n<InvDefault>1）优化宣战基础体验，将提前获胜所需的积分差由 5000 上调至 15000。调整后，当一方积分领先另一方超过 15000 分时，积分高的一方将直接获胜。</><InvHighlight>调整将在</><InvHighlight>8月27日</><InvHighlight>20点之后</><InvDefault>的宣战场次生效。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调击杀、助攻时可获得的俱乐部宣战积分。</><InvHighlight>调整将在8月27日20点之后</><InvDefault>的宣战场次生效。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1.【Club War Declaration】</>\n<InvDefault>1）The basic declaration-of-war experience has been improved, increasing the point lead required for an early victory from 5000 to 15000. After the adjustment, when one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the side with the higher score will win immediately.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after </><InvHighlight>August 27</><InvHighlight>at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>2）The club-war points awarded for kills and assists have been reduced.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after August 27 at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Universe in a Shell] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Universe in a Shell; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Universe in a Shell] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Universe in a Shell; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Italic>—A certain calmness envelops you, your state of mind like a windless lake. Every decision you make is clear and certain; there is no noise in your mind, no hesitation, no uninvited guests. This means your eyes can see what they are meant to see, and your hands can land where they are supposed to land. This peace may come from training, or perhaps from some will you cannot quite name—but regardless, at this moment, you are more like yourself than anyone else. </>"] = "<Italic>—A certain calmness envelops you, your state of mind like a windless lake. Every decision you make is clear and certain; there is no noise in your mind, no hesitation, no uninvited guests. This means your eyes can see what they are meant to see, and your hands can land where they are supposed to land. This peace may come from training, or perhaps from some will you cannot quite name—but regardless, at this moment, you are more like yourself than anyone else. </>",
