    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Wrist Turn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand action rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand · Wrist Turn. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Wrist Turn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand action rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand · Wrist Turn. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["53级6人本Boss普通"] = "Level 53 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>友好的灵界生物，经过“橘光”启蒙的喵呜贼\n（积极地扭动）（光明且适度地爬行）（大方地前进）\n（随风飘荡）（脚步轻盈）（沐浴阳光） \n重复获取将自动分解为绑定金镑×100。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World Creature, the Meow Thief enlightened by the \"Orange Light\" \n (Actively wiggling) (Crawling brightly and moderately) (Advancing generously) \n (Floating with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathing in sunlight) \n Duplicate acquisitions will be automatically decomposed into Bound Gold Pounds ×100.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的余味】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得魔女的余味套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Aftertaste of the Witch] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Aftertaste of the Witch set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【夜帷盛宴】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>战令奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得夜帷盛宴套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>战令解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Night Veil Feast】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Battle Pass reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Night Veil Feast set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via Battle Pass",
    ["Next match starts in <HighLight>%s seconds </>"] = "Next match starts in <HighLight>%s seconds </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Mystery Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302512}\n<Assistant_Title2>My Mystery Circle: </><Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Mystery Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302}\n<Assistant_Title2>Mystery Circle Data: </>You can view your Mystery Circle following list and fan list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302}. You can view like data in <Assistant_System>Like List - Mystery Circle</>; Mystery Circle likes are not counted in the total like count on your personal homepage.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mystery Circle Operations: </>You can like, comment on, repost, and share other people's Mystery Circle updates within the Mystery Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Message Center: </>In the <Assistant_System>Message Center</> at the top right of the Mystery Circle, you will receive red dot notifications for likes, comments/replies, reposts, and @mentions from others regarding your Mystery Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mystery Circle updates, comments, or images are non-compliant, they will be removed.</>If you discover any violations or abnormal behavior by other players, please report them or contact customer support promptly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Mystery Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302512}\n<Assistant_Title2>My Mystery Circle: </><Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Mystery Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302}\n<Assistant_Title2>Mystery Circle Data: </>You can view your Mystery Circle following list and fan list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302}. You can view like data in <Assistant_System>Like List - Mystery Circle</>; Mystery Circle likes are not counted in the total like count on your personal homepage.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mystery Circle Operations: </>You can like, comment on, repost, and share other people's Mystery Circle updates within the Mystery Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Message Center: </>In the <Assistant_System>Message Center</> at the top right of the Mystery Circle, you will receive red dot notifications for likes, comments/replies, reposts, and @mentions from others regarding your Mystery Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mystery Circle updates, comments, or images are non-compliant, they will be removed.</>If you discover any violations or abnormal behavior by other players, please report them or contact customer support promptly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}",
    ["<Highlight>在激活时间内</>，寻找并击败地图中游荡的<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">守卫者</>。|击败守卫者：<Highlight>%d</>/2"] = "<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, find and defeat the <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Guardians </> wandering the map.|Defeat Guardians: <Highlight>%d</>/2",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Requiem Flower Cluster】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Requiem Flower Cluster. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Requiem Flower Cluster】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Requiem Flower Cluster. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["62级12人本Boss普通"] = "Level 62 12-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的商会成员：</>\n铁路大亨赛季已结束，未领取的赛季任务和常规任务奖励已通过邮件发放，请及时查收"] = "<M_Default>Dear Chamber of Commerce member: </>\nThe Railway Tycoon season has ended. Unclaimed season quest and regular quest rewards have been sent via email. Please check them in time.",
    ["<Highlight>叹息之种·争怪任务可接取次数</>，任务目标为<Highlight>前往指定争怪区域接取并击败试炼怪物</>。"] = "<Highlight> Remaining attempts for the Seed of Sighs: Monster Dispute quest </>. The quest objective is to <Highlight> go to the designated dispute area to accept and defeat the trial monster </>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暖意蹲蹲】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得暖意蹲蹲，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warm Squat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Warm Squat. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Cross-Server Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends - Cross-Server Friends</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add tab, you can search for and add cross-server friends by entering their character nickname or character numeric ID.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Gifts: </>You can exchange gifts with cross-server friends to increase your Friendliness via <Assistant_System>Friends - Private Chat - Gift in the bottom right corner</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Cross-Server Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends - Cross-Server Friends</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add tab, you can search for and add cross-server friends by entering their character nickname or character numeric ID.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Gifts: </>You can exchange gifts with cross-server friends to increase your Friendliness via <Assistant_System>Friends - Private Chat - Gift in the bottom right corner</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["<EmptyText_B> Acting level reached level </><Prompt_White>%d</><EmptyText_B> </>"] = "<EmptyText_B> Acting level reached level </><Prompt_White>%d</><EmptyText_B> </>",
    ["<P_Heart> (Steps forward) </> Get lost with your stick, or I'll help you sober up."] = "<P_Heart> (Steps forward) </> Get lost with your stick, or I'll help you sober up.",
    ["4个小时后，去<P_Yellow>后街咖啡店</>的门口，那里有一座花台。"] = "4 hours later, go to the entrance of the <P_Yellow> Back Street Coffee Shop </>, there is a flower bed there.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低笑）</>你果然很聪明。挑选你来提问，我没有选错。"] = "<P_Heart>(Chuckling)</> You are indeed very clever. I did not choose wrong in picking you to ask questions.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Explanation: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Tingen to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards. <Assistant_Red>Weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Sources: </>{JumpToUI:【城市暗面】|1302443}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Explanation: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Тинген to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards. <Assistant_Red>Weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Sources: </>{JumpToUI:【Dark Side of the City】|1302443}",
    ["1.8 Find the popped button"] = "1.8 Find the popped button",
    ["<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> Yeah, I hope they can reunite with their families and friends in the Goddess's kingdom."] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> Yeah, I hope they can reunite with their families and friends in the Goddess's kingdom.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【门径的始与终】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>听见了谁的呼喊声……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往前往{Location:[廷根(892,1117)]|-10798;11732;-1882;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>卡在墙上的男子</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [The Beginning and End of the Doorway] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2> Acting Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Heard someone's cry for help... \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After completing the main storyline Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 19 </> in Acting, go to {Location: [Тинген (892, 1117)] | -10798; 11732; -1882; 2; 5200002; 0 } and talk to the <Assistant_Red> man stuck in the wall </> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Highlight>%s</> key settings are empty. Please confirm if you need to reset them!"] = "<Highlight>%s</> key settings are empty. Please confirm if you need to reset them!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>金秋湖导游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-秩序世界\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>金秋湖秩序世界完成度到达100%"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Golden Autumn Lake Tour Guide</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Order World\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach 100% completion in the Golden Autumn Lake Order World",
    ["06_Partner Deploy/Cancel"] = "06_Partner Deploy/Cancel",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The Hidden Hand Behind the Stock】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There seems to be some sound under the tree...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then go to {Location:[Tingen(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man stuck in the tree</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Hidden Hand Behind the Stock】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There seems to be some sound under the tree...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then go to {Location:[Тинген(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man stuck in the tree</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>第一个朋友</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>拥有1个好友"] = "<Assistant_Title1>First Friend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Have 1 friend",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【值夜典袍】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>剧情奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得值夜典袍套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过剧情获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Nighthawk Ceremonial Robe】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Story reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Nighthawk Ceremonial Robe set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via story",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Firearm Shooting Gameplay】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Tingen</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific levels</>, the firearm function will be activated as the level progresses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Introduction: </>After activating firearms, use the Basic Attack button to shoot directly, and use skills to switch between different firearms, aim down sights, and perform auxiliary knockback effects. \nIn different levels, the types of activated firearms will vary; please use them reasonably to defeat enemies. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903}, {SendAnswer:[手枪]|899}, {SendAnswer:[霰弹枪]|900}, {SendAnswer:[狙击枪]|901}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Firearm Shooting Gameplay】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Тинген</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific levels</>, the firearm function will be activated as the level progresses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Introduction: </>After activating firearms, use the Базовая атака button to shoot directly, and use skills to switch between different firearms, aim down sights, and perform auxiliary knockback effects. \nIn different levels, the types of activated firearms will vary; please use them reasonably to defeat enemies. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Aiming and Shooting]|903}, {SendAnswer:[Pistol]|899}, {SendAnswer:[Shotgun]|900}, {SendAnswer:[Sniper Rifle]|901}",
    ["1.普通镜头提供规范化的拍摄视角，便于进行角色展示与构图调整。\n2.自由镜头可自由控制拍摄位置与视角，实现更多创意取景效果。"] = "1. The normal lens provides a standardized shooting perspective, facilitating character display and composition adjustment. \n2. The free lens allows free control of the shooting position and perspective, achieving more creative framing effects.",
    ["<Highlight>尽快击破所有分身，</>中止小丑的研究。"] = "<Highlight>Destroy all projections as soon as possible</> to stop the Клоун's research.",
    ["<Default> Fashion Level: </> <Highlight> %d Level </>"] = "<Default> Fashion Level: </> <Highlight> %d Level </>",
    ["0: \"Default to the line connecting the first offset point to the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\""] = "0: \"Default to the line connecting the first offset point to the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\"",
