    ["<Chat_Highlight>%s</> has left the family group chat."] = "<Chat_Highlight>%s</> has left the family group chat.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【常胜之勋】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得常胜之勋，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过终末猎杀拍卖获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Medal of Constant Victory] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Competition gameplay accessory \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Medal of Constant Victory; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via Final Hunt auction",
    ["<InvHighlight> The ballad is for reference only; proceed with caution. </> \n \n Sailing away \n Into the whirlpool \n Violent waves, silent heart \n \n Bravely surging \n Wildly churning \n Peace exists in the depths of the sea waves \n \n Glittering scales \n Shining on the spray \n Dreams surging, an eternal home \n \n Roaring for help \n Helplessly indulging \n A touch of homesickness with the scent of sea breeze"] = "<InvHighlight> The ballad is for reference only; proceed with caution. </> \n \n Sailing away \n Into the whirlpool \n Violent waves, silent heart \n \n Bravely surging \n Wildly churning \n Peace exists in the depths of the sea waves \n \n Glittering scales \n Shining on the spray \n Dreams surging, an eternal home \n \n Roaring for help \n Helplessly indulging \n A touch of homesickness with the scent of sea breeze",
    ["1打开; 0关闭; 设置之后要切换一下场景, 重新载入角色; 使用X可以切换姿态"] = "1 to enable; 0 to disable; after setting, you must switch scenes and reload the character; use X to switch stances.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑荆棘安保公司】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>邓恩的邀请实在令人心动，去黑荆棘安保公司看看吧，人总是要工作的。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第三天解锁。完成原著剧情《意外的访客》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>48级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blackthorn Security Company】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Dunn's invitation is truly tempting; go check out the Blackthorn Security Company. One always needs to work.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the original story \"Unexpected Visitor\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>48</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment",
    ["1. Based on the Club's God-Chosen ranking, a certain number of Club members can be granted the title of Conquest Vanguard; \n2. Players granted the title of Conquest Vanguard will receive the item \"Proof of Conquest\"; \n3. When upgrading personal Military Rank from Level 4 to Level 3, one \"Proof of Conquest\" is required."] = "1. Based on the Club's God-Chosen ranking, a certain number of Club members can be granted the title of Conquest Vanguard; \n2. Players granted the title of Conquest Vanguard will receive the item \"Proof of Conquest\"; \n3. When upgrading personal Military Rank from Level 4 to Level 3, one \"Proof of Conquest\" is required.",
