    ["<Assistant_Title1>【印象湖畔】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷展台\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得印象湖畔，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-灵幻祭坛商店</>中使用灵幻牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Impression Lakeside】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Showcase\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Impression Lakeside. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Showcase</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Spirit Illusion Cards in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Spirit Illusion Altar Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Beginning of the Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Beginning of the Journey set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Beginning of the Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Beginning of the Journey set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes",
    ["<EquipHighLight>Can be switched without loss via Gift Scheme </> and reshaped entries <EquipHighLight></>"] = "<EquipHighLight>Can be switched without loss via Gift Scheme </> and reshaped entries <EquipHighLight></>",
    ["1、每周根据俱乐部神选积分排名，会长可授予一定数量的俱乐部成员为征服先锋；\n2、被授予征服先锋的玩家，将获得道具“征服之证”。"] = "1. Every week, based on the Club's Divine Selection ranking, the President can grant a certain number of Club members the title of Conquest Vanguard; \n2. Players granted the title of Conquest Vanguard will receive the item \"Proof of Conquest\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>巅峰启程</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-成长\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>扮演等级升到70级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Setting Off for the Peak</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Development\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Acting Level 70",
    ["91级6人本BOSS困难"] = "Level 91 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Ranking Among the Lesser Gods</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Top 4 honorary title after participating in Peak of the Gods"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Ranking Among the Lesser Gods</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Top 4 honorary title after participating in Peak of the Gods",
    ["<P_Heart>(Sighs)</> The work is very tedious, documents are piled up like a mountain, and I have to deal with all kinds of relationships. Sometimes working overtime until late at night, looking at the fog outside the window, I think... is all this worth it?"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighs)</> The work is very tedious, documents are piled up like a mountain, and I have to deal with all kinds of relationships. Sometimes working overtime until late at night, looking at the fog outside the window, I think... is all this worth it?",
    ["1. Default is off; when off, it filters ambient noise and enhances human voices for better voice chat quality. \n 2. When turned on, it enhances ambient noise, which is better if you are using other devices to play music. \n 3. This switch resets to off after exiting the current chat room."] = "1. Default is off; when off, it filters ambient noise and enhances human voices for better voice chat quality. \n 2. When turned on, it enhances ambient noise, which is better if you are using other devices to play music. \n 3. This switch resets to off after exiting the current chat room.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Eternal Rule</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Conquest Emperor rank in Dominator's Clash"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Eternal Rule</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Conquest Emperor rank in Dominator's Clash",
