    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for City of Shadows gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Taste of the Witch set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via City of Shadows Bounty Value."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for City of Shadows gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Taste of the Witch set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via City of Shadows Bounty Value.",
    ["<M_Orange>%s </> Club has finished responding and was successfully established! \n· After joining a club, you can participate in special gameplay every day. \n· You can obtain exclusive club territory. \n· You can also lead members to participate in leagues and win the highest glory. \n· Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in club activities; reserve members are the reserve force of the club and cannot participate in some club activities. You can maintain activity and contact management to be promoted to an official member."] = "<M_Orange>%s </> Club has finished responding and was successfully established! \n· After joining a club, you can participate in special gameplay every day. \n· You can obtain exclusive club territory. \n· You can also lead members to participate in leagues and win the highest glory. \n· Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in club activities; reserve members are the reserve force of the club and cannot participate in some club activities. You can maintain activity and contact management to be promoted to an official member.",
    ["<Chat_Highlight>%s</>势力攻破了<Chat_Highlight>%s</>"] = "The <Chat_Highlight>%s</> faction has breached <Chat_Highlight>%s</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【White Cliff Winter Night】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the White Cliff Winter Night outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【White Cliff Winter Night】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the White Cliff Winter Night outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<DecH> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World creature, a Meow-Meow Thief enlightened by \"Orange Light\" \n (Wiggles actively) (Crawls brightly and moderately) (Advances generously) \n (Drifts with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathed in sunlight)"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World creature, a Meow-Meow Thief enlightened by \"Orange Light\" \n (Wiggles actively) (Crawls brightly and moderately) (Advances generously) \n (Drifts with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathed in sunlight)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Level Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rapport and Level: </>Complete weekly family Quests to earn Rapport and increase the family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Assistant_Red>2000 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Quests: </>Family members can earn Rapport by teaming up to participate in corresponding gameplay. \n    <Assistant_Property1>High-Multiplier Rapport: </>Earned during the first few completions of each quest per week; after exceeding this limit, only the normal multiplier is granted. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Refresh Time: </>Quests refresh weekly. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Covenant Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Description]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Showcase Rules]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Level Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rapport and Level: </>Complete weekly family Quests to earn Rapport and increase the family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Assistant_Red>2000 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Quests: </>Family members can earn Rapport by teaming up to participate in corresponding gameplay. \n    <Assistant_Property1>High-Multiplier Rapport: </>Earned during the first few completions of each quest per week; after exceeding this limit, only the normal multiplier is granted. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Refresh Time: </>Quests refresh weekly. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Covenant Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Description]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Showcase Rules]|669}",
