    ["20_Clear All Items in Specified Inventory Tab"] = "20_Clear All Items in Specified Inventory Tab",
    ["<Highlight>Daly Simone</>, a former member of the Tingen Nighthawks squad, is the most famous Spirit Medium in Awwa County. She was noticed by the Holy Cathedral because she summarized the Acting Method herself, leading to extremely fast advancement, and was later transferred to Backlund. Her relationship with Captain Dunn seems to be unusual."] = "<Highlight>Daly Simone</>, a former member of the Тинген Ночные Ястребы squad, is the most famous Spirit Medium in Awwa County. She was noticed by the Holy Cathedral because she summarized the Acting Method herself, leading to extremely fast advancement, and was later transferred to Бэкланд. Her relationship with Captain Dunn seems to be unusual.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精鞣皮革・轻便裁剪・都市漫步装\n身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Tanned Leather - Lightweight Cut - Urban Stroll Outfit\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for one's own sunny day in the corners of the City of Cities.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Hunter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Bounty Hunter outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Охотник】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Bounty Охотник outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【特剪·剧中】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得特剪·剧中，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装累计召唤解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Special Cut - In Play] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Special Cut - In Play; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </><Assistant_System> Unlocked via cumulative summons in Summon - Astral Strange Attire",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们在敲诈那个老人？去帮帮忙吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Are they blackmailing that old man? Let's go help!)</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Show Strength】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Show Strength. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Show Strength】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Show Strength. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Positions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>President: </>The President is the leader of the Club, holding the highest authority and representing the Club in handling internal management and diplomatic rights.\n<Assistant_Title2>Vice President: </>The Vice President is an important position assisting the President, holding high authority second only to the President, and can exercise some internal management and diplomatic rights on behalf of the President, appointed by the President.\n<Assistant_Title2>Director: </>Directors are management positions in the Club with a certain degree of management authority, appointed by the President, up to 3 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Group Leader: </>Group Leaders are the core management for Club activities, responsible for the appointment and dismissal of members within the group, and organizing activities like league team formation. Each Club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 people; members within a group automatically gain qualification for league participation.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Star: </>Club Stars are the face of the Club, responsible for recruiting and entertaining new members, appointed by the President, up to 2 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Official Member: </>Official Members are the backbone of the Club and can participate in Club activities.<Assistant_Red>Some activities only support Official Members participating</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Reserve Member: </>Reserve Members are the reserve force of the Club and cannot participate in some Club activities. Keep working hard, stay active, and contact management to join as an Official Member.\n<Assistant_Title2>Position Adjustment: </>Club members can hold management positions, group positions, and Club Star positions simultaneously; management positions include President, Vice President, and Director.\n<Assistant_Title2>Permission Adjustment: </>The Club President can adjust the permission allocation for different positions in the permission adjustment interface.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Positions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>President: </>The President is the leader of the Club, holding the highest authority and representing the Club in handling internal management and diplomatic rights.\n<Assistant_Title2>Vice President: </>The Vice President is an important position assisting the President, holding high authority second only to the President, and can exercise some internal management and diplomatic rights on behalf of the President, appointed by the President.\n<Assistant_Title2>Director: </>Directors are management positions in the Club with a certain degree of management authority, appointed by the President, up to 3 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Group Leader: </>Group Leaders are the core management for Club activities, responsible for the appointment and dismissal of members within the group, and organizing activities like league team formation. Each Club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 people; members within a group automatically gain qualification for league participation.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Star: </>Club Stars are the face of the Club, responsible for recruiting and entertaining new members, appointed by the President, up to 2 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Official Member: </>Official Members are the backbone of the Club and can participate in Club activities.<Assistant_Red>Some activities only support Official Members participating</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Reserve Member: </>Reserve Members are the reserve force of the Club and cannot participate in some Club activities. Keep working hard, stay active, and contact management to join as an Official Member.\n<Assistant_Title2>Position Adjustment: </>Club members can hold management positions, group positions, and Club Star positions simultaneously; management positions include President, Vice President, and Director.\n<Assistant_Title2>Permission Adjustment: </>The Club President can adjust the permission allocation for different positions in the permission adjustment interface.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [tomorrow %s]!"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [tomorrow %s]!",
    ["96级6人本BOSS困难"] = "Level 96 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【观众】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Зритель】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<DecH> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement · Short Cape Set \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost."] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement · Short Cape Set \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【不灭之握】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得不灭之握，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Undying Grasp】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Undying Grasp. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: Exchange using <Assistant_Red>1</> God-favored Card in the <Assistant_System>Goddess's Gift Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl-Gameplay Rules】</>\nWhen registration is open, the gameplay will randomly select <Assistant_Red>16</> players from the guild members as <Assistant_Property1>Phantom Projections</> for participants to use. All participants use the same type of projection.\nThe competition is divided into multiple rounds. Players can choose a projection to enter into <Assistant_Property1>any round</> to participate in the competition. Projections that have already been entered cannot be <Assistant_Property1>reused</>.\nWhen the designated round begins, the projection for that round will be summoned and <Assistant_Property1>fight automatically</>. Participants can go to the Club Base to <Assistant_Property1>watch the battle</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl-Scoring Rules]|10}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl-Gameplay Rules】</>\nWhen registration is open, the gameplay will randomly select <Assistant_Red>16</> players from the guild members as <Assistant_Property1>Phantom Projections</> for participants to use. All participants use the same type of projection.\nThe competition is divided into multiple rounds. Players can choose a projection to enter into <Assistant_Property1>any round</> to participate in the competition. Projections that have already been entered cannot be <Assistant_Property1>reused</>.\nWhen the designated round begins, the projection for that round will be summoned and <Assistant_Property1>fight automatically</>. Participants can go to the Club Base to <Assistant_Property1>watch the battle</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl-Scoring Rules]|10}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【镀银眼镜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得镀银眼镜，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角后自动获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Silver-Plated Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Silver-Plated Glasses after character creation. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Automatically obtained after character creation.",
    ["06_伙伴出战/取消"] = "06_Partner Deploy/Cancel",
    ["<M_Default>Respected member of the Church: </>\n\n The gift of the Primordial has disappeared from you. \n Because you missed two Charm Invitations last week, your charm has gradually dimmed in the Mirror World. According to the Church's code, starting next week, your charm will be temporarily tarnished (Charm attribute -5) until you participate in two Charm Invitations again and achieve victory, only then can you restore the favor of the Witch. \n Do not let that perfect self in the mirror disappear completely."] = "<M_Default>Respected member of the Church: </>\n\n The gift of the Primordial has disappeared from you. \n Because you missed two Charm Invitations last week, your charm has gradually dimmed in the Mirror World. According to the Church's code, starting next week, your charm will be temporarily tarnished (Charm attribute -5) until you participate in two Charm Invitations again and achieve victory, only then can you restore the favor of the Witch. \n Do not let that perfect self in the mirror disappear completely.",
    ["Level 99 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard"] = "Level 99 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Chat_Red>%s</>击败了你。"] = "<Chat_Red>%s</> defeated you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道马西莫有没有发现……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I wonder if Massimo noticed...) </>",
    ["68装等装备随机箱"] = "Level 68 Equipment Random Box",
    ["<M_Default>Attention all club members: </>\n After the first two rounds of the league in the strategic server screening stage, this club successfully advanced to the <M_Default>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> by virtue of being in the <M_Default>top 4 in total points for the strategic server screening</>, and obtained the <M_Default>qualification to participate in the strategic server</>. We will go to the strategic server together with the other three advancing clubs as one of the <M_Default>representatives of this server's division</>! \n[Special Note]\n 1. <M_Default>During the advancement period (1 month from the sending of this email)</>, this club will no longer participate in the subsequent Four-Way League of this server this season, and will prepare to participate in the subsequent gameplay of the strategic server. \n 2. The opening time, participation method, and subsequent gameplay arrangements for the strategic server will be subject to subsequent announcements. Please have the president/councilors pay close attention. \n 3. Please hurry up to prepare for battle, coordinate lineups, and allocate resources to fight for higher honors for this server's division! \n May you all win the first battle and return in triumph!"] = "<M_Default>Attention all club members: </>\n After the first two rounds of the league in the strategic server screening stage, this club successfully advanced to the <M_Default>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> by virtue of being in the <M_Default>top 4 in total points for the strategic server screening</>, and obtained the <M_Default>qualification to participate in the strategic server</>. We will go to the strategic server together with the other three advancing clubs as one of the <M_Default>representatives of this server's division</>! \n[Special Note]\n 1. <M_Default>During the advancement period (1 month from the sending of this email)</>, this club will no longer participate in the subsequent Four-Way League of this server this season, and will prepare to participate in the subsequent gameplay of the strategic server. \n 2. The opening time, participation method, and subsequent gameplay arrangements for the strategic server will be subject to subsequent announcements. Please have the president/councilors pay close attention. \n 3. Please hurry up to prepare for battle, coordinate lineups, and allocate resources to fight for higher honors for this server's division! \n May you all win the first battle and return in triumph!",
    ["<ChatTag_GVG>[Battlefield]</>"] = "<ChatTag_GVG>[Battlefield]</>",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>接受了<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战，决斗将在[明天%s]开启！"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [tomorrow %s]!",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜呢料・诗意裁剪・长燕尾外套\n于黑夜的引领下，红手套在隐秘之中穿行。守护此夜的，正是其中最明亮的一颗星星。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Night Woolen · Poetic Tailoring · Long Tailcoat \n Guided by the night, the Ночные Ястребы walk in secrecy. The one guarding this night is the brightest star among them.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Blood Moon Slaughter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Blood Moon Slaughter outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blood Moon Slaughter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Blood Moon Slaughter outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【沉眠】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得沉眠套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Slumber】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Slumber set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先稳住它再说。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's stabilize it first.)</>",
    ["1. 选择你要进行<Highlight>部分可见</>以及<Highlight>对谁隐身</>的范围\n2. 在群聊中若有不是你好友的玩家，范围设置将不生效"] = "1. Select the scope for <Highlight> partial visibility </> and <Highlight> who to hide from </> \n 2. If there are players in the group chat who are not your friends, the scope settings will not take effect.",
    ["2 guide 2"] = "2 guide 2",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> killed the President <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> of the <Chat_Highlight> %s Club </>, this battle will be sung by bards."] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> killed the President <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> of the <Chat_Highlight> %s Club </>, this battle will be sung by bards.",
    ["5200259 Doll Shop Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200259 Doll Shop Multiplayer Scene",
    ["78级12人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 78 12-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Butterfly Perch Cape】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Butterfly Perch Cape. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Butterfly Perch Cape】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Butterfly Perch Cape. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<P_Heart> (He is too anxious, it's time to help him unload some psychological burden!) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (He is too anxious, it's time to help him unload some psychological burden!) </>",
    ["2113【Can't help it】"] = "2113【Can't help it】",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们在为难那个女孩？上去帮帮她吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Are they giving that girl a hard time? Go up and help her!) </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【花开半靥】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得花开半靥，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Half-Bloomed Flower】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Half-Bloomed Flower; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["62世界BOSS普通10%生命"] = "Level 62 World Boss Normal 10% HP",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>金色传说</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>穿戴8件金色品质及以上装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Golden Legend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Equip 8 items of Gold quality or higher",
    ["1、参与战略服玩法，可获得征服声望和战功；\n2、征服声望达到对应值，可提高个人征服军衔等级，获得对应奖励并解锁对应功能。"] = "1. Participate in strategic server gameplay to earn Conquest Prestige and War Merit; \n2. When Conquest Prestige reaches the corresponding value, you can increase your personal Conquest Military Rank, obtain corresponding rewards, and unlock corresponding functions.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Carved Vase】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Carved Vase display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Carved Vase】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Carved Vase display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["69装等装备随机箱"] = "Level 69 Equipment Random Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>猎人的收获</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-竞逐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>获得200点终末猎杀段位胜点"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Охотник's Harvest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 200 Victory Points in Final Hunt rank",
    ["<P_Heart> (Sounds like the candle workshop was poorly managed and owed a lot of money. This villager wants to protect Finn...) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Sounds like the candle workshop was poorly managed and owed a lot of money. This villager wants to protect Finn...) </>",
    ["5230991 QA Task Save Test - Default Scene 996 Script Copy"] = "5230991 QA Task Save Test - Default Scene 996 Script Copy",
    ["Level 66 Equipment Random Box"] = "Level 66 Equipment Random Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>首胜荣光</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>获胜1次四方联赛。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Glory of the First Victory</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Win 1 Four-Way League match.",
    ["<Highlight>Wishing</> for a designated Connection can increase the probability of obtaining the corresponding Connection during Socializing. \nThe Connections that can be wished for are Legendary Connections that can be socialized with. \nAfter Wishing, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of obtaining the Wish target increases to <Highlight>80%</>. If you do not obtain the Wish target, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be the Wish target. \n\nIn permanent Socializing, <Highlight>every week</> you can have <Highlight>2</> Wishing effects take effect, resetting on Monday. \nEvery <Highlight>110 Socializing attempts</>, you can obtain one additional Wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count."] = "<Highlight>Wishing</> for a designated Connection can increase the probability of obtaining the corresponding Connection during Socializing. \nThe Connections that can be wished for are Legendary Connections that can be socialized with. \nAfter Wishing, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of obtaining the Wish target increases to <Highlight>80%</>. If you do not obtain the Wish target, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be the Wish target. \n\nIn permanent Socializing, <Highlight>every week</> you can have <Highlight>2</> Wishing effects take effect, resetting on Monday. \nEvery <Highlight>110 Socializing attempts</>, you can obtain one additional Wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【New Store Opening】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A new store has opened on the street, but neither the owner nor the customers seem very happy...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Tingen(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the shopkeeper </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【New Store Opening】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A new store has opened on the street, but neither the owner nor the customers seem very happy...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Тинген(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the shopkeeper </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Covenant of Time</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach a friendship level of 1314 with any friend"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Covenant of Time</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach a friendship level of 1314 with any friend",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们两个虽然语气听着不好，实际行为却挺讲礼貌。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Although their tone sounds bad, their actual behavior is quite polite.)</>",
    ["5230207   战斗引导测试关卡   位面"] = "5230207 Combat Tutorial Test Level Plane",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部乱斗-得分规则】</>\n玩家将根据投影在战场上的表现而累计得分：\n按照存活的排名，前三名投影依次获得<Assistant_Red>60,40,30</>分，\n每有其他投影阵亡，自身投影获得<Assistant_Red>3</>分，\n击杀其他投影获得<Assistant_Red>5</>分。\n玩家需投入<Assistant_Red>8</>名以上的投影以获得奖励。比赛结束后，总分优秀者与对应投影数据突出者将额外获得<Assistant_Property1>称号</>奖励。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗]|8}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗-玩法规则]|9}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Scoring Rules】</>\nPlayers will accumulate scores based on the performance of their projections on the battlefield:\nAccording to the survival ranking, the top three projections receive <Assistant_Red>60, 40, 30</> points respectively. \nFor every other projection that falls, your own projection gains <Assistant_Red>3</> points, \nand killing other projections grants <Assistant_Red>5</> points.\nPlayers must deploy at least <Assistant_Red>8</> projections to be eligible for rewards. After the match, those with excellent total scores and outstanding projection data will receive additional <Assistant_Property1>Title</> rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl-Gameplay Rules]|9}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>被选中之“人”</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-趣味\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>被选定成为幻象投影一次"] = "<Assistant_Title1>The Chosen \"Person\"</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>Leisure-Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Selected to become a phantom projection once",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Timothy Rabbit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Timothy Rabbit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Timothy Rabbit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Timothy Rabbit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<P_Heart>(Seems quite interesting. Let me think about what I can do!)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Seems quite interesting. Let me think about what I can do!)</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【小圆框眼镜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得小圆框眼镜，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Small Round Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Small Round Glasses. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</> and <HighLight>[%s]</>'s club war has officially begun, the outcome will soon be revealed!"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> and <HighLight>[%s]</>'s club war has officially begun, the outcome will soon be revealed!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Protector】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Protector display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Protector】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Protector display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Obtaining Firearms】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Tingen</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific levels</>, the firearm function will be activated as the level progresses. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[枪械玩法简介]|898}, {SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Obtaining Firearms】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Тинген</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific levels</>, the firearm function will be activated as the level progresses. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Firearm Gameplay Introduction]|898}, {SendAnswer:[Aim and Shoot]|903}",
    ["<P_Heart>（例如在这里放一张长桌……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (For example, putting a long table here...) </>",
    ["1.8找到崩掉的纽扣"] = "1.8 Find the popped button",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Ten-Battle Journey</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Participate in 10 Four-Way League matches."] = "<Assistant_Title1>Ten-Battle Journey</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Participate in 10 Four-Way League matches.",
    ["Level 62 Adventure Equipment Selection Box"] = "Level 62 Adventure Equipment Selection Box",
    ["2.上传视频"] = "2. Upload Video",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Genie's Crown】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for World Adventure gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Genie's Crown. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Genie's Crown】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for World Adventure gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Genie's Crown. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【死亡咏叹】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>黑荆棘安保公司接到一桩复杂的寻人委托，弗莱希望你加入一起调查。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>61级</>后，在任务栏可接取支线任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：绑定金镑、金纺线、绑定苏勒、认知经验、腰饰【永暗蜡烛】"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Death's Lament] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </> <Assistant_Property2> Side Quest </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> The Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person commission. Frye wants you to join the investigation. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 61 </> in Acting Level, you can accept the side quest in the quest log. \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Bound Gold Pounds, Gold Thread, Bound Soles, Cognition EXP, Waist Ornament [Eternal Darkness Candle]",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Eternal Dream】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Mini-program check-in reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain Eternal Dream. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via mini-program check-in."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Eternal Dream】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Mini-program check-in reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain Eternal Dream. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via mini-program check-in.",
    ["1. 最多可以选择4种不同类型的外观\n2. 外观馈赠的数量等于玩家放置的外观道具数量"] = "1. You can choose up to 4 different types of appearances. \n 2. The number of appearance gifts is equal to the number of appearance items placed by the player.",
    ["5230215 QA Resource Test Template Level Plane"] = "5230215 QA Resource Test Template Level Plane",
    ["5231136 Backlund Single-Player Instance"] = "5231136 Бэкланд Single-Player Instance",
    ["<Chat_Highlight>%s</>被移出了家族专属群聊"] = "<Chat_Highlight>%s</> has been removed from the Family exclusive group chat.",
    ["57级6人本Boss困难"] = "Level 57 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["40级6人本Boss普通"] = "Level 40 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["1、双方俱乐部活动期间无法发起和接受合并申请。接受合并申请时，两方俱乐部总成员之和不得超过合入俱乐部的总成员数上限。超出上限则合并失败，需请离人员再进行合并。"] = "1. Merger requests cannot be initiated or accepted during Club activities. When accepting a merger request, the total number of members of both Clubs must not exceed the maximum member limit of the receiving Club. If it exceeds the limit, the merger will fail; you must remove members before merging.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蝶栖流光】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蝶栖流光，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Butterfly Resting on Flowing Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Butterfly Resting on Flowing Light. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["1. Summon mushrooms;\n 2. Fan-shaped AOE*4;\n 3. Full-screen AOE knockback"] = "1. Summon mushrooms;\n 2. Fan-shaped AOE*4;\n 3. Full-screen AOE knockback",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【睡莲镇漫游指南】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>睡莲小镇欢迎你。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[睡莲小镇(134,-14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0}，<Assistant_Red>翻阅笔记</>接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Water Lily Town welcomes you.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town (134, -14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red>read the notes</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<P_Heart>（但是河里为什么会漂浮崭新的生活用品啊！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But why are brand-new household items floating in the river!)</>",
    ["2压力核心"] = "2 Pressure Cores",
    ["5200238   钟表店   多人场景"] = "5200238 Clock Shop Multiplayer Scene",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎是两个刚采购完的女仆……要听听她们的闲聊吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Seems to be two maids who just finished shopping... want to listen to their gossip?) </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Dusk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Dusk after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dusk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Dusk after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黄昏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得黄昏，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dusk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Dusk after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<ChatTag_Server>[Faction]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Server>[Faction]</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Event Goal: </>Various unexpected events will constantly occur in the City of Shadows. Participate in and complete events to obtain bounty rewards and advance gameplay progress.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize completing {SendAnswer:Plot Events|879} to gradually unlock more {SendAnswer:Challenge Events|880} and {SendAnswer:Competition Events|881} and experience the complete City of Shadows content.\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Event Types (includes three types): </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Advance the plot and unlock more gameplay content.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Complete boss challenges, racing, and other gameplay to obtain rich rewards. Note: Fierce Battle · Bonnie will convert attributes based on the player's combat power, affecting the challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Participate in resource contention, chases, and compete with other players in the same arena.\n<Assistant_Title2>2. Event Refresh Rules: </>Only events that are currently unlocked and meet the activation conditions will be displayed. As the plot progresses, more events will be gradually unlocked.\n<Assistant_Title3>Plot Events: </>Unlocked after completing prerequisites; they will not refresh randomly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Challenge Events: </>Continuously refresh after meeting activation conditions; they reappear approximately 10 seconds after completion.\n<Assistant_Title3>Competition Events: </>Open for matchmaking at specified times daily; starts after successful matchmaking.\n<Assistant_Title2>3. Reward Rules: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Complete to claim rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Racing challenges distribute rewards based on ranking; Fierce Battle · Bonnie has tiered rewards based on performance; difficult boss events do not have tiered rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Rewards are distributed based on final ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>4. Reward Cap: </>There is no limit to the number of times event rewards can be claimed, but there is a weekly cap on the Bounty Value that can be obtained. You can continue to participate in events after reaching the cap, but you will not continue to receive Bounty Value.\n<Assistant_Title2>5. Failure Conditions: </>\nFailure to complete event objectives within the specified time.\nLeaving the event area too far during the event is considered a voluntary abandonment."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Event Goal: </>Various unexpected events will constantly occur in the City of Shadows. Participate in and complete events to obtain bounty rewards and advance gameplay progress.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize completing {SendAnswer:Plot Events|879} to gradually unlock more {SendAnswer:Challenge Events|880} and {SendAnswer:Competition Events|881} and experience the complete City of Shadows content.\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Event Types (includes three types): </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Advance the plot and unlock more gameplay content.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Complete boss challenges, racing, and other gameplay to obtain rich rewards. Note: Fierce Battle · Bonnie will convert attributes based on the player's combat power, affecting the challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Participate in resource contention, chases, and compete with other players in the same arena.\n<Assistant_Title2>2. Event Refresh Rules: </>Only events that are currently unlocked and meet the activation conditions will be displayed. As the plot progresses, more events will be gradually unlocked.\n<Assistant_Title3>Plot Events: </>Unlocked after completing prerequisites; they will not refresh randomly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Challenge Events: </>Continuously refresh after meeting activation conditions; they reappear approximately 10 seconds after completion.\n<Assistant_Title3>Competition Events: </>Open for matchmaking at specified times daily; starts after successful matchmaking.\n<Assistant_Title2>3. Reward Rules: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Complete to claim rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Racing challenges distribute rewards based on ranking; Fierce Battle · Bonnie has tiered rewards based on performance; difficult boss events do not have tiered rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Rewards are distributed based on final ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>4. Reward Cap: </>There is no limit to the number of times event rewards can be claimed, but there is a weekly cap on the Bounty Value that can be obtained. You can continue to participate in events after reaching the cap, but you will not continue to receive Bounty Value.\n<Assistant_Title2>5. Failure Conditions: </>\nFailure to complete event objectives within the specified time.\nLeaving the event area too far during the event is considered a voluntary abandonment.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的滋味真不错】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>近日的廷根并不太平。作为值夜者小队的新人，你也被分派了一桩奇异的案件。而它指向的，是廷根北区的某个沙龙，以及留驻其中的神秘倩影……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>50级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备、挂画·春夜之邀、双人·牵手、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Тинген have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Ночные Ястребы squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Тинген's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands, Title",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Crow Talk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Crow Talk outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Crow Talk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Crow Talk outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【先祖铠甲】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得先祖铠甲套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-五月庄园·花园</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ancestor Armor】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ancestor Armor set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Garden</>",
    ["<P_Heart> (Full of longing) </> This kind of gap is very wonderful, it hides in all sorts of places."] = "<P_Heart> (Full of longing) </> This kind of gap is very wonderful, it hides in all sorts of places.",
    ["57级6人本Boss普通"] = "Level 57 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Worm of Time Treasure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>The \"God of Mischief\" Amon has hidden treasures of Worms of Time scattered everywhere. Touching a Rift of Time can summon Amon's puzzles.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Worm of Time Treasure</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Worm of Time Treasure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Worm of Time Treasure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Starting the Treasure Hunt</>\nInteract with the Rift of Time and complete the conversation with the monocle phantom shadow to start the treasure hunt challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Collecting the Treasure</>\nFollow the guidance to find the scattered treasure chests; after collecting all of them, you can open the final treasure chest to receive your reward.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\n<Assistant_Red>spirit vision</> can help you discover hidden treasure chests; it is recommended to use it during your search~\nSome hidden treasure chests can only be opened after completing a challenge."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Worm of Time Treasure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>The \"God of Mischief\" Amon has hidden treasures of Worms of Time scattered everywhere. Touching a Rift of Time can summon Amon's puzzles.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Worm of Time Treasure</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Worm of Time Treasure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Worm of Time Treasure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Starting the Treasure Hunt</>\nInteract with the Rift of Time and complete the conversation with the monocle phantom shadow to start the treasure hunt challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Collecting the Treasure</>\nFollow the guidance to find the scattered treasure chests; after collecting all of them, you can open the final treasure chest to receive your reward.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\n<Assistant_Red>spirit vision</> can help you discover hidden treasure chests; it is recommended to use it during your search~\nSome hidden treasure chests can only be opened after completing a challenge.",
    ["1.上传时必须选择一项自定义内容（动作、表情、音频、镜头其中一项即可）。\n2.目前仅支持上传自定义内容，暂无法上传系统动作和预设的运镜。\n3.上传后可在【我的-选择对应作品-编辑】中进行修改和删除。"] = "1. You must select one custom content (action, expression, audio, or camera) when uploading. \n2. Currently, only custom content can be uploaded; system actions and preset camera movements cannot be uploaded yet. \n3. After uploading, you can modify or delete it in [Mine - Select Corresponding Work - Edit].",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·比心】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>组队玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·比心，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-同行商店</>使用同行纹章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Heart Hands】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Heart Hands. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Host Permissions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Voice Room - Permission Settings (Bottom Left)</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Free Speech Mode: </>All players can unmute and speak.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Permissions: </>In this mode, players can click the unmute button to request to speak; once the host approves, they gain speaking rights. The host can also manually adjust speaking permissions in the player list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Order: </>In this mode, up to 8 microphone slots can be set. It defaults to sequential speaking; only the host and the player on Mic 1 can unmute. Once the player on Mic 1 finishes, they must manually click to step down from the mic to pass the turn to the player on Mic 2.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mute: </>Muted players cannot use real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The host can manage this in the Mute Management tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Blacklist: </>Blacklisted players will be kicked from the voice room and cannot re-enter. The host can manage this in the Blacklist tab.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-常驻房间]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Host Permissions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Voice Room - Permission Settings (Bottom Left)</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Free Speech Mode: </>All players can unmute and speak.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Permissions: </>In this mode, players can click the unmute button to request to speak; once the host approves, they gain speaking rights. The host can also manually adjust speaking permissions in the player list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Order: </>In this mode, up to 8 microphone slots can be set. It defaults to sequential speaking; only the host and the player on Mic 1 can unmute. Once the player on Mic 1 finishes, they must manually click to step down from the mic to pass the turn to the player on Mic 2.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mute: </>Muted players cannot use real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The host can manage this in the Mute Management tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Blacklist: </>Blacklisted players will be kicked from the voice room and cannot re-enter. The host can manage this in the Blacklist tab.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Rabbit Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Rabbit Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Rabbit Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Rabbit Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["<Highlight>Guide the legion soldiers to collide with each other</>."] = "<Highlight>Guide the legion soldiers to collide with each other</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Host Permissions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Voice Room - Permission Settings (Bottom Left)</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Free Speech Mode: </>All players can unmute and speak.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Permissions: </>In this mode, players can click the unmute button to request to speak; once the host approves, they gain speaking rights. The host can also manually adjust speaking permissions in the player list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Order: </>In this mode, up to 8 microphone slots can be set. It defaults to sequential speaking; only the host and the player on Mic 1 can unmute. Once the player on Mic 1 finishes, they must manually click to step down from the mic to pass the turn to the player on Mic 2.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mute: </>Muted players cannot use real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The host can manage this in the Mute Management tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Blacklist: </>Blacklisted players will be kicked from the voice room and cannot re-enter. The host can manage this in the Blacklist tab.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Host Permissions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Voice Room - Permission Settings (Bottom Left)</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Free Speech Mode: </>All players can unmute and speak.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Permissions: </>In this mode, players can click the unmute button to request to speak; once the host approves, they gain speaking rights. The host can also manually adjust speaking permissions in the player list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host-Set Speech Order: </>In this mode, up to 8 microphone slots can be set. It defaults to sequential speaking; only the host and the player on Mic 1 can unmute. Once the player on Mic 1 finishes, they must manually click to step down from the mic to pass the turn to the player on Mic 2.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mute: </>Muted players cannot use real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The host can manage this in the Mute Management tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Blacklist: </>Blacklisted players will be kicked from the voice room and cannot re-enter. The host can manage this in the Blacklist tab.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Play Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}",
